rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Any change to a land\'s type or splicing of text into a land can affect the types of mana a land can produce."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Any replacement effects are considered by Reflecting Pool when determining the types of mana a land can produce.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Multiple Reflecting Pools won\'t help each other produce mana. If you control a Reflecting Pool, and all other lands you control either lack mana abilities or are other Reflecting Pools, you may still activate Reflecting Pool\'s ability — it just won\'t produce any mana."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'Reflecting Pool checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands you control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag says "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If you control Vivid Crag and Reflecting Pool, you can tap Reflecting Pool for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Reflecting Pool doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your lands put on the mana they produce, such as Pillar of the Paruns and Hall of the Bandit Lord do. It just cares about types of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Does not trigger on a card on the battlefield being changed into a creature.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability will not trigger on itself entering the battlefield, but it will trigger on any other creature that is put onto the battlefield at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It reduces your life total to 1, not the damage to 1.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Worship does not prevent damage. It causes some damage to be unable to lower your life total. So any damage rendered useless by Worship was still dealt and is counted by effects that track the amount of damage done to a player. In addition, Worship does not prevent loss of life, so loss of life bypasses Worship.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability can be used on a creature without First Strike or Swampwalk but has no effect.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If a creature loses first strike after first strike combat damage has been assigned, it won’t deal damage during the second combat damage step.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Causing a creature to lose swampwalk is useful only during the declare attackers step or earlier. Once the declare blockers step begins, it’s too late to block the creature.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Urborg’s second ability affects only the first strike ability, not the part of the double strike ability that acts like first strike.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You choose whether the targeted creature loses first strike or swampwalk as the ability resolves. If the creature has both abilities, it will lose just one of them.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The timestamp for the "in your graveyard" ability is set at the time that this card goes to your graveyard, regardless of whether you control a Mountain at that time.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This can be used on a creature without landwalking but has no effect.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Causing a creature to lose landwalk abilities is useful only during the declare attackers step or earlier. Once the declare blockers step begins, it’s too late to block the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Whether or not a creature is without flying is only checked on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You must choose a card if there are any in your library.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "Suppose mana produced by Boseiju is spent on a spell and an effect creates a copy of that spell. The copy can be countered, even though the original can\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': \'The spell can\\\'t be countered if the mana produced by Boseiju is spent to cover any cost of the spell, even an additional cost such as a splice cost. This is true even if you pay an additional cost while casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t Modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an enchantment, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-05-01\', \'text\': "If you target Ghost Quarter with its own ability, the ability won\'t resolve because its target is no longer on the battlefield. You won\'t get to search for a land card."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the targeted land is an illegal target by the time Ghost Quarter\'s ability resolves, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. The land\'s controller won\'t get to search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "The target land\'s controller gets to search for a basic land card even if that land wasn\'t destroyed by Ghost Quarter\'s ability. This may happen because the land has indestructible or because it was regenerated."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': \'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A "creature card" is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-09-16\', \'text\': "The controller of the countered spell doesn\'t choose how many cards to draw until the relevant ability resolves. The player may draw 0, 1, or 2 cards. They choose the number before drawing any cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "At the time the ability resolves, you\'ll get to play the card if you declared three different creatures as attackers at any point in the turn. A creature declared as an attacker in two different attack phases counts only once. A creature that entered the battlefield attacking (such as a token created by Militia\'s Pride) doesn\'t count because you never attacked with it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Doran’s ability doesn’t actually change creatures’ power; it changes only the value of the combat damage they assign. All other rules and effects that check power or toughness use the real values.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Doran’s ability means, for example, that a 2/3 creature will assign 3 damage in combat instead of 2.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'This effect is mandatory and affects all creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': \'If Lignify leaves the battlefield, the creature goes back to being what it was before. Any effects that applied while the Lignify was on the battlefield, such as Giant Growth or Lace with Moonglove, will continue to apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "If a previous effect switched the creature\'s power and toughness, that effect still applies (though it will apply to the creature\'s new power and toughness)."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature has a characteristic-defining ability that specifies its color, that ability will still have its effect because it\'s applied before the creature loses the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': \'Lignify causes the enchanted creature to lose all abilities it had at the time it became enchanted. Any abilities granted to the creature after Lignify entered the battlefield will work normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "Lignify overwrites characteristic-defining abilities that specify the enchanted creature\'s power or toughness (such as the one Dauntless Dourbark has) or that specify its creature types (such as changeling does)."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "Lignify overwrites previous effects that changed the enchanted creature\'s creature types. Any such effects that apply after Lignify enters the battlefield will work normally."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': \'Lignify will overwrite static abilities that come from the creature itself (such as the one on Verduran Enchantress) because Lignify causes the creature to lose that ability before it gets a chance to apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Lignify will not overwrite effects such as those from Glorious Anthem, counters, or Giant Growth that change the enchanted creature\'s power or toughness without setting it to a specific value. Apply such effects after applying Lignify."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Lignify will overwrite any previous effects that set the enchanted creature\'s power or toughness (such as Serendib Sorcerer does). Any such effects that apply after Lignify entered the battlefield will work normally."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, only creatures you control trigger the ability and get the bonus, but your teammate\'s attacking creatures are included in the calculation of those bonuses."}, {\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': \'This ability counts creatures, not creature types. For example, if you attack with five creatures — an Elf Shaman, an Elf Warrior, a Goblin Shaman, an Elemental, and a creature with all creature types — the ability will trigger five times. Those creatures will get +3/+0, +2/+0, +2/+0, +1/+0, and +4/+0, respectively.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you cast a creature spell of the chosen type, Door of Destinies will get a charge counter before the creature enters the battlefield. The creature will enter the battlefield with the additional boost to its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Creature types, such as Human or Sliver, appear after the dash on the type line of creatures. Notably, artifact is not a creature type. A creature may have more than one creature type, such as Goblin Warrior. Such a creature would benefit from Door of Destinies if the chosen creature type was Goblin or Warrior.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': \'Murmuring Bosk is a Forest, but it isn\\\'t a basic land. Things that affect basic lands don\\\'t affect it. Things that affect basic land types do. For example, you can\\\'t find Murmuring Bosk with Fertilid\\\'s ability ("searches their library for a basic land card"), but you can find Murmuring Bosk with Everbark Shaman\\\'s ability ("search your library for two Forest cards").\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Knollspine Dragon\'s ability checks only whether damage was dealt. It doesn\'t care whether the player\'s life total also changed for other reasons (such as if the player paid life or gained life). For example, if an opponent was dealt 4 damage and gained 6 life during the turn, that player will have a higher life total than they started the turn with — but Knollspine Dragon\'s ability will let you discard your hand and draw four cards."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "This ability counts the total amount of damage (both combat and noncombat) dealt to the targeted opponent by all sources (including ones you controlled and ones you didn\'t) over the course of the turn. Damage that was prevented or replaced doesn\'t count. Damage that resolved but didn\'t cause loss of life (due to Worship, for example) will count."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "You target an opponent when the ability triggers. You don\'t decide whether you want to discard and draw until the ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If River Kelpie and another permanent are each put onto the battlefield from a graveyard at the same time, River Kelpie’s first ability will trigger twice. (It will see the other permanent entering the battlefield.)'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you cast River Kelpie itself from your graveyard (by using Yawgmoth’s Will, for example), neither ability triggers. The first ability doesn’t trigger because River Kelpie is put onto the stack; the second ability doesn’t trigger because it works only while River Kelpie is already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you cast another artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker spell from a graveyard, only the second ability triggers. That’s because the card is put onto the stack, not onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you play a land card from a graveyard (by using Crucible of Worlds, for example), only the first ability triggers. That’s because the land (which isn’t a spell) is put directly onto the battlefield from the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'River Kelpie doesn’t give you the ability to cast spells from graveyards. Its second ability merely triggers whenever a spell is cast this way (by using Memory Plunder, for example).'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Forest or Plains, not for lands named Forest or Plains. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Hallowed Fountain (a nonbasic land with the land types Plains and Island), Sunpetal Grove will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Island or Swamp, not for lands named Island or Swamp. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Blood Crypt (a nonbasic land with the land types Swamp and Mountain), Drowned Catacomb will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Plains or Island, not for lands named Plains or Island. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Watery Grave (a nonbasic land with the land types Island and Swamp), Glacial Fortress will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Swamp or Mountain, not for lands named Swamp or Mountain. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Stomping Ground (a nonbasic land with the land types Mountain and Forest), Dragonskull Summit will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s first ability affects only other Elves you control. However, Elvish Archdruid\'s second ability counts all Elves you control — including itself."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sanguine Bond\'s ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it\'s 1 life from Soul Warden or 8 life from Tendrils of Corruption."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Sanguine Bond\'s ability will trigger twice and you may choose a different opponent for each trigger. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an ability triggers whenever an opponent loses life and causes you to gain life, such as the ability of Exquisite Blood, this will loop until either you win the game or a player takes an action to break the loop. If neither of these happen, the game ends in a draw.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and Sanguine Bond\\\'s ability triggers only once.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Soul’s Attendant and another creature enter the battlefield at the same time, Soul’s Attendant’s ability will trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as you put Inferno Titan\'s triggered ability on the stack, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. (In other words, as you put the ability on the stack, you choose whether to have it deal 3 damage to a single target, 2 damage to one target and 1 damage to another target, or 1 damage to each of three targets.)"}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'You check the power of your creatures as Overwhelming Stampede resolves. For example, if you control a 2/1 creature, a 2/2 creature, a 2/4 creature, a 4/1 creature, a 5/5 creature, and a 5/6 creature at that time, each of your creatures gets +5/+5 and gains trample until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'You may target any creature with the regeneration ability, not just one you control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is also an artifact when Go for the Throat tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is also an artifact when Go for the Throat tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Pristine Talisman has a mana ability. Its ability doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than four cards in your library, you\'ll look at all the cards there and put one into your hand and the rest into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "In most cases, when determining whether a creature entering the battlefield under your control should get a +1/+1 counter, you\'ll simply look at what the creature will looklike on the battlefield. You\'ll consider any effects affecting a creature entering the battlefield under your control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The effect is cumulative. Human creatures you control will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter for each Dearly Departed in your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Untapping an attacking creature doesn\'t remove it from combat."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The owner of a card is the player who started the game with that card in their deck.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Once a battalion ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter how many creatures are still attacking when that ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'The effects of battalion abilities vary from card to card. Read each card carefully.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The three attacking creatures don\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Creatures that come under your control after Frontline Medic\'s battalion ability resolves will not be granted indestructible by this effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can\'t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Pact of Negation is countered or otherwise doesn\'t resolve (perhaps because its target became illegal), the delayed triggered ability that threatens you with a game loss won\'t trigger at the beginning of your next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Pact of Negation resolves with a legal target but fails to counter that spell (most likely because that spell can\'t be countered), the delayed triggered ability will still trigger at the beginning of your next upkeep and you will have to pay. Or else."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner\'s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won\'t trigger and the card won\'t return to the battlefield. That\'s because persist checks the creature\'s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they\'ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player\'s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player\'s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it\'s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Colossal Whale\'s ability causes a zone change with a duration, a new style of ability that\'s somewhat reminiscent of older cards like Oblivion Ring. However, unlike Oblivion Ring, cards like Colossal Whale have a single ability that creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the creature when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after Colossal Whale leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Colossal Whale\'s triggered ability triggers and resolves during the declare attackers step, before blocking creatures are declared."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If Colossal Whale leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Colossal Whale\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Colossal Whale leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions. The two creatures aren\'t on the battlefield at the same time. For example, if the returning creature is a Clone, it can\'t enter the battlefield as a copy of Colossal Whale."}]', "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If Timber Protector somehow becomes a Forest, it doesn’t give itself indestructible.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If the permanent is still a legal target but is not destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), its controller still gets the Beast token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Beast Within tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates a Beast token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Beast token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Swan Song can target a spell that can\'t be countered. That spell won\'t be countered when Swan Song resolves, but its controller will get a Bird token."}]', "[{'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'After each opponent has decided, the effect happens simultaneously for each one who accepted the offer. Then, the effect happens again for you a number of times equal to the number of opponents who accepted.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Your opponents decide in turn order whether or not they accept the offer, starting with the opponent on your left. Each opponent will know the decisions of previous opponents in turn order when making their decision.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "If Realm Seekers enters the battlefield directly from a player\'s hand without being cast, it counts itself when determining the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The value of X is determined as Realm Seekers enters the battlefield. Players can cast spells and activate abilities while Realm Seekers is on the stack to remove cards from their hands if they wish, and this will result in fewer counters being placed on Realm Seekers as it enters the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Players can\'t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "You must vote for one of the available options. You can\'t abstain."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, dethrone will trigger if the creature attacks either player on the team with the most life or tied for the most life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Once dethrone triggers, it doesn\'t matter what happens to the players\' life totals before the ability resolves. You\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature even if the defending player doesn\'t have the most life as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Scourge of the Throne\\\'s ability has an intervening "if" clause. It must be attacking the player with the most life or tied with the most life both when it\\\'s declared as an attacker and as it starts to resolve for it to have any effect. If, at either time, the player isn\\\'t the one with the most life or tied for the most life, the ability will have no effect. Notably, this is different than how dethrone works. (Dethrone checks only once to see if the ability triggers.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Dethrone doesn\'t trigger if the creature attacks a planeswalker, even if its controller has the most life. The same is true if the creature attacks a battle, even if its protector has the most life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Fell the Mighty won\'t destroy the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Fell the Mighty tries to resolve, Fell the Mighty won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creatures will be destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Use the power of the target creature as Fell the Mighty resolves to determine which creatures are destroyed. Fell the Mighty doesn\'t target any of those creatures, so a creature with hexproof or protection from white will be destroyed if its power is high enough."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose the opponents for each effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose the same opponent for each of the effects, or you may choose different opponents. None of the affected players are targets of the spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If you control no other creatures as Merciless Executioner\'s ability resolves, you\'ll have to sacrifice Merciless Executioner."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'Although the token is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "As [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[This creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield as a copy of or becomes a copy of a creature whose dash cost was paid, the copy won\'t have haste and won\'t be returned to its owner\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If another creature becomes or enters the battlefield as a copy of the token, you won\'t exile that creature at end of combat. However, if Flamerush Rider creates multiple tokens due to a replacement effect (like the one Doubling Season creates), you\'ll exile each of those tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature had {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is a token, the token created by Flamerush Rider copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature was copying something else, the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature was copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If you choose to pay the dash cost rather than the mana cost, you\'re still casting the spell. It goes on the stack and can be responded to and countered. You can cast a creature spell for its dash cost only when you otherwise could cast that creature spell. Most of the time, this means during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If you pay the dash cost to cast a creature spell, that card will be returned to its owner\'s hand only if it\'s still on the battlefield when its triggered ability resolves. If it dies or goes to another zone before then, it will stay where it is."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on. Notably, it doesn\'t copy any effects that may have turned a noncreature permanent into a creature. If the token isn\'t a creature as it enters the battlefield, it won\'t be attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "You choose which opponent or opposing planeswalker the token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker Flamerush Rider is attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to attack with the creature with dash unless another ability says you do."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If the player\'s graveyard is empty, the player will shuffle their library, then you\'ll draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'A "commander creature" is a permanent that\\\'s both someone\\\'s commander and a creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Bastion Protector\'s ability applies to any commander creature you control, whether you own it or not."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Bastion Protector\'s ability doesn\'t apply to commanders that aren\'t currently creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'Any creatures controlled by the player that are already untapped will just get +2/+2 until end of turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Great Oak Guardian\'s last ability targets only the player, not any creatures. Creatures with shroud that player controls will be affected, for example."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery card you cast this way goes to a zone other than exile or a graveyard, perhaps because one of its abilities says to put it into its owner\'s hand, it won\'t be exiled. This is true even if the card would be put into a graveyard later that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'If an instant or sorcery card you cast this way is countered, it will be exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'If the instant or sorcery card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the target instant or sorcery card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast it, it will remain in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay alternative costs such as surge costs. You can pay additional costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'You cast the card during the resolution of the enters-the-battlefield ability, not later in the turn. If it\\\'s a sorcery card, ignore the timing restrictions based on it being a sorcery card. Other timing restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during combat," must be followed.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If the nonland permanent becomes an illegal target, Anguished Unmaking doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t lose 3 life."}]', "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost, such as a land, has a converted mana cost of 0.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The phrase “different converted mana costs” compares the mana costs of cards in your graveyard to one another, not to Seasons Past. You may return a card with a converted mana cost of 6.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'You choose which cards to return as Seasons Past resolves, not as you cast it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Forest or Plains is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Fortified Village, you may reveal the other land to have Fortified Village enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Fortified Village onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Fortified Village itself is neither a Forest nor a Plains, even though it produces green and white mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Fortified Village."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Plains or Island is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Port Town, you may reveal the other land to have Port Town enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Port Town onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Port Town itself is neither a Plains nor an Island, even though it produces white and blue mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Canopy Vista from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Port Town."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an Island or Swamp is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Choked Estuary, you may reveal the other land to have Choked Estuary enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Choked Estuary onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Choked Estuary itself is neither an Island nor a Swamp, even though it produces blue and black mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Choked Estuary."}]', "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Second Harvest copies all tokens, not only creature tokens. Notably, this includes Clue tokens.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Second Harvest copies the original characteristics of each token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. It doesn’t copy whether that token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Extract from Darkness doesn\'t target a creature card. You choose which card you\'re putting onto the battlefield as it resolves. You can choose any creature card in a graveyard at that time, including one just put into a graveyard by Extract from Darkness. If there are no creature cards in graveyards at that time, Extract from Darkness simply finishes resolving."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Faithless Looting is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'The number of Spiders you control is checked only as Ishkanah’s last ability resolves. The ability will count Ishkanah itself if it’s still on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger whenever you "become the monarch" trigger only if you aren\\\'t already the monarch. For example, if you are already the monarch as Custodi Lich enters the battlefield, its last ability won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack, and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Creatures destroyed this way count toward the life gained even if they\'re put into a zone other than a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Creatures with indestructible aren\'t destroyed this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Causing an opponent to lose the game after you\'ve announced that you\'re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won\'t cause you to have to pay more mana."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don\'t affect its mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "If each target is illegal as Seeds of Renewal resolves, Seeds of Renewal doesn\'t resolve and is put into its owner\'s graveyard. It\'s not exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "If one target becomes illegal before Seeds of Renewal resolves, you\'ll still return the legal target from your graveyard to your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Selfless Squire\'s first triggered ability prevents all damage that would be dealt to you this turn after the triggered ability resolves, even if Selfless Squire leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'Selfless Squire\\\'s second triggered ability doesn\\\'t trigger only when damage is prevented by its first triggered ability\\\'s effect. Any effect that uses the word "prevent" will cause it to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'All cards in the Aether Revolt set with triggered revolt abilities use an intervening "if" clause. A permanent you controlled must have left the battlefield earlier in the turn in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there\\\'s no way to have the ability trigger if no permanent you controlled has left the battlefield that turn, even if you intend to have one do so in response to the triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t permanents. Paying {E} won\'t satisfy a revolt ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don\'t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don\'t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities don\'t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They\'re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Explore\'s effect allows you to play an additional land during your main phase. Doing so follows the normal timing rules for playing lands. In particular, you don\'t get to play a land as Explore resolves; Explore fully resolves first and you draw a card, perhaps a land you\'ll play later."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If you somehow manage to cast Explore when it\'s not your turn, you\'ll draw a card when it resolves, but you won\'t be able to play a land that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Explores in the same turn are cumulative. They\'re also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Urban Evolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you\'re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you\'ll exile the card if it would leave the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can\'t cast the half with aftermath."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you\'ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you\'d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can\'t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All cards in the Amonkhet set that let you exert a creature let you do so as you declare it as an attacking creature, as do some of the cards in the Hour of Devastation set. You can\'t do so later in combat, and creatures put onto the battlefield attacking can\'t be exerted. Any abilities that trigger on exerting an attacking creature will resolve before blockers are declared."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Combat Celebrant\'s ability untaps all of your creatures, not just the ones that are attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If an exerted creature is already untapped during your next untap step (most likely because it had vigilance or an effect untapped it), exert\'s effect preventing it from untapping expires without having done anything."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you exert Combat Celebrant, you get an additional combat phase even if Combat Celebrant doesn\'t survive the first combat phase."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you exert multiple Combat Celebrants in one combat phase, you\'ll have that many additional combat phases, but all of your creatures are untapped only during the current combat phase. You\'ll need to exert the Combat Celebrants one at a time, in multiple combat phases, to untap your attacking creatures and attack with them in each combat step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you gain control of another player\'s creature until end of turn and exert it, it will untap during that player\'s untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "There\'s no main phase between your combat phases, so you\'ll have no opportunity to cast spells or activate abilities that could only be cast any time you could cast a sorcery. For example, you won\'t be able to cast another creature or equip Equipment between combats."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Untapping an attacking creature doesn\'t remove it from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'You can\\\'t exert a creature unless an effect allows you to do so. Similar effects that "tap and freeze" a creature (such as that of Decision Paralysis) don\\\'t exert that creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate. Notably, exerting a creature isn\\\'t an activated ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Harsh Mentor\'s ability doesn\'t trigger when an opponent activates an ability of a card in hand (such as cycling) or a card in a graveyard (such as embalm), even if that causes a card to be put onto the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Harsh Mentor\'s ability resolves before the ability that caused it to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t put the top card of your library into your hand, you put it back on top of your library without revealing it. You\'ll draw it in that turn\'s draw step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you somehow control a Herald\'s Horn with no chosen creature type, no spells will cost less to cast, not even creature spells with no creature type. You\'ll be able to look at the top card of your library at the beginning of each of your upkeeps, but you can never put it into your hand this way, even if it\'s a creature card with no creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "The effect of Herald\'s Horn reduces only generic mana in a spell\'s cost. If that cost has no generic mana, the cost isn\'t reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Cat Warrior." A Cat Warrior is both a Cat and a Warrior. It\\\'s affected by anything that affects either type and unaffected by things that affect non-Cat or non-Warrior creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'You must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Cat. Card types such as "artifact" can\\\'t be chosen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'"Artifact" isn\\\'t a creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Compare the revealed cards to the creature as it last existed before it died, not to the creature card as it exists in its owner\'s graveyard, to determine which one you put into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If Heirloom Blade leaves the battlefield at the same time that the equipped creature dies, its triggered ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If the equipped creature has no creature type, no card can share a creature type with it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t reveal a creature card that shares a type with the creature that died, you\'ll just reveal and randomize your library."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "You\'ll reveal cards until you find one that shares at least one creature type with the creature that died. For example, if a Cat Wizard dies, you\'ll stop if you reveal a Human Wizard or Cat Soldier."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Hostage Taker has received errata to prevent it from targeting itself. The correct Oracle wording appears above.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield. You can\'t cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If it\'s still in exile, the exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Hostage Taker\'s owner leaves the game while the card is still exiled and another player owns that card, the exiled card will return to the battlefield under its owner\'s control. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spell or permanent cards you control from Hostage Taker\'s ability are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once you begin to cast the exiled card, it\'s considered a new object. You\'ll control that spell and the permanent that spell becomes even if Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "The choice of creature type is made as Vanquisher\'s Banner enters the battlefield. Players can\'t respond to this choice. The bonus starts applying immediately."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "The last ability of Vanquisher\'s Banner resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if the creature spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control of the chosen type may become lethal if Vanquisher\'s Banner leaves the battlefield during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Fungus or Sliver. You can\'t choose multiple creature types, such as Fungus Sliver. Card types such as artifact can\'t be chosen, nor can subtypes that aren\'t creature types, such as Jace, Vehicle, or Treasure."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Abyssal Persecutor won\'t preclude an opponent\'s life total from reaching 0 or less. It will just preclude that player from losing the game as a result."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'Effects that say the game is a draw, such as the _Legends_(TM) card Divine Intervention, are not affected by Abyssal Persecutor.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Even though your opponents can\'t lose the game, a player can\'t pay an amount of life that\'s greater than their life total. If a player\'s life total is 0 or less, that player can\'t pay life at all, with one exception: a player may always pay 0 life."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If Abyssal Persecutor leaves the battlefield while an opponent has 0 or less life, that opponent will lose the game as a state-based action. No player can respond between the time Abyssal Persecutor leaves the battlefield and the time that player loses the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "No game effect can cause you to win the game or cause any opponent to lose the game while you control Abyssal Persecutor. It doesn\'t matter whether an opponent has 0 or less life, an opponent is forced to draw a card while their library is empty, an opponent has ten or more poison counters, an opponent is dealt combat damage by Phage the Untouchable, you control Felidar Sovereign and have 40 or more life, or so on. You keep playing."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Other circumstances can still cause an opponent to lose the game, however. An opponent will lose a game if they concede, if that player is penalized with a Game Loss or a Match Loss during a sanctioned tournament due to a DCI rules infraction, or if that player\'s Magic Online® game clock runs out of time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "All of the permanents put onto the battlefield this way enter at the same time. If any have triggered abilities that trigger on something else entering the battlefield, they\'ll see each other."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a card in your library has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0. Such cards can always be put onto the battlefield with Genesis Wave."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If you have fewer than X cards in your library, you reveal all of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to put permanent cards revealed this way onto the battlefield if you choose not to, regardless of their mana values."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'As Living Death resolves, all players exile their creature cards from graveyards at the same time. Then all players sacrifice all creatures they control at the same time. Then all players put all creatures they exiled onto the battlefield at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Only cards exiled by Living Death\'s first instruction are put onto the battlefield. If a replacement effect (such as that of Leyline of the Void) causes any of the sacrificed creatures to be exiled instead of put into a graveyard, those cards aren\'t returned to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If an opponent is instructed to draw a card then discard a card, and Notion Thief causes you to draw a card instead, that opponent still discards a card. The same is true of any other actions that opponent is instructed to do.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If two or more players each control a Notion Thief and a player would draw a card other than the first one in their draw step, that player chooses one of the applicable Notion Thief effects to apply. Then the player whose Notion Thief\'s effect was chosen repeats this process among the remaining Notion Thief effects, and so on, until there are no more possible such effects to apply. Each effect can be applied to the card draw only once this way."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'The above procedure means that if each player in a two-player game controls a Notion Thief and one would draw a card, it really will be that player who draws a card.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apply power bonuses from counters the creature enters the battlefield with and continuous effects such as that of Valiant Knight before checking to see if Mentor of the Meek\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Mentor of the Meek\'s ability checks the power of the other creature only as it enters the battlefield. If that creature\'s power is 2 or less, the ability will trigger. Once the ability triggers, raising that creature\'s power above 2 won\'t affect that ability. Similarly, reducing the creature\'s power to 2 or less after it enters the battlefield won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Mentor of the Meek, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Guttersnipe\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Guttersnipe\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'An artifact is "tapped for mana" when a player activates a mana ability of an artifact that includes {T} (the tap symbol). Notably, tapping an artifact to pay for a spell with the improvise keyword is not tapping that artifact for mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an opponent taps an artifact for mana during your turn, you\'ll gain control of it and keep control of it until the end of your next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If multiple players each control Treasure Nabbers, an artifact tapped for mana will make quite a journey. For example, if player A taps an artifact for mana during their turn, and players B and C are the next players in turn order who control Treasure Nabbers, C\'s ability resolves before B and C gains control of the artifact. Then B gains control of the artifact. B keeps it during their turn, and then C regains control of the artifact once B\'s effect expires, then A will have it back after C\'s expires. However, if B or C taps the artifact for mana, one of them will take it from the other. You may need to pay very careful attention to which effects are still in effect, which have expired, and who owns what."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the artifact leaves the battlefield, Treasure Nabber doesn\'t nab it from the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you control multiple Treasure Nabbers, their effects all expire at the same time. You won\'t keep an artifact for any longer."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If that player controls any nabbed treasures, the effect giving that player control of those artifacts ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The artifact remains tapped when you gain control of it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word "draw," the card wasn\\\'t drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won\'t be able to cast it using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "It\'s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can\\\'t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven\'t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you\'ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don\'t want to cast it at that time (or you can\'t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won\'t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it\'s the first card you\'ve drawn that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card\'s type."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don\'t wish to cast it at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don\'t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2018-09-11', 'text': 'This card preview was provided to Scryfall courtesy of Wizards of the Coast. Thank you!'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Dawn of Hope\'s first ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it\'s 1 life from Vicious Rumors or 3 life from Creeping Chill."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Dawn of Hope\'s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and Dawn of Hope\\\'s first ability triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay {2} multiple times to draw more than one card each time you resolve Dawn of Hope\'s triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If any abilities trigger on the creature entering the battlefield, those abilities resolve after you lose life. If losing life results in you losing the game, those abilities won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the creature you control from Reanimate is exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "The amount of life you lose is determined by the mana value of the card in your graveyard, not the creature once it\'s on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'You lose life after the creature is already on the battlefield. Any abilities it has that interact with loss of life, such as that of Platinum Emperion, apply to that loss of life.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'If Fiend Hunter leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the target creature indefinitely. This is different from abilities on other cards that exile a permanent "until" something happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if you lose the game, the creature exiled with Fiend Hunter remains exiled indefinitely. This is also different from abilities on other cards that exile a permanent "until" something happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'The spell can\\\'t be countered if the mana produced by Cavern of Souls is spent to cover any cost of the spell, even an additional cost such as a kicker cost. This is true even if you use the mana to pay an additional cost while casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact can\'t be chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Addendum abilities of instant spells apply while the spell is resolving, not immediately after casting it. If the spell is countered, you don\'t get the addendum bonus. For example, if you cast Sphinx\'s Insight during your main phase, you gain 2 life during its resolution, after you draw two cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If a spell with an addendum ability is copied, the copy won\'t give you the addendum bonus. This is because the copy wasn\'t cast at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Unbreakable Formation affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain indestructible or vigilance and they won\'t get a +1/+1 counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Growth Spiral\'s effect doesn\'t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if it\'s not your turn or if you\'ve already played your land for the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Although the common lands have basic land types, they aren\'t basic lands."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once the common lands (such as Mystic Sanctuary) enter the battlefield tapped, there\'s no way to untap them with a spell or ability to make their last ability trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Kenrith\'s first ability affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t gain trample or haste."}, {\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': \'Kenrith’s last ability can target a creature card in any player’s graveyard. Its owner will control the creature, and it will remain on the battlefield even if you leave the game (if you don’t own it).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once The Great Henge\'s last ability has triggered, you\'ll draw a card even if you can\'t put a +1/+1 counter on the creature for some reason (most likely because it has left the battlefield)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much a relic\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Once you determine the cost to cast The Great Henge, you may activate mana abilities to pay that cost. If the greatest power among creatures you control changes while activating mana abilities, the cost to cast The Great Henge remains what you previously determined.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in the relic\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'The first step of casting a spell is to move it to the stack. If this causes the greatest power among creatures you control to change, that new power will be used to determine the cost reduction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of Revenge of Ravens resolves before any abilities the attacking player controls. If this causes the attacking player to lose the game, that player\'s triggered abilities won\'t resolve and no combat damage will be dealt."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, damage previously dealt to a creature with indestructible may cause it to be destroyed if Shadowspear\'s second ability resolves during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a permanent enters the battlefield under an opponent\'s control with hexproof or indestructible after Shadowspear\'s second ability resolves, it won\'t lose that ability unless you activate Shadowspear\'s second ability again. The same is true if an opponent\'s permanent gains indestructible or hexproof after Shadowspear\'s second ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You can activate Shadowspear\'s second ability whether or not it\'s equipped to a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Creatures your opponents control attacking one of your opponents will cause Frontier Warmonger\'s ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you play a land from the top of your library and it has a replacement effect that requires you to make a decision (such as that of Temple Garden), you must make that decision without knowing the next card of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Verge Rangers doesn\'t allow you to play additional lands."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Verge Rangers lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Shiny Impetus causes you to create a Treasure token, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'+1/+1 counters on The Ozolith have no effect unless it becomes a creature. Keyword counters on The Ozolith will grant it keywords that may have no practical effect. For example, flying on a noncreature artifact is just strange, but hexproof on a noncreature artifact is entirely useful.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "As The Ozolith\'s last ability resolves, you choose whether to move the counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If The Ozolith leaves the battlefield after the last ability triggers but before it resolves, you can\'t move any counters from it onto the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time The Ozolith\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. You won\'t remove any counters from The Ozolith."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The Ozolith\'s first ability doesn\'t move counters off the creature that\'s left the battlefield. Rather, you put the same number of each kind of counter the creature had onto The Ozoloith. Notably, if you somehow control a second The Ozolith, each one will receive the same number and kinds of counters that were on the creature that left the battlefield. Similarly, if the creature has an ability that triggers when it leaves the battlefield that refers to the number of counters it had, that ability will use the number of counters that were on the permanent, even if The Ozolith\'s first ability resolves first."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t move only some of the counters from The Ozolith onto the target creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A planeswalker with indestructible still loses loyalty counters as it\'s dealt damage and will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard if its loyalty reaches 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The set of permanents affected by Heroic Intervention is determined as the spell resolves. Permanents you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain hexproof and indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "A battle with indestructible still loses defense counters as it\'s dealt damage. If it\'s a Siege, it will still be exiled when the last defense counter is removed from it, and its controller may still cast it transformed without paying its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Basalt Monolith\'s last ability can untap it as often as you can pay for it. If you believe you\'ve found a way to generate an unbounded amount of mana with it, you\'re probably right."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Ensnaring Bridge\'s effect checks the number of cards in your hand only while a player (including you) is declaring attackers. Once a creature has legally attacked, changing its power or the number of cards in your hand won\'t remove it from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Lightning Greaves to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t simply unequip Equipment from a creature. If Lightning Greaves is attached to the only creature you control, you won\'t be able to attach other equipment to it (or target it with anything else) until you have another creature onto which you can move Lightning Greaves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'All creatures on the battlefield when Toxic Deluge resolves are affected. Ones that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn are not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you cast Toxic Deluge without paying its mana cost, you\'ll still choose a value for X and pay X life. This is because it doesn\'t have {X} in its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If there is no legal creature for you to attach the Equipment to, it remains on the battlefield unattached.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Stonehewer Giant\'s ability doesn\'t target a creature. However, the creature must be able to be legally equipped by the Equipment. For example, you could attach the Equipment to a creature with shroud, but not to one with protection from artifacts."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a kicked spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If any targets become illegal, the other targets will still be affected as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If either target creature is an illegal target as Inscription of Abundance resolves with its last mode chosen, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If more than one mode is chosen, perform them in the order written. Nothing can happen in between, however, and no player may choose to take actions. Any abilities that trigger will be put onto the stack after the spell has finished resolving.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the second mode is chosen and each creature the target player controls has negative power, that player doesn\'t gain or lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you copy a kicked spell, the copy is also kicked. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn\'t kicked, even if the original was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you kick Inscription of Abundance, you can\'t choose any one mode more than once."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you put a permanent with a kicker ability onto the battlefield without casting it, you can\'t kick it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Kicker represents an optional additional cost that you may choose to pay as you cast the spell. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is "kicked."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Some instant or sorcery spells require alternative or additional targets if they\'re kicked. You ignore these targeting requirements if those spells aren\'t kicked, and you can\'t kick those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can kick a permanent spell even if you won\'t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "To determine a spell\'s total cost, start with the mana cost (or an alternative cost if another card\'s effect allows you to pay one instead), add any cost increases (such as kicker), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay a kicker cost more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Feed the Swarm tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t lose any life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The amount of life you lose is determined by the permanent\'s mana value as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Humble Defector\'s ability can be activated any time during your turn, including in response to a spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Humble Defector is controlled by a player other than its owner, and its controller leaves the game, the effect giving that player control of Humble Defector ends. Humble Defector will return to the control of the player still in the game who most recently controlled it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector isn\'t on the battlefield as its ability resolves, but the target player is still a legal target, the ability will resolve. You\'ll draw two cards, even though the player doesn\'t gain control of Humble Defector."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector\'s owner leaves the game, Humble Defector humbly leaves the game along with that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If paying the activation cost of the ability includes sacrificing Rings of Brighthearth, the ability won\'t be copied. At the time the ability is considered activated (after all costs are paid), Rings of Brighthearth is no longer on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the ability has {X} in its cost, the copy uses the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the ability it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability of Rings of Brighthearth and the copy it creates both resolve before the ability that caused it to trigger. They resolve even if that ability is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay {2} more than once for each time the triggered ability of Rings of Brighthearth resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Count the number of opponents you currently have, not how many you started with. If your four-player game is down to you and a single opponent, the land enters the battlefield tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an effect puts the land onto the battlefield tapped, having two or more opponents won\'t untap it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter how many Elves enter the battlefield under your control. The ability creates only one Elf Warrior creature token."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "Once the triggered ability has triggered once during a turn, it can\'t trigger again, even if the triggered ability is still on the stack, has been countered, or has otherwise left the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "The activated ability affects only Elves you control as the ability resolves. Elves you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get the bonuses. Creatures you control that become Elves later in the turn won\'t get the bonuses, and Elves you control that got the bonuses that stop being Elves later in the turn won\'t lose them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you\'re not the monarch as Palace Jailer\'s second ability resolves, the creature will be exiled until there\'s a new monarch and that player is one of your opponents. The creature won\'t immediately return just because an opponent is the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if the monarch leaves the game, the player whose turn it is immediately becomes the monarch. If the player whose turn it is has left the game, instead the next player in turn order becomes the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Palace Jailer leaving the battlefield won\'t cause the exiled creature to return. The game will continue to watch for the next time an opponent becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The opponent that controlled the exiled card doesn\'t have to be the same opponent that becomes the monarch in order to cause that card to return to the battlefield. Any opponent becoming the monarch will cause the card to return."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Banishing Light leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an Aura is exiled this way, its owner chooses what it will enchant as it returns to the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to a permanent with shroud, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains in exile for the rest of the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Mystic Confluence is copied, the effect that creates the copy will usually allow you to choose new targets, but you can\'t choose new modes."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If the middle mode is chosen more than once, you choose the relative order to return the target creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you choose the first and/or second modes but all of the targets become illegal before Mystic Confluence resolves, the spell won\'t resolve. If you also chose the last mode once or twice, you won\'t draw any cards. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'No matter which combination of modes you choose, you always follow the instructions in the order they are written.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "No player can cast spells or activate abilities in between the modes of a resolving spell. Any abilities that trigger won\'t be put onto the stack until Mystic Confluence is done resolving."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an effect such as that of Magus of the Moon causes Urborg to lose its abilities by setting it to a basic land type not in addition to its other types, it won\'t turn lands into Swamps, no matter in what order those effects started to apply."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Land cards not on the battlefield aren\'t Swamps while Urborg is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Urborg\\\'s ability causes each land on the battlefield to have the land type Swamp. Any land that\\\'s a Swamp has the ability "{T}: Add {B}." Nothing else changes about those lands, including their names, other subtypes, other abilities, and whether they\\\'re legendary, basic, or snow.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth isn\'t a Swamp while it\'s not on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Path to Exile tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. The creature\'s controller won\'t search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The controller of the exiled creature isn\'t required to search their library for a basic land. If that player doesn\'t, the player won\'t shuffle their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target land is an illegal target by the time Field of Ruin\'s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. No players search for a basic land card or shuffles. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), each player does search and shuffle."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can target any permanent, including one that\'s untapped or one that you already control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can cast Everflowing Chalice without kicking it at all if you wish. However, if Everflowing Chalice has no charge counters on it, activating its last ability won\'t produce any mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A player\\\'s "opening hand" is the hand of cards the player has after all players have taken mulligans. If players have any cards in hand that allow actions to be taken with them from a player\\\'s opening hand, the starting player takes all such actions first in any order, followed by each other player in turn order. Then the first turn begins.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If multiple Gemstone Caverns are put onto the battlefield under a single player\\\'s control before the game begins, the "legend rule" won\\\'t put the extras into that player\\\'s graveyard until just before the starting player gets priority during the game\\\'s first upkeep step. There\\\'s no opportunity to tap the extras for mana.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Farseek can find any land with any of the listed land types, including nonbasic ones, even if that land is a Forest in addition to one or more of those types.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is greater than 3 as Access Tunnel\'s second ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. However, if instead the creature\'s power is raised above 3 after the ability resolves, it still can\'t be blocked that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or less has been blocked, Access Tunnel\'s second ability won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As Sword of Hearth and Home\'s second ability resolves, the land and the creature will enter the battlefield at the same time."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the creature you own is a token, it won\'t return to the battlefield. It will stay in exile and cease to exist after the ability finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you choose a target creature you own and that creature isn\'t a legal target as the triggered ability tries to resolve, that ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t search for a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Land cards not on the battlefield aren\'t Forests while Yavimaya is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Yavimaya\\\'s ability causes each land on the battlefield to have the land type Forest. Any land that\\\'s a Forest has the ability "{T}: Add {G}." Nothing else changes about those lands, including their names, other subtypes, and whether they\\\'re legendary, basic, or snow.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth isn\'t a Forest while it\'s not on the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana ability of Cabal Coffers counts each land you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Typecycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on a card being typecycled. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops a typecycling ability from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, typecycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Rather, it lets you search your library for a card with the type or types indicated by the ability name. For example, a card with basic landcycling lets you search for a basic land card, and a card with Wizardcycling lets you search for a Wizard card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "If Secluded Courtyard is somehow on the battlefield without a chosen type, mana from its second mana ability can\'t be spent on anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Siege-Gang Commander\'s activated ability, including Siege-Gang Commander itself."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Piles may be empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You must discard exactly one card to cast Thrill of Possibility; you can\'t cast it without discarding a card, and you can\'t discard additional cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "A creature that is both a Beast and a Bird still only gets one instance of ward {1} from Radagast, Wizard of Wilds\'s first ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If Radagast, Wizard of Wilds is a Beast or a Bird, it will have two instances of ward {1}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Radagast, Wizard of the Wilds\'s last triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger resolves. It will resolve even if the spell that caused it to trigger is countered or has otherwise left the stack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "A creature that is both a Goblin and an Orc still only gets one instance of ward {2} from Saruman, the White Hand\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If Saruman, the White Hand is a Goblin or an Orc, it will have ward {2}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Activating Corsairs of Umbar\'s first ability after a Goblin, Orc, or Pirate has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Sauron, Lord of the Rings\'s last ability will trigger even if the owner of the commander that died chooses to return it to the command zone after it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The creature card you choose doesn\'t need to be a card you milled. You may choose a creature card that was already in your graveyard before you milled."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you want to cast one of the milled cards, you cast it as part of the resolution of Summons of Saruman. You can\'t wait to cast the spell later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "An opponent who chooses not to pay {X} for Champions of Minas Tirith\'s last ability can still attack planeswalkers you control or battles you\'re protecting."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the spell resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Except in some very rare cases, the card each opponent draws will be the card revealed from the top of their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a permanent spell is copied, it\'s put onto the battlefield as a token as the spell resolves rather than putting the copy of the spell onto the battlefield. The rules that apply to a permanent spell becoming a permanent apply to a copy of a spell becoming a token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was put onto the stack, the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters to targets."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Creating the copy won\\\'t cause abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell or ability it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If the spell is a permanent spell with targets, such as an Aura, you may also choose a new target for that spell. The new targets must be legal. If, for any target, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The token that a resolving copy of a spell becomes isn\\\'t said to have been "created" and won\\\'t interact with abilities that care about tokens being created, such as that of Rosie Cotton of South Lane.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability and the copy it creates will resolve before the spell that caused the ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'While a spell with {X} in its mana cost is on the stack, use the value of X that was chosen when it was cast to determine its mana value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for a copied spell. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You copy the spell you cast, not any of the revealed cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You create only one copy, no matter how many revealed cards share a card type with the spell you cast or how many card types those cards share with the spell you cast.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a creature targeted by In the Darkness Bind Them\'s final chapter ability changes controllers before the ability resolves, that creature is no longer a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "When In the Darkness Bind Them\'s final chapter ability triggers, you can choose to target no creatures just so that the Ring tempts you. However, if you do choose at least one target, and all of those targets are illegal at the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "While resolving In the Darkness Bind Them\'s first three chapter abilities, you can choose the Wraith token you just created to be your Ring-bearer as the Ring tempts you."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Assemble the Entmoot\'s activated ability counts the total amount of life you gained without taking into account any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you gained 3 life and lost 3 life earlier in the turn, you\'ll create three tapped 3/3 green Treefolk creature tokens, then put a reach counter on each of them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or the player that goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Cavern-Hoard Dragon\'s first ability counts only the artifacts controlled by the opponent who controls the greatest number of artifacts among your opponents. If you have an opponent who controls two artifacts and another opponent who controls three artifacts, Cavern-Hoard Dragon\'s mana cost would be reduced by {3}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Cavern-Hoard Dragon\'s last ability cares about the number of artifacts that player controls as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the greatest number of artifacts an opponent controls is seven or more, Cavern-Hoard Dragon costs {R}{R} to cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced that they are casting Cavern-Hoard Dragon, no player may take actions to try and change the greatest number of artifacts an opponent controls before Cavern-Hoard Dragon\'s cost is locked in."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Even 1 damage dealt to a creature from a source with deathtouch is considered lethal damage, so any amount greater than that will cause excess damage to be dealt, even if the total amount of damage isn\'t greater than the creature\'s toughness. Note that a source of damage having deathtouch has no effect on damage dealt to planeswalkers."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Excess damage has been dealt to a creature if the damage dealt to it is greater than lethal damage. Usually, this means damage greater than its toughness, although damage already marked on the creature is taken into account.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Galadhrim Ambush counts all attacking creatures no matter which player, planeswalker, or battle they\'re attacking, including attacking creatures you control if Galadhrim Ambush is cast during your combat phase."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gollum, Obsessed Stalker\'s last ability counts players who were dealt combat damage by any creature named Gollum, Obsessed Stalker. It doesn\'t matter who controlled those creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gollum, Obsessed Stalker\'s last ability counts the total amount of life you gained without taking into account any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you gained 3 life and lost 3 life earlier in the turn, each opponent dealt combat damage this game by a creature named Gollum, Obsessed Stalker loses 3 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gwaihir, Greatest of the Eagles\'s ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained 3 or more life by the time an end step begins, Gwaihir, Greatest of the Eagles\'s ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You create just one Bird token, no matter how much life you\'ve gained past 3 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Arwen, Weaver of Hope and another creature you control enter the battlefield at the same time, Arwen\'s ability won\'t cause that creature to enter with additional +1/+1 counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To determine how many additional +1/+1 counters a creature enters the battlefield with, use Arwen, Weaver of Hope\'s toughness as that creature is entering the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Legolas Greenleaf enters the battlefield at the same time as another legendary creature you control, Legolas\'s Greenleaf\'s third ability will trigger and put a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Reducing a creature\'s power after it has blocked Legolas Greenleaf will not remove that blocking creature from combat or make Legolas Greenleaf unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Lobelia, Defender of Bag End leaves the battlefield, and later another Lobelia, Defender of Bag End enters the battlefield, it is a new object (even if the two were represented by the same card). You can\'t play cards exiled by the original Lobelia, Defender of Bag End with the second ability of the new Lobelia, Defender of Bag End."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To play a card using the permission granted by the first mode of Lobelia, Defender of Bag End\'s activated ability, you must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can play a land from exile this way only during your main phase while the stack is empty, and only if you have an available land play remaining for the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You may look at these face-down exiled cards any time you wish. No other player may look at the face-down cards you exiled with Lobelia, Defender of Bag End, even if another player takes control of it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield as a copy of or becomes a copy of a creature whose dash cost was paid, the copy won\'t have haste and won\'t be returned to its owner\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you pay the dash cost to cast a creature spell, that card will be returned to its owner\'s hand only if it\'s still on the battlefield when its triggered ability resolves. If it dies or goes to another zone before then, it will stay where it is."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to attack with the creature with dash unless another ability says you do."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a player is attacking a planeswalker you control or a battle you\'re protecting but not attacking you, Mirkwood Trapper\'s last ability will still trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to sacrifice a creature, and you control any creatures other than the ones you gained control of with Call for Aid this turn, you must sacrifice one of them. You can\'t try to sacrifice one of the creatures you gained control of, fail, and therefore ignore the effect."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice the creatures you gained control of with Call for Aid this turn for any reason. If an effect instructs you to sacrifice one of them, you can\'t and it remains on the battlefield. You also can\'t sacrifice any of them to pay a cost that requires you to sacrifice a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If an opponent has multiple votes, it\'s possible for them to count as both an opponent who voted for a choice you voted for and an opponent who voted for a choice you didn\'t vote for."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "When Erestor of the Council\'s ability resolves, you\'ll draw a card at the end no matter how other players voted."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If another Human didn\'t enter the battlefield before your beginning of combat step, Éowyn, Shieldmaiden\'s ability won\'t trigger. You won\'t draw a card even if you control six or more Humans."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the monarch leaves the game, and that player is not the owner of Fealty to the Realm, the active player or the next player in turn order becomes the monarch and thus gains control of the enchanted creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the monarch leaves the game, and that player is the owner of Fealty to the Realm, the active player or the next player in turn order becomes the monarch. That player gains control of the enchanted creature for a very brief moment. At the same time, Fealty to the Realm leaves the game, and control of the enchanted creature reverts to its owner (unless another control-changing effect applies.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the case where Fealty to the Realm is enchanting a creature but there is no monarch, the second ability will create a control-changing effect with the timestamp mentioned above, but that effect won\'t do anything until a player becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The timestamp of Fealty to the Realm\'s control-changing effect is the time at which it entered the battlefield and won\'t change when another player becomes the monarch. This means that, if another player gains control of the creature enchanted with Fealty to the Realm, they won\'t lose control of it when another player becomes the monarch. When (or if) that control-changing effect ends, the enchanted creature will then be controlled by the current monarch, which might be a different player than it was when that control-changing effect began."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "When Aragorn, King of Gondor\'s last ability triggers, you can choose not to target a creature, probably because you\'re the monarch and just want creatures to be unable to block this turn. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Creatures will still be able to block this turn, even if you\'re the monarch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "When Oath of Eorl\'s final chapter ability triggers, you can choose not to target a Human just to become the monarch. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t become the monarch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If that player exiles their entire library without exiling an instant or sorcery card, they will randomize the order of the exiled cards, and the cards then become that player\'s library, ending the effect. They will not continue to exile and randomize their library forever."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you choose not to cast the card, it is put on the bottom of its owner\'s library in a random order along with the other exiled cards."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The cards are exiled face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You cast the card while the ability is resolving and still on the stack. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the card you return to the battlefield isn\'t a creature on the battlefield, it has no power and therefore deals no damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained 3 or more life by the time an end step begins, The Gaffer\'s ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The Gaffer\'s ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You draw just one card, no matter how much life you\'ve gained past 3 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In a two-player game, the other player is the player to your right. (They\'re also the player to your left. Funny how that works.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'In some formats, such as Two-Headed Giant, the player to your right might be a teammate. In that case, that teammate gains control of Hithlain Rope as either ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that the Elf card you return to your hand doesn\'t have power, you\'ll gain 0 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The chosen player needs only to have the most life or tied for most life as The Black Gate\'s last ability resolves. After the ability resolves, any changes in life total won\'t affect which creatures can block or be blocked that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The creature that was targeted by The Black Gate\'s last ability can\'t be blocked by any creature the chosen player controls, including creatures that weren\'t on the battlefield when The Black Gate\'s ability resolved."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'"Partner with [name]" represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: "When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Frodo, Adventurous Hobbit\'s ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained 3 or more life by the time Frodo, Adventurous Hobbit attacks, the ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Frodo, Adventurous Hobbit and Sam, Loyal Attendant are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with white, black, and/or green in their color identity, but not blue or red."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren\'t included in the ability\'s reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon\'s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The Ring tempts you just once, no matter how much life you\'ve gained past 3 life."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The second ability represented by the "partner with [name]" keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with "partner with [name]" is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander. For more information on the Commander variant, please visit Wizards.com/Commander.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability of the "partner with" keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player, whether or not they have that card in their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability or corresponding "partner with" abilities as the game begins. A creature with a "partner with" ability can\\\'t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn\\\'t cause either to cease to be your commander.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'"Partner with [name]" represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: "When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Frodo, Adventurous Hobbit and Sam, Loyal Attendant are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with white, black, and/or green in their color identity, but not blue or red."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren\'t included in the ability\'s reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon\'s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The second ability represented by the "partner with [name]" keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with "partner with [name]" is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander. For more information on the Commander variant, please visit Wizards.com/Commander.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability of the "partner with" keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player, whether or not they have that card in their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability or corresponding "partner with" abilities as the game begins. A creature with a "partner with" ability can\\\'t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn\\\'t cause either to cease to be your commander.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'"Partner with [name]" represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: "When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Frodo, Adventurous Hobbit and Sam, Loyal Attendant are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with white, black, and/or green in their color identity, but not blue or red."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren\'t included in the ability\'s reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon\'s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The second ability represented by the "partner with [name]" keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with "partner with [name]" is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander. For more information on the Commander variant, please visit Wizards.com/Commander.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability of the "partner with" keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player, whether or not they have that card in their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability or corresponding "partner with" abilities as the game begins. A creature with a "partner with" ability can\\\'t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn\\\'t cause either to cease to be your commander.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger "whenever players finish voting" trigger once all players have voted or once all secret votes are revealed, but they won\\\'t go on the stack until the current spell or ability finishes resolving.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "After the votes are revealed, starting with the player whose turn it is and proceeding in turn order, each player who voted fellowship chooses a creature they control for each of their fellowship votes. Then the controller of Elrond of the White Council\'s ability gains control of those creatures and they gain the listed ability. Finally, that player puts a +1/+1 counter on each creature they control for each aid vote."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Before secret votes are revealed, players may announce how they intend to vote, but they can\'t reveal what they actually wrote down until all votes are simultaneously revealed. Players can lie about how they intend to vote before the votes are revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Each player must vote for one of the available options. They can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you control Elrond of the Secret Council\'s ability, it is usually best to vote for aid. Gaining control of a creature you already control is only occasionally helpful."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you have multiple votes, you can vote for fellowship multiple times. If you do, you can choose the same creature each time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'To secretly vote, each player writes down their chosen option without showing it to anyone else. Each player then keeps their vote secret until all players simultaneously reveal their votes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger "whenever players finish voting" trigger once all players have voted or once all secret votes are revealed, but they won\\\'t go on the stack until the current spell or ability finishes resolving.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Each player must vote for one of the available options. They can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If another Elf hasn\'t entered the battlefield under your control this turn as your beginning of combat step starts, Galadriel, Elven-Queen\'s ability won\'t trigger. No one will vote, and none of the other effects will happen. Putting another Elf onto the battlefield during the beginning of combat step won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'In the case of non-secret voting, votes are cast in turn order, and each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger "whenever players finish voting" trigger once all players have voted or once all secret votes are revealed, but they won\\\'t go on the stack until the current spell or ability finishes resolving.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Before secret votes are revealed, players may announce how they intend to vote, but they can\'t reveal what they actually wrote down until all votes are simultaneously revealed. Players can lie about how they intend to vote before the votes are revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Each player must vote for one of the available options. They can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'None of the creatures are targeted. Players may vote for a creature with hexproof, protection from blue, or similar.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Players may vote for creatures that are already tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'To secretly vote, each player writes down their chosen option without showing it to anyone else. Each player then keeps their vote secret until all players simultaneously reveal their votes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger "whenever players finish voting" trigger once all players have voted or once all secret votes are revealed, but they won\\\'t go on the stack until the current spell or ability finishes resolving.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Each player must vote for one of the available options. They can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If embark gets more votes or the vote is tied, players decide and announce in turn order, starting with the active player, whether or not they want to discard their hand. Then, all players who chose to do so discard their hands and draw seven cards. Players later in the turn order will know if players before them are discarding, but they don\'t get to see what those players will discard to help them decide whether to discard themselves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If return gets more votes, first the active player chooses which cards they\'ll return from their graveyard to their hand, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing choices made before their choice. Then all those cards are returned from graveyards to hands simultaneously."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'In the case of non-secret voting, votes are cast in turn order, and each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger "whenever players finish voting" trigger once all players have voted or once all secret votes are revealed, but they won\\\'t go on the stack until the current spell or ability finishes resolving.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Each player must vote for one of the available options. They can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'In the case of non-secret voting, votes are cast in turn order, and each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger "whenever players finish voting" trigger once all players have voted or once all secret votes are revealed, but they won\\\'t go on the stack until the current spell or ability finishes resolving.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'After the votes are revealed, first the player whose turn it is draws a card for each vote they received, then each other player in turn order does so. Then, if the first player received no votes, they may put a permanent card from their hand onto the battlefield. Then each other player in turn order does the same.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Before secret votes are revealed, players may announce how they intend to vote, but they can\'t reveal what they actually wrote down until all votes are simultaneously revealed. Players can lie about how they intend to vote before the votes are revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Each player must vote for one of the available options. They can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'To secretly vote, each player writes down their chosen option without showing it to anyone else. Each player then keeps their vote secret until all players simultaneously reveal their votes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Bilbo, Birthday Celebrant\\\'s first ability applies just once to each life-gaining event, no matter how much life is gained. If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something or "equal to the number" of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Bilbo, Birthday Celebrant applies only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Bilbo, Birthday Celebrant\'s first ability will apply to those two events separately. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will apply only once."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you somehow control two Bilbo, Birthday Celebrants and you would gain life, you gain that much life plus 2. A third Bilbo, Birthday Celebrant has you gain that much life plus 3, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause Bilbo, Birthday Celebrant\'s first ability to apply, even though it will cause your team\'s life total to increase."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with Shelob, Dread Weaver that would go to the graveyard but have that replaced by an effect such as Leyline of the Void are considered new objects. They are no longer considered to have been exiled with Shelob, Dread Weaver for the purposes of its activated abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Shelob, Dread Weaver and a nontoken creature an opponent controls die at the same time, the opponent\'s creature will be exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Devour Food is a variant of the devour ability. It allows you to sacrifice Foods rather than creatures, but otherwise functions identically to devour.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you cast this spell, you choose how many and which Foods to devour as part of the resolution of the spell. (It can\'t be countered at that point.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The comparison of power is done only when blockers are declared. Decreasing the power of a creature blocking Feasting Hobbit or increasing the power of Feasting Hobbit after this point won\'t cause Feasting Hobbit to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You may choose not to sacrifice any Foods for the devour Food ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Rapacious Guest\'s third ability triggers whenever you sacrifice a Food for any reason, not just to activate a Food\'s activated ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To determine the amount of life the target opponent loses from Rapacious Guest\'s last ability, use Rapacious Guest\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield, not its power in the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "When Of Herbs and Stewed Rabbit\'s first chapter ability triggers, you can choose not to target a creature just to create a Food token. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t create a Food token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability causes more than one creature token to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), Field-Tested Frying Pan becomes attached to one of them of your choice.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'No player may take any actions between the time you create the Halfling token and the time Field-Tested Frying Pan becomes attached to it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'If multiple players are instructed to scry at once, those players each look at the top cards of their library at the same time, then they choose in turn order whether to put those cards on the top or bottom of their library and in what order.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'If there are three or more ribbon counters on Prize Pig after you put ribbon counters on it, all of the counters will be removed. It does not matter whether or not Prize Pig is already untapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Lidless Gaze uses a new template indicating that you may spend mana as though it were mana of any type to cast the exiled cards. The six types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Snow mana is not a type of mana. Lidless Gaze won\'t let you pay a snow cost using mana produced by a nonsnow source."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren\'t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as Saruman\'s Trickery) won\'t affect them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can choose 0 as the value of X in Rampaging War Mammoth\'s cycling cost. In that case, its triggered ability won\'t have any targets and won\'t destroy any artifacts."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won\'t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered, the other ability will still resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren\'t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as Saruman\'s Trickery) won\'t affect them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Halfling or Scout. You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Halfling Scout." Card types such as artifacts can\\\'t be chosen, nor can subtypes that aren\\\'t creature types, such as Forest, Equipment, or Food.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Typecycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on a card being typecycled. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops a typecycling ability from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, typecycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Rather, it lets you search your library for a card with the type or types indicated by the ability name. For example, a card with basic landcycling lets you search for a basic land card, and a card with Wizardcycling lets you search for a Wizard card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]']
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'Abendliches Gelage', 'text': 'Falls ein Gegner mehr Lebenspunkte hat als du, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nFalls ein Gegner mehr Kreaturen kontrolliert als du, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nFalls ein Gegner mehr Karten auf der Hand hat als du, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621474&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d26d085-ebc3-44df-abec-c21cdeebc6b5', 'multiverseId': 621474}, 'multiverseid': 621474}, {'name': 'Fiestas del ocaso', 'text': 'Si un oponente tiene más vidas que tú, ganas 4 vidas.\\nSi un oponente controla más criaturas que tú, crea dos fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1.\\nSi un oponente tiene más cartas en la mano que tú, roba una carta.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621661&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c671defc-59c5-426c-8a7d-8c6c9c922042', 'multiverseId': 621661}, 'multiverseid': 621661}, {'name': 'Festivités du couchant', 'text': 'Si un adversaire a plus de points de vie que vous, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\nSi un adversaire contrôle plus de créatures que vous, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nSi un adversaire a plus de cartes en main que vous, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621848&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cbc8deb-65c0-4f95-b12b-036dec09ebdf', 'multiverseId': 621848}, 'multiverseid': 621848}, {'name': 'Celebrazione del Tramonto', 'text': 'Se un avversario ha più punti vita di te, guadagni 4 punti vita.\\nSe un avversario controlla più creature di te, crei due pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche.\\nSe un avversario ha più carte in mano di te, peschi una carta.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622035&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dad49994-7117-42bd-b582-e53d7e2e58de', 'multiverseId': 622035}, 'multiverseid': 622035}, {'name': '黄昏の享楽', 'text': '対戦相手１人のライフがあなたより多いなら、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\n対戦相手１人があなたより多くのクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、あなたは白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\n対戦相手１人の手札にあるカードがあなたより多いなら、あなたはカード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622222&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f3a525d-5776-45ca-9eb8-d630c2e740c3', 'multiverseId': 622222}, 'multiverseid': 622222}, {'name': 'Festança do Ocaso', 'text': 'Se um oponente tem mais pontos de vida que você, você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\\nSe um oponente controla mais criaturas que você, crie duas fichas de criatura Humano branca 1/1.\\nSe um oponente tem mais cards na mão do que você, compre um card.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622409&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2005fa54-b2ad-4635-87d7-c5eddb1c285a', 'multiverseId': 622409}, 'multiverseid': 622409}]", "[{'name': 'Abfangen der Eindringlinge', 'text': 'Geheimes Konzil — Jeder Spieler stimmt geheim für eine Kreatur, die du nicht kontrollierst, dann werden die Stimmen offenbart. Lege auf jede Kreatur mit einer oder mehreren Stimmen entsprechend viele Betäubungsmarken und tappe sie dann. (Falls eine bleibende Karte mit Betäubungsmarke enttappt würde, entferne stattdessen eine davon.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620783&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aaffe5bc-4673-4d39-9670-67cb91ed2cea', 'multiverseId': 620783}, 'multiverseid': 620783}, {'name': 'Atrapar a los intrusos', 'text': 'Concilio secreto — Cada jugador vota en secreto por una criatura que no controlas y luego se dan a conocer los votos. Por cada criatura con uno o más votos, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores de aturdimiento sobre ella y luego gírala. (Si un permanente con un contador de aturdimiento fuera a enderezarse, en vez de eso, remueve uno de esos contadores de él.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620855&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b82f16c-a627-49e6-8ae7-851490610bfb', 'multiverseId': 620855}, 'multiverseid': 620855}, {'name': 'Piéger les intrus', 'text': 'Conseil secret — Chaque joueur vote secrètement pour une créature que vous ne contrôlez pas, puis ces votes sont révélés. Pour chaque créature avec au moins un vote, mettez autant de marqueurs « étourdissement » sur elle, puis engagez-la. (Si un permanent avec un marqueur « étourdissement » devait devenir dégagé, retirez-lui en un à la place.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620927&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '945931fc-1bae-4baf-a037-63cac50f353e', 'multiverseId': 620927}, 'multiverseid': 620927}, {'name': 'Intrappolare gli Intrusi', 'text': 'Consiglio segreto — Ogni giocatore vota segretamente per una creatura che non controlli, poi quei voti vengono rivelati. Per ogni creatura con uno o più voti, metti altrettanti segnalini stordimento su di essa, poi TAPpala. (Se un permanente con un segnalino stordimento sta per essere STAPpato, rimuovi invece un segnalino stordimento da esso.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620999&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f96c203f-846f-43de-9b11-db0cd194edff', 'multiverseId': 620999}, 'multiverseid': 620999}, {'name': '侵入者を捕らえろ', 'text': '秘密会議 — 各プレイヤーは、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体に秘密裏に投票する。その後、それらの投票を公開する。票を得た各クリーチャーにつきそれぞれ、そのクリーチャーの上にその得た票数に等しい麻痺カウンターを置く。その後、それをタップする。（麻痺カウンターが置かれているパーマネントがアンタップ状態になるなら、代わりにそれの上から麻痺カウンター１個を取り除く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621071&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2ba1a69-112e-465a-b9a9-1043c2e233f3', 'multiverseId': 621071}, 'multiverseid': 621071}, {'name': 'Prender os Intrusos', 'text': 'Conselho secreto — Cada jogador vota secretamente em uma criatura que você não controla e depois aqueles votos são revelados. Para cada criatura com um ou mais votos, coloque naquela criatura uma quantidade de marcadores de atordoamento igual ao número de votos e depois a vire. (Se uma permanente com um marcador de atordoamento se tornaria desvirada, em vez disso, remova um marcador de atordoamento dela.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621143&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87a1ae32-2022-4e01-976d-8760b02400a9', 'multiverseId': 621143}, 'multiverseid': 621143}, {'name': '围困擅闯客', 'text': '密议～每位牌手各私下投票选择一个不由你操控的生物，然后展示投票结果。对每个得到一票或数票的生物而言，在其上放置等量的晕眩指示物，然后将它横置。（如果某个其上有晕眩指示物的永久物将成为未横置，则改为从其上移去一个晕眩指示物。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621215&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17c59723-f27e-4079-a788-1412da4d431a', 'multiverseId': 621215}, 'multiverseid': 621215}]", "[{'name': 'Abfangen der Eindringlinge', 'text': 'Geheimes Konzil — Jeder Spieler stimmt geheim für eine Kreatur, die du nicht kontrollierst, dann werden die Stimmen offenbart. Lege auf jede Kreatur mit einer oder mehreren Stimmen entsprechend viele Betäubungsmarken und tappe sie dann.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620374&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f56632a9-b6b5-493e-9097-bdbff24a125f', 'multiverseId': 620374}, 'multiverseid': 620374}, {'name': 'Piéger les intrus', 'text': 'Conseil secret — Chaque joueur vote secrètement pour une créature que vous ne contrôlez pas, puis ces votes sont révélés. Pour chaque créature avec au moins un vote, mettez autant de marqueurs « étourdissement » sur elle, puis engagez-la.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620442&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92934dd0-5d93-4e1f-b166-3a679fd3dca3', 'multiverseId': 620442}, 'multiverseid': 620442}, {'name': '侵入者を捕らえろ', 'text': '秘密会議 — 各プレイヤーは、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体に秘密裏に投票する。その後、それらの投票を公開する。票を得た各クリーチャーにつきそれぞれ、そのクリーチャーの上にその得た票数に等しい個数の麻痺カウンターを置く。その後、それをタップする。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620510&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38413e7d-17ae-402d-8613-ebb6fc3d25a5', 'multiverseId': 620510}, 'multiverseid': 620510}, {'name': '围困擅闯客', 'text': '密议～每位牌手各私下投票选择一个不由你操控的生物，然后展示投票结果。对每个得到一票或数票的生物而言，在其上放置等量的晕眩指示物，然后将它横置。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620578&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89cd15ca-df0b-49dc-ada9-4839b558cde4', 'multiverseId': 620578}, 'multiverseid': 620578}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abgenutzter Kraftstein\', \'text\': \'Der Abgenutzte Kraftstein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Palantíri der Könige aus alten Zeiten: der Name bedeutete ‚das, was in die Ferne blickt\\\'. Der Orthanc-Stein war einer davon, und er überstieg Sarumans Kunst."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621590&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad941b0c-0d94-45df-bdd9-c5abe445e351\', \'multiverseId\': 621590}, \'multiverseid\': 621590}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de poder desgastada\', \'text\': \'La Piedra de poder desgastada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Las palantíri de los Reyes Antiguos, cuyo nombre significa \\\'lo que mira a lo lejos\\\'. La piedra de Orthanc era una de ellas y Saruman no hubiese podido crear nada semejante".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57bf7343-501e-4e97-b7e7-d2dc1baa2023\', \'multiverseId\': 621777}, \'multiverseid\': 621777}, {\'name\': \'Lithoforce usée\', \'text\': \'La Lithoforce usée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Les palantíri des rois d\\\'antan : ce nom signifie "ce qui voit au loin." La pierre d\\\'Orthanc en était un, et elle dépasse les compétences de Saruman. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621964&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'158a4c8f-3057-45ad-b1eb-5d56958993e3\', \'multiverseId\': 621964}, \'multiverseid\': 621964}, {\'name\': \'Pietra del Potere Consunta\', \'text\': \'La Pietra del Potere Consunta entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"I palantíri dei Re dell\\\'Antichità: il nome significa "ciò che guarda lontano". La pietra di Orthanc era una di essi e Saruman non sarebbe capace di creare un simile oggetto."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a4ed22b-ba7d-4a72-bfa2-63dd9481b878\', \'multiverseId\': 622151}, \'multiverseid\': 622151}, {\'name\': \'摩滅したパワーストーン\', \'text\': \'摩滅したパワーストーンはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「古代の王たちのパランティーリ、『はるか遠くを見るもの』の意味じゃ。オルサンクの石もその一つ、サルマンの技でも及ばぬものじゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'547e6d23-7771-497d-8e50-3f996d4043a8\', \'multiverseId\': 622338}, \'multiverseid\': 622338}, {\'name\': \'Pedra de Energia Gasta\', \'text\': \'Pedra de Energia Gasta entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"As palantíri dos Reis de Outrora: o nome significava \\\'a que enxerga longe\\\'. A Pedra de Orthanc era uma delas, e ela está além da arte de Saruman."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2638330e-c9fb-4428-a6cc-0361b54d3e25\', \'multiverseId\': 622525}, \'multiverseid\': 622525}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwägen\', \'text\': \'Überwachen 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine neue Macht erhebt sich. Gegen sie werden die alten Bündnisse und die alten Strategien nichts ausrichten. Wir müssen eine Wahl treffen."\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621484&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea731db7-2da9-428f-9de4-c83636f51bca\', \'multiverseId\': 621484}, \'multiverseid\': 621484}, {\'name\': \'Considerar\', \'text\': \'Escruta 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en tu cementerio.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un nuevo poder está surgiendo. Los antiguos aliados y normas no nos protegerán contra él. Solo nos queda una opción".\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'669ca842-85c6-4907-950e-f8e8080d6ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 621671}, \'multiverseid\': 621671}, {\'name\': \'Scruter\', \'text\': \'Surveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte dans votre cimetière.)\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Une nouvelle puissance s\'élève. Face à elle, les anciennes alliances et les vieilles politiques ne nous serviront à rien. Nous sommes face à un choix. »\\n—Saruman", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621858&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fdd12b3-beb2-4db0-a921-ce423b07ed99\', \'multiverseId\': 621858}, \'multiverseid\': 621858}, {\'name\': \'Considerare\', \'text\': \'Sorveglia 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una nuova Potenza sta emergendo. Contro di essa sarebbero inutili i vecchi alleati e l\\\'antico modo di agire. C\\\'è dunque una scelta che si offre a noi."\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5727ddc7-0131-4949-8cdf-3221cdcb6e47\', \'multiverseId\': 622045}, \'multiverseid\': 622045}, {\'name\': \'考慮\', \'text\': \'諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。そのカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「新たな力が興ろうとしている。それに対抗するには、古い同盟や方策では、まったく我らの役には立たぬ。我らにとって、選ぶべき道はただ一つ。」\\n――サルマン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e89ab601-602b-444b-9d52-2b08c6bd166a\', \'multiverseId\': 622232}, \'multiverseid\': 622232}, {\'name\': \'Considerar\', \'text\': \'Vigiar 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card em seu cemitério.)\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Um novo Poder se levanta. Contra ele antigos aliados e políticas não nos valerão de nada. Temos uma escolha a fazer."\\n— Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8878eeaf-11ed-40d8-b3bb-e94f51c5a75f\', \'multiverseId\': 622419}, \'multiverseid\': 622419}]', '[{\'name\': \'An die Kehle gehen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Nichtartefaktkreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Schatz, Schatz, Schatz!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621498&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c553ad4-e248-4b46-b113-98e8ee23f409\', \'multiverseId\': 621498}, \'multiverseid\': 621498}, {\'name\': \'Golpe a la garganta\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Tesoro, tesoro, tesoro!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0976fe98-4b5d-4c60-bcae-a68451c3a1b5\', \'multiverseId\': 621685}, \'multiverseid\': 621685}, {\'name\': \'Droit à la gorge\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature non-artefact ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Mon précieux trésor ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb13934a-4c73-46d3-b1fa-5c6c023c4968\', \'multiverseId\': 621872}, \'multiverseid\': 621872}, {\'name\': \'Mirare alla Gola\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura non artefatto bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tesoro, tesoro, tesoro!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5321da58-f822-476d-9e85-77307865e1e7\', \'multiverseId\': 622059}, \'multiverseid\': 622059}, {\'name\': \'喉首狙い\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「いとしい、いとしい、いとしい！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc7f187f-467a-408b-9cfc-1140416a8df8\', \'multiverseId\': 622246}, \'multiverseid\': 622246}, {\'name\': \'Atacar na Jugular\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura não artefato alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Precioso, precioso, precioso!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d52c63e7-89f5-431f-a66b-b74a6f795d1b\', \'multiverseId\': 622433}, \'multiverseid\': 622433}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anführerin aus Lossarnach\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn die Anführerin aus Lossarnach oder ein anderer Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c19ff301-e024-41fe-865b-e7f9e83f589c\', \'multiverseId\': 620366}, \'multiverseid\': 620366}, {\'name\': \'Capitaine de Lossarnach\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois que la Capitaine de Lossarnach ou un autre humain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nAu début de votre entretien, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b81c66e-0f37-40ee-990c-e1d0f770fb5e\', \'multiverseId\': 620434}, \'multiverseid\': 620434}, {\'name\': \'ロッサールナハの隊長\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nロッサールナハの隊長やこれでない人間１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e0bb548-df6c-49c9-a8ac-60089c602529\', \'multiverseId\': 620502}, \'multiverseid\': 620502}, {\'name\': \'洛斯阿尔那赫队长\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当洛斯阿尔那赫队长或另一个人类在你操控下进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。\\n在你的维持开始时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'985a1e2c-a673-4bb4-abd5-a1837f637449\', \'multiverseId\': 620570}, \'multiverseid\': 620570}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anführerin aus Lossarnach\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn die Anführerin aus Lossarnach oder ein anderer Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620774&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39308e03-1727-43c4-81c7-954c5821b1db\', \'multiverseId\': 620774}, \'multiverseid\': 620774}, {\'name\': \'Capitana de Lossarnach\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que la Capitana de Lossarnach u otro Humano entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7a9518-e1d0-4942-897f-dfc686e16620\', \'multiverseId\': 620846}, \'multiverseid\': 620846}, {\'name\': \'Capitaine de Lossarnach\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois que la Capitaine de Lossarnach ou un autre humain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nAu début de votre entretien, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620918&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'775be500-0cd4-40fa-b9b4-e6fd046f451a\', \'multiverseId\': 620918}, \'multiverseid\': 620918}, {\'name\': \'Capitana di Lossarnach\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta la Capitana di Lossarnach o un altro Umano entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f89a99b3-dcc4-4a2d-a848-165fe21c772b\', \'multiverseId\': 620990}, \'multiverseid\': 620990}, {\'name\': \'ロッサールナハの隊長\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nロッサールナハの隊長やこれでない人間１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e13d676-317c-4948-b4ec-a93bd73978e2\', \'multiverseId\': 621062}, \'multiverseid\': 621062}, {\'name\': \'Capitã de Lossarnach\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que Capitã de Lossarnach ou outro Humano entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, crie uma ficha de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a2d38ca-9d8c-4e91-b9bf-9770cb33675f\', \'multiverseId\': 621134}, \'multiverseid\': 621134}, {\'name\': \'洛斯阿尔那赫队长\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当洛斯阿尔那赫队长或另一个人类在你操控下进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。\\n在你的维持开始时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bc855cf-0551-49c8-a2a4-53164d0d02d8\', \'multiverseId\': 621206}, \'multiverseid\': 621206}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ansuchen um Macht\', \'text\': \'Wille des Konzils — Beginnend mit dir stimmt jeder Spieler für Zeit oder Wissen. Falls Zeit mehr Stimmen erhält, erhältst du nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug. Bei Gleichstand oder falls Wissen mehr Stimmen erhält, ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Aus dem Schicksalsberg steigt erneut Rauch auf. Die Macht des Schwarzen Landes wächst, und wir sind in arger Bedrängnis."\\n—Boromir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621492&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0fe824f-4c61-4c1c-90b9-ef959c44ee74\', \'multiverseId\': 621492}, \'multiverseid\': 621492}, {\'name\': \'Súplica de poder\', \'text\': \'Voluntad del consejo — Comenzando contigo, cada jugador vota tiempo o conocimiento. Si tiempo consigue más votos, juega un turno adicional después de este. Si conocimiento consigue más votos o el voto acaba en empate, roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El humo del Monte del Destino se alza una vez más. El poder de la Tierra Tenebrosa crece, acosándonos".\\n—Boromir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27b4b309-b275-4989-b04b-c240a0b8700d\', \'multiverseId\': 621679}, \'multiverseid\': 621679}, {\'name\': \'Supplique de pouvoir\', \'text\': \'Volonté du conseil — En commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour temps ou connaissance. Si temps gagne plus de votes, jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci. Si connaissance gagne plus de votes ou que les votes sont à égalité, piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La fumée s\'élève une fois encore de la Montagne du Destin. La puissance de la Terre Noire grandit et nous sommes durement assaillis. »\\n—Boromir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41a3998-643f-4912-a6b8-13e011170b70\', \'multiverseId\': 621866}, \'multiverseid\': 621866}, {\'name\': \'Appello al Potere\', \'text\': \'Volontà del concilio — A partire da te, ogni giocatore vota tempo o conoscenza. Se il tempo ottiene più voti, gioca un turno extra dopo questo. Se la conoscenza ottiene più voti o il voto è un pareggio, pesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il fumo si alza di nuovo dal Monte Fato. Il potere della Terra Nera aumenta e noi siamo assediati."\\n—Boromir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55b24ccd-6e50-498b-94df-7b3856aa5642\', \'multiverseId\': 622053}, \'multiverseid\': 622053}, {\'name\': \'権力への嘆願\', \'text\': \'議決 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「時間」または「知識」のいずれかに投票する。「時間」がより多くの票を得たなら、あなたはこのターンの直後に追加の１ターンを得る。「知識」がより多くの票を得た、あるいは票が同数だったなら、あなたはカード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「滅びの山からもふたたび煙が立ちのぼっている。黒の国の力は強大になり、我々はがっちりと包囲されてしまった。」\\n――ボロミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b36e21-5ed7-4f63-bc6c-a77b879cac1d\', \'multiverseId\': 622240}, \'multiverseid\': 622240}, {\'name\': \'Apelo ao Poder\', \'text\': \'Vontade do conselho — A começar por você, cada jogador vota em tempo ou conhecimento. Se tempo receber mais votos, jogue um turno extra depois deste. Se conhecimento receber mais votos ou a votação empatar, compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A fumaça voltou a subir do Monte da Perdição. O poder da Terra Negra cresce, e estamos sob forte assédio."\\n— Boromir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99a14329-f011-45b1-9e10-14b325ff76ab\', \'multiverseId\': 622427}, \'multiverseid\': 622427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn, König von Gondor\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn Aragorn, König von Gondor, ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nImmer wenn Aragorn angreift, kann bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken. Falls du der Monarch bist, können Kreaturen in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„An diesem Ort werde ich verweilen und so auch meine Erben, bis zum Ende der Welt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620259&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db2a977-0336-4ad5-9c1a-ae70faa5ca7c\', \'multiverseId\': 620259}, \'multiverseid\': 620259}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, roi du Gondor\', \'text\': "Vigilance, lien de vie\\nQuand Aragorn, roi du Gondor arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Aragon attaque, jusqu\'à une créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci. Si vous êtes le monarque, les créatures ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': "« En ce lieu, je me fixerai, et après moi mes héritiers, jusqu\'à la fin du monde. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620267&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4f30c09-741f-44a2-bafe-4570764be8c0\', \'multiverseId\': 620267}, \'multiverseid\': 620267}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの王、アラゴルン\', \'text\': \'警戒、絆魂\\nゴンドールの王、アラゴルンが戦場に出たとき、あなたは統治者になる。\\nゴンドールの王、アラゴルンが攻撃するたび、クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。あなたが統治者であるなら、このターン、クリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「この地にわれとわが世継たち、この世が終わるまで住もうではないか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d66f6307-4528-4823-8c96-94bcbcc653c5\', \'multiverseId\': 620275}, \'multiverseid\': 620275}, {\'name\': \'刚铎国王阿拉贡\', \'text\': \'警戒，系命\\n当刚铎国王阿拉贡进战场时，你成为君主。\\n每当阿拉贡攻击时，至多一个目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。若你是君主，则生物本回合都不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「我将永居此处，传承后嗣，直至世界终结。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16dc281c-48db-48e0-b8c1-5d724dc711d2\', \'multiverseId\': 620283}, \'multiverseid\': 620283}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn, König von Gondor\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn Aragorn, König von Gondor, ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nImmer wenn Aragorn angreift, kann bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken. Falls du der Monarch bist, können Kreaturen in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„An diesem Ort werde ich verweilen und so auch meine Erben, bis zum Ende der Welt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620667&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f5ece6f-b733-4579-bb14-e537d5cb5a07\', \'multiverseId\': 620667}, \'multiverseid\': 620667}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, rey de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, vínculo vital.\\nCuando Aragorn, rey de Gondor entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nSiempre que Aragorn ataque, hasta una criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno. Si eres el monarca, las criaturas no pueden bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta será mi morada, y la de mis descendientes, hasta el fin de los tiempos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e66f988-4ab7-4447-8119-b98325673fba\', \'multiverseId\': 620671}, \'multiverseid\': 620671}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, roi du Gondor\', \'text\': "Vigilance, lien de vie\\nQuand Aragorn, roi du Gondor arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Aragon attaque, jusqu\'à une créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci. Si vous êtes le monarque, les créatures ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': "« En ce lieu, je me fixerai, et après moi mes héritiers, jusqu\'à la fin du monde. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620675&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25a6c46a-c128-465a-acfb-a1626bbae721\', \'multiverseId\': 620675}, \'multiverseid\': 620675}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, Re di Gondor\', \'text\': \'Cautela, legame vitale\\nQuando Aragorn, Re di Gondor entra nel campo di battaglia, diventi il monarca.\\nOgniqualvolta Aragorn attacca, fino a una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno. Se sei il monarca, le creature non possono bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Dimorerò in questo luogo, e così i miei eredi, fino alla fine del mondo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbc4df0e-18e9-43cf-b6c5-bfddcaa68b43\', \'multiverseId\': 620679}, \'multiverseid\': 620679}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの王、アラゴルン\', \'text\': \'警戒、絆魂\\nゴンドールの王、アラゴルンが戦場に出たとき、あなたは統治者になる。\\nゴンドールの王、アラゴルンが攻撃するたび、クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。あなたが統治者であるなら、このターン、クリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「この地にわれとわが世継たち、この世が終わるまで住もうではないか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'713d26aa-106e-4a1f-8565-c946ca9783a1\', \'multiverseId\': 620683}, \'multiverseid\': 620683}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, Rei de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, vínculo com a vida\\nQuando Aragorn, Rei de Gondor, entra no campo de batalha, você se torna o monarca.\\nToda vez que Aragorn atacar, até uma criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno. Se você for o monarca, as criaturas não poderão bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"Neste local, eu habitarei, e meus herdeiros, até o fim do mundo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f8c970-3faa-4670-b29e-b2cf91a7702a\', \'multiverseId\': 620687}, \'multiverseid\': 620687}, {\'name\': \'刚铎国王阿拉贡\', \'text\': \'警戒，系命\\n当刚铎国王阿拉贡进战场时，你成为君主。\\n每当阿拉贡攻击时，至多一个目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。若你是君主，则生物本回合都不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「我将永居此处，传承后嗣，直至世界终结。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5286c4d8-fdd9-4979-bb2c-01d4fe9f9b64\', \'multiverseId\': 620691}, \'multiverseid\': 620691}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archivarin aus Gondor\', \'text\': \'Wenn dein Kommandeur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt und falls niemand der Monarch ist, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn des Endsegments des Monarchen zieht jener Spieler eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn Ihr, wie Ihr behauptet, nur Aufzeichnungen aus alten Tagen und über die Anfänge der Stadt begehrt, so lest nach Belieben!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1aa4158-cc9a-42de-abf7-92b42d418307\', \'multiverseId\': 620367}, \'multiverseid\': 620367}, {\'name\': \'Archiviste du Gondor\', \'text\': "Quand votre commandant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, s\'il n\'y a pas de monarque, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de l\'étape de fin du monarque, ce joueur pioche une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'« Si, comme vous le dites, vous ne cherchez effectivement que des documents liés aux jours anciens et aux origines de la cité, poursuivez vos lectures ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99dfbe5c-b676-414e-a73f-2a67ba937ee4\', \'multiverseId\': 620435}, \'multiverseid\': 620435}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの文書保管人\', \'text\': \'あなたの統率者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、統治者がいない場合、あなたが統治者になる。\\n統治者の終了ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたが仰るように、古い時代と、この都のなりたちの記録をただ調べるだけのおつもりなら、読まれるがよい！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d74591e1-0650-46ea-9963-cf91db0fdc2c\', \'multiverseId\': 620503}, \'multiverseid\': 620503}, {\'name\': \'刚铎档案师\', \'text\': \'当你的指挥官对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若此时没有君主，则你成为君主。\\n在君主的结束步骤开始时，该牌手抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你确如所言，只是想查阅古时及白城创立之初的记载，就继续读下去吧！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a090f3e-448e-4043-8861-84e55730a072\', \'multiverseId\': 620571}, \'multiverseid\': 620571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archivarin aus Gondor\', \'text\': \'Wenn dein Kommandeur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt und falls niemand der Monarch ist, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn des Endsegments des Monarchen zieht jener Spieler eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn Ihr, wie Ihr behauptet, nur Aufzeichnungen aus alten Tagen und über die Anfänge der Stadt begehrt, so lest nach Belieben!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620776&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56137e25-ddc6-47bd-8fe8-bf3f57d4e037\', \'multiverseId\': 620776}, \'multiverseid\': 620776}, {\'name\': \'Archivista de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Cuando tu comandante haga daño de combate a un jugador, si no hay ningún monarca, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo del paso final del monarca, ese jugador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si realmente solo buscas, tal y como dices, crónicas de los días antiguos y del inicio de la ciudad, ¡lee!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f99910-18f5-48a9-8b4b-cb8420c75131\', \'multiverseId\': 620848}, \'multiverseid\': 620848}, {\'name\': \'Archiviste du Gondor\', \'text\': "Quand votre commandant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, s\'il n\'y a pas de monarque, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de l\'étape de fin du monarque, ce joueur pioche une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'« Si, comme vous le dites, vous ne cherchez effectivement que des documents liés aux jours anciens et aux origines de la cité, poursuivez vos lectures ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620920&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be538fdd-95a7-46d6-95c5-b3413c13bcbb\', \'multiverseId\': 620920}, \'multiverseid\': 620920}, {\'name\': \'Archivista di Gondor\', \'text\': "Quando il tuo comandante infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, se nessuno è il monarca, tu diventi il monarca.\\nAll\'inizio della sottofase finale del monarca, quel giocatore pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se veramente, come dici, ti limiti a cercare notizie dei tempi che furono e dei primordi della Città, leggi pure!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'991a97d5-03a3-4203-ac7c-02f56b7d4460\', \'multiverseId\': 620992}, \'multiverseid\': 620992}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの文書保管人\', \'text\': \'あなたの統率者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、統治者がいない場合、あなたが統治者になる。\\n統治者の終了ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたが仰るように、古い時代と、この都のなりたちの記録をただ調べるだけのおつもりなら、読まれるがよい！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c73eead-8f37-430e-9e83-88ff20c698b4\', \'multiverseId\': 621064}, \'multiverseid\': 621064}, {\'name\': \'Arquivista de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Quando seu comandante causa dano de combate a um jogador, se não houver um monarca, você se torna o monarca.\\nNo início da etapa final do monarca, aquele jogador compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se de fato você busca apenas, como diz, registros de dias antigos e dos primórdios da Cidade, pode ler!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5567787-d8e7-448a-8911-e155b279995a\', \'multiverseId\': 621136}, \'multiverseid\': 621136}, {\'name\': \'刚铎档案师\', \'text\': \'当你的指挥官对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若此时没有君主，则你成为君主。\\n在君主的结束步骤开始时，该牌手抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你确如所言，只是想查阅古时及白城创立之初的记载，就继续读下去吧！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9acdb775-12e1-498c-a1a1-fa9545416f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 621208}, \'multiverseid\': 621208}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Magische Ringe sind, nun ja, magisch, und sie sind selten und seltsam."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621570&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d074983c-74a6-4d05-9326-a094915983b0\', \'multiverseId\': 621570}, \'multiverseid\': 621570}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los anillos mágicos son… Bueno, mágicos: raros y curiosos".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfb59b64-9f6e-4c85-81ad-c9d939764a51\', \'multiverseId\': 621757}, \'multiverseid\': 621757}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Les anneaux magiques sont... magiques ; et ils sont rares et étranges. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621944&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d19ccc28-ebe1-4295-a095-c38695be8c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 621944}, \'multiverseid\': 621944}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Arcano\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli anelli magici sono, come dire... magici; inoltre sono strani e rari."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b328f7-7890-4e90-8a8e-e647849946aa\', \'multiverseId\': 622131}, \'multiverseid\': 622131}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「魔法の指輪というものは――さよう、魔力がある。そうした指輪は類い希で、興味深いものじゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6485bb5b-6346-4bd4-b105-47816e74d233\', \'multiverseId\': 622318}, \'multiverseid\': 622318}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Anéis mágicos são... bem... mágicos; eles são raros e curiosos."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27407a44-744e-4234-b6e6-10969d462c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 622505}, \'multiverseid\': 622505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arwen, Weberin der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, kommt mit so vielen zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie die Widerstandskraft von Arwen, Weberin der Hoffnung, beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Aus der Ferne wachte Arwen über Aragorn und webte ihm als Zeichen der Hoffnung ein königliches Banner.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620384&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9015eaa8-9fa8-4b78-be1d-e30e0f2bbf0d\', \'multiverseId\': 620384}, \'multiverseid\': 620384}, {\'name\': "Arwen, tisseuse d\'espoir", \'text\': "Chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires égal à l\'endurance d\'Arwen, tisseuse d\'espoir.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': \'De loin, Arwen veillait sur Aragorn, et avec espoir, elle lui confectionna un grand étendard royal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3492438-9d3d-4e4c-ad56-685d302ab3b6\', \'multiverseId\': 620452}, \'multiverseid\': 620452}, {\'name\': \'希望の紡ぎ手、アルウェン\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは、希望の紡ぎ手、アルウェンのタフネスに等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'アルウェンはアラゴルンを遠くから見守っていた。そして望みを抱いて、彼のために大きく威風ある旗印をこしらえた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c0cff2-fb33-4ec7-8306-b4f5bcfebf19\', \'multiverseId\': 620520}, \'multiverseid\': 620520}, {\'name\': \'织望阿尔玟\', \'text\': \'每个由你操控的其他生物进战场时上面均额外有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于织望阿尔玟的防御力。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'远隔万里，阿尔玟遥相守护阿拉贡；心怀希望，她为对方缝制了一面巨幅王旗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc87be0-abb0-4b6a-8560-f06d2978b9a4\', \'multiverseId\': 620588}, \'multiverseid\': 620588}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arwen, Weberin der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, kommt mit so vielen zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie die Widerstandskraft von Arwen, Weberin der Hoffnung, beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Aus der Ferne wachte Arwen über Aragorn und webte ihm als Zeichen der Hoffnung ein königliches Banner.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f5ffdb5-70d0-4435-a6af-fe805b7d1831\', \'multiverseId\': 620793}, \'multiverseid\': 620793}, {\'name\': \'Arwen, tejedora de esperanza\', \'text\': \'Cada otra criatura que controlas entra al campo de batalla con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 adicionales sobre ella igual a la resistencia de Arwen, tejedora de esperanza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Desde lejos, Arwen velaba por Aragorn y, con esperanza, hizo para él un gran estandarte real.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c323cdf-d841-405f-b7e1-d6d8d1585b1e\', \'multiverseId\': 620865}, \'multiverseid\': 620865}, {\'name\': "Arwen, tisseuse d\'espoir", \'text\': "Chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires égal à l\'endurance d\'Arwen, tisseuse d\'espoir.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': \'De loin, Arwen veillait sur Aragorn, et avec espoir, elle lui confectionna un grand étendard royal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620937&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6eccaf1-6a9a-4abf-8d7a-e0d4fb9e523e\', \'multiverseId\': 620937}, \'multiverseid\': 620937}, {\'name\': \'Arwen, Tessitrice di Speranza\', \'text\': \'Ogni altra creatura che controlli entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 addizionali pari alla costituzione di Arwen, Tessitrice di Speranza.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': "Da lontano, Arwen protesse Aragorn con il pensiero e, nell\'attesa piena di speranza, gli preparò un grande vessillo regale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bfa9e79-a3ec-46dc-a3c3-61941e66c0bf\', \'multiverseId\': 621009}, \'multiverseid\': 621009}, {\'name\': \'希望の紡ぎ手、アルウェン\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは、希望の紡ぎ手、アルウェンのタフネスに等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'アルウェンはアラゴルンを遠くから見守っていた。そして望みを抱いて、彼のために大きく威風ある旗印をこしらえた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d6499da-a136-46aa-805d-2d3013a4bf0b\', \'multiverseId\': 621081}, \'multiverseid\': 621081}, {\'name\': \'Arwen, Tecelã da Esperança\', \'text\': \'Cada outra criatura que você controla entra no campo de batalha com um número de marcadores +1/+1 adicionais igual à resistência de Arwen, Tecelã da Esperança.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'De longe, Arwen zelava por Aragorn e, esperançosa, fez para ele um grande e régio estandarte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3730f7bc-6e98-441e-9e02-d2c917302769\', \'multiverseId\': 621153}, \'multiverseid\': 621153}, {\'name\': \'希望织匠阿尔玟\', \'text\': \'每个由你操控的其他生物进战场时上面均额外有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于希望织匠阿尔玟的防御力。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'远隔万里，阿尔玟遥相守护阿拉贡；心怀希望，她为对方缝制了一面巨幅王旗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80482a47-c953-4180-9604-765233c37d7c\', \'multiverseId\': 621225}, \'multiverseid\': 621225}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aschenödnis\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die hübsche Reihe alter Hobbithöhlen in der Böschung am Nordufer des Sees war verlassen, und ihre kleinen Gärten, die bis zum Rand des Wassers reichten, waren von Unkraut überwuchert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9f3bd5-588f-44b0-b4e3-4cea4a04cbc3\', \'multiverseId\': 621592}, \'multiverseid\': 621592}, {\'name\': \'Yermos humeantes\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La acogedora fila de siempre de cuevas hobbits en el margen norte del lago estaba abandonada y los jardincitos que antaño descendían hasta el borde del agua tenían malezas por doquier.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bfff4fb-1879-4445-ba74-0f7278439817\', \'multiverseId\': 621779}, \'multiverseid\': 621779}, {\'name\': \'Landes cendreuses\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La jolie rangée d\'anciens terriers de hobbits dans le talus du côté nord de l\'Étang était abandonnée, et leurs petits jardins autrefois chatoyants qui descendaient jusqu\'au bord de l\'eau étaient à présent envahis de mauvaises herbes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621966&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccafa2b6-eff8-4466-ab06-5866997ec2fa\', \'multiverseId\': 621966}, \'multiverseid\': 621966}, {\'name\': \'Distese di Polvere\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\nCicloterra base {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "La graziosa fila di antiche caverne Hobbit sull\'argine nord del Lago era in uno stato di miserevole abbandono e i loro giardinetti che prima scendevano allegri e vivaci sino al bordo dell\'acqua erano pieni di erbacce.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5bed432-d1ef-4193-b50b-e4cc556404e6\', \'multiverseId\': 622153}, \'multiverseid\': 622153}, {\'name\': \'灰のやせ地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'池の北側の堤に、住み心地よさそうに並んでいた昔からのホビット坑は廃屋となり、かつては色鮮やかに水際まで伸びていた小さな庭々も、今は雑草がはびこるままだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d735f709-d3f9-4f39-acaf-17619eced7a7\', \'multiverseId\': 622340}, \'multiverseid\': 622340}, {\'name\': \'Desolação Fumegante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\nReciclar terreno básico {1} ({1}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.)\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': "A agradável fileira de velhas tocas de hobbit na margem norte do Lago estava deserta, e seus jardinzinhos que costumavam vicejar até a beira d\'água estavam tomados por ervas daninhas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26f65030-ed54-44df-9c67-e6ff30cef1b1\', \'multiverseId\': 622527}, \'multiverseid\': 622527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Asketentum\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Fluchsicherheit.\\n{1}{G}: Regeneriere eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. (Das nächste Mal, dass sie zerstört würde, tappe sie stattdessen, entferne sie aus dem Kampf und heile allen auf ihr vermerkten Schaden.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Radagast kennt Pflanzen und Tiere, und besonders Vögel sind seine Freunde."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'607b4f02-8ed4-458b-b419-298074a83eaf\', \'multiverseId\': 621530}, \'multiverseid\': 621530}, {\'name\': \'Ascetismo\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de antimaleficio.\\n{1}{G}: Regenera la criatura objetivo. (La próxima vez que fuese a ser destruida, en vez de eso, gírala, remuévela del combate y cura todo el daño que haya recibido.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Radagast conoce bien las hierbas y las bestias. Tiene especial amistad con las aves".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15c83fc8-cfa9-4857-95c6-03866583c33e\', \'multiverseId\': 621717}, \'multiverseid\': 621717}, {\'name\': \'Ascétisme\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la défense talismanique.\\n{1}{G} : Régénérez une créature ciblée. (La prochaine fois qu\'elle devrait être détruite, à la place, engagez-la, retirez-la du combat et retirez-lui toutes ses blessures.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Radagast a une grande connaissance des herbes et des bêtes, et les oiseaux en particulier sont ses amis. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906ac913-353c-43cd-93fe-31271ec2833d\', \'multiverseId\': 621904}, \'multiverseid\': 621904}, {\'name\': \'Ascetismo\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno anti-malocchio.\\n{1}{G}: Rigenera una creatura bersaglio. (La prossima volta che sta per essere distrutta, invece TAPpala, rimuovila dal combattimento e cura tutti i suoi danni.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Radagast è esperto di erbe e bestie, ed è amico soprattutto degli uccelli."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223eed5b-c4e1-4e26-96a1-d409c006e898\', \'multiverseId\': 622091}, \'multiverseid\': 622091}, {\'name\': \'苦行主義\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは呪禁を持つ。\\n{1}{G}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを再生する。（それが次に破壊されるなら、代わりに、それをタップし、戦闘から取り除き、それが負っているすべてのダメージを回復する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「ラダガストは薬草とけものたちのことにくわしい。とりわけ鳥たちは彼の友じゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1059f69c-8e72-4ff8-88e3-7a99d4f08a32\', \'multiverseId\': 622278}, \'multiverseid\': 622278}, {\'name\': \'Asceticismo\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla têm resistência a magia.\\n{1}{G}: Regenere a criatura alvo. (Na próxima vez em que seria destruída, em vez disso, vire-a, remova-a do combate e cure todo o dano marcado.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Radagast conhece muito das ervas e das bestas, e os pássaros em especial são seus amigos."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c808b26-46a9-4f2b-823d-36b342188969\', \'multiverseId\': 622465}, \'multiverseid\': 622465}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf, Eorlingas!\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 2/2 rote Mensch-Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile, die Trampelschaden verursachen.\\nImmer wenn in diesem Zug eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem oder mehreren Spielern Kampfschaden zufügen, wirst du zum Monarchen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Tag der Schwerter, ein roter Tag, noch vor Sonnenaufgang!\\nReitet nun, reitet los! Auf nach Gondor!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620814&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'675a221d-10f4-4f26-be02-d058349167b0\', \'multiverseId\': 620814}, \'multiverseid\': 620814}, {\'name\': \'¡Adelante, eorlingas!\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Caballero Humano rojas 2/2 con las habilidades de arrollar y prisa.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a uno o más jugadores este turno, te conviertes en el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Es un día de espadas, un día rojo en el que todavía no amaneció!\\n¡Galopen sin demora, galopen! ¡A Gondor!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45d7dcc9-d78b-48fb-8dc8-2eb7dabd7014\', \'multiverseId\': 620886}, \'multiverseid\': 620886}, {\'name\': \'En avant, Eorlingas !\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Humain et Chevalier avec le piétinement et la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à au moins un joueur ce tour-ci, vous devenez le monarque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Un jour d\'épée, un jour rouge, avant le lever du soleil !\\nAu galop maintenant, au galop ! Pour le Gondor ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620958&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c7d9cae-2881-4ca8-802b-8bb1545ace7f\', \'multiverseId\': 620958}, \'multiverseid\': 620958}, {\'name\': \'Avanti Eorlingas!\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Cavaliere Umano 2/2 rosse con travolgere e rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a uno o più giocatori in questo turno, diventi il monarca.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sarà rosso il giorno prima dell\\\'alba!\\nCavalcate, cavalcate! Cavalcate verso Gondor!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b430817-3b03-4266-9858-5c50ab4ddb8c\', \'multiverseId\': 621030}, \'multiverseid\': 621030}, {\'name\': \'進め、エオルの家の子よ！\', \'text\': \'トランプルと速攻を持つ赤の２/２の人間・騎士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。\\nこのターン、あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーが１人以上のプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたが統治者になる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「剣の日だ！ 赤き血の日だ！\\n駆けろ！ 駆けるのだ！ゴンドールへ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb19c56-8a2f-4bd8-be3d-b71b25a3c98b\', \'multiverseId\': 621102}, \'multiverseid\': 621102}, {\'name\': \'Avante, Eorlingas!\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura Humano Cavaleiro vermelha 2/2 com atropelar e ímpeto.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que você controla causam dano de combate a um ou mais jogadores neste turno, você se torna o monarca.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Um dia da espada, um dia rubro, antes do sol nascer!\\nCavalguem, cavalguem! Rumo a Gondor!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c84f3e-feea-4833-a525-b5a48b67b0a8\', \'multiverseId\': 621174}, \'multiverseid\': 621174}, {\'name\': \'埃奥尔勇往直前！\', \'text\': \'派出X个2/2红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的人类／骑士衍生生物。\\n本回合中，每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对一位或多位牌手造成战斗伤害时，你成为君主。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「举剑拼杀，浴血奋战，直至旭日重生！\\n翻身策马，翻身策马！策马奔赴刚铎！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00435f7e-ebc0-43fb-8242-4dfb3b539dcf\', \'multiverseId\': 621246}, \'multiverseid\': 621246}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf, Eorlingas!\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 2/2 rote Mensch-Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile, die Trampelschaden verursachen.\\nImmer wenn in diesem Zug eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem oder mehreren Spielern Kampfschaden zufügen, wirst du zum Monarchen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Tag der Schwerter, ein roter Tag, noch vor Sonnenaufgang!\\nReitet nun, reitet los!\\nAuf nach Gondor!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620405&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e9098c-12b8-4051-a284-e7d1fdddaf6d\', \'multiverseId\': 620405}, \'multiverseid\': 620405}, {\'name\': \'En avant, Eorlingas !\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Humain et Chevalier avec le piétinement et la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à au moins un joueur ce tour-ci, vous devenez le monarque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Un jour d\'épée, un jour rouge, avant le lever du soleil !\\nAu galop maintenant, au galop ! Pour le Gondor ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'380d6282-65d2-4751-87c8-f9e380e21bdd\', \'multiverseId\': 620473}, \'multiverseid\': 620473}, {\'name\': \'進め、エオルの家の子よ！\', \'text\': \'トランプルと速攻を持つ赤の２/２の人間・騎士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。\\nこのターン、あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーが１人以上のプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたが統治者になる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「剣の日だ！ 赤き血の日だ！\\n駆けろ！ 駆けるのだ！ゴンドールへ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'997e8e66-c135-499e-8aed-1898f3fbd2c4\', \'multiverseId\': 620541}, \'multiverseid\': 620541}, {\'name\': \'埃奥尔勇往直前！\', \'text\': \'派出X个2/2红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的人类／骑士衍生生物。\\n本回合中，每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对一位或多位牌手造成战斗伤害时，你成为君主。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「举剑拼杀，浴血奋战，直至旭日重生！\\n翻身策马，翻身策马！策马奔赴刚铎！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ee897d4-25d2-4811-a826-c7408c87aa67\', \'multiverseId\': 620609}, \'multiverseid\': 620609}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufruf zur Einigkeit\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, lege eine Einigkeitsmarke auf den Aufruf zur Einigkeit.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 für jede Einigkeitsmarke auf dem Aufruf zur Einigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Verschwindet! Wenn ihr uns noch einmal belästigt, werdet ihr es bereuen."\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621460&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb75d292-a6ee-47ec-8e45-3dbe0d9f08ba\', \'multiverseId\': 621460}, \'multiverseid\': 621460}, {\'name\': \'Llamada a la unidad\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, pon un contador de unidad sobre la Llamada a la unidad.\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 por cada contador de unidad sobre la Llamada a la unidad.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Largo! Si nos molestan otra vez, verán lo que es bueno".\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d29ce1d-78f6-41ae-9dfe-a5bb89418b65\', \'multiverseId\': 621647}, \'multiverseid\': 621647}, {\'name\': "Appel à l\'unité", \'text\': "Révolte — Au début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur « unité » sur l\'Appel à l\'unité.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « unité » sur l\'Appel à l\'unité.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Partez ! Si vous nous importunez encore, vous le regretterez. »\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e7d7027-1f74-4d7c-b7e0-fbd80c2b344c\', \'multiverseId\': 621834}, \'multiverseid\': 621834}, {\'name\': "Richiamo all\'Unità", \'text\': "Rivolta — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, metti un segnalino unità sul Richiamo all\'Unità.\\nLe creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 per ogni segnalino unità sul Richiamo all\'Unità.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Andatevene! Se ci infastidite di nuovo, lo rimpiangerete amaramente."\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1932026-59d8-479a-976d-a0263ee51884\', \'multiverseId\': 622021}, \'multiverseid\': 622021}, {\'name\': \'結束への呼びかけ\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、結束への呼びかけの上に結束カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは、結束への呼びかけの上にある結束カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「いってしまえ！二度とぼくたちの手をわずらわせるな、後悔するぞ。」\\n――メリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'980ba622-9bb5-407f-9d76-99233b380d7d\', \'multiverseId\': 622208}, \'multiverseid\': 622208}, {\'name\': \'Chamado à Unidade\', \'text\': \'Revolta — No início de sua etapa final, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, coloque um marcador de unidade em Chamado à Unidade.\\nAs criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 para cada marcador de unidade em Chamado à Unidade.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Vão embora! Se nos importunarem de novo, vocês vão se arrepender."\\n— Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef2d5ace-a673-429d-8940-957c277a61a4\', \'multiverseId\': 622395}, \'multiverseid\': 622395}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus der Dunkelheit herausziehen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler millt zwei Karten. Bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Macht ihres Herrn ist in ihnen, und mit ihm stehen oder fallen sie."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c95fec38-5787-4239-b7d2-a8f15b0d6713\', \'multiverseId\': 621563}, \'multiverseid\': 621563}, {\'name\': \'Extraer de la oscuridad\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador muele dos cartas. Luego, pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El poder de su amo vive en ellos: o resisten o mueren junto a él".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e626e69-e496-4b5f-9733-e1ddf04a1e60\', \'multiverseId\': 621750}, \'multiverseid\': 621750}, {\'name\': \'Extraire des ténèbres\', \'text\': \'Chaque joueur meule deux cartes. Ensuite, vous mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature depuis un cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Le pouvoir de leur maître les habite, et ils se dressent ou tombent de son fait. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621937&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b6749f-8e86-44a7-bb45-344151516ca4\', \'multiverseId\': 621937}, \'multiverseid\': 621937}, {\'name\': "Estrarre dall\'Oscurità", \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore macina due carte. Poi metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura da un cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il potere del loro padrone è in essi, ed è al suo fianco che si ergono o crollano."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b40dad0e-6a39-4050-a0e4-00dbc9ecddb3\', \'multiverseId\': 622124}, \'multiverseid\': 622124}, {\'name\': \'闇からの摘出\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード２枚を切削する。その後、あなたは墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「彼らは主人の力が吹きこまれて動く。立つも倒れるも、主人次第じゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef628c57-8210-45d1-8c4b-9f7d0293b3d8\', \'multiverseId\': 622311}, \'multiverseid\': 622311}, {\'name\': \'Extrair das Trevas\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador tritura dois cards. Em seguida, você coloca um card de criatura de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O poder de seu mestre está neles, e eles perseveram e caem com ele."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d60eb32d-a5c9-4940-96bd-250da4531aef\', \'multiverseId\': 622498}, \'multiverseid\': 622498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausräuchern\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Du erhältst für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte Kreatur 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der eigene, kleine Garten eines freien Gärtners war alles, was Sam verlangte und ihm zustand, nicht ein Garten-Reich; er wollte seine eigenen Hände gebrauchen, nicht über die Hände anderer gebieten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621467&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d982b750-15bf-4793-816f-d2585294d147\', \'multiverseId\': 621467}, \'multiverseid\': 621467}, {\'name\': \'Fumigar\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. Ganas 1 vida por cada criatura destruida de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Lo único que respondía a los gustos y necesidades de Sam era un pequeño jardín de un jardinero libre, y no un jardín de las dimensiones de un reino; el trabajo de sus propias manos, y no las de otros bajo sus órdenes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74ad39b0-a0e2-48e6-b0a4-338c2c23aa56\', \'multiverseId\': 621654}, \'multiverseid\': 621654}, {\'name\': \'Fumigation\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le petit jardin d\'un jardinier libre était tout ce à quoi Sam voulait prétendre. Il n\'avait pas besoin d\'un jardin grand comme un royaume. Il lui fallait utiliser ses propres mains, pas commander à celles des autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ca91d26-3cd6-4fe7-ab58-16e8de825528\', \'multiverseId\': 621841}, \'multiverseid\': 621841}, {\'name\': \'Fumigare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature. Guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura distrutta in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il piccolo giardino di un giardiniere libero era tutto ciò di cui Sam aveva bisogno e non di un giardino ingrandito come un reame; aveva bisogno di usare le proprie mani e non di comandare le mani altrui.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea68bf41-dfed-4389-baf9-f755b6e52c87\', \'multiverseId\': 622028}, \'multiverseid\': 622028}, {\'name\': \'燻蒸\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。あなたは、これにより破壊されたクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'サムが望むふさわしい庭は、独立した庭師の小さな庭一つであり、王国ほどの庭ではない。自分の手で充分に世話でき、他人を使う必要のない庭でいいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cdaad3b-a6e0-4ce4-b33b-a6bd5e5e913c\', \'multiverseId\': 622215}, \'multiverseid\': 622215}, {\'name\': \'Fumigar\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura destruída dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Um jardim pequeno de um jardineiro livre era tudo a que Sam tinha direito e de que precisava, não um jardim inchado até virar um reino; com o uso de suas próprias mãos, e não o comando das mãos de outros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'007fd8a9-2122-43c7-a8cb-4dbf2b2a4381\', \'multiverseId\': 622402}, \'multiverseid\': 622402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bankettgäste\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Speisen (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Speise, die du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nDie Bankettgäste kommen mit zweimal X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{2}, opfere eine Speise: Die Bankettgäste erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620805&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa964321-735c-486f-a1eb-b07c1d0c090c\', \'multiverseId\': 620805}, \'multiverseid\': 620805}, {\'name\': \'Invitados al banquete\', \'text\': \'Afinidad por Comida. (Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada Comida que controlas.)\\nArrolla.\\nLos Invitados al banquete entran al campo de batalla con el doble de X contadores +1/+1 sobre ellos.\\n{2}, sacrificar una Comida: Los Invitados al banquete ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6061c2-1fe9-4602-9339-0af761b9b8d7\', \'multiverseId\': 620877}, \'multiverseid\': 620877}, {\'name\': \'Convives du banquet\', \'text\': "Affinité pour la nourriture (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque nourriture que vous contrôlez.)\\nPiétinement\\nLes Convives du banquet arrivent sur le champ de bataille avec deux fois X marqueurs +1/+1 sur eux.\\n{2}, sacrifiez une nourriture : Les Convives du banquet acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620949&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7febe11a-3e7d-4ebe-b4b3-bcab78104c7a\', \'multiverseId\': 620949}, \'multiverseid\': 620949}, {\'name\': \'Invitati al Banchetto\', \'text\': \'Affinità con il Cibo (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni Cibo che controlli.)\\nTravolgere\\nGli Invitati al Banchetto entrano nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al doppio di X.\\n{2}, Sacrifica un Cibo: Gli Invitati al Banchetto hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85e865d1-2cb6-4c38-9cb6-85326e88af27\', \'multiverseId\': 621021}, \'multiverseid\': 621021}, {\'name\': \'宴会の招待客\', \'text\': \'親和（食物）（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしている食物１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）\\nトランプル\\n宴会の招待客は、Ｘの２倍の個数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}, 食物１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、宴会の招待客は破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c65e3c7-c985-43fc-b9b8-d78359718953\', \'multiverseId\': 621093}, \'multiverseid\': 621093}, {\'name\': \'Convidados do Banquete\', \'text\': \'Afinidade por Comida (Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada Comida que você controla.)\\nAtropelar\\nConvidados do Banquete entra no campo de batalha com duas vezes X marcadores +1/+1.\\n{2}, sacrifique uma Comida: Convidados do Banquete ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pequenino Cidadão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6fd6dd1-7692-445c-8c88-86268866fbb4\', \'multiverseId\': 621165}, \'multiverseid\': 621165}, {\'name\': \'宴会客人\', \'text\': \'食品共鸣（你每操控一个食品，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n践踏\\n宴会客人进战场时上面有两倍于X数量的+1/+1指示物。\\n{2}，牺牲一个食品：宴会客人获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半身人／市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c070690-0a9c-4180-ac76-097431054f86\', \'multiverseId\': 621237}, \'multiverseid\': 621237}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bankettgäste\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Speisen\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nDie Bankettgäste kommen mit zweimal X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{2}, opfere eine Speise: Die Bankettgäste erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620396&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13ca0c40-31ef-425b-b122-fb5405a49ad6\', \'multiverseId\': 620396}, \'multiverseid\': 620396}, {\'name\': \'Convives du banquet\', \'text\': "Affinité pour la nourriture\\nPiétinement\\nLes Convives du banquet arrivent sur le champ de bataille avec deux fois X marqueurs +1/+1 sur eux.\\n{2}, sacrifiez une nourriture : Les Convives du banquet acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaac8ea3-cc94-43c2-bba8-e613443adfd1\', \'multiverseId\': 620464}, \'multiverseid\': 620464}, {\'name\': \'宴会の招待客\', \'text\': \'親和（食物）\\nトランプル\\n宴会の招待客は、Ｘの２倍の個数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}, 食物１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、宴会の招待客は破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcfada98-5af1-4c9d-ad38-35df70c0fbcf\', \'multiverseId\': 620532}, \'multiverseid\': 620532}, {\'name\': \'宴会客人\', \'text\': \'食品共鸣\\n践踏\\n宴会客人进战场时上面有两倍于X数量的+1/+1指示物。\\n{2}，牺牲一个食品：宴会客人获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半身人／市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582961d0-8e27-4066-a862-486815ce70b1\', \'multiverseId\': 620600}, \'multiverseid\': 620600}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannendes Licht\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bannende Licht ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis das Bannende Licht das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Allen voran schritt Aragorn mit der Flamme des Westens — Andúril, wie ein neu entfachtes Feuer, Narsil neu geschmiedet, so tödlich wie in alter Zeit. Und auf seiner Stirn leuchtete der Stern von Elendil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621458&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e50af3-96d1-4e16-b659-9ad6e6e1fba6\', \'multiverseId\': 621458}, \'multiverseid\': 621458}, {\'name\': \'Luz de destierro\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Luz de destierro entre al campo de batalla, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente hasta que la Luz de destierro deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Delante de todos se encontraba Aragorn con la Llama del Oeste, Andúril. Como si de un nuevo fuego prendido se tratase, Narsil reforjada y tan letal como antaño. Llevaba en la frente la Estrella de Elendil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0011f1fc-bfe5-4c50-b6f7-5738ca262aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 621645}, \'multiverseid\': 621645}, {\'name\': \'Lumière de bannissement\', \'text\': "Quand la Lumière de bannissement arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que la Lumière de bannissement quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Mais devant tous venait Aragorn avec la Flamme de l\'Ouest, Andúril, comme un feu nouvellement allumé, Narsil reforgée aussi mortelle que jadis. Et sur son front brillait l\'étoile d\'Elendil.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66384ecb-de2e-4d27-b13e-6261c8c4225c\', \'multiverseId\': 621832}, \'multiverseid\': 621832}, {\'name\': \'Luce Esiliatrice\', \'text\': \'Quando la Luce Esiliatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario finché la Luce Esiliatrice non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "Aragorn marciava davanti a tutti con la Fiamma dell\'Ovest, Andùril, che sfavillava come fuoco appena acceso, Narsil riforgiata e letale come in passato. Sulla sua fronte brillava la Stella di Elendil.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36045603-4449-40cf-a938-ed6d14c15219\', \'multiverseId\': 622019}, \'multiverseid\': 622019}, {\'name\': \'払拭の光\', \'text\': \'払拭の光が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。払拭の光が戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'すべての先頭に立つのはアラゴルン、その手には新たに燃ゆる西方の焰アンドゥリル、すなわち昔日と同じく必殺の剣に鍛え直されたナルシルがあった。そして彼の額にはエレンディルの星が輝いていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f135544-636e-41bd-95ab-d3793cb1bc20\', \'multiverseId\': 622206}, \'multiverseid\': 622206}, {\'name\': \'Luz Banidora\', \'text\': \'Quando Luz Banidora entrar no campo de batalha, exile a permanente alvo não de terreno que um oponente controla até que Luz Banidora deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'E à frente de todos ia Aragorn com a Chama do Oeste, Andúril, como um fogo novo aceso, Narsil reforjada, mortífera como outrora. E na testa dele estava a Estrela de Elendil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa59b00-a810-48d1-891d-b2859c9ee340\', \'multiverseId\': 622393}, \'multiverseid\': 622393}]', '[{\'name\': \'Banner der Siegreichen\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Banner der Siegreichen ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber des bestimmten Typs wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Sieben Sterne und sieben Steine und ein weißer Baum."\\n—Alter Vers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621586&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a31f5c-253b-4a9a-a164-ebdae496e420\', \'multiverseId\': 621586}, \'multiverseid\': 621586}, {\'name\': \'Estandarte del vencedor\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Estandarte del vencedor entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura del tipo elegido, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Siete estrellas, siete piedras y un árbol de blancas ramas".\\n—Una vieja canción\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba59a39-25c2-4d3d-9574-3180ac44fa98\', \'multiverseId\': 621773}, \'multiverseid\': 621773}, {\'name\': \'Bannière du vainqueur\', \'text\': \'Au moment où la Bannière du vainqueur arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature du type choisi, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Sept étoiles et sept pierres, et un arbre blanc. »\\n—Vers d\'un poème traditionnel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621960&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ce9843-c5d3-48ca-8a09-38f0df4946d4\', \'multiverseId\': 621960}, \'multiverseid\': 621960}, {\'name\': \'Vessillo del Trionfatore\', \'text\': \'Mentre il Vessillo del Trionfatore entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nLe creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura del tipo scelto, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Sette stelle e sette pietre e un albero bianco."\\n—Un poema di sapienza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'950c9b46-e82c-4944-aa51-2f3535101f73\', \'multiverseId\': 622147}, \'multiverseid\': 622147}, {\'name\': \'勝者の戦旗\', \'text\': \'勝者の戦旗が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプを持つすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがその選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「七つの星に、七つ石、また一本の白の木よ。」\\n――古い伝承の歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af53426e-c282-4848-a7f3-1c83bb1d8ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 622334}, \'multiverseid\': 622334}, {\'name\': \'Estandarte do Vitorioso\', \'text\': \'Conforme Estandarte do Vitorioso entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAs criaturas que você controla do tipo escolhido recebem +1/+1.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de criatura do tipo escolhido, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Sete estrelas, sete pedras e uma árvore branca."\\n— Rima do saber\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c521888a-f06d-4035-8467-d106cd4a8f39\', \'multiverseId\': 622521}, \'multiverseid\': 622521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basaltmonolith\', \'text\': \'Der Basaltmonolith enttappt nicht während deines Enttappsegments.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}: Enttappe den Basaltmonolith.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Straße um den schwarzen Felsen biegt, werdet ihr ihn sehen. Plötzlich werdet ihr ihn über euch erblicken, und ihr werdet euch verstecken wollen."\\n—Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8da7d2af-fa05-42b3-af15-7b59a06e1a48\', \'multiverseId\': 621571}, \'multiverseid\': 621571}, {\'name\': \'Monolito de basalto\', \'text\': \'El Monolito de basalto no se endereza durante tu paso de enderezar.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}: Endereza el Monolito de basalto.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando pasas por al lado de la roca negra, lo ves. Lo ves de pronto sobre tu cabeza y quieres esconderte".\\n—Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66672a66-768e-483d-addb-0e50e9daa847\', \'multiverseId\': 621758}, \'multiverseid\': 621758}, {\'name\': \'Monolithe de basalte\', \'text\': \'Le Monolithe de basalte ne se dégage pas pendant votre étape de dégagement.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3} : Dégagez le Monolithe de basalte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand la route tournera au rocher noir, vous le verrez. Vous le verrez soudain au-dessus de vous, et vous voudrez vous cacher. »\\n—Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621945&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f8b4a0-7f33-48af-abfb-ed8ac4d7b771\', \'multiverseId\': 621945}, \'multiverseid\': 621945}, {\'name\': \'Monolito di Basalto\', \'text\': \'Il Monolito di Basalto non STAPpa durante il tuo STAP.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}: STAPpa il Monolito di Basalto.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando gira intorno alla roccia nera, allora la vedrai. Improvvisamente la vedrai sopra di te e vorrai nasconderti."\\n—Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81fc7a22-0e6f-4dad-9e9c-714d7174b801\', \'multiverseId\': 622132}, \'multiverseid\': 622132}, {\'name\': \'玄武岩のモノリス\', \'text\': \'玄武岩のモノリスはあなたのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n{T}：{C}{C}{C}を加える。\\n{3}：玄武岩のモノリスをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「黒い岩のとこで道を折れると、見えるのよ。突然あたまの上に見えてくるよ、そして隠れたくなるよ。」\\n――ゴラム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d127a2c5-3cce-4b8c-ab23-f619776a1206\', \'multiverseId\': 622319}, \'multiverseid\': 622319}, {\'name\': \'Monólito de Basalto\', \'text\': \'Monólito de Basalto não desvira durante sua etapa de desvirar.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}: Desvire Monólito de Basalto.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando ela gira em torno da pedra preta, vocês vão ver ela. De repente vão ver ela em cima de vocês e vão querer se esconder."\\n— Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dee3551-69ad-4a87-b9e2-d4196ba49aea\', \'multiverseId\': 622506}, \'multiverseid\': 622506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bauer Hüttinger\', \'text\': \'Wenn Bauer Hüttinger ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Halbling-Kreaturenspielsteine und X Speise-Spielsteine. (Sie sind Artefakte mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'„Endlich ist es also soweit! Es juckt mich schon das ganze Jahr, ihnen Ärger zu machen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620813&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1f67bd5-1e52-4504-9793-753d843a4e30\', \'multiverseId\': 620813}, \'multiverseid\': 620813}, {\'name\': \'Granjero Coto\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Granjero Coto entre al campo de batalla, crea X fichas de criatura Mediano blancas 1/1 y X fichas de Comida. (Son artefactos con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Plebeyo mediano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Por fin empezó! Llevo todo el año con ganas de gresca".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a9b9708-e15c-44f3-92db-61f920f72dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 620885}, \'multiverseid\': 620885}, {\'name\': \'Fermier Chaumine\', \'text\': \'Quand le Fermier Chaumine arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Halfelin et X jetons Nourriture. (Ce sont des artefacts avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et paysan\', \'flavor\': "« Alors ça commence enfin ! J\'ai eu envie de faire du grabuge toute l\'année ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620957&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f85f96-84a7-4133-9280-ed928e3be351\', \'multiverseId\': 620957}, \'multiverseid\': 620957}, {\'name\': \'Contadino Cotton\', \'text\': \'Quando il Contadino Cotton entra nel campo di battaglia, crea X pedine creatura Halfling 1/1 bianche e X pedine Cibo. (Sono artefatti con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Popolano Halfling\', \'flavor\': \'"Allora è finalmente arrivato il momento! Da un anno ormai le mani mi prudevano."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eac8660-8a5f-447a-9874-db55eb282836\', \'multiverseId\': 621029}, \'multiverseid\': 621029}, {\'name\': \'お百姓のコトン\', \'text\': \'お百姓のコトンが戦場に出たとき、白の１/１のハーフリング・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体と食物・トークンＸ個を生成する。（それらは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・農民\', \'flavor\': \'「やっと始まったか！わしは今年になってからずっと待ちわびておった！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc7cfd4f-aa26-4682-b862-737eacb663ce\', \'multiverseId\': 621101}, \'multiverseid\': 621101}, {\'name\': \'Fazendeiro Villa\', \'text\': \'Quando Fazendeiro Villa entrar no campo de batalha, crie X fichas de criatura Pequenino branca 1/1 e X fichas de Comida. (Elas são artefatos com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Plebeu\', \'flavor\': \'"Então finalmente começou! Estou atrás de uma confusão desde o início do ano."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d579e2f-8fbe-48d5-b232-09b7cd02d676\', \'multiverseId\': 621173}, \'multiverseid\': 621173}, {\'name\': \'农夫科顿\', \'text\': \'当农夫科顿进战场时，派出X个1/1白色半身人衍生生物和X个食品衍生物。（它们是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「终于开始了！我这一整年总想着闹上一场。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ec3330b-c7cd-4d31-84b4-67dd3d0cb5c6\', \'multiverseId\': 621245}, \'multiverseid\': 621245}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bauer Hüttinger\', \'text\': \'Wenn Bauer Hüttinger ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Halbling-Kreaturenspielsteine und X Speise-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'„Endlich ist es also soweit! Es juckt mich schon das ganze Jahr, ihnen Ärger zu machen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620404&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687f2c29-dcb1-41bc-9723-ede5b1c5898b\', \'multiverseId\': 620404}, \'multiverseid\': 620404}, {\'name\': \'Fermier Chaumine\', \'text\': \'Quand le Fermier Chaumine arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Halfelin et X jetons Nourriture.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et paysan\', \'flavor\': "« Alors ça commence enfin ! J\'ai eu envie de faire du grabuge toute l\'année ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eb9310d-0881-45be-ae5c-3f139b809931\', \'multiverseId\': 620472}, \'multiverseid\': 620472}, {\'name\': \'お百姓のコトン\', \'text\': \'お百姓のコトンが戦場に出たとき、白の１/１のハーフリング・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体と食物・トークンＸ個を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・農民\', \'flavor\': \'「やっと始まったか！わしは今年になってからずっと待ちわびておった！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab06a7a7-f322-4eb2-b36c-77bbe3b687ce\', \'multiverseId\': 620540}, \'multiverseid\': 620540}, {\'name\': \'农夫科顿\', \'text\': \'当农夫科顿进战场时，派出X个1/1白色半身人衍生生物和X个食品衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「终于开始了！我这一整年总想着闹上一场。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e08dcee-5b11-4a1d-9a3c-8f87bc9e2f01\', \'multiverseId\': 620608}, \'multiverseid\': 620608}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumbart, großzügiger Gastgeber\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Abwehr {2}\\nWenn Baumbart, großzügiger Gastgeber, ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei Speise-Spielsteine.\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf einen Halbling oder einen Baumhirten deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich gehe meinen eigenen Weg, aber euer mag eine Weile neben meinem herlaufen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620831&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abbf0c5a-aad2-42eb-bc3f-592230d4a9f9\', \'multiverseId\': 620831}, \'multiverseid\': 620831}, {\'name\': \'Bárbol, anfitrión amable\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, rebatir {2}.\\nCuando Bárbol, anfitrión amable entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de Comida.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Mediano o el Pueblo-arbóreo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sigo mi camino, pero pueden acompañarme un rato".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'481332b1-2c35-431e-be38-3f05ea1e6cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 620903}, \'multiverseid\': 620903}, {\'name\': \'Sylvebarbe, hôte affable\', \'text\': \'Piétinement, parade {2}\\nQuand Sylvebarbe, hôte affable arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons Nourriture.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur un halfelin ou un sylvin ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : sylvin\', \'flavor\': \'« Je suis mon propre chemin, mais votre chemin pourrait suivre le mien pendant un temps. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620975&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'682e228f-e66a-48d2-b453-0750a98f80da\', \'multiverseId\': 620975}, \'multiverseid\': 620975}, {\'name\': \'Barbalbero, Ospite Gentile\', \'text\': \'Travolgere, egida {2}\\nQuando Barbalbero, Ospite Gentile entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine Cibo.\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 su un Halfling o su un Silvantropo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'"Io vado per la mia strada, ma la vostra potrebbe fiancheggiare la mia per un po\\\'."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'168b781c-7142-438e-8194-4b4e2ad0a238\', \'multiverseId\': 621047}, \'multiverseid\': 621047}, {\'name\': \'親切にもてなす者、木の鬚\', \'text\': \'トランプル、護法{2}\\n親切にもてなす者、木の鬚が戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン２つを生成する。\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、ハーフリングやツリーフォークのうち１体を対象とする。その得た点数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターをそれの上に置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': \'「わしはわしの道をゆく。しかしお前さんたちの道も、しばらくは同じ方へゆくのかもしれぬな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d143bc1f-fa14-4050-921d-d10d9455eef6\', \'multiverseId\': 621119}, \'multiverseid\': 621119}, {\'name\': \'Barbárvore, Anfitrião Gracioso\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, salvaguarda {2}\\nQuando Barbárvore, Anfitrião Gracioso, entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de Comida.\\nToda vez que você ganhar pontos de vida, coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 no Pequenino ou Ent alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ent\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu sigo meu próprio caminho, mas o caminho de vocês pode acompanhar o meu por um tempo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90d3448e-9715-462c-84f6-95a1d7efba26\', \'multiverseId\': 621191}, \'multiverseid\': 621191}, {\'name\': \'和蔼东主树须\', \'text\': \'践踏，守护{2}\\n当和蔼东主树须进战场时，派出两个食品衍生物。\\n每当你获得生命时，在目标半身人或树妖上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～树妖\', \'flavor\': \'「我走我的路，不过你的路可能有一段会跟我重合。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cdf0043-190a-4aae-bbd3-07a12e93808c\', \'multiverseId\': 621263}, \'multiverseid\': 621263}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumbart, großzügiger Gastgeber\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Abwehr {2}\\nWenn Baumbart, großzügiger Gastgeber, ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei Speise-Spielsteine.\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf einen Halbling oder einen Baumhirten deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich gehe meinen eigenen Weg, aber eurer mag eine Weile neben meinem herlaufen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620419&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c957ae70-45fe-43d3-9942-6dccac6e42c4\', \'multiverseId\': 620419}, \'multiverseid\': 620419}, {\'name\': \'Sylvebarbe, hôte affable\', \'text\': \'Piétinement, parade {2}\\nQuand Sylvebarbe, hôte affable arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons Nourriture.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur un halfelin ou un sylvin ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : sylvin\', \'flavor\': \'« Je suis mon propre chemin, mais votre chemin pourrait suivre le mien pendant un temps. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620487&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49178fd6-038f-451c-b004-60237cade1d6\', \'multiverseId\': 620487}, \'multiverseid\': 620487}, {\'name\': \'親切にもてなす者、木の鬚\', \'text\': \'トランプル、護法{2}\\n親切にもてなす者、木の鬚が戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン２つを生成する。\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、ハーフリングやツリーフォークのうち１体を対象とする。その得た点数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターをそれの上に置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': \'「わしはわしの道をゆく。しかしお前さんたちの道も、しばらくは同じ方へゆくのかもしれぬな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8235ec5d-3840-423c-bab4-c37250545b22\', \'multiverseId\': 620555}, \'multiverseid\': 620555}, {\'name\': \'和蔼东主树须\', \'text\': \'践踏，守护{2}\\n当和蔼东主树须进战场时，派出两个食品衍生物。\\n每当你获得生命时，在目标半身人或树妖上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～树妖\', \'flavor\': \'「我走我的路，不过你的路可能有一段会跟我重合。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c60ddbb-1f5d-47bd-9e91-860207439cef\', \'multiverseId\': 620623}, \'multiverseid\': 620623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Hobbits aus dem Westviertel hieß es, von der Spitze des Turms könne man das Meer sehen; doch es war nicht bekannt, dass ihn je ein Hobbit erklommen hätte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40349095-4838-48e0-9219-bc419131bc7d\', \'multiverseId\': 621598}, \'multiverseid\': 621598}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los hobbits de la Cuaderna del Oeste decían que podía verse el mar desde arriba de la torre, pero no se conoce que ningún hobbit haya podido subir hasta lo alto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e717dd15-835b-4cd6-bffa-423a8d16c1f1\', \'multiverseId\': 621785}, \'multiverseid\': 621785}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les hobbits du Quartier Ouest affirmaient que l\'on voyait la mer du haut de cette tour... mais à ce qu\'on en savait, aucun hobbit n\'y était encore jamais monté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621972&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e7638bc-27a1-45fc-a5ed-4fbc285d1457\', \'multiverseId\': 621972}, \'multiverseid\': 621972}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Gli Hobbit del Decumano Ovest sostenevano che si potesse vedere il Mare dall\'alto della torre, ma nessun Hobbit vi si era mai arrampicato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9146d4b-3efa-4edd-b132-3203efcc3677\', \'multiverseId\': 622159}, \'multiverseid\': 622159}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'西四が一の庄のホビットたちの話によれば、その塔のてっぺんに立つと海が見えたという。しかしその塔に登ったホビットのことは知られていない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bf1e110-b457-454a-8d13-7e9fc6eb8fd5\', \'multiverseId\': 622346}, \'multiverseid\': 622346}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Comando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os Hobbits da Quarta Oeste diziam que dava para ver o Mar do topo daquela torre; mas jamais se soube de um Hobbit que a tenha subido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5966c422-4f84-402b-b6b2-e762d7f8d6e5\', \'multiverseId\': 622533}, \'multiverseid\': 622533}]', "[{'name': 'Befestigtes Dorf', 'text': 'Sowie das Befestigte Dorf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Wald- oder Ebene-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt das Befestigte Dorf getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'An jedem Ende der Brücke stand ein großes, stachelbewehrtes Tor, sehr düster und gar nicht dem Auenland gemäß.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621608&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2868590-29ff-45d5-bc68-46ff47c31ddb', 'multiverseId': 621608}, 'multiverseid': 621608}, {'name': 'Aldea fortificada', 'text': 'En cuanto la Aldea fortificada entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Bosque o Llanura de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Aldea fortificada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'En cada extremo del puente había una gran puerta con pinchos muy lúgubre, para nada el estilo de la Comarca.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621795&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0aab56c0-1d73-4d2c-8761-ff517fa6664f', 'multiverseId': 621795}, 'multiverseid': 621795}, {'name': 'Village fortifié', 'text': 'Au moment où le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de forêt ou de plaine de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'À chaque extrémité du pont se trouvait un grand portail hérissé de pointes, particulièrement sinistre et inhabituel pour la Comté.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621982&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b78a47c-e960-482c-9ff6-57fb8ff8584c', 'multiverseId': 621982}, 'multiverseid': 621982}, {'name': 'Villaggio Fortificato', 'text': 'Mentre il Villaggio Fortificato entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Foresta o Pianura dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, il Villaggio Fortificato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'A entrambe le estremità del Ponte si ergeva un grande cancello sormontato da punte aguzze, molto squallido e per nulla in carattere con la Contea.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622169&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '906f456b-1402-4142-98e0-c7eb6cd1b5ac', 'multiverseId': 622169}, 'multiverseid': 622169}, {'name': '要塞化した村', 'text': '要塞化した村が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり森や平地であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、要塞化した村はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '橋の両側には釘を植えた大きな門があり、非常に陰気でホビット庄らしからぬ風情だった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622356&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dad94e88-84c8-4884-9755-910fe10ff59a', 'multiverseId': 622356}, 'multiverseid': 622356}, {'name': 'Aldeia Fortificada', 'text': 'Conforme Aldeia Fortificada entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Floresta ou Planície de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Aldeia Fortificada entrará no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Em cada extremidade da Ponte havia um grande portão com estacas, deveras deprimentes e estranhos no Condado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622543&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e207d36a-f89f-46c1-99bf-010dd20d6cf0', 'multiverseId': 622543}, 'multiverseid': 622543}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beherztes Pony\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nImmer wenn das Beherzte Pony angreift, erhalten angreifende Kreaturen +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls in diesem Zug eine Speise unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, enttappe jene Kreaturen und sie erhalten zusätzlich +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pferd\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76e178eb-e10d-4825-93e8-68c9dc720606\', \'multiverseId\': 620391}, \'multiverseid\': 620391}, {\'name\': \'Poney motivé\', \'text\': "Piétinement, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Poney motivé attaque, les créatures attaquantes gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si une nourriture est arrivée sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, dégagez ces créatures et elles gagnent +2/+2 supplémentaires jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : cheval\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64d45358-e2f3-4bac-b416-55d36c1cb145\', \'multiverseId\': 620459}, \'multiverseid\': 620459}, {\'name\': \'意気盛んな小馬\', \'text\': \'トランプル、速攻\\n意気盛んな小馬が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、すべての攻撃クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。このターンにあなたのコントロール下で食物が戦場に出たことがあるなら、それらのクリーチャーをアンタップし、ターン終了時まで、それらは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 馬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a767c2cc-1b2f-474d-97f7-b3e86de05eb6\', \'multiverseId\': 620527}, \'multiverseid\': 620527}, {\'name\': \'积极小马\', \'text\': \'践踏，敏捷\\n每当积极小马攻击时，进行攻击的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。若本回合中有食品在你操控下进战场，则重置这些生物，且它们再得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～马\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bff4115-8b59-41fb-a6de-b8779d4fb6bf\', \'multiverseId\': 620595}, \'multiverseid\': 620595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beherztes Pony\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nImmer wenn das Beherzte Pony angreift, erhalten angreifende Kreaturen +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls in diesem Zug eine Speise unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, enttappe jene Kreaturen und sie erhalten zusätzlich +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pferd\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620800&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd12002d-2d4a-4050-98f8-6acce3c1b0d8\', \'multiverseId\': 620800}, \'multiverseid\': 620800}, {\'name\': \'Poni motivado\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, prisa.\\nSiempre que el Poni motivado ataque, las criaturas atacantes obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno. Si una Comida entró al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, endereza esas criaturas y obtienen un +2/+2 adicional hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7646025c-163d-494b-aee5-1296cad7fafb\', \'multiverseId\': 620872}, \'multiverseid\': 620872}, {\'name\': \'Poney motivé\', \'text\': "Piétinement, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Poney motivé attaque, les créatures attaquantes gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si une nourriture est arrivée sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, dégagez ces créatures et elles gagnent +2/+2 supplémentaires jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : cheval\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620944&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce026b6d-874b-41d0-8219-e6ecb105a098\', \'multiverseId\': 620944}, \'multiverseid\': 620944}, {\'name\': \'Pony Motivato\', \'text\': \'Travolgere, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta il Pony Motivato attacca, le creature attaccanti prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno. Se un Cibo è entrato nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, STAPpa quelle creature, che prendono un +2/+2 addizionale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavallo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e01df9a-ff8c-429c-beab-7150fa0b96f1\', \'multiverseId\': 621016}, \'multiverseid\': 621016}, {\'name\': \'意気盛んな小馬\', \'text\': \'トランプル、速攻\\n意気盛んな小馬が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、すべての攻撃クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。このターンにあなたのコントロール下で食物が戦場に出たことがあるなら、それらのクリーチャーをアンタップし、ターン終了時まで、それらは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 馬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d4313a9-88cf-413e-99df-9e99a43d6cf7\', \'multiverseId\': 621088}, \'multiverseid\': 621088}, {\'name\': \'Pônei Motivado\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, ímpeto\\nToda vez que Pônei Motivado ataca, as criaturas atacantes recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno. Se uma Comida tiver entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, desvire aquelas criaturas. Elas recebem +2/+2 adicionais até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cavalo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3613bbb-c2b9-48be-9b10-320df18a7040\', \'multiverseId\': 621160}, \'multiverseid\': 621160}, {\'name\': \'积极小马\', \'text\': \'践踏，敏捷\\n每当积极小马攻击时，进行攻击的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。若本回合中有食品在你操控下进战场，则重置这些生物，且它们再得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～马\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e95068-38e3-435d-975c-ba3e66622a66\', \'multiverseId\': 621232}, \'multiverseid\': 621232}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beinschienen des Blitzes\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Eile und Verhülltheit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nAusrüsten {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Stärksten müssen einen Weg suchen, sagst du? Ich dagegen sage: Lass einen Bauer pflügen, aber wähle einen Otter fürs Schwimmen und einen Elben, um leicht über Gras und Laub zu laufen."\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621578&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e66a9343-3bcb-4acc-b680-ccefb5ac1fef\', \'multiverseId\': 621578}, \'multiverseid\': 621578}, {\'name\': \'Grebas relámpago\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de prisa y velo. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Dijeron que los más fuertes deben buscar un camino? Pero yo digo que un labrador are, que una nutria nade y que un elfo corra ligeramente sobre la hierba y las hojas".\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a351cec-c200-459d-9e81-605e6a45d192\', \'multiverseId\': 621765}, \'multiverseid\': 621765}, {\'name\': "Jambières d\'éclair", \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la célérité et le linceul. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nÉquipement {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Les plus forts doivent déblayer un chemin, dites-vous ? Moi je dis : que le laboureur laboure, mais pour la nage choisissez une loutre, puis un elfe pour marcher avec légèreté sur l\'herbe et les feuilles. »\\n—Legolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621952&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43c8882c-c5d2-4624-9ce0-b1d52a0a3a55\', \'multiverseId\': 621952}, \'multiverseid\': 621952}, {\'name\': \'Schinieri dei Fulmini\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha rapidità e velo. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\\nEquipaggiare {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"I più forti devono cercare una via, dite voi? Ma io dico: fate arare il campo al coltivatore, ma scegliete una lontra per nuotare e un Elfo per correre veloce su erbe e foglie."\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d3d0a0b-96e1-4f11-87f4-83501e46d62e\', \'multiverseId\': 622139}, \'multiverseid\': 622139}, {\'name\': \'稲妻のすね当て\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは速攻と被覆を持つ。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備{0}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「最も強健な者が道を探さねばならぬ。そうですね。でも私にいわせれば、耕夫には耕させよ。だが、泳ぐにはカワウソを、草葉の上を軽々と駆けるには、エルフを選ぶべしです。」\\n――レゴラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1d2f14-87d5-454b-976d-077f66a45cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 622326}, \'multiverseid\': 622326}, {\'name\': \'Grevas Faiscantes\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem manto e ímpeto. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Os mais fortes precisam achar um caminho, você diz? Mas eu digo: deixe o fazendeiro arar, mas escolha uma lontra para nadar, e escolha um Elfo para correr com leveza sobre a grama e a folhagem."\\n— Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11b0297b-67ca-421e-bc8b-10f92ae092e3\', \'multiverseId\': 622513}, \'multiverseid\': 622513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungsmeister der Orks\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nAndere Orks und Goblins, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden.\\nImmer wenn der Belagerungsmeister der Orks angreift, erhält er bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620382&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10310722-f7bc-43aa-ae26-6845a95faf07\', \'multiverseId\': 620382}, \'multiverseid\': 620382}, {\'name\': \'Maître de siège orque\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLes autres orques et les gobelins que vous contrôlez ont le piétinement.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Maître de siège orque attaque, il gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebc0b609-fa6b-4dcc-bb2f-c7df5dee890a\', \'multiverseId\': 620450}, \'multiverseid\': 620450}, {\'name\': \'オークの攻城戦指揮官\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nオークやゴブリンのうちあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてはトランプルを持つ。\\nオークの攻城戦指揮官が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最大のパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4fb0ded-f429-4b7e-b76d-4390545d726a\', \'multiverseId\': 620518}, \'multiverseid\': 620518}, {\'name\': \'奥克攻城领队\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n由你操控的其他半兽人和鬼怪具有践踏异能。\\n每当奥克攻城领队攻击时，它得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为由你操控之生物中的最大力量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半兽人／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba7747d4-ed1a-4aa8-8f85-445b23447024\', \'multiverseId\': 620586}, \'multiverseid\': 620586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungsmeister der Orks\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nAndere Orks und Goblins, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden.\\nImmer wenn der Belagerungsmeister der Orks angreift, erhält er bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620791&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a01e6b1b-edda-46f1-b206-f229e0a382d0\', \'multiverseId\': 620791}, \'multiverseid\': 620791}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de asedio orco\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nLos otros Orcos y Trasgos que controlas tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\\nSiempre que el Maestro de asedio orco ataque, obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa9b414-78a8-4245-8df2-964a0da6f387\', \'multiverseId\': 620863}, \'multiverseid\': 620863}, {\'name\': \'Maître de siège orque\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLes autres orques et les gobelins que vous contrôlez ont le piétinement.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Maître de siège orque attaque, il gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620935&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1e02ae6-57fb-449d-9803-8e673c27d684\', \'multiverseId\': 620935}, \'multiverseid\': 620935}, {\'name\': "Orco Maestro d\'Assedio", \'text\': "Travolgere\\nGli altri Orchi e Goblin che controlli hanno travolgere.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Orco Maestro d\'Assedio attacca, prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è la forza maggiore tra le creature che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934924fe-e065-44f1-94f8-5dcebd7c4a97\', \'multiverseId\': 621007}, \'multiverseid\': 621007}, {\'name\': \'オークの攻城戦指揮官\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nオークやゴブリンのうちあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてはトランプルを持つ。\\nオークの攻城戦指揮官が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最大のパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'772913d1-d58f-420d-8a5c-47b49ed0ad90\', \'multiverseId\': 621079}, \'multiverseid\': 621079}, {\'name\': \'Mestre de Cerco Orc\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nOs outros Orcs e Goblins que você controla têm atropelar.\\nToda vez que Mestre de Cerco Orc ataca, ele recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X o maior poder entre os das criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Orc Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e496caeb-690f-4ff8-8b41-169ec74ed78b\', \'multiverseId\': 621151}, \'multiverseid\': 621151}, {\'name\': \'奥克围攻大师\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n由你操控的其他半兽人和鬼怪具有践踏异能。\\n每当奥克围攻大师攻击时，它得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为由你操控的生物中的最大力量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半兽人／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9d7d8d7-baea-4244-9e8d-52056e5e95ff\', \'multiverseId\': 621223}, \'multiverseid\': 621223}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge drei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n{1}{R}, opfere einen Goblin: Der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Sie begannen, Geschosse zu schleudern, die mit dumpfem Geräusch innerhalb des ersten Mauerrings der Stadt landeten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621525&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'935926b4-205a-4e3f-abc3-59063f5015e6\', \'multiverseId\': 621525}, \'multiverseid\': 621525}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de sitiadores\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Comandante de sitiadores entre al campo de batalla, crea tres fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\\n{1}{R}, sacrificar un Trasgo: El Comandante de sitiadores hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Comenzaron a lanzar proyectiles que pasaron justo por encima del destacamento y cayeron de un batacazo en el primer círculo de la ciudad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a80d6658-1526-464d-803d-9e3695681a13\', \'multiverseId\': 621712}, \'multiverseid\': 621712}, {\'name\': \'Commandant des assiégeants\', \'text\': "Quand le Commandant des assiégeants arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifiez un gobelin : Le Commandant des assiégeants inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': \'Ils commencèrent à tirer des projectiles qui passaient juste au-dessus des remparts et retombaient dans un bruit sourd dans le premier cercle de la cité.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6125df1b-fdd6-4475-828b-090017825209\', \'multiverseId\': 621899}, \'multiverseid\': 621899}, {\'name\': \'Capo della Squadra di Assedio\', \'text\': \'Quando il Capo della Squadra di Assedio entra nel campo di battaglia, crea tre pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifica un Goblin: Il Capo della Squadra di Assedio infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': "Cominciarono a lanciare i proiettili che superarono i parapetti e piombarono all\'interno della prima cerchia di mura della Città.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6029d6c-a262-4017-9aca-714e2338a3a1\', \'multiverseId\': 622086}, \'multiverseid\': 622086}, {\'name\': \'包囲攻撃の司令官\', \'text\': \'包囲攻撃の司令官が戦場に出たとき、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\\n{1}{R}, ゴブリン１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。包囲攻撃の司令官はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは大石を放ち始めた。それは胸壁のすぐ上を越えて、第一環状区にズシンと落ちた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdacaf49-0e1d-44a9-8816-e83e05eb7221\', \'multiverseId\': 622273}, \'multiverseid\': 622273}, {\'name\': \'Comandante do Grupo de Cerco\', \'text\': \'Quando Comandante do Grupo de Cerco entrar no campo de batalha, crie três fichas de criatura Goblin vermelha 1/1.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifique um Goblin: Comandante do Grupo de Cerco causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Eles começaram a disparar projéteis que passaram logo acima das ameias e caíram no primeiro círculo da cidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09e2fc87-6f0f-42fb-92eb-af80912935e0\', \'multiverseId\': 622460}, \'multiverseid\': 622460}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beregond, Mitglied der Wache\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Beregond, Mitglied der Wache, oder ein anderer Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Beregond, achte darauf, so gut du es vermagst, dass nichts Schreckliches geschieht."\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620359&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d967bc05-45ce-4423-9a3d-c64aa188d72b\', \'multiverseId\': 620359}, \'multiverseid\': 620359}, {\'name\': \'Beregond de la Garde\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Beregond de la Garde ou un autre humain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Beregond, si vous le pouvez, faites quelque chose pour empêcher un drame. »\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac03515-391f-4f9c-8a4f-1bda6c1c626c\', \'multiverseId\': 620427}, \'multiverseid\': 620427}, {\'name\': \'近衛隊のベレゴンド\', \'text\': \'近衛隊のベレゴンドやこれでない人間１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ベレゴンドどの、もしできるなら、何か恐ろしいことが起こらぬよう手を尽くしてください。」\\n――ピピン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d10be1be-c254-43ef-b1ad-b5571f359f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 620495}, \'multiverseid\': 620495}, {\'name\': \'卫士贝瑞刚德\', \'text\': \'每当卫士贝瑞刚德或另一个人类在你操控下进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「贝瑞刚德，你要是有能耐就快作些什么，让恐怖的事情都不要发生。」\\n～皮平\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a71572-856d-4d0c-ac80-80d397b42abe\', \'multiverseId\': 620563}, \'multiverseid\': 620563}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beregond, Mitglied der Wache\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Beregond, Mitglied der Wache, oder ein anderer Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Beregond, achte darauf, so gut du es vermagst, dass nichts Schreckliches geschieht."\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620767&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f985e98-6686-4c47-ba95-5ff542ab094d\', \'multiverseId\': 620767}, \'multiverseid\': 620767}, {\'name\': \'Beregond de la guardia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Beregond de la guardia u otro Humano entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si puedes, Beregond, haz algo para impedir que sucedan cosas horribles".\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dc93d96-38ed-4ded-afa8-2180492cade1\', \'multiverseId\': 620839}, \'multiverseid\': 620839}, {\'name\': \'Beregond de la Garde\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Beregond de la Garde ou un autre humain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Beregond, si vous le pouvez, faites quelque chose pour empêcher un drame. »\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a8c583f-e217-466b-9ccf-437005828724\', \'multiverseId\': 620911}, \'multiverseid\': 620911}, {\'name\': \'Beregond delle Guardie\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Beregond delle Guardie o un altro Umano entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Beregond, se puoi, fai qualcosa per impedire che accada qualcosa di terribile."\\n—Pipino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7e7a2ad-ac5b-4c68-a141-39d2de151f71\', \'multiverseId\': 620983}, \'multiverseid\': 620983}, {\'name\': \'近衛隊のベレゴンド\', \'text\': \'近衛隊のベレゴンドやこれでない人間１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ベレゴンドどの、もしできるなら、何か恐ろしいことが起こらぬよう手を尽くしてください。」\\n――ピピン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eecf1b65-08ea-426a-a814-5001f8aa32d9\', \'multiverseId\': 621055}, \'multiverseid\': 621055}, {\'name\': \'Beregond da Guarda\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Beregond da Guarda ou outro Humano entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Beregond, se puder, faça alguma coisa para impedir que qualquer coisa terrível aconteça."\\n— Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65e2fbe0-9b39-4a99-964d-82d82163c220\', \'multiverseId\': 621127}, \'multiverseid\': 621127}, {\'name\': \'卫士贝瑞刚德\', \'text\': \'每当卫士贝瑞刚德或另一个人类在你操控下进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「贝瑞刚德，你要是有能耐就快作些什么，让恐怖的事情都不要发生。」\\n～皮平\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27d02ef0-b619-40c5-9979-6889e1142a3d\', \'multiverseId\': 621199}, \'multiverseid\': 621199}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschützerin der Bastion\', \'text\': \'Kommandeur-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und haben Unzerstörbarkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer kann jetzt die Furten halten, wenn der König der Neun Reiter kommt?"\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621459&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a58369b-8c02-40a2-9961-8756ba3cd13b\', \'multiverseId\': 621459}, \'multiverseid\': 621459}, {\'name\': \'Protectora del bastión\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas comandante que controlas obtienen +2/+2 y tienen la habilidad de indestructible.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Ahora quién podrá defender los vados cuando llegue el Rey de los Nueve Jinetes?".\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d377aaf8-a7da-4f1e-becc-459169ffa674\', \'multiverseId\': 621646}, \'multiverseid\': 621646}, {\'name\': \'Protectrice du bastion\', \'text\': "Les créatures Commandant que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et ont l\'indestructible.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Qui pourra tenir les gués maintenant que le roi des neuf cavaliers arrive ? »\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621833&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66eb8e6c-f204-4870-9a74-49d38cbef2c0\', \'multiverseId\': 621833}, \'multiverseid\': 621833}, {\'name\': \'Protettrice del Baluardo\', \'text\': \'Le creature comandante che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno indistruttibile.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi potrebbe ora difendere i guadi assaliti dal Re dei Nove Cavalieri?"\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'835326d2-b7b5-47d6-94df-032dcc199761\', \'multiverseId\': 622020}, \'multiverseid\': 622020}, {\'name\': \'拠点の守備兵\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて統率者であるすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け破壊不能を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「九人組の乗り手の王が来たのなら、誰が浅瀬を守り切れるだろう？」\\n――フロド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a39f3a-208b-43b7-a845-31f526d47489\', \'multiverseId\': 622207}, \'multiverseid\': 622207}, {\'name\': \'Protetora do Bastião\', \'text\': \'As criaturas comandantes que você controla recebem +2/+2 e têm indestrutível.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"E agora quem poderá defender os vaus quando o Rei dos Nove Cavaleiros vier?"\\n— Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cd4abe1-e1e8-4823-ae64-431de4830000\', \'multiverseId\': 622394}, \'multiverseid\': 622394}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beutesammler in Moria\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung, Eile\\n{T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte. Falls die abgeworfene Karte eine Kreaturenkarte war, wende Ork-Aufmarsch 1 an. (Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Ork. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Ork-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620821&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9333213a-1260-40f9-a1ec-7e796f8c53b8\', \'multiverseId\': 620821}, \'multiverseid\': 620821}, {\'name\': \'Carroñero de Moria\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal, prisa.\\n{T}, descartar una carta: Roba una carta. Si la carta descartada era una carta de criatura, enrola 1 Orco. (Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. También es un Orco. Si no controlas un Ejército, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Orco negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbed1f80-43dd-46ed-90fa-d4c1a22a0753\', \'multiverseId\': 620893}, \'multiverseid\': 620893}, {\'name\': \'Charognard de la Moria\', \'text\': "Contact mortel, célérité\\n{T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Piochez une carte. Si la carte défaussée était une carte de créature, amassez des orques 1. (Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un orque. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Orque et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620965&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da1d23bc-1a45-42de-a13d-ba85e992ee43\', \'multiverseId\': 620965}, \'multiverseid\': 620965}, {\'name\': \'Predone di Moria\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale, rapidità\\n{T}, Scarta una carta: Pesca una carta. Se la carta scartata era una carta creatura, recluta Orchi 1. (Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. È anche un Orco. Se non controlli un Esercito, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Orco 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd49a276-61f3-4efd-b534-c27c3fdca1d0\', \'multiverseId\': 621037}, \'multiverseid\': 621037}, {\'name\': \'モリアの死体あさり\', \'text\': \'接死、速攻\\n{T}, カード１枚を捨てる：カード１枚を引く。その捨てられたカードがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、オーク動員１を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。それはオークでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のオーク・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af6019ee-2266-4637-b167-1960ff6aba17\', \'multiverseId\': 621109}, \'multiverseid\': 621109}, {\'name\': \'Carniceiro de Moria\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero, ímpeto\\n{T}, descarte um card: Compre um card. Se o card descartado era um card de criatura, arregimente Orcs 1. (Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Ele também é um Orc. Se você não controlar um Exército, crie antes uma ficha de criatura Orc Exército preta 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Orc Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9edfdcb8-9e02-4fd6-a2bc-fa0b7155ecf9\', \'multiverseId\': 621181}, \'multiverseid\': 621181}, {\'name\': \'墨瑞亚拾荒客\', \'text\': \'死触，敏捷\\n{T}，弃一张牌：抓一张牌。如果所弃之牌是生物牌，则囤兵半兽人1。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它也是半兽人。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色半兽人／军队衍生生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半兽人／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e07941-50a7-403c-8519-0e4c85234fc6\', \'multiverseId\': 621253}, \'multiverseid\': 621253}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beutesammler in Moria\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung, Eile\\n{T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte. Falls die abgeworfene Karte eine Kreaturenkarte war, wende Ork-Aufmarsch 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620411&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abdfe8db-1aba-4d36-8bf4-1ca1b30146ec\', \'multiverseId\': 620411}, \'multiverseid\': 620411}, {\'name\': \'Charognard de la Moria\', \'text\': "Contact mortel, célérité\\n{T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Piochez une carte. Si la carte défaussée était une carte de créature, amassez des orques 1.", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620479&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6c840b9-0437-4b07-a81a-12b6c5a01a4b\', \'multiverseId\': 620479}, \'multiverseid\': 620479}, {\'name\': \'モリアの死体あさり\', \'text\': \'接死、速攻\\n{T}, カード１枚を捨てる：カード１枚を引く。その捨てられたカードがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、オーク動員１を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'154cf168-a65c-4c4a-8918-a66ea8a129dc\', \'multiverseId\': 620547}, \'multiverseid\': 620547}, {\'name\': \'墨瑞亚拾荒客\', \'text\': \'死触，敏捷\\n{T}，弃一张牌：抓一张牌。如果所弃之牌是生物牌，则囤兵半兽人1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半兽人／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22e9e594-e063-4a61-97e9-c49dad2482a8\', \'multiverseId\': 620615}, \'multiverseid\': 620615}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bilbo das Geburtstagskind\', \'text\': \'Falls du Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten würdest, erhältst du stattdessen so viele Lebenspunkte plus 1 dazu.\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, schicke Bilbo das Geburtstagskind ins Exil: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du 111 oder mehr Lebenspunkte hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620397&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d325f87-a215-488f-af9d-85b02a3f6bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 620397}, \'multiverseid\': 620397}, {\'name\': "Bilbo, célébrant de l\'anniversaire", \'text\': "Si vous deviez gagner des points de vie, vous gagnez ce nombre de points de vie plus 1 à la place.\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, exilez Bilbo, célébrant de l\'anniversaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez. N\'activez que si vous avez au moins 111 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce7a3ad7-4c27-4f5d-becf-2578b4774622\', \'multiverseId\': 620465}, \'multiverseid\': 620465}, {\'name\': \'誕生日の主賓、ビルボ\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るなら、代わりにあなたはその点数に１を足した点数のライフを得る。\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, 誕生日の主賓、ビルボを追放する：あなたのライブラリーから望む数のクリーチャー・カードを探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。あなたのライフが111点以上でなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e38d36f5-8cc8-4f7c-8647-7cdf9e774cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 620533}, \'multiverseid\': 620533}, {\'name\': \'寿星比尔博\', \'text\': \'如果你将获得生命，则改为你获得原数量加1点生命。\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}，{T}，放逐寿星比尔博：从你的牌库中搜寻任意数量的生物牌，将它们放进战场，然后洗牌。只能于你的总生命为111或更多时起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7df6d02-6542-41fc-9945-b316d973a85e\', \'multiverseId\': 620601}, \'multiverseid\': 620601}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bilbo das Geburtstagskind\', \'text\': \'Falls du Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten würdest, erhältst du stattdessen so viele Lebenspunkte plus 1 dazu.\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, schicke Bilbo das Geburtstagskind ins Exil: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du 111 oder mehr Lebenspunkte hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620806&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e814b3d1-1184-4a01-a25c-8b09f992be5c\', \'multiverseId\': 620806}, \'multiverseid\': 620806}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, cumpleañero\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a ganar vidas, en vez de eso, ganas esa misma cantidad de vidas más 1.\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, exiliar a Bilbo, cumpleañero: Busca en tu biblioteca cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura, ponlas en el campo de batalla y luego baraja. Activa esto solo si tienes 111 o más vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d019f88-5b4d-4bcb-87b4-077d111b3ec7\', \'multiverseId\': 620878}, \'multiverseid\': 620878}, {\'name\': "Bilbo, célébrant de l\'anniversaire", \'text\': "Si vous deviez gagner des points de vie, vous gagnez ce nombre de points de vie plus 1 à la place.\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, exilez Bilbo, célébrant de l\'anniversaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez. N\'activez que si vous avez au moins 111 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620950&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'233cda0c-0f10-4b5b-9391-70f45aa4783f\', \'multiverseId\': 620950}, \'multiverseid\': 620950}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, Festeggiato del Compleanno\', \'text\': \'Se stai per guadagnare punti vita, ne guadagni invece altrettanti più 1.\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, Esilia Bilbo, Festeggiato del Compleanno: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura, mettile sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola. Attiva solo se hai 111 o più punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f058456-bf6b-476d-be21-656e9467c849\', \'multiverseId\': 621022}, \'multiverseid\': 621022}, {\'name\': \'誕生日の主賓、ビルボ\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るなら、代わりにあなたはその点数に１を足した点数のライフを得る。\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, 誕生日の主賓、ビルボを追放する：あなたのライブラリーから望む数のクリーチャー・カードを探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。あなたのライフが111点以上でなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c655d13-8dc7-450e-a179-f66099e1de59\', \'multiverseId\': 621094}, \'multiverseid\': 621094}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, Aniversariante\', \'text\': \'Se você ganharia pontos de vida, em vez disso, você ganha aquela quantidade de pontos de vida mais 1.\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}, {T}, exile Bilbo, Aniversariante: Procure em seu grimório qualquer número de cards de criatura, coloque-os no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe. Ative somente se você tiver 111 ou mais pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be7bb18c-b757-4972-bd94-5e218abc2b19\', \'multiverseId\': 621166}, \'multiverseid\': 621166}, {\'name\': \'生日寿星比尔博\', \'text\': \'如果你将获得生命，则改为你获得原数量加1点生命。\\n{2}{W}{B}{G}，{T}，放逐生日寿星比尔博：从你的牌库中搜寻任意数量的生物牌，将它们放进战场，然后洗牌。只能于你的总生命为111或更多时起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faadcabf-347b-41cf-8b67-7c2c1198cd71\', \'multiverseId\': 621238}, \'multiverseid\': 621238}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasphemische Tat\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur im Spiel {1} weniger.\\nDie Blasphemische Tat fügt jeder Kreatur 13 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Und dann gibt es natürlich einige Dinge, auf deren Seite ich überhaupt nicht stehe: diese burárum — diese Orks und ihre Herren."\\n—Baumbart\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291cb31b-f7f7-4c04-be06-ed3fa83576ab\', \'multiverseId\': 621508}, \'multiverseid\': 621508}, {\'name\': \'Acto blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura en el campo de batalla.\\nEl Acto blasfemo hace 13 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Y hay cosas de cuya parte no podría estar: estos burárum, estos orcos y sus amos".\\n—Bárbol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e24bc399-a17b-42aa-9737-a3f655331132\', \'multiverseId\': 621695}, \'multiverseid\': 621695}, {\'name\': \'Acte blasphématoire\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature sur le champ de bataille.\\nL\'Acte blasphématoire inflige 13 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Et il y a certaines choses, bien sûr, du côté desquelles je ne suis pas du tout : ces burárum, ces orques, et leurs maîtres. »\\n—Sylvebarbe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e6c9a7-52ee-4680-b99a-5e49573f5246\', \'multiverseId\': 621882}, \'multiverseid\': 621882}, {\'name\': \'Atto Blasfemo\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura sul campo di battaglia.\\nL\'Atto Blasfemo infligge 13 danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sono però, beninteso, casi in cui io sono del tutto dalla parte opposta: questi... burárum... questi Orchi e i loro padroni."\\n—Barbalbero\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87bae3d9-d008-4538-ac77-57d6c5503cc6\', \'multiverseId\': 622069}, \'multiverseid\': 622069}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の行動\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n冒涜の行動は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ13点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「それからいうまでもなく、わしが、絶対にそちら側にはつかぬやつらがおる。あのブラールム――あのオークども、そしてあいつらの主人どもじゃ。」\\n――木の鬚\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2091261b-530c-4163-9b8c-407b1a71772c\', \'multiverseId\': 622256}, \'multiverseid\': 622256}, {\'name\': \'Ato Blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada criatura no campo de batalha.\\nAto Blasfemo causa 13 pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"E há algumas coisas, é claro, do lado das quais eu não estou de forma alguma: esses burárum — esses orcs e os mestres deles."\\n— Barbárvore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b16c02a0-3310-4680-9556-f247458cc174\', \'multiverseId\': 622443}, \'multiverseid\': 622443}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutroter Bund\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie haben versucht, dein Herz mit einem Morgulmesser zu durchbohren, das in der Wunde verbleibt. Wäre es ihnen gelungen, so wärst du geworden wie sie, nur schwächer und unter ihrem Befehl."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621505&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee96aac-0ba3-4484-ad1d-d2a082d24835\', \'multiverseId\': 621505}, \'multiverseid\': 621505}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo sangriento\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, el oponente objetivo pierde esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Trataban de atravesarte el corazón con un puñal de Morgul, que permanece en la herida. Si lo hubiesen conseguido, ahora serías como ellos, aunque más débil y te tendrían sometido".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'114a76a7-fd69-4282-9bc8-998b55423370\', \'multiverseId\': 621692}, \'multiverseid\': 621692}, {\'name\': \'Lien sanguin\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, un adversaire ciblé perd autant de points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Ils ont essayé de vous percer le cœur avec une lame de Morgul, qui reste dans la blessure. S\'ils avaient réussi, vous seriez devenu comme eux, mais plus faible et à leurs ordres. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621879&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252e1348-77f3-48b3-9d1b-df971dd75ab0\', \'multiverseId\': 621879}, \'multiverseid\': 621879}, {\'name\': \'Legame Sanguigno\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, un avversario bersaglio perde altrettanti punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tentavano di far penetrare nel tuo cuore un pugnale Morgul che rimane nella ferita. Se ci fossero riusciti, saresti diventato come loro, ma più debole e sottomesso alla loro autorità."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3bfbb6d-18b6-4453-ac00-0909a045625f\', \'multiverseId\': 622066}, \'multiverseid\': 622066}, {\'name\': \'血なまぐさい結合\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはその点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「やつらはモルグルの刃でおまえの心臓を貫こうとしたのじゃ。その破片が傷に残っておった。もし成功しておれば、おまえはやつらの同類になっておったじゃろう。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4dc472e-a2f9-4547-be79-4b8376d372c4\', \'multiverseId\': 622253}, \'multiverseid\': 622253}, {\'name\': \'Pacto de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, o oponente alvo perde uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles tentaram perfurar seu coração com um Punhal de Morgul, que continua na ferida. Se tivessem conseguido, você teria se tornado como eles, apenas mais fraco e sob o comando deles."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb98cb9-cb58-4c7b-802f-12cccec9e7be\', \'multiverseId\': 622440}, \'multiverseid\': 622440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Panorama\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.)\\nDas Blätterdach-Panorama kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Das Auenland hatte selten einen so schönen Sommer oder einen so reichhaltigen Herbst erlebt; die Bäume waren mit Äpfeln beladen, aus den Waben tropfte der Honig, und der Mais war hoch und voll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621595&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ec0a7c4-3395-4913-83f3-1a4baffbd6f8\', \'multiverseId\': 621595}, \'multiverseid\': 621595}, {\'name\': \'Panorámica de la enramada\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.)\\nLa Panorámica de la enramada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque llanura\', \'flavor\': \'Rara vez se había visto en la Comarca un verano tan bello y un otoño más fértil: los árboles estaban cargados de manzanas, la miel rezumaba de los paneles y el grano era alto y cuantioso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26233415-12bd-433b-9259-40d602240591\', \'multiverseId\': 621782}, \'multiverseid\': 621782}, {\'name\': \'Vue de la canopée\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.)\\nLa Vue de la canopée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt et plaine\', \'flavor\': "La Comté avait rarement connu un été si radieux ou un automne si riche ; les arbres étaient chargés de pommes, le miel s\'écoulait des ruches, et le maïs se dressait en abondance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621969&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'524ae8fa-d52d-4b4a-a7da-60080d467604\', \'multiverseId\': 621969}, \'multiverseid\': 621969}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Fronde\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.)\\nIl Panorama di Fronde entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Pianura\', \'flavor\': "Raramente si era avuta nella Contea un\'estate così splendida e un autunno tanto generoso: gli alberi erano sovraccarichi di mele, il grano era alto e fitto, e il miele gocciolava dagli alveari.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7aa2113-4be6-49bb-8ce7-609e3ea2d394\', \'multiverseId\': 622156}, \'multiverseid\': 622156}, {\'name\': \'梢の眺望\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、梢の眺望はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・平地\', \'flavor\': \'これほど天気に恵まれた夏や、実り豊かな秋は、ホビット庄でも滅多になかった。りんごは木々にたわわになり、蜂の巣からは蜜が滴り、穀物はすくすくと伸び豊かに実った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cea58ee-c928-4dda-9bed-62bdf80a089f\', \'multiverseId\': 622343}, \'multiverseid\': 622343}, {\'name\': \'Vista do Dossel\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.)\\nVista do Dossel entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta Planície\', \'flavor\': \'Raramente o Condado vira verão tão belo, nem outono tão rico; as macieiras estavam carregadas, o mel pingava das colmeias e o trigo crescia alto e cheio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2704a1d2-3d33-4db1-a728-35d668ded920\', \'multiverseId\': 622530}, \'multiverseid\': 622530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boromir, Gondors Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Boromir, Gondors Hoffnung, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, schaue dir die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Mensch- oder Artefaktkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Weit bin ich auf vergessenen Straßen gereist, auf der Suche nach dem Haus von Elrond."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620398&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a5d646-043e-4519-b78a-e31702c61f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 620398}, \'multiverseid\': 620398}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, espoir du Gondor\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Boromir, espoir du Gondor arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, regardez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'humain ou d\'artefact parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai longtemps erré sur des routes oubliées, à la recherche de la maison d\'Elrond. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a92ead-5b57-46a8-b8dc-422fbd35b976\', \'multiverseId\': 620466}, \'multiverseid\': 620466}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの希望、ボロミア\', \'text\': \'ゴンドールの希望、ボロミアが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード６枚を見る。あなたは「その中から人間やアーティファクトであるカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「エルロンド殿の館を求めて、長い間、忘れ去られた道を彷徨ってきた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'126957e3-5551-43ab-8130-13f1387aeeab\', \'multiverseId\': 620534}, \'multiverseid\': 620534}, {\'name\': \'刚铎之望波洛米尔\', \'text\': \'每当刚铎之望波洛米尔进战场或攻击时，检视你牌库顶的六张牌。你可以展示其中一张人类或神器牌并置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我已在遭弃道路上徘徊良久，一路寻找埃尔隆德之家所在。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4bedde3-892e-4033-bdd3-38d2f03de538\', \'multiverseId\': 620602}, \'multiverseid\': 620602}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boromir, Gondors Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Boromir, Gondors Hoffnung, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, schaue dir die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Mensch- oder Artefaktkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Weit bin ich auf vergessenen Straßen gereist, auf der Suche nach dem Haus von Elrond."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620807&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b57ad59-b32e-4f32-b4d0-fa30c28ae1c9\', \'multiverseId\': 620807}, \'multiverseid\': 620807}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, esperanza de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Boromir, esperanza de Gondor entre al campo de batalla o ataque, mira las seis primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de Humano o de artefacto de entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Durante mucho tiempo vagué por caminos olvidados en busca de la casa de Elrond".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eadf8df-287e-485b-9cc6-71254c0e64b0\', \'multiverseId\': 620879}, \'multiverseid\': 620879}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, espoir du Gondor\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Boromir, espoir du Gondor arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, regardez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'humain ou d\'artefact parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai longtemps erré sur des routes oubliées, à la recherche de la maison d\'Elrond. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620951&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d5509c-5c74-41e4-9347-625eade7c3eb\', \'multiverseId\': 620951}, \'multiverseid\': 620951}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Speranza di Gondor\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Boromir, Speranza di Gondor entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, guarda le prime sei carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta Umano o artefatto scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"A lungo ho vagabondato per sentieri sconosciuti, in cerca della casa di Elrond."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'676c6981-5857-4542-9530-9c3c0791e756\', \'multiverseId\': 621023}, \'multiverseid\': 621023}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの希望、ボロミア\', \'text\': \'ゴンドールの希望、ボロミアが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード６枚を見る。あなたは「その中から人間やアーティファクトであるカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「エルロンド殿の館を求めて、長い間、忘れ去られた道を彷徨ってきた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae233be-0f87-4de5-9d47-0c1b895145d5\', \'multiverseId\': 621095}, \'multiverseid\': 621095}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Esperança de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Boromir, Esperança de Gondor, entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, olhe os seis cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de Humano ou de artefato dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Muito vaguei por estradas esquecidas, em busca da casa de Elrond."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'643ae05f-4fb3-483f-9b7f-656adabbe0f8\', \'multiverseId\': 621167}, \'multiverseid\': 621167}, {\'name\': \'刚铎之望波洛米尔\', \'text\': \'每当刚铎之望波洛米尔进战场或攻击时，检视你牌库顶的六张牌。你可以展示其中一张人类或神器牌并置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我已在遭弃道路上徘徊良久，一路寻找埃尔隆德之家所在。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f80b581-b32e-49da-bd01-a0045c65f2ec\', \'multiverseId\': 621239}, \'multiverseid\': 621239}]', "[{'name': 'Brosche des Wandersmanns', 'text': '{2}, {T}, opfere die Brosche des Wandersmanns: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Nicht alles, was glänzt, ist Gold,\\nnicht alle, die wandern, verirrt;\\nAltes, das stark ist, vergeht nicht,\\ndie Wurzeln vom Frost unberührt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621587&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd58529cb-2bc2-4172-90e1-1c1cb6c31b0c', 'multiverseId': 621587}, 'multiverseid': 621587}, {'name': 'Baratija del caminante', 'text': '{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Baratija del caminante: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'No todo lo que es oro reluce\\nni todos los errantes están perdidos.\\nEl viejo fuerte no se desluce;\\nno llega el frío a las raíces profundas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621774&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ef5c8a2-1b79-47ae-820f-8a7080086bd5', 'multiverseId': 621774}, 'multiverseid': 621774}, {'name': 'Babiole du voyageur', 'text': '{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Babiole du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Tout ce qui est or ne brille pas,\\nNe sont pas perdus tous ceux qui errent ;\\nLe doyen qui est fort ne dépérit pas,\\nLes racines profondes ne gèlent pas en hiver.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621961&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4963967a-a7fc-4f0c-aa59-7ae6aefdd52f', 'multiverseId': 621961}, 'multiverseid': 621961}, {'name': 'Ninnolo del Viaggiatore', 'text': '{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Ninnolo del Viaggiatore: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Non tutto quel che è oro brilla,\\nNé gli erranti si smarriscono;\\nIl vecchio che è forte non vacilla,\\nLe radici profonde non avvizziscono.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622148&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ccf29afb-27f2-456e-9bb8-c530a0e71998', 'multiverseId': 622148}, 'multiverseid': 622148}, {'name': '旅人のガラクタ', 'text': '{2}, {T}, 旅人のガラクタを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '黄金すべては輝かない\\n彷徨うすべては迷っていない\\n古くて強きは色褪せない\\n深き樹根は霜を知らない', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622335&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1aa889f7-4917-4b77-b4d5-3252de0b1fb7', 'multiverseId': 622335}, 'multiverseid': 622335}, {'name': 'Bijuteria do Viajante', 'text': '{2}, {T}, sacrifique Bijuteria do Viajante: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Nem tudo que é ouro rebrilha,\\nNem tudo que vaga se perde;\\nO antigo que é forte não mirra,\\nRaiz funda à geada não cede.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622522&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76e1209d-91ee-4b00-bbd2-6b2feebb318d', 'multiverseId': 622522}, 'multiverseid': 622522}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brunnen der verlorenen Träume\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {X} bezahlen, wobei X kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an dazuerhaltenen Lebenspunkten ist. Falls du dies tust, ziehe X Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Dies war Frodo und Sams eigenes Land, und jetzt erkannten sie, dass sie es mehr liebten als jeden anderen Ort auf der Welt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'251bb0a1-784f-44bc-81a0-9bbff2024a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 621588}, \'multiverseid\': 621588}, {\'name\': \'Pozo de los sueños perdidos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {X}, donde X es menor o igual a la cantidad de vidas que ganaste. Si lo haces, roba X cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Era la tierra de Frodo y Sam, y ahora sabían que no existía en el mundo un lugar más querido para ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6701bb7-a4bc-4a1d-839d-caf73c8b9592\', \'multiverseId\': 621775}, \'multiverseid\': 621775}, {\'name\': \'Puits des songes perdus\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {X}, X étant inférieur ou égal au nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez X cartes.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "C\'était le pays de Sam et Frodo, et ils découvraient maintenant qu\'ils y tenaient plus encore qu\'à tout autre endroit du monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621962&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dee5fbb1-ba59-4ae6-a4a1-42d186e4b516\', \'multiverseId\': 621962}, \'multiverseid\': 621962}, {\'name\': \'Pozzo dei Sogni Perduti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {X}, dove X è pari o inferiore ai punti vita guadagnati. Se lo fai, pesca X carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Questa era la terra di Frodo e di Sam, ed essi si accorsero ora di amarla più di qualunque altro posto al mondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c22eafa0-b94e-46a9-b841-ec9c5fd9f4d8\', \'multiverseId\': 622149}, \'multiverseid\': 622149}, {\'name\': \'失われし夢の井戸\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。Ｘはそのあなたが得たライフの点数以下の値である。そうしたなら、カードＸ枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ここはフロドとサムの故郷だった。そして二人は自分たちが世界中のほかのどこよりも、ここを気にかけていることを今改めて悟ったのだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4658a40d-f11c-4493-91b5-ce6272a6d1a2\', \'multiverseId\': 622336}, \'multiverseid\': 622336}, {\'name\': \'Poço dos Sonhos Perdidos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que ganha pontos de vida, você pode pagar {X}, sendo X igual ou inferior à quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou. Se fizer isso, compre X cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Aquele era o próprio país de Frodo e Sam, e eles descobriam agora que se importavam mais com ele do que com qualquer outro lugar no mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2dca50d-7313-42ea-a616-b70bb36bb0bd\', \'multiverseId\': 622523}, \'multiverseid\': 622523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Gandalfs Ruhm im Auenland gründete sich hauptsächlich auf sein Geschick mit Feuer, Rauch und Licht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621572&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76326746-fb09-4c4b-a518-6c2f99277aa2\', \'multiverseId\': 621572}, \'multiverseid\': 621572}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Gandalf era conocido en la Comarca por su habilidad manejando fuegos, humos y luces.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a77a74fb-4a32-443e-a4e1-9c3635ec212d\', \'multiverseId\': 621759}, \'multiverseid\': 621759}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Dans la Comté, la renommée de Gandalf était surtout due à son talent pour les feux d\'artifices, la pipe et les lumières.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c99a75-5002-4d04-9f6b-6b4955d9c6b8\', \'multiverseId\': 621946}, \'multiverseid\': 621946}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La fama di Gandalf nella Contea era dovuta soprattutto alla sua abilità nel maneggiare fuochi, fumi e luci.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e9cb77a-9280-4aaa-9d2f-948042acaf53\', \'multiverseId\': 622133}, \'multiverseid\': 622133}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ホビット庄におけるガンダルフの名声は、主に火、煙、光を使いこなす技の巧みさによるものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8621377b-aa1c-4eef-974f-2792176fa5cb\', \'multiverseId\': 622320}, \'multiverseid\': 622320}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'A fama de Gandalf no Condado se devia principalmente a sua habilidade com fogo, fumaça e luzes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d6a5b06-3abd-4cc7-a048-6e8cf6c952c5\', \'multiverseId\': 622507}, \'multiverseid\': 622507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Círdan der Schiffbauer\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nGeheimes Konzil — Immer wenn Círdan der Schiffbauer ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, stimmt jeder Spieler geheim für einen Spieler, dann werden die Stimmen offenbart. Jeder Spieler zieht für jede Stimme, die auf ihn entfallen ist, eine Karte. Jeder Spieler, auf den keine Stimme entfallen ist, kann eine bleibende Karte aus seiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620399&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a05b6f-0040-44f6-a137-f3f52f1f98d6\', \'multiverseId\': 620399}, \'multiverseid\': 620399}, {\'name\': \'Círdan le charpentier de navires\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nConseil secret — À chaque fois que Círdan le charpentier de navires arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, chaque joueur vote secrètement pour un joueur, puis ces votes sont révélés. Chaque joueur pioche une carte pour chaque vote qu\'il a reçu. Chaque joueur qui n\'a reçu aucun vote peut mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent de sa main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a40fd6e7-91dc-4606-b362-07970d6b895d\', \'multiverseId\': 620467}, \'multiverseid\': 620467}, {\'name\': \'船大工キールダン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n秘密会議 — 船大工キールダンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーは秘密裏にプレイヤー１人に投票する。その後、それらの投票を公開する。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分が得た１票につき１枚のカードを引く。投票されなかった各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb266e9-6f5e-4ed6-b318-22f302a17427\', \'multiverseId\': 620535}, \'multiverseid\': 620535}, {\'name\': \'造船者奇尔丹\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n密议～每当造船者奇尔丹进战场或攻击时，每位牌手各私下投票选择一位牌手，然后展示投票结果。对每位牌手而言，其每得一票，便抓一张牌。对每位未得票的牌手而言，其可以将一张永久物牌从其手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9e844f3-74b7-4353-9236-b8d19492b161\', \'multiverseId\': 620603}, \'multiverseid\': 620603}]', '[{\'name\': \'Círdan der Schiffbauer\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nGeheimes Konzil — Immer wenn Círdan der Schiffbauer ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, stimmt jeder Spieler geheim für einen Spieler, dann werden die Stimmen offenbart. Jeder Spieler zieht für jede Stimme, die auf ihn entfallen ist, eine Karte. Jeder Spieler, auf den keine Stimme entfallen ist, kann eine bleibende Karte aus seiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620808&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b8dc85c-bec1-4399-bf5d-13707ba181e7\', \'multiverseId\': 620808}, \'multiverseid\': 620808}, {\'name\': \'Círdan, el carpintero de barcos\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nConcilio secreto — Siempre que Círdan, el carpintero de barcos entre al campo de batalla o ataque, cada jugador vota en secreto por un jugador y luego se dan a conocer los votos. Cada jugador roba una carta por cada voto que recibió. Cada jugador que no recibió ningún voto puede poner en el campo de batalla una carta de permanente de su mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de4d0c3e-aa98-4a5d-98e9-baad77b84704\', \'multiverseId\': 620880}, \'multiverseid\': 620880}, {\'name\': \'Círdan le charpentier de navires\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nConseil secret — À chaque fois que Círdan le charpentier de navires arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, chaque joueur vote secrètement pour un joueur, puis ces votes sont révélés. Chaque joueur pioche une carte pour chaque vote qu\'il a reçu. Chaque joueur qui n\'a reçu aucun vote peut mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent de sa main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620952&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40726b42-e8fa-42c7-8760-e3cffe81edf0\', \'multiverseId\': 620952}, \'multiverseid\': 620952}, {\'name\': \'Círdan il Timoniere\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nConsiglio segreto — Ogniqualvolta Círdan il Timoniere entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, ogni giocatore vota segretamente per un giocatore, poi quei voti vengono rivelati. Ogni giocatore pesca una carta per ogni voto che ha ricevuto. Ogni giocatore che non ha ricevuto voti può mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente dalla propria mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cffc5c5-eb48-47e4-b103-766e9b7ead50\', \'multiverseId\': 621024}, \'multiverseid\': 621024}, {\'name\': \'船大工キールダン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n秘密会議 — 船大工キールダンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーは秘密裏にプレイヤー１人に投票する。その後、それらの投票を公開する。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分が得た１票につき１枚のカードを引く。投票されなかった各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c80163-665d-46ff-a8fa-c722bf76ba2e\', \'multiverseId\': 621096}, \'multiverseid\': 621096}, {\'name\': \'Círdan, o Armador\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nConselho secreto — Toda vez que Círdan, o Armador, entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, cada jogador vota secretamente em um jogador e depois esses votos são revelados. Cada jogador compra um card para cada voto que tenha recebido. Cada jogador que não recebeu nenhum voto pode colocar um card de permanente da própria mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2bca292-f436-4537-a6ad-5a3f6c93abbe\', \'multiverseId\': 621168}, \'multiverseid\': 621168}, {\'name\': \'造船者奇尔丹\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n密议～每当造船者奇尔丹进战场或攻击时，每位牌手各私下投票选择一位牌手，然后展示投票结果。对每位牌手而言，其每得一票，便抓一张牌。对每位未得票的牌手而言，其可以将一张永久物牌从其手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86ff5729-ed74-4806-842a-552adfbefd66\', \'multiverseId\': 621240}, \'multiverseid\': 621240}]', "[{'name': 'Das Schwarze Tor', 'text': 'Sowie Das Schwarze Tor ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 3 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt es getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Bestimme einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten. Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug von Kreaturen, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Legendäres Land — Tor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620426&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '139a0a4a-1311-46d4-bcb8-f07d62ab89fb', 'multiverseId': 620426}, 'multiverseid': 620426}, {'name': 'La Porte Noire', 'text': 'Au moment où La Porte Noire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 3 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, elle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Choisissez un joueur qui a le total de points de vie le plus élevé ou qui partage le total de points de vie le plus élevé. Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée par les créatures que ce joueur contrôle ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain légendaire : porte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620494&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b7e8752-cfb5-4837-8c35-f7b37678d449', 'multiverseId': 620494}, 'multiverseid': 620494}, {'name': '黒門', 'text': '黒門が戦場に出るに際し、あなたは３点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{1}{B}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤー１人を選ぶ。このターン、そのクリーチャーはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャーにはブロックされない。', 'type': '伝説の土地 — 門', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620562&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57face10-0ec3-4085-ad38-d925d9dd6a48', 'multiverseId': 620562}, 'multiverseid': 620562}, {'name': '黑门', 'text': '于黑门进战场时，你可以支付3点生命。如果你未如此作，则它须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}。\\n{1}{B}，{T}：选择一位总生命最高或与他者同为最高的牌手。目标生物本回合不能被由该牌手操控的生物阻挡。', 'type': '传奇地 ～门', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620630&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e60a46a5-8a8e-4b48-8bad-d751ec0e8bfb', 'multiverseId': 620630}, 'multiverseid': 620630}]", "[{'name': 'Das Schwarze Tor', 'text': 'Sowie Das Schwarze Tor ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 3 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt es getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Bestimme einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten. Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug von Kreaturen, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Legendäres Land — Tor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620838&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0ddbaeb-9795-426a-84ee-d525503c038d', 'multiverseId': 620838}, 'multiverseid': 620838}, {'name': 'La Puerta Negra', 'text': 'En cuanto La Puerta Negra entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 3 vidas. Si no lo haces, entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Elige un jugador con la mayor cantidad de vidas o empatado con la mayor cantidad de vidas. La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas que controla ese jugador este turno.', 'type': 'Tierra legendaria — Portal', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620910&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee0231b8-1647-4035-93c7-aa35051bd0b5', 'multiverseId': 620910}, 'multiverseid': 620910}, {'name': 'La Porte Noire', 'text': 'Au moment où La Porte Noire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 3 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, elle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Choisissez un joueur qui a le total de points de vie le plus élevé ou qui partage le total de points de vie le plus élevé. Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée par les créatures que ce joueur contrôle ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain légendaire : porte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620982&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1994896-4237-470d-ab24-79a35cc3961b', 'multiverseId': 620982}, 'multiverseid': 620982}, {'name': 'Il Cancello Nero', 'text': 'Mentre Il Cancello Nero entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 3 punti vita. Se non lo fai, entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Scegli un giocatore con più punti vita o con più punti vita a pari merito con un altro giocatore. Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata dalle creature controllate da quel giocatore in questo turno.', 'type': 'Terra Leggendaria — Cancello', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621054&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4e56c4e-c8bc-46da-93ac-211ac5067af1', 'multiverseId': 621054}, 'multiverseid': 621054}, {'name': '黒門', 'text': '黒門が戦場に出るに際し、あなたは３点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、これはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{1}{B}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤー１人を選ぶ。このターン、そのクリーチャーはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャーにはブロックされない。', 'type': '伝説の土地 — 門', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621126&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be0436d0-7bca-4a1a-8ea8-83196cbf6a75', 'multiverseId': 621126}, 'multiverseid': 621126}, {'name': 'O Portão Negro', 'text': 'Conforme O Portão Negro entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 3 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, ele entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Escolha um jogador com mais pontos de vida ou empatado em mais pontos de vida. Neste turno, a criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas que aquele jogador controla.', 'type': 'Terreno Lendário — Portão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621198&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fb28362-4a29-4940-b04a-2d0f12a7747b', 'multiverseId': 621198}, 'multiverseid': 621198}, {'name': '黑门', 'text': '于黑门进战场时，你可以支付3点生命。如果你未如此作，则它须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}。\\n{1}{B}，{T}：选择一位总生命最高或与他者同为最高的牌手。目标生物本回合不能被由该牌手操控的生物阻挡。', 'type': '传奇地 ～门', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621270&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1ccd3b2-4b6f-4ea1-b386-9ad85ca30bfb', 'multiverseId': 621270}, 'multiverseid': 621270}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dekret des Schmerzes\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden. Ziehe für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise zerstört wurde, eine Karte.\\nUmwandlung {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Dekret des Schmerzes umwandelst, erhalten alle Kreaturen -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20a8e872-b1d1-4e44-94b2-b13e50a3d2aa\', \'multiverseId\': 621496}, \'multiverseid\': 621496}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de dolor\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. No pueden ser regeneradas. Roba una carta por cada criatura destruida de esta manera.\\nCiclo {3}{B}{B}. ({3}{B}{B}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de dolor, todas las criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3ed42b-f323-4ecb-8722-3118b94559ba\', \'multiverseId\': 621683}, \'multiverseid\': 621683}, {\'name\': \'Décret de souffrance\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures. Elles ne peuvent pas être régénérées. Piochez une carte pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.\\nRecyclage {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de souffrance, toutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ecb257-f86b-4bc9-a0a3-e0059f9b277c\', \'multiverseId\': 621870}, \'multiverseid\': 621870}, {\'name\': \'Decreto del Dolore\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature. Non possono essere rigenerate. Pesca una carta per ogni creatura distrutta in questo modo.\\nCiclo {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Decreto del Dolore, tutte le creature prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d085c729-ef68-44e8-b1f6-dedc2f13c50e\', \'multiverseId\': 622057}, \'multiverseid\': 622057}, {\'name\': \'苦痛の命令\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。それらは再生できない。これにより破壊されたクリーチャー１体につき１枚のカードを引く。\\nサイクリング {3}{B}{B} （{3}{B}{B}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたが苦痛の命令をサイクリングしたとき、ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2b08a21-772e-4ab5-99c5-a3b93f042ea3\', \'multiverseId\': 622244}, \'multiverseid\': 622244}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Dor\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Elas não podem ser regeneradas. Compre um card para cada criatura destruída desta forma.\\nReciclar {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você recicla Decreto de Dor, todas as criaturas recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f09d5163-71f7-451c-9077-2dee8153d168\', \'multiverseId\': 622431}, \'multiverseid\': 622431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demütige Überläuferin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe zwei Karten. Ein Gegner deiner Wahl übernimmt die Kontrolle über die Demütige Überläuferin. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Die wenigen Überlebenden wurden im Wald zusammengetrieben, und jene, die sich ergaben, wurden zur Grenze gebracht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621519&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e0632c-b274-4fd6-bb54-3f6c39c69a42\', \'multiverseId\': 621519}, \'multiverseid\': 621519}, {\'name\': \'Desertora humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba dos cartas. El oponente objetivo gana el control de la Desertora humilde. Activa esto solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los escasos supervivientes fueron cercados en los bosques y los que se rindieron fueron llevados a las fronteras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5251ce6-cb85-47be-abc6-caa20927cb31\', \'multiverseId\': 621706}, \'multiverseid\': 621706}, {\'name\': \'Humble défecteur\', \'text\': "{T} : Piochez deux cartes. Un adversaire ciblé acquiert le contrôle de l\'Humble défecteur. N\'activez que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Les quelques survivants furent rassemblés dans les bois et ceux qui s\'étaient rendus furent reconduits aux frontières.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621893&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11823813-d8b1-4ad1-a188-a146803b319a\', \'multiverseId\': 621893}, \'multiverseid\': 621893}, {\'name\': \'Disertrice Umile\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca due carte. Un avversario bersaglio prende il controllo della Disertrice Umile. Attiva solo durante il tuo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'I pochi superstiti furono circondati nei boschi e coloro che si arresero vennero condotti alla frontiera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0ad6bee-94b0-444b-a788-b8316f2a6c75\', \'multiverseId\': 622080}, \'multiverseid\': 622080}, {\'name\': \'謙虚な離反者\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。カード２枚を引く。そのプレイヤーは謙虚な離反者のコントロールを得る。あなたのターンにしか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'僅かに生き残った者たちも森の中で捕えられ、降伏した者は国境まで連行されていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91ee1c8e-af78-4671-8cab-28c8ee0d1d74\', \'multiverseId\': 622267}, \'multiverseid\': 622267}, {\'name\': \'Desertora Humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre dois cards. O oponente alvo ganha o controle de Desertora Humilde. Ative apenas durante seu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Os poucos sobreviventes foram encurralados na mata, e os que se renderam foram levados até a fronteira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'602616a4-d318-4298-a460-29413339007a\', \'multiverseId\': 622454}, \'multiverseid\': 622454}]', '[{\'name\': \'Denethor, Seher des Steins\', \'text\': \'Wenn Denethor, Seher des Steins, ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\n{3}{R}, {T}, opfere Denethor: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wird zum Monarchen. Denethor fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihr mögt auf dem Schlachtfeld kurzfristig Erfolge erzielen können. Aber gegen diese aufstrebende Macht kann es keinen Sieg geben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55966716-53e5-4e34-b95d-1c52052e85c7\', \'multiverseId\': 620369}, \'multiverseid\': 620369}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, voyant de la Pierre\', \'text\': "Quand Denethor, voyant de la Pierre arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2.\\n{3}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez Denethor : Un joueur ciblé devient le monarque. Denethor inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Vous pouvez triompher sur le terrain, pour une journée. Mais face à une telle puissance, aucune victoire n\'est possible. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620437&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cdb9fc5-5882-494d-9484-1b7f35a88a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 620437}, \'multiverseid\': 620437}, {\'name\': \'石の予見者、デネソール\', \'text\': \'石の予見者、デネソールが戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。\\n{3}{R}, {T}, 石の予見者、デネソールを生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人と、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。その前者が統治者になる。石の予見者、デネソールはその後者に３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「おぬしは戦場で一日は勝利を得るかも知れん。だが、今や勃興してきた、かの力に対して勝てはせぬぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'820aa4ad-b724-4cfb-9859-7d925878d63a\', \'multiverseId\': 620505}, \'multiverseid\': 620505}, {\'name\': \'阅石先知德内梭尔\', \'text\': \'当阅石先知德内梭尔进战场时，占卜2。\\n{3}{R}，{T}，牺牲德内梭尔：目标牌手成为君主。德内梭尔对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「也许你能在佩兰诺平野上小赢几仗，但要对抗这个如今已经崛起的力量，却是毫无胜算。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7628f0ab-e245-44a5-8de0-9a2feefefad0\', \'multiverseId\': 620573}, \'multiverseid\': 620573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Denethor, Seher des Steins\', \'text\': \'Wenn Denethor, Seher des Steins, ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\n{3}{R}, {T}, opfere Denethor: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wird zum Monarchen. Denethor fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihr mögt auf dem Schlachtfeld kurzfristig Erfolge erzielen können. Aber gegen diese aufstrebende Macht kann es keinen Sieg geben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620778&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba572c0-68a3-47ac-bb87-bc839af5ee06\', \'multiverseId\': 620778}, \'multiverseid\': 620778}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, contemplador de la piedra\', \'text\': \'Cuando Denethor, contemplador de la piedra entre al campo de batalla, adivina 2.\\n{3}{R}, {T}, sacrificar a Denethor: El jugador objetivo se convierte en el monarca. Denethor hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Quizá triunfes en el campo un día, mas contra el Poder que se despierta ahora no existe victoria alguna".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dffd645f-fb2a-4443-869a-4a592f34c044\', \'multiverseId\': 620850}, \'multiverseid\': 620850}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, voyant de la Pierre\', \'text\': "Quand Denethor, voyant de la Pierre arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2.\\n{3}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez Denethor : Un joueur ciblé devient le monarque. Denethor inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Vous pouvez triompher sur le terrain, pour une journée. Mais face à une telle puissance, aucune victoire n\'est possible. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620922&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'748c3f47-ad66-47f1-bfb6-038d422a7411\', \'multiverseId\': 620922}, \'multiverseid\': 620922}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, Veggente della Pietra\', \'text\': \'Quando Denethor, Veggente della Pietra entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 2.\\n{3}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica Denethor: Un giocatore bersaglio diventa il monarca. Denethor infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Forse trionferai sul campo, per un giorno. Ma contro il Potere che sta sorgendo non c\\\'è speranza di vittoria."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9580d4dc-66e4-4eee-a78c-4431bcb1f0b7\', \'multiverseId\': 620994}, \'multiverseid\': 620994}, {\'name\': \'石の予見者、デネソール\', \'text\': \'石の予見者、デネソールが戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。\\n{3}{R}, {T}, 石の予見者、デネソールを生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人と、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。その前者が統治者になる。石の予見者、デネソールはその後者に３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「おぬしは戦場で一日は勝利を得るかも知れん。だが、今や勃興してきた、かの力に対して勝てはせぬぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95ba6923-1e03-40d7-88d9-3b6033ecb248\', \'multiverseId\': 621066}, \'multiverseid\': 621066}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, Vidente da Pedra\', \'text\': \'Quando Denethor, Vidente da Pedra, entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 2.\\n{3}{R}, {T}, sacrifique Denethor: O jogador alvo se torna o monarca. Denethor causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"Você pode triunfar em campo, por um dia. Mas contra o Poder que agora se levanta não há vitória."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bb29ed-9678-4072-8adf-4e312d57770c\', \'multiverseId\': 621138}, \'multiverseid\': 621138}, {\'name\': \'阅石先知德内梭尔\', \'text\': \'当阅石先知德内梭尔进战场时，占卜2。\\n{3}{R}，{T}，牺牲德内梭尔：目标牌手成为君主。德内梭尔对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「也许你能在佩兰诺平野上小赢几仗，但要对抗这个如今已经崛起的力量，却是毫无胜算。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315691a7-17ed-4c05-a790-ab0a7c22c137\', \'multiverseId\': 621210}, \'multiverseid\': 621210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Balrog von Moria\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nWenn der Balrog von Moria stirbt, kannst du ihn ins Exil schicken. Wenn du dies tust, schicke für jeden Gegner bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil.\\nUmwandlung {3}{R} ({3}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Balrog von Moria umwandelst, erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620804&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5af86037-af20-4e6a-a904-70827bea3ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 620804}, \'multiverseid\': 620804}, {\'name\': \'El balrog de Moria\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, prisa.\\nCuando El balrog de Moria muera, puedes exiliarlo. Cuando lo hagas, por cada oponente, exilia hasta una criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador.\\nCiclo {3}{R}. ({3}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo de El balrog de Moria, crea dos fichas de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a408492-256e-425d-96f0-33533e13f3ce\', \'multiverseId\': 620876}, \'multiverseid\': 620876}, {\'name\': \'Le Balrog de la Moria\', \'text\': "Piétinement, célérité\\nQuand Le Balrog de la Moria meurt, vous pouvez l\'exiler. Quand vous faites ainsi, pour chaque adversaire, exilez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\\nRecyclage {3}{R} ({3}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez Le Balrog de la Moria, créez deux jetons Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620948&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e00e800d-c31a-4a01-83a0-f8d1b6d3860a\', \'multiverseId\': 620948}, \'multiverseid\': 620948}, {\'name\': \'Il Balrog di Moria\', \'text\': \'Travolgere, rapidità\\nQuando Il Balrog di Moria muore, puoi esiliarlo. Quando lo fai, per ogni avversario, esilia fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore.\\nCiclo {3}{R} ({3}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli Il Balrog di Moria, crea due pedine Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Demone Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a56adc6-7e36-48bb-adf3-70b7743881fd\', \'multiverseId\': 621020}, \'multiverseid\': 621020}, {\'name\': \'モリアのバルログ\', \'text\': \'トランプル、速攻\\nモリアのバルログが死亡したとき、あなたはこれを追放してもよい。そうしたとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それを追放する。\\nサイクリング{3}{R}（{3}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたがモリアのバルログをサイクリングしたとき、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a2d5ece-0bf5-49e9-909d-851992dd670a\', \'multiverseId\': 621092}, \'multiverseid\': 621092}, {\'name\': \'O Balrog de Moria\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, ímpeto\\nQuando O Balrog de Moria morre, você pode exilá-lo. Quando fizer isso, para cada oponente, exile até uma criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla.\\nReciclar {3}{R} ({3}{R}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você reciclar O Balrog de Moria, crie duas fichas de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Avatar Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57401ef7-56a0-4423-9ba6-c5bfa735a68a\', \'multiverseId\': 621164}, \'multiverseid\': 621164}, {\'name\': \'墨瑞亚炎魔\', \'text\': \'践踏，敏捷\\n当墨瑞亚炎魔死去时，你可以将它放逐。当你如此作时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～放逐至多一个目标由该牌手操控的生物。\\n循环{3}{R}（{3}{R}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环墨瑞亚炎魔时，派出两个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69e50ed1-8775-4f99-b23b-222c07117826\', \'multiverseId\': 621236}, \'multiverseid\': 621236}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Balrog von Moria\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nWenn der Balrog von Moria stirbt, kannst du ihn ins Exil schicken. Wenn du dies tust, schicke für jeden Gegner bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil.\\nUmwandlung {3}{R}\\nWenn du den Balrog von Moria umwandelst, erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620395&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90426bee-c7d0-4aa1-a7f9-bf9e85ef79fe\', \'multiverseId\': 620395}, \'multiverseid\': 620395}, {\'name\': \'Le Balrog de la Moria\', \'text\': "Piétinement, célérité\\nQuand Le Balrog de la Moria meurt, vous pouvez l\'exiler. Quand vous faites ainsi, pour chaque adversaire, exilez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\\nRecyclage {3}{R}\\nQuand vous recyclez Le Balrog de la Moria, créez deux jetons Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e154f43a-cf49-49e2-8e0f-6e50962b4811\', \'multiverseId\': 620463}, \'multiverseid\': 620463}, {\'name\': \'モリアのバルログ\', \'text\': \'トランプル、速攻\\nモリアのバルログが死亡したとき、あなたはこれを追放してもよい。そうしたとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それを追放する。\\nサイクリング{3}{R}\\nあなたがモリアのバルログをサイクリングしたとき、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a7d07da-6479-47e7-85a7-b38083a8c66e\', \'multiverseId\': 620531}, \'multiverseid\': 620531}, {\'name\': \'墨瑞亚炎魔\', \'text\': \'践踏，敏捷\\n当墨瑞亚炎魔死去时，你可以将它放逐。当你如此作时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～放逐至多一个目标由该牌手操控的生物。\\n循环{3}{R}\\n当你循环墨瑞亚炎魔时，派出两个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6ffa4c-5d74-4610-a89f-e0399307086e\', \'multiverseId\': 620599}, \'multiverseid\': 620599}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der alte Ohm\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'Was den Anbau von Gemüse und insbesondere Kartoffeln anging, war Hamfast Gamdschie in der gesamten Nachbarschaft als höchste Autorität anerkannt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620362&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f7e0398-861d-4733-b050-b912e6e91e5a\', \'multiverseId\': 620362}, \'multiverseid\': 620362}, {\'name\': "L\'Ancien", \'text\': \'Au début de chaque étape de fin, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et paysan\', \'flavor\': "En matière de légumes, et notamment de pommes de terre, maître Hamfast Gamegie faisait figure d\'autorité dans tout le voisinage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d34b45f3-fb05-49de-9d24-1c2c55c7d977\', \'multiverseId\': 620430}, \'multiverseid\': 620430}, {\'name\': \'とっつぁん\', \'text\': \'各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・農民\', \'flavor\': \'野菜の育て方、特にじゃがいもに関しては、ハムファスト・ギャムジー親方は近郷で自他ともに認める権威であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b331e89-e6e0-48f8-b909-2afbd1379197\', \'multiverseId\': 620498}, \'multiverseid\': 620498}, {\'name\': \'老头儿\', \'text\': \'在每个结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得过3点或更多生命，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／平民\', \'flavor\': \'在种植蔬菜方面～尤其是马铃薯这类～汉姆法斯特·甘姆吉师傅可是附近邻里公认的头号权威。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68759b8a-6e1d-41ff-9f32-2644d6c97bdc\', \'multiverseId\': 620566}, \'multiverseid\': 620566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der alte Ohm\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'Was den Anbau von Gemüse und insbesondere Kartoffeln anging, war Hamfast Gamdschie in der gesamten Nachbarschaft als höchste Autorität anerkannt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620770&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb8b0b90-0ed9-4184-8a2b-1f652dd65f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 620770}, \'multiverseid\': 620770}, {\'name\': \'El Tío\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada paso final, si ganaste 3 o más vidas este turno, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Plebeyo mediano\', \'flavor\': \'En lo que respecta al cultivo de hortalizas, sobre todo patatas, el maestro Hamfast Gamyi era la máxima autoridad en todas las vecindades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c11efd68-218f-4e45-86e5-28f97b6aa82a\', \'multiverseId\': 620842}, \'multiverseid\': 620842}, {\'name\': "L\'Ancien", \'text\': \'Au début de chaque étape de fin, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et paysan\', \'flavor\': "En matière de légumes, et notamment de pommes de terre, maître Hamfast Gamegie faisait figure d\'autorité dans tout le voisinage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620914&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10df8015-8c19-4713-85f8-57f03968b715\', \'multiverseId\': 620914}, \'multiverseid\': 620914}, {\'name\': \'Il Gaffiere\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, se hai guadagnato 3 o più punti vita in questo turno, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Popolano Halfling\', \'flavor\': \'Circa la crescita delle verdure, e in particolar modo delle patate, Mastro Ham Gamgee era considerato da tutto il vicinato il migliore esperto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd3fc241-15d2-4a80-b587-1bc7aeb57bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 620986}, \'multiverseid\': 620986}, {\'name\': \'とっつぁん\', \'text\': \'各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・農民\', \'flavor\': \'野菜の育て方、特にじゃがいもに関しては、ハムファスト・ギャムジー親方は近郷で自他ともに認める権威であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a208956a-56b9-4f9d-899a-ce1143c88b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 621058}, \'multiverseid\': 621058}, {\'name\': \'O Feitor\', \'text\': \'No início de cada etapa final, se você ganhou 3 ou mais pontos de vida neste turno, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Plebeu\', \'flavor\': \'No cultivo da horta, especialmente de batatas, Mestre Hamfast Gamgi era reconhecido como a maior autoridade por todos na vizinhança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593ab75f-e305-46b2-814d-5e5fdf653f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 621130}, \'multiverseid\': 621130}, {\'name\': \'老头儿\', \'text\': \'在每个结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得过3点或更多生命，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／平民\', \'flavor\': \'在种植蔬菜方面～尤其是马铃薯这类～汉姆法斯特·甘姆吉师傅可是附近邻里公认的头号权威。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e26707-010c-469e-bd5f-ff69f5dd47c9\', \'multiverseId\': 621202}, \'multiverseid\': 621202}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Ärger\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nSolange Der Ärger in deinem Friedhof ist und du ein Gebirge kontrollierst, haben Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Inkarnation\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt viele böse und unfreundliche Dinge in der Welt, die für jene, die auf zwei Beinen laufen, nicht viel übrig haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5dfe168-df9c-4d4c-b530-10817670a4b4\', \'multiverseId\': 621507}, \'multiverseid\': 621507}, {\'name\': \'Enojo\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nMientras el Enojo esté en tu cementerio y controles una Montaña, las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Encarnación\', \'flavor\': \'Existen muchas cosas malignas y hostiles en el mundo que sienten poca simpatía por los que caminan con dos piernas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b94965d-d601-4ec7-a7a3-0b101077ae86\', \'multiverseId\': 621694}, \'multiverseid\': 621694}, {\'name\': \'La Colère\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nTant que La Colère est dans votre cimetière et que vous contrôlez une montagne, les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Créature : incarnation\', \'flavor\': "Il y a bien des choses malveillantes et hostiles dans le monde qui n\'aiment guère ceux qui vont sur deux jambes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621881&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60f21313-e684-4ab2-80f0-79f36c064aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 621881}, \'multiverseid\': 621881}, {\'name\': \'La Rabbia\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nFintanto che La Rabbia è nel tuo cimitero e controlli una Montagna, le creature che controlli hanno rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Incarnazione\', \'flavor\': \'Ci sono molte cose malefiche e ostili nel mondo, che nutrono poco amore per coloro che camminano su due gambe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b0e719-5fef-47cf-b22c-6dafbd7208ee\', \'multiverseId\': 622068}, \'multiverseid\': 622068}, {\'name\': \'憤怒\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n憤怒があなたの墓地にあり、あなたが山をコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — インカーネーション\', \'flavor\': \'この世には、二本の足で歩く者に親しみなど持たぬ、邪悪で敵意を持ったものがたくさんいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52860335-14b9-43a3-9744-cfa0d0e486cf\', \'multiverseId\': 622255}, \'multiverseid\': 622255}, {\'name\': \'Ira\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nEnquanto Ira estiver em seu cemitério e você controlar uma Montanha, as criaturas que você controla terão ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Encarnação\', \'flavor\': \'Há no mundo muitas coisas más e inamistosas com pouco apreço pelos que andam com duas pernas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'108fc226-8020-423e-8c36-2154d91e1e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 622442}, \'multiverseid\': 622442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Mächtigen stürzen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre jede Kreatur, deren Stärke größer ist als die Stärke einer Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Dort saßen wir hoch über den Fluten und sahen zu, wie Isengart ertrank."\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621464&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac985d76-1643-4148-ae7e-869e03d45e20\', \'multiverseId\': 621464}, \'multiverseid\': 621464}, {\'name\': \'Tumbar a los poderosos\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas con una fuerza mayor que la fuerza de la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Estábamos sentados muy por encima de las inundaciones y presenciamos cómo Isengard se hundía".\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3fd133-c9f6-4e86-876f-c7f37bdd09cc\', \'multiverseId\': 621651}, \'multiverseid\': 621651}, {\'name\': \'Anéantir les puissants\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure à la force d\'une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Nous nous sommes assis là, bien au-dessus des eaux, et nous avons regardé l\'Isengard se noyer. »\\n—Pippin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7357ea28-9e50-4faf-9eb0-9182a2d7b6ca\', \'multiverseId\': 621838}, \'multiverseid\': 621838}, {\'name\': \'Distruggere i Potenti\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature con forza superiore alla forza di una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Giunti là, ci sedemmo in alto sopra l\\\'inondazione per assistere all\\\'annegamento di Isengard."\\n—Pipino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c64c53a2-ba2e-4c43-932c-d06644e340cc\', \'multiverseId\': 622025}, \'multiverseid\': 622025}, {\'name\': \'強者破り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのパワーより大きいパワーを持つすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ぼくたちは洪水をはるかに見下ろして座り、アイゼンガルドが水浸しになるのを見ていたよ。」\\n――ピピン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51884311-d9cc-4cb5-8636-8fe99bc4bcbe\', \'multiverseId\': 622212}, \'multiverseid\': 622212}, {\'name\': \'Derrubar os Poderosos\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas com poder maior que o poder da criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"E lá ficamos, sentados muito acima da enchente, e assistimos à inundação de Isengard."\\n— Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccfdcff2-bb93-4920-8b0a-16c682ad7ec0\', \'multiverseId\': 622399}, \'multiverseid\': 622399}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die innere Bestie\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Radagast ist ein würdiger Zauberer, ein Meister der Formen und der wechselnden Farbtöne."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621531&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c89ce242-6c4f-46e2-99d1-b701a3289caf\', \'multiverseId\': 621531}, \'multiverseid\': 621531}, {\'name\': \'La bestia interior\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Radagast es, por supuesto, un mago digno y un maestro de las formas y tonalidades".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a8a3af1-d557-417f-a108-5700cbe2a6a0\', \'multiverseId\': 621718}, \'multiverseid\': 621718}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller la bête\', \'text\': \'Détruisez un permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Radagast est évidemment un digne magicien, un maître des formes et des changements de couleurs. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aba103e-2abf-4716-a850-d2553646b995\', \'multiverseId\': 621905}, \'multiverseid\': 621905}, {\'name\': \'Bestia Interiore\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Radagast, naturalmente, è uno Stregone di grande valore, un maestro nelle forme e nelle variazioni dei colori."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baac73ac-003e-445d-8fce-2961a4768a8f\', \'multiverseId\': 622092}, \'multiverseid\': 622092}, {\'name\': \'内にいる獣\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ラダガストももちろんりっぱな魔法使で、色の変化と形の大家じゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec24647-5e14-4f0e-91ce-0156b186433c\', \'multiverseId\': 622279}, \'multiverseid\': 622279}, {\'name\': \'Fera Interior\', \'text\': \'Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Besta verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Radagast é, evidentemente, um Mago de valor, um mestre das formas e mudanças de cor."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bed2a334-ab3e-4f22-96d9-5c03df7a3375\', \'multiverseId\': 622466}, \'multiverseid\': 622466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorfläuter\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn der Dorfläuter ins Spiel kommt, enttappe alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Feind ist da! Wir haben jeden Pfeil abgeschossen, den wir hatten, und den Deich mit Orkleichen gefüllt. Doch das wird sie nicht lange aufhalten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df4906a8-e38a-4c8f-afef-4574350ac6ca\', \'multiverseId\': 621478}, \'multiverseid\': 621478}, {\'name\': \'Campanero de la aldea\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando el Campanero de la aldea entre al campo de batalla, endereza todas las criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡El enemigo está por llegar! Disparamos todas las flechas de las que disponíamos y llenamos la empalizada de orcos, pero no los contendrá mucho más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af2122d-0db9-406b-8188-e3f063a0db8f\', \'multiverseId\': 621665}, \'multiverseid\': 621665}, {\'name\': \'Sonneur de cloche du village\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nQuand le Sonneur de cloche du village arrive sur le champ de bataille, dégagez toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« L\'ennemi est là ! Nous avons tiré toutes les flèches que nous avions, et nous avons rempli le Fossé d\'orques. Mais cela ne les arrêtera pas longtemps. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da816f3-a430-4f5a-b056-44f5b9ce39a4\', \'multiverseId\': 621852}, \'multiverseid\': 621852}, {\'name\': \'Campanaro del Villaggio\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando il Campanaro del Villaggio entra nel campo di battaglia, STAPpa tutte le creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il nemico è arrivato! Abbiamo tirato ogni freccia disponibile, riempiendo la Diga di Orchi. Ma questo non li fermerà a lungo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7173dd9-f880-4080-94ab-0ec9c3a9ee69\', \'multiverseId\': 622039}, \'multiverseid\': 622039}, {\'name\': \'村の鐘鳴らし\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n村の鐘鳴らしが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「敵が迫っている！我らはあらん限りの矢を放ち、堤防をオークの死体で埋めた。だが、もはや防ぎきれぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a780aa18-2e09-4987-9f91-41fbead78d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 622226}, \'multiverseid\': 622226}, {\'name\': \'Sineiro da Aldeia\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Sineiro da Aldeia entrar no campo de batalha, desvire todas as criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"O inimigo está chegando! Atiramos as flechas que tínhamos e enchemos o Dique com orcs. Mas isso não vai detê-los por muito tempo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3056bd3-2c0b-401c-947b-84d828196637\', \'multiverseId\': 622413}, \'multiverseid\': 622413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornwaldfälle\', \'text\': \'Die Dornwaldfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dornwaldfälle ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nach Bruchtal, wo noch Elben leben,\\nauf Lichtungen, wo Nebel schweben."\\n—Merry und Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621635&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8c06ce9-6f7b-4103-a0d2-3b2dd5f361c8\', \'multiverseId\': 621635}, \'multiverseid\': 621635}, {\'name\': \'Cascadas bosquespinoso\', \'text\': \'Las Cascadas bosquespinoso entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Cascadas bosquespinoso entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"A Rivendel, donde los elfos aún moran\\nbajo una neblina que los claros perforan".\\n—Merry y Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d76bf0e-a0ae-4e12-bd6b-69f0ac15d2ea\', \'multiverseId\': 621822}, \'multiverseid\': 621822}, {\'name\': \'Chutes de Boisépine\', \'text\': \'Les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« À Fondcombe, où les elfes perdurent\\nDans des clairières où la brume murmure. »\\n—Merry et Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622009&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89413219-042c-41ef-a796-c5d27db99899\', \'multiverseId\': 622009}, \'multiverseid\': 622009}, {\'name\': \'Cascate di Boscorovo\', \'text\': \'Le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Gran Burrone degli Elfi è la dimora,\\nIn radure dove la nebbia sosta a ogni ora."\\n—Merry e Pipino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d195ac6c-1d81-439a-b362-f96047f05fb3\', \'multiverseId\': 622196}, \'multiverseid\': 622196}, {\'name\': \'茨森の滝\', \'text\': \'茨森の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n茨森の滝が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「今もエルフ住まう、裂け谷へ、\\n霧まく谷の森の空き地へ。」\\n――メリーとピピン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'365c5a5d-3431-4cb0-b48e-fa4b851d265f\', \'multiverseId\': 622383}, \'multiverseid\': 622383}, {\'name\': \'Cachoeira dos Espinhos\', \'text\': \'Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"A Valfenda, d\\\'elfos ainda vivenda,\\nclareiras fundas nas colinas nevoentas."\\n— Merry e Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f81b1f2-31d2-434b-9b1a-694325b8967f\', \'multiverseId\': 622570}, \'multiverseid\': 622570}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenschädel-Pass\', \'text\': \'Der Drachenschädel-Pass kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen Sumpf oder ein Gebirge.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nun hängt eine große Wolke über allem Land von hier bis zu den Schattenbergen; und sie wird dunkler. Der Krieg hat bereits begonnen."\\n—Reitender Bote aus Gondor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f123773-3ae3-4cd6-9cef-1333d8fce1d2\', \'multiverseId\': 621601}, \'multiverseid\': 621601}, {\'name\': \'Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón\', \'text\': \'La Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles un Pantano o una Montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora la nube se cierne sobre toda la región, entre aquí y las Montañas de la Sombra; y cada vez se oscurece más. Ya ha empezado la guerra".\\n—Mensajero de Gondor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66051e03-2dcd-4037-9c21-8644b23adfce\', \'multiverseId\': 621788}, \'multiverseid\': 621788}, {\'name\': \'Sommet du Crânedragon\', \'text\': \'Le Sommet du Crânedragon arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez un marais ou une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Le grand nuage s\'étend désormais sur tout le pays d\'ici aux Monts de l\'Ombre, et il s\'épaissit. La guerre a déjà commencé. »\\n—Messager du Gondor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621975&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'640123f2-39b2-4d85-aba7-ce07451e00a1\', \'multiverseId\': 621975}, \'multiverseid\': 621975}, {\'name\': \'Vetta del Teschio di Drago\', \'text\': \'La Vetta del Teschio di Drago entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una Palude o una Montagna.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Ora la grande nuvola domina tutto il territorio compreso fra le Montagne dell\\\'Ombra e qui, e si sta infittendo. La guerra è già incominciata."\\n—Messaggero di Gondor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fff5548-222b-4680-8103-2b592702e40a\', \'multiverseId\': 622162}, \'multiverseid\': 622162}, {\'name\': \'竜髑髏の山頂\', \'text\': \'あなたが沼や山をコントロールしていないかぎり、竜髑髏の山頂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「今やこの大きな雲はここから影の山脈まで全土を覆っており、色濃くなってまいりました。戦いはすでに始まったのでございます。」\\n――ゴンドールの使者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57e97449-5812-4d75-b59c-4332eb485d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 622349}, \'multiverseid\': 622349}, {\'name\': \'Pico da Caveira de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Pico da Caveira de Dragão entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle um Pântano ou uma Montanha.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora a grande nuvem paira sobre toda a terra daqui até as Montanhas da Sombra; e ela se adensa. A guerra já começou."\\n— Estafeta de Gondor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f3f0ff-7b3b-4d97-90aa-6b1158e614cd\', \'multiverseId\': 622536}, \'multiverseid\': 622536}]', "[{'name': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Stärke 3 oder mehr.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621463&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '531882bc-2a5a-4e9f-a022-829f2d584391', 'multiverseId': 621463}, 'multiverseid': 621463}, {'name': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'Destruye todas las criaturas con fuerza de 3 o más.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621650&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97beb2e9-7662-4306-ba95-cff6f41e3798', 'multiverseId': 621650}, 'multiverseid': 621650}, {'name': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 3.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621837&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ef4b4f6-0688-44e6-86be-0eaa0b1b9469', 'multiverseId': 621837}, 'multiverseid': 621837}, {'name': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'Distruggi tutte le creature con forza pari o superiore a 3.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622024&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d30591f-6de8-4442-aa20-e7a6b33a31b0', 'multiverseId': 622024}, 'multiverseid': 622024}, {'name': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'パワーが３以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622211&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a72f2ae-5ad9-4cbb-ba83-a6e2e9804a85', 'multiverseId': 622211}, 'multiverseid': 622211}, {'name': 'Dusk // Dawn', 'text': 'Destrua todas as criaturas com poder igual ou superior a 3.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Dusk', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622398&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4b5e422-e8ea-47ba-8278-e5073cf4d6cb', 'multiverseId': 622398}, 'multiverseid': 622398}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eid von Eorl\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nII — Erzeuge zwei 2/2 rote Mensch-Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile, die Trampelschaden verursachen.\\nIII — Lege eine Unzerstörbar-Marke auf bis zu einen Menschen deiner Wahl. Du wirst zum Monarchen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620822&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ded0a6-1bc8-45b3-a95d-40ead7534fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 620822}, \'multiverseid\': 620822}, {\'name\': \'Juramento de Eorl\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Crea dos fichas de criatura Soldado Humano blancas 1/1.\\nII — Crea dos fichas de criatura Caballero Humano rojas 2/2 con las habilidades de arrollar y prisa.\\nIII — Pon un contador de indestructible sobre hasta un Humano objetivo. Te conviertes en el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea96ce60-440c-4f22-9c64-d6617dcc6ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 620894}, \'multiverseid\': 620894}, {\'name\': "Serment d\'Eorl", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\nII — Créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Humain et Chevalier avec le piétinement et la célérité.\\nIII — Mettez un marqueur « indestructible » sur jusqu\'à un humain ciblé. Vous devenez le monarque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620966&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61dfe50-3a0a-4f7e-a9d8-2287e6a9c533\', \'multiverseId\': 620966}, \'multiverseid\': 620966}, {\'name\': \'Giuramento di Eorl\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Crea due pedine creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianche.\\nII — Crea due pedine creatura Cavaliere Umano 2/2 rosse con travolgere e rapidità.\\nIII — Scegli fino a un Umano bersaglio. Metti un segnalino indistruttibile su di esso. Tu diventi il monarca.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf7a7ca-01f6-465d-a4f5-836e4ace8d4a\', \'multiverseId\': 621038}, \'multiverseid\': 621038}, {\'name\': \'エオルの誓い\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — 白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nII — トランプルと速攻を持つ赤の２/２の人間・騎士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nIII — 人間最大１体を対象とする。それの上に破壊不能・カウンター１個を置く。あなたが統治者になる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d4bed6f-ae46-407f-b703-9608cdf4a6c4\', \'multiverseId\': 621110}, \'multiverseid\': 621110}, {\'name\': \'Juramento de Eorl\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Crie duas fichas de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1\\nII — Crie duas fichas de criatura Humano Cavaleiro vermelha 2/2 com atropelar e ímpeto.\\nIII — Coloque um marcador de indestrutível em até um Humano alvo. Você se torna o monarca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'840c8843-1b7b-44a4-a4fd-99bc9c17d901\', \'multiverseId\': 621182}, \'multiverseid\': 621182}, {\'name\': \'埃奥尔之誓\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 派出两个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\nII — 派出两个2/2红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的人类／骑士衍生生物。\\nIII — 在至多一个目标人类上放置一个不灭指示物。你成为君主。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e7d5fe9-61c1-48be-a7ba-d4713f236755\', \'multiverseId\': 621254}, \'multiverseid\': 621254}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einberufung des Entthings\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Reichweite.\\nOpfere die Einberufung des Entthings: Erzeuge drei getappte X/X grüne Baumhirte-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast. Lege auf jeden davon eine Reichweite-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Bumm, bumm, rahbumm, buhrar, bumm bumm, dahrar bumm bumm, dahrar bumm …"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620385&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe27ffc-b973-4b36-a257-14d15c5b4845\', \'multiverseId\': 620385}, \'multiverseid\': 620385}, {\'name\': \'Réunir le Conseil des Ents\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la portée.\\nSacrifiez Réunir le Conseil des Ents : Créez, engagés, trois jetons de créature X/X verte Sylvin, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés ce tour-ci. Mettez un marqueur « portée » sur chacun d\'eux.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Boum, boum, rumboum, bourar, boum boum, dahrar boum boum, dahrar boum... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d833f7-912c-49c7-8668-030943ba1e79\', \'multiverseId\': 620453}, \'multiverseid\': 620453}, {\'name\': \'エントの寄合の呼集\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは到達を持つ。\\nエントの寄合の呼集を生け贄に捧げる：緑のＸ/Ｘのツリーフォーク・クリーチャー・トークン３体をタップ状態で生成する。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。それらの上に、それぞれ到達・カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「フーム、フーム、ルン フーム、フーラール、フーム フーム、ダーラール フーム フーム、ダーラール フーム……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12bb3a52-fa44-4a6a-8784-70efcfd09e2a\', \'multiverseId\': 620521}, \'multiverseid\': 620521}, {\'name\': \'召集恩特大会\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有延势异能。\\n牺牲召集恩特大会：派出三个已横置的X/X绿色树妖衍生生物，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。在这些生物上各放置一个延势指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「轰姆，轰姆，噜姆轰姆，轰啦，轰姆－轰姆，哒啦－轰姆－轰姆，哒啦－轰姆…」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aadacb78-ad44-4801-a62b-c852031b69ef\', \'multiverseId\': 620589}, \'multiverseid\': 620589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einberufung des Entthings\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Reichweite.\\nOpfere die Einberufung des Entthings: Erzeuge drei getappte X/X grüne Baumhirte-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast. Lege auf jeden davon eine Reichweite-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Bumm, bumm, rahbumm, buhrar, bumm bumm, dahrar bumm bumm, dahrar bumm …"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620794&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da1aa54e-ccbb-4e3f-8c16-83727165e442\', \'multiverseId\': 620794}, \'multiverseid\': 620794}, {\'name\': \'Congregar a la Cámara de los ents\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de alcance.\\nSacrificar Congregar a la Cámara de los ents: Crea tres fichas de criatura Pueblo-arbóreo verdes X/X giradas, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno. Pon un contador de alcance sobre cada una de ellas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Bum, bum, rumbum, burar, bum, bum, dahrar bum bu, dahrar bum...".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7e8b7c0-80a0-4698-851c-37712b4413ed\', \'multiverseId\': 620866}, \'multiverseid\': 620866}, {\'name\': \'Réunir le Conseil des Ents\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la portée.\\nSacrifiez Réunir le Conseil des Ents : Créez, engagés, trois jetons de créature X/X verte Sylvin, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés ce tour-ci. Mettez un marqueur « portée » sur chacun d\'eux.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Boum, boum, rumboum, bourar, boum boum, dahrar boum boum, dahrar boum... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620938&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a26079d-5f08-4407-9209-1b29688a47dc\', \'multiverseId\': 620938}, \'multiverseid\': 620938}, {\'name\': "Radunare l\'Entaconsulta", \'text\': "Le creature che controlli hanno raggiungere.\\nSacrifica Radunare l\'Entaconsulta: Crea tre pedine creatura Silvantropo X/X verdi TAPpate, dove X sono i punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno. Metti un segnalino raggiungere su ciascuna di esse.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Buum, buum, rumbuum, buurar, bum bum, dabrar bum bum, dabrar buum..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2248a0e1-5e37-4094-8db5-7d6ce092f85f\', \'multiverseId\': 621010}, \'multiverseid\': 621010}, {\'name\': \'エントの寄合の呼集\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは到達を持つ。\\nエントの寄合の呼集を生け贄に捧げる：緑のＸ/Ｘのツリーフォーク・クリーチャー・トークン３体をタップ状態で生成する。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。それらの上に、それぞれ到達・カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「フーム、フーム、ルン フーム、フーラール、フーム フーム、ダーラール フーム フーム、ダーラール フーム……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0581674a-6d5c-4c2f-b4af-77a039c58b2e\', \'multiverseId\': 621082}, \'multiverseid\': 621082}, {\'name\': \'Reunir o Entebate\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla têm alcance.\\nSacrifique Reunir o Entebate: Crie três fichas de criatura Ent verde X/X viradas, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno. Coloque um marcador de alcance em cada uma delas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Bum, bum, rumbum, burar, bum bum, darar bum bum, darar bum . . ."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'433f2a6b-378f-4791-bd79-0c763be24c82\', \'multiverseId\': 621154}, \'multiverseid\': 621154}, {\'name\': \'召集恩特大会\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有延势异能。\\n牺牲召集恩特大会：派出三个已横置的X/X绿色树妖衍生生物，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。在这些生物上各放置一个延势指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「轰姆，轰姆，噜姆轰姆，轰啦，轰姆－轰姆，哒啦－轰姆－轰姆，哒啦－轰姆…」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8c8406-85bb-4de6-ac25-8e74c5b2a897\', \'multiverseId\': 621226}, \'multiverseid\': 621226}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einfall in die Gruft\', \'text\': \'Schicke alle Kreaturenkarten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil. Du erhältst für jede Karte, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurde, 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Unvermutet stimmte ein Gesang an: ein kaltes Murmeln, das anstieg und fiel, grimmig und elend, eiskalt und herzlos. Die Nacht wetterte gegen den Morgen, dessen sie beraubt wurde, und die Kälte verfluchte die Wärme, nach der sie hungerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621495&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe33c563-b10c-437b-a972-923da6a6a11a\', \'multiverseId\': 621495}, \'multiverseid\': 621495}, {\'name\': \'Incursión en la cripta\', \'text\': \'Exilia todas las cartas de criatura del cementerio del jugador objetivo. Ganas 3 vidas por cada carta exiliada de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'De pronto, comenzó un canto: un murmullo frío, siniestro, cruel y triste que subía y bajaba. La noche se quejaba de la mañana que le habían quitado y el frío maldecía el calor que deseaba.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a77283b0-eac1-4cf1-9eb7-90dc2215c2ed\', \'multiverseId\': 621682}, \'multiverseid\': 621682}, {\'name\': \'Incursion dans la crypte\', \'text\': "Exilez toutes les cartes de créature du cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé. Vous gagnez 3 points de vie pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Soudain, un chant s\'éleva : un murmure froid, s\'envolant et retombant, sinistre, glacial, cruel et misérable. La nuit pestait contre le matin dont elle portait le deuil, et le froid maudissait la chaleur à laquelle il aspirait.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fae5e174-fad7-4e60-a111-0f6a1c5666fd\', \'multiverseId\': 621869}, \'multiverseid\': 621869}, {\'name\': \'Irruzione nella Cripta\', \'text\': \'Esilia tutte le carte creatura dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio. Guadagni 3 punti vita per ogni carta esiliata in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Improvvisamente si levò un canto: un freddo mormorio che saliva e scendeva, empio, spietato, inesorabile e dolente. La notte malediceva il giorno che la soppiantava e il freddo imprecava contro il caldo tanto desiderato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff1eae6-e987-407e-aee4-65ee320c1d9c\', \'multiverseId\': 622056}, \'multiverseid\': 622056}, {\'name\': \'墓所への乱入\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるすべてのクリーチャー・カードを追放する。あなたはこれにより追放されたカード１枚につき３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'突然歌声が起こった。冷ややかな呟き声は、高くなり低くなり、不気味で冷酷で、悲惨で無情だった。夜が、奪われた朝を罵り、冷たさが、渇望してやまぬ温もりを呪っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d17f68b0-f8d7-4289-a1b7-429a228645f3\', \'multiverseId\': 622243}, \'multiverseid\': 622243}, {\'name\': \'Incursão de Cripta\', \'text\': \'Exile todos os cards de criatura do cemitério do jogador alvo. Você ganha 3 pontos de vida para cada card exilado desta forma.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'De repente começou uma canção: um murmúrio frio, subindo e descendo, sinistro, frio, impiedoso e deplorável. A noite vociferava contra a manhã que lhe fora tomada, e o frio maldizia o calor que cobiçava.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8d0d148-b734-4229-b8b8-3c4a8aae9a44\', \'multiverseId\': 622430}, \'multiverseid\': 622430}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einsame Sandbank\', \'text\': \'Die Einsame Sandbank kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich glaube nicht, dass die Welt um uns herum jemals wieder so sein wird wie in alten Zeiten. Denn die Elben werden bald zum Meer streben und Mittelerde für immer verlassen."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621616&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46fff1f8-08c8-4e9d-b9eb-a1d7d0f64c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 621616}, \'multiverseid\': 621616}, {\'name\': \'Banco de arena solitario\', \'text\': \'El Banco de arena solitario entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"No contemplo que nuestro mundo sea de nuevo como antaño, puesto que los elfos tal vez pronto crucen el mar sin obstáculos y abandonen la Tierra Media para siempre".\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b170abb-0b61-4def-b6b3-b7ae654a4a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 621803}, \'multiverseid\': 621803}, {\'name\': \'Banc de sable isolé\', \'text\': \'Le Banc de sable isolé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne crois pas que le monde qui nous entoure sera un jour à nouveau tel qu\'il était autrefois. Car les elfes traverseront bientôt la mer, quittant libres la Terre du Milieu à tout jamais. »\\n—Haldir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621990&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b501e91-fdb5-400f-988a-a1f47589605b\', \'multiverseId\': 621990}, \'multiverseid\': 621990}, {\'name\': \'Secca Solitaria\', \'text\': \'La Secca Solitaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Io non credo che il mondo intorno a noi tornerà mai com\\\'era in passato. Gli Elfi ne approfitterebbero per raggiungere il Mare liberamente e abbandonare per sempre la Terra di Mezzo."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'258c4ffd-b8eb-4e9c-96ca-ef9746c11556\', \'multiverseId\': 622177}, \'multiverseid\': 622177}, {\'name\': \'孤立した砂州\', \'text\': \'孤立した砂州はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング {U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「私は、我らを取り囲む世の中がいつかまた昔の通りとなるとは信じない。エルフたちは阻まれることなく海に出て、この中つ国を永遠に去るだろう。」\\n――ハルディア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b791f8a-7722-4298-8748-d667487ba125\', \'multiverseId\': 622364}, \'multiverseid\': 622364}, {\'name\': \'Banco de Areia Isolado\', \'text\': \'Banco de Areia Isolado entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Não acredito que o mundo ao nosso redor volte a ser como era antigamente. Pois logo os elfos poderão chegar ao Mar desimpedidos e deixar a Terra Média para sempre.\\n— Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f907448-5ff1-46e2-a12b-1c962394b44c\', \'multiverseId\': 622551}, \'multiverseid\': 622551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elch aus dem Düsterwald\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Elch aus dem Düsterwald ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, bringe eine Elf-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der Karte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'„Zwar offenbart das Licht die wahre Natur der Dunkelheit, doch sein eigenes Geheimnis bleibt unergründet."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620390&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddb6b496-473f-4a60-913f-c3ddbbd95d67\', \'multiverseId\': 620390}, \'multiverseid\': 620390}, {\'name\': \'Élan de la Forêt Noire\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Élan de la Forêt Noire arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, renvoyez une carte d\'elfe ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à la force de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : élan\', \'flavor\': "« Bien que la lumière perçoive le cœur même des ténèbres, son propre secret n\'a pas encore été découvert. »\\n—Haldir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1204cd-6c67-4826-81fa-c080ee08b9bd\', \'multiverseId\': 620458}, \'multiverseid\': 620458}, {\'name\': \'闇の森の大鹿\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n闇の森の大鹿が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にあるエルフ・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたはそのカードのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「光は闇の核心まで見て理解しているが、それに反して、光そのものの秘密はいまだ明かされてはいない。」\\n――ハルディア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741912d0-cddf-40ab-a8a6-89355cbcb8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 620526}, \'multiverseid\': 620526}, {\'name\': \'黑森林雄鹿\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当黑森林雄鹿进战场或攻击时，将目标妖精牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。你获得等同于该牌力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「尽管光明已然看穿黑暗的核心，但自身的秘密却未被发现。」\\n～哈尔迪尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c96e0349-d443-44d2-9845-555288362bb6\', \'multiverseId\': 620594}, \'multiverseid\': 620594}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elch aus dem Düsterwald\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Elch aus dem Düsterwald ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, bringe eine Elf-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der Karte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'„Zwar offenbart das Licht die wahre Natur der Dunkelheit, doch sein eigenes Geheimnis bleibt unergründet."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620799&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd369223-387a-43c3-96ca-c4eb373aa450\', \'multiverseId\': 620799}, \'multiverseid\': 620799}, {\'name\': \'Alce del Bosque Negro\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Alce del Bosque Negro entre al campo de batalla o ataque, regresa la carta de Elfo objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la fuerza de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"La luz, aquello que atraviesa el corazón de las tinieblas, pero cuyo secreto todavía está por descubrir".\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86254f0e-8643-444f-80e9-e556a357c653\', \'multiverseId\': 620871}, \'multiverseid\': 620871}, {\'name\': \'Élan de la Forêt Noire\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Élan de la Forêt Noire arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, renvoyez une carte d\'elfe ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à la force de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : élan\', \'flavor\': "« Bien que la lumière perçoive le cœur même des ténèbres, son propre secret n\'a pas encore été découvert. »\\n—Haldir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620943&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b723d12-0a70-4ffc-befe-fc830e84c455\', \'multiverseId\': 620943}, \'multiverseid\': 620943}, {\'name\': \'Alce di Bosco Atro\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Alce di Bosco Atro entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, riprendi in mano una carta Elfo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Guadagni punti vita pari alla forza di quella carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"Mentre la luce penetra nel cuore stesso dell\\\'oscurità, il suo segreto non è ancora stato scoperto."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada6f2b3-df52-40e9-a5b3-4973127b4c22\', \'multiverseId\': 621015}, \'multiverseid\': 621015}, {\'name\': \'闇の森の大鹿\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n闇の森の大鹿が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にあるエルフ・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたはそのカードのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「光は闇の核心まで見て理解しているが、それに反して、光そのものの秘密はいまだ明かされてはいない。」\\n――ハルディア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f77142-651b-42ac-beb2-b95f6df5e8ca\', \'multiverseId\': 621087}, \'multiverseid\': 621087}, {\'name\': \'Alce da Floresta das Trevas\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Alce da Floresta das Trevas entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, devolva o card de Elfo alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao poder daquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"Enquanto a luz percebe o coração das trevas, seu próprio segredo não foi descoberto."\\n— Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ab235c8-0d9b-4056-9a03-ea78b0923a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 621159}, \'multiverseid\': 621159}, {\'name\': \'黑森林雄鹿\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当黑森林雄鹿进战场或攻击时，将目标妖精牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。你获得等同于该牌力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「尽管光明已然看穿黑暗的核心，但自身的秘密却未被发现。」\\n～哈尔迪尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e99ab80-43da-4df1-813b-a9922ee5a230\', \'multiverseId\': 621231}, \'multiverseid\': 621231}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfen-Kriegsmeister\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein oder mehrere andere Elfen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\\n{5}{G}{G}: Elfen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4caa6a9-560f-4b9d-93a4-7382452d178b\', \'multiverseId\': 621538}, \'multiverseid\': 621538}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de la guerra élfico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que uno o más otros Elfos entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\\n{5}{G}{G}: Los Elfos que controlas obtienen +2/+2 y ganan la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52c07f4-dc63-443d-8cd8-f2a3c2637880\', \'multiverseId\': 621725}, \'multiverseid\': 621725}, {\'name\': \'Maître de guerre elfe\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins un autre elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\n{5}{G}{G} : Les elfes que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et acquièrent le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b80fc6-e24e-4760-bd29-ad3dd469271d\', \'multiverseId\': 621912}, \'multiverseid\': 621912}, {\'name\': \'Maestro Guerriero degli Elfi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta uno o più altri Elfi entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\\n{5}{G}{G}: Gli Elfi che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'998e81cd-06a7-4ceb-a0f5-0eeb38a5fc42\', \'multiverseId\': 622099}, \'multiverseid\': 622099}, {\'name\': \'エルフの戦練者\', \'text\': \'これでない１体以上のエルフがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\\n{5}{G}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのエルフは＋２/＋２の修整を受け接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30ce56e1-436d-43d5-8e20-988dfd029413\', \'multiverseId\': 622286}, \'multiverseid\': 622286}, {\'name\': \'Mestre de Guerra Elfo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um ou mais Elfos entrarem no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura Elfo Guerreiro verde 1/1. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\\n{5}{G}{G}: Os Elfos que você controla recebem +2/+2 e ganham toque mortífero até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e26035-88c8-4221-960e-b7523159bdb6\', \'multiverseId\': 622473}, \'multiverseid\': 622473}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfen-Mystiker\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Die drei Ringe der Elben wurden nicht als Waffen für Krieg und Eroberung geschmiedet — ihre Macht liegt anderswo. Jene, die sie fertigten, begehrten weder Stärke noch Herrschaft oder gehortete Reichtümer, sondern Wissen, Schöpfung und Heilung, um alles Makellose zu behüten."\\n—Elrond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f72aecba-f5fd-41ee-8e71-fa914cc0b79a\', \'multiverseId\': 621535}, \'multiverseid\': 621535}, {\'name\': \'Místico élfico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los Tres Anillos de los elfos no se crearon como armas de guerra o conquista. No es ese el poder que tienen. Quienes los forjaron no anhelaban ni fuerza ni dominio ni riqueza, sino comprender, crear y curar con tal de preservar todo de forma impoluta".\\n—Elrond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61a06066-af10-4526-8cff-f7cd6f27affd\', \'multiverseId\': 621722}, \'multiverseid\': 621722}, {\'name\': \'Mystique elfe\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Les trois Anneaux des Elfes ne furent pas créés comme des armes de guerre ou de conquête ; là n\'est pas leur pouvoir. Ceux qui les ont forgés ne désiraient ni force, ni domination, ni richesse, mais la compréhension, la création et la guérison, pour préserver toutes choses immaculées. »\\n—Elrond", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f95f1601-c0f7-4266-ab86-3c02f9a11a9e\', \'multiverseId\': 621909}, \'multiverseid\': 621909}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Mistico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"I Tre Anelli degli Elfi non furono fabbricati per servire come armi di guerra e di conquista: non è questo il loro potere. Coloro che li forgiarono non desideravano forza o dominazione, né accumulavano tesori; cercavano di capire, fabbricare e curare, per mantenere ogni cosa immacolata."\\n—Elrond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3551d0be-4749-4992-9c15-87ac51c0f1f5\', \'multiverseId\': 622096}, \'multiverseid\': 622096}, {\'name\': \'エルフの神秘家\', \'text\': \'{T}：{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「エルフの三つの指輪は戦いや征服のための武器として作られたものではない――この指輪の力はそのようなものではない。三つの指輪を作った者たちは、力や支配や蓄えた富などは願わず、すべてを浄く保つため、理解し、作り、癒す力を望んだ。」\\n――エルロンド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33fa7d0f-ee3e-4958-9540-d91896694de0\', \'multiverseId\': 622283}, \'multiverseid\': 622283}, {\'name\': \'Místico Élfico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Três Anéis dos Elfos não foram feitos como armas de guerra nem de conquista — esse não é o poder deles. Os que os fizeram não desejavam força nem dominância nem acumular riquezas, mas entendimento, criação e cura, a preservação imaculada de todas as coisas."\\n— Elrond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ee22cc-79f8-496a-a074-7d099c37ca62\', \'multiverseId\': 622470}, \'multiverseid\': 622470}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfischer Erzdruide\', \'text\': \'Andere Elf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} für jeden Elfen, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sang von Blättern, Blättern aus Gold, da wuchsen Blätter aus Gold:\\nIch sang von Wind, und Wind hob an, strich durch Baumkronen hold."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9755383-74fe-4f8d-b0cf-501863d8c20b\', \'multiverseId\': 621534}, \'multiverseid\': 621534}, {\'name\': \'Archidruida élfico\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas Elfo que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} por cada Elfo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Canté sobre hojas, sobre hojas de oro, y allí crecieron hojas de oro;\\ncanté sobre el viento, y un viento vino y sopló entre las ramas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba13d3a-467f-4d30-95cf-6ac8ec60209d\', \'multiverseId\': 621721}, \'multiverseid\': 621721}, {\'name\': \'Archidruide elfe\', \'text\': \'Les autres créatures Elfe que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} pour chaque elfe que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai chanté les feuilles, les feuilles d\'or, et des feuilles d\'or poussèrent là.\\nJ\'ai chanté le vent, et le vent vint qui dans les branches souffla. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5be98d01-d26f-43b7-9d2a-08b58b83174b\', \'multiverseId\': 621908}, \'multiverseid\': 621908}, {\'name\': \'Arcidruido Elfico\', \'text\': \'Le altre creature Elfo che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} per ogni Elfo che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cantavo di foglie, di foglie dorate, e le foglie dorate crebbero,\\nCantavo del vento, e il vento tra le fronde e le foglie giocava."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26985d10-fcf7-4ce5-8afb-0deb2ffe7465\', \'multiverseId\': 622095}, \'multiverseid\': 622095}, {\'name\': \'エルフの大ドルイド\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのエルフ・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしているエルフ１体につき{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「私は歌った、木の葉を、黄金の木の葉を、かの地に生い茂った黄金の木の葉を。\\n私は歌った、風を、かの地に吹き来たりて、かの枝々をさやがせた風を。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a023109-9b87-437b-bd91-1ef6bc6434df\', \'multiverseId\': 622282}, \'multiverseid\': 622282}, {\'name\': \'Arqueodruida Elfo\', \'text\': \'As outras criaturas Elfo que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} para cada Elfo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Cantei as folhas, folhas d\\\'ouro, e folhas d\\\'ouro brotaram:\\nCantei o vento, os ventos vieram, e ali nos galhos sopraram."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a474ce90-4747-4bbb-bdce-2e1e34ad2756\', \'multiverseId\': 622469}, \'multiverseid\': 622469}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfischer Pfeifer\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}: Du kannst eine Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„In Dwimordene, in Lórien\\ndie Sterblichen nur selten geh\\\'n,\\nWenige von ihnen bekamen das Licht,\\ndas hell dort wohnt, je zu Gesicht.\\nGaladriel! Galadriel!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec60e9b5-95d3-4bc2-b49a-4f64decda065\', \'multiverseId\': 621536}, \'multiverseid\': 621536}, {\'name\': \'Flautista élfica\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}: Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de criatura de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"En Dwimordene, en Lórien;\\npocos hombres estuvieron en este edén.\\nPocos ojos mortales han visto bien\\nla luz brillante que alumbra sin desdén.\\n¡Galadriel! ¡Galadriel!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8254daa-e9ec-40fa-bc76-5f6d758d7f3c\', \'multiverseId\': 621723}, \'multiverseid\': 621723}, {\'name\': \'Joueuse de flûte elfe\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T} : Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« À Dwimordene, en Lórien\\nRares sont les hommes qui marchèrent,\\nPeu d\'yeux mortels ont vu la lumière\\nQui y règne toujours, brillante et pérenne.\\nGaladriel ! Galadriel ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621910&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'889f8ee7-f3e5-41d7-8de8-298055ed2bff\', \'multiverseId\': 621910}, \'multiverseid\': 621910}, {\'name\': \'Pifferaio Elfico\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}: Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"A Lórien, a Dwimordene\\nGli Uomini hanno camminato raramente,\\nPochi mortali han veduto la luce\\nChe vi brilla sempre splendente.\\nGaladriel! Galadriel!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5665fbb9-faef-4398-9087-b4c4fb0e6515\', \'multiverseId\': 622097}, \'multiverseid\': 622097}, {\'name\': \'エルフの笛吹き\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}：あなたの手札にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「ドウィモルデーネに、ロリアンに、\\n人の足跡のしるされることは稀だった。\\nかの地に長く眩しくある光を\\n生命短き人の目に見たためしはわずか。\\nガラドリエルよ！ガラドリエル！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d3f5d06-c1d6-4ae9-8b9e-317857e2de4b\', \'multiverseId\': 622284}, \'multiverseid\': 622284}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Flautista\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}: Você pode colocar no campo de batalha um card de criatura de sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Em Dwimordene, em Lórien,\\nPouco andaram os Homens, nem\\nViram mortais muitos jamais\\nlá a luz que, antiga e forte, jaz.\\nGaladriel! Galadriel!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96660c7e-e521-4a59-91fc-256b212ae686\', \'multiverseId\': 622471}, \'multiverseid\': 622471}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfischer Visionär\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Elfische Visionär ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Glaubt nicht, dass Lothlórien nur durch Gesang unter den Blättern oder die schlanken Pfeile der Elbenbögen bewahrt und gegen seine Feinde verteidigt wird."\\n—Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da999ed7-95d5-49f8-a63f-6471aac752a2\', \'multiverseId\': 621537}, \'multiverseid\': 621537}, {\'name\': \'Visionaria élfica\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Visionaria élfica entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No pienses que solo con cantar entre los árboles o solo con las delgadas flechas de los arcos élficos la tierra de Lothlórien resiste y se defiende de su enemigo".\\n—Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'021317af-9d2e-47e5-a502-ead281619350\', \'multiverseId\': 621724}, \'multiverseid\': 621724}, {\'name\': \'Visionnaire elfe\', \'text\': \'Quand la Visionnaire elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Ne vous imaginez pas que les chants parmi les arbres, ni même les flèches effilées des archers elfes, permettent de préserver et de défendre cette terre de Lothlórien contre son Ennemi. »\\n—Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6acd3c66-4857-4810-84ec-40d96aef10f4\', \'multiverseId\': 621911}, \'multiverseid\': 621911}, {\'name\': \'Elfa Visionaria\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Elfa Visionaria entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non credere che siano sufficienti i canti fra gli alberi, o le esili frecce degli archi elfici, per custodire e difendere dal Nemico la terra di Lothlórien."\\n—Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f2dcd6d-d9a8-441d-9ad1-6d304568a2d8\', \'multiverseId\': 622098}, \'multiverseid\': 622098}, {\'name\': \'エルフの幻想家\', \'text\': \'エルフの幻想家が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「木々の間で歌ってばかりいたり、エルフの弓の華奢な矢に頼って、このロスロリアンの地が敵から守られていると考えてはなりませぬ。」\\n――ガラドリエル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'602fd298-a854-44b9-a4de-59cf4f4ce1f8\', \'multiverseId\': 622285}, \'multiverseid\': 622285}, {\'name\': \'Visionário Élfico\', \'text\': \'Quando Visionário Élfico entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Não pense que só pelo canto em meio às árvores, ou pelas finas flechas dos arcos élficos, esta terra de Lothlórien se mantém e se defende contra seu Inimigo."\\n— Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'696fd1b0-cf1e-4bae-953f-e1ff8917244b\', \'multiverseId\': 622472}, \'multiverseid\': 622472}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elrond vom Weißen Rat\', \'text\': \'Geheimes Konzil — Wenn Elrond vom Weißen Rat ins Spiel kommt, stimmt jeder Spieler geheim für Gefährten oder Beistand, dann werden die Stimmen offenbart. Für jede Gefährten-Stimme bestimmt der Spieler, der sie abgegeben hat, eine Kreatur, die er kontrolliert. Du übernimmst die Kontrolle über jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise bestimmt wurde, und sie erhält „Diese Kreatur kann ihren Besitzer nicht angreifen." Lege dann für jede Beistand-Stimme auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620400&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeccd7da-ee27-4a64-91e2-a453dcd27d92\', \'multiverseId\': 620400}, \'multiverseid\': 620400}, {\'name\': \'Elrond du Conseil Blanc\', \'text\': "Conseil secret — Quand Elrond du Conseil Blanc arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur vote secrètement pour communauté ou aide, puis ces votes sont révélés. Pour chaque vote pour communauté, le votant choisit une créature qu\'il contrôle. Vous acquérez le contrôle de chaque créature choisie de cette manière, et elles acquièrent « Cette créature ne peut pas attaquer son propriétaire. » Puis pour chaque vote aide, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'855f2ee8-a234-47f0-a473-8ea9a4c9d597\', \'multiverseId\': 620468}, \'multiverseid\': 620468}, {\'name\': \'白の会議のエルロンド\', \'text\': \'秘密会議 — 白の会議のエルロンドが戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーは秘密裏に「仲間」または「救援」のいずれかに投票する。その後、それらの投票を公開する。「仲間」に投票した各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を選ぶ。あなたはこれにより選ばれたすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得て、それらは「このクリーチャーはオーナーを攻撃できない。」を得る。その後、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、「救援」１票につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f6d3119-d67b-40a3-931e-94173872b515\', \'multiverseId\': 620536}, \'multiverseid\': 620536}, {\'name\': \'白道会的埃尔隆德\', \'text\': \'密议～当白道会的埃尔隆德进战场时，每位牌手各私下投票选择「组盟」或「援助」，然后展示投票结果。对每票「组盟」而言，投该票者选择一个由其操控的生物。你获得所有以此法选中之生物的操控权，且这些生物获得「此生物不能攻击其拥有者。」然后「援助」每有一票，便在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07c8e233-9caa-4d12-afda-66705d70e2ff\', \'multiverseId\': 620604}, \'multiverseid\': 620604}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elrond vom Weißen Rat\', \'text\': \'Geheimes Konzil — Wenn Elrond vom Weißen Rat ins Spiel kommt, stimmt jeder Spieler geheim für Gefährten oder Beistand, dann werden die Stimmen offenbart. Für jede Gefährten-Stimme bestimmt der Spieler, der sie abgegeben hat, eine Kreatur, die er kontrolliert. Du übernimmst die Kontrolle über jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise bestimmt wurde, und sie erhält „Diese Kreatur kann ihren Besitzer nicht angreifen." Lege dann für jede Beistand-Stimme auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620809&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54edcdcb-01ab-416c-ac33-ea7270bbb5e3\', \'multiverseId\': 620809}, \'multiverseid\': 620809}, {\'name\': \'Elrond del Concilio Blanco\', \'text\': \'Concilio secreto — Cuando Elrond del Concilio Blanco entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador vota en secreto comunidad o ayuda y luego se dan a conocer los votos. Por cada voto de comunidad, el votante elige una criatura que controla. Ganas el control de cada criatura elegida de esta manera y estas ganan "Esta criatura no puede atacar a su propietario". Luego, por cada voto de ayuda, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b6bdd99-e37c-464e-9610-1501a3398f81\', \'multiverseId\': 620881}, \'multiverseid\': 620881}, {\'name\': \'Elrond du Conseil Blanc\', \'text\': "Conseil secret — Quand Elrond du Conseil Blanc arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur vote secrètement pour communauté ou aide, puis ces votes sont révélés. Pour chaque vote pour communauté, le votant choisit une créature qu\'il contrôle. Vous acquérez le contrôle de chaque créature choisie de cette manière, et elles acquièrent « Cette créature ne peut pas attaquer son propriétaire. » Puis pour chaque vote aide, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620953&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ac6208-7c13-4896-bcc0-bcf8564cfbec\', \'multiverseId\': 620953}, \'multiverseid\': 620953}, {\'name\': \'Elrond del Bianco Consiglio\', \'text\': \'Consiglio segreto — Quando Elrond del Bianco Consiglio entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore vota segretamente per la compagnia o per aiutare, poi quei voti vengono rivelati. Per ogni voto per la compagnia, il votante sceglie una creatura che controlla. Prendi il controllo di ogni creatura scelta in questo modo, che ha "Questa creatura non può attaccare il suo proprietario". Poi, per ogni voto per aiutare, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43182a46-a28d-4472-96ef-0995e6f79a03\', \'multiverseId\': 621025}, \'multiverseid\': 621025}, {\'name\': \'白の会議のエルロンド\', \'text\': \'秘密会議 — 白の会議のエルロンドが戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーは秘密裏に「仲間」または「救援」のいずれかに投票する。その後、それらの投票を公開する。「仲間」に投票した各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を選ぶ。あなたはこれにより選ばれたすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得て、それらは「このクリーチャーはオーナーを攻撃できない。」を得る。その後、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、「救援」１票につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f42edb-66aa-4fad-922d-e91bfc6d2d9a\', \'multiverseId\': 621097}, \'multiverseid\': 621097}, {\'name\': \'Elrond do Conselho Branco\', \'text\': \'Conselho secreto — Quando Elrond do Conselho Branco entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador vota secretamente em sociedade ou auxílio e depois aqueles votos são revelados. Para cada voto em sociedade, quem votou escolhe uma criatura que controla. Você ganha o controle de cada criatura escolhida dessa forma e elas ganham "Esta criatura não pode atacar o próprio dono". Em seguida, para cada voto em auxílio, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4655dbf-4b4c-4683-8843-98df27672530\', \'multiverseId\': 621169}, \'multiverseid\': 621169}, {\'name\': \'白道会的埃尔隆德\', \'text\': \'密议～当白道会的埃尔隆德进战场时，每位牌手各私下投票选择「组盟」或「援助」，然后展示投票结果。对每票「组盟」而言，投该票者选择一个由其操控的生物。你获得所有以此法选中之生物的操控权，且这些生物获得「此生物不能攻击其拥有者。」然后「援助」每有一票，便在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79e815ec-991a-4c91-878e-7264d637dfb5\', \'multiverseId\': 621241}, \'multiverseid\': 621241}]', "[{'name': 'Entdecker der Reiche', 'text': 'Die Entdecker der Reiche kommen mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Gesamtanzahl an Karten auf den Händen aller Spieler ist.\\n{2}{G}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von den Entdeckern der Reiche: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Länderkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Späher', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621555&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd729f37b-8880-4956-8b4a-40068f661199', 'multiverseId': 621555}, 'multiverseid': 621555}, {'name': 'Rastreadores de terrenos', 'text': 'Los Rastreadores de terrenos entran al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ellos, donde X es la cantidad total de cartas que haya en las manos de todos los jugadores.\\n{2}{G}, remover un contador +1/+1 de los Rastreadores de terrenos: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.', 'type': 'Criatura — Explorador elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621742&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31042d9d-d116-46aa-bb11-952079bc8343', 'multiverseId': 621742}, 'multiverseid': 621742}, {'name': 'Chercheurs de royaume', 'text': 'Les Chercheurs de royaume arrivent sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur eux, X étant le nombre total de cartes dans les mains de tous les joueurs.\\n{2}{G}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 des Chercheurs de royaume : Cherchez une carte de terrain dans votre bibliothèque, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et éclaireur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621929&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc50242a-e5a5-43b9-b3cd-dbdf8d4bf5f3', 'multiverseId': 621929}, 'multiverseid': 621929}, {'name': 'Cercatori di Reami', 'text': 'I Cercatori di Reami entrano nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1, dove X è il numero totale di carte nelle mani di tutti i giocatori.\\n{2}{G}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dai Cercatori di Reami: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra, rivelala, aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.', 'type': 'Creatura — Esploratore Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622116&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4e58fdb-6d93-4478-99ea-ba262b20bd6f', 'multiverseId': 622116}, 'multiverseid': 622116}, {'name': '領域の探求者', 'text': '領域の探求者は、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはすべてのプレイヤーの手札にあるカードの総数に等しい。\\n{2}{G}, 領域の探求者の上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く：あなたのライブラリーから土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622303&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f56ea5b-c3be-4bff-a908-deeb60113427', 'multiverseId': 622303}, 'multiverseid': 622303}, {'name': 'Buscadores de Reinos', 'text': 'Buscadores de Reinos entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1, sendo X o número total de cards nas mãos de todos os jogadores.\\n{2}{G}, remova um marcador +1/+1 de Buscadores de Reinos: Procure um card de terreno em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e, em seguida, embaralhe.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elfo Batedor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622490&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5ff2a2f-7a24-4351-9d65-5edd04508cc6', 'multiverseId': 622490}, 'multiverseid': 622490}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erdbeben\', \'text\': \'Das Erdbeben fügt jedem Spieler und jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Von weit her, mal schwach, mal anschwellend, kam ein trommelndes Grollen, ein Brüllen, eine lange, hallende Woge aus zerstörerischem Lärm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7f6b74d-54b2-44ec-8c44-1b0ce222225f\', \'multiverseId\': 621511}, \'multiverseid\': 621511}, {\'name\': \'Terremoto\', \'text\': \'El Terremoto hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura sin la habilidad de volar y a cada jugador.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Se oyó desde muy lejos, a veces poco, a veces creciente, a veces trepando hasta las nubes, un tamborileo sordo y prolongado, un estruendo, unos ecos duraderos con un redoble de destrucción y ruina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75c27fef-4ac3-4f97-a4a6-c2a2b39921e9\', \'multiverseId\': 621698}, \'multiverseid\': 621698}, {\'name\': \'Tremblement de terre\', \'text\': \'Le Tremblement de terre inflige X blessures à chaque créature sans le vol et à chaque joueur.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Dans le lointain, d\'abord faible, puis croissant, puis montant jusqu\'aux nuages, résonna un grondement de tambours, un rugissement, un long roulement d\'un bruit désastreux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e112ded8-9f5f-4084-b27b-395cbfbe1f17\', \'multiverseId\': 621885}, \'multiverseid\': 621885}, {\'name\': \'Terremoto\', \'text\': \'Il Terremoto infligge X danni a ogni creatura senza volare e a ogni giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Da lontano, ora più fioco, ora più forte, alzandosi fra le nubi, si udì un rombo, un ruggito, un lungo boato lacerante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a860953-5e23-4695-b590-4d9faa9685cc\', \'multiverseId\': 622072}, \'multiverseid\': 622072}, {\'name\': \'地震\', \'text\': \'地震は飛行を持たない各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'遥か遠くから初めかすかに、やがて大きく、ついには雲に達するほど高まって、太鼓のような地響きが、轟音が、長くこだまする破壊の物音が聞こえてきた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c3e715e-a5c8-4e2f-a156-52e6a79ea1fd\', \'multiverseId\': 622259}, \'multiverseid\': 622259}, {\'name\': \'Terremoto\', \'text\': \'Terremoto causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura sem voar e a cada jogador.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'De longe, ora fraco, ora crescente, ora alcançando as nuvens, veio um ribombar ritmado, um rugido, uma longa e ecoante sequência de barulhos funestos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'448f111e-0cb4-422a-974a-9f6d5476f5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 622446}, \'multiverseid\': 622446}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erestor, Mitglied des Rats\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Spieler eine Abstimmung beenden, erzeugt jeder Gegner, der für eine Option gestimmt hat, für die du gestimmt hast, einen Schatz-Spielstein. Du wendest Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Gegnern ist, die für eine Option gestimmt haben, für die du nicht gestimmt hast. Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Uns bleiben nur zwei Möglichkeiten: den Ring bis in alle Ewigkeit zu verbergen oder ihn zu vernichten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620402&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d56edfe-cabd-4b79-aac6-06560b704ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 620402}, \'multiverseid\': 620402}, {\'name\': \'Erestor du Conseil\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que les joueurs finissent de voter, chaque adversaire qui a voté pour un choix pour lequel vous avez voté crée un jeton Trésor. Vous appliquez regard X, X étant le nombre d\'adversaires qui ont voté pour un choix pour lequel vous n\'avez pas voté. Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a que deux voies possibles : cacher l\'Anneau à tout jamais, ou le détruire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64282692-a0b4-49c0-99c7-f66f1ba7af79\', \'multiverseId\': 620470}, \'multiverseid\': 620470}, {\'name\': \'賢者会議のエレストール\', \'text\': \'すべてのプレイヤーが投票を完了するたび、あなたと同じ選択に投票した各対戦相手はそれぞれ宝物・トークン１つを生成する。あなたは占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたと異なる選択に投票した対戦相手の人数に等しい。カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「選択肢は二つです。指輪を永遠に隠し続けるか、壊してなきものとするか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e58ff66-575a-4219-9395-d0eb42914229\', \'multiverseId\': 620538}, \'multiverseid\': 620538}, {\'name\': \'白道会的埃芮斯托\', \'text\': \'每当所有牌手完成投票时，每位投票选择你投票之选项的对手各派出一个珍宝衍生物。你占卜X，X为投票选择你未投票之选项的对手数量。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「这样就只剩下两条路了：要么将魔戒永远藏匿；要么就将它销毁。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee469ae3-69aa-4f9d-8f91-5cc8a0502927\', \'multiverseId\': 620606}, \'multiverseid\': 620606}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erestor, Mitglied des Rats\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Spieler eine Abstimmung beenden, erzeugt jeder Gegner, der für eine Option gestimmt hat, für die du gestimmt hast, einen Schatz-Spielstein. Du wendest Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Gegnern ist, die für eine Option gestimmt haben, für die du nicht gestimmt hast. Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Uns bleiben nur zwei Möglichkeiten: den Ring bis in alle Ewigkeit zu verbergen oder ihn zu vernichten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620811&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2712238-ef5b-42fd-9ac0-c71bd72bea6f\', \'multiverseId\': 620811}, \'multiverseid\': 620811}, {\'name\': \'Erestor del Concilio\', \'text\': \'Siempre que los jugadores terminen de votar, cada oponente que votó una opción que tú votaste crea una ficha de Tesoro. Adivinas X, donde X es la cantidad de oponentes que votaron una opción que tú no votaste. Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tan solo hay dos caminos: esconder el Anillo para siempre o destruirlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d79f98-9f05-4df4-a806-0e5b879cb7d4\', \'multiverseId\': 620883}, \'multiverseid\': 620883}, {\'name\': \'Erestor du Conseil\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que les joueurs finissent de voter, chaque adversaire qui a voté pour un choix pour lequel vous avez voté crée un jeton Trésor. Vous appliquez regard X, X étant le nombre d\'adversaires qui ont voté pour un choix pour lequel vous n\'avez pas voté. Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a que deux voies possibles : cacher l\'Anneau à tout jamais, ou le détruire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620955&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a316240-0fe1-459d-8cbc-b1a269e1aadf\', \'multiverseId\': 620955}, \'multiverseid\': 620955}, {\'name\': \'Erestor del Consiglio\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta i giocatori terminano di votare, ogni avversario che ha votato come te crea una pedina Tesoro. Profetizzi X, dove X è il numero di avversari che hanno votato diversamente da te. Peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sono solo due direzioni da prendere: nascondere per sempre l\\\'Anello o distruggerlo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f834f57b-7303-47bd-8502-388e3b78abc0\', \'multiverseId\': 621027}, \'multiverseid\': 621027}, {\'name\': \'賢者会議のエレストール\', \'text\': \'すべてのプレイヤーが投票を完了するたび、あなたと同じ選択に投票した各対戦相手はそれぞれ宝物・トークン１つを生成する。あなたは占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたと異なる選択に投票した対戦相手の人数に等しい。カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「選択肢は二つです。指輪を永遠に隠し続けるか、壊してなきものとするか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c01a95c-6f70-4a7c-864d-224b3636f465\', \'multiverseId\': 621099}, \'multiverseid\': 621099}, {\'name\': \'Erestor do Conselho\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que os jogadores terminarem de votar, cada oponente que votou numa opção em que você votou cria uma ficha de Tesouro. Você usa vidência X, sendo X o número de oponentes que votaram em uma escolha na qual você não votou. Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"Há somente dois caminhos: esconder o Anel para sempre ou destruí-lo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'819ebcde-360a-433e-8828-4a7c1802940d\', \'multiverseId\': 621171}, \'multiverseid\': 621171}, {\'name\': \'白道会的埃芮斯托\', \'text\': \'每当所有牌手完成投票时，每位投票选择你投票之选项的对手各派出一个珍宝衍生物。你占卜X，X为投票选择你未投票之选项的对手数量。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「这样就只剩下两条路了：要么将魔戒永远藏匿；要么就将它销毁。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15c35abe-c76e-45d5-b633-a071cf0561cf\', \'multiverseId\': 621243}, \'multiverseid\': 621243}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erprobte Bratpfanne\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Erprobte Bratpfanne ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein, erzeuge dann einen 1/1 weißen Halbling-Kreaturenspielstein und lege die Erprobte Bratpfanne an ihn an.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur hat „Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält diese Kreatur bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du dazuerhalten hast."\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620361&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'237c7a69-b7c4-4dff-9c2f-7122b456587a\', \'multiverseId\': 620361}, \'multiverseid\': 620361}, {\'name\': \'Poêle à frire de terrain\', \'text\': "Quand la Poêle à frire de terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Nourriture, puis créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Halfelin et attachez-lui la Poêle à frire de terrain.\\nLa créature équipée a « À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, cette créature gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés. »\\nÉquipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75cfdcaf-348b-45da-9335-9c8331d52775\', \'multiverseId\': 620429}, \'multiverseid\': 620429}, {\'name\': \'百戦錬磨のフライパン\', \'text\': \'百戦錬磨のフライパンが戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン１つを生成する。その後、白の１/１のハーフリング・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成し、百戦錬磨のフライパンをそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは「あなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはそのあなたが得たライフの点数に等しい。」を持つ。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1101f360-86dd-44c6-ae5e-4cb160662a18\', \'multiverseId\': 620497}, \'multiverseid\': 620497}, {\'name\': \'经战平底锅\', \'text\': \'当经战平底锅进战场时，派出一个食品衍生物，然后派出一个1/1白色半身人衍生生物，并将经战平底锅贴附于其上。\\n佩带此武具的生物具有「每当你获得生命时，此生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为你获得的生命数量。」\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcc615af-5317-42fc-9d16-53a33abbd877\', \'multiverseId\': 620565}, \'multiverseid\': 620565}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erprobte Bratpfanne\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Erprobte Bratpfanne ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein, erzeuge dann einen 1/1 weißen Halbling-Kreaturenspielstein und lege die Erprobte Bratpfanne an ihn an.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur hat „Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält diese Kreatur bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du dazuerhalten hast."\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620769&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35af85c2-9265-432e-b2b5-52daef8ef031\', \'multiverseId\': 620769}, \'multiverseid\': 620769}, {\'name\': \'Sartén de viajero\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Sartén de viajero entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Comida. Luego crea una ficha de criatura Mediano blanca 1/1 y anéxale la Sartén de viajero.\\nLa criatura equipada tiene "Siempre que ganes vidas, esta criatura obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste".\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc030224-31b9-40b0-9e93-50bde82e86b0\', \'multiverseId\': 620841}, \'multiverseid\': 620841}, {\'name\': \'Poêle à frire de terrain\', \'text\': "Quand la Poêle à frire de terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Nourriture, puis créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Halfelin et attachez-lui la Poêle à frire de terrain.\\nLa créature équipée a « À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, cette créature gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés. »\\nÉquipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef97ca33-1445-4832-b05e-c6b2d6b7919f\', \'multiverseId\': 620913}, \'multiverseid\': 620913}, {\'name\': \'Padella da Combattimento\', \'text\': \'Quando la Padella da Combattimento entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Cibo, poi crea una pedina creatura Halfling 1/1 bianca e assegnale la Padella da Combattimento.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata ha "Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, questa creatura prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato".\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8330da27-24c3-4be6-9c04-1e238da4b10c\', \'multiverseId\': 620985}, \'multiverseid\': 620985}, {\'name\': \'百戦錬磨のフライパン\', \'text\': \'百戦錬磨のフライパンが戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン１つを生成する。その後、白の１/１のハーフリング・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成し、百戦錬磨のフライパンをそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは「あなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはそのあなたが得たライフの点数に等しい。」を持つ。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12392e8a-3f05-43fc-b418-2c91a348770f\', \'multiverseId\': 621057}, \'multiverseid\': 621057}, {\'name\': \'Frigideira Testada em Campo\', \'text\': \'Quando Frigideira Testada em Campo entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Comida e, em seguida, crie uma ficha de criatura Pequenino branca 1/1 e anexe Frigideira Testada em Campo a ela.\\nA criatura equipada tem "Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, esta criatura recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou".\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'762ecfc3-fdb4-4cc1-b635-3b514d086870\', \'multiverseId\': 621129}, \'multiverseid\': 621129}, {\'name\': \'经战平底锅\', \'text\': \'当经战平底锅进战场时，派出一个食品衍生物，然后派出一个1/1白色半身人衍生生物，并将经战平底锅贴附于其上。\\n佩带此武具的生物具有「每当你获得生命时，此生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为你获得的生命数量。」\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecb64ed9-f0a6-40a8-b1b2-99a857a7475b\', \'multiverseId\': 621201}, \'multiverseid\': 621201}]', '[{\'name\': \'Errichten der Palisaden\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Bringe alle Kreaturen, die nicht den bestimmten Typ haben, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sie wirkte unermesslich groß und unerträglich schön; Grauen erregend und Anbetung gebietend.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620372&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282f0a5c-7ca7-40ab-87cd-403216bd6d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 620372}, \'multiverseid\': 620372}, {\'name\': \'Levée de la palissade\', \'text\': \'Choisissez un type de créature. Renvoyez toutes les créatures qui ne sont pas du type choisi dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Elle semblait d\'une taille démesurée et d\'une beauté insoutenable, terrible et éminente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620440&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ba018b-5156-4814-b1f2-e41bc68013c4\', \'multiverseId\': 620440}, \'multiverseid\': 620440}, {\'name\': \'矢来を上げよ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。その選ばれたタイプでないすべてのクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は測りがたいほど大きく、耐えがたいほど美しく、戦慄すべき恐ろしさとあがむべき尊厳さを備えて見えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2214f3f7-62ba-4e22-bdd7-d775bbcb1509\', \'multiverseId\': 620508}, \'multiverseid\': 620508}, {\'name\': \'召起护壁\', \'text\': \'选择一种生物类别。将所有不为该类别的生物移回其拥有者的手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'她显得高不可测、美不可攀，恐怖与尊贵并存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74cb6b39-ef46-426d-b969-c35b673cbd17\', \'multiverseId\': 620576}, \'multiverseid\': 620576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Errichten der Palisaden\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Bringe alle Kreaturen, die nicht den bestimmten Typ haben, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sie wirkte unermesslich groß und unerträglich schön; Grauen erregend und Anbetung gebietend.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620781&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55ceecac-c998-41e5-a93c-114a8add804e\', \'multiverseId\': 620781}, \'multiverseid\': 620781}, {\'name\': \'Alzar la empalizada\', \'text\': \'Elige un tipo de criatura. Regresa todas las criaturas que no sean del tipo elegido a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Parecía extremadamente alta e irresistiblemente bella, imponente y tremenda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d01551d-1e1e-4522-852f-9248a0deb1f2\', \'multiverseId\': 620853}, \'multiverseid\': 620853}, {\'name\': \'Levée de la palissade\', \'text\': \'Choisissez un type de créature. Renvoyez toutes les créatures qui ne sont pas du type choisi dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Elle semblait d\'une taille démesurée et d\'une beauté insoutenable, terrible et éminente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620925&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d871c3d0-acf3-4ef1-85ed-2dc00e76cf42\', \'multiverseId\': 620925}, \'multiverseid\': 620925}, {\'name\': \'Innalzare la Palizzata\', \'text\': \'Scegli un tipo di creatura. Fai tornare tutte le creature che non sono del tipo scelto in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Pareva immensamente alta e il fascino della sua bellezza era insostenibile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6592c8b-06b7-4020-b80c-e536180b4461\', \'multiverseId\': 620997}, \'multiverseid\': 620997}, {\'name\': \'矢来を上げよ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。その選ばれたタイプでないすべてのクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は測りがたいほど大きく、耐えがたいほど美しく、戦慄すべき恐ろしさとあがむべき尊厳さを備えて見えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3642e33-3c4d-4098-893f-3861a2042957\', \'multiverseId\': 621069}, \'multiverseid\': 621069}, {\'name\': \'Erguer a Paliçada\', \'text\': \'Escolha um tipo de criatura. Devolva todas as criaturas que não sejam do tipo escolhido para a mão de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Ela parecia imensuravelmente alta, insuportavelmente bela, terrível e venerável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de24d8e-6d2f-4065-930d-2eea162feee6\', \'multiverseId\': 621141}, \'multiverseid\': 621141}, {\'name\': \'召起围栏\', \'text\': \'选择一种生物类别。将所有不为该类别的生物移回各自拥有者的手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'她显得高不可测、美不可攀，恐怖与尊贵并存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777fc905-e886-4f73-aa24-f655909a3af9\', \'multiverseId\': 621213}, \'multiverseid\': 621213}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erwecken des Drachen\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 6/6 schwarzen und roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, Bedrohlichkeit und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, übernimm die Kontrolle über ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das jener Spieler kontrolliert."\\nRückblende {6}{B}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620832&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22cd54f6-7f9b-47e5-b767-cf7afebd89ac\', \'multiverseId\': 620832}, \'multiverseid\': 620832}, {\'name\': \'Despertar al dragón\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Dragón negra y roja 6/6 con las habilidades de volar, amenaza y "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, gana el control del artefacto objetivo que controla ese jugador".\\nRetrospectiva {6}{B}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7a2ac27-f6ba-4070-bf93-8d153c11466f\', \'multiverseId\': 620904}, \'multiverseid\': 620904}, {\'name\': \'Éveil du dragon\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature 6/6 noire et rouge Dragon avec le vol, la menace et « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, acquérez le contrôle d\'un artefact ciblé que ce joueur contrôle. »\\nFlashback {6}{B}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620976&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43d05cca-75c9-451f-a8c9-8fede1d0fec8\', \'multiverseId\': 620976}, \'multiverseid\': 620976}, {\'name\': \'Risvegliare il Drago\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Drago 6/6 rossa e nera con volare, minacciare e "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, prendi il controllo di un artefatto bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore".\\nFlashback {6}{B}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39bbec52-e9d3-4f8d-82aa-9def068c85fc\', \'multiverseId\': 621048}, \'multiverseid\': 621048}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンを起こす\', \'text\': \'飛行と威迫と「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つを対象とする。それのコントロールを得る。」を持つ黒赤の６/６のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{B}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa5fa92a-3bce-4a5f-892a-3d8a46c841d4\', \'multiverseId\': 621120}, \'multiverseid\': 621120}, {\'name\': \'Acordar o Dragão\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura Dragão preta e vermelha 6/6 com voar, ameaçar e "Toda vez que esta criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, ganhe o controle do artefato alvo que aquele jogador controla".\\nRecapitular {6}{B}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fdd5a64-868e-4ebe-8ac5-9eefa836ba6a\', \'multiverseId\': 621192}, \'multiverseid\': 621192}, {\'name\': \'唤醒巨龙\', \'text\': \'派出一个6/6，黑红双色的龙衍生生物，且具有飞行、威慑与「每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，获得目标由该牌手操控之神器的操控权。」\\n返照{6}{B}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9697c9b1-cba1-46f4-b5b1-996ed9a723c3\', \'multiverseId\': 621264}, \'multiverseid\': 621264}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erwecken des Drachen\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 6/6 schwarzen und roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, Bedrohlichkeit und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, übernimm die Kontrolle über ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das jener Spieler kontrolliert."\\nRückblende {6}{B}{R}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620420&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f22e987c-891d-432f-b9f8-285c9f870ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 620420}, \'multiverseid\': 620420}, {\'name\': \'Éveil du dragon\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature 6/6 noire et rouge Dragon avec le vol, la menace et « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, acquérez le contrôle d\'un artefact ciblé que ce joueur contrôle. »\\nFlashback {6}{B}{R}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620488&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3044fa3-2dd9-463c-98c0-395c038cece1\', \'multiverseId\': 620488}, \'multiverseid\': 620488}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンを起こす\', \'text\': \'飛行と威迫と「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つを対象とする。それのコントロールを得る。」を持つ黒赤の６/６のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{B}{R}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b4c2fe-e37e-414a-aa63-076c7808c882\', \'multiverseId\': 620556}, \'multiverseid\': 620556}, {\'name\': \'唤醒巨龙\', \'text\': \'派出一个6/6，黑红双色的龙衍生生物，且具有飞行、威慑与「每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，获得目标由该牌手操控之神器的操控权。」\\n返照{6}{B}{R}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c347e6a-86ee-468e-a7e8-027ab30500fb\', \'multiverseId\': 620624}, \'multiverseid\': 620624}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die ältesten Ebereschen wurden von den Ents gepflanzt, um die Entfrauen zu erfreuen; doch diese lächelten nur und sagten, sie wüssten, wo weißere Blüten und reichere Früchte wuchsen."\\n—Flinkbaum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621604&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b285656c-4533-43b4-98b7-3f2558eb8cd2\', \'multiverseId\': 621604}, \'multiverseid\': 621604}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Los fresnos más antiguos los plantaron los ents para complacer a las ent-mujeres; pero ellas los miraron, esbozaron una sonrisa y dijeron que conocían un lugar en el que crecían más blancos y había frutos más ricos".\\n—Ramaviva\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bb5015d-4ec0-4414-b9b2-a108a8f63b82\', \'multiverseId\': 621791}, \'multiverseid\': 621791}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Les plus anciens sorbiers avaient été plantés par les Ents pour tenter de plaire aux Ents-femmes ; mais elles les regardèrent en souriant, et répondirent qu\'elles savaient où trouver des fleurs plus blanches et des fruits plus délicieux. »\\n—Vifsorbier", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621978&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0574bf-9014-4874-b1bb-57871d6f388f\', \'multiverseId\': 621978}, \'multiverseid\': 621978}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"I sorbi più vecchi erano stati piantati dagli Ent per far piacere alle Entesse, ma queste li osservarono, e sorridendo dissero di sapere dove crescevano frutti più abbondanti e fiori ancor più candidi."\\n—Sveltolampo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54890c9b-8e8c-49fd-8367-e648d8d5183e\', \'multiverseId\': 622165}, \'multiverseid\': 622165}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「一番古いななかまどの木はエント女を喜ばせようと、エントが植えたものだった。ところが彼女たちは木を眺めると、にっこり笑って言ったのだ。もっと白い花が咲き、もっと味のよい果物がなる場所を知っているとね。」\\n――せっかち\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0206f77-d829-44df-b75a-8fed424cb880\', \'multiverseId\': 622352}, \'multiverseid\': 622352}, {\'name\': \'Pomar Exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"As tramazeiras mais antigas foram plantadas pelos Ents para tentar agradar as Entesposas; mas elas olharam as árvores, sorriram e disseram que sabiam onde cresciam flores mais brancas e frutas mais ricas."\\n—Tronquesperto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4059981-75f5-4106-a2e9-6213e3cef356\', \'multiverseId\': 622539}, \'multiverseid\': 622539}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fakt oder Fiktion\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt jene Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm einen Haufen auf deine Hand und lege den anderen auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Welchen Beistand hast du je gebracht, Sturmkrähe? Und welchen Beistand bringst du jetzt? Als du das letzte Mal hier warst, wolltest du Beistand von uns."\\n—Schlangenzunge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621487&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c00ccfba-13e7-46bf-a0c3-b84d8e3c44e6\', \'multiverseId\': 621487}, \'multiverseid\': 621487}, {\'name\': \'Realidad o ficción\', \'text\': \'Muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Un oponente separa esas cartas en dos montones. Pon un montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Has otorgado ayuda alguna vez, Cuervo de la Tempestad? ¿Y qué ayuda traes ahora? La última vez que estuviste aquí nos pediste auxilio tú a nosotros".\\n—Lengua de Serpiente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5728c50-6ef2-4178-8f4b-c93c56d3f3dc\', \'multiverseId\': 621674}, \'multiverseid\': 621674}, {\'name\': \'Fait ou fiction\', \'text\': "Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez un tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Quelle aide avez-vous jamais apportée, corbeau de tempête ? Et quelle aide apportez-vous maintenant ? C\'est de notre aide dont vous aviez besoin la dernière fois que vous êtes venu. »\\n—Langue de Serpent", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85fccf52-03b2-4c71-8a4a-05b3fef0cd01\', \'multiverseId\': 621861}, \'multiverseid\': 621861}, {\'name\': \'Certezza o Finzione\', \'text\': "Rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Un avversario separa quelle carte in due pile. Aggiungi alla tua mano una pila e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quale aiuto hai mai fornito, Corvotempesta? E quale aiuto porti adesso? Da noi hai cercato aiuto l\\\'ultima volta che eri qui."\\n—Vermilinguo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c660b293-8f37-4bac-9fc1-fc6eb481b83e\', \'multiverseId\': 622048}, \'multiverseid\': 622048}, {\'name\': \'嘘か真か\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を公開する。対戦相手１人はそれらのカードを２つの束に分ける。あなたは一方の束をあなたの手札に、もう一方の束をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「疫病神よ、あなたは今までどんな助けをたずさえてこられましたかな？して、今度はいかなる助けをたずさえておいでかな？先にお見えになった時、お求めになったのは我らからの援助でございましたな。」\\n――蛇の舌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c393372d-444f-4038-a00e-62b9614418de\', \'multiverseId\': 622235}, \'multiverseid\': 622235}, {\'name\': \'Fato ou Ficção\', \'text\': \'Revele os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Um oponente separa aqueles cards em dois montes. Você coloca um monte na própria mão e o outro no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Que ajuda você já nos deu, Corvo da tempestade? E que ajuda você nos vem dar agora? Era a nossa ajuda que você procurava na última vez em que esteve aqui."\\n— Língua de Cobra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ab0d115-f790-4c52-972f-1f533209e96c\', \'multiverseId\': 622422}, \'multiverseid\': 622422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallensteller aus dem Düsterwald\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler dich angreift, erhält eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl -2/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler angreift und falls er nicht dich angreift, bestimmt jener Spieler eine angreifende Kreatur. Sie erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Wipfeln des Düsterwalds herrschte tödlicher Unfrieden zwischen Elben und den Wesen der Dunkelheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f745c23a-da71-482b-a43d-52932c1c9574\', \'multiverseId\': 620410}, \'multiverseid\': 620410}, {\'name\': \'Trappeur de la Forêt Noire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur vous attaque, une créature attaquante ciblée gagne -2/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque, s\'il ne vous attaque pas, ce joueur choisit une créature attaquante. Elle gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': \'Sous les branches de la Forêt Noire, une lutte mortelle opposait les elfes à des êtres maléfiques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbe5960c-4255-4481-a2f7-4aa0a81598c2\', \'multiverseId\': 620478}, \'multiverseid\': 620478}, {\'name\': \'闇の森の罠師\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人があなたを攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－０の修整を受ける。\\nプレイヤー１人が攻撃するたび、そのプレイヤーがあなたを攻撃していない場合、そのプレイヤーは攻撃クリーチャー１体を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'闇の森の大樹の下で、エルフと邪悪な魔物が死闘を繰り広げていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3803bbc8-57ff-483a-a1f6-2cc7dc07be7f\', \'multiverseId\': 620546}, \'multiverseid\': 620546}, {\'name\': \'黑森林布陷人\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手攻击你时，目标进行攻击的生物得-2/-0直到回合结束。\\n每当任一牌手攻击时，若其未攻击你，则该牌手选择一个进行攻击的生物。它得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'在黑森林的粗枝下，精灵与邪物正殊死搏斗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b923c099-829f-4546-bff0-406b27d9f019\', \'multiverseId\': 620614}, \'multiverseid\': 620614}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallensteller aus dem Düsterwald\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler dich angreift, erhält eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl -2/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler angreift und falls er nicht dich angreift, bestimmt jener Spieler eine angreifende Kreatur. Sie erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Wipfeln des Düsterwalds herrschte tödlicher Unfrieden zwischen Elben und den Wesen der Dunkelheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620820&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b20bdc96-cf83-4f9e-8775-5e4e067f5a62\', \'multiverseId\': 620820}, \'multiverseid\': 620820}, {\'name\': \'Trampero del Bosque Negro\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador te ataque, la criatura atacante objetivo obtiene -2/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que un jugador ataque, si no te ataca a ti, ese jugador elige una criatura atacante. Obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Bajo las ramas del Bosque Negro se libraba una lucha encarnizada entre elfos y seres malignos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe22e3ea-e231-4922-9963-55ac01802766\', \'multiverseId\': 620892}, \'multiverseid\': 620892}, {\'name\': \'Trappeur de la Forêt Noire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur vous attaque, une créature attaquante ciblée gagne -2/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque, s\'il ne vous attaque pas, ce joueur choisit une créature attaquante. Elle gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': \'Sous les branches de la Forêt Noire, une lutte mortelle opposait les elfes à des êtres maléfiques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620964&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'202d3801-8812-474f-89b6-4b038837956d\', \'multiverseId\': 620964}, \'multiverseid\': 620964}, {\'name\': \'Trappolatore di Bosco Atro\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore ti attacca, una creatura attaccante bersaglio prende -2/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore attacca, se non sta attaccando te, quel giocatore sceglie una creatura attaccante. Prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Sotto le fronde del Bosco Atro, infieriva il conflitto tra Elfi ed esseri malvagi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a1dd66-2c6c-428a-bbcc-a96a7853be3a\', \'multiverseId\': 621036}, \'multiverseid\': 621036}, {\'name\': \'闇の森の罠師\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人があなたを攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－０の修整を受ける。\\nプレイヤー１人が攻撃するたび、そのプレイヤーがあなたを攻撃していない場合、そのプレイヤーは攻撃クリーチャー１体を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'闇の森の大樹の下で、エルフと邪悪な魔物が死闘を繰り広げていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e1c9b27-31df-4c75-9d24-f4bef9ac682b\', \'multiverseId\': 621108}, \'multiverseid\': 621108}, {\'name\': \'Armadilheiro da Floresta das Trevas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador ataca você, a criatura atacante alvo recebe -2/-0 até o final do turno.\\nToda vez que um jogador ataca, se não estiver atacando você, aquele jogador escolhe uma criatura atacante. Ela recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Sob os galhos da Floresta das Trevas travava-se um embate mortal entre elfos e seres malignos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a55b3f2b-05b2-449a-84b8-b26133d5be3c\', \'multiverseId\': 621180}, \'multiverseid\': 621180}, {\'name\': \'黑森林布陷人\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手攻击你时，目标进行攻击的生物得-2/-0直到回合结束。\\n每当任一牌手攻击时，若其未攻击你，则该牌手选择一个进行攻击的生物。它得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'在黑森林的粗枝下，精灵与邪物正殊死搏斗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dabf46fd-bb0d-4b77-9bfc-c548c85a1970\', \'multiverseId\': 621252}, \'multiverseid\': 621252}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fanatische Rekruten\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn die Fanatischen Rekruten ins Spiel kommen, übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Enttappe jene bleibende Karte. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Schild und Panzer, Schwert und Axt\\nund glänzende Speere gehörten zum Schatz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0341ee8c-b3fc-4ba2-bfe5-0ccad420275f\', \'multiverseId\': 621528}, \'multiverseid\': 621528}, {\'name\': \'Conscriptos fervientes\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando los Conscriptos fervientes entren al campo de batalla, gana el control del permanente objetivo hasta el final del turno. Endereza ese permanente. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'El escudo y la malla, el hacha y la espada\\ny las lanzas brillantes allí aguardaban.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34ac3e22-4df8-4c76-928d-0c09fa40d9e0\', \'multiverseId\': 621715}, \'multiverseid\': 621715}, {\'name\': \'Conscrits zélés\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand les Conscrits zélés arrivent sur le champ de bataille, acquérez le contrôle d\'un permanent ciblé jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ce permanent. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Bouclier et corselet, hache et épée,\\nEt lances reluisantes étaient amassés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a4a5b1-8b22-403b-9822-100947acc6ac\', \'multiverseId\': 621902}, \'multiverseid\': 621902}, {\'name\': \'Reclute Zelanti\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nQuando le Reclute Zelanti entrano nel campo di battaglia, prendi il controllo di un permanente bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quel permanente. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Scudi e corazze, asce e spade,\\nE fiammanti lance venivano accumulati per scorta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f4139f-2635-4a45-9195-9081649a20af\', \'multiverseId\': 622089}, \'multiverseid\': 622089}, {\'name\': \'士気溢れる徴集兵\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n士気溢れる徴集兵が戦場に出たとき、パーマネント１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。そのパーマネントをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'円盾に胴よろい、斧に剣、\\n輝く槍も数多く貯えられた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd45a38a-3b42-43b6-9f66-274e380373ea\', \'multiverseId\': 622276}, \'multiverseid\': 622276}, {\'name\': \'Recrutas Zelosos\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nQuando Recrutas Zelosos entrar no campo de batalha, ganhe o controle da permanente alvo até o final do turno. Desvire aquela permanente. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Broquel e colete, espada e machado,\\nE lanças brilhantes foram empilhados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2684b174-9f23-4a4a-8e2b-49751434dfc5\', \'multiverseId\': 622463}, \'multiverseid\': 622463}]', '[{\'name\': \'Faramir, Truchsess von Gondor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine legendäre Kreatur mit Manabetrag 4 oder mehr unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du der Monarch bist, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Der letzte Truchsess von Gondor bittet untertänigst um Erlaubnis, sein Amt niederzulegen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620403&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f220e74-3fa7-4023-b58c-3396974dc9d1\', \'multiverseId\': 620403}, \'multiverseid\': 620403}, {\'name\': \'Faramir, Intendant du Gondor\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature légendaire avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 4 arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si vous êtes le monarque, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Le dernier Intendant du Gondor demande la permission d\'abandonner sa charge. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620471&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e55f08a-6215-4060-bf37-3f9a45f8de8b\', \'multiverseId\': 620471}, \'multiverseid\': 620471}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの執政、ファラミア\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が４以上である伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたが統治者であった場合、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「ゴンドール最後の執政は、ここに謹んで解任を乞う。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650ede44-d937-44b6-8b9d-4314499f4264\', \'multiverseId\': 620539}, \'multiverseid\': 620539}, {\'name\': \'刚铎宰相法拉米尔\', \'text\': \'每当一个法术力值等于或大于4的传奇生物在你操控下进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若你是君主，则派出两个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「刚铎最后一任宰相请求交还职权。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39c384dd-4984-47cb-8a0a-29febe245811\', \'multiverseId\': 620607}, \'multiverseid\': 620607}]', '[{\'name\': \'Faramir, Truchsess von Gondor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine legendäre Kreatur mit Manabetrag 4 oder mehr unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du der Monarch bist, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Der letzte Truchsess von Gondor bittet untertänigst um Erlaubnis, sein Amt niederzulegen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620812&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d60c9779-84ee-4d8f-b609-4cbc14d275c1\', \'multiverseId\': 620812}, \'multiverseid\': 620812}, {\'name\': \'Faramir, senescal de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura legendaria con valor de maná de 4 o más entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si eres el monarca, crea dos fichas de criatura Soldado Humano blancas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El último senescal de Gondor solicita permiso para renunciar a su puesto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d887a36-e57f-40d6-b076-b2030fc69ffa\', \'multiverseId\': 620884}, \'multiverseid\': 620884}, {\'name\': \'Faramir, Intendant du Gondor\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature légendaire avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 4 arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si vous êtes le monarque, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Le dernier Intendant du Gondor demande la permission d\'abandonner sa charge. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620956&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5f314a-dd05-4e30-b020-7d8ede21f963\', \'multiverseId\': 620956}, \'multiverseid\': 620956}, {\'name\': \'Faramir, Sovrintendente di Gondor\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura leggendaria con valore di mana pari o superiore a 4 entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, diventi il monarca.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se sei il monarca, crea due pedine creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianche.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ultimo Sovrintendente di Gondor chiede il permesso di dimettersi dal suo incarico."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c35553-ee5a-4fbc-844a-d88bcabdc5a9\', \'multiverseId\': 621028}, \'multiverseid\': 621028}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの執政、ファラミア\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が４以上である伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたが統治者であった場合、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「ゴンドール最後の執政は、ここに謹んで解任を乞う。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57441cbd-f5aa-4c47-ac11-80f5c67d6de2\', \'multiverseId\': 621100}, \'multiverseid\': 621100}, {\'name\': \'Faramir, Regente de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura lendária com valor de mana igual ou superior a 4 entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você se torna o monarca.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, se você for o monarca, crie duas fichas de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"O último Regente de Gondor solicita licença para entregar o cargo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0bcd35c-cc04-4f4d-847b-86c12b7a7c28\', \'multiverseId\': 621172}, \'multiverseid\': 621172}, {\'name\': \'刚铎宰相法拉米尔\', \'text\': \'每当一个法术力值等于或大于4的传奇生物在你操控下进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若你是君主，则派出两个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「刚铎最后一任宰相请求交还职权。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cd8d831-4ca0-4711-9cbb-6b8729674d33\', \'multiverseId\': 621244}, \'multiverseid\': 621244}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feldschmiede\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Die Feldschmiede fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Am Morgen werde ich nach Edoras reiten, zur Versammlung der Mark."\\n—Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171097d8-cd94-4117-875a-f839e9b99edc\', \'multiverseId\': 621593}, \'multiverseid\': 621593}, {\'name\': \'Forja del campo de batalla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}. La Forja del campo de batalla te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Por la mañana pondré rumbo a Edoras para la revista de las tropas de la Marca".\\n—Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f052dd84-1729-4b86-994a-d6850f706d38\', \'multiverseId\': 621780}, \'multiverseid\': 621780}, {\'name\': \'Forge de campagne\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. La Forge de campagne vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Au matin, je chevaucherai jusqu\'à Edoras pour le rassemblement de la Marche. »\\n—Théoden", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621967&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67f2f72a-7d6e-419f-a409-214dadd25f9f\', \'multiverseId\': 621967}, \'multiverseid\': 621967}, {\'name\': \'Forgia da Campo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}. La Forgia da Campo ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Domattina mi recherò a Edoras all\\\'adunata del Mark."\\n—Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07ea8f33-dd5c-4822-a681-e46ddfb999ef\', \'multiverseId\': 622154}, \'multiverseid\': 622154}, {\'name\': \'戦場の鍛冶場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。戦場の鍛冶場はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「朝になったらマークの召集に、エドラスへ馬を進めることになろう。」\\n――セオデン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11749d90-cbc2-4a21-9362-9db57efea13d\', \'multiverseId\': 622341}, \'multiverseid\': 622341}, {\'name\': \'Forjaria do Campo de Batalha\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}. Forjaria do Campo de Batalha causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Pela manhã seguirei para Edoras, para a reunião da Marca."\\n— Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed8bcd7d-f3cd-488d-8803-82c2865a80b0\', \'multiverseId\': 622528}, \'multiverseid\': 622528}]', "[{'name': 'Felskuppenzuflucht', 'text': 'Die Felskuppenzuflucht kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst ein Gebirge oder eine Ebene.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Die Behausungen der Rohirrim liegen unter den bewaldeten Hängen der Weißen Berge, verborgen in Nebel und Wolken.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621597&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5529a0e3-16b2-42fa-96c2-043ae80b039c', 'multiverseId': 621597}, 'multiverseid': 621597}, {'name': 'Refugio en la cima', 'text': 'El Refugio en la cima entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles una Montaña o una Llanura.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Las moradas de los Rohirrim se encontraban en los estribos boscosos de las Montañas Blancas, ocultas entre niebla y nubes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621784&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d609668-b392-4b0f-b61e-9046e76c5999', 'multiverseId': 621784}, 'multiverseid': 621784}, {'name': 'Rectorat du haut des falaises', 'text': 'Le Rectorat du haut des falaises arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une montagne ou une plaine.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Les Rohirrims habitent les corniches boisées des Montagnes Blanches, dissimulés par la brume et les nuages.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621971&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b95fc098-4f28-460f-b483-1cd520542d27', 'multiverseId': 621971}, 'multiverseid': 621971}, {'name': 'Rifugio in Cima al Dirupo', 'text': 'Il Rifugio in Cima al Dirupo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una Montagna o una Pianura.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Le abitazioni dei Rohirrim si trovavano sotto i boschi frondosi dei Monti Bianchi, nascosti dalla nebbia e dalle nuvole.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622158&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d3de553-1a43-484a-b955-aa2cfafa379b', 'multiverseId': 622158}, 'multiverseid': 622158}, {'name': '断崖の避難所', 'text': 'あなたが山や平地をコントロールしていないかぎり、断崖の避難所はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'ロヒアリムの住まう場所は、霧と雲に隠れた白の山脈の木の茂ったひさしの下あたりだった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622345&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d8efa81-9019-4c9b-a2d4-3bdba3ccf5d6', 'multiverseId': 622345}, 'multiverseid': 622345}, {'name': 'Retiro da Falésia', 'text': 'Retiro da Falésia entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma Montanha ou uma Planície.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Os lares dos Rohirrim ficavam sob os sopés arborizados das Montanhas Brancas, ocultos na névoa e nas nuvens.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622532&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3946d0e2-4a07-4403-8a94-8c5bd392114e', 'multiverseId': 622532}, 'multiverseid': 622532}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fernsuche\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-, Insel-, Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist eine gefährliche Sache, Frodo, vor die Tür zu treten. Du betrittst die Straße, und wenn du nicht auf deine Füße aufpasst, kannst du nie wissen, wohin sie dich tragen."\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c76be85-a534-4c44-80d0-eb1681786612\', \'multiverseId\': 621541}, \'multiverseid\': 621541}, {\'name\': \'Visión lejana\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, Isla, Pantano o Montaña, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Es peligroso, Frodo, cruzar la puerta. Vas hacia el camino y, si no cuidas tus pasos, no sabes a dónde te pueden llevar".\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f3af12c-830d-4de8-af65-34be3608e3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 621728}, \'multiverseid\': 621728}, {\'name\': \'Cherchauloin\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, d\'île, de marais ou de montagne, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Il est dangereux de sortir de chez toi, Frodo. Tu vas sur la route et, si tu ne retiens pas tes pieds, nul ne sait jusqu\'où tu pourrais être emporté. »\\n—Bilbo", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa682c1-569f-4551-ad33-d377efc9ec5f\', \'multiverseId\': 621915}, \'multiverseid\': 621915}, {\'name\': \'Lungosguardo\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, Isola, Palude o Montagna, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"È pericoloso, Frodo, uscire di casa. Ti metti in strada e, se non badi a dove metti i piedi, non sai mai dove potresti ritrovarti."\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9914baa9-16d1-42e7-99ee-dbc884503303\', \'multiverseId\': 622102}, \'multiverseid\': 622102}, {\'name\': \'遥か見\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから平地や島や沼や山であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「フロドよ、自分の家の玄関を出て行くということは、危険な仕事なんだよ。道に足を踏み入れたが最後、倒れないようにちゃんと立ってなければ、どこに流されて行くかわかったもんじゃない。」\\n――ビルボ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9edb8d-42c8-449a-9832-c61effda211b\', \'multiverseId\': 622289}, \'multiverseid\': 622289}, {\'name\': \'Busca Longínqua\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície, Ilha, Pântano ou Montanha, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"É um negócio perigoso, Frodo, sair pela porta. Você põe o pé na Estrada e, se não olhar bem por onde anda, ninguém sabe onde ela pode te levar."\\n— Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb3e87cd-eadc-43f2-b766-d485401ff2a1\', \'multiverseId\': 622476}, \'multiverseid\': 622476}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenrausch-Reiter\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Flammenrausch-Reiter angreift, erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer anderen angreifenden Kreatur deiner Wahl ist. Schicke den Spielstein am Ende des Kampfes ins Exil.\\nSturmangriff {2}{R}{R} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Sturmangriff-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, erhält die Kreatur Eile und kehrt zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments aus dem Spiel auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ab05bd1-cecc-4f6a-9460-5e2be69ba7ea\', \'multiverseId\': 621513}, \'multiverseid\': 621513}, {\'name\': \'Jinete llamarrauda\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Jinete llamarrauda ataque, crea una ficha que es una copia de otra criatura atacante objetivo y que está girada y atacando. Exilia la ficha al final del combate.\\nRapidez {2}{R}{R}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de rapidez. Si lo haces, gana la habilidad de prisa y regresa del campo de batalla a la mano de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c453dde5-6e44-4da2-ba05-f215adce0444\', \'multiverseId\': 621700}, \'multiverseid\': 621700}, {\'name\': \'Cavalier courseflamme\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Cavalier courseflamme attaque, créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une autre créature attaquante ciblée, engagé et attaquant. Exilez ce jeton à la fin du combat.\\nPrécipitation {2}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de précipitation. Si vous faites ainsi, il acquiert la célérité et revient dans la main de son propriétaire depuis le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd4f6909-a748-4814-97d3-fc5fd60442ba\', \'multiverseId\': 621887}, \'multiverseid\': 621887}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliere della Carica Infuocata\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Cavaliere della Carica Infuocata attacca, crea una pedina che è una copia di un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio ed è TAPpata e attaccante. Esilia la pedina alla fine del combattimento.\\nAccelerare {2}{R}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di accelerare. Se lo fai, ha rapidità e torna in mano al suo proprietario dal campo di battaglia all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d65074e-8ced-4ae3-8a0a-739aeabc36f3\', \'multiverseId\': 622074}, \'multiverseid\': 622074}, {\'name\': \'炎駆の乗り手\', \'text\': \'炎駆の乗り手が攻撃するたび、これでない攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。そのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１体を、タップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。戦闘終了時に、そのトークンを追放する。\\n疾駆{2}{R}{R}（あなたはこの呪文を、疾駆コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これは速攻を得て、次の終了ステップの開始時に、これを戦場からオーナーの手札に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fd92642-25d7-48f7-b093-5ddda94d191f\', \'multiverseId\': 622261}, \'multiverseid\': 622261}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador Flamígero\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Saqueador Flamígero atacar, crie uma ficha virada e atacando que seja uma cópia de outra criatura atacante alvo. Exile a ficha no final do combate.\\nInvestida {2}{R}{R} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de investida. Se fizer isso, ela ganha ímpeto e é devolvida do campo de batalha para a mão de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0202c604-cbe7-43e5-ab31-3f8a8be015c9\', \'multiverseId\': 622448}, \'multiverseid\': 622448}]', '[{\'name\': \'Friedliche Bucht\', \'text\': \'Die Friedliche Bucht kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Friedliche Bucht ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Im Süden blieb das Reich Gondor lange bestehen, und für eine Weile wuchs seine Pracht, als sein Volk hohe Türme und Häfen für viele Schiffe baute.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621637&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa007e55-490d-485d-a6e3-03fc7c8c7b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 621637}, \'multiverseid\': 621637}, {\'name\': \'Cala tranquila\', \'text\': \'La Cala tranquila entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Cala tranquila entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En el sur, el reino de Gondor sobrevivió mucho tiempo y su esplendor se acrecentó durante un cierto periodo. Su gente construyó elevadas torres y refugios para muchos barcos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45606e7d-49d3-413a-a70b-4c543262d3c1\', \'multiverseId\': 621824}, \'multiverseid\': 621824}, {\'name\': \'Crique tranquille\', \'text\': \'La Crique tranquille arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Crique tranquille arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Au sud, le royaume du Gondor survécut longtemps, et pendant un temps sa splendeur s\'accrut, ses habitants érigèrent de hautes tours et des havres pour de nombreux navires.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622011&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'141a0674-7dbe-45b8-9987-e499ba2dd00c\', \'multiverseId\': 622011}, \'multiverseid\': 622011}, {\'name\': \'Baia Tranquilla\', \'text\': \'La Baia Tranquilla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Baia Tranquilla entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'A sud il reame di Gondor durò a lungo; per un certo tempo il suo splendore crebbe, grazie alle alte torri innalzate e i porti per le molte navi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8f5be19-4f00-43c7-a70c-a17ca5ff51d5\', \'multiverseId\': 622198}, \'multiverseid\': 622198}, {\'name\': \'平穏な入り江\', \'text\': \'平穏な入り江はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n平穏な入り江が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'南ではゴンドールの王国が長く続いた。しばしの間、王国の権勢は増すばかりで、人々は高い塔を建て、多くの船が出入りする港を作った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b9d62f3-2d55-4ff7-a3e0-cd67fb32472d\', \'multiverseId\': 622385}, \'multiverseid\': 622385}, {\'name\': \'Angra Tranquila\', \'text\': \'Angra Tranquila entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Angra Tranquila entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'No Sul, o reino de Gondor resistiu longamente, e por um tempo seu esplendor cresceu, com seu povo construindo torres altas e portos para muitos navios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45ed4a6-7a4b-4b8f-add2-b757d6838058\', \'multiverseId\': 622572}, \'multiverseid\': 622572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frodo, abenteuerlustiger Hobbit\', \'text\': \'Partner von Sam, treuer Leibdiener\\nWachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Frodo, abenteuerlustiger Hobbit, angreift und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, führt der Ring dich in Versuchung. Falls dann Frodo dein Ringträger ist und der Ring dich in dieser Partie zweimal oder öfter in Versuchung geführt hat, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620261&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dca2147b-fb2f-4288-b845-1fbc4331c929\', \'multiverseId\': 620261}, \'multiverseid\': 620261}, {\'name\': \'Frodo, hobbit audacieux\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Sam, serviteur loyal\\nVigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que Frodo, hobbit audacieux attaque, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, l\'Anneau vous tente. Puis si Frodo est votre porteur de l\'Anneau et que l\'Anneau vous a tenté au moins deux fois pendant cette partie, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620269&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b86d093-919c-4faa-89b7-6dc95380b6d9\', \'multiverseId\': 620269}, \'multiverseid\': 620269}, {\'name\': \'冒険好きなホビット、フロド\', \'text\': \'忠実なる従者、サムとの共闘\\n警戒\\n冒険好きなホビット、フロドが攻撃するたび、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、指輪があなたを誘惑する。その後、フロドがあなたの指輪所持者であり、このゲームで指輪があなたを２回以上誘惑していたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cfb4950-eea9-4158-93fd-c88a4b141424\', \'multiverseId\': 620277}, \'multiverseid\': 620277}, {\'name\': \'雄心霍比特人弗罗多\', \'text\': \'与忠诚随员山姆拍档\\n警戒\\n每当雄心霍比特人弗罗多攻击时，若你本回合中获得过3点或更多生命，则魔戒引诱你。然后如果弗罗多是你的持戒人，且本盘游戏中魔戒已引诱你两次或更多，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b99f7f62-c6c6-452e-a17b-2ffff9a826bb\', \'multiverseId\': 620285}, \'multiverseid\': 620285}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frodo, abenteuerlustiger Hobbit\', \'text\': \'Partner von Sam, treuer Leibdiener\\nWachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Frodo, abenteuerlustiger Hobbit, angreift und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, führt der Ring dich in Versuchung. Falls dann Frodo dein Ringträger ist und der Ring dich in dieser Partie zweimal oder öfter in Versuchung geführt hat, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620636&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df8bcf10-f921-4880-9e7d-05f224f0e11c\', \'multiverseId\': 620636}, \'multiverseid\': 620636}, {\'name\': \'Frodo, hobbit aventurero\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Sam, ayudante leal.\\nVigilancia.\\nSiempre que Frodo, hobbit aventurero ataque, si ganaste 3 o más vidas este turno, el Anillo te tienta. Luego, si Frodo es tu portador del Anillo y el Anillo te tentó dos o más veces este juego, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Explorador mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894def90-e9bf-49fc-bc95-e6e5e90acf00\', \'multiverseId\': 620640}, \'multiverseid\': 620640}, {\'name\': \'Frodo, hobbit audacieux\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Sam, serviteur loyal\\nVigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que Frodo, hobbit audacieux attaque, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, l\'Anneau vous tente. Puis si Frodo est votre porteur de l\'Anneau et que l\'Anneau vous a tenté au moins deux fois pendant cette partie, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620644&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20916de2-e850-483e-b20e-8938cb03daea\', \'multiverseId\': 620644}, \'multiverseid\': 620644}, {\'name\': \'Frodo, Hobbit Avventuroso\', \'text\': "Partner di Sam, Aiutante Leale\\nCautela\\nOgniqualvolta Frodo, Hobbit Avventuroso attacca, se hai guadagnato 3 o più punti vita in questo turno, l\'Anello ti tenta. Poi, se Frodo è il tuo Portatore dell\'Anello e l\'Anello ti ha tentato due o più volte in questa partita, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Esploratore Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea94e4bb-829f-425c-8064-a4cff194647e\', \'multiverseId\': 620648}, \'multiverseid\': 620648}, {\'name\': \'冒険好きなホビット、フロド\', \'text\': \'忠実なる従者、サムとの共闘\\n警戒\\n冒険好きなホビット、フロドが攻撃するたび、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、指輪があなたを誘惑する。その後、フロドがあなたの指輪所持者であり、このゲームで指輪があなたを２回以上誘惑していたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa62dfa-d706-4ce0-b97d-8fd5fd16dace\', \'multiverseId\': 620652}, \'multiverseid\': 620652}, {\'name\': \'Frodo, Hobbit Aventureiro\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Sam, Ajudante Leal\\nVigilância\\nToda vez que Frodo, Hobbit Aventureiro, atacar, se você ganhou 3 ou mais pontos de vida neste turno, o Anel tentará você. Depois, se Frodo for o seu Guardião do Anel e se o Anel tiver tentado você duas ou mais vezes neste jogo, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c5d04b-1c0d-4b75-9c42-3a235b950365\', \'multiverseId\': 620656}, \'multiverseid\': 620656}, {\'name\': \'雄心霍比特人弗罗多\', \'text\': \'与忠诚随员山姆拍档\\n警戒\\n每当雄心霍比特人弗罗多攻击时，若你本回合中获得过3点或更多生命，则魔戒引诱你。然后如果弗罗多是你的持戒人，且本盘游戏中魔戒已引诱你两次或更多，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a02c937a-b8ce-4958-95a7-559a93085e07\', \'multiverseId\': 620660}, \'multiverseid\': 620660}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frontarzt\', \'text\': \'Bataillon — Immer wenn der Frontarzt und mindestens zwei andere Kreaturen angreifen, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nOpfere den Frontarzt: Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl mit {X} in seinen Manakosten, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Welt ist voll genug von Schmerz und Unglück, auch ohne Kriege, die sie vervielfachen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621466&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'927978d8-7da9-442b-b24c-536e7b639850\', \'multiverseId\': 621466}, \'multiverseid\': 621466}, {\'name\': \'Médico de primera línea\', \'text\': \'Batallón — Siempre que el Médico de primera línea y al menos otras dos criaturas ataquen, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nSacrificar el Médico de primera línea: Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo con {X} en su coste de maná a menos que su controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El mundo tiene ya suficiente dolor y desgracias sin guerras que las multipliquen".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f84d28b6-9646-4240-8291-c7e20865a2e4\', \'multiverseId\': 621653}, \'multiverseid\': 621653}, {\'name\': \'Carabin du front\', \'text\': "Bataillon — À chaque fois que le Carabin du front et au moins deux autres créatures attaquent, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nSacrifiez le Carabin du front : Contrecarrez un sort ciblé avec {X} dans son coût de mana à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Le monde subit assez de blessures et de mésaventures sans les guerres pour les multiplier. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621840&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20a16966-fec0-4f25-bebe-c203f65b65e8\', \'multiverseId\': 621840}, \'multiverseid\': 621840}, {\'name\': \'Medico in Prima Linea\', \'text\': \'Battaglione — Ogniqualvolta il Medico in Prima Linea e almeno altre due creature attaccano, le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nSacrifica il Medico in Prima Linea: Neutralizza una magia bersaglio con {X} nel suo costo di mana a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mondo è pieno di dolore e disgrazie anche senza le guerre che li moltiplicano."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410516f9-6b96-4083-89e3-d3094648b0ea\', \'multiverseId\': 622027}, \'multiverseid\': 622027}, {\'name\': \'前線の衛生兵\', \'text\': \'大隊 ― 前線の衛生兵と、これでない２体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\\n前線の衛生兵を生け贄に捧げる：マナ・コストに{X}を含む呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「戦によって倍にされずとも、この世には充分すぎるほど傷や不幸が満ちみちております。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ec904a2-6327-4f14-8fcf-4503d3fbeb7e\', \'multiverseId\': 622214}, \'multiverseid\': 622214}, {\'name\': \'Médico da Linha de Frente\', \'text\': \'Batalhão — Toda vez que Médico da Linha de Frente e pelo menos duas outras criaturas atacam, as criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\\nSacrifique Médico da Linha de Frente: Anule a mágica alvo com {X} no custo de mana, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"O mundo já é cheio de mágoas e infortúnios suficientes sem guerras para multiplicá-los."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da83067c-745d-4f3c-bfdb-e48d34cc2e44\', \'multiverseId\': 622401}, \'multiverseid\': 622401}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkelnder Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af9ab6c5-ba17-44eb-8b92-353c97e0072d\', \'multiverseId\': 621524}, \'multiverseid\': 621524}, {\'name\': \'Ímpetu brillante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, creas una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'682d6cf3-423d-4b42-8eba-98da4f1f43cc\', \'multiverseId\': 621711}, \'multiverseid\': 621711}, {\'name\': \'Impetus brillant\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, vous créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621898&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f453b7f6-8fb5-4b80-a16e-7df195fa869c\', \'multiverseId\': 621898}, \'multiverseid\': 621898}, {\'name\': \'Impeto Lucente\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, crei una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16926ada-877f-468a-bd36-617250b8e7cd\', \'multiverseId\': 622085}, \'multiverseid\': 622085}, {\'name\': \'輝光の推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、使嗾される。（それは各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b996f365-e3f9-4248-b3b9-806c147ca2a0\', \'multiverseId\': 622272}, \'multiverseid\': 622272}, {\'name\': \'Ímpeto Brilhante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, você cria uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c09b036-a3de-4295-9ff7-cdb798de1077\', \'multiverseId\': 622459}, \'multiverseid\': 622459}]', '[{\'name\': \'Futter für den Schwarm\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags jener bleibenden Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir fanden viele aus unserem Volk erschlagen, die dorthin geflohen waren."\\n—Reiter von Rohan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621497&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4cb73f5-2a70-4bf9-9aa2-81f6b9706523\', \'multiverseId\': 621497}, \'multiverseid\': 621497}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar al enjambre\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo que controla un oponente. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hallamos muertos a muchos de nuestros hombres que trataron de huir en esa dirección".\\n—Jinete de Rohan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de06a263-ffa3-458a-a103-b3b9fd03eb42\', \'multiverseId\': 621684}, \'multiverseid\': 621684}, {\'name\': "Nourrir l\'essaim", \'text\': "Détruisez une cible, créature ou enchantement, qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Nous avons retrouvé beaucoup des nôtres abattus alors qu\'ils fuyaient par là. »\\n—Cavalier du Rohan", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f107c7a-33f8-473e-a1c4-e0ac571c9ba3\', \'multiverseId\': 621871}, \'multiverseid\': 621871}, {\'name\': \'Nutrire lo Sciame\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio controllati da un avversario. Perdi punti vita pari al valore di mana di quel permanente.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Abbiamo trovato molti dei nostri uccisi nella fuga."\\n—Cavaliere di Rohan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'940f9f72-cb06-4803-ba0f-6215b3d24ad1\', \'multiverseId\': 622058}, \'multiverseid\': 622058}, {\'name\': \'大群への給餌\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは、そのパーマネントのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我らは、逃げる途中で殺された民の亡骸を、たくさん見つけた。」\\n――ローハンの乗り手\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f3c8bf-ee05-4449-974a-248111254475\', \'multiverseId\': 622245}, \'multiverseid\': 622245}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar o Enxame\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou o encantamento alvo que um oponente controla. Você perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana daquela permanente.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Encontramos muitos dos nossos, mortos ao fugirem para lá."\\n— Cavaleiro de Rohan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'177efba5-8f12-4e99-9613-a898eaf281b3\', \'multiverseId\': 622432}, \'multiverseid\': 622432}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fürst der Nazgûl\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWraiths, die du kontrollierst, haben Schutz vor Ringträgern.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 3/3 schwarzen Wraith-Kreaturenspielstein mit Bedrohlichkeit. Falls du dann neun oder mehr Wraiths kontrollierst, haben Wraiths, die du kontrollierst, Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 9/9 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Wraith, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620408&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23410035-67b7-4aa7-acf2-a22217929a3f\', \'multiverseId\': 620408}, \'multiverseid\': 620408}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur des Nazgûl\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes apparitions que vous contrôlez ont la protection contre les porteurs de l\'Anneau.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 noire Apparition avec la menace. Puis si vous contrôlez au moins neuf apparitions, les apparitions que vous contrôlez ont une force et endurance de base de 9/9 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : apparition et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfe0657b-0ae4-4b0b-939e-76d9faa5f6b2\', \'multiverseId\': 620476}, \'multiverseid\': 620476}, {\'name\': \'ナズグルの首領\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのレイスはプロテクション（指輪所持者）を持つ。\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、威迫を持つ黒の３/３のレイス・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、あなたが９体以上のレイスをコントロールしているなら、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのレイスの基本のパワーとタフネスは９/９になる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — レイス・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80a2060c-ff53-4909-9917-cf02dfc3f7b0\', \'multiverseId\': 620544}, \'multiverseid\': 620544}, {\'name\': \'那兹古尔领主\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n由你操控的鬼魂具有反持戒人保护异能。\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个3/3黑色，具威慑异能的鬼魂衍生生物。然后若你操控九个或更多鬼魂，则由你操控的鬼魂之基础力量与防御力为9/9直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼魂／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca3c3a1-fa9c-4211-b8e5-47a2b3ed93d6\', \'multiverseId\': 620612}, \'multiverseid\': 620612}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fürst der Nazgûl\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWraiths, die du kontrollierst, haben Schutz vor Ringträgern.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 3/3 schwarzen Wraith-Kreaturenspielstein mit Bedrohlichkeit. Falls du dann neun oder mehr Wraiths kontrollierst, haben Wraiths, die du kontrollierst, Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 9/9 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Wraith, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620818&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6daf115e-c823-4e12-b6b1-bce596dabfa1\', \'multiverseId\': 620818}, \'multiverseid\': 620818}, {\'name\': \'Señor de los Nazgûl\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLas Apariciones que controlas tienen protección contra portadores del Anillo.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Aparición negra 3/3 con la habilidad de amenaza. Luego, si controlas nueve o más Apariciones, las Apariciones que controlas tienen una fuerza y resistencia base de 9/9 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble aparición\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4eadab7-a58a-4ece-a747-a208e0cd0352\', \'multiverseId\': 620890}, \'multiverseid\': 620890}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur des Nazgûl\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes apparitions que vous contrôlez ont la protection contre les porteurs de l\'Anneau.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 noire Apparition avec la menace. Puis si vous contrôlez au moins neuf apparitions, les apparitions que vous contrôlez ont une force et endurance de base de 9/9 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : apparition et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620962&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983191d0-d4e3-4de3-a45b-9ef12d502d67\', \'multiverseId\': 620962}, \'multiverseid\': 620962}, {\'name\': \'Signore dei Nazgûl\', \'text\': "Volare\\nI Necrospettri che controlli hanno protezione dai Portatori dell\'Anello.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura Necrospettro 3/3 nera con minacciare. Poi, se controlli nove o più Necrospettri, i Necrospettri che controlli hanno forza e costituzione base 9/9 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Necrospettro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c496ab09-7500-4b7c-8087-f566b2d403bc\', \'multiverseId\': 621034}, \'multiverseid\': 621034}, {\'name\': \'ナズグルの首領\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのレイスはプロテクション（指輪所持者）を持つ。\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、威迫を持つ黒の３/３のレイス・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、あなたが９体以上のレイスをコントロールしているなら、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのレイスの基本のパワーとタフネスは９/９になる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — レイス・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b24e61fa-99cb-4864-a8d2-15619998b72f\', \'multiverseId\': 621106}, \'multiverseid\': 621106}, {\'name\': \'Senhor dos Nazgûl\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAs Aparições que você controla têm proteção contra Guardiões do Anel.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, crie uma ficha de criatura Aparição preta 3/3 com ameaçar. Depois, se você controla nove ou mais Aparições, as Aparições que você controla têm poder e resistência básicos 9/9 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Aparição Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f6b0b31-a0bb-4b70-9645-794eff229d73\', \'multiverseId\': 621178}, \'multiverseid\': 621178}, {\'name\': \'那兹古尔领主\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n由你操控的鬼魂具有反持戒人保护异能。\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个3/3黑色，具威慑异能的鬼魂衍生生物。然后若你操控九个或更多鬼魂，则由你操控的鬼魂之基础力量与防御力为9/9直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼魂／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309715bd-3125-4937-94d8-a2cc7b69efad\', \'multiverseId\': 621250}, \'multiverseid\': 621250}]', '[{\'name\': \'Galadriel, Königin der Elben\', \'text\': \'Wille des Konzils — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls in diesem Zug ein anderer Elf unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, stimmt jeder Spieler, beginnend mit dir, für Herrschaft oder Ratschlag. Falls Herrschaft mehr Stimmen erhält, führt der Ring dich in Versuchung, dann legst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf deinen Ringträger. Bei Gleichstand oder falls Ratschlag mehr Stimmen erhält, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620262&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d269123e-1a66-4318-84f8-6497718c7be2\', \'multiverseId\': 620262}, \'multiverseid\': 620262}, {\'name\': \'Galadriel, reine elfe\', \'text\': "Volonté du conseil — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si un autre elfe est arrivé sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, en commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour domination ou conseils. Si domination gagne plus de votes, l\'Anneau vous tente, puis vous mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur votre porteur de l\'Anneau. Si conseils gagne plus de votes ou que les votes sont à égalité, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620270&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7618aef-2b3f-4976-a293-a770c16fc9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 620270}, \'multiverseid\': 620270}, {\'name\': \'エルフの女王、ガラドリエル\', \'text\': \'議決 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、このターンにこれでないエルフ１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがある場合、あなたから開始して各プレイヤーは「支配」か「導き」のいずれかに投票する。「支配」がより多くの票を得たなら、指輪があなたを誘惑し、その後、あなたはあなたの指輪所持者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。「導き」がより多くの票を得るか同数だったなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb9abb6e-6eaa-4b97-a978-96ba03b3fc3b\', \'multiverseId\': 620278}, \'multiverseid\': 620278}, {\'name\': \'精灵女王加拉德瑞尔\', \'text\': \'议定～在你回合的战斗开始时，若本回合中有另一个妖精在你的操控下进战场，则由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「占有」或「指引」。若占有票数较多，则魔戒引诱你，然后你在你的持戒人上放置一个+1/+1指示物。若指引票数较多或两者同为最多，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f0dbea5-d621-4877-b41f-0183bb9aa2da\', \'multiverseId\': 620286}, \'multiverseid\': 620286}]', '[{\'name\': \'Galadriel, Königin der Elben\', \'text\': \'Wille des Konzils — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls in diesem Zug ein anderer Elf unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, stimmt jeder Spieler, beginnend mit dir, für Herrschaft oder Ratschlag. Falls Herrschaft mehr Stimmen erhält, führt der Ring dich in Versuchung, dann legst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf deinen Ringträger. Bei Gleichstand oder falls Ratschlag mehr Stimmen erhält, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620637&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7162ebb-54f3-439a-a179-e60c9c80bf98\', \'multiverseId\': 620637}, \'multiverseid\': 620637}, {\'name\': \'Galadriel, reina de los elfos\', \'text\': \'Voluntad del consejo — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si otro Elfo entró al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, comenzando contigo, cada jugador vota dominio o tutela. Si dominio consigue más votos, el Anillo te tienta y luego pones un contador +1/+1 sobre tu portador del Anillo. Si tutela consigue más votos o el voto acaba en empate, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce255af3-15ab-4c28-bcc2-af19617deb05\', \'multiverseId\': 620641}, \'multiverseid\': 620641}, {\'name\': \'Galadriel, reine elfe\', \'text\': "Volonté du conseil — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si un autre elfe est arrivé sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, en commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour domination ou conseils. Si domination gagne plus de votes, l\'Anneau vous tente, puis vous mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur votre porteur de l\'Anneau. Si conseils gagne plus de votes ou que les votes sont à égalité, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620645&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f61f087-393d-4f69-9b4b-f5244f8f0254\', \'multiverseId\': 620645}, \'multiverseid\': 620645}, {\'name\': \'Galadriel, Regina Elfica\', \'text\': "Volontà del concilio — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se un altro Elfo è entrato nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, a partire da te, ogni giocatore vota per il dominio o la guida. Se il dominio ottiene più voti, l\'Anello ti tenta, poi metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul tuo Portatore dell\'Anello. Se la guida ottiene più voti o il voto è un pareggio, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce05ed5-caa2-407f-b209-51211ccfed97\', \'multiverseId\': 620649}, \'multiverseid\': 620649}, {\'name\': \'エルフの女王、ガラドリエル\', \'text\': \'議決 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、このターンにこれでないエルフ１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがある場合、あなたから開始して各プレイヤーは「支配」か「導き」のいずれかに投票する。「支配」がより多くの票を得たなら、指輪があなたを誘惑し、その後、あなたはあなたの指輪所持者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。「導き」がより多くの票を得るか同数だったなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3ae5a91-0d65-4df7-8cd9-dcdd801ec9ef\', \'multiverseId\': 620653}, \'multiverseid\': 620653}, {\'name\': \'Galadriel, Rainha Élfica\', \'text\': \'Vontade do conselho — No início do combate no seu turno, se outro Elfo tiver entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, começando por você, cada jogador vota por domínio ou orientação. Se domínio tiver mais votos, o Anel tentará você e, em seguida, você colocará um marcador +1/+1 em seu Guardião do Anel. Se orientação tiver mais votos ou se a votação estiver empatada, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4807b9d5-07ba-476f-b258-dd197e6a2808\', \'multiverseId\': 620657}, \'multiverseid\': 620657}, {\'name\': \'精灵女王加拉德瑞尔\', \'text\': \'议定～在你回合的战斗开始时，若本回合中有另一个妖精在你的操控下进战场，则由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「占有」或「指引」。若占有票数较多，则魔戒引诱你，然后你在你的持戒人上放置一个+1/+1指示物。若指引票数较多或两者同为最多，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0eb5a6-a1df-462d-9075-9b786977f8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 620661}, \'multiverseid\': 620661}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gandalf, Reisender gen Westen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag 5 oder mehr wirkst, zeigt jeder Gegner die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek offen vor. Falls eine der vorgezeigten Karten einen Kartentyp mit dem gewirkten Zauberspruch gemeinsam hat, kopiere ihn, du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen, und jeder Gegner zieht eine Karte. Anderenfalls ziehst du eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'596e2413-cc71-4808-a0fb-3919344e830d\', \'multiverseId\': 620263}, \'multiverseid\': 620263}, {\'name\': "Gandalf, voyageur vers l\'ouest", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 5, chaque adversaire révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si l\'une de ces cartes partage un type de carte avec ce sort, copiez ce sort, vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour la copie, et chaque adversaire pioche une carte. Sinon, vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620271&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e432aded-f875-4644-b60c-8c902c0aacf1\', \'multiverseId\': 620271}, \'multiverseid\': 620271}, {\'name\': \'西方への航海者、ガンダルフ\', \'text\': \'あなたがマナ総量が５以上である呪文を唱えるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それらの中にその呪文と共通のカード・タイプを持つカードがあったなら、「その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を引く。」を行う。そうでないなら、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eb08eca-05c8-4112-9a4d-fc8389a9897a\', \'multiverseId\': 620279}, \'multiverseid\': 620279}, {\'name\': \'西行旅者甘道夫\', \'text\': \'每当你施放法术力值等于或大于5的咒语时，每位对手各展示其牌库顶牌。若其中任一牌与该咒语具共通的牌张类别，则复制该咒语，你可以为复制品选择新的目标，且每位对手各抓一张牌。若否，则你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f339a678-1719-4fcb-957a-08084ed76e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 620287}, \'multiverseid\': 620287}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gandalf, Reisender gen Westen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag 5 oder mehr wirkst, zeigt jeder Gegner die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek offen vor. Falls eine der vorgezeigten Karten einen Kartentyp mit dem gewirkten Zauberspruch gemeinsam hat, kopiere ihn, du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen, und jeder Gegner zieht eine Karte. Ziehe sonst eine Karte. (Eine Kopie eines Bleibende-Karte-Zauberspruchs wird zu einem Spielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620668&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b6c906-2280-4cf3-a71a-1db1dc61fdf9\', \'multiverseId\': 620668}, \'multiverseid\': 620668}, {\'name\': \'Gandalf, viajero hacia el Oeste\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo con valor de maná de 5 o más, cada oponente muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si cualesquiera de esas cartas comparten un tipo de carta con ese hechizo, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia y cada oponente roba una carta. De lo contrario, robas una carta. (Una copia de un hechizo de permanente se convierte en una ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71752b61-c6a6-46d8-9de9-c79de6cf7d5d\', \'multiverseId\': 620672}, \'multiverseid\': 620672}, {\'name\': "Gandalf, voyageur vers l\'ouest", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 5, chaque adversaire révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si l\'une de ces cartes partage un type de carte avec ce sort, copiez ce sort, vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour la copie, et chaque adversaire pioche une carte. Sinon, vous piochez une carte. (Une copie d\'un sort de permanent devient un jeton.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620676&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62165b99-2e39-4ce0-b6b7-75b56c1529cb\', \'multiverseId\': 620676}, \'multiverseid\': 620676}, {\'name\': \'Gandalf, Viaggiatore a Ovest\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia con valore di mana pari o superiore a 5, ogni avversario rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio. Se una qualsiasi di quelle carte condivide un tipo di carta con quella magia, copia quella magia, puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia, e ogni avversario pesca una carta. Altrimenti, peschi una carta. (Una copia di una magia permanente diventa una pedina.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'236cce6b-b946-4eb3-bf2a-e6ce46f880a9\', \'multiverseId\': 620680}, \'multiverseid\': 620680}, {\'name\': \'西方への航海者、ガンダルフ\', \'text\': \'あなたがマナ総量が５以上である呪文を唱えるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それらの中にその呪文と共通のカード・タイプを持つカードがあったなら、「その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を引く。」を行う。そうでないなら、あなたはカード１枚を引く。（パーマネント・呪文のコピーはトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53896e50-015d-45f5-9be8-d7bbb480831e\', \'multiverseId\': 620684}, \'multiverseid\': 620684}, {\'name\': \'Gandalf, Viajante Rumo ao Oeste\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica com valor de mana igual ou superior a 5, cada oponente revela o card no topo do próprio grimório. Se qualquer desses cards compartilhar um tipo de card com aquela mágica, copie aquela mágica, você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia e cada oponente compra um card. Caso contrário, você compra um card. (Uma cópia de uma mágica de permanente torna-se uma ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Avatar Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f371e64d-28ad-451c-bcbe-031333604940\', \'multiverseId\': 620688}, \'multiverseid\': 620688}, {\'name\': \'西行旅者甘道夫\', \'text\': \'每当你施放法术力值等于或大于5的咒语时，每位对手各展示其牌库顶牌。若其中任一牌与该咒语具共通的牌张类别，则复制该咒语，你可以为复制品选择新的目标，且每位对手各抓一张牌。若否，则你抓一张牌。（永久物咒语的复制品会成为衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dde7131-b179-4b34-b1cb-f5b7df417196\', \'multiverseId\': 620692}, \'multiverseid\': 620692}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankendieb\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFalls ein Gegner eine Karte ziehen würde, abgesehen von der ersten, die er in jedem seiner Ziehsegmente zieht, übergeht er stattdessen jenes Kartenziehen und du ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist also euer Tonfall, wie? Ändert ihn, oder wir ändern ihn für euch. Ihr kleinen Leute werdet zu hochnäsig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621567&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'184aed28-d038-4488-8b98-17fe5151857f\', \'multiverseId\': 621567}, \'multiverseid\': 621567}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de creencias\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSi un oponente fuera a robar una carta excepto la primera que roba en sus pasos de robar, en vez de eso, ese jugador se salta ese robo y tú robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuidado con ese tono. O lo cambias o te lo cambiamos. La gente pequeña se lo tiene muy creído".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f30afb-0159-46a5-aded-72154438b76f\', \'multiverseId\': 621754}, \'multiverseid\': 621754}, {\'name\': \'Voleur de notion\', \'text\': "Flash\\nSi un adversaire devait piocher une carte excepté la première qu\'il pioche à chacune de ses étapes de pioche, ce joueur passe cette pioche et vous piochez une carte à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous le prenez sur ce ton, hein ? Va falloir en changer, ou on le fera pour vous. Vous, les petites personnes, vous devenez trop arrogants. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621941&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'391ba9ec-4502-4a92-8ae3-c6a326895a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 621941}, \'multiverseid\': 621941}, {\'name\': \'Ladro di Concetti\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nSe un avversario sta per pescare una carta, tranne la prima che pesca in ogni sua sottofase di acquisizione, quel giocatore salta invece quella pescata e tu peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La prendete su questo tono? Fareste bene a cambiarlo o ve lo faremo cambiare noi. Voi piccoletti state diventando troppo sfrontati."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'584e5557-9e9f-4880-b809-292a0474e33a\', \'multiverseId\': 622128}, \'multiverseid\': 622128}, {\'name\': \'概念泥棒\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n対戦相手が、自分の各ドロー・ステップ内で初めて引くカード以外のカード１枚を引くなら、代わりに、そのプレイヤーはそれを飛ばし、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「それがてめえの口の利きかたか？口の利きようを変えねえなら、こっちが変えてやるぜ。お前ら小せえ連中は少々つけあがってやがる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b342ff-6f5e-4cea-afde-557f207107ca\', \'multiverseId\': 622315}, \'multiverseid\': 622315}, {\'name\': \'Ladrão de Noção\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nSe um oponente for comprar um card que não seja o primeiro de cada etapa de compra, em vez disso, aquele jogador pula aquela compra e você compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"É esse o seu tom, é? Mude-o, ou eu mudarei por você. Vocês gente pequena estão ficando arrogantes demais."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ccdee2b-4d1e-4c83-bf8b-39877ea2db23\', \'multiverseId\': 622502}, \'multiverseid\': 622502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankengefäß\', \'text\': \'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Widerwillig gestattete mir Fürst Denethor, seine gehorteten Schriftrollen und Bücher zu durchsuchen."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43db7c7b-27c5-47ed-b3dc-f960de2863db\', \'multiverseId\': 621584}, \'multiverseid\': 621584}, {\'name\': \'Vasija de pensamientos\', \'text\': \'Tu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"El señor Denethor me permitió de mala gana que buscara en su montón de pergaminos y libros".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f775a8-8d2a-4bfb-b824-0b19d8dca681\', \'multiverseId\': 621771}, \'multiverseid\': 621771}, {\'name\': \'Urne de pensée\', \'text\': "Il n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« À contrecœur, le seigneur Denethor m\'autorisa à faire des recherches dans sa collection de tomes et de parchemins. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621958&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03550742-4be1-4dd5-8825-2ba5a23a8789\', \'multiverseId\': 621958}, \'multiverseid\': 621958}, {\'name\': \'Ricettacolo di Pensieri\', \'text\': \'Non hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Sire Denethor mi permise a malincuore di cercare tra le sue pergamene ammonticchiate e i suoi libri."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc1890a-eee0-42ef-af28-3d2842d74f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 622145}, \'multiverseid\': 622145}, {\'name\': \'思考の器\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「デネソール侯は、秘蔵する本や巻物を調べたいというわしの頼みを、いやいやながら許してくれた。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d75de50-ebc0-4217-9068-27279d40cb58\', \'multiverseId\': 622332}, \'multiverseid\': 622332}, {\'name\': \'Receptáculo de Pensamentos\', \'text\': \'Não há limite para o número máximo de cards em sua mão.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A contragosto, o Senhor Denethor me permitiu pesquisar nos pergaminhos e livros que ele acumulara."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ca5eb0a-2535-48ad-b6f6-a859acb24e2e\', \'multiverseId\': 622519}, \'multiverseid\': 622519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Jahre hatten an der Statue genagt, und gewaltsame Hände hatten sie verstümmelt. Ihr Kopf fehlte, und an seiner Stelle war zum Spott ein grob behauener runder Stein aufgesetzt, roh bemalt mit dem Abbild eines grinsenden Gesichts mit einem großen Auge in der Mitte der Stirn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bce6853-8866-4983-94ba-c5d48ea51b86\', \'multiverseId\': 621579}, \'multiverseid\': 621579}, {\'name\': \'Piedra mental\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Piedra mental: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los años la habían carcomido y unas manos violentas la habían mutilado. La habían decapitado y, en lugar de su cabeza, habían puesto como burla una piedra redonda, áspera y toscamente pintada que simulaba una cara de espanto con un ojo enorme en medio de la frente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bad30a2a-2513-4b60-82fa-7d49e37f37c0\', \'multiverseId\': 621766}, \'multiverseid\': 621766}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les années l\'avait érodée, et de violentes mains l\'avaient mutilée. Elle avait perdu sa tête, et à la place en dérision se trouvait une pierre ronde inégale, peinte grossièrement pour ressembler à un visage grimaçant portant un gros œil unique au milieu du front.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621953&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd536b8-b949-49a3-85d5-97a56fca343e\', \'multiverseId\': 621953}, \'multiverseid\': 621953}, {\'name\': \'Pietra della Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra della Mente: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Gli anni l\'avevano consumata e delle mani crudeli mutilata. La testa era stata sostituita in segno di scherno da una rozza pietra, volgarmente dipinta con le sembianze di una faccia sghignazzante con un unico grande occhio in mezzo alla fronte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3195f6cf-e27c-447c-b76a-483f5dc62c67\', \'multiverseId\': 622140}, \'multiverseid\': 622140}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'歳月がこれを蝕み、乱暴な手がこれを壊していた。頭は失われ、それを嘲りまねて粗く削った丸石が載っていた。そこにはぞんざいに、額の真ん中に大きな赤い一つ目を備え、にたりと笑った顔が描かれていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcf3acd4-d457-42a6-9d08-def9d3e6b2db\', \'multiverseId\': 622327}, \'multiverseid\': 622327}, {\'name\': \'Pedra da Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Pedra da Mente: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os anos a tinham corroído, e mãos violentas a haviam mutilado. A cabeça se fora, e em seu lugar fora posta em escárnio uma tosca pedra redonda, pintada de modo grosseiro como um rosto sorridente e um grande olho no meio da testa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'844f3571-ce1d-436f-9081-638aaf1681a6\', \'multiverseId\': 622514}, \'multiverseid\': 622514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geiselnehmerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Geiselnehmerin ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine andere Kreatur oder ein anderes Artefakt deiner Wahl ins Exil, bis die Geiselnehmerin das Spiel verlässt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und du kannst Mana beliebiger Typen ausgeben, um sie zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'Umbar war ein Zufluchtsort für alle Feinde Gondors — eine Bedrohung für seine Küstenlande und für jegliche Schifffahrt auf dem Meer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621565&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25a8794b-9716-4fe4-9d16-3482332e93ab\', \'multiverseId\': 621565}, \'multiverseid\': 621565}, {\'name\': \'Secuestradora\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Secuestradora entre al campo de batalla, exilia otra criatura o artefacto objetivo hasta que la Secuestradora deje el campo de batalla. Puedes lanzar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'Umbar era un refugio para todo enemigo de Gondor y una amenaza para las costas y el tráfico marítimo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30abb603-149f-418b-aa66-c11771765401\', \'multiverseId\': 621752}, \'multiverseid\': 621752}, {\'name\': "Preneuse d\'otage", \'text\': "Quand la Preneuse d\'otage arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une autre cible, créature ou artefact, jusqu\'à ce que la Preneuse d\'otage quitte le champ de bataille. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour la lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': "Umbar était un refuge pour tous les ennemis du Gondor, une menace pour ses côtes et l\'ensemble du commerce maritime.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621939&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'216089c7-9f28-47df-a3b9-6a0f6b18638c\', \'multiverseId\': 621939}, \'multiverseid\': 621939}, {\'name\': \'Sequestratrice di Ostaggi\', \'text\': "Quando la Sequestratrice di Ostaggi entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un altro artefatto o un\'altra creatura bersaglio finché la Sequestratrice di Ostaggi non lascia il campo di battaglia. Puoi lanciare quella carta fintanto che rimane esiliata e puoi spendere mana di qualsiasi tipo per lanciarla.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Umbar era un rifugio per tutti i nemici di Gondor: una minaccia per le sue coste e per tutto il commercio marittimo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e51548ca-dd23-4104-8368-33b51b0d0ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 622126}, \'multiverseid\': 622126}, {\'name\': \'人質取り\', \'text\': \'人質取りが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやアーティファクトのうちこれでない１つを対象とする。人質取りが戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよい。あなたはそれを唱えるためにマナを望むタイプのマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'ウンバールはゴンドールの敵すべての避難場所であり、その沿岸地方およびすべての海上交通にとって脅威であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8030bbdf-53ca-44ae-a609-9fe8a9343904\', \'multiverseId\': 622313}, \'multiverseid\': 622313}, {\'name\': \'Tomadora de Reféns\', \'text\': \'Quando Tomadora de Reféns entrar no campo de batalha, exile outra criatura ou artefato alvo até que Tomadora de Reféns deixe o campo de batalha. Você pode conjurar aquele card enquanto ele permanecer exilado, e pode gastar mana de qualquer tipo para conjurá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Pirata\', \'flavor\': \'Umbar era um refúgio para todos os inimigos de Gondor, uma ameaça a sua costa e a todo o tráfego marítimo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d59a72a-6df7-4c7c-bb02-f706569c7697\', \'multiverseId\': 622500}, \'multiverseid\': 622500}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geisterviertel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, opfere das Geisterviertel: Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl. Sein Beherrscher kann seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Das Licht war grau, denn die Sonne war noch nicht über die schwarzen Grate des verwunschenen Berges gestiegen, der vor ihnen lag.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6850374e-4844-4d08-a29b-0f3ea695aade\', \'multiverseId\': 621611}, \'multiverseid\': 621611}, {\'name\': \'Cuartel fantasmal\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Cuartel fantasmal: Destruye la tierra objetivo. Su controlador puede buscar en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La luz era gris, ya que el sol no había trepado aún por las crestas negras del Monte de los Espectros que se encontraba frente a ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d770ab-6f22-4880-913c-38bb3ddaa256\', \'multiverseId\': 621798}, \'multiverseid\': 621798}, {\'name\': \'Quartier fantôme\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifiez le Quartier fantôme : Détruisez un terrain ciblé. Son contrôleur peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille, puis mélanger.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La lumière était grise, car le soleil n\'était pas encore passé au-dessus des crêtes noires de la Montagne Hantée qui se dressait devant eux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621985&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e859f2c7-23ad-45c8-a9a7-6066d5b2c39e\', \'multiverseId\': 621985}, \'multiverseid\': 621985}, {\'name\': \'Quartiere Fantasma\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifica il Quartiere Fantasma: Distruggi una terra bersaglio. Il suo controllore può passare in rassegna il proprio grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Il cielo era grigio, poiché il sole non aveva ancora scavalcato le nere creste del Monte Invasato davanti a loro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'512a4b37-5f18-42d3-81da-ca28e09d5fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 622172}, \'multiverseid\': 622172}, {\'name\': \'幽霊街\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, 幽霊街を生け贄に捧げる：土地１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは「自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'光はまだ薄暗かった。太陽はまだ、彼らの前に聳える精霊山の、黒々とした山の峯まで昇っていなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a243a9f-6f02-4385-bfe3-20b4cb748953\', \'multiverseId\': 622359}, \'multiverseid\': 622359}, {\'name\': \'Quarteirão Fantasma\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifique Quarteirão Fantasma: Destrua o terreno alvo. Seu controlador pode procurar no próprio grimório um card de terreno básico, colocá-lo no campo de batalha e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A luz era cinzenta, pois o sol ainda não subira acima dos cumes negros da Montanha Assombrada diante deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7d060ad-d27d-49c5-8382-70c985eae615\', \'multiverseId\': 622546}, \'multiverseid\': 622546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geißel des Throns\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Entthronen (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nImmer wenn die Geißel des Throns zum ersten Mal in einem Zug angreift und falls sie einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten angreift, enttappe alle angreifenden Kreaturen. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621522&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ec7003b-29ec-4c7b-92c3-ad24b7e97e21\', \'multiverseId\': 621522}, \'multiverseid\': 621522}, {\'name\': \'Flagelo del trono\', \'text\': \'Vuela, destronar. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque al jugador con mayor cantidad de vidas o empatado con la mayor cantidad de vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nSiempre que el Flagelo del trono ataque por primera vez cada turno, si está atacando al jugador con mayor cantidad de vidas o empatado con la mayor cantidad de vidas, endereza todas las criaturas atacantes. Después de esta fase, hay una fase de combate adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28423f62-5244-40d6-b356-849d4a912a35\', \'multiverseId\': 621709}, \'multiverseid\': 621709}, {\'name\': \'Fléau du trône\', \'text\': "Vol, détrônement (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque le joueur qui a le total de points de vie le plus élevé ou qui partage le total de points de vie le plus élevé, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Fléau du trône attaque pour la première fois à chaque tour, s\'il attaque le joueur qui a le total de points de vie le plus élevé ou qui partage le total de points de vie le plus élevé, dégagez toutes les créatures attaquantes. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621896&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af432b8b-9019-4f18-bff1-765d8845ed95\', \'multiverseId\': 621896}, \'multiverseid\': 621896}, {\'name\': \'Flagello del Trono\', \'text\': "Volare, spodestare (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca il giocatore con più punti vita o con più punti vita a pari merito con un altro giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Flagello del Trono attacca per la prima volta in ogni turno, se sta attaccando il giocatore con più punti vita o con più punti vita a pari merito con un altro giocatore, STAPpa tutte le creature attaccanti. Dopo questa fase, c\'è una fase di combattimento addizionale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa6c25b9-2dc4-462a-9c8c-ae28b39d8ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 622083}, \'multiverseid\': 622083}, {\'name\': \'玉座の災い魔\', \'text\': \'飛行、廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n玉座の災い魔が各ターン最初に攻撃するたび、これが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃している場合、すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509414f2-44e9-42d2-a883-db0ed7044ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 622270}, \'multiverseid\': 622270}, {\'name\': \'Flagelo do Trono\', \'text\': \'Voar, destronar (Toda vez que esta criatura atacar o jogador com mais pontos de vida ou empatado pelo maior total de pontos de vida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela.)\\nToda vez que Flagelo do Trono atacar pela primeira vez a cada turno, se ele estiver atacando um jogador com mais pontos de vida ou empatado pelo maior total de pontos de vida, desvire todas as criaturas atacantes. Depois dessa fase, há uma fase de combate adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7dc4f18-6e50-4e82-a7b3-da98bed58616\', \'multiverseId\': 622457}, \'multiverseid\': 622457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geliebter Verstorbener\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange der Geliebte Verstorbene in deinem Friedhof ist, kommt jede Mensch-Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Häuser der Toten sind kein Ort für die Lebenden."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621462&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e21703e6-0f7f-429f-803f-af0c9c5a1215\', \'multiverseId\': 621462}, \'multiverseid\': 621462}, {\'name\': \'Difuntos amados\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMientras los Difuntos amados estén en tu cementerio, cada criatura Humano que controlas entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Los hogares de los muertos no son sitios para los vivos".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b02a2dcd-b3d1-4a85-9780-7f21a0a80011\', \'multiverseId\': 621649}, \'multiverseid\': 621649}, {\'name\': \'Chers disparus\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nTant que les Chers disparus sont dans votre cimetière, chaque créature Humain que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Les maisons des morts ne sont pas faites pour les vivants. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621836&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'def24b47-909d-4863-a434-838d680136e0\', \'multiverseId\': 621836}, \'multiverseid\': 621836}, {\'name\': \'Cari Estinti\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nFintanto che i Cari Estinti sono nel tuo cimitero, ogni creatura Umano che controlli entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Le case dei morti non sono luoghi adatti ai vivi."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb79a1a-0e2a-4bd0-86db-672deadce31b\', \'multiverseId\': 622023}, \'multiverseid\': 622023}, {\'name\': \'安らかに旅立つ者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n安らかに旅立つ者があなたの墓地にあるかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべての人間・クリーチャーは追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「死せる者の家は生きている者の居場所ではありませぬぞ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f922f197-f0b8-4e95-883c-9d622758b069\', \'multiverseId\': 622210}, \'multiverseid\': 622210}, {\'name\': \'Queridos Defuntos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEnquanto Queridos Defuntos estiver no seu cemitério, cada criatura Humano que você controla entrará no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"As casas dos mortos não são lugar para os vivos."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625897a2-13c7-46d4-a8ec-81189ecce07e\', \'multiverseId\': 622397}, \'multiverseid\': 622397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genaue Analyse\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht zwei Karten.\\nRückblende — {1}{U}, bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„An den tiefen Orten der Welt gibt es Dinge, die älter und verdorbener sind als Orks."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621485&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1da9482d-1e0a-4464-b1b7-c97ba86b734d\', \'multiverseId\': 621485}, \'multiverseid\': 621485}, {\'name\': \'Análisis profundo\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva—{1}{U}, pagar 3 vidas. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay seres más antiguos y repugnantes que los orcos en las profundidades del mundo".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f095bf1-7a1e-4d88-a285-0e59b42c4b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 621672}, \'multiverseid\': 621672}, {\'name\': \'Analyse en profondeur\', \'text\': \'Un joueur ciblé pioche deux cartes.\\nFlashback — {1}{U}, payez 3 points de vie. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y a des choses plus anciennes et plus viles que les orques dans les profondeurs du monde. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621859&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3620be2d-9f46-41f8-82ba-a2741377e0f4\', \'multiverseId\': 621859}, \'multiverseid\': 621859}, {\'name\': \'Analisi Approfondita\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca due carte.\\nFlashback—{1}{U}, Paga 3 punti vita. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sono cose più antiche e più immonde degli Orchi nei luoghi profondi della terra."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbbf7696-ff93-492f-8f37-142087c10688\', \'multiverseId\': 622046}, \'multiverseid\': 622046}, {\'name\': \'綿密な分析\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を引く。\\nフラッシュバック―{1}{U}, ３点のライフを支払う。（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この世の深みにはオークどもよりもっと古くから存在し、もっといやなものがいろいろおるのじゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ca533b0-7482-4362-9107-4eac40c355f8\', \'multiverseId\': 622233}, \'multiverseid\': 622233}, {\'name\': \'Análise Profunda\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo compra dois cards.\\nRecapitular — {1}{U}, pague 3 pontos de vida. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Há coisas mais antigas e piores que os Orcs nas profundezas do mundo."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c791442-8dde-48f9-93e4-a5f1ee34e609\', \'multiverseId\': 622420}, \'multiverseid\': 622420}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genesiswelle\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten mit Manabetrag X oder weniger ins Spiel bringen. Lege dann alle Karten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt und nicht ins Spiel gebracht wurden, auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d021733-8413-4142-ae0d-85a5c21b0fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 621542}, \'multiverseid\': 621542}, {\'name\': \'Ola de génesis\', \'text\': \'Muestra las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla cualquier cantidad de cartas de permanente con valor de maná de X o menos de entre ellas. Luego, pon en tu cementerio todas las cartas mostradas de esta manera que no fueron puestas en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b90fc0c-d102-4acc-907d-d4723a23fa86\', \'multiverseId\': 621729}, \'multiverseid\': 621729}, {\'name\': \'Vague de genèse\', \'text\': "Révélez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Parmi elles, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de permanent avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X. Mettez ensuite dans votre cimetière toutes les cartes révélées de cette manière qui n\'ont pas été mises sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed2a4cb1-9b1f-4f5f-8918-dcc695fe553c\', \'multiverseId\': 621916}, \'multiverseid\': 621916}, {\'name\': "Flusso d\'Origine", \'text\': \'Rivela le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte permanente con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X scelte tra quelle carte rivelate. Poi metti nel tuo cimitero tutte le carte rivelate in questo modo che non sono state messe sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c86f7d8f-a76d-42b6-a2db-eadeec00e3d9\', \'multiverseId\': 622103}, \'multiverseid\': 622103}, {\'name\': \'起源の波\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を公開する。あなたはその中から、望む枚数の、マナ総量がＸ以下であるパーマネント・カードを戦場に出してもよい。その後、これにより公開し戦場に出さなかったすべてのカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de9a6892-fb59-4fbe-9a14-aeb130dadcc4\', \'multiverseId\': 622290}, \'multiverseid\': 622290}, {\'name\': \'Onda de Gênese\', \'text\': \'Revele os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar no campo de batalha qualquer número de cards de permanente com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X dentre eles. Depois, coloque em seu cemitério todos os cards revelados dessa maneira que não foram colocados no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f12298-4f08-4ddf-af51-588774044474\', \'multiverseId\': 622477}, \'multiverseid\': 622477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gerissene Jägerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Gerissene Jägerin angreift oder blockt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\\nOpfere zwei Speisen: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„In der Wildnis gibt es Nahrung. Ihr müsst keinen Hunger fürchten, bevor der Winter kommt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621568&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fff7e1c-72e3-442a-aef0-bee995461f49\', \'multiverseId\': 621568}, \'multiverseid\': 621568}, {\'name\': \'Cazadora avezada\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Cazadora avezada ataque o bloquee, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\\nSacrificar dos Comidas: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay comida en la naturaleza. No teman morir de hambre antes de que llegue el invierno".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebcd13c3-2235-4a27-8cc0-41e928bf75cc\', \'multiverseId\': 621755}, \'multiverseid\': 621755}, {\'name\': \'Chasseuse éclairée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Chasseuse éclairée attaque ou bloque, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\\nSacrifiez deux nourritures : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Il y a à manger dans la nature. Il n\'y a pas à s\'inquiéter de la faim avant l\'hiver. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621942&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c2adcb-c8c7-4543-b32b-9285fffab52e\', \'multiverseId\': 621942}, \'multiverseid\': 621942}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatrice Esperta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Cacciatrice Esperta attacca o blocca, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\\nSacrifica due Cibi: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"C\\\'è cibo nelle terre selvagge. Non dovete temere di morire di fame prima che giunga l\\\'inverno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'080d2381-4efb-44fb-894a-dd142c2a25c2\', \'multiverseId\': 622129}, \'multiverseid\': 622129}, {\'name\': \'抜け目ない狩人\', \'text\': \'抜け目ない狩人が攻撃するかブロックするたび、食物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n食物２つを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「原野には食べ物がある。冬が来ないうちは飢え死にを心配する必要はない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d49ff88-c5fe-43e0-91c1-373b202f280b\', \'multiverseId\': 622316}, \'multiverseid\': 622316}, {\'name\': \'Caçadora Calejada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Caçadora Calejada atacar ou bloquear, crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.")\\nSacrifique duas Comidas: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Há comida nas terras selvagens. Vocês não precisam temer a fome antes da chegada do inverno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df01633f-e2fd-48a3-8638-7eddfbd6b834\', \'multiverseId\': 622503}, \'multiverseid\': 622503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gestrüppland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}. Das Gestrüppland fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Abkürzungen verlängern den Weg. Das Land hier ist unwirtlich, und unten im Bruch gibt es Moore und alle möglichen Hindernisse."\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'470c8dcf-2a48-4972-ac03-55ac313af4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 621594}, \'multiverseid\': 621594}, {\'name\': \'Matorrales\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}. Los Matorrales te hacen 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Los atajos provocan retrasos largos. El campo de aquí es escabroso y hay pantanos y todo tipo de complicaciones por la Marjala".\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a4a76d7-b02e-462a-ab8d-4cca52cc3671\', \'multiverseId\': 621781}, \'multiverseid\': 621781}, {\'name\': \'Broussaille\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}. La Broussaille vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Les raccourcis font les longs délais. La région est accidentée par ici, il y a des tourbières et toute sorte de difficultés dans le Maresque. »\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621968&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba9e65ff-a162-4fd2-b7a7-361e85e1deda\', \'multiverseId\': 621968}, \'multiverseid\': 621968}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}. La Boscaglia ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi va piano va sano e va lontano. La campagna è impervia da queste parti e giù nelle Paludi ci sono stagni e una quantità di altri ostacoli."\\n—Pipino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29646ce6-f4fe-464b-8327-b80c5389c32d\', \'multiverseId\': 622155}, \'multiverseid\': 622155}, {\'name\': \'低木林地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。低木林地はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「急がば、まわれ、だよ。このあたりの土地は起伏が多いんだ。それにあの沢地には泥沼のほかいろんな障害物がある。」\\n――ピピン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76309bac-2273-4c1f-9a4d-d18c338d475e\', \'multiverseId\': 622342}, \'multiverseid\': 622342}, {\'name\': \'Macegal\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}. Macegal causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Atalhos dão em longos atrasos. A terra por aqui é rude, e há atoleiros e todo tipo de dificuldade lá no Pântano."\\n— Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a43c65f2-1b4a-472b-9ccc-118355e341cb\', \'multiverseId\': 622529}, \'multiverseid\': 622529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geteilte Abneigung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+0 für jede andere angreifende Kreatur, mit der sie einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Von den belagerten Hügeln stürmten Ritter von Gondor, Reiter von Rohan und Dúnedain des Nordens gegen ihre wankenden Feinde und bedrängten sie mit erbitterten Speerstößen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3618f688-ef06-4254-ad7c-4d2b30bf0bbd\', \'multiverseId\': 621523}, \'multiverseid\': 621523}, {\'name\': \'Animosidad compartida\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque, obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno por cada otra criatura atacante que comparta un tipo de criatura con ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Desde las colinas sitiadas, los Caballeros de Gondor, los Jinetes de Rohan y los Dúnedain del Norte se precipitaron sobre sus enemigos confundidos y se abrieron paso empuñando sus letales lanzas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2075ab4-431f-4e04-8543-0dfa7b0132ee\', \'multiverseId\': 621710}, \'multiverseid\': 621710}, {\'name\': \'Animosité partagée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque, elle gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque autre créature attaquante qui partage un type de créature avec elle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Des collines assiégées, les chevaliers du Gondor, les Cavaliers du Rohan et les Dúnedains du Nord déferlèrent sur leurs ennemis hésitants, perçant la masse de la pointe de leurs lances implacables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af337f6b-f705-4cb1-b9ad-d5566f3521ff\', \'multiverseId\': 621897}, \'multiverseid\': 621897}, {\'name\': \'Animosità Condivisa\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca, prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno per ogni altra creatura attaccante che condivide un tipo di creatura con essa.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Dai colli assediati, Cavalieri di Gondor e di Rohan e i Dúnedain del Nord si scagliarono sugli avversari esitanti, aprendosi un varco con la punta delle loro lance infallibili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9233a6d9-57f0-4db4-930b-84f2017e44b2\', \'multiverseId\': 622084}, \'multiverseid\': 622084}, {\'name\': \'分かち合う憎しみ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは、それと共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持ちそれでない攻撃クリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'包囲された丘から、ゴンドールの騎士、ローハンの乗り手、北方のドゥーネダインが、浮き足立つ敵に向かって突進し、容赦ない槍の穂先を敵陣に突き込んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48068e1d-2460-43bb-8345-c174ba0fd888\', \'multiverseId\': 622271}, \'multiverseid\': 622271}, {\'name\': \'Animosidade Compartilhada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca, ela recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno para cada outra criatura atacante que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com ela.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Das colinas sitiadas os cavaleiros de Gondor, os Cavaleiros de Rohan e os Dúnedain do Norte investiram contra seus inimigos vacilantes, penetrando suas fileiras com lanças afiadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a46378d9-5fad-4cd3-941a-206cf0d6ea33\', \'multiverseId\': 622458}, \'multiverseid\': 622458}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gieriger Gast\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\\nImmer wenn du eine Speise opferst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Gierigen Gast.\\nWenn der Gierige Gast das Spiel verlässt, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl Lebenspunkte in Höhe seiner Stärke.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ef2c76d-4f5c-41ef-a012-130b66f9ccdf\', \'multiverseId\': 620377}, \'multiverseid\': 620377}, {\'name\': \'Invitée insatiable\', \'text\': "Menace\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Nourriture.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous sacrifiez une nourriture, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Invitée insatiable.\\nQuand l\'Invitée insatiable quitte le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé perd un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.", \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620445&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'960e294c-6d3d-467e-befd-3a471f754568\', \'multiverseId\': 620445}, \'multiverseid\': 620445}, {\'name\': \'欲張りな招待客\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\nあなたが食物１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、欲張りな招待客の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n欲張りな招待客が戦場を離れたとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはこれのパワーに等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d9027be-c365-49b8-a0ef-0ed53c210119\', \'multiverseId\': 620513}, \'multiverseid\': 620513}, {\'name\': \'贪食宾客\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个食品衍生物。\\n每当你牺牲一个食品时，在贪食宾客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n当贪食宾客离开战场时，目标对手失去等同于其力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半身人／市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bba4378-a9b4-47a2-ada5-893be889b2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 620581}, \'multiverseid\': 620581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gieriger Gast\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\\nImmer wenn du eine Speise opferst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Gierigen Gast.\\nWenn der Gierige Gast das Spiel verlässt, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl Lebenspunkte in Höhe seiner Stärke.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620786&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6dc2ce-fedd-47ce-b8d3-e1a4fed9ff0f\', \'multiverseId\': 620786}, \'multiverseid\': 620786}, {\'name\': \'Invitada voraz\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Comida.\\nSiempre que sacrifiques una Comida, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Invitada voraz.\\nCuando la Invitada voraz deje el campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52089e75-5f5a-4ef6-bf60-632db280b799\', \'multiverseId\': 620858}, \'multiverseid\': 620858}, {\'name\': \'Invitée insatiable\', \'text\': "Menace\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Nourriture.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous sacrifiez une nourriture, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Invitée insatiable.\\nQuand l\'Invitée insatiable quitte le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé perd un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.", \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a9415bf-001e-4061-96b4-e20cebf76edb\', \'multiverseId\': 620930}, \'multiverseid\': 620930}, {\'name\': \'Ospite Vorace\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei una pedina Cibo.\\nOgniqualvolta sacrifichi un Cibo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Ospite Vorace.\\nQuando l\'Ospite Vorace lascia il campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio perde punti vita pari alla sua forza.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34411603-c967-4229-a5e0-75a72d390aac\', \'multiverseId\': 621002}, \'multiverseid\': 621002}, {\'name\': \'欲張りな招待客\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\nあなたが食物１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、欲張りな招待客の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n欲張りな招待客が戦場を離れたとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはこれのパワーに等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09043a2c-9168-47f2-819d-e5ee96585ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 621074}, \'multiverseid\': 621074}, {\'name\': \'Convidada Voraz\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que você controla causarem dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de Comida.\\nToda vez que você sacrificar uma Comida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Convidada Voraz.\\nQuando Convidada Voraz deixa o campo de batalha, o oponente alvo perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao poder dela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pequenino Cidadão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f04d3dc-9b28-45a6-8704-e06bc815041f\', \'multiverseId\': 621146}, \'multiverseid\': 621146}, {\'name\': \'贪食宾客\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个食品衍生物。\\n每当你牺牲一个食品时，在贪食宾客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n当贪食宾客离开战场时，目标对手失去等同于其力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半身人／市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8862981a-0ea7-4d64-a231-09269bfc0da9\', \'multiverseId\': 621218}, \'multiverseid\': 621218}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gigantischer Wal\', \'text\': \'Inseltarnung (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler eine Insel kontrolliert.)\\nImmer wenn der Gigantische Wal angreift, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil schicken, bis der Gigantische Wal das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wal\', \'flavor\': \'„Und in der Nacht, von Anderwelt jenseits des Meeres, erhob sich stark und unbändig ein Sturm …"\\n—Lied von Eärendil\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4688d58c-108b-4a72-9e31-c1ae4d52128e\', \'multiverseId\': 621483}, \'multiverseid\': 621483}, {\'name\': \'Ballena colosal\', \'text\': \'Cruza islas. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle una Isla.)\\nSiempre que la Ballena colosal ataque, puedes exiliar la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor hasta que la Ballena colosal deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ballena\', \'flavor\': \'"Y en aquella noche de otro mundo, más allá del mar, llegó un temporal libre e iracundo…".\\n—Canción de Eärendil\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7b141e-3ec2-4a43-972a-514ffae5c923\', \'multiverseId\': 621670}, \'multiverseid\': 621670}, {\'name\': \'Baleine colossale\', \'text\': "Traversée des îles (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une île.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Baleine colossale attaque, vous pouvez exiler une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle jusqu\'à ce que la Baleine colossale quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : baleine\', \'flavor\': "« Et dans la nuit, depuis l\'Autre Monde par-delà la mer, une tempête se leva forte et libre... »\\n—Chanson d\'Eärendil", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621857&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28bfc9fa-ce62-4207-b024-e20d5b8589eb\', \'multiverseId\': 621857}, \'multiverseid\': 621857}, {\'name\': \'Balena Colossale\', \'text\': "Passa-Isole (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla un\'Isola.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Balena Colossale attacca, puoi esiliare una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa finché la Balena Colossale non lascia il campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Balena\', \'flavor\': \'"Nella notte buia di questo mondo oltre il mare si levò all\\\'improvviso una tempesta violenta..."\\n—Canzone di Eärendil\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b0bf82-bcc8-427e-8345-81743bf1fddb\', \'multiverseId\': 622044}, \'multiverseid\': 622044}, {\'name\': \'壮大な鯨\', \'text\': \'島渡り（防御プレイヤーが島をコントロールしているかぎり、このクリーチャーはブロックされない。）\\n壮大な鯨が攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを、壮大な鯨が戦場を離れるまで追放してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鯨\', \'flavor\': \'「すると海のかなたの別世界より、夜中に嵐が烈しく吹いた……」\\n――エアレンディルの歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93a031f-ee34-4fda-a43b-2b117a751e84\', \'multiverseId\': 622231}, \'multiverseid\': 622231}, {\'name\': \'Baleia Colossal\', \'text\': \'Travessia de ilha (Esta criatura não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto o jogador defensor controlar uma Ilha.)\\nToda vez que Baleia Colossal ataca, você pode exilar a criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla até que Baleia Colossal deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Baleia\', \'flavor\': \'"E à noite, do Outro Mundo, forte e livre tempestade vem d\\\'além do Mar profundo..."\\n— Canção de Eärendil\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46035c9a-ef8c-45a4-835f-bc4652e414b0\', \'multiverseId\': 622418}, \'multiverseid\': 622418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gilraen, Beschützerin der Dúnedain\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil. Du kannst jene Karte unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurückbringen. Falls du dies nicht tust, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments mit einer Wachsamkeit-Marke und einer Lebensverknüpfung-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620363&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37ee2fdb-c366-4dcb-8181-b19b6a2c3eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 620363}, \'multiverseid\': 620363}, {\'name\': \'Gilraen, protectrice des Dúnedains\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T} : Exilez une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez renvoyer cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Si vous ne le faites pas, au début de la prochaine étape de fin, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur « vigilance » et un marqueur « lien de vie » sur elle.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': \'« Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a58ed6f-f0e6-4d79-a1b9-caad1c8b7d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 620431}, \'multiverseid\': 620431}, {\'name\': \'ドゥーネダインの保護者、ギルライン\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。あなたはそのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻してもよい。そうしないなら、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で警戒・カウンター１個と絆魂・カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「オネン イ＝エステル エダイン、 ウー＝ヘビン エステル アニム。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a400a737-2fd7-4636-b1a5-6d81d1cd7c35\', \'multiverseId\': 620499}, \'multiverseid\': 620499}, {\'name\': \'杜内丹保护者吉尔蕾恩\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物。你可以将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。若你未如此作，则在下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且上面有一个警戒指示物和一个系命指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim.」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8297bb36-b987-444f-bf28-790cb27880bb\', \'multiverseId\': 620567}, \'multiverseid\': 620567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gilraen, Beschützerin der Dúnedain\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil. Du kannst jene Karte unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurückbringen. Falls du dies nicht tust, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments mit einer Wachsamkeit-Marke und einer Lebensverknüpfung-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620771&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1736965f-5ac1-452c-969d-56ac3bca3d85\', \'multiverseId\': 620771}, \'multiverseid\': 620771}, {\'name\': \'Gilraen, protectora dúnedain\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Exilia otra criatura objetivo que controlas. Puedes regresar esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario. Si no lo haces, al comienzo del próximo paso final, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador de vigilancia y un contador de vínculo vital sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc412d38-ed6f-4581-8033-d453010b1cd9\', \'multiverseId\': 620843}, \'multiverseid\': 620843}, {\'name\': \'Gilraen, protectrice des Dúnedains\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T} : Exilez une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez renvoyer cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Si vous ne le faites pas, au début de la prochaine étape de fin, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur « vigilance » et un marqueur « lien de vie » sur elle.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': \'« Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b7392d-fe31-44fc-b7ce-6407880983be\', \'multiverseId\': 620915}, \'multiverseid\': 620915}, {\'name\': \'Gilraen, Protettrice dei Dúnedain\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}: Esilia un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli. Puoi rimettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario. Se non lo fai, all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino cautela e un segnalino legame vitale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2032b933-675a-418a-8046-40023188289a\', \'multiverseId\': 620987}, \'multiverseid\': 620987}, {\'name\': \'ドゥーネダインの保護者、ギルライン\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。あなたはそのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻してもよい。そうしないなら、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で警戒・カウンター１個と絆魂・カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「オネン イ＝エステル エダイン、 ウー＝ヘビン エステル アニム。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d7634d0-b017-4e2d-b8dd-beaaba7a382d\', \'multiverseId\': 621059}, \'multiverseid\': 621059}, {\'name\': \'Gilraen, Protetora Dúnedain\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Exile outra criatura alvo que você controla. Você pode devolver aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono. Se não fizer isso, no início da próxima etapa final, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador de vigilância e um marcador de vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24a4f8d-b204-4b08-ad3f-7b1c13b47be4\', \'multiverseId\': 621131}, \'multiverseid\': 621131}, {\'name\': \'杜内丹保护者吉尔蕾恩\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物。你可以将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。若你未如此作，则在下个结束步骤开始时，将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且上面有一个警戒指示物和一个系命指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「Ónen í-Estel Edain, ú-chebin estel anim.」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03ce0b7d-d379-4afd-b65a-9b36ad7e1b84\', \'multiverseId\': 621203}, \'multiverseid\': 621203}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gimli von den Glitzernden Höhlen\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nImmer wenn eine andere legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Gimli von den Glitzernden Höhlen.\\nImmer wenn Gimli einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Kein Zwerg könnte von solcher Schönheit ungerührt bleiben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5495a510-cfb9-4301-a410-00bf3029be11\', \'multiverseId\': 620381}, \'multiverseid\': 620381}, {\'name\': \'Gimli des Cavernes Étincelantes\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature légendaire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Gimli des Cavernes Étincelantes.\\nÀ chaque fois que Gimli inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Aucun nain ne resterait insensible à une telle beauté. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe7865f7-ae1f-4deb-9691-0c28b9eed279\', \'multiverseId\': 620449}, \'multiverseid\': 620449}, {\'name\': \'燦光洞のギムリ\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\nこれでない伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、燦光洞のギムリの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n燦光洞のギムリがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「そのすばらしさに動じぬドワーフなどいない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'829a12fe-0c2c-4e36-b261-3cc0e4cb076d\', \'multiverseId\': 620517}, \'multiverseid\': 620517}, {\'name\': \'晶辉洞的吉姆利\', \'text\': \'连击\\n每当另一个传奇生物在你操控下进战场时，在晶辉洞的吉姆利上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当吉姆利对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～矮人／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「没有哪个矮人见到如此美景还会无动于衷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'859fe71a-c2be-40f9-8841-d0eb544b2a50\', \'multiverseId\': 620585}, \'multiverseid\': 620585}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gimli von den Glitzernden Höhlen\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nImmer wenn eine andere legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Gimli von den Glitzernden Höhlen.\\nImmer wenn Gimli einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Kein Zwerg könnte von solcher Schönheit ungerührt bleiben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620790&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91689646-a480-4543-a223-d1cd3f9b7951\', \'multiverseId\': 620790}, \'multiverseid\': 620790}, {\'name\': \'Gimli de las Cavernas Centelleantes\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nSiempre que otra criatura legendaria entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Gimli de las Cavernas Centelleantes.\\nSiempre que Gimli haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero enano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cualquier enano se emocionaría ante semejante belleza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15dc0005-16ca-4ee3-ba12-97e18299ef2f\', \'multiverseId\': 620862}, \'multiverseid\': 620862}, {\'name\': \'Gimli des Cavernes Étincelantes\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature légendaire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Gimli des Cavernes Étincelantes.\\nÀ chaque fois que Gimli inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Aucun nain ne resterait insensible à une telle beauté. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620934&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2d96d2e-7a47-4e57-a795-fcfeadbf2d82\', \'multiverseId\': 620934}, \'multiverseid\': 620934}, {\'name\': \'Gimli delle Scintillanti Caverne\', \'text\': "Doppio attacco\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura leggendaria entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Gimli delle Scintillanti Caverne.\\nOgniqualvolta Gimli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei una pedina Tesoro.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nessun Nano rimarrebbe impassibile davanti a tanta bellezza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f39e8ee-7d64-4d2b-977e-8e52cc34c6c1\', \'multiverseId\': 621006}, \'multiverseid\': 621006}, {\'name\': \'燦光洞のギムリ\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\nこれでない伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、燦光洞のギムリの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n燦光洞のギムリがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「そのすばらしさに動じぬドワーフなどいない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a954dc6-9e50-4c8a-83bd-c1619ce05f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 621078}, \'multiverseid\': 621078}, {\'name\': \'Gimli das Cavernas Cintilantes\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nToda vez que outra criatura lendária entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Gimli das Cavernas Cintilantes.\\nToda vez que Gimli das Cavernas Cintilantes causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anão Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Anão algum deixaria de se comover com tamanha formosura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a86dc37-d159-40d9-be2c-a8ef184f665f\', \'multiverseId\': 621150}, \'multiverseid\': 621150}, {\'name\': \'晶辉洞的吉姆利\', \'text\': \'连击\\n每当另一个传奇生物在你操控下进战场时，在晶辉洞的吉姆利上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当吉姆利对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～矮人／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「没有哪个矮人见到如此美景还会无动于衷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed90fa4b-5d49-4e44-96e7-c07f782bb081\', \'multiverseId\': 621222}, \'multiverseid\': 621222}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gletscherfestung\', \'text\': \'Die Gletscherfestung kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine Ebene oder eine Insel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Unter dem Mond und geleitet von Sternen\\nWanderte er weit von den Stränden des Nordens …\\nVom Knirschen auf dem schmalen Eis,\\nwo Schatten auf gefrorenen Hügeln liegt."\\n—Lied von Eärendil\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621612&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90005888-0171-41ad-9dbe-13356d970a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 621612}, \'multiverseid\': 621612}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza glacial\', \'text\': \'La Fortaleza glacial entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una Llanura o una Isla.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Bajo la luna y las estrellas\\nvagó lejos del norte.\\nPor hielos que no dejan huellas,\\ntierras sin conforte.\\n—Canción de Eärendil\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fc61544-94e4-4ce3-9b70-f7e3bde9d2d2\', \'multiverseId\': 621799}, \'multiverseid\': 621799}, {\'name\': \'Forteresse glaciaire\', \'text\': \'La Forteresse glaciaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez une plaine ou une île.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Sous la lune et sous les étoiles\\nIl erra loin des rives boréales...\\nDepuis le grincement de la Glace Resserrée\\nOù l\'ombre s\'étend sur les collines gelées. »\\n—Chanson d\'Eärendil", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621986&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08876463-2f51-4994-929e-fd6072e924d7\', \'multiverseId\': 621986}, \'multiverseid\': 621986}, {\'name\': \'Fortezza Glaciale\', \'text\': "La Fortezza Glaciale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una Pianura o un\'Isola.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Sotto la Luna e sotto le stelle\\nDai lidi nordici partì a vagabondare...\\nDal tormento gelido dello Stretto Ghiaccio\\nDove l\\\'ombra copre le colline glaciali."\\n—Canzone di Eärendil\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da2562b0-af8c-43a4-8eae-e710e357f150\', \'multiverseId\': 622173}, \'multiverseid\': 622173}, {\'name\': \'氷河の城砦\', \'text\': \'あなたが平地や島をコントロールしていないかぎり、氷河の城砦はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「星空の下、月の下、\\n北の岸べを遠くはなれて……\\n凍った丘に影のさす\\n狭く凍れる海のきしみに。」\\n――エアレンディルの歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'145279e3-d81e-4d7c-86a5-ef0693fb785d\', \'multiverseId\': 622360}, \'multiverseid\': 622360}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza Glacial\', \'text\': \'Fortaleza Glacial entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle uma Planície ou uma Ilha.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Embaixo de Lua e sob as estrelas\\nafastou-se d\\\'areias setentrionais...\\nDo Gelo Estreito que se range,\\ne umbra tange morros geando."\\n— Canção de Eärendil\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfdd0a37-b1a4-4e13-a2cb-5d643eaa2caf\', \'multiverseId\': 622547}, \'multiverseid\': 622547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gnadenloser Scharfrichter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Gnadenlose Scharfrichter ins Spiel kommt, opfert jeder Spieler eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Verflucht seien die Isengarter! Uglúk u bagronk sha pushdug Saruman-glob búbhosh skai!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cce0a1ee-1e7a-4cdf-82b8-e31f058a45df\', \'multiverseId\': 621501}, \'multiverseid\': 621501}, {\'name\': \'Verdugo despiadado\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Verdugo despiadado entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero orco\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Malditos sean los isengardos! ¡Uglúk u bagronk sha pushdug Saruman-glob búbhosh skai!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a94a337-a127-440c-b3d4-e412b62b18c8\', \'multiverseId\': 621688}, \'multiverseid\': 621688}, {\'name\': \'Exécuteur impitoyable\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Exécuteur impitoyable arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Maudits soient les Isengardiens ! Uglúk u bagronk sha pushdug Saruman-glob búbhosh skai ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621875&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fca6305-5eba-4c83-9752-362aad735b25\', \'multiverseId\': 621875}, \'multiverseid\': 621875}, {\'name\': \'Carnefice Spietato\', \'text\': \'Quando il Carnefice Spietato entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore sacrifica una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Orco\', \'flavor\': \'"Maledetti Isengardiani! Uglúk u bagronk sha pushdug Saruman-glob búbhosh skai!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6072e5e-2da4-4081-9a2d-d65cf0dd5b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 622062}, \'multiverseid\': 622062}, {\'name\': \'無慈悲な処刑人\', \'text\': \'無慈悲な処刑人が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「畜生、アイゼンガルドの連中め！ウグルーク ウ バグロンク シャ プシュドゥグ サルマン゠グロブ ブーブホシュ スカイ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62bdeebd-36b2-455e-a851-e337029af004\', \'multiverseId\': 622249}, \'multiverseid\': 622249}, {\'name\': \'Executor Impiedoso\', \'text\': \'Quando Executor Impiedoso entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador sacrifica uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Orc Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Malditos de Isengard! Uglúk u bagronk sha pushdug Saruman-glob búbhosh skai!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f612523b-abfa-48c6-a112-8d7daf3ab116\', \'multiverseId\': 622436}, \'multiverseid\': 622436}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Kratermacher\', \'text\': \'{1}, opfere den Goblin-Kratermacher: Bestimme eines —\\n• Der Goblin-Kratermacher fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre eine farblose bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Aber die Orks haben eine Teufelei von Orthanc mitgebracht."\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0369fe26-3564-4094-99a3-a1a67d3c5eab\', \'multiverseId\': 621515}, \'multiverseid\': 621515}, {\'name\': \'Trasgo dinamitero\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrificar el Trasgo dinamitero: Elige uno:\\n• El Trasgo dinamitero hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Destruye el permanente incoloro objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los orcos han traído una perversidad de Orthanc".\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54286b53-17cb-4f41-a303-09bfe918fc5e\', \'multiverseId\': 621702}, \'multiverseid\': 621702}, {\'name\': \'Cratérier gobelin\', \'text\': "{1}, sacrifiez le Cratérier gobelin : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Cratérier gobelin inflige 2 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n• Détruisez un permanent non-terrain incolore ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Mais les orques ont apporté une magie noire d\'Orthanc. »\\n—Aragorn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621889&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152948f1-f7b5-4af8-baeb-b752921fa896\', \'multiverseId\': 621889}, \'multiverseid\': 621889}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Apricrateri\', \'text\': \'{1}, Sacrifica il Goblin Apricrateri: Scegli uno —\\n• Il Goblin Apricrateri infligge 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un permanente non terra incolore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Ma gli Orchi hanno portato da Orthanc qualcosa di diabolico."\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c209146a-9be3-459b-97a9-34ec172e5bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 622076}, \'multiverseid\': 622076}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンのクレーター掘り\', \'text\': \'{1}, ゴブリンのクレーター掘りを生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ゴブリンのクレーター掘りはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n・無色であり土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「だがオークどもはオルサンクから悪魔の道具を持って来ている。」\\n——アラゴルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a56f05f-8ca2-43fe-af72-b33dd6efdc17\', \'multiverseId\': 622263}, \'multiverseid\': 622263}, {\'name\': \'Cratereiro Goblin\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrifique Cratereiro Goblin: Escolha um —\\n• Cratereiro Goblin causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n• Destrua a permanente não de terreno incolor alvo .\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Mas os Orcs trouxeram algo diabólico de Orthanc."\\n— Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee4c89b4-ff28-4882-a9f6-6df4d7c8d098\', \'multiverseId\': 622450}, \'multiverseid\': 622450}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblins der Dunkelheit\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWenn die Goblins der Dunkelheit ins Spiel kommen, kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls der Zauberspruch auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a0041bd-d0b8-4c4a-b95f-3364cd7ba8c9\', \'multiverseId\': 621516}, \'multiverseid\': 621516}, {\'name\': \'Trasgos habitasombras\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCuando los Trasgos habitasombras entren al campo de batalla, puedes lanzar desde tu cementerio la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos sin pagar su coste de maná. Si ese hechizo fuera a ir a tu cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77c17b53-d8dc-43e0-9afd-e33473aca984\', \'multiverseId\': 621703}, \'multiverseid\': 621703}, {\'name\': \'Gobelins sciaphiles\', \'text\': "Menace\\nQuand les Gobelins sciaphiles arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez lancer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 depuis votre cimetière sans payer son coût de mana. Si ce sort devait être mis dans votre cimetière, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'106787c2-5e67-412e-9746-8b567b082945\', \'multiverseId\': 621890}, \'multiverseid\': 621890}, {\'name\': "Goblin Abitanti dell\'Oscurità", \'text\': "Minacciare\\nQuando i Goblin Abitanti dell\'Oscurità entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi lanciare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se quella magia sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero, invece esiliala.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecbd9517-a646-465c-aa60-1d2e1e019120\', \'multiverseId\': 622077}, \'multiverseid\': 622077}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの闇住まい\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nゴブリンの闇住まいが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下でありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その呪文があなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4598f8b0-ba14-42b6-8945-ee8037f6789b\', \'multiverseId\': 622264}, \'multiverseid\': 622264}, {\'name\': \'Umbrígeos Goblins\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nQuando Umbrígeos Goblins entra no campo de batalha, você pode conjurar o card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se aquela mágica seria colocada no seu cemitério, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ba199f-27fe-4cf5-910b-abc1194f160c\', \'multiverseId\': 622451}, \'multiverseid\': 622451}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldene Gans\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Goldene Gans ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\\n{1}{G}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\\n{T}, opfere eine Speise: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e00096d-4569-4fdd-9cf3-4f44244ae6de\', \'multiverseId\': 621543}, \'multiverseid\': 621543}, {\'name\': \'Gansa dorada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Gansa dorada entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\\n{1}{G}, {T}: Crea una ficha de Comida.\\n{T}, sacrificar una Comida: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab49d4b4-a69d-414b-8bb0-e9f3e0def901\', \'multiverseId\': 621730}, \'multiverseid\': 621730}, {\'name\': "Oie d\'or", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Oie d\'or arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\\n{1}{G}, {T} : Créez un jeton Nourriture.\\n{T}, sacrifiez une nourriture : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77144127-d8e7-4898-a6bc-17e2077e590a\', \'multiverseId\': 621917}, \'multiverseid\': 621917}, {\'name\': "Oca d\'Oro", \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando l\\\'Oca d\\\'Oro entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\\n{1}{G}, {T}: Crea una pedina Cibo.\\n{T}, Sacrifica un Cibo: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24765d25-0bd1-4eba-a3eb-1a2943d829d2\', \'multiverseId\': 622104}, \'multiverseid\': 622104}, {\'name\': \'金のガチョウ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n金のガチョウが戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n{1}{G}, {T}：食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{T}, 食物１つを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2045c4a4-a6f3-44e7-ad5a-1d3aaaa22dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 622291}, \'multiverseid\': 622291}, {\'name\': \'Ganso Dourado\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Ganso Dourado entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.")\\n{1}{G}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de Comida.\\n{T}, sacrifique uma Comida: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8dc3b74-1c14-4a3d-a7cd-9040d81d65de\', \'multiverseId\': 622478}, \'multiverseid\': 622478}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gollum, getriebener Pirscher\', \'text\': \'Schleichen (Diese Kreatur kann von Kreaturen mit größerer Stärke nicht geblockt werden.)\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments verliert jeder Gegner, dem in dieser Partie von einer Kreatur namens Gollum, getriebener Pirscher, Kampfschaden zugefügt wurde, so viele Lebenspunkte, wie du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'Er hasste ihn und liebte ihn, wie er auch sich selbst hasste und liebte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620784&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6ee69db-20f2-4f2d-8724-6cbcdc43afe7\', \'multiverseId\': 620784}, \'multiverseid\': 620784}, {\'name\': \'Gollum, acechador obseso\', \'text\': \'Escurridizo. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con mayor fuerza que la suya.)\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, cada oponente que recibió daño de combate este juego de una criatura llamada Gollum, acechador obseso pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Horror mediano\', \'flavor\': \'Lo odiaba y lo amaba de la misma forma que se odiaba y se amaba a sí mismo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00da65ad-b64e-40cb-a1db-9bac809081da\', \'multiverseId\': 620856}, \'multiverseid\': 620856}, {\'name\': "Gollum, pisteur rongé par l\'obsession", \'text\': "Furtivité (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée par des créatures de force supérieure.)\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, chaque adversaire qui a subi des blessures de combat pendant cette partie d\'une créature appelée Gollum, pisteur rongé par l\'obsession perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et horreur\', \'flavor\': "Il le haïssait et l\'adorait, tout comme il se haïssait et s\'adorait lui-même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620928&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5fa17de-e0aa-40ec-a56f-051edd8aa86c\', \'multiverseId\': 620928}, \'multiverseid\': 620928}, {\'name\': \'Gollum, Inseguitore Ossessionato\', \'text\': "Furtivo (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata da creature con forza superiore.)\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, ogni avversario a cui è stato inflitto danno da combattimento in questa partita da una creatura chiamata Gollum, Inseguitore Ossessionato perde punti vita pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orrore Halfling\', \'flavor\': \'Lui lo odiava e amava, così come odiava e amava se stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ee3250-67ca-4c0d-a5c9-6fa24b07c6cd\', \'multiverseId\': 621000}, \'multiverseid\': 621000}, {\'name\': \'心奪われし追跡者、ゴクリ\', \'text\': \'潜伏（このクリーチャーは、これより大きなパワーを持つクリーチャーにはブロックされない。）\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このゲームで「心奪われし追跡者、ゴクリ」という名前のクリーチャーから戦闘ダメージを受けた各対戦相手は、このターンにあなたが得たライフの点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'彼はそれを嫌い、愛していたのじゃ。自分自身を嫌い、愛すると同様にな。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c9280f-b0ee-445b-8abd-cd6412911310\', \'multiverseId\': 621072}, \'multiverseid\': 621072}, {\'name\': \'Gollum, Espreitador Obcecado\', \'text\': \'Esquivo (Esta criatura não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com poder superior ao dela.)\\nNo início de sua etapa final, cada oponente que sofreu dano de combate de uma criatura com o nome Gollum, Espreitador Obcecado, neste jogo perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual à quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Horror\', \'flavor\': \'Ele o odiava e amava, como odiava e amava a si mesmo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a0cc87-7b11-4f37-8835-0ca17fc8ee53\', \'multiverseId\': 621144}, \'multiverseid\': 621144}, {\'name\': \'痴迷跟踪怪咕噜\', \'text\': \'潜匿（此生物不能被力量比它大的生物阻挡。）\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，每位本盘游戏中受过名称为痴迷跟踪怪咕噜之生物战斗伤害的对手均失去若干生命，其数量等同于你本回合中获得过的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'他对魔戒爱恨交加，正如他对自己一样。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe3e851-8419-4b46-9a3c-2494a08fbcd0\', \'multiverseId\': 621216}, \'multiverseid\': 621216}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gollum, getriebener Pirscher\', \'text\': \'Schleichen\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments verliert jeder Gegner, dem in dieser Partie von einer Kreatur namens Gollum, getriebener Pirscher, Kampfschaden zugefügt wurde, so viele Lebenspunkte, wie du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'Er hasste den Ring und liebte ihn, wie er auch sich selbst hasste und liebte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620375&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb534d1-33e0-4014-a5ae-e4b434eeb2f0\', \'multiverseId\': 620375}, \'multiverseid\': 620375}, {\'name\': "Gollum, pisteur rongé par l\'obsession", \'text\': "Furtivité\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, chaque adversaire qui a subi des blessures de combat pendant cette partie d\'une créature appelée Gollum, pisteur rongé par l\'obsession perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et horreur\', \'flavor\': "Il haïssait l\'Anneau et l\'adorait, tout comme il se haïssait et s\'adorait lui-même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c0ab9c-c666-443b-831c-bc2a0a1b48e7\', \'multiverseId\': 620443}, \'multiverseid\': 620443}, {\'name\': \'心奪われし追跡者、ゴラム\', \'text\': \'潜伏\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このゲームで「心奪われし追跡者、ゴラム」という名前のクリーチャーから戦闘ダメージを受けた各対戦相手は、このターンにあなたが得たライフの点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'彼はその指輪を嫌い、愛していたのじゃ。自分自身を嫌い、愛すると同様にな。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91a19173-f072-413b-adfc-bc181ba66d2e\', \'multiverseId\': 620511}, \'multiverseid\': 620511}, {\'name\': \'痴迷跟踪怪咕噜\', \'text\': \'潜匿\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，每位本盘游戏中受过名称为痴迷跟踪怪咕噜之生物战斗伤害的对手均失去若干生命，其数量等同于你本回合中获得过的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'他对魔戒爱恨交加，正如他对自己一样。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581abea7-8461-48b3-a2dc-a2ec48461f95\', \'multiverseId\': 620579}, \'multiverseid\': 620579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gossenschütze\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, fügt der Gossenschütze jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe Moria erblickt, und es ist wahrhaft groß, doch es ist düster und furchtbar geworden."\\n—Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d657a3dc-226f-4dce-948a-fb778b7fec3e\', \'multiverseId\': 621517}, \'multiverseid\': 621517}, {\'name\': \'Disparacuneta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, el Disparacuneta hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya he visto Moria y es muy grande, aunque se ha convertido en un lugar oscuro y terrible".\\n—Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a66ae8-2ec4-4320-ae3d-d5f5f76c274e\', \'multiverseId\': 621704}, \'multiverseid\': 621704}, {\'name\': \'Gobelin des rues\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, le Gobelin des rues inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai vu la Moria et elle est magnifique, mais elle est devenue sombre et terrible. »\\n—Gimli", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b550b40b-ab8b-4b55-aa89-8dd60b69499a\', \'multiverseId\': 621891}, \'multiverseid\': 621891}, {\'name\': \'Cecchino\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, il Cecchino infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio sguardo si è posato su Moria; è immensa, ma è divenuta oscura e spaventosa."\\n—Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e13ee3ba-1a9e-4bec-a910-ca5a5c77dfec\', \'multiverseId\': 622078}, \'multiverseid\': 622078}, {\'name\': \'どぶ潜み\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、どぶ潜みは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「俺はモリアを見たことがある。それはもう素晴らしい所だった。だが今は暗く恐ろしい所になっちまった。」\\n――ギムリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de15ba98-0b59-46a8-9d10-5b5c5c1f3f7d\', \'multiverseId\': 622265}, \'multiverseid\': 622265}, {\'name\': \'Atirador da Sarjeta\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, Atirador da Sarjeta causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu contemplei Moria, e ela é magnífica, mas se tornou sombria e temível."\\n— Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f80aef0c-0195-4119-af71-368d8ccee859\', \'multiverseId\': 622452}, \'multiverseid\': 622452}]', '[{\'name\': \'Graupelz-Refugium\', \'text\': \'Das Graupelz-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Graupelz-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Solange das Auenland sicher ist, finde ich das Wandern erträglicher; es gibt irgendwo festen Halt, selbst wenn ich nicht zurückkehren sollte."\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621613&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a37fc0-672a-4b22-87cd-4091fc62f30c\', \'multiverseId\': 621613}, \'multiverseid\': 621613}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de Pellejo Gris\', \'text\': \'El Refugio de Pellejo Gris entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de Pellejo Gris entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Mientras la Comarca esté a salvo, aguantaré mejor mis viajes. Sabré que en algún lugar hay tierra firme, aunque yo no pueda regresar".\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf153565-70fb-4613-934e-3a093c3d803f\', \'multiverseId\': 621800}, \'multiverseid\': 621800}, {\'name\': \'Refuge de Grisepeau\', \'text\': \'Le Refuge de Grisepeau arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge de Grisepeau arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Tant que la Comté sera en sécurité, je trouverai mes errances plus supportables. Il y aura quelque part un pilier solide, même si je ne pourrai plus m\'appuyer dessus. »\\n—Frodo", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621987&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd7de9eb-efbb-4544-aa02-890d1bced8f9\', \'multiverseId\': 621987}, \'multiverseid\': 621987}, {\'name\': \'Rifugio di Pellegrigia\', \'text\': \'Il Rifugio di Pellegrigia entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio di Pellegrigia entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fin quando la Contea è al sicuro, girovagare sarà per me più facile; in una parte del mondo c\\\'è un appoggio stabile che mi attende, anche se non vi dovessi più tornare."\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f13707e-94e3-432e-bbdb-a77cf5f45cda\', \'multiverseId\': 622174}, \'multiverseid\': 622174}, {\'name\': \'灰色革の隠れ家\', \'text\': \'灰色革の隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n灰色革の隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「ホビット庄が安全である限り、放浪の旅がより耐えやすいものとなる。たとえこの足でふたたびそこに立つことはできないにしろ、しっかりした足がかりがあるとわかっていればいい。」\\n――フロド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44bb6b31-ac85-40a6-a8a0-a0ccafcf7ada\', \'multiverseId\': 622361}, \'multiverseid\': 622361}, {\'name\': \'Refúgio de Pele-cinza\', \'text\': \'Refúgio de Pele-cinza entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Refúgio de Pele-cinza entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Enquanto o Condado permanecer seguro, eu acharei mais suportável vagar; em algum lugar há um chão firme, mesmo que eu não retorne."\\n— Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc2cac2a-60db-4959-a5db-d57d1ae1aa1d\', \'multiverseId\': 622548}, \'multiverseid\': 622548}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzland-Kriegstreiberin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen einen deiner Gegner oder einen Planeswalker, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, angreifen, erhalten sie Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Was könnte ein Krieger in dieser Stunde nicht alles tun?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e137c1d2-1ef4-4080-9b62-6c105e7a4f8a\', \'multiverseId\': 621514}, \'multiverseid\': 621514}, {\'name\': \'Belicista de la frontera\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas ataquen a uno de tus oponentes o a un planeswalker que controlan, esas criaturas ganan la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'¿Qué no haría un corazón guerrero en esta situación?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc2fab4-6b9f-4b33-b983-1df355e2a44c\', \'multiverseId\': 621701}, \'multiverseid\': 621701}, {\'name\': \'Belliciste des frontières\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature attaque un de vos adversaires ou un planeswalker qu\'il contrôle, ces créatures acquièrent la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Qu\'est-ce qu\'un guerrier pouvait faire d\'autre en cette heure ?", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'221082b1-e889-4a2a-a2f2-60c8902de976\', \'multiverseId\': 621888}, \'multiverseid\': 621888}, {\'name\': \'Guerrafondaia di Frontiera\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature attaccano uno dei tuoi avversari o un planeswalker controllato da un avversario, quelle creature hanno minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Che cosa non farebbe un guerriero in un momento come questo?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a158b741-6a21-40bf-830a-9740f6b330fa\', \'multiverseId\': 622075}, \'multiverseid\': 622075}, {\'name\': \'開拓地の戦争屋\', \'text\': \'１体以上のクリーチャーが対戦相手か対戦相手がコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは威迫を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'かかる時に、武人たる者にできぬことなど何があろう？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea47bb02-faff-4694-b1fc-b38b5553f800\', \'multiverseId\': 622262}, \'multiverseid\': 622262}, {\'name\': \'Belicista da Fronteira\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas atacam um de seus oponentes ou um planeswalker que eles controlam, aquelas criaturas ganham ameaçar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'O que um guerreiro não poderia fazer nessa hora?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d68315c2-2d85-460a-bbc6-df38cb26df8b\', \'multiverseId\': 622449}, \'multiverseid\': 622449}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gríma, Sarumans Handlanger\', \'text\': \'Gríma, Sarumans Handlanger, kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn Gríma einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt jener Spieler Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Danach legt der Spieler alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620406&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af36e8f5-03be-4d78-8098-8eb2ade53164\', \'multiverseId\': 620406}, \'multiverseid\': 620406}, {\'name\': \'Gríma, valet de pied de Saruman\', \'text\': "Gríma, valet de pied de Saruman ne peut pas être bloqué.\\nÀ chaque fois que Gríma inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Ce joueur met ensuite les cartes exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière au-dessous de sa bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f8fcb4b-d545-4823-a68d-cb795ebaad37\', \'multiverseId\': 620474}, \'multiverseid\': 620474}, {\'name\': \'サルマンの下僕、グリマ\', \'text\': \'サルマンの下僕、グリマはブロックされない。\\nサルマンの下僕、グリマがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは、インスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚が追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、そのプレイヤーはこれにより追放されて唱えられなかったすべてのカードを自分のラｈイブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'221941ac-8674-4bd0-b0de-4a474dbdd9a0\', \'multiverseId\': 620542}, \'multiverseid\': 620542}, {\'name\': \'萨茹曼听差格里马\', \'text\': \'萨茹曼听差格里马不能被阻挡。\\n每当格里马对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张瞬间或法术牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后该牌手将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌以随机顺序置于其牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0f6651b-8e12-49a2-ba2f-2542f1378ad8\', \'multiverseId\': 620610}, \'multiverseid\': 620610}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gríma, Sarumans Handlanger\', \'text\': \'Gríma, Sarumans Handlanger, kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn Gríma einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt jener Spieler Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Danach legt der Spieler alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620815&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d876235-3e8b-411f-80ef-17c49b55308b\', \'multiverseId\': 620815}, \'multiverseid\': 620815}, {\'name\': \'Gríma, lacayo de Saruman\', \'text\': \'Gríma, lacayo de Saruman no puede ser bloqueado.\\nSiempre que Gríma haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, ese jugador pone las cartas exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en el fondo de su biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d28b5a-956c-42d4-877e-ebe12ccf91c4\', \'multiverseId\': 620887}, \'multiverseid\': 620887}, {\'name\': \'Gríma, valet de pied de Saruman\', \'text\': "Gríma, valet de pied de Saruman ne peut pas être bloqué.\\nÀ chaque fois que Gríma inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Ce joueur met ensuite les cartes exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière au-dessous de sa bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620959&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c488e1f0-a191-4bf7-a311-f75ba63ce94d\', \'multiverseId\': 620959}, \'multiverseid\': 620959}, {\'name\': \'Gríma, Lacchè di Saruman\', \'text\': \'Gríma, Lacchè di Saruman non può essere bloccato.\\nOgniqualvolta Gríma infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia carte dalla cima del suo grimorio finché non esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria. Puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Poi quel giocatore mette in fondo al suo grimorio in ordine casuale le carte esiliate che non sono state lanciate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'992ab01b-d10f-4906-9074-2801a06f1b69\', \'multiverseId\': 621031}, \'multiverseid\': 621031}, {\'name\': \'サルマンの下僕、グリマ\', \'text\': \'サルマンの下僕、グリマはブロックされない。\\nサルマンの下僕、グリマがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは、インスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚が追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、そのプレイヤーはこれにより追放されて唱えられなかったすべてのカードを自分のラｈイブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf87a06e-2978-48bd-89ff-923bd16529b1\', \'multiverseId\': 621103}, \'multiverseid\': 621103}, {\'name\': \'Gríma, Lacaio de Saruman\', \'text\': \'Gríma, Lacaio de Saruman, não pode ser bloqueado.\\nToda vez que Gríma causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador exila cards do topo do próprio grimório até exilar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço. Você pode conjurar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Depois, aquele jogador coloca os cards exilados que não foram conjurados dessa forma no fundo do próprio grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'095ce1b7-f763-4231-ad3c-ac77a0f51f00\', \'multiverseId\': 621175}, \'multiverseid\': 621175}, {\'name\': \'萨茹曼听差格里马\', \'text\': \'萨茹曼听差格里马不能被阻挡。\\n每当格里马对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张瞬间或法术牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后该牌手将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌以随机顺序置于其牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b9392eb-3cff-44b2-8099-76451835ac29\', \'multiverseId\': 621247}, \'multiverseid\': 621247}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gwaihir, Mächtigster aller Adler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn Gwaihir angreift, erhält eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, erzeuge einen 3/3 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhält eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620365&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abb43e67-30b6-4dfb-936a-373521c431e4\', \'multiverseId\': 620365}, \'multiverseid\': 620365}, {\'name\': \'Gwaihir, le plus grand des aigles\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que Gwaihir attaque, une créature attaquante ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nAu début de chaque étape de fin, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 blanche Oiseau avec le vol et « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, une créature attaquante ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : oiseau et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d2257f-b8de-4f97-9183-60abe57bbc48\', \'multiverseId\': 620433}, \'multiverseid\': 620433}, {\'name\': \'最強の大鷲、グワイヒア\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n最強の大鷲、グワイヒアが攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\\n各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、飛行と「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。」を持つ白の３/３の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c23fff36-5bd3-4484-a5b5-6e68144a2a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 620501}, \'multiverseid\': 620501}, {\'name\': \'鹰中之雄格怀希尔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当格怀希尔攻击时，目标进行攻击的生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\\n在每个结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得过3点或更多生命，则派出一个3/3白色的鸟衍生生物，且具有飞行与「每当此生物攻击时，目标进行攻击的生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鸟／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ce5aa3-33bc-4aa7-945f-a021991ebd2a\', \'multiverseId\': 620569}, \'multiverseid\': 620569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gwaihir, Mächtigster aller Adler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn Gwaihir angreift, erhält eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, erzeuge einen 3/3 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhält eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620773&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfb4a382-33e5-4f42-a216-1ced0e2f3bd0\', \'multiverseId\': 620773}, \'multiverseid\': 620773}, {\'name\': \'Gwaihir, la más grande de las águilas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que Gwaihir ataque, la criatura atacante objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\\nAl comienzo de cada paso final, si ganaste 3 o más vidas este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Ave blanca 3/3 con la habilidad de volar y "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, la criatura atacante objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab39f468-1197-4d9d-af1d-9c57b0eeb11c\', \'multiverseId\': 620845}, \'multiverseid\': 620845}, {\'name\': \'Gwaihir, le plus grand des aigles\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que Gwaihir attaque, une créature attaquante ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nAu début de chaque étape de fin, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 blanche Oiseau avec le vol et « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, une créature attaquante ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : oiseau et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5fb9165-5221-4a75-9972-3a214c63c4eb\', \'multiverseId\': 620917}, \'multiverseid\': 620917}, {\'name\': \'Gwaihir, Signore delle Aquile\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta Gwaihir attacca, una creatura attaccante bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\\nAll\\\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, se hai guadagnato 3 o più punti vita in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Uccello 3/3 bianca con volare e "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, una creatura attaccante bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a14e3c73-cb61-421c-920a-796318b18260\', \'multiverseId\': 620989}, \'multiverseid\': 620989}, {\'name\': \'最強の大鷲、グワイヒア\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n最強の大鷲、グワイヒアが攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\\n各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、飛行と「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。」を持つ白の３/３の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6ef301e-4e1a-4082-aa1a-b3a14c16657a\', \'multiverseId\': 621061}, \'multiverseid\': 621061}, {\'name\': \'Gwaihir, a Maior das Águias\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Gwaihir ataca, a criatura atacante alvo ganha voar até o final do turno.\\nNo início de cada etapa final, se você ganhou 3 ou mais pontos de vida neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Ave branca 3/3 com voar e "Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, a criatura atacante alvo ganha voar até o final do turno".\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ave Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca74fd0-e952-46a6-ac9b-8f13abc6bfa5\', \'multiverseId\': 621133}, \'multiverseid\': 621133}, {\'name\': \'鹰中之雄格怀希尔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当格怀希尔攻击时，目标进行攻击的生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\\n在每个结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得过3点或更多生命，则派出一个3/3白色的鸟衍生生物，且具有飞行与「每当此生物攻击时，目标进行攻击的生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鸟／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67466c90-56be-4aea-a546-5b27747db3f4\', \'multiverseId\': 621205}, \'multiverseid\': 621205}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hafenstadt\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Hafenstadt ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Ebene- oder Insel-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt die Hafenstadt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Dort bei Pelargir lag die Hauptflotte von Umbar, fünfzig große Schiffe und unzählige kleinere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621620&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b190aa33-b0c5-4c20-960f-5743387cae45\', \'multiverseId\': 621620}, \'multiverseid\': 621620}, {\'name\': \'Pueblo portuario\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Pueblo portuario entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Llanura o Isla de tu mano. Si no lo haces, el Pueblo portuario entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Allí, en Pelargir, se encontraba la flota principal de Umbar: cincuenta navíos de gran envergadura y muchas embarcaciones más pequeñas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'222b546e-db4b-465c-920d-52d71ab22963\', \'multiverseId\': 621807}, \'multiverseid\': 621807}, {\'name\': \'Ville portuaire\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Ville portuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de plaine ou d\'île de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, la Ville portuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "À Pelargir se trouvait la principale flotte d\'Umbar, cinquante grands vaisseaux et d\'autres plus petits, innombrables.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621994&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ec136c3-430c-48b2-94d7-cac9f35c83a3\', \'multiverseId\': 621994}, \'multiverseid\': 621994}, {\'name\': \'Città Portuale\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Città Portuale entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Pianura o Isola dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, la Città Portuale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Lì a Pelargir si trovava la più grande flotta di Umbar, cinquanta grandi navi e barche a non finire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d953176a-bb05-4434-84a7-e0a6c30d19a3\', \'multiverseId\': 622181}, \'multiverseid\': 622181}, {\'name\': \'港町\', \'text\': \'港町が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり平地や島であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、港町はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ペラルギアの地にウンバールの主力艦隊がいた。五十隻の大型船に、数えきれぬほどの小型船だった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'490186f4-d71b-4129-8318-ebebdd2ec700\', \'multiverseId\': 622368}, \'multiverseid\': 622368}, {\'name\': \'Cidade Portuária\', \'text\': \'Conforme Cidade Portuária entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Planície ou Ilha de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Cidade Portuária entrará no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Lá em Pelargir estava a frota principal de Umbar, cinquenta grandes navios e incontáveis embarcações menores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8640cf68-db19-4d7e-bb15-5b95d03b8738\', \'multiverseId\': 622555}, \'multiverseid\': 622555}]', '[{\'name\': \'Haldir, Leutnant Lóriens\', \'text\': \'Haldir, Leutnant Lóriens, kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWachsamkeit\\n{5}{G}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten andere Elfen, die du kontrollierst, Wachsamkeit und +1/+1 für jede +1/+1-Marke auf Haldir.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Nun ist es für euch an der Zeit, dem Herrn und der Herrin vorgeführt zu werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620388&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a7c0c0-dc2b-459e-a457-38bcb96370d6\', \'multiverseId\': 620388}, \'multiverseid\': 620388}, {\'name\': \'Haldir, lieutenant de la Lórien\', \'text\': "Haldir, lieutenant de la Lórien arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nVigilance\\n{5}{G} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les autres elfes que vous contrôlez acquièrent la vigilance et gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur Haldir.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous devez maintenant être amenés devant le Seigneur et la Dame. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16757ad3-43dd-4756-8700-61f068568b65\', \'multiverseId\': 620456}, \'multiverseid\': 620456}, {\'name\': \'ロリアンの士官、ハルディア\', \'text\': \'ロリアンの士官、ハルディアは、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n警戒\\n{5}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのエルフはロリアンの士官、ハルディアの上にある＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ここまで来たからには、殿と奥方の御前に出てもらわねばならぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e784bb0-fb9c-42c6-86b2-31b1e42a4fae\', \'multiverseId\': 620524}, \'multiverseid\': 620524}, {\'name\': \'罗瑞恩副官哈尔迪尔\', \'text\': \'罗瑞恩副官哈尔迪尔进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n警戒\\n{5}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的其他妖精获得警戒异能，且哈尔迪尔上每有一个+1/+1指示物，它们便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「现在，我必须领你们去觐见领主和夫人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39c65a25-cad5-4fce-95a7-737e0e2e6d65\', \'multiverseId\': 620592}, \'multiverseid\': 620592}]', '[{\'name\': \'Haldir, Leutnant Lóriens\', \'text\': \'Haldir, Leutnant Lóriens, kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWachsamkeit\\n{5}{G}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten andere Elfen, die du kontrollierst, Wachsamkeit und +1/+1 für jede +1/+1-Marke auf Haldir.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Nun ist es für euch an der Zeit, dem Herrn und der Herrin vorgeführt zu werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620797&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc827bee-471c-470c-9d97-bf9def9bec39\', \'multiverseId\': 620797}, \'multiverseid\': 620797}, {\'name\': \'Haldir, teniente de Lórien\', \'text\': \'Haldir, teniente de Lórien entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nVigilancia.\\n{5}{G}: Hasta el final del turno, los otros Elfos que controlas ganan la habilidad de vigilancia y obtienen +1/+1 por cada contador +1/+1 sobre Haldir.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Debemos llevarte ante el Señor y la Dama".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4af77af0-69f6-4d90-8e57-d26b6bc934e6\', \'multiverseId\': 620869}, \'multiverseid\': 620869}, {\'name\': \'Haldir, lieutenant de la Lórien\', \'text\': "Haldir, lieutenant de la Lórien arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nVigilance\\n{5}{G} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les autres elfes que vous contrôlez acquièrent la vigilance et gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur Haldir.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous devez maintenant être amenés devant le Seigneur et la Dame. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620941&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ed2f2b3-c691-4287-8c8e-ea76013a6971\', \'multiverseId\': 620941}, \'multiverseid\': 620941}, {\'name\': \'Haldir, Tenente di Lórien\', \'text\': \'Haldir, Tenente di Lórien entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nCautela\\n{5}{G}: Fino alla fine del turno, gli altri Elfi che controlli hanno cautela e prendono +1/+1 per ogni segnalino +1/+1 su Haldir.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ora devi apparire al cospetto del Signore e della Dama."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb109959-1dd7-4830-8aea-a7eb6ffc3e04\', \'multiverseId\': 621013}, \'multiverseid\': 621013}, {\'name\': \'ロリアンの士官、ハルディア\', \'text\': \'ロリアンの士官、ハルディアは、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n警戒\\n{5}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのエルフはロリアンの士官、ハルディアの上にある＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ここまで来たからには、殿と奥方の御前に出てもらわねばならぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a47febd-f90e-4ec6-b6a4-ebbcd3a3af87\', \'multiverseId\': 621085}, \'multiverseid\': 621085}, {\'name\': \'Haldir, Tenente de Lórien\', \'text\': \'Haldir, Tenente de Lórien, entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\\nVigilância\\n{5}{G}: Até o final do turno, os outros Elfos que você controla ganham vigilância e recebem +1/+1 para cada marcador +1/+1 em Haldir.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora vocês precisam ser levados ao Senhor e à Senhora."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f74cbb8-a62e-4e1a-a700-a5ff0407f96a\', \'multiverseId\': 621157}, \'multiverseid\': 621157}, {\'name\': \'罗瑞恩副官哈尔迪尔\', \'text\': \'罗瑞恩副官哈尔迪尔进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n警戒\\n{5}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的其他妖精获得警戒异能，且哈尔迪尔上每有一个+1/+1指示物，它们便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「现在，我必须把你们带去觐见领主和夫人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6332607e-5d9a-41a2-b16a-736bed3a2097\', \'multiverseId\': 621229}, \'multiverseid\': 621229}]', '[{\'name\': \'Handelsposten\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{1}, {T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge einen 0/1 weißen Ziege-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621585&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f033bdf-3e5b-4947-85b2-475556ead127\', \'multiverseId\': 621585}, \'multiverseid\': 621585}, {\'name\': \'Puesto comercial\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, descartar una carta: Ganas 4 vidas.\\n{1}, {T}, pagar 1 vida: Crea una ficha de criatura Cabra blanca 0/1.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf390da-c5a6-46d9-9482-c0d67ca3622d\', \'multiverseId\': 621772}, \'multiverseid\': 621772}, {\'name\': \'Comptoir de commerce\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\n{1}, {T}, payez 1 point de vie : Créez un jeton de créature 0/1 blanche Chèvre.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Renvoyez dans votre main une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621959&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b72decd4-46e7-4131-aef2-c39530b25644\', \'multiverseId\': 621959}, \'multiverseid\': 621959}, {\'name\': \'Stazione Commerciale\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Scarta una carta: Guadagni 4 punti vita.\\n{1}, {T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Crea una pedina creatura Capra 0/1 bianca.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4b9f777-df02-4ffb-896f-113a696f09ba\', \'multiverseId\': 622146}, \'multiverseid\': 622146}, {\'name\': \'交易所\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, カード１枚を捨てる：４点のライフを得る。\\n{1}, {T}, １点のライフを支払う：白の０/１のヤギ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1}, {T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n{1}, {T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74dbd7ca-5e8b-4e9e-995c-ead9eb475fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 622333}, \'multiverseid\': 622333}, {\'name\': \'Entreposto\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, descarte um card: Você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\\n{1}, {T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 0/1 do tipo Bode.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Devolva o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique um artefato: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3bb1747-c895-4ae8-9c18-edb1dd3f4d95\', \'multiverseId\': 622520}, \'multiverseid\': 622520}]', '[{\'name\': \'Harscher Mentor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Fähigkeit eines Artefakts, einer Kreatur oder eines Landes im Spiel aktiviert und falls es keine Manafähigkeit ist, fügt der Harsche Mentor dem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Schon bald könnte eine Zeit kommen, in der Tapferkeit ohne Ruhm benötigt wird. Doch die Taten werden nicht weniger tapfer sein, weil man keine Loblieder über sie singt."\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e59c6c58-86a7-4fd2-9aad-866b842186d1\', \'multiverseId\': 621518}, \'multiverseid\': 621518}, {\'name\': \'Mentor riguroso\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente active una habilidad de un artefacto, criatura o tierra en el campo de batalla, si no es una habilidad de maná, el Mentor riguroso hace 2 puntos de daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tal vez pronto llegue el día en el que necesitemos valentía sin gloria. Las hazañas no son menos valerosas porque nadie las alabe".\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'712ff9d4-3547-409a-940c-2b30313c185d\', \'multiverseId\': 621705}, \'multiverseid\': 621705}, {\'name\': \'Mentor exigeant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire active une capacité d\'un artefact, d\'une créature ou d\'un terrain sur le champ de bataille, si ce n\'est pas une capacité de mana, le Mentor exigeant inflige 2 blessures à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Peut-être bientôt viendra un jour où nous aurons besoin de bravoure sans renom. Pourtant les actions ne seront pas moins vaillantes parce qu\'elles ne sont pas glorifiées. »\\n—Aragorn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621892&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60006057-55dc-4a60-9dc6-e42baaf2ede1\', \'multiverseId\': 621892}, \'multiverseid\': 621892}, {\'name\': \'Mentore Severo\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un avversario attiva un\'abilità di un artefatto, una creatura o una terra sul campo di battaglia, se non è un\'abilità di mana, il Mentore Severo infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Presto ci sarà bisogno di valore senza gloria. Eppure saranno imprese altrettanto valorose, anche se non sono lodate."\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d36bfcd-ae52-4e75-96dd-70022efa1fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 622079}, \'multiverseid\': 622079}, {\'name\': \'過酷な指導者\', \'text\': \'対戦相手が戦場にあるアーティファクトやクリーチャーや土地の能力１つを起動するたび、それがマナ能力でない場合、過酷な指導者はそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「功名なき勇猛が必要とされるときも来るだろう。讃える者がないからと、その功が勇敢さにおいて劣ることにはなりはしまい。」\\n——アラゴルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b19a1643-4f6c-4b68-8baa-17bf8d09e5fa\', \'multiverseId\': 622266}, \'multiverseid\': 622266}, {\'name\': \'Mentor Austero\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente ativa uma habilidade de um artefato, criatura ou terreno no campo de batalha, se essa não é uma habilidade de mana, Mentor Austero causa 2 pontos de dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Em breve pode chegar um momento em que haverá a necessidade de valentia sem renome. E mesmo assim os feitos não serão menos valorosos por não serem celebrados."\\n— Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d1d63e-627b-4425-b822-fd0d700b51ad\', \'multiverseId\': 622453}, \'multiverseid\': 622453}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heldinnen von Minas Tirith\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Heldinnen von Minas Tirith ins Spiel kommen, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes im Zug jedes Gegners und falls du der Monarch bist, kann jener Gegner {X} bezahlen, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf seiner Hand ist. Falls er dies nicht tut, kann er dich in diesem Kampf nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Herrschaft Saurons ist ein für alle Mal vorbei!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620360&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68d647b-4157-44c2-800a-7c6048fe82cf\', \'multiverseId\': 620360}, \'multiverseid\': 620360}, {\'name\': \'Champions de Minas Tirith\', \'text\': "Quand les Champions de Minas Tirith arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début du combat pendant le tour de chaque adversaire, si vous êtes le monarque, cet adversaire peut payer {X}, X étant le nombre de cartes dans sa main. S\'il ne le fait pas, il ne peut pas vous attaquer à ce combat.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Le royaume de Sauron a disparu à jamais ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620428&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b96d5c-2418-483b-9f80-453fab028dd6\', \'multiverseId\': 620428}, \'multiverseid\': 620428}, {\'name\': \'ミナス・ティリスの英雄\', \'text\': \'ミナス・ティリスの英雄が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\n各対戦相手のターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたが統治者である場合、その対戦相手は{X}を支払ってもよい。Ｘはそのプレイヤーの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。そうしないなら、この戦闘で、そのプレイヤーはあなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「サウロンの王国は永遠に終わった！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d9889e-4957-49c0-8959-0da9623fb59a\', \'multiverseId\': 620496}, \'multiverseid\': 620496}, {\'name\': \'米那斯提力斯斗士\', \'text\': \'当米那斯提力斯斗士进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在每位对手回合的战斗开始时，若你是君主，则该对手可以支付{X}，X为其手牌数量。若其未如此作，则该对手本次战斗不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「索隆的国度已被终结，永不复存！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb29769-1e62-4119-9f98-067ef63d2d89\', \'multiverseId\': 620564}, \'multiverseid\': 620564}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heldinnen von Minas Tirith\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Heldinnen von Minas Tirith ins Spiel kommen, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes im Zug jedes Gegners und falls du der Monarch bist, kann jener Gegner {X} bezahlen, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf seiner Hand ist. Falls er dies nicht tut, kann er dich in diesem Kampf nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Herrschaft Saurons ist ein für alle Mal vorbei!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620768&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a94d8f2a-5243-48f7-bb1b-3256fb49456d\', \'multiverseId\': 620768}, \'multiverseid\': 620768}, {\'name\': \'Campeones de Minas Tirith\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Campeones de Minas Tirith entren al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo del combate en el turno de cada oponente, si eres el monarca, ese oponente puede pagar {X}, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en su mano. Si no lo hace, no puede atacarte este combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡El reino de Sauron terminó para siempre!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dacd3d88-9381-45ac-aeb6-440114dd2757\', \'multiverseId\': 620840}, \'multiverseid\': 620840}, {\'name\': \'Champions de Minas Tirith\', \'text\': "Quand les Champions de Minas Tirith arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début du combat pendant le tour de chaque adversaire, si vous êtes le monarque, cet adversaire peut payer {X}, X étant le nombre de cartes dans sa main. S\'il ne le fait pas, il ne peut pas vous attaquer à ce combat.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Le royaume de Sauron a disparu à jamais ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1712731b-4464-4df9-8142-e5d3d878fd44\', \'multiverseId\': 620912}, \'multiverseid\': 620912}, {\'name\': \'Campioni di Minas Tirith\', \'text\': "Quando i Campioni di Minas Tirith entrano nel campo di battaglia, diventi il monarca.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel turno di ogni avversario, se sei il monarca, quell\'avversario può pagare {X}, dove X è il numero di carte nella sua mano. Se non lo fa, non può attaccarti in questo combattimento.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il Regno di Sauron è finito per sempre!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0221c324-d87b-4591-8876-25eaf4141944\', \'multiverseId\': 620984}, \'multiverseid\': 620984}, {\'name\': \'ミナス・ティリスの英雄\', \'text\': \'ミナス・ティリスの英雄が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\n各対戦相手のターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたが統治者である場合、その対戦相手は{X}を支払ってもよい。Ｘはそのプレイヤーの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。そうしないなら、この戦闘で、そのプレイヤーはあなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「サウロンの王国は永遠に終わった！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a60d286-68f8-4180-9652-7525f9ea0b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 621056}, \'multiverseid\': 621056}, {\'name\': \'Campeões de Minas Tirith\', \'text\': \'Quando Campeões de Minas Tirith entra no campo de batalha, você se torna o monarca.\\nNo início do combate no turno de cada oponente, se você for o monarca, aquele oponente pode pagar {X}, sendo X o número de cards na mão dele. Se não fizer isso, aquele oponente não poderá atacar você neste combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"O Reino de Sauron se foi para sempre!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c1ed28e-b530-4090-ae8e-2e3ed4cb3d29\', \'multiverseId\': 621128}, \'multiverseid\': 621128}, {\'name\': \'米那斯提力斯斗士\', \'text\': \'当米那斯提力斯斗士进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在每位对手回合的战斗开始时，若你是君主，则该对手可以支付{X}，X为其手牌数量。若其未如此作，则该对手本次战斗不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「索隆的国度已被终结，永不复存！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63520d67-7e9a-4e8f-81dd-21bad9c4e7a0\', \'multiverseId\': 621200}, \'multiverseid\': 621200}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heroische Intervention\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Lass eure Herzen nicht von Sorgen schwer werden. Selbst jetzt gibt es noch Hoffnung."\\n—Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621546&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9989ccc4-aa57-445e-96d6-61d31a15f737\', \'multiverseId\': 621546}, \'multiverseid\': 621546}, {\'name\': \'Intervención heroica\', \'text\': \'Los permanentes que controlas ganan las habilidades de antimaleficio e indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que sus corazones no se turben. Aún hay esperanza".\\n—Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b72c6d-dc47-4229-999f-8be44e877830\', \'multiverseId\': 621733}, \'multiverseid\': 621733}, {\'name\': \'Intervention héroïque\', \'text\': "Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent la défense talismanique et l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ne laissez pas vos cœurs se troubler. En ce moment même, il y a encore de l\'espoir. »\\n—Galadriel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621920&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b04e8be-7663-4f39-920a-47bde151f001\', \'multiverseId\': 621920}, \'multiverseid\': 621920}, {\'name\': \'Intervento Eroico\', \'text\': \'I permanenti che controlli hanno anti-malocchio e indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Che i vostri cuori non si turbino. C\\\'è ancora qualche speranza."\\n—Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c828292-7e37-47d7-a944-0a80efd65ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 622107}, \'multiverseid\': 622107}, {\'name\': \'英雄的介入\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは呪禁と破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「心配なさらぬように。今でもまだ望みは残っております。」\\n――ガラドリエル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8abee64e-9f6f-4553-8de4-322fc2d6abd9\', \'multiverseId\': 622294}, \'multiverseid\': 622294}, {\'name\': \'Intervenção Heroica\', \'text\': \'As permanentes que você controla ganham resistência a magia e indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não permitam que seus corações se aflijam. Mesmo agora ainda há esperança."\\n— Galadriel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47f6998-4deb-409b-8839-e3cd7273aae8\', \'multiverseId\': 622481}, \'multiverseid\': 622481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterhalt der Galadrim\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/1 grüne Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an angreifenden Kreaturen ist.\\nVerhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug von Nicht-Elf-Kreaturen zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Keiner dieser Orks wird jemals aus Lórien zurückkehren."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620387&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64ff001d-ed09-4c01-928d-dfe0ef297de0\', \'multiverseId\': 620387}, \'multiverseid\': 620387}, {\'name\': \'Embuscade des Galadhrim\', \'text\': \'Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier, X étant le nombre de créatures attaquantes.\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci par des créatures non-Elfe.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Jamais plus ces orques ne repartiront de la Lórien. »\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25758005-0665-4e6a-9d12-6c4c33ef2f2f\', \'multiverseId\': 620455}, \'multiverseid\': 620455}, {\'name\': \'ガラズリムの待ち伏せ\', \'text\': \'緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘは攻撃クリーチャーの数に等しい。\\nこのターン、エルフでないクリーチャーが与えるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「オークは一人たりとも、ロリアンから生きて帰れはしないでしょう。」\\n――ハルディア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e3367a-9473-4bf1-bc90-ab8b9ea125bc\', \'multiverseId\': 620523}, \'multiverseid\': 620523}, {\'name\': \'加拉兹民突袭\', \'text\': \'派出X个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物，X为进行攻击的生物数量。\\n于本回合中，防止非妖精生物将造成的所有战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「那些奥克都别想活着离开罗瑞恩。」\\n～哈尔迪尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54b456c3-fada-46f2-8138-d68145f1ddcb\', \'multiverseId\': 620591}, \'multiverseid\': 620591}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterhalt der Galadrim\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/1 grüne Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an angreifenden Kreaturen ist.\\nVerhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug von Nicht-Elf-Kreaturen zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Keiner dieser Orks wird jemals aus Lórien zurückkehren."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'468afe77-0a41-455e-b785-63466ade79d9\', \'multiverseId\': 620796}, \'multiverseid\': 620796}, {\'name\': \'Emboscada de los galadrim\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Guerrero Elfo verdes 1/1, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas atacantes.\\nPrevén todo el daño de combate que fueran a hacer este turno las criaturas que no sean Elfo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ninguno de los orcos logrará salir de Lórien".\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9885ac7-71f7-4e85-a551-8acd3bc85b80\', \'multiverseId\': 620868}, \'multiverseid\': 620868}, {\'name\': \'Embuscade des Galadhrim\', \'text\': \'Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier, X étant le nombre de créatures attaquantes.\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci par des créatures non-Elfe.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Jamais plus ces orques ne repartiront de la Lórien. »\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620940&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32b81eea-29b7-4357-b626-b550870f0bd1\', \'multiverseId\': 620940}, \'multiverseid\': 620940}, {\'name\': \'Imboscata dei Galadhrim\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verdi, dove X è il numero di creature attaccanti.\\nPrevieni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto in questo turno dalle creature non Elfo.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Di quegli Orchi nemmeno uno uscirà vivo da Lórien."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f8dab84-9b13-4591-93b5-1bbf067eb489\', \'multiverseId\': 621012}, \'multiverseid\': 621012}, {\'name\': \'ガラズリムの待ち伏せ\', \'text\': \'緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘは攻撃クリーチャーの数に等しい。\\nこのターン、エルフでないクリーチャーが与えるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「オークは一人たりとも、ロリアンから生きて帰れはしないでしょう。」\\n――ハルディア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca48c69e-fde7-41ce-93af-8e2e47c7aa69\', \'multiverseId\': 621084}, \'multiverseid\': 621084}, {\'name\': \'Emboscada dos Galadhrim\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura Elfo Guerreiro verde 1/1, sendo X o número de criaturas atacantes.\\nPrevina todo o dano de combate que seria causado neste turno por criaturas não Elfo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Nenhum dos orcs jamais retornará de Lórien."\\n— Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c50db899-90ad-4510-82e5-31fb027ec780\', \'multiverseId\': 621156}, \'multiverseid\': 621156}, {\'name\': \'加拉兹民突袭\', \'text\': \'派出X个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物，X为进行攻击的生物数量。\\n于本回合中，防止非妖精生物将造成的所有战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「那些奥克都别想活着离开罗瑞恩。」\\n～哈尔迪尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e07c261-4af1-4736-91f8-649732e6c585\', \'multiverseId\': 621228}, \'multiverseid\': 621228}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterlandhafen\', \'text\': \'Der Hinterlandhafen kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen Wald oder eine Insel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Legolas baute in Ithilien ein graues Schiff, segelte damit den Anduin hinab und weiter, übers Meer; mit ihm, so hieß es, fuhr Gimli der Zwerg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621614&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a2f019d-84ac-49e8-aa18-7644a6f8da4f\', \'multiverseId\': 621614}, \'multiverseid\': 621614}, {\'name\': \'Puerto interior\', \'text\': \'El Puerto interior entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles un Bosque o una Isla.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Legolas construyó una nave gris en Ithilien y navegó por el Anduin hasta llegar al mar. Se dice que con él fue Gimli, el enano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c606eb11-1115-4660-a393-c5f733e67f54\', \'multiverseId\': 621801}, \'multiverseid\': 621801}, {\'name\': "Port de l\'arrière-pays", \'text\': "Le Port de l\'arrière-pays arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une forêt ou une île.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Legolas construisit une embarcation grise en Ithilien, et descendit l\'Anduin jusqu\'à la mer... Et avec lui, dit-on, partit Gimli le nain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621988&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cdb971c-0347-4934-aace-4f576fa4c778\', \'multiverseId\': 621988}, \'multiverseid\': 621988}, {\'name\': "Porto dell\'Entroterra", \'text\': "Il Porto dell\'Entroterra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una Foresta o un\'Isola.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Legolas costruì nell\'Ithilien una barca grigia, discese il corso dell\'Anduin e traversò il Mare; con lui pare vi fosse Gimli il Nano.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dab3b03-e317-479e-a5c2-c081f85aef4e\', \'multiverseId\': 622175}, \'multiverseid\': 622175}, {\'name\': \'内陸の湾港\', \'text\': \'あなたが森や島をコントロールしていないかぎり、内陸の湾港はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'レゴラスはイシリアンで灰色の船を造り、アンドゥインを下って海を渡った。彼と共にドワーフのギムリも行ったと言われている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4763a39b-849c-4785-a4e0-28c458f7c6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 622362}, \'multiverseid\': 622362}, {\'name\': \'Porto do Interior\', \'text\': \'Porto do Interior entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma Floresta ou uma Ilha.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Legolas construiu um barco cinza em Ithilien e velejou pelo Anduin e além Mar; e com ele, dizia-se, foi Gimli, o Anão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'239ecbfc-0e4a-40c0-8cb8-2afc36a672b5\', \'multiverseId\': 622549}, \'multiverseid\': 622549}]', "[{'name': 'Hithlain-Seil', 'text': 'Das Hithlain-Seil kann nicht geopfert werden.\\n{1}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach. Der Spieler rechts von dir übernimmt die Kontrolle über das Hithlain-Seil.\\n{2}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Der Spieler rechts von dir übernimmt die Kontrolle über das Hithlain-Seil.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620422&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8801c565-d32d-479f-adca-bd26ea530624', 'multiverseId': 620422}, 'multiverseid': 620422}, {'name': 'Corde de hithlain', 'text': 'La Corde de hithlain ne peut pas être sacrifiée.\\n{1}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez. Le joueur à votre droite acquiert le contrôle de la Corde de hithlain.\\n{2}, {T} : Piochez une carte. Le joueur à votre droite acquiert le contrôle de la Corde de hithlain.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620490&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4901bf2b-a45d-433e-a141-b2b09711f706', 'multiverseId': 620490}, 'multiverseid': 620490}, {'name': 'ヒスラインの綱', 'text': 'ヒスラインの綱は生け贄に捧げることができない。\\n{1}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。あなたの右側のプレイヤーはヒスラインの綱のコントロールを得る。\\n{2}, {T}：カード１枚を引く。あなたの右側のプレイヤーはヒスラインの綱のコントロールを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620558&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a767672-1494-4a88-a0e4-a0ae01f86033', 'multiverseId': 620558}, 'multiverseid': 620558}, {'name': '希斯莱恩绳索', 'text': '不能牺牲希斯莱恩绳索。\\n{1}，{T}：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。你右手边的牌手获得希斯莱恩绳索之操控权。\\n{2}，{T}：抓一张牌。你右手边的牌手获得希斯莱恩绳索之操控权。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620626&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b17e3ff-22d5-4cb0-b6b1-b95a724a8369', 'multiverseId': 620626}, 'multiverseid': 620626}]", "[{'name': 'Hithlain-Seil', 'text': 'Das Hithlain-Seil kann nicht geopfert werden.\\n{1}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach. Der Spieler rechts von dir übernimmt die Kontrolle über das Hithlain-Seil.\\n{2}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Der Spieler rechts von dir übernimmt die Kontrolle über das Hithlain-Seil.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620834&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d69d982-dd24-4a23-953f-a7acb6244c2e', 'multiverseId': 620834}, 'multiverseid': 620834}, {'name': 'Cuerda de hithlain', 'text': 'La Cuerda de hithlain no puede ser sacrificada.\\n{1}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja. El jugador de tu derecha gana el control de la Cuerda de hithlain.\\n{2}, {T}: Roba una carta. El jugador de tu derecha gana el control de la Cuerda de hithlain.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620906&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cd04b0c-1da7-4f1f-a7db-e9d0c853bef2', 'multiverseId': 620906}, 'multiverseid': 620906}, {'name': 'Corde de hithlain', 'text': 'La Corde de hithlain ne peut pas être sacrifiée.\\n{1}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez. Le joueur à votre droite acquiert le contrôle de la Corde de hithlain.\\n{2}, {T} : Piochez une carte. Le joueur à votre droite acquiert le contrôle de la Corde de hithlain.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620978&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '464f6584-212c-490a-ac4c-4a45134bdc3a', 'multiverseId': 620978}, 'multiverseid': 620978}, {'name': 'Corda di Hithlain', 'text': 'La Corda di Hithlain non può essere sacrificata.\\n{1}, {T}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola. Il giocatore alla tua destra prende il controllo della Corda di Hithlain.\\n{2}, {T}: Peschi una carta. Il giocatore alla tua destra prende il controllo della Corda di Hithlain.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621050&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94ffd01d-ed36-49c4-a9a5-bbd1ef47ab8b', 'multiverseId': 621050}, 'multiverseid': 621050}, {'name': 'ヒスラインの綱', 'text': 'ヒスラインの綱は生け贄に捧げることができない。\\n{1}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。あなたの右側のプレイヤーはヒスラインの綱のコントロールを得る。\\n{2}, {T}：カード１枚を引く。あなたの右側のプレイヤーはヒスラインの綱のコントロールを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621122&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28286bcb-5bbb-4e18-9111-dfc4238672fa', 'multiverseId': 621122}, 'multiverseid': 621122}, {'name': 'Corda de Hithlain', 'text': 'Corda de Hithlain não pode ser sacrificada.\\n{1}, {T}: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe. O jogador à sua direita ganha o controle de Corda de Hithlain.\\n{2}, {T}: Compre um card. O jogador à sua direita ganha o controle de Corda de Hithlain.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621194&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40ba1dcf-93a8-4e52-8f8c-8447c521db62', 'multiverseId': 621194}, 'multiverseid': 621194}, {'name': '希斯莱恩绳索', 'text': '不能牺牲希斯莱恩绳索。\\n{1}，{T}：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。你右手边的牌手获得希斯莱恩绳索之操控权。\\n{2}，{T}：抓一张牌。你右手边的牌手获得希斯莱恩绳索之操控权。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621266&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02071ade-61e5-4f0f-9742-43889e4ce000', 'multiverseId': 621266}, 'multiverseid': 621266}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hof des Zorns\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Hof des Zorns ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt der Hof des Zorns einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls du der Monarch bist, fügt er stattdessen 7 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie lang ist es her, dass Saruman dich gekauft hat? Wie hoch war der versprochene Preis?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621510&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67538f72-e574-4ceb-a6b4-5ca877696fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 621510}, \'multiverseid\': 621510}, {\'name\': \'Corte de la ira\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Corte de ira entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, la Corte de la ira hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo. Si eres el monarca, en vez de eso, hace 7 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Cuánto hace desde que Saruman te compró? ¿Qué precio te prometió?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7160f2f-89a1-4dfe-af91-8d5bcce2be73\', \'multiverseId\': 621697}, \'multiverseid\': 621697}, {\'name\': \'Cour de la Colère\', \'text\': "Quand la Cour de la Colère arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de votre entretien, la Cour de la Colère inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. Si vous êtes le monarque, elle inflige 7 blessures à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Depuis combien de temps Saruman vous a-t-il acheté ? Quel était le prix promis ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad043301-be30-4f82-9a07-834e053e6500\', \'multiverseId\': 621884}, \'multiverseid\': 621884}, {\'name\': \'Corte della Collera\', \'text\': "Quando la Corte della Collera entra nel campo di battaglia, diventi il monarca.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, la Corte della Collera infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Se sei il monarca, infligge invece 7 danni.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Da quanto tempo ti sei venduto a Saruman? Qual era la ricompensa promessa?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3495bf64-09d6-4563-9b35-181dc1710349\', \'multiverseId\': 622071}, \'multiverseid\': 622071}, {\'name\': \'激憤の宮廷\', \'text\': \'激憤の宮廷が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。激憤の宮廷はそれに２点のダメージを与える。あなたが統治者であるなら、代わりに、これは７点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「いつからサルマンに買収されておった？引き換えに約束されたのは何だ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de746255-a23a-4883-8a0d-43a59460506b\', \'multiverseId\': 622258}, \'multiverseid\': 622258}, {\'name\': \'Corte da Ira\', \'text\': \'Quando Corte da Ira entra no campo de batalha, você se torna o monarca.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, Corte da Ira causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo. Se você for o monarca, em vez disso, ela causa 7 pontos de dano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Quanto tempo faz que Saruman o comprou? Qual foi o preço prometido?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a021db32-2190-4d6d-acf3-4389a34f9b96\', \'multiverseId\': 622445}, \'multiverseid\': 622445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hoffnungsschimmer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{3}{W}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein mit Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Hoffnung entfachte er neu, und in Hoffnung endete er;\\nüber den Tod, über die Furcht, über das Verderben erhaben\\naus Verlust, aus dem Leben, zu ewig währendem Ruhm."\\n—Grabrede auf Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9921f217-0fb2-4a4c-ae2f-dfb3e372393b\', \'multiverseId\': 621461}, \'multiverseid\': 621461}, {\'name\': \'Alba de esperanza\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Encendió una nueva esperanza, y murió esperanzado.\\nTrascendió la muerte, el pavor y el destino esperado.\\nSin ruina y vida, por siempre de gloria colmado".\\n—Elegía a Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8508c569-b7d1-424f-b46d-0c49c5693c55\', \'multiverseId\': 621648}, \'multiverseid\': 621648}, {\'name\': "Aube de l\'espoir", \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\n{3}{W} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat avec le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« L\'espoir il a ravivé, et dans l\'espoir il a fini ;\\nélevé au-dessus de la mort, de la crainte et de la tragédie,\\nloin du deuil et de la vie, jusqu\'à une gloire infinie. »\\n—Oraison funèbre de Théoden", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5066a6d2-b730-4e3c-8df4-f677d67ea329\', \'multiverseId\': 621835}, \'multiverseid\': 621835}, {\'name\': \'Alba di Speranza\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca con legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La speranza riaccese e nella speranza se ne andò;\\noltre la morte, la paura e il fato,\\nverso la pace, la speranza e la gloria."\\n—Elogio funebre a Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dd2f14d-80ee-42a3-b821-dadf6d732811\', \'multiverseId\': 622022}, \'multiverseid\': 622022}, {\'name\': \'希望の夜明け\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\\n{3}{W}：絆魂を持つ白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「王は望みの火を再び灯し、望みを抱きつつ果てた。\\n死を越え、恐れを越え、滅びを越えて\\n人の世の生死を抜けて、とこしえの栄光に昇っていった。」\\n――セオデンへの追悼歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aaadc72-b724-4b3a-9369-b6aeac8ea85e\', \'multiverseId\': 622209}, \'multiverseid\': 622209}, {\'name\': \'Aurora da Esperança\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\\n{3}{W}: Crie uma ficha de criatura Soldado branca 1/1 com vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A esperança ele reacendeu, e em esperança ele se foi;\\nacima da morte, acima do terror, acima da ruína alçado\\nalém da perda, além da vida, rumo à glória duradoura."\\n— Elogio a Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac17671-2b71-48d1-947d-c42555fef6d2\', \'multiverseId\': 622396}, \'multiverseid\': 622396}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hohn vom Bollwerk\', \'text\': \'Stachle alle Kreaturen an, die deine Gegner kontrollieren. Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug können jene Kreaturen nicht blocken. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen jene Kreaturen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greifen einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heißt es nicht, dass kein Feind je die Hornburg einnehmen konnte, wenn Menschen sie verteidigten?"\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620829&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca3fab1-8452-4a57-8030-33faf83b08a9\', \'multiverseId\': 620829}, \'multiverseid\': 620829}, {\'name\': \'Burla desde la muralla\', \'text\': \'Incita a todas las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes. Hasta tu próximo turno, esas criaturas no pueden bloquear. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esas criaturas atacan cada combate si pueden y atacan a un jugador que no seas tú si pueden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Acaso no se dice que ningún enemigo tomó jamás Cuernavilla cuando la defendieron los hombres?".\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8d54fc4-3b06-4279-af2a-5191673ca70b\', \'multiverseId\': 620901}, \'multiverseid\': 620901}, {\'name\': \'Moquerie du haut des remparts\', \'text\': "Incitez toutes les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent. Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures ne peuvent pas bloquer. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures attaquent à chaque combat si possible et attaquent un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ne dit-on pas qu\'aucun ennemi n\'a jamais pris Fort le Cor quand des hommes le défendaient ? »\\n—Aragorn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620973&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'314e2543-40c7-45eb-b4d2-0f32ba2f3823\', \'multiverseId\': 620973}, \'multiverseid\': 620973}, {\'name\': \'Provocazione dal Bastione\', \'text\': \'Sprona tutte le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari. Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature non possono bloccare. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature attaccano in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se possono farlo.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non si dice forse che mai nemico prese il Trombatorrione difeso dagli Uomini?"\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b16d052-6864-4b45-bab1-c2684cb99d55\', \'multiverseId\': 621045}, \'multiverseid\': 621045}, {\'name\': \'塁壁からの挑発\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーを使嗾する。次のあなたのターンまで、それらのクリーチャーではブロックできない。（次のあなたのターンまで、それらのクリーチャーは、可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「人間の守りあらば、角笛城はいかなる敵にも落ちたことがない。そう言い伝えられてはいなかったか？」\\n――アラゴルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50f540e6-5561-407b-8121-2903708c39e6\', \'multiverseId\': 621117}, \'multiverseid\': 621117}, {\'name\': \'Provocar das Ameias\', \'text\': \'Atice todas as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam. Até seu próximo turno aquelas criaturas não podem bloquear. (Até seu próximo turno, aquelas criaturas atacam a cada combate se estiverem aptas e atacam um jogador que não seja você se estiverem aptas.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Não se diz que inimigo algum jamais tomou o Forte da Trombeta com homens a defendê-lo?"\\n— Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba18e69-4246-4202-82a4-38663e356856\', \'multiverseId\': 621189}, \'multiverseid\': 621189}, {\'name\': \'壁垒叫嚣\', \'text\': \'煽惑所有由对手操控的生物。直到你的下一个回合，这些生物不能进行阻挡。（直到你的下一个回合，那些生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「不是说，只要有人来守号角堡，就不曾有敌人攻下它？」\\n～阿拉贡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'866290cf-69ab-4567-b01b-1e0028b98f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 621261}, \'multiverseid\': 621261}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hohn vom Bollwerk\', \'text\': \'Stachle alle Kreaturen an, die deine Gegner kontrollieren. Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug können jene Kreaturen nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heißt es nicht, dass kein Feind je die Hornburg einnehmen konnte, wenn Menschen sie verteidigten?"\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620417&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e52d201-1816-4812-bb05-a50859a4a619\', \'multiverseId\': 620417}, \'multiverseid\': 620417}, {\'name\': \'Moquerie du haut des remparts\', \'text\': "Incitez toutes les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent. Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures ne peuvent pas bloquer.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ne dit-on pas qu\'aucun ennemi n\'a jamais pris Fort le Cor quand des hommes le défendaient ? »\\n—Aragorn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620485&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb7a612-be26-4a16-a787-d482c321d50b\', \'multiverseId\': 620485}, \'multiverseid\': 620485}, {\'name\': \'塁壁からの挑発\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーを使嗾する。次のあなたのターンまで、それらのクリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「人間の守りあらば、角笛城はいかなる敵にも落ちたことがない。そう言い伝えられてはいなかったか？」\\n――アラゴルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae50085f-b0ce-4d67-9c79-aa256730ced1\', \'multiverseId\': 620553}, \'multiverseid\': 620553}, {\'name\': \'壁垒叫嚣\', \'text\': \'煽惑所有由对手操控的生物。直到你的下一个回合，这些生物不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「不是说，只要有人来守号角堡，就不曾有敌人攻下它？」\\n～阿拉贡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f122121-83ec-4e10-ad1f-65d25f4076d2\', \'multiverseId\': 620621}, \'multiverseid\': 620621}]', '[{\'name\': \'Horn des Herolds\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Horn des Herolds ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturenzauber des bestimmten Typs, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments schaust du dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte des bestimmten Typs ist, kannst du sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f42675e-0331-468a-8047-0c06a67723d1\', \'multiverseId\': 621577}, \'multiverseid\': 621577}, {\'name\': \'Cuerno del heraldo\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Cuerno del heraldo entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de criatura del tipo elegido.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura del tipo elegido, puedes mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e39b5a-2874-4402-a035-0a1f94a890d6\', \'multiverseId\': 621764}, \'multiverseid\': 621764}, {\'name\': \'Cor du héraut\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Cor du héraut arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes sorts de créature du type choisi que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nAu début de votre entretien, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature du type choisi, vous pouvez la révéler et la mettre dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621951&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba66fefc-c9e0-4407-a102-842cbc713047\', \'multiverseId\': 621951}, \'multiverseid\': 621951}, {\'name\': "Corno dell\'Araldo", \'text\': "Mentre il Corno dell\'Araldo entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nLe magie creatura del tipo scelto che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura del tipo scelto, puoi rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'561734cf-429e-49e4-83c2-00b23740ab4f\', \'multiverseId\': 622138}, \'multiverseid\': 622138}, {\'name\': \'通報の角笛\', \'text\': \'通報の角笛が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがその選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それがその選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・カードであるなら、あなたは「それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'444d82d5-684e-4920-a7c1-f4c3e1119d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 622325}, \'multiverseid\': 622325}, {\'name\': \'Corneta do Arauto\', \'text\': \'Conforme Corneta do Arauto entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAs mágicas de criatura do tipo escolhido que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura do tipo escolhido, você poderá revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9b94ef1-6887-4b26-83da-5e5919710a5c\', \'multiverseId\': 622512}, \'multiverseid\': 622512}]', "[{'name': 'Hornissenkönigin', 'text': 'Fliegend, Todesberührung\\nWenn die Hornissenkönigin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 grüne Insekt-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit und Todesberührung.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621547&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4d4fd1d-427a-4a13-b210-b58877aee338', 'multiverseId': 621547}, 'multiverseid': 621547}, {'name': 'Avispa reina', 'text': 'Vuela, toque mortal.\\nCuando la Avispa reina entre al campo de batalla, crea cuatro fichas de criatura Insecto verdes 1/1 con las habilidades de volar y toque mortal.', 'type': 'Criatura — Insecto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621734&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d7f0b94-83fc-46e8-8f3e-7aea41fc1b6c', 'multiverseId': 621734}, 'multiverseid': 621734}, {'name': 'Reine des frelons', 'text': 'Vol, contact mortel\\nQuand la Reine des frelons arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature 1/1 verte Insecte avec le vol et le contact mortel.', 'type': 'Créature : insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621921&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae88661b-9e86-4db9-8160-c13efc5588d3', 'multiverseId': 621921}, 'multiverseid': 621921}, {'name': 'Regina dei Calabroni', 'text': 'Volare, tocco letale\\nQuando la Regina dei Calabroni entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura Insetto 1/1 verdi con volare e tocco letale.', 'type': 'Creatura — Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622108&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca4b54b9-cf58-4bf5-88fb-5d7adca07245', 'multiverseId': 622108}, 'multiverseid': 622108}, {'name': '女王スズメバチ', 'text': '飛行、接死\\n女王スズメバチが戦場に出たとき、飛行と接死を持つ緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622295&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21f99477-efc9-406b-9132-d03511be6dec', 'multiverseId': 622295}, 'multiverseid': 622295}, {'name': 'Vespa Rainha', 'text': 'Voar, toque mortífero\\nQuando Vespa Rainha entrar no campo de batalha, crie quatro fichas de criatura Inseto verde 1/1 com voar e toque mortífero.', 'type': 'Criatura — Inseto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622482&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f18deb31-30da-4f83-bf45-0fb61769bd88', 'multiverseId': 622482}, 'multiverseid': 622482}]", "[{'name': 'Hurtigwindhöhen', 'text': 'Refugium 4 (Wenn dieses Land ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nDie Hurtigwindhöhen kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Falls du in diesem Zug mit drei oder mehr Kreaturen angegriffen hast, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621642&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4674a7c8-7a46-47ea-adc6-c619eda72506', 'multiverseId': 621642}, 'multiverseid': 621642}, {'name': 'Cumbres viento vigorizante', 'text': 'Esconder 4. (Cuando esta tierra entre al campo de batalla, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo en un orden aleatorio.)\\nLas Cumbres viento vigorizante entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si atacaste con tres o más criaturas este turno.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621829&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c87c6ebf-b035-4c56-846d-ec78f214f6a7', 'multiverseId': 621829}, 'multiverseid': 621829}, {'name': 'Hauts de Ventabrupt', 'text': 'Cachette 4 (Quand ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nLes Hauts de Ventabrupt arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\n{W}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si vous avez attaqué avec au moins trois créatures ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622016&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36dbfb28-8dee-4796-b682-20e9e38287ab', 'multiverseId': 622016}, 'multiverseid': 622016}, {'name': 'Alture di Vento Pungente', 'text': 'Nascondiglio 4 (Quando questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo in ordine casuale.)\\nLe Alture di Vento Pungente entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se hai attaccato con tre o più creature in questo turno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622203&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53c88a08-01da-4931-8005-b783dcd43a61', 'multiverseId': 622203}, 'multiverseid': 622203}, {'name': '風立ての高地', 'text': '秘匿４（この土地が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後、残りを一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\n風立ての高地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\n{W}, {T}：このターンにあなたが３体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃していたなら、あなたはその追放されているカード１枚をマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622390&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7fbcec6-cf0a-49a7-8fbd-9999b59f8daa', 'multiverseId': 622390}, 'multiverseid': 622390}, {'name': 'Cumes dos Ventos Velozes', 'text': 'Refúgio 4 (Quando este terreno entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo em ordem aleatória.)\\nCumes dos Ventos Velozes entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se tiver atacado com três ou mais criaturas neste turno.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622577&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5019fa9-44c4-4ad9-bef0-f0974d4a357f', 'multiverseId': 622577}, 'multiverseid': 622577}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hymne des Marschalls\', \'text\': \'Multibonus {1}{W} (Du kannst zusätzlich beliebig oft {1}{W} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nWenn die Hymne des Marschalls ins Spiel kommt, bringe bis zu X Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl ist, wie oft die Bonuskosten der Hymne des Marschalls bezahlt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621469&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'704cbb1c-8bc8-490d-aa48-32c3ac01c963\', \'multiverseId\': 621469}, \'multiverseid\': 621469}, {\'name\': \'Himno del mariscal\', \'text\': \'Multiestímulo {1}{W}. (Puedes pagar {1}{W} adicionales tantas veces como quieras al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nCuando el Himno del mariscal entre al campo de batalla, regresa hasta X cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla, donde X es igual a la cantidad de veces que el Himno del mariscal fue estimulado.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a8a31d6-af16-430b-95f1-3798493a0671\', \'multiverseId\': 621656}, \'multiverseid\': 621656}, {\'name\': \'Antienne du maréchal\', \'text\': "Multikick {1}{W} (Vous pouvez payer {1}{W} supplémentaires autant de fois que vous le souhaitez au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nQuand l\'Antienne du maréchal arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à X cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière, X étant le nombre de fois que l\'Antienne du maréchal a été kickée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc8784a6-8128-421f-9392-7e7684336ddc\', \'multiverseId\': 621843}, \'multiverseid\': 621843}, {\'name\': \'Inno del Maresciallo\', \'text\': "Multipotenziamento {1}{W} (Puoi pagare {1}{W} addizionale un qualsiasi numero di volte mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nLe creature che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nQuando l\'Inno del Maresciallo entra nel campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia fino a X carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero, dove X è il numero di volte che l\'Inno del Maresciallo è stato potenziato.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44f5affa-0e1e-415c-97d1-cd260b130eff\', \'multiverseId\': 622030}, \'multiverseid\': 622030}, {\'name\': \'司令官の頌歌\', \'text\': \'多重キッカー{1}{W}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{W}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n司令官の頌歌が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大Ｘ枚を対象とする。それらを戦場に戻す。Ｘは司令官の頌歌がキッカーされた回数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cd38398-a3f5-4286-b248-b06a08ecf54f\', \'multiverseId\': 622217}, \'multiverseid\': 622217}, {\'name\': \'Antífona do Marechal\', \'text\': \'Multireforçar {1}{W} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {1}{W} quantas vezes quiser conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nAs criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\nQuando Antífona do Marechal entrar no campo de batalha, devolva ao campo de batalha até X cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério, sendo X o número de vezes que Antífona do Marechal foi reforçada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53fa47d4-9084-467b-b710-a25de49acd4a\', \'multiverseId\': 622404}, \'multiverseid\': 622404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höhlenhort-Drache\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der höchsten Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\\nFliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nImmer wenn der Höhlenhort-Drache einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeugst du für jedes Artefakt, das der Spieler kontrolliert, einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620380&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa8603a-ede9-4a80-af72-fc068f6d3b6f\', \'multiverseId\': 620380}, \'multiverseid\': 620380}, {\'name\': \'Dragon à la caverne au trésor\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le plus grand nombre d\'artefacts qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nVol, piétinement, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon à la caverne au trésor inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous créez un jeton Trésor pour chaque artefact que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e1ea4e9-bc61-4c66-a221-663bf75d6626\', \'multiverseId\': 620448}, \'multiverseid\': 620448}, {\'name\': \'洞窟に宝蓄えしドラゴン\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘは対戦相手１人がコントロールしているアーティファクトの個数の中の最大の値に等しい。\\n飛行、トランプル、速攻\\n洞窟に宝蓄えしドラゴンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき１つの宝物・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eba355a5-228c-4570-8518-73a2b092a52b\', \'multiverseId\': 620516}, \'multiverseid\': 620516}, {\'name\': \'宝窟巨龙\', \'text\': \'此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为各对手操控之神器数量中的最大值。\\n飞行，践踏，敏捷\\n每当宝窟巨龙对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手每操控一个神器，你便派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'871afe98-e0f6-4111-a5ff-429762d8b5eb\', \'multiverseId\': 620584}, \'multiverseid\': 620584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höhlenhort-Drache\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der höchsten Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\\nFliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nImmer wenn der Höhlenhort-Drache einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeugst du für jedes Artefakt, das der Spieler kontrolliert, einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620789&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5462536a-3afe-4164-ba33-5d97c9666cd2\', \'multiverseId\': 620789}, \'multiverseid\': 620789}, {\'name\': \'Dragón atesorador\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es la mayor cantidad de artefactos que controla un oponente.\\nVuela, arrolla, prisa.\\nSiempre que el Dragón atesorador haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Tesoro por cada artefacto que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5dbbda7-dc4e-467d-8ee5-15a515c31a38\', \'multiverseId\': 620861}, \'multiverseid\': 620861}, {\'name\': \'Dragon à la caverne au trésor\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le plus grand nombre d\'artefacts qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nVol, piétinement, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon à la caverne au trésor inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous créez un jeton Trésor pour chaque artefact que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea770261-6fcf-477f-b8e9-f9a83b94d086\', \'multiverseId\': 620933}, \'multiverseid\': 620933}, {\'name\': \'Drago Accumulatore delle Caverne\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata, dove X è il numero maggiore di artefatti controllati da un avversario.\\nVolare, travolgere, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta il Drago Accumulatore delle Caverne infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei una pedina Tesoro per ogni artefatto controllato da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede41995-6aba-4319-b3c0-be10aec49c7b\', \'multiverseId\': 621005}, \'multiverseid\': 621005}, {\'name\': \'洞窟に宝蓄えしドラゴン\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘは対戦相手１人がコントロールしているアーティファクトの個数の中の最大の値に等しい。\\n飛行、トランプル、速攻\\n洞窟に宝蓄えしドラゴンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき１つの宝物・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af09aa73-ba91-4e83-92b7-f0de6b51c331\', \'multiverseId\': 621077}, \'multiverseid\': 621077}, {\'name\': \'Dragão do Tesouro da Caverna\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {X} a menos para ser conjurada, sendo X o maior número de artefatos que um oponente controla.\\nVoar, atropelar, ímpeto\\nToda vez que Dragão do Tesouro da Caverna causa dano de combate a um jogador, você cria uma ficha de Tesouro para cada artefato que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5773d09-97c9-4678-9fab-568d74253b45\', \'multiverseId\': 621149}, \'multiverseid\': 621149}, {\'name\': \'贮窟巨龙\', \'text\': \'此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为各对手操控之神器数量中的最大值。\\n飞行，践踏，敏捷\\n每当贮窟巨龙对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手每操控一个神器，你便派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c685fbcb-3a41-4f7b-a938-c0b5e912af76\', \'multiverseId\': 621221}, \'multiverseid\': 621221}]', "[{'name': 'Hügelrücken-Drache', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Hügelrücken-Drache ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Hand abwerfen und so viele Karten ziehen, wie einem Gegner deiner Wahl in diesem Zug Schadenspunkte zugefügt wurden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Drache', 'flavor': 'Von den sieben Ringen der Macht der Zwergenkönige hat Sauron drei wiedererlangt. Die anderen haben die Drachen verschlungen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621521&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a9aea30-6673-4ce2-b8f6-ee952cf39f74', 'multiverseId': 621521}, 'multiverseid': 621521}, {'name': 'Dragón loma espinosa', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Dragón loma espinosa entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar tu mano y robar una cantidad de cartas igual al daño hecho al oponente objetivo este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragón', 'flavor': 'De los siete Anillos de Poder que poseyeron los reyes enanos, Sauron recuperó tres y los otros los devoraron los dragones.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621708&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '719efb70-e2e6-4232-861a-411087d3309f', 'multiverseId': 621708}, 'multiverseid': 621708}, {'name': 'Dragon de Tertrépine', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Dragon de Tertrépine arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser de votre main et piocher un nombre de cartes égal au nombre de blessures infligées à un adversaire ciblé ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : dragon', 'flavor': 'Des sept Anneaux de Pouvoir que les Rois nains possédaient, Sauron en a récupéré trois, et les autres ont été consumés par les dragons.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621895&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5761535e-7398-4d59-a9ed-caa20f934153', 'multiverseId': 621895}, 'multiverseid': 621895}, {'name': 'Drago di Spina Rocciosa', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Drago di Spina Rocciosa entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi scartare la tua mano e pescare un numero di carte pari al danno inflitto in questo turno a un avversario bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Drago', 'flavor': 'Dei sette Anelli del Potere posseduti dai Re dei Nani, tre li ha ripresi Sauron e gli altri sono stati annientati dai Draghi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622082&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05984357-b692-4382-b086-82040ebd165b', 'multiverseId': 622082}, 'multiverseid': 622082}, {'name': '山背骨のドラゴン', 'text': '飛行\\n山背骨のドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたは「あなたの手札を捨て、このターンにそのプレイヤーが受けたダメージの点数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': '指輪のうち七つはドワーフ王たちが所有していた。そのうち三つはサウロンが奪いとり、残りは竜どもが焼きつくした。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622269&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac98c25c-8e0b-4992-adef-e59d6bb7bbb8', 'multiverseId': 622269}, 'multiverseid': 622269}, {'name': 'Dragão da Colina Espinhosa', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Dragão da Colina Espinhosa entra no campo de batalha, você pode descartar sua mão e comprar uma quantidade de cards igual ao dano causado ao oponente alvo neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragão', 'flavor': 'Dos sete Anéis do Poder que os reis dos Anões possuíam, três Sauron recuperou. Os outros, os dragões consumiram.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622456&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9408e84-72de-462e-93e6-9c2882a32128', 'multiverseId': 622456}, 'multiverseid': 622456}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hüter des Lebenssafts\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Elben geben selten unbedacht Rat, denn Ratschläge sind ein gefährliches Geschenk, selbst unter den Weisen."\\n—Gildor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d499543-aabf-47e9-ae4b-0190944f8e96\', \'multiverseId\': 621539}, \'multiverseid\': 621539}, {\'name\': \'Protectora de esencia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Rara vez dan los elfos consejos indiscretos, pues los consejos son un presente peligroso, hasta del más sabio a otro sabio".\\n—Gildor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8986e1e2-df97-4f69-98f1-85ceaefe5463\', \'multiverseId\': 621726}, \'multiverseid\': 621726}, {\'name\': "Garde d\'essence", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Les elfes donnent rarement des conseils spontanés, car un conseil est un don dangereux même d\'un sage à un autre. »\\n—Gildor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ab946a2-fee3-412a-8a75-535b8f2155ed\', \'multiverseId\': 621913}, \'multiverseid\': 621913}, {\'name\': "Guardiana dell\'Essenza", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"È molto raro che gli Elfi esprimano il loro parere, poiché i consigli sono doni pericolosi, anche se scambiati fra saggi."\\n—Gildor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d18639d-ab8a-4b19-bdc9-d3c0230f31ca\', \'multiverseId\': 622100}, \'multiverseid\': 622100}, {\'name\': \'本質の管理人\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体が戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「エルフが軽々しく忠告を与えることはめったにない。忠告は、賢者から賢者に与えた場合でも、危険な贈り物だ。」\\n――ギルドール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abef872f-896e-4e8c-b31f-2f159a725f96\', \'multiverseId\': 622287}, \'multiverseid\': 622287}, {\'name\': \'Encarregada da Essência\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Elfos raramente dão conselhos sem cautela, pois conselhos são dádivas perigosas, mesmo de um sábio a outro."\\n— Gildor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3c8db2-cdae-4cdc-9726-eaa47a8c069e\', \'multiverseId\': 622474}, \'multiverseid\': 622474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immervoller Kelch\', \'text\': \'Multibonus {2} (Du kannst zusätzlich beliebig oft {2} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nDer Immervolle Kelch kommt mit X Ladungsmarken ins Spiel, wobei X die Anzahl ist, wie oft seine Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C} für jede Ladungsmarke auf dem Immervollen Kelch.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbca5448-97cb-4ff7-b85a-8c7827985590\', \'multiverseId\': 621575}, \'multiverseid\': 621575}, {\'name\': \'Cáliz flujo eterno\', \'text\': \'Multiestímulo {2}. (Puedes pagar {2} adicionales tantas veces como quieras al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nEl Cáliz flujo eterno entra al campo de batalla con un contador de carga sobre él por cada vez que fue estimulado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C} por cada contador de carga sobre el Cáliz flujo eterno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82d3f159-cdba-4f5f-8df9-087434cd25eb\', \'multiverseId\': 621762}, \'multiverseid\': 621762}, {\'name\': \'Calice toujours ruisselant\', \'text\': "Multikick {2} (Vous pouvez payer {2} supplémentaires autant de fois que vous le souhaitez au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nLe Calice toujours ruisselant arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un marqueur « charge » pour chaque fois qu\'il a été kické.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur le Calice toujours ruisselant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621949&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8320aadc-f23c-4dcf-8760-4dfe119470b3\', \'multiverseId\': 621949}, \'multiverseid\': 621949}, {\'name\': \'Calice Infinito\', \'text\': \'Multipotenziamento {2} (Puoi pagare {2} addizionale un qualsiasi numero di volte mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nIl Calice Infinito entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino carica per ogni volta che è stato potenziato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C} per ogni segnalino carica sul Calice Infinito.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'846f8b35-31a1-41f1-9440-dd06102f9163\', \'multiverseId\': 622136}, \'multiverseid\': 622136}, {\'name\': \'永遠溢れの杯\', \'text\': \'多重キッカー{2}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{2}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n永遠溢れの杯は、これがキッカーされた１回につき１個の蓄積カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：永遠溢れの杯の上にある蓄積カウンター１個につき{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72450c85-f790-4891-838f-072de72c4a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 622323}, \'multiverseid\': 622323}, {\'name\': \'Cálice do Fluxo Perene\', \'text\': \'Multireforçar {2} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {2} quantas vezes quiser conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nCálice do Fluxo Perene entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de carga para cada vez que tiver sido reforçado.\\n{T}: Adicione {C} para cada marcador de carga em Cálice do Fluxo Perene.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e008ef7-158d-40f4-bf9f-be4313ba4c6a\', \'multiverseId\': 622510}, \'multiverseid\': 622510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immerändernde Weite\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Immerändernde Weite: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Erde ächzte und bebte. The Zähne von Mordor wankten, taumelten und fielen zusammen. Das mächtige Bollwerk stürzte ein, und das Schwarze Tor zerbarst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621634&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3634855-9ffb-4c20-a3ce-c383346c8988\', \'multiverseId\': 621634}, \'multiverseid\': 621634}, {\'name\': \'Expansión terramórfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Expansión terramórfica: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La tierra rugió y se estremeció. Las Torres de los Dientes se agitaron, tambalearon y desplomaron. La gran muralla se desmoronó y la Puerta Negra quedó en ruinas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e73529d-ceb0-4cae-9257-c53e9b92982c\', \'multiverseId\': 621821}, \'multiverseid\': 621821}, {\'name\': \'Immensité terramorphe\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez l\'Immensité terramorphe : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La terre gronda et trembla. Les Tours des Dents vacillèrent, chancelèrent et s\'effondrèrent. Le puissant rempart s\'écroula et la Porte Noire fut projetée en ruine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622008&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13c6a598-774d-4a2c-a0dd-94550694e7e0\', \'multiverseId\': 622008}, \'multiverseid\': 622008}, {\'name\': \'Distesa Terramorfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica la Distesa Terramorfica: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "La terra gemette e fu percorsa da un tremito. Le Torri dei Denti ondeggiarono, vacillarono e crollarono a terra. L\'imponente muraglia si sbriciolò e il Cancello Nero fu distrutto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67254f5c-58d0-4ab7-940c-b7bbf713efda\', \'multiverseId\': 622195}, \'multiverseid\': 622195}, {\'name\': \'広漠なる変幻地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'地は呻き、震えた。歯の塔は傾き、ぐらつき、そして崩れ落ちた。堅固な城壁が崩れ、黒門は凄まじい勢いで倒壊した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'079a1f14-7deb-4848-ae65-09ea36a8a2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 622382}, \'multiverseid\': 622382}, {\'name\': \'Vastidão Morfoterrena\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique Vastidão Morfoterrena: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A terra gemeu e tremeu. As Torres dos Dentes balançaram, tombaram e caíram. As poderosas ameias se esfacelaram e o Portão Negro foi atirado na ruína.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da532d10-5250-4fbd-9218-81c3c5cdf11a\', \'multiverseId\': 622569}, \'multiverseid\': 622569}]', '[{\'name\': \'In Einklang bringen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Singt heißa! für das Bad am Tagesende,\\nvom Dreck befreit es Füße und Hände!\\nEin Narr ist, wer nicht jauchzend singt:\\nOh! Heiß Wasser ist ein edles Ding!"\\n—Das Badelied\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ede4d3-7669-4601-993b-8e2c80960bbd\', \'multiverseId\': 621545}, \'multiverseid\': 621545}, {\'name\': \'Armonizar\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Cántala! ¡Al final de día un baño\\ny fuera el cansancio y el daño!\\nQuien no cante es un huraño.\\n¡Oh! ¡Agua caliente año tras año!".\\n—La canción de baño\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb051c64-ccec-4d49-98b8-370410e3928e\', \'multiverseId\': 621732}, \'multiverseid\': 621732}, {\'name\': \'Harmonisation\', \'text\': \'Piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Chantons ! Pour le bain en début de soirée\\nQui lave la boue et emporte les tracas !\\nRustre est celui qui ne chantera pas :\\nAh ! L\'eau chaude est affaire de gaité ! »\\n—La chanson de bain", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c68675b-3a5b-4f61-8ec1-c33edfacdb44\', \'multiverseId\': 621919}, \'multiverseid\': 621919}, {\'name\': \'Armonizzare\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Canta! Perché il bagno sul finir del giorno\\nSai che laverà via il fango più immondo!\\nPazzo è colui che si rifiuta di cantare;\\nDell\\\'Acqua Calda non vi è piacer più salutare!"\\n—La Canzone del Bagno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14ef988b-50b8-4404-85c1-9c521c919a43\', \'multiverseId\': 622106}, \'multiverseid\': 622106}, {\'name\': \'調和\', \'text\': \'カード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「歌おう、ヘイ！一日の終わり、湯浴みの歌で\\nつかれと泥とを洗い流そう！\\n歌わぬ者は、いかれてござるぞ。\\nああ！ありがたきものは、暖かなお湯！」\\n――湯浴み歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc519d2-9dff-457a-a1c9-bd56222155d2\', \'multiverseId\': 622293}, \'multiverseid\': 622293}, {\'name\': \'Harmonizar\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Sorria! É o banho do fim do dia\\nque lava a lama que ali havia!\\nMaluco é aquele que não entoa:\\nAi! Água quente! Que coisa boa!"\\n— A Canção do Banho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d84b7881-36b7-4a8e-a6aa-b685dc713661\', \'multiverseId\': 622480}, \'multiverseid\': 622480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inferno-Titan\', \'text\': \'{R}: Der Inferno-Titan erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn der Inferno-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, fügt er 3 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein, zwei oder drei Ziele deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich würde behaupten, in einigen dieser Geschichten steckt mehr Wahrheit, als man vermutet."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621520&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46281147-e449-4d36-9dc2-f996a1e5b146\', \'multiverseId\': 621520}, \'multiverseid\': 621520}, {\'name\': \'Titán infernal\', \'text\': \'{R}: El Titán infernal obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que el Titán infernal entre al campo de batalla o ataque, hace 3 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre uno, dos o tres objetivos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Te digo yo que en algunas de esas historias hay más verdad de lo que crees".\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ea4570b-fae5-46d5-98c5-53eb2e47cf39\', \'multiverseId\': 621707}, \'multiverseid\': 621707}, {\'name\': \'Titan de la fournaise\', \'text\': "{R} : Le Titan de la fournaise gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan de la fournaise arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, il inflige 3 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre une, deux ou trois cibles.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': "« Je crois bien qu\'il y a plus de vérité dans ces histoires qu\'on ne l\'imagine. »\\n—Sam", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621894&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf100ae3-02cf-4bc3-88d7-57cf08cca2e1\', \'multiverseId\': 621894}, \'multiverseid\': 621894}, {\'name\': "Titano dell\'Inferno", \'text\': "{R}: Il Titano dell\'Inferno prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta il Titano dell\'Inferno entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, infligge 3 danni divisi a tua scelta tra uno, due o tre bersagli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Scommetto che alcune di quelle storie contengono più verità di quanto non si creda."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af049fef-36ae-4157-a2a0-40559c149f89\', \'multiverseId\': 622081}, \'multiverseid\': 622081}, {\'name\': \'業火のタイタン\', \'text\': \'{R}：ターン終了時まで、業火のタイタンは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n業火のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つか２つか３つを対象とし、３点分を望むように割り振る。業火のタイタンはそれらにその割り振った点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「昔話のなかには、お前が思ってるより本当のことがあるぞ。」\\n――サム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f357d9d-741f-4e37-a89f-c943c93ad123\', \'multiverseId\': 622268}, \'multiverseid\': 622268}, {\'name\': \'Titã do Inferno\', \'text\': \'{R}: Titã do Inferno recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\nToda vez que Titã do Inferno entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, ele causa 3 pontos de dano divididos como você escolher entre um, dois ou três alvos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"Acredito que haja mais verdade em algumas dessas histórias do que você imagina."\\n— Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb7e25b-92d3-4693-8a7d-75c0c3c144db\', \'multiverseId\': 622455}, \'multiverseid\': 622455}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ins Dunkel zu treiben\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach IV.)\\nI, II, III — Erzeuge einen 3/3 schwarzen Wraith-Kreaturenspielstein mit Bedrohlichkeit. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\\nIV — Übernimm von jedem Gegner bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der Spieler kontrolliert. Enttappe jene Kreaturen. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620816&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c56190-f8e4-4ba5-be56-1b1b845469e7\', \'multiverseId\': 620816}, \'multiverseid\': 620816}, {\'name\': \'Y atarlos en las tinieblas\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de IV.)\\nI, II, III — Crea una ficha de criatura Aparición negra 3/3 con la habilidad de amenaza. El Anillo te tienta.\\nIV — Por cada oponente, gana el control de hasta una criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador hasta el final del turno. Endereza esas criaturas. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac9433a8-c08d-4d70-a2dc-27c5cf7471ed\', \'multiverseId\': 620888}, \'multiverseid\': 620888}, {\'name\': \'Dans les ténèbres les lier\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après IV.)\\nI, II, III — Créez un jeton de créature 3/3 noire Apparition avec la menace. L\'Anneau vous tente.\\nIV — Pour chaque adversaire, acquérez le contrôle de jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620960&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7e70640-b570-4c4c-bb37-643921560b79\', \'multiverseId\': 620960}, \'multiverseid\': 620960}, {\'name\': \'Nel Buio Incatenarli\', \'text\': "(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo IV.)\\nI, II, III — Crea una pedina creatura Necrospettro 3/3 nera con minacciare. L\'Anello ti tenta.\\nIV — Per ogni avversario, prendi il controllo di fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quelle creature. Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f0732b6-0f80-49ff-aa3f-81713396ed9b\', \'multiverseId\': 621032}, \'multiverseid\': 621032}, {\'name\': \'くらやみのなかにつなぎとめる\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IVの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II, III ― 威迫を持つ黒の３/３のレイス・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\\nIV ― 各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらのコントロールを得る。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8853c5-329f-4e92-a94c-a4d5fb9175b7\', \'multiverseId\': 621104}, \'multiverseid\': 621104}, {\'name\': \'Nas Trevas Amarrá-los\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após IV.)\\nI, II, III — Crie uma ficha de criatura Aparição preta 3/3 com ameaçar. O Anel tenta você.\\nIV — Para cada oponente, ganhe o controle de até uma criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla até o final do turno. Desvire aquelas criaturas. Elas ganham ímpeto até o final do turno. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf0ad4e3-bc15-4c4c-817e-7bb8dd411b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 621176}, \'multiverseid\': 621176}, {\'name\': \'至尊魔戒锢余众\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到IV后牺牲之。）\\nI, II, III — 派出一个3/3黑色，具威慑异能的鬼魂衍生生物。魔戒引诱你。\\nIV — 为每位对手各进行以下流程～获得至多一个目标由该牌手操控的生物之操控权直到回合结束。重置这些生物。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c0aa522-3cb9-4891-8c8c-1a2f427ad095\', \'multiverseId\': 621248}, \'multiverseid\': 621248}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inschrift des Überflusses\', \'text\': \'Bonus {2}{G}\\nBestimme eines. Falls die Bonuskosten dieses Zauberspruchs bezahlt wurden, bestimme stattdessen eine beliebige Anzahl.\\n• Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl erhält X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen ist, die er kontrolliert.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b8a5902-5aa8-4b03-ae6d-2abe51def14c\', \'multiverseId\': 621548}, \'multiverseid\': 621548}, {\'name\': \'Inscripción de abundancia\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {2}{G}.\\nElige uno. Si este hechizo fue estimulado, en vez de eso, elige cualquier cantidad de opciones.\\n• Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n• El jugador objetivo gana X vidas, donde X es la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controla.\\n• La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'320902f9-ca89-43fb-824a-1575f6db9b1b\', \'multiverseId\': 621735}, \'multiverseid\': 621735}, {\'name\': "Inscription d\'abondance", \'text\': "Kick {2}{G}\\nChoisissez l\'un. Si ce sort a été kické, choisissez n\'importe quel nombre à la place.\\n• Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n• Un joueur ciblé gagne X points de vie, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures qu\'il contrôle.\\n• Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621922&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3937ad-405b-49c1-b1ed-ee69e346050c\', \'multiverseId\': 621922}, \'multiverseid\': 621922}, {\'name\': "Iscrizione dell\'Abbondanza", \'text\': \'Potenziamento {2}{G}\\nScegli uno. Se questa magia è stata potenziata, scegli invece un qualsiasi numero.\\n• Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio guadagna X punti vita, dove X è la forza maggiore tra le creature che controlla.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9cf0ed7-d526-4d42-8e17-7d82598c29ab\', \'multiverseId\': 622109}, \'multiverseid\': 622109}, {\'name\': \'豊穣の碑文\', \'text\': \'キッカー{2}{G}\\n以下から１つを選ぶ。この呪文がキッカーされていたなら、代わりに以下から望む数だけ選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n・プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最大のパワーの値に等しい。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f0816f0-f4f8-46cc-901d-e845307694cf\', \'multiverseId\': 622296}, \'multiverseid\': 622296}, {\'name\': \'Epígrafe de Abundância\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {2}{G}\\nEscolha um. Se esta mágica foi reforçada, em vez disso, escolha qualquer número.\\n• Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\\n• O jogador alvo ganha X pontos de vida, sendo X o maior poder entre os das criaturas que ele controla.\\n• A criatura alvo que você controla luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'138dd4bf-22f2-4e33-88a4-44b6cb8d5a7f\', \'multiverseId\': 622483}, \'multiverseid\': 622483}]', '[{\'name\': \'Isolierte Kapelle\', \'text\': \'Die Isolierte Kapelle kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine Ebene oder einen Sumpf.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Das Haus der Landbüttel hatte nur ein Stockwerk und schmale Fenster. Es war aus hässlichen, bleichen Ziegeln gebaut, schlecht gemauert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621615&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da4a9454-735f-4f73-9eec-f226f458a9d6\', \'multiverseId\': 621615}, \'multiverseid\': 621615}, {\'name\': \'Capilla aislada\', \'text\': \'La Capilla aislada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una Llanura o un Pantano.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las casas de los oficiales solo tenían un piso, ventanas estrechas y estaban hechas de ladrillos poco estéticos y blanquecinos mal alineados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16884e2f-aa4c-42bf-a9a1-4aec700abd58\', \'multiverseId\': 621802}, \'multiverseid\': 621802}, {\'name\': \'Chapelle isolée\', \'text\': \'La Chapelle isolée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez une plaine ou un marais.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La maison des Shirriffs n\'avait qu\'un étage, des fenêtres étroites, et elle était construite de vilaines briques pâles mal agencées.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621989&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5480a422-9f23-404b-b99b-6736b7a251f1\', \'multiverseId\': 621989}, \'multiverseid\': 621989}, {\'name\': \'Cappella Isolata\', \'text\': \'La Cappella Isolata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una Pianura o una Palude.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'La Casa dei Guardacontea aveva un unico piano, finestre strette ed era fatta di brutti mattoni sbiaditi e mal connessi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44f4476e-5e23-4579-8257-6ae0e2cc8f2d\', \'multiverseId\': 622176}, \'multiverseid\': 622176}, {\'name\': \'孤立した礼拝堂\', \'text\': \'あなたが平地や沼をコントロールしていないかぎり、孤立した礼拝堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'蛙沢の庄察署は一階だけの平屋で、狭い窓がついており、見苦しい生焼け煉瓦が下手に積んであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feaf2bd2-553a-42e6-b903-604e0401c9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 622363}, \'multiverseid\': 622363}, {\'name\': \'Capela Isolada\', \'text\': \'Capela Isolada entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle uma Planície ou um Pântano.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A Casa do Condestável tinha um único andar, janelas estreitas e fora construída com feios tijolos brancos mal colocados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee457b1c-3ae6-4a9c-8d7a-ee7e77632673\', \'multiverseId\': 622550}, \'multiverseid\': 622550}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kampf-Zelebrant\', \'text\': \'Falls der Kampf-Zelebrant in diesem Zug noch nicht erschöpft wurde, kannst du ihn erschöpfen, sowie er angreift. Wenn du dies tust, enttappe alle anderen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, und es gibt nach dieser Phase eine zusätzliche Kampfphase. (Eine erschöpfte Kreatur enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Dies ist die Stunde, in der wir gemeinsam das Schwert ziehen!"\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75967fdd-e236-4900-ad82-d679cf87f327\', \'multiverseId\': 621509}, \'multiverseid\': 621509}, {\'name\': \'Celebrante del combate\', \'text\': \'Si el Celebrante del combate no fue espoleado este turno, puedes espolearlo en cuanto ataque. Cuando lo hagas, endereza todas las otras criaturas que controlas y después de esta fase hay una fase de combate adicional. (Una criatura espoleada no se enderezará durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Es el momento en el que blandimos espadas juntos!".\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc02963f-c1d0-48eb-b862-7ad92d0cb483\', \'multiverseId\': 621696}, \'multiverseid\': 621696}, {\'name\': \'Célébrant de combat\', \'text\': "Si le Célébrant de combat n\'a pas été surmené ce tour-ci, vous pouvez le surmener au moment où il attaque. Quand vous faites ainsi, dégagez toutes les autres créatures que vous contrôlez et cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire. (Une créature surmenée ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Voici venu l\'instant où nous tirons l\'épée côte à côte ! »\\n—Aragorn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bed24bb2-3746-47b1-afae-3faea414b7ca\', \'multiverseId\': 621883}, \'multiverseid\': 621883}, {\'name\': \'Celebrante da Battaglia\', \'text\': "Se il Celebrante da Battaglia non è stato stremato in questo turno, puoi stremarlo mentre attacca. Quando lo fai, STAPpa tutte le altre creature che controlli e, dopo questa fase, c\'è una fase di combattimento aggiuntiva. (Una creatura stremata non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"È giunta l\\\'ora di sguainare insieme le nostre spade!"\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21085019-99b1-452f-8513-aa72004dfee2\', \'multiverseId\': 622070}, \'multiverseid\': 622070}, {\'name\': \'戦闘の祝賀者\', \'text\': \'戦闘の祝賀者がこのターンに督励されていなかったなら、これが攻撃するに際し、あなたはこれを督励してもよい。そうしたとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーをアンタップし、このフェイズの後に追加の戦闘フェイズを１つ加える。（督励されたクリーチャーは、あなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「今こそともに剣を抜く時ぞ！」\\n——アラゴルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44f962ac-db8f-48c6-b8d1-c795e2db1243\', \'multiverseId\': 622257}, \'multiverseid\': 622257}, {\'name\': \'Celebrante do Combate\', \'text\': \'Se Celebrante do Combate não tiver sido exaurido neste turno, você pode exauri-lo conforme ele ataca. Quando fizer isso, desvire todas as outras criaturas que você controla e, após esta fase, há uma fase adicional de combate. (Uma criatura exaurida não será desvirada durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Chegou a hora de desembainharmos juntos as espadas!"\\n— Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4a32eb6-45ee-42c7-9637-2aa934746876\', \'multiverseId\': 622444}, \'multiverseid\': 622444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kankra, Weberin des Grauens\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, schicke sie ins Exil.\\n{2}{B}, lege eine Kreaturenkarte, die von Kankra, Weberin des Grauens, ins Exil geschickt wurde, auf den Friedhof ihres Besitzers: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf Kankra. Ziehe eine Karte.\\n{X}{1}{B}: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X, die von Kankra ins Exil geschickt wurde, getappt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Spinne, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620378&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fc71131-db19-457b-8d88-309855807cef\', \'multiverseId\': 620378}, \'multiverseid\': 620378}, {\'name\': "Arachne, tisseuse de l\'effroi", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, exilez-la.\\n{2}{B}, mettez une carte de créature exilée par Arachne, tisseuse de l\'effroi dans le cimetière de son propriétaire : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur Arachne. Piochez une carte.\\n{X}{1}{B} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle et engagée, une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana de X ciblée exilée par Arachne.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : araignée et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a154d00d-b8c2-45cf-ab71-2df7c684e1de\', \'multiverseId\': 620446}, \'multiverseid\': 620446}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の織り手、シェロブ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それを追放する。\\n{2}{B}, 戦慄の織り手、シェロブによって追放されているクリーチャー・カード１枚をオーナーの墓地に置く：戦慄の織り手、シェロブの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。カード１枚を引く。\\n{X}{1}{B}：戦慄の織り手、シェロブによって追放されていてマナ総量がＸであるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 蜘蛛・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d20ae2fe-4142-46e9-b4ab-cd86849c959c\', \'multiverseId\': 620514}, \'multiverseid\': 620514}, {\'name\': \'惧怖织蛛希洛布\', \'text\': \'每当一个由对手操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，将它放逐。\\n{2}{B}，将一张以惧怖织蛛希洛布放逐的生物牌置入其拥有者的坟墓场：在希洛布上放置两个+1/+1指示物。抓一张牌。\\n{X}{1}{B}：将目标以希洛布放逐且法术力值为X的生物牌在你操控下横置放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～蜘蛛／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab698709-550a-4c04-8a02-41b7439cb98b\', \'multiverseId\': 620582}, \'multiverseid\': 620582}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kankra, Weberin des Grauens\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, schicke sie ins Exil.\\n{2}{B}, lege eine Kreaturenkarte, die von Kankra, Weberin des Grauens, ins Exil geschickt wurde, auf den Friedhof ihres Besitzers: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf Kankra. Ziehe eine Karte.\\n{X}{1}{B}: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X, die von Kankra ins Exil geschickt wurde, getappt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Spinne, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620787&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'696f5ee1-8706-4f21-b1c4-e22ead1b71b5\', \'multiverseId\': 620787}, \'multiverseid\': 620787}, {\'name\': \'Ella-Laraña, tejedora pavorosa\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controla un oponente muera, exíliala.\\n{2}{B}, poner una carta de criatura exiliada con Ella-Laraña, tejedora pavorosa en el cementerio de su propietario: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre Ella-Laraña. Roba una carta.\\n{X}{1}{B}: Pon en el campo de batalla girada bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X exiliada con Ella-Laraña.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio araña\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931005a4-3f7c-4ce6-861d-57db03fa62b2\', \'multiverseId\': 620859}, \'multiverseid\': 620859}, {\'name\': "Arachne, tisseuse de l\'effroi", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, exilez-la.\\n{2}{B}, mettez une carte de créature exilée par Arachne, tisseuse de l\'effroi dans le cimetière de son propriétaire : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur Arachne. Piochez une carte.\\n{X}{1}{B} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle et engagée, une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana de X ciblée exilée par Arachne.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : araignée et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620931&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f4054ac-08be-42df-b534-b7cf15456269\', \'multiverseId\': 620931}, \'multiverseid\': 620931}, {\'name\': \'Shelob, Tessitrice Terrificante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura non pedina controllata da un avversario muore, esiliala.\\n{2}{B}, Metti una carta creatura esiliata con Shelob, Tessitrice Terrificante nel cimitero del suo proprietario: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su Shelob. Peschi una carta.\\n{X}{1}{B}: Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo TAPpata una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari a X esiliata con Shelob.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Demone Ragno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e617cf82-8d8f-4223-bdf3-013ba6d86985\', \'multiverseId\': 621003}, \'multiverseid\': 621003}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の織り手、シェロブ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それを追放する。\\n{2}{B}, 戦慄の織り手、シェロブによって追放されているクリーチャー・カード１枚をオーナーの墓地に置く：戦慄の織り手、シェロブの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。カード１枚を引く。\\n{X}{1}{B}：戦慄の織り手、シェロブによって追放されていてマナ総量がＸであるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 蜘蛛・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d66a5a6b-4bac-4d8a-93bb-446d51f7770f\', \'multiverseId\': 621075}, \'multiverseid\': 621075}, {\'name\': \'Laracna, Tecelâ Macabra\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura não ficha que um oponente controla morrer, exile-a.\\n{2}{B}, coloque um card de criatura exilado com Laracna, Tecelâ Macabra, no cemitério de seu dono: Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Laracna. Compre um card.\\n{X}{1}{B}: Coloque o card de criatura alvo com valor de mana X exilado com Laracna no campo de batalha virado sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Aranha Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c503fcb-8190-4964-85d4-ecb3d993c106\', \'multiverseId\': 621147}, \'multiverseid\': 621147}, {\'name\': \'惧怖织蛛希洛布\', \'text\': \'每当一个由对手操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，将它放逐。\\n{2}{B}，将一张以惧怖织蛛希洛布放逐的生物牌置入其拥有者的坟墓场：在希洛布上放置两个+1/+1指示物。抓一张牌。\\n{X}{1}{B}：将目标以希洛布放逐且法术力值为X的生物牌在你操控下横置放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～蜘蛛／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77152c0-7a38-4b67-b83c-93ebf8384f53\', \'multiverseId\': 621219}, \'multiverseid\': 621219}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kasteiung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bald waren die Kaninchen zerteilt und köchelten mit Büscheln von Kräutern in ihren Pfannen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621566&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee5ab02c-78aa-4d90-958d-d51370322298\', \'multiverseId\': 621566}, \'multiverseid\': 621566}, {\'name\': \'Mortificar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En nada, los conejos estaban cortados y se hacían a fuego lento en las sartenes con algunas hierbas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f366b0-68ff-45b1-b393-74e5642bdf91\', \'multiverseId\': 621753}, \'multiverseid\': 621753}, {\'name\': \'Mortification\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, créature ou enchantement.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les lapins furent bientôt coupés en morceaux et mis dans une poêle à mijoter avec un bouquet d\'herbes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621940&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9694829-5802-4a66-901a-e543016b06ee\', \'multiverseId\': 621940}, \'multiverseid\': 621940}, {\'name\': \'Mortificare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ben presto i conigli tagliati a pezzi bollirono a fuoco lento nelle casseruole con le erbe raccolte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5c4383f-94d9-4f84-82f5-5385a17aaf64\', \'multiverseId\': 622127}, \'multiverseid\': 622127}, {\'name\': \'屈辱\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ぶつ切りにした兎はやがて、鍋の中で束ねた香草と一緒にグツグツ煮え始めた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0660f41-0102-4b07-87d9-c926036b160b\', \'multiverseId\': 622314}, \'multiverseid\': 622314}, {\'name\': \'Mortificar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Logo os coelhos estavam cortados e cozinhavam nas panelas com as ervas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3737516c-4b8c-4d35-9eef-458dcb8c3509\', \'multiverseId\': 622501}, \'multiverseid\': 622501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klinge aus Lothlórien\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, fügt sie einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\\nAusrüsten eines Elfen {2}\\nAusrüsten {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620423&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'821f8bc9-9920-474e-9fb3-0e75d9cab2cb\', \'multiverseId\': 620423}, \'multiverseid\': 620423}, {\'name\': \'Lame de Lothlórien\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle.\\nÉquipement d\'elfe {2}\\nÉquipement {5}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620491&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1ed611-4d59-410e-ba35-bd9daad134a9\', \'multiverseId\': 620491}, \'multiverseid\': 620491}, {\'name\': \'ロスロリアンの刃\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。装備しているクリーチャーはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\nエルフに装備{2}\\n装備{5}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d627fd9e-aa2b-4472-b921-f6129443c7b9\', \'multiverseId\': 620559}, \'multiverseid\': 620559}, {\'name\': \'洛丝罗瑞恩之刃\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，它对目标由防御牌手操控的生物造成等同于前者力量的伤害。\\n佩带妖精{2}\\n佩带{5}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f6cb301-39bb-410a-b1f0-4a9e19575ced\', \'multiverseId\': 620627}, \'multiverseid\': 620627}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klinge aus Lothlórien\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, fügt sie einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\\nAusrüsten eines Elfen {2}\\nAusrüsten {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620835&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ddefd89-332d-4dd3-bb9a-2676fc660ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 620835}, \'multiverseid\': 620835}, {\'name\': \'Espada de Lothlórien\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\\nEquipar Elfo {2}.\\nEquipar {5}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31aea020-5a79-40b4-a7c9-3fb044f424ff\', \'multiverseId\': 620907}, \'multiverseid\': 620907}, {\'name\': \'Lame de Lothlórien\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle.\\nÉquipement d\'elfe {2}\\nÉquipement {5}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620979&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c53e70f-34d7-4ece-bbf2-1c1e7091ff7c\', \'multiverseId\': 620979}, \'multiverseid\': 620979}, {\'name\': \'Lama di Lothlórien\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa.\\nEquipaggia Elfo {2}\\nEquipaggiare {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0e1ddf1-db7f-418b-8ef2-e96e12740bc9\', \'multiverseId\': 621051}, \'multiverseid\': 621051}, {\'name\': \'ロスロリアンの刃\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。装備しているクリーチャーはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\nエルフに装備{2}\\n装備{5}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43b26fc5-58c2-4d13-bd81-0456b97897d7\', \'multiverseId\': 621123}, \'multiverseid\': 621123}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Lothlórien\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura equipada ataca, ela causa dano igual ao seu poder à criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla.\\nEquipar Elfo {2}\\nEquipar {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbedc9a2-6eb8-4963-ac4b-d281c9c03d15\', \'multiverseId\': 621195}, \'multiverseid\': 621195}, {\'name\': \'洛丝罗瑞恩之刃\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，它对目标由防御牌手操控的生物造成等同于前者力量的伤害。\\n佩带妖精{2}\\n佩带{5}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1fa63a0-a43b-4005-ac7d-a4eb4a3da505\', \'multiverseId\': 621267}, \'multiverseid\': 621267}]', '[{\'name\': \'Korsaren von Umbar\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Ein Goblin, Ork oder Pirat deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn die Korsaren von Umbar einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, wende Ork-Aufmarsch 3 an. (Lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Ork. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Ork-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620777&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca1110d-4409-4cca-9c3e-7a665604800d\', \'multiverseId\': 620777}, \'multiverseid\': 620777}, {\'name\': \'Corsarios de Umbar\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: El Trasgo, Orco o Pirata objetivo no puede ser bloqueado este turno.\\nSiempre que los Corsarios de Umbar hagan daño de combate a un jugador, enrola 3 Orcos. (Pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. También es un Orco. Si no controlas un Ejército, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Orco negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c367db5-bb97-4400-b3cd-8b7d42c5d66f\', \'multiverseId\': 620849}, \'multiverseid\': 620849}, {\'name\': "Pirates d\'Umbar", \'text\': "{2}{U} : Un gobelin, un orque ou un pirate ciblé ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que les Pirates d\'Umbar infligent des blessures de combat à un joueur, amassez des orques 3. (Mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un orque. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Orque et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620921&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0894a864-643e-4e4c-bb67-8c7ce930d9a2\', \'multiverseId\': 620921}, \'multiverseid\': 620921}, {\'name\': \'Corsari di Umbar\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Un Goblin, un Orco o un Pirata bersaglio non può essere bloccato in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta i Corsari di Umbar infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, recluta Orchi 3. (Metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. È anche un Orco. Se non controlli un Esercito, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Orco 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b2e212-e7a2-4259-9ff8-61b62791ee3d\', \'multiverseId\': 620993}, \'multiverseid\': 620993}, {\'name\': \'ウンバールの海賊\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：ゴブリンやオークや海賊のうち１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\\nウンバールの海賊がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、オーク動員３を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター３個を置く。それはオークでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のオーク・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9f6d705-e181-4273-88a8-740d4a5be0e5\', \'multiverseId\': 621065}, \'multiverseid\': 621065}, {\'name\': \'Corsários de Umbar\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: O Goblin, Orc ou Pirata alvo não pode ser bloqueado neste turno.\\nToda vez que Corsários de Umbar causar dano de combate a um jogador, arregimente Orcs 3. (Coloque três marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Ele também é um Orc. Se você não controlar um Exército, crie antes uma ficha de criatura Orc Exército preta 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Pirata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af225edd-3774-4148-99d0-7e67451bfd78\', \'multiverseId\': 621137}, \'multiverseid\': 621137}, {\'name\': \'乌姆巴尔的海盗\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：目标鬼怪，半兽人或海盗本回合不能被阻挡。\\n每当乌姆巴尔的海盗对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，囤兵半兽人3。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置三个+1/+1指示物。它也是半兽人。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色半兽人／军队衍生生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f06d31-8ed7-4fd2-ae64-353c3dcc6df8\', \'multiverseId\': 621209}, \'multiverseid\': 621209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Korsaren von Umbar\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Ein Goblin, Ork oder Pirat deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn die Korsaren von Umbar einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, wende Ork-Aufmarsch 3 an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620368&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7987ff72-6c6e-4872-8081-e20b72b0be4a\', \'multiverseId\': 620368}, \'multiverseid\': 620368}, {\'name\': "Pirates d\'Umbar", \'text\': "{2}{U} : Un gobelin, un orque ou un pirate ciblé ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que les Pirates d\'Umbar infligent des blessures de combat à un joueur, amassez des orques 3.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620436&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'848b0e17-5f21-4c50-9a28-6b664c1e5cf7\', \'multiverseId\': 620436}, \'multiverseid\': 620436}, {\'name\': \'ウンバールの海賊\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：ゴブリンやオークや海賊のうち１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\\nウンバールの海賊がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、オーク動員３を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a9812ed-366f-4a4c-a552-80b6a873fac1\', \'multiverseId\': 620504}, \'multiverseid\': 620504}, {\'name\': \'乌姆巴尔的海盗\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：目标鬼怪，半兽人或海盗本回合不能被阻挡。\\n每当乌姆巴尔的海盗对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，囤兵半兽人3。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b93dc73-c7d7-491f-b954-b589b508671b\', \'multiverseId\': 620572}, \'multiverseid\': 620572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krone von Gondor\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\\nWenn eine legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt und falls niemand der Monarch ist, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nAusrüsten {4}. Diese Fähigkeit kostet beim Aktivieren {3} weniger, falls du der Monarch bist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ef381f5-d4ac-42ce-96c9-dd724f061bb3\', \'multiverseId\': 620421}, \'multiverseid\': 620421}, {\'name\': \'Couronne du Gondor\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nQuand une créature légendaire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, s\'il n\'y a pas de monarque, vous devenez le monarque.\\nÉquipement {4}. Cette capacité coûte {3} de moins à activer si vous êtes le monarque.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620489&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3b07d2b-b66e-4582-b73d-123068d36542\', \'multiverseId\': 620489}, \'multiverseid\': 620489}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの王冠\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たとき、統治者がいない場合、あなたが統治者になる。\\n装備{4}。あなたが統治者であるなら、この能力を起動するためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fee9b83-3986-40c2-a550-34b7c4bec778\', \'multiverseId\': 620557}, \'multiverseid\': 620557}, {\'name\': \'刚铎皇冠\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个生物，佩带此武具的生物便得+1/+1。\\n当一个传奇生物在你操控下进战场时，若此时没有君主，则你成为君主。\\n佩带{4}。如果你是君主，则此异能减少{3}来起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8febc9a2-aec3-4223-a299-6492fe5ac579\', \'multiverseId\': 620625}, \'multiverseid\': 620625}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krone von Gondor\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\\nWenn eine legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt und falls niemand der Monarch ist, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nAusrüsten {4}. Diese Fähigkeit kostet beim Aktivieren {3} weniger, falls du der Monarch bist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3799806-27f9-4813-af9e-82416d111800\', \'multiverseId\': 620833}, \'multiverseid\': 620833}, {\'name\': \'Corona de Gondor\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1 por cada criatura que controlas.\\nCuando una criatura legendaria entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, si no hay ningún monarca, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nEquipar {4}. Te cuesta {3} menos activar esta habilidad si eres el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fbd1b70-d6d6-401c-bd1e-23aaab1e13d9\', \'multiverseId\': 620905}, \'multiverseid\': 620905}, {\'name\': \'Couronne du Gondor\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nQuand une créature légendaire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, s\'il n\'y a pas de monarque, vous devenez le monarque.\\nÉquipement {4}. Cette capacité coûte {3} de moins à activer si vous êtes le monarque.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620977&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e802cc6-2264-4044-8a80-dc2ea100a92f\', \'multiverseId\': 620977}, \'multiverseid\': 620977}, {\'name\': \'Corona di Gondor\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1 per ogni creatura che controlli.\\nQuando una creatura leggendaria entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, se nessuno è il monarca, tu diventi il monarca.\\nEquipaggiare {4}. Questa abilità costa {3} in meno per essere attivata se sei il monarca.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b7cc8d-eaf1-4715-81f2-d08ceb5fa3cd\', \'multiverseId\': 621049}, \'multiverseid\': 621049}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの王冠\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たとき、統治者がいない場合、あなたが統治者になる。\\n装備{4}。あなたが統治者であるなら、この能力を起動するためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c8fb5f3-0bee-4921-a732-3f969593ec87\', \'multiverseId\': 621121}, \'multiverseid\': 621121}, {\'name\': \'Coroa de Gondor\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+1 para cada criatura que você controla.\\nQuando uma criatura lendária entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, se não houver um monarca, você se tornará o monarca.\\nEquipar {4}. Esta habilidade custa {3} a menos para ser ativada se você é o monarca.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4df16733-1493-49f2-8713-97f2feb47f14\', \'multiverseId\': 621193}, \'multiverseid\': 621193}, {\'name\': \'刚铎皇冠\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个生物，佩带此武具的生物便得+1/+1。\\n当一个传奇生物在你操控下进战场时，若此时没有君主，则你成为君主。\\n佩带{4}。如果你是君主，则此异能减少{3}来起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e089b19-4e83-494d-9a6b-785d8d505cbb\', \'multiverseId\': 621265}, \'multiverseid\': 621265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kräuter und Kaninchenpfeffer\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\\nII — Ziehe eine Karte. Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\\nIII — Erzeuge für jede Speise, die du kontrollierst, einen 1/1 weißen Halbling-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620775&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'136ef23e-ed39-46fb-8927-5d8f4239fa0f\', \'multiverseId\': 620775}, \'multiverseid\': 620775}, {\'name\': \'Hierbas aromáticas y guiso de conejo\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo. Crea una ficha de Comida.\\nII — Roba una carta. Crea una ficha de Comida.\\nIII — Crea una ficha de criatura Mediano blanca 1/1 por cada Comida que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e727bb3-80c7-42b1-badc-7002def47bdb\', \'multiverseId\': 620847}, \'multiverseid\': 620847}, {\'name\': \'Herbes et ragoût de lapin\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Créez un jeton Nourriture.\\nII — Piochez une carte. Créez un jeton Nourriture.\\nIII — Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Halfelin pour chaque nourriture que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0592ad9-e34d-45ed-a1aa-572d23b3ff7b\', \'multiverseId\': 620919}, \'multiverseid\': 620919}, {\'name\': \'Erbe Aromatiche e Stufato di Coniglio\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Crea una pedina Cibo.\\nII — Pesca una carta. Crea una pedina Cibo.\\nIII — Crea una pedina creatura Halfling 1/1 bianca per ogni Cibo che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d19f5d11-d397-4c85-b36c-dde68c59fc90\', \'multiverseId\': 620991}, \'multiverseid\': 620991}, {\'name\': \'香り草入り兎肉シチュー\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\nII ― カード１枚を引く。食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\nIII ― あなたがコントロールしている食物１つにつき１体の白の１/１のハーフリング・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e5efc9f-6acf-4a13-8e6e-abf2a3e33e2e\', \'multiverseId\': 621063}, \'multiverseid\': 621063}, {\'name\': \'De Ervas e Coelho Ensopado\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em até uma criatura alvo. Crie uma ficha de Comida.\\nII — Compre um card. Crie uma ficha de Comida.\\nIII — Crie uma ficha de criatura Pequenino branca 1/1 para cada Comida que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33bc98a3-c8d0-4efb-9ca5-7a2edc45d6af\', \'multiverseId\': 621135}, \'multiverseid\': 621135}, {\'name\': \'香草炖野兔\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 在至多一个目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。派出一个食品衍生物。\\nII — 抓一张牌。派出一个食品衍生物。\\nIII — 你每操控一个食品，便派出一个1/1白色半身人衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9129ea79-77cf-4e73-9174-6a59444cebe6\', \'multiverseId\': 621207}, \'multiverseid\': 621207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel, nimm die andere auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als sie näher kamen, brach plötzlich ein schreckliches Gebell los, und eine laute Stimme rief: „Greif! Fang! Wolf! Auf, Burschen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a12563-dd54-41bc-9df3-ae46bcd52a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 621533}, \'multiverseid\': 621533}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'De repente, se acercaron y unos aullidos y ladridos temibles estallaron. Una voz gritó: "¡Garra! ¡Colmillo! ¡Lobo! ¡A callar, muchachos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'264ffafd-afd0-45f0-b1ac-309403ce00ec\', \'multiverseId\': 621720}, \'multiverseid\': 621720}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes, mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée et l\'autre dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Soudain, alors qu\'ils approchaient, des aboiements terrifiants éclatèrent tandis qu\'une voix forte s\'écria : « Étau ! Croc ! Loup ! Allez, mes petits ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30dd11fb-a759-4101-a1a9-87faaaa656c1\', \'multiverseId\': 621907}, \'multiverseid\': 621907}, {\'name\': \'Coltivare\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'All\\\'improvviso, mentre si stavano avvicinando, sentirono dei cani latrare e abbaiare furiosamente e una voce possente urlare: "Raffa! Zanna! Lupo! Venite, ragazzi!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91608b52-a32d-4b28-9efa-f910e2d7d4be\', \'multiverseId\': 622094}, \'multiverseid\': 622094}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'三人が近づくと、恐ろしい唸り声、吠え声が突如として起こった。そして大声で怒鳴るのが聞こえた。「くいつき！きば！おおかみ！さあ行け！」と。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea80d1ae-d090-4f4f-b4ad-70f97cca6efa\', \'multiverseId\': 622281}, \'multiverseid\': 622281}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-os e coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'De repente, enquanto eles se aproximavam, ouviram uivos e latidos terríveis, e ouviu-se uma voz potente gritar: "Garra! Presa! Lobo! Venham cá!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'095ca518-3dae-474e-ae6a-dedc812a7ff1\', \'multiverseId\': 622468}, \'multiverseid\': 622468}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lauben-Elf\', \'text\': \'{T}: Enttappe einen Wald deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich danke euch erneut, und sage euch Lebewohl. Möge euer Wald wieder in Frieden wachsen."\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c1b94d5-ee31-4f0a-952c-9de46dc97090\', \'multiverseId\': 621529}, \'multiverseid\': 621529}, {\'name\': \'Elfo enramado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Endereza el Bosque objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Les doy las gracias una vez más y me despido. Ojalá su bosque crezca otra vez en paz".\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca4c0131-580f-4f17-afcf-8b9fac3b0d5a\', \'multiverseId\': 621716}, \'multiverseid\': 621716}, {\'name\': \'Elfe de la charmille\', \'text\': \'{T} : Dégagez une forêt ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Je vous remercie une fois encore, et je vous dis adieu. Que votre forêt prospère à nouveau en paix. »\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f76a1a3f-ad1e-4a3f-98df-1e5b0fa299df\', \'multiverseId\': 621903}, \'multiverseid\': 621903}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Arboreo\', \'text\': \'{T}: STAPpa una Foresta bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ora vi ringrazio di nuovo e vi dico addio. Possa la vostra foresta crescere in pace come prima."\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06a6a258-eb79-4123-94c6-cd8b555c9d6b\', \'multiverseId\': 622090}, \'multiverseid\': 622090}, {\'name\': \'東屋のエルフ\', \'text\': \'{T}：森１つを対象とする。それをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「今一度お礼を申しあげる。そしてお別れを。願わくばあなた方の森が再び平穏に生い繁らんことを。」\\n——アラゴルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5422e465-ab12-48ec-8117-ab947985d674\', \'multiverseId\': 622277}, \'multiverseid\': 622277}, {\'name\': \'Elfo do Arvoredo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Desvire a Floresta alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu lhe agradeço mais uma vez e lhe digo adeus. Que sua floresta volte a crescer em paz."\\n— Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65f6ff37-18c2-4ca9-b9d9-cf51c6101d5d\', \'multiverseId\': 622464}, \'multiverseid\': 622464}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lebende Tote\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler schickt alle Kreaturenkarten aus seinem Friedhof ins Exil, opfert dann alle Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert, und bringt dann alle auf diese Weise von ihm ins Exil geschickten Karten ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sie wirkten wie eine schwarze Leere im tiefen Schatten hinter ihnen. Frodo glaubte, ein leises Zischen wie von giftigem Atem zu hören, und spürte eine durchdringende Kälte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'693ce955-94ea-4fe0-bb27-54c479a35436\', \'multiverseId\': 621500}, \'multiverseid\': 621500}, {\'name\': \'La muerte de los vivos\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador exilia todas las cartas de criatura de su cementerio, luego sacrifica todas las criaturas que controla y pone todas las cartas que exilió de esta manera en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Eran tan negras que parecían agujeros negros en la sombra oscura que los rodeaba. Frodo creyó oír un débil siseo, como un aliento venenoso, y sintió un escalofrío que le heló la sangre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a76c90e3-e379-40ac-a1dd-5bf0f227997c\', \'multiverseId\': 621687}, \'multiverseid\': 621687}, {\'name\': \'Mort vivante\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur exile toutes les cartes de créature de son cimetière, puis sacrifie toutes les créatures qu\'il contrôle, et met ensuite sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes qu\'il a exilées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ils ressemblaient à des trous noirs dans l\'ombre profonde derrière eux. Frodo crut entendre un léger sifflement, comme un souffle venimeux, et sentit un froid aigu et mordant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e96be8cf-a9fd-45cf-8856-5876338d116b\', \'multiverseId\': 621874}, \'multiverseid\': 621874}, {\'name\': \'Morte Vivente\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore esilia tutte le carte creatura dal proprio cimitero, poi sacrifica tutte le creature che controlla, infine mette sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte esiliate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Sembravano buchi neri nell\'ombra scura che li circondava. Frodo credette di sentire una specie di sibilo, come un respiro velenoso, e un brivido gelido gli attraversò la schiena.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84430c30-3816-4689-8383-42a19d902c55\', \'multiverseId\': 622061}, \'multiverseid\': 622061}, {\'name\': \'生ける屍\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の墓地にあるすべてのクリーチャー・カードを追放し、その後、自分がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げ、その後、これにより自分が追放したすべてのカードを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは背後の深い闇に穿たれた黒い穴のように見えた。フロドは毒ある息を吐き出す、微かなしゅうしゅうという音を聞いたように思い、身を貫く寒気を感じた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4674568-27b3-4bd4-825e-cadb07fd5689\', \'multiverseId\': 622248}, \'multiverseid\': 622248}, {\'name\': \'Morte Viva\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador exila todos os cards de criatura do próprio cemitério, em seguida sacrifica todas as criaturas que controla e depois coloca todos os cards que exilou dessa maneira no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Eles pareciam buracos negros com uma sombra profunda por trás. Frodo pensou ter ouvido um tênue sibilo como o de um arfar peçonhento, e sentiu um calafrio fino e penetrante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be658b6a-7fe0-458d-bd73-2bd25589455a\', \'multiverseId\': 622435}, \'multiverseid\': 622435}]', '[{\'name\': \'Legolas Grünblatt\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nLegolas Grünblatt kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn eine andere legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Legolas Grünblatt.\\nImmer wenn Legolas Grünblatt einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620389&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecd68a91-c760-45df-af75-7cc03f74fec7\', \'multiverseId\': 620389}, \'multiverseid\': 620389}, {\'name\': \'Legolas Vertefeuille\', \'text\': "Portée\\nLegolas Vertefeuille ne peut pas être bloqué par des créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature légendaire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Legolas Vertefeuille.\\nÀ chaque fois que Legolas Vertefeuille inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et archer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f11ebb2-9d24-4ad7-a942-3d568897f588\', \'multiverseId\': 620457}, \'multiverseid\': 620457}, {\'name\': \'緑葉のレゴラス\', \'text\': \'到達\\n緑葉のレゴラスは、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\\nこれでない伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑葉のレゴラスの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n緑葉のレゴラスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・射手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4519b89-49dc-4486-a284-085569ea2a3f\', \'multiverseId\': 620525}, \'multiverseid\': 620525}, {\'name\': \'绿叶莱戈拉斯\', \'text\': \'延势\\n绿叶莱戈拉斯不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\\n每当另一个传奇生物在你操控下进战场时，在绿叶莱戈拉斯上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当绿叶莱戈拉斯对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f10ae177-e0ed-42b4-9d17-b5117406daf9\', \'multiverseId\': 620593}, \'multiverseid\': 620593}]', '[{\'name\': \'Legolas Grünblatt\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nLegolas Grünblatt kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn eine andere legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Legolas Grünblatt.\\nImmer wenn Legolas Grünblatt einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620798&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a42405fb-4485-4b46-9785-1ffd0aa25599\', \'multiverseId\': 620798}, \'multiverseid\': 620798}, {\'name\': \'Legolas Hojaverde\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nLegolas Hojaverde no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\\nSiempre que otra criatura legendaria entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Legolas Hojaverde.\\nSiempre que Legolas Hojaverde haga daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Arquero elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9753110b-6726-4e53-a136-f7fa9b5eddf3\', \'multiverseId\': 620870}, \'multiverseid\': 620870}, {\'name\': \'Legolas Vertefeuille\', \'text\': "Portée\\nLegolas Vertefeuille ne peut pas être bloqué par des créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature légendaire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Legolas Vertefeuille.\\nÀ chaque fois que Legolas Vertefeuille inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et archer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620942&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5300da8c-4de1-4e71-8b55-5d6fe6c176ce\', \'multiverseId\': 620942}, \'multiverseid\': 620942}, {\'name\': \'Legolas Verdefoglia\', \'text\': "Raggiungere\\nLegolas Verdefoglia non può essere bloccato da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura leggendaria entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Legolas Verdefoglia.\\nOgniqualvolta Legolas Verdefoglia infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, peschi una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Arciere Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f571c6-8c31-4691-8c81-3f6baa06092a\', \'multiverseId\': 621014}, \'multiverseid\': 621014}, {\'name\': \'緑葉のレゴラス\', \'text\': \'到達\\n緑葉のレゴラスは、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\\nこれでない伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑葉のレゴラスの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n緑葉のレゴラスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・射手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6367acc2-68a4-4f1d-933d-119b6dba504a\', \'multiverseId\': 621086}, \'multiverseid\': 621086}, {\'name\': \'Legolas Verdefolha\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nLegolas Verdefolha não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\nToda vez que outra criatura lendária entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Legolas Verdefolha.\\nToda vez que Legolas Verdefolha causar dano de combate a um jogador, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ea337e-c4a2-4a7a-ac40-11b53ba2e359\', \'multiverseId\': 621158}, \'multiverseid\': 621158}, {\'name\': \'绿叶莱戈拉斯\', \'text\': \'延势\\n绿叶莱戈拉斯不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\\n每当另一个传奇生物在你操控下进战场时，在绿叶莱戈拉斯上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当绿叶莱戈拉斯对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21f5aef7-83f0-4056-abe5-f104e54cd778\', \'multiverseId\': 621230}, \'multiverseid\': 621230}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lehren der Vergangenheit\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl mischt seinen Friedhof in seine Bibliothek.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Große Ring wird nun zum Erbstück des Nördlichen Königreichs, doch Aufzeichnungen über ihn bleiben in Gondor, damit nicht eines Tages die Erinnerung an diese wichtigen Angelegenheiten verblasst."\\n—Isildurs Schriftrolle\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4d9a404-c5f1-4014-bfee-a8e0d87af870\', \'multiverseId\': 621489}, \'multiverseid\': 621489}, {\'name\': \'Aprender del pasado\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo baraja su cementerio en su biblioteca.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El Gran Anillo será uno de los legados del Reino del Norte, pero las crónicas sobre él permanecerán en Gondor por si el recuerdo de estos importantes asuntos cayera en el olvido".\\n—Pergamino de Isildur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d4412d7-796b-41cc-b349-c29edc83d872\', \'multiverseId\': 621676}, \'multiverseid\': 621676}, {\'name\': \'Enseignements du passé\', \'text\': \'Un joueur ciblé mélange son cimetière dans sa bibliothèque.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Le Grand Anneau sera désormais un héritage du Royaume du Nord, mais des archives seront conservées au Gondor, au cas où le souvenir de ces grandes choses ne s\'estompe. »\\n—Parchemin d\'Isildur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b28dcb-2aa3-4576-aec1-678fc56635fb\', \'multiverseId\': 621863}, \'multiverseid\': 621863}, {\'name\': \'Imparare dal Passato\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio rimescola il suo cimitero nel suo grimorio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il Grande Anello d\\\'ora in poi apparterrà al Regno del Nord; ma a Gondor rimarranno alcuni documenti in proposito, nel caso che un giorno il ricordo di una questione così importante fosse offuscato."\\n—Pergamena di Isildur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6a12fae-ef7a-4c16-b40c-c1708ec66e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 622050}, \'multiverseid\': 622050}, {\'name\': \'過去に学ぶ\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の墓地を自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「大いなる指輪は、今後北方王国重代の宝となすべし。されど、これら大事の記憶が薄れる時が至るを恐れ、ゴンドールにその記録を残すべし。」\\n――イシルドゥアの自筆の記録\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a6e1c7-4aee-4847-9267-c3cb69e00a48\', \'multiverseId\': 622237}, \'multiverseid\': 622237}, {\'name\': \'Aprender com o Passado\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo embaralha o próprio cemitério no próprio grimório.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O Anel Maior passará a ser uma herança do Reino do Norte; mas registros dele serão deixados em Gondor, para que não chegue o dia em que a lembrança de assuntos tão importantes enfraqueça."\\n— Pergaminho de Isildur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cbea27b-7eb9-4708-a0ee-a82082032aef\', \'multiverseId\': 622424}, \'multiverseid\': 622424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leuchtschatten-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Leuchtschatten-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Ebene- oder Sumpf-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Leuchtschatten-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Seht nur! Die Macht Mordors wurde zerstreut wie Staub im Wind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621628&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ed025bd-56a8-462b-81e4-1d7230a98dbe\', \'multiverseId\': 621628}, \'multiverseid\': 621628}, {\'name\': \'Maraña sombrabrillante\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña sombrabrillante entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Llanura o de Pantano de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña sombrabrillante entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Y, entonces, el poder de Mordor se deshizo como polvo en el viento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6355e82-1c8a-439a-aa9c-f08dd0dbc638\', \'multiverseId\': 621815}, \'multiverseid\': 621815}, {\'name\': \'Lacis luminombre\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Lacis luminombre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de plaine ou de marais de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis luminombre arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Et voilà que la puissance du Mordor s\'effritait comme de la poussière face au vent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622002&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce05ba6a-b811-4d45-b3ad-5442fac4bdda\', \'multiverseId\': 622002}, \'multiverseid\': 622002}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Ombraluce\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Ombraluce entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Pianura o Palude dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Ombraluce entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Meraviglia! Il potere di Mordor svaniva come polvere al vento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'406d33bc-3ddf-4fe6-9e2f-a321591fbc5a\', \'multiverseId\': 622189}, \'multiverseid\': 622189}, {\'name\': \'光影の交錯\', \'text\': \'光影の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり平地や沼であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、光影の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'見よ！モルドールの軍勢が風に飛ぶ塵の如く散していくさまを。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67222595-66e5-4deb-8116-2d17e0f1ee39\', \'multiverseId\': 622376}, \'multiverseid\': 622376}, {\'name\': \'Liame do Umbrolume\', \'text\': \'Conforme Liame do Umbrolume entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Planície ou Pântano de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Liame do Umbrolume entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Vejam! O poder de Mordor se dispersava como poeira ao vento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56f7e934-a131-4952-a9da-580e9341ce1e\', \'multiverseId\': 622563}, \'multiverseid\': 622563}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lidloser Blick\', \'text\': \'Schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil. Bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges kannst du jene Karten spielen und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um sie zu wirken.\\nRückblende {2}{B}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620817&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0734db93-809c-4984-b28c-e540ac2e80fe\', \'multiverseId\': 620817}, \'multiverseid\': 620817}, {\'name\': \'Mirada sin párpados\', \'text\': \'Exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esas cartas y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzarlas.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{B}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'360419e3-d097-44e9-bb6c-036a45334f89\', \'multiverseId\': 620889}, \'multiverseid\': 620889}, {\'name\': \'Regard vigilant\', \'text\': "Exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour les lancer.\\nFlashback {2}{B}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620961&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87a18731-6f7b-465e-ab61-2a32a1109cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 620961}, \'multiverseid\': 620961}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo Senza Palpebre\', \'text\': \'Esilia la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quelle carte e puoi spendere mana di qualsiasi tipo per lanciarle.\\nFlashback {2}{B}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb11aee6-e56a-466f-acbd-56968ea2cecd\', \'multiverseId\': 621033}, \'multiverseid\': 621033}, {\'name\': \'まぶた無き御目の凝視\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚をそれぞれ追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよく、それらを唱えるためにマナを望むタイプのマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{B}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7eda92-7e38-4254-80ee-51cfe87df39d\', \'multiverseId\': 621105}, \'multiverseid\': 621105}, {\'name\': \'Olhar Sem Pálpebras\', \'text\': \'Exile o card do topo do grimório de cada jogador. Até o final de seu próximo turno, você pode jogar aqueles cards e pode gastar mana de qualquer tipo para conjurá-los.\\nRecapitular {2}{B}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'657f05b7-5240-4933-8a34-79978a9f4b66\', \'multiverseId\': 621177}, \'multiverseid\': 621177}, {\'name\': \'无睑瞪视\', \'text\': \'放逐每位牌手的牌库顶牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用这些牌，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放。\\n返照{2}{B}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50856bfc-cac4-466b-b4e1-837ad0604935\', \'multiverseId\': 621249}, \'multiverseid\': 621249}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lidloser Blick\', \'text\': \'Schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil. Bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges kannst du jene Karten spielen und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um sie zu wirken.\\nRückblende {2}{B}{R}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620407&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4729b2b8-834e-4980-921d-8d62eaef235f\', \'multiverseId\': 620407}, \'multiverseid\': 620407}, {\'name\': \'Regard vigilant\', \'text\': "Exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour les lancer.\\nFlashback {2}{B}{R}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620475&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7a7652-8c53-472d-b7ce-610280ea698b\', \'multiverseId\': 620475}, \'multiverseid\': 620475}, {\'name\': \'まぶた無き御目の凝視\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚をそれぞれ追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよく、それらを唱えるためにマナを望むタイプのマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{B}{R}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3ab1cd-c304-4082-95b1-679e16e4df38\', \'multiverseId\': 620543}, \'multiverseid\': 620543}, {\'name\': \'无睑瞪视\', \'text\': \'放逐每位牌手的牌库顶牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用这些牌，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放。\\n返照{2}{B}{R}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a6307bc-1f59-40b1-8810-a09e37226bc0\', \'multiverseId\': 620611}, \'multiverseid\': 620611}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lied von Eärendil\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann zwei Karten.\\nII — Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein und einen 2/2 blauen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nIII — Lege auf jede Kreatur ohne Flugfähigkeit, die du kontrollierst, eine Fliegend-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620827&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ca5ea81-f418-4088-9a15-2087ceaf67c1\', \'multiverseId\': 620827}, \'multiverseid\': 620827}, {\'name\': \'Canción de Eärendil\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Adivina 2, luego roba dos cartas.\\nII — Crea una ficha de Tesoro y una ficha de criatura Ave azul 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\\nIII — Pon un contador de volar sobre cada criatura que controlas sin la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0242e529-1c10-454c-b86f-f427a3230d26\', \'multiverseId\': 620899}, \'multiverseid\': 620899}, {\'name\': "Chanson d\'Eärendil", \'text\': \'(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Regard 2, puis piochez deux cartes.\\nII— Créez un jeton Trésor et un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Oiseau avec le vol.\\nIII — Mettez un marqueur « vol » sur chaque créature sans le vol que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620971&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3187ff9-2373-4ae8-9cbb-201f7b8ba1d5\', \'multiverseId\': 620971}, \'multiverseid\': 620971}, {\'name\': \'Canzone di Eärendil\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Profetizza 2, poi pesca due carte.\\nII — Crea una pedina Tesoro e una pedina creatura Uccello 2/2 blu con volare.\\nIII — Metti un segnalino volare su ogni creatura che controlli senza volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bb62d72-dba3-4d88-ab4c-89d9c8f5b7b3\', \'multiverseId\': 621043}, \'multiverseid\': 621043}, {\'name\': \'エアレンディルの歌\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — 占術２を行う。その後、カード２枚を引く。\\nII — 宝物・トークン１つと飛行を持つ青の２/２の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nIII — あなたがコントロールしていて飛行を持たない各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ飛行・カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d7419c7-0d13-4c41-ae27-90a69e4af4fa\', \'multiverseId\': 621115}, \'multiverseid\': 621115}, {\'name\': \'Canção de Eärendil\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Use vidência 2 e depois compre dois cards.\\nII — Crie uma ficha de Tesouro e uma ficha de criatura Ave azul 2/2 com voar.\\nIII — Coloque um marcador de voar em cada criatura sem voar que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b9ff86-5187-453b-853f-a7345f28cf9d\', \'multiverseId\': 621187}, \'multiverseid\': 621187}, {\'name\': \'埃雅仁迪尔之歌\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 占卜2，然后抓两张牌。\\nII — 派出一个珍宝衍生物和一个2/2蓝色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物。\\nIII — 在每个由你操控且不具飞行异能的生物上各放置一个飞行指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b177aab-6a99-482e-953c-9cbd53a6cc2e\', \'multiverseId\': 621259}, \'multiverseid\': 621259}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lobelia, Verteidigerin von Beutelsend\', \'text\': \'Wenn Lobelia ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Gegners an und schicke die Karten verdeckt ins Exil.\\n{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Bestimme eines —\\n• Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du eine Karte, die von Lobelia ins Exil geschickt wurde, spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\n• Jeder Gegner verliert 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620376&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf13ca83-8a17-4b07-ba66-5e595178ac57\', \'multiverseId\': 620376}, \'multiverseid\': 620376}, {\'name\': \'Lobelia, défenseuse de Cul-de-sac\', \'text\': "Quand Lobelia arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque adversaire et exilez ces cartes face cachée.\\n{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer une carte exilée par Lobelia sans payer son coût de mana.\\n• Chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d80bb66-b406-4373-a726-9a53a7062457\', \'multiverseId\': 620444}, \'multiverseid\': 620444}, {\'name\': \'袋小路屋敷を守る者、ロベリアばあさま\', \'text\': \'袋小路屋敷を守る者、ロベリアばあさまが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見て、それらのカードを裏向きに追放する。\\n{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・ターン終了時まで、あなたは袋小路屋敷を守る者、ロベリアばあさまによって追放されているカード１枚を、マナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\\n・各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4abc2ece-2815-4a5b-aeb5-012f9f74bb8d\', \'multiverseId\': 620512}, \'multiverseid\': 620512}, {\'name\': \'袋底洞保护者洛比莉亚\', \'text\': \'当洛比莉亚进战场时，检视每位对手的牌库顶牌并牌面朝下地放逐这些牌。\\n{T}，牺牲一个神器：选择一项～\\n•直到回合结束，你可以使用一张以洛比莉亚放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n•每位对手各失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcb28934-d35c-4f70-b5d7-9d4566bf022b\', \'multiverseId\': 620580}, \'multiverseid\': 620580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lobelia, Verteidigerin von Beutelsend\', \'text\': \'Wenn Lobelia ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Gegners an und schicke die Karten verdeckt ins Exil.\\n{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Bestimme eines —\\n• Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du eine Karte, die von Lobelia ins Exil geschickt wurde, spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\n• Jeder Gegner verliert 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620785&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771ae962-5187-4ce5-b1d3-e614153df3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 620785}, \'multiverseid\': 620785}, {\'name\': \'Lobelia, defensora de Bolsón Cerrado\', \'text\': \'Cuando Lobelia entre al campo de batalla, mira la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada oponente y exilia esas cartas boca abajo.\\n{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Elige uno:\\n• Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar una carta exiliada con Lobelia sin pagar su coste de maná.\\n• Cada oponente pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ciudadano mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3382a5-6d3d-4f82-b0c5-6683158e7b55\', \'multiverseId\': 620857}, \'multiverseid\': 620857}, {\'name\': \'Lobelia, défenseuse de Cul-de-sac\', \'text\': "Quand Lobelia arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque adversaire et exilez ces cartes face cachée.\\n{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer une carte exilée par Lobelia sans payer son coût de mana.\\n• Chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620929&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc65b7f-e141-4182-9ebc-ed8ea0326762\', \'multiverseId\': 620929}, \'multiverseid\': 620929}, {\'name\': \'Lobelia, Difensore di Casa Baggins\', \'text\': \'Quando Lobelia entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda la prima carta del grimorio di ogni avversario ed esilia quelle carte a faccia in giù.\\n{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Scegli uno —\\n• Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare una carta esiliata con Lobelia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\n• Ogni avversario perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cittadino Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f69d91af-f7e8-4b6e-8a51-aa90228858bb\', \'multiverseId\': 621001}, \'multiverseid\': 621001}, {\'name\': \'袋小路屋敷を守る者、ロベリアばあさま\', \'text\': \'袋小路屋敷を守る者、ロベリアばあさまが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見て、それらのカードを裏向きに追放する。\\n{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・ターン終了時まで、あなたは袋小路屋敷を守る者、ロベリアばあさまによって追放されているカード１枚を、マナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\\n・各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba10ded4-2060-444b-9129-1f728ea557be\', \'multiverseId\': 621073}, \'multiverseid\': 621073}, {\'name\': \'Lobelia, Defensora de Bolsão\', \'text\': \'Quando Lobelia entrar no campo de batalha, olhe o card do topo do grimório de cada oponente e exile aqueles cards com a face voltada para baixo.\\n{T}, sacrifique um artefato: Escolha um —\\n• Até o final do turno, você pode jogar um card exilado com Lobelia sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\n• Cada oponente perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Cidadão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f7e7613-7634-4292-a7f5-f85915e57959\', \'multiverseId\': 621145}, \'multiverseid\': 621145}, {\'name\': \'袋底洞保护者洛比莉亚\', \'text\': \'当洛比莉亚进战场时，检视每位对手的牌库顶牌并牌面朝下地放逐这些牌。\\n{T}，牺牲一个神器：选择一项～\\n•直到回合结束，你可以使用一张以洛比莉亚放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n•每位对手各失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb84c05b-ac09-490a-871a-752a9c1fc9dd\', \'multiverseId\': 621217}, \'multiverseid\': 621217}]', '[{\'name\': \'Makelloser Talisman\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Umhang hatte einen Verschluss am Hals, eine Brosche in Form eines grünen Blattes mit Adern aus Silber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c37d13-572f-4e77-9409-db451c62ff82\', \'multiverseId\': 621580}, \'multiverseid\': 621580}, {\'name\': \'Talismán prístino\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}. Ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Cada capa se cerraba al cuello con un broche con forma de hoja de color verde y nervaduras de plata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c72f1f3b-5923-4562-9250-2c06212790da\', \'multiverseId\': 621767}, \'multiverseid\': 621767}, {\'name\': \'Talisman immaculé\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Chaque cape était attachée autour du cou par une broche ressemblant à une feuille verte veinée d\'argent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621954&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec71f936-0788-49ee-bb27-ffee6c5c64d5\', \'multiverseId\': 621954}, \'multiverseid\': 621954}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Integro\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Ogni mantello veniva chiuso al collo da una spilla simile a una verde foglia venata d\'argento.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'775a3608-7a7b-4afc-a6e2-15fe3fa4f18f\', \'multiverseId\': 622141}, \'multiverseid\': 622141}, {\'name\': \'清純のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'マントはそれぞれ首のところで、銀の葉脈が走る緑の葉の形をしたブローチによって留めてあった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cf6f3c7-c438-4aae-b3f3-4ffe413f6049\', \'multiverseId\': 622328}, \'multiverseid\': 622328}, {\'name\': \'Talismã Imaculado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}. Você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Cada manto era afixado em torno do pescoço com um broche em forma de folha verde com veios de prata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb337580-8bd6-4c1c-92b0-6e3753c110e3\', \'multiverseId\': 622515}, \'multiverseid\': 622515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mantel aus Flüsterseide\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden und hat Verhülltheit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sind diese Umhänge verzaubert?", fragte Pippin.\\n„Ich weiß nicht, was du damit meinst", antwortete der Anführer der Elben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ff3c7c-991e-4258-9356-faa708bf7721\', \'multiverseId\': 621589}, \'multiverseid\': 621589}, {\'name\': \'Manto de sedasusurrante\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada no puede ser bloqueada y tiene la habilidad de velo. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'—¿Son capas mágicas? —preguntó Pippin.\\n—No sé a qué te refieres —respondió el líder de los elfos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6727fbcc-e6dd-40dd-9a10-1df3e8d5a43c\', \'multiverseId\': 621776}, \'multiverseid\': 621776}, {\'name\': \'Cape de frémisoie\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée ne peut pas être bloquée et a le linceul. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'« Ces capes sont-elles magiques ? » demanda Pippin.\\n« Je ne sais pas ce que vous voulez dire », répondit le chef des elfes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621963&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e39d2a3-3e18-4b39-85a5-1a318fd9f7ad\', \'multiverseId\': 621963}, \'multiverseid\': 621963}, {\'name\': \'Manto Setabisbiglio\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata non può essere bloccata e ha velo. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono questi dei mantelli magici?" domandò Pipino.\\n"Non so che cosa tu intenda dire", rispose il capo degli Elfi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'145ddb1a-4108-4ece-83cf-9331c1f53734\', \'multiverseId\': 622150}, \'multiverseid\': 622150}, {\'name\': \'囁き絹の外套\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、被覆を持ちブロックされない。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「これは魔法のマントですか？」ピピンが尋ねた。\\n「いかなる意味で言われたか、私にはわかりかねますが」と、エルフのかしらが答えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'751f84b3-5aa2-4274-aeab-f83f749c1502\', \'multiverseId\': 622337}, \'multiverseid\': 622337}, {\'name\': \'Manto de Seda Ruflante\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada não pode ser bloqueada e tem manto. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Esses mantos são mágicos?", perguntou Pippin.\\n"Não sei o que você quer dizer com isso", respondeu o líder dos elfos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b9e7e0-e113-49f7-960b-d8bbaa2bd434\', \'multiverseId\': 622524}, \'multiverseid\': 622524}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mentor der Sanften\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur mit Stärke 2 oder weniger unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Im Nu war der Tisch gedeckt. Es gab heiße Suppe, kaltes Fleisch, eine Brombeertorte, frisches Brot, reichlich Butter und gereiften Käse: gutes, einfaches Essen, das beste, was das Auenland bieten konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621470&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edea41a5-b239-42bb-9a43-d83d4a9abec0\', \'multiverseId\': 621470}, \'multiverseid\': 621470}, {\'name\': \'Mentor de los mansos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura con fuerza de 2 o menos entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'En un abrir y cerrar de ojos, se puso la mesa. Había sopa caliente, fiambre, una tarta de moras, barras recién horneadas, trozos de mantequilla y medio queso maduro: comida corriente y buena, tan buena como lo que ofrecía la Comarca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67bb3b5e-6bae-49f3-bdcc-c3017236f34e\', \'multiverseId\': 621657}, \'multiverseid\': 621657}, {\'name\': \'Mentor des humbles\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature avec une force inférieure ou égale à 2 arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "En un éclair, la table fut mise. Il y avait de la soupe chaude, des viandes froides, une tarte aux mûres, des miches de pain frais, des mottes de beurre et la moitié d\'un fromage bien fait : de la nourriture simple, la meilleure de la Comté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4576d42-4af7-4ff7-bd77-062bed7cdc49\', \'multiverseId\': 621844}, \'multiverseid\': 621844}, {\'name\': \'Mentore degli Umili\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura con forza pari o inferiore a 2 entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': "La tavola fu apparecchiata in un batter d\'occhio. C\'erano zuppa calda, carne fredda, una crostata di more, pagnotte di pane fresco, panetti di burro e una mezza forma di formaggio invecchiato; buon cibo semplice come i migliori pasti della Contea.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87c95472-67a9-470c-82d3-601307df6cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 622031}, \'multiverseid\': 622031}, {\'name\': \'弱者の師\', \'text\': \'パワーが２以下でありこれでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'あっという間にテーブルの支度は整った。熱いスープに冷肉、きいちごのパイに焼きたてのパン、厚く切ったバターに食べ頃のチーズと、簡素だがホビット庄でもなかなかない美味しい食事であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa7f2056-5da0-44ef-adbb-9e3b205e0aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 622218}, \'multiverseid\': 622218}, {\'name\': \'Mentor dos Humildes\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura com poder igual ou inferior a 2 entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Num lampejo a mesa foi posta. Havia sopa quente, carnes frias, torta de amora, pães frescos, tabletes de manteiga e meio queijo de cura: comida boa e simples, tão boa quanto o Condado podia proporcionar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'559e3cc3-b999-4892-8f9b-b9f04eaa3bf6\', \'multiverseId\': 622405}, \'multiverseid\': 622405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Merry, Truchsess von Isengart\', \'text\': \'Partner von Pippin, Truchsess von Isengart (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Pippin aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Artefakte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein mit Lebensverknüpfung. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620819&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a17a27f-db1f-45c4-ba22-449de44cfc6e\', \'multiverseId\': 620819}, \'multiverseid\': 620819}, {\'name\': \'Merry, guardián de Isengard\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Pippin, guardián de Isengard. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Pippin en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nSiempre que uno o más artefactos entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de vínculo vital. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d32c9f3e-8ae0-45bc-9a27-76c11d9df17b\', \'multiverseId\': 620891}, \'multiverseid\': 620891}, {\'name\': "Merry, garde d\'Isengard", \'text\': "Partenariat avec Pippin, garde d\'Isengard (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé peut mettre Pippin dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat avec le lien de vie. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620963&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'652ea193-7ba5-4e52-a820-dfdc310cd41b\', \'multiverseId\': 620963}, \'multiverseid\': 620963}, {\'name\': \'Merry, Guardiano di Isengard\', \'text\': \'Partner di Pipino, Guardiano di Isengard (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Pipino alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nOgniqualvolta uno o più artefatti entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca con legame vitale. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d9f7243-6a92-442e-a727-53c09d375bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 621035}, \'multiverseid\': 621035}, {\'name\': \'アイゼンガルドの監視人、メリー\', \'text\': \'アイゼンガルドの監視人、ピピンとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーからアイゼンガルドの監視人、ピピンを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\n１つ以上のアーティファクトがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、絆魂を持つ白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'573812f8-e51d-46ec-a8e0-36a263a57f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 621107}, \'multiverseid\': 621107}, {\'name\': \'Merry, Protetor de Isengard\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Pippin, Protetor de Isengard (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Pippin na própria mão do próprio grimório e, em seguida, embaralha.)\\nToda vez que um ou mais artefatos entrarem no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura Soldado branca 1/1 com vínculo com a vida. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7919c22-9b64-444f-92b8-99c063aa2093\', \'multiverseId\': 621179}, \'multiverseid\': 621179}, {\'name\': \'艾森加德守门人梅里\', \'text\': \'与艾森加德守门人皮平拍档（当此生物进战场时，目标牌手可以将皮平从其牌库置于其手上，然后洗牌。）\\n每当一个或数个神器在你操控下进战场时，派出一个1/1白色，具系命异能的士兵衍生生物。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ad64fd-564b-4a80-bf16-55ed1248d964\', \'multiverseId\': 621251}, \'multiverseid\': 621251}]', '[{\'name\': \'Merry, Truchsess von Isengart\', \'text\': \'Partner von Pippin, Truchsess von Isengart\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Artefakte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein mit Lebensverknüpfung. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620409&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0742b42-43c9-4a2b-ac80-a9fddfcc1cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 620409}, \'multiverseid\': 620409}, {\'name\': "Merry, garde d\'Isengard", \'text\': "Partenariat avec Pippin, garde d\'Isengard\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat avec le lien de vie. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e394024f-ec08-4f15-9654-a0bac0b0b8ae\', \'multiverseId\': 620477}, \'multiverseid\': 620477}, {\'name\': \'アイゼンガルドの監視人、メリー\', \'text\': \'アイゼンガルドの監視人、ピピンとの共闘\\n１つ以上のアーティファクトがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、絆魂を持つ白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e09d5433-2591-478b-8175-486b15001278\', \'multiverseId\': 620545}, \'multiverseid\': 620545}, {\'name\': \'艾森加德守门人梅里\', \'text\': \'与艾森加德守门人皮平拍档\\n每当一个或数个神器在你操控下进战场时，派出一个1/1白色，具系命异能的士兵衍生生物。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa5c1f1-46fe-4e46-a37f-d838c11ac2f3\', \'multiverseId\': 620613}, \'multiverseid\': 620613}]', '[{\'name\': \'Modell der Einheit\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Spieler eine Abstimmung beenden, könnt du und jeder Gegner, der für eine Option gestimmt hat, für die du gestimmt hast, Hellsicht 2 anwenden.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Bruchtal ist ein vortreffliches Haus, ganz gleich, ob dir nach Speisen oder Schlaf oder Geschichten oder Gesang oder einer angenehmen Mischung aus all dem ist."\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620424&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'844a479a-1643-461c-b4e4-8c65f1dcafba\', \'multiverseId\': 620424}, \'multiverseid\': 620424}, {\'name\': "Maquette d\'unité", \'text\': \'À chaque fois que les joueurs finissent de voter, vous et chaque adversaire qui a voté pour un choix pour lequel vous avez voté pouvez appliquer regard 2.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Fondcombe est une maison parfaite, qu\'on aime manger, dormir ou raconter des histoires, ou même chanter, voire même un agréable mélange de tout cela. »\\n—Bilbo", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9796844d-ba02-41d2-913c-1585540a78e6\', \'multiverseId\': 620492}, \'multiverseid\': 620492}, {\'name\': \'統一の模範\', \'text\': \'すべてのプレイヤーが投票を完了するたび、あなたと、あなたと同じ選択に投票した各対戦相手はそれぞれ占術２を行ってもよい。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「食べたり昼寝したり、物語ったり歌ったり、あるいはその全部を好きなように楽しんだり、裂け谷は何一つ不自由しないよ。」\\n――ビルボ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a97e4a0-e3fa-414e-8d8b-81b326f3096e\', \'multiverseId\': 620560}, \'multiverseid\': 620560}, {\'name\': \'团结模范\', \'text\': \'每当所有牌手完成投票时，你和每位投票选择你投票之选项的对手各可以占卜2。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「幽谷就像一所完美的房子，无论你是想吃饭、睡觉、说书、歌唱还是这些都混在一起，它都是最理想的去处。」\\n～比尔博\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad5aba81-3fb4-493b-a43d-fc79a30f68e9\', \'multiverseId\': 620628}, \'multiverseid\': 620628}]', '[{\'name\': \'Modell der Einheit\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Spieler eine Abstimmung beenden, könnt du und jeder Gegner, der für eine Option gestimmt hat, für die du gestimmt hast, Hellsicht 2 anwenden.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Bruchtal ist ein vortreffliches Haus, ganz gleich, ob dir nach Speisen oder Schlaf oder Geschichten oder Gesang oder einer angenehmen Mischung aus all dem ist."\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33fed7cc-2b78-42b3-a6cd-b5be3d76a189\', \'multiverseId\': 620836}, \'multiverseid\': 620836}, {\'name\': \'Maqueta de unidad\', \'text\': \'Siempre que los jugadores terminen de votar, tú y cada oponente que votó una opción que tú votaste pueden adivinar 2.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Rivendel es la casa perfecta, tanto si te gusta comer como descansar, contar historias, cantar o una agradable mezcla de todo ello".\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65bf1f1d-31a0-4d1e-9d5c-47c7572bd2ec\', \'multiverseId\': 620908}, \'multiverseid\': 620908}, {\'name\': "Maquette d\'unité", \'text\': \'À chaque fois que les joueurs finissent de voter, vous et chaque adversaire qui a voté pour un choix pour lequel vous avez voté pouvez appliquer regard 2.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Fondcombe est une maison parfaite, qu\'on aime manger, dormir ou raconter des histoires, ou même chanter, voire même un agréable mélange de tout cela. »\\n—Bilbo", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620980&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74704ed8-74e8-4e96-abfa-9b48f1ce0d79\', \'multiverseId\': 620980}, \'multiverseid\': 620980}, {\'name\': \'Modello di Unità\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta i giocatori terminano di votare, tu e ogni avversario che ha votato come te potete profetizzare 2.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Gran Burrone è una casa perfetta, sia che amiate il cibo, o il riposo, o il canto, o i racconti, o un piacevole miscuglio di tutto."\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e87323ad-a5a3-4eb2-bc12-2f892c9da26a\', \'multiverseId\': 621052}, \'multiverseid\': 621052}, {\'name\': \'統一の模範\', \'text\': \'すべてのプレイヤーが投票を完了するたび、あなたと、あなたと同じ選択に投票した各対戦相手はそれぞれ占術２を行ってもよい。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「食べたり昼寝したり、物語ったり歌ったり、あるいはその全部を好きなように楽しんだり、裂け谷は何一つ不自由しないよ。」\\n――ビルボ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba9fb78-1b55-43b7-a9a0-2a0f7dae681f\', \'multiverseId\': 621124}, \'multiverseid\': 621124}, {\'name\': \'Modelo de Unidade\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que os jogadores terminarem de votar, você e cada oponente que votou em uma escolha que você votou poderão usar vidência 2.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Valfenda é uma casa perfeita, seja para comer, dormir, contar histórias, cantar ou uma agradável mistura de todas essas coisas."\\n— Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4088b07a-c3c0-41cc-a993-5761bdbeb293\', \'multiverseId\': 621196}, \'multiverseid\': 621196}, {\'name\': \'团结模范\', \'text\': \'每当所有牌手完成投票时，你和每位投票选择你投票之选项的对手各可以占卜2。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「幽谷就像一所完美的房子，无论你是想吃饭、睡觉、说书、歌唱还是这些都混在一起，它都是最理想的去处。」\\n～比尔博\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d4897c-98cf-4675-af11-14bec066ad18\', \'multiverseId\': 621268}, \'multiverseid\': 621268}]', "[{'name': 'Murmelndes Gehölz', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {G}.)\\nSowie das Murmelnde Gehölz ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Baumhirte-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt das Murmelnde Gehölz getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}. Das Murmelnde Gehölz fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land — Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621617&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9be38256-0c8c-4af8-9c37-50f05d3965c2', 'multiverseId': 621617}, 'multiverseid': 621617}, {'name': 'Espesura murmurante', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {G}.)\\nEn cuanto la Espesura murmurante entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Pueblo-arbóreo de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Espesura murmurante entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}. La Espesura murmurante te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621804&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '818c378d-b60a-4cd5-9b69-6c279026360a', 'multiverseId': 621804}, 'multiverseid': 621804}, {'name': 'Bosquet bruissant', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {G}.)\\nAu moment où le Bosquet bruissant arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de sylvin de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Bosquet bruissant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}. Le Bosquet bruissant vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621991&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '412a7938-e672-4db2-bd73-9c2e20d85395', 'multiverseId': 621991}, 'multiverseid': 621991}, {'name': 'Bosco Sussurrante', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {G}.)\\nMentre il Bosco Sussurrante entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Silvantropo dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, il Bosco Sussurrante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}. Il Bosco Sussurrante ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622178&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c7b8c3c-d6d3-4786-9710-a9fa4252d76c', 'multiverseId': 622178}, 'multiverseid': 622178}, {'name': 'つぶやき林', 'text': '（{T}：{G}を加える。）\\nつぶやき林が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあるツリーフォーク・カード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、つぶやき林はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。つぶやき林はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622365&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fc1c724-7448-43a3-b2ff-0593fc7d2fad', 'multiverseId': 622365}, 'multiverseid': 622365}, {'name': 'Bosque Murmurante', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {G}.)\\nConforme Bosque Murmurante entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Ent da sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Bosque Murmurante entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}. Bosque Murmurante causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622552&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4dfc66b8-8253-4fce-99fe-8ffac098d757', 'multiverseId': 622552}, 'multiverseid': 622552}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mysteriöse Ablehnung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Sein Beherrscher kann zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des nächsten Zuges bis zu zwei Karten ziehen.\\nZiehe zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des nächsten Zuges eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Gestern Abend habe ich euch von Sauron, dem Dunklen Herrscher, erzählt. Die Gerüchte sind wahr: Er hat sich wieder erhoben."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621481&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fee3824-7b38-4d81-b6c1-b3e1abf51250\', \'multiverseId\': 621481}, \'multiverseid\': 621481}, {\'name\': \'Constricción arcana\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Su controlador puede robar hasta dos cartas al comienzo del mantenimiento del próximo turno.\\nTú robas una carta al comienzo del mantenimiento del próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Anoche te hablé de Sauron, el Señor Oscuro. Los rumores son ciertos: ha aparecido nuevamente".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5b1265-2b72-4ce3-9235-b669af1b383c\', \'multiverseId\': 621668}, \'multiverseid\': 621668}, {\'name\': \'Déni des arcanes\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Son contrôleur peut piocher jusqu\'à deux cartes au début de l\'entretien du prochain tour.\\nVous piochez une carte au début de l\'entretien du prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La nuit dernière, je vous ai parlé de Sauron, le Seigneur ténébreux. Les rumeurs sont vraies : il est de retour. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87880b7-0794-4c50-bdd9-1a4293efc0fc\', \'multiverseId\': 621855}, \'multiverseid\': 621855}, {\'name\': \'Privazione Arcana\', \'text\': "Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Il suo controllore può pescare fino a due carte all\'inizio del mantenimento del prossimo turno.\\nPeschi una carta all\'inizio del mantenimento del prossimo turno.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ieri sera ti ho parlato di Sauron, l\\\'Oscuro Signore. Le voci che corrono sono vere: egli si è messo di nuovo in movimento."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83f6abcb-d1ed-4eea-b1cb-3ffe9650e67b\', \'multiverseId\': 622042}, \'multiverseid\': 622042}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の否定\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。次のターンのアップキープの開始時に、それのコントローラーはカード最大２枚を引いてもよい。\\n次のターンのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「昨夜わしは、冥王サウロンのことをおまえに話した。噂は本当じゃ。あやつはふたたびその力を盛り返したのじゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'969f64ca-9b4f-411c-84da-5425080106c4\', \'multiverseId\': 622229}, \'multiverseid\': 622229}, {\'name\': \'Contradição Arcana\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Seu controlador pode comprar até dois cards no início da manutenção do próximo turno.\\nVocê compra um card no início da manutenção do próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Noite passada eu lhe falei de Sauron, o Senhor Sombrio. Os rumores são verdade: ele se levantou novamente."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1bc13a6-c666-402a-bb2d-fa34dd0dc228\', \'multiverseId\': 622416}, \'multiverseid\': 622416}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mystische Konfluenz\', \'text\': \'Bestimme drei. Du kannst denselben Modus mehr als einmal bestimmen.\\n• Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}.\\n• Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621490&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7abff60b-0c8a-44eb-a3f9-4b9c7119ac33\', \'multiverseId\': 621490}, \'multiverseid\': 621490}, {\'name\': \'Confluencia mística\', \'text\': \'Elige tres. Puedes elegir el mismo modo más de una vez.\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {3}.\\n• Regresa la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\n• Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5101529c-839d-4365-abc6-db2af3ba9ff1\', \'multiverseId\': 621677}, \'multiverseid\': 621677}, {\'name\': \'Confluence mystique\', \'text\': "Choisissez trois. Vous pouvez choisir le même mode plus d\'une fois.\\n• Contrecarrez un sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.\\n• Renvoyez une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d23d22-10e4-4796-893e-df4ee4e52d2e\', \'multiverseId\': 621864}, \'multiverseid\': 621864}, {\'name\': \'Confluenza Mistica\', \'text\': \'Scegli tre. Puoi scegliere lo stesso modo più di una volta.\\n• Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.\\n• Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\n• Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25bad703-e161-4a8a-ab3e-8785b2a6650e\', \'multiverseId\': 622051}, \'multiverseid\': 622051}, {\'name\': \'神秘の合流点\', \'text\': \'以下から３つを選ぶ。同じモードを２回以上選んでもよい。\\n・呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14b2cd47-aac6-44c1-8ec9-8ca0ed3de944\', \'multiverseId\': 622238}, \'multiverseid\': 622238}, {\'name\': \'Confluência Mística\', \'text\': \'Escolha três. Você pode escolher o mesmo modo mais de uma vez.\\n• Anule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\\n• Devolva a criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono.\\n• Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0403ea5-b1ea-44e3-be49-7fac2bc9ebe0\', \'multiverseId\': 622425}, \'multiverseid\': 622425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtgeflüster\', \'text\': \'Du ziehst zwei Karten und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Frodo war kaum weniger verängstigt als seine Begleiter; er zitterte, als sei ihm bitterkalt, doch ein plötzliches Verlangen, sich den Ring anzustecken, übertönte seine Furcht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'336d04d7-af24-4e81-9b5c-86782befb82b\', \'multiverseId\': 621502}, \'multiverseid\': 621502}, {\'name\': \'Susurro nocturno\', \'text\': \'Robas dos cartas y pierdes 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Frodo tenía tanto miedo como sus compañeros: temblaba, atacado por un frío intenso, pero la pronta tentación de ponerse el Anillo se sobrepuso al miedo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9c16bfb-f85c-4972-a98f-c36fc1c8fb73\', \'multiverseId\': 621689}, \'multiverseid\': 621689}, {\'name\': \'Chuchotements nocturnes\', \'text\': \'Vous piochez deux cartes et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Frodo n\'était pas moins terrifié que ses compagnons. Il tremblait comme dans un froid glacial, mais sa terreur fut engloutie par la tentation soudaine de mettre l\'Anneau à son doigt.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a282bd-9012-4160-aa0c-c5f2930a2eaa\', \'multiverseId\': 621876}, \'multiverseid\': 621876}, {\'name\': \'Sussurri della Notte\', \'text\': \'Peschi due carte e perdi 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Frodo non era meno spaventato dei suoi compagni: tremava come per un gran freddo; ma il suo spavento fu improvvisamente inghiottito dalla forte tentazione di infilarsi l\'Anello.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb6df5cd-f7af-4855-8dbb-55a8c7e730e3\', \'multiverseId\': 622063}, \'multiverseid\': 622063}, {\'name\': \'夜の囁き\', \'text\': \'あなたはカード２枚を引き、２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'フロドも仲間たちに劣らず怯えていた。ひどく寒気がするように震えていた。だがその恐怖は突然、指輪をはめたいという誘惑に吸い込まれてしまった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f737ddad-49ce-4170-b0c0-15b6fd9f5d57\', \'multiverseId\': 622250}, \'multiverseid\': 622250}, {\'name\': \'Sussurro da Noite\', \'text\': \'Você compra dois cards e perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Frodo estava quase tão aterrorizado quanto seus companheiros; ele tremia como se sentisse frio, mas seu terror foi devorado uma tentação repentina de colocar o Anel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df6f6558-7590-45c6-a420-f8c8c0725c96\', \'multiverseId\': 622437}, \'multiverseid\': 622437}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nekroblüten-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Nekroblüten-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Sumpf- oder Wald-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Nekroblüten-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Merry stand am Fuß des grünen Hügels und weinte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621618&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c52189a-562a-4035-95e5-783dee65164a\', \'multiverseId\': 621618}, \'multiverseid\': 621618}, {\'name\': \'Maraña necroflorecida\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña necroflorecida entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Pantano o de Bosque de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña necroflorecida entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Merry lloró al pie del túmulo verde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e640075-1dcf-49f4-a497-014bdeae9a0a\', \'multiverseId\': 621805}, \'multiverseid\': 621805}, {\'name\': \'Lacis nécrofleur\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Lacis nécrofleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de marais ou de forêt de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis nécrofleur arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Merry était debout au pied du tertre vert, et il pleurait.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621992&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ac1baba-0ca8-4190-8b74-02bd7bea28e7\', \'multiverseId\': 621992}, \'multiverseid\': 621992}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Necrogermoglio\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Necrogermoglio entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Palude o Foresta dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Necrogermoglio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Merry piangeva ai piedi del verde tumulo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b079898-1c96-4aee-ae0a-39c2c5bfd56c\', \'multiverseId\': 622179}, \'multiverseid\': 622179}, {\'name\': \'屍花の交錯\', \'text\': \'屍花の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり沼や森であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、屍花の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'メリーは緑の塚山の麓に立ち、泣いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f11ce852-c676-4c4c-8a73-861e77b47c95\', \'multiverseId\': 622366}, \'multiverseid\': 622366}, {\'name\': \'Liame da Necroflorescência\', \'text\': \'Conforme Liame da Necroflorescência entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Pântano ou Floresta de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Liame da Necroflorescência entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Merry postou-se na base do monte verde e chorou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50dd23a8-bdac-4303-b752-054def34dd55\', \'multiverseId\': 622553}, \'multiverseid\': 622553}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oberster Holzeinschläger\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Oberste Holzeinschläger ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die keine Kreatur ist.\\nBeharrlichkeit (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und falls keine -1/-1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer -1/-1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621561&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c69cf77-1658-4c34-a44c-98dce053af4e\', \'multiverseId\': 621561}, \'multiverseid\': 621561}, {\'name\': \'Primus pudremadera\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Primus pudremadera entre al campo de batalla, destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea criatura.\\nPersistir. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores -1/-1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador -1/-1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25f679fd-f843-41d7-855d-b1eb728176b6\', \'multiverseId\': 621748}, \'multiverseid\': 621748}, {\'name\': \'Primus chutebois\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand le Primus chutebois arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez un permanent non-créature ciblé.\\nPersistance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs -1/-1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur -1/-1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621935&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49d8a94-a28c-4ba0-9685-9c65a358c235\', \'multiverseId\': 621935}, \'multiverseid\': 621935}, {\'name\': \'Primus della Foresta Caduta\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Primus della Foresta Caduta entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un permanente non creatura bersaglio.\\nPersistere (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini -1/-1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfcafb22-dee5-418e-b8dd-861011ad7ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 622122}, \'multiverseid\': 622122}, {\'name\': \'森滅ぼしの最長老\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n森滅ぼしの最長老が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーでないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n頑強（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に－１/－１カウンターがない場合、これを－１/－１カウンター１個が置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b985a78b-01aa-4d50-a38f-b2b0bdbbfbe0\', \'multiverseId\': 622309}, \'multiverseid\': 622309}, {\'name\': \'Primaz Desmatador\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Primaz Desmatador entrar no campo de batalha, destrua a permanente não de criatura alvo.\\nPersistir (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador -1/-1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ent Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4149a347-a624-4ac9-9e1e-8b32ef864242\', \'multiverseId\': 622496}, \'multiverseid\': 622496}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oberster Richtspruch\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nZerstöre alle Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Eine riesige Schattengestalt erhob sich, undurchdringlich, von Blitzen gekrönt, und füllte den ganzen Himmel. Gewaltig richtete sie sich über der Welt auf, fürchterlich und doch machtlos, denn als sie sich über sie beugte, erfasste sie ein starker Wind, und alles wurde fortgeweht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621569&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e07b24ba-f184-44e0-a636-8741758f9909\', \'multiverseId\': 621569}, \'multiverseid\': 621569}, {\'name\': \'Veredicto supremo\', \'text\': \'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nDestruye todas las criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cubría el cielo una inmensa forma de sombra impenetrable, coronada de rayos. Se desplegó gigantesca sobre el mundo, terrible pero impotente. Cuando comenzó a cernirse sobre ellos, un fuerte viento la arrastró y la disipó.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d60c3fd-376e-46f9-b14d-e73eb2241ced\', \'multiverseId\': 621756}, \'multiverseid\': 621756}, {\'name\': \'Verdict suprême\', \'text\': \'Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nDétruisez toutes les créatures.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Une immense nappe d\'ombres, impénétrable, couronnée d\'éclairs emplit le ciel. Elle s\'élevait, énorme, au-dessus du monde, terrible mais impuissante : car alors même qu\'elle se penchait sur eux, un grand vent l\'emporta et elle fut soufflée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621943&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53c908a4-eaaf-42f0-ae8a-80ecdd71e4da\', \'multiverseId\': 621943}, \'multiverseid\': 621943}, {\'name\': \'Verdetto Supremo\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nDistruggi tutte le creature.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Si levò l\'immensa forma di un\'ombra, impenetrabile, incoronata da fulmini, e invase tutto il cielo. Enorme e gigantesca sovrastò tutto il mondo, terribile ma impotente: infatti, proprio mentre si avvicinava, un forte vento la sospinse e la spazzò via.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90864ea6-da21-418b-bc23-47a960a22775\', \'multiverseId\': 622130}, \'multiverseid\': 622130}, {\'name\': \'至高の評決\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'巨大な影姿が上って来た。それは一切の光を徹さぬほどに黒く、稲妻の冠を頂き、空を覆っていた。下界を見降ろす恐ろしさは総毛立つほどだったが、何の力もなかった。覆い被さるように身を屈めたその時、それは大風にさらわれ、吹き散らされてしまった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb5f0feb-8372-4027-a0bd-2c38c53e93e5\', \'multiverseId\': 622317}, \'multiverseid\': 622317}, {\'name\': \'Veredito Supremo\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica não pode ser anulada.\\nDestrua todas as criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Assomou uma grande forma sombria, impenetrável, coroada de raios, preenchendo o céu inteiro. Enorme, ela se ergueu sobre o mundo, terrível, mas impotente, pois quando se inclinou na direção deles, um grande vento a levou e ela se dispersou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcc53901-434b-4cea-b8a1-a001e1a961bd\', \'multiverseId\': 622504}, \'multiverseid\': 622504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Obstgartenschreiter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Obstgartenschreiter ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei Speise-Spielsteine. (Sie sind Artefakte mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1}{G} ({1}{G}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed1a6ad4-11b1-4276-8c25-720177458e19\', \'multiverseId\': 621550}, \'multiverseid\': 621550}, {\'name\': \'Montaraz frutal\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Montaraz frutal entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de Comida. (Son artefactos con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {1}{G}. ({1}{G}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b0a8e3-6e71-4fef-8dc2-d05a2b48fb7a\', \'multiverseId\': 621737}, \'multiverseid\': 621737}, {\'name\': \'Enjambeur du verger\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Enjambeur du verger arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons Nourriture. (Ce sont des artefacts avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1}{G} ({1}{G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)", \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb12eb5-3112-4df9-b8b2-5bf65e452846\', \'multiverseId\': 621924}, \'multiverseid\': 621924}, {\'name\': \'Ramingo del Frutteto\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ramingo del Frutteto entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine Cibo. (Sono artefatti con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\\nCicloterra base {1}{G} ({1}{G}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ad7a92-5f58-4a63-a5f5-e063dddf9be5\', \'multiverseId\': 622111}, \'multiverseid\': 622111}, {\'name\': \'果樹園の徘徊者\', \'text\': \'果樹園の徘徊者が戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン２つを生成する。（それらは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}{G}（{1}{G}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'711f780f-a6ad-4511-bf90-a4d4a3d44321\', \'multiverseId\': 622298}, \'multiverseid\': 622298}, {\'name\': \'Andarilho do Pomar\', \'text\': \'Quando Andarilho do Pomar entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de Comida. (Elas são artefatos com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida".)\\nReciclar terreno básico {1}{G} ({1}{G}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983d1e5d-b7b8-4ee8-b68e-f1ca3f0f107f\', \'multiverseId\': 622485}, \'multiverseid\': 622485}]', '[{\'name\': \'Optionen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Sie blickten gen Osten auf den Schatten und gen Westen auf die Dämmerung, und sie gaben sich ein Versprechen und waren froh.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621491&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92355f59-12c6-4427-b8c6-f3e7796bee5f\', \'multiverseId\': 621491}, \'multiverseid\': 621491}, {\'name\': \'Optar\', \'text\': \'Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Miraron al este hacia la sombra y al oeste hacia el crepúsculo. Se juraron eterna fidelidad y fueron felices.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcc47285-43bb-4add-9355-c1fa954e0c54\', \'multiverseId\': 621678}, \'multiverseid\': 621678}, {\'name\': \'Option\', \'text\': \'Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous.)\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Ils regardèrent à l\'est vers l\'Ombre et à l\'ouest vers le Crépuscule ; alors, ils se promirent l\'un à l\'autre et furent heureux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621865&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b275a9f7-d1cd-4ede-acf9-c2faac3dd6c7\', \'multiverseId\': 621865}, \'multiverseid\': 621865}, {\'name\': \'Opzione\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla in fondo.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Guardarono a oriente l\'Ombra e a occidente il Crepuscolo; si giurarono eterna fedeltà e furono felici.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e362db4a-7977-4d91-b91a-d2f0926aa7e4\', \'multiverseId\': 622052}, \'multiverseid\': 622052}, {\'name\': \'選択\', \'text\': \'占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードを一番下に置いてもよい。）\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'二人は東に影を、西に黄昏を見た。そして二人は結婚の約束をして喜び合った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61c647d-f96f-4ac7-abd4-d24a852cf08b\', \'multiverseId\': 622239}, \'multiverseid\': 622239}, {\'name\': \'Optar\', \'text\': \'Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo.)\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Eles olharam para o leste, para a Sombra, e para o oeste, para o Crepúsculo, juraram fidelidade e se alegraram.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33428e91-633f-45e0-9b20-4869ff17f6e3\', \'multiverseId\': 622426}, \'multiverseid\': 622426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Palast-Kerkermeister\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Palast-Kerkermeister ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nWenn der Palast-Kerkermeister ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis ein Gegner zum Monarchen wird.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ist es in der Stadt nicht Gesetz, dass jene, die Schwarz-Silber tragen, in der Zitadelle bleiben müssen?"\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621471&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d63d5d-5aa2-4c98-9658-aeb7e4c405c6\', \'multiverseId\': 621471}, \'multiverseid\': 621471}, {\'name\': \'Carcelero de palacio\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Carcelero de palacio entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nCuando el Carcelero de palacio entre al campo de batalla, exilia la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente hasta que un oponente se convierta en el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Acaso no dicta una ley de la ciudad que los que llevan negro y plata deben permanecer en la Ciudadela?".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8acaade9-4372-43be-864b-f1514c1db666\', \'multiverseId\': 621658}, \'multiverseid\': 621658}, {\'name\': \'Gardien de prison du palais\', \'text\': "Quand le Gardien de prison du palais arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nQuand le Gardien de prison du palais arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce qu\'un adversaire devienne le monarque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Une loi de la cité ne dicte-t-elle pas que ceux qui portent le noir et l\'argent doivent demeurer dans la Citadelle ? »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5657f4bd-ff48-4e7e-8155-1abc5e12341f\', \'multiverseId\': 621845}, \'multiverseid\': 621845}, {\'name\': \'Carceriere del Palazzo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Carceriere del Palazzo entra nel campo di battaglia, diventi il monarca.\\nQuando il Carceriere del Palazzo entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario finché un avversario non diventa il monarca.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non stabilisce forse la legge della Città che coloro che vestono di nero e d\\\'argento devono restare nella Cittadella?"\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77795481-7a4f-4210-bf2d-c69ec4b866c9\', \'multiverseId\': 622032}, \'multiverseid\': 622032}, {\'name\': \'宮殿の看守\', \'text\': \'宮殿の看守が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\n宮殿の看守が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。対戦相手１人が統治者になるまでそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「黒と銀の制服を着る者は、主君の許しがない限り、城塞に留まらねばならぬ掟ではなかったか？」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2902e1dc-d2af-4231-a63e-1f8cd6d058c2\', \'multiverseId\': 622219}, \'multiverseid\': 622219}, {\'name\': \'Carcereiro do Palácio\', \'text\': \'Quando Carcereiro do Palácio entra no campo de batalha, você se torna o monarca.\\nQuando Carcereiro do Palácio entrar no campo de batalha, exile a criatura alvo que um oponente controla até que um oponente se torne o monarca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é a lei da idade que quem veste preto e prata precisa permanecer na Cidadela?"\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08799f05-d18c-481b-b350-48897a1698e8\', \'multiverseId\': 622406}, \'multiverseid\': 622406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paradiesdruidin\', \'text\': \'Die Paradiesdruidin hat Fluchsicherheit, solange sie ungetappt ist. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Nirgendwo gibt Bäume wie in diesem Land. Denn im Herbst fallen ihre Blätter nicht, sondern sie werden zu Gold."\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621552&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'273617e0-ad79-484b-974b-cbcc9f7d6adc\', \'multiverseId\': 621552}, \'multiverseid\': 621552}, {\'name\': \'Druida del paraíso\', \'text\': \'La Druida del paraíso tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio mientras esté enderezada. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay árboles como los de esa tierra, pues en el otoño las hojas no caen: solo amarillean".\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8102c36-ec83-490d-9643-734b827bae23\', \'multiverseId\': 621739}, \'multiverseid\': 621739}, {\'name\': \'Druidesse de paradis\', \'text\': "La Druidesse de paradis a la défense talismanique tant qu\'elle est dégagée. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« On ne trouve les arbres de ces terres nulle part ailleurs. Car en automne, leurs feuilles ne tombent pas, mais deviennent d\'or. »\\n—Legolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621926&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc27153-7c7c-4574-9e3b-d644f7e8c457\', \'multiverseId\': 621926}, \'multiverseid\': 621926}, {\'name\': \'Druida del Paradiso\', \'text\': \'La Druida del Paradiso ha anti-malocchio fintanto che è STAPpata. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non vi sono alberi uguali agli alberi di quella terra. In autunno le loro foglie non cadono, ma diventano d\\\'oro."\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a51305-999b-4ef8-adca-3ad110a53dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 622113}, \'multiverseid\': 622113}, {\'name\': \'楽園のドルイド\', \'text\': \'楽園のドルイドがアンタップ状態であるかぎり、これは呪禁を持つ。（これは対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「かの地の木々のような木はどこにもありません。秋になっても葉は落ちず、金色に変わるのです。」\\n――レゴラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1d38e6b-128e-44bc-92d5-b1222876e05b\', \'multiverseId\': 622300}, \'multiverseid\': 622300}, {\'name\': \'Druida do Paraíso\', \'text\': \'Druida do Paraíso terá resistência a magia enquanto estiver desvirado. (Ele não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há árvores como as árvores dessa terra. Pois no outono suas folhas não caem, mas tornam-se douradas."\\n— Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6571a3-2f7d-4545-97f8-180691ccd7da\', \'multiverseId\': 622487}, \'multiverseid\': 622487}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paradiesvögel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Das Geräusch von plätscherndem Wasser stieg aus dem schäumenden Flussbett herauf. Vögel sangen, und ein wohltuender Frieden lag über dem Land.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f1d265-2914-4b3b-a934-36b4048a3f47\', \'multiverseId\': 621532}, \'multiverseid\': 621532}, {\'name\': \'Aves del paraíso\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'El sonido de las aguas que burbujeaban provenía del espumoso lecho del río. Los pájaros cantaban y una paz apacible se extendía sobre la tierra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a08c24f4-21e9-4ba8-997c-1b5f5509b039\', \'multiverseId\': 621719}, \'multiverseid\': 621719}, {\'name\': \'Oiseaux de paradis\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "Le gargouillis des eaux tourbillonnantes s\'élevait du lit de la rivière écumeuse. Les oiseaux chantaient et une paix sereine régnait sur la contrée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a1092cf-fbb8-4520-84c7-9ffca1dae842\', \'multiverseId\': 621906}, \'multiverseid\': 621906}, {\'name\': \'Uccelli del Paradiso\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Dal letto spumeggiante del fiume giungeva il gorgogliare delle acque. Gli uccelli cantavano e tutto era immerso nella calma e nella pace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00892f5e-6094-49af-b37a-5676f993e6f2\', \'multiverseId\': 622093}, \'multiverseid\': 622093}, {\'name\': \'極楽鳥\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'白く泡立って流れる川から、せせらぎの音が聞こえてくる。鳥が歌い、汚れなき平和がこの土地を覆っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1e1df7b-dd99-4bab-9647-43279a1fff56\', \'multiverseId\': 622280}, \'multiverseid\': 622280}, {\'name\': \'Aves do Paraíso\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'O som de águas borbulhantes veio do leito espumante do rio. Os pássaros cantavam e uma paz saudável reinava na terra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09293ced-8ab5-4824-a0c7-76fda74846b2\', \'multiverseId\': 622467}, \'multiverseid\': 622467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Der Pfad der Ahnen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs. Wenn dieses Mana ausgegeben wird, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken, der einen Kreaturentyp mit deinem Kommandeur gemeinsam hat, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Merry blickte mit Staunen und Mitgefühl auf die Púkelmänner, die im Sonnenuntergang traurig vor ihm aufragten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621619&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'698f739b-6970-40d4-b1a2-574656dbf6b9\', \'multiverseId\': 621619}, \'multiverseid\': 621619}, {\'name\': \'Senda de los ancestros\', \'text\': \'La Senda de los ancestros entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante. Cuando ese maná se use para lanzar un hechizo de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con tu comandante, adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Merry miró a los hombres Púkel con asombro y pena mientras estos se alzaban con melancolía en el crepúsculo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f5a47cc-7e76-4f79-b9e1-7c0ac1883417\', \'multiverseId\': 621806}, \'multiverseid\': 621806}, {\'name\': "Voie de l\'Ascendance", \'text\': "La Voie de l\'Ascendance arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant. Quand ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort de créature qui partage un type de créature avec votre commandant, regard 1.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Merry contempla les Biscornus, avec étonnement et pitié, tandis qu\'ils se dressaient tristement à la tombée du jour.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621993&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4669ca-fa20-4936-a6ce-d4a6581095ca\', \'multiverseId\': 621993}, \'multiverseid\': 621993}, {\'name\': \'Sentiero Ancestrale\', \'text\': "Il Sentiero Ancestrale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante. Quando quel mana viene speso per lanciare una magia creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con il tuo comandante, profetizza 1.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Merry osservava i Púkel con stupore e pietà, vedendoli giganteggiare tristi nel crepuscolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0966cf31-4c12-4bfb-8fb2-9e3dbdfabe9d\', \'multiverseId\': 622180}, \'multiverseid\': 622180}, {\'name\': \'祖先の道\', \'text\': \'祖先の道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナがあなたの統率者と共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるために支払われたとき、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'メリーは、夕闇の中にぼうっと浮かぶプーケル人の姿を、驚嘆の念と憐れみに近い気持ちでじっと見つめた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ae2db4-6440-4dfe-bbd1-d58a7b657bae\', \'multiverseId\': 622367}, \'multiverseid\': 622367}, {\'name\': \'Caminho da Ascendência\', \'text\': \'Caminho da Ascendência entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante. Quando aquele mana for gasto para conjurar uma mágica de criatura que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com seu comandante, use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Merry olhou os Homens Púkel maravilhado e compadecido, conforme eles assomavam tristemente no crepúsculo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9549d8b-3bb6-4264-b6e9-315d7e2bb77d\', \'multiverseId\': 622554}, \'multiverseid\': 622554}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pippin, Truchsess von Isengart\', \'text\': \'Partner von Merry, Truchsess von Isengart (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Merry aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\\n{T}, opfere vier Speisen: Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+3 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620823&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cdd3901-1792-4b2b-8b9b-e0d4fb6c5f4e\', \'multiverseId\': 620823}, \'multiverseid\': 620823}, {\'name\': \'Pippin, guardián de Isengard\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Merry, guardián de Isengard. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Merry en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\n{1}, {T}: Crea una ficha de Comida.\\n{T}, sacrificar cuatro Comidas: Las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +3/+3 y ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a0396cf-c93e-4333-aba8-f6462b66071e\', \'multiverseId\': 620895}, \'multiverseid\': 620895}, {\'name\': "Pippin, garde d\'Isengard", \'text\': "Partenariat avec Merry, garde d\'Isengard (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé peut mettre Merry dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\n{1}, {T} : Créez un jeton Nourriture.\\n{T}, sacrifiez quatre nourritures : Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 et acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620967&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a4f0dac-6c50-4e50-ad4a-f1fb90a3c1fb\', \'multiverseId\': 620967}, \'multiverseid\': 620967}, {\'name\': \'Pipino, Guardiano di Isengard\', \'text\': \'Partner di Merry, Guardiano di Isengard (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Merry alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\n{1}, {T}: Crea una pedina Cibo.\\n{T}, Sacrifica quattro Cibi: Le altre creature che controlli prendono +3/+3 e hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'558a3d13-d4f1-456b-9f30-4cb118eb3a45\', \'multiverseId\': 621039}, \'multiverseid\': 621039}, {\'name\': \'アイゼンガルドの監視人、ピピン\', \'text\': \'アイゼンガルドの監視人、メリーとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーからアイゼンガルドの監視人、メリーを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す」を選んでもよい。）\\n{1}, {T}：食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{T}, 食物４つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け速攻を得る。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a740fdad-3f59-4114-8adb-b53cad95d041\', \'multiverseId\': 621111}, \'multiverseid\': 621111}, {\'name\': \'Pippin, Protetor de Isengard\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Merry, Protetor de Isengard (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Merry na própria mão do próprio grimório e, em seguida, embaralhar.)\\n{1}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de Comida.\\n{T}, sacrifique quatro Comidas: As outras criaturas que você controla recebem +3/+3 e ganham ímpeto até o final do turno. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf11f95-70a5-4ddb-8c76-1577fe4a6b72\', \'multiverseId\': 621183}, \'multiverseid\': 621183}, {\'name\': \'艾森加德守门人皮平\', \'text\': \'与艾森加德守门人梅里拍档（当此生物进战场时，目标牌手可以将梅里从其牌库置于其手上，然后洗牌。）\\n{1}，{T}：派出一个食品衍生物。\\n{T}，牺牲四个食品：直到回合结束，由你操控的其他生物得+3/+3且获得敏捷异能。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bd220d0-e4e0-403e-986e-f89ee138006c\', \'multiverseId\': 621255}, \'multiverseid\': 621255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pippin, Truchsess von Isengart\', \'text\': \'Partner von Merry, Truchsess von Isengart\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\\n{T}, opfere vier Speisen: Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+3 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620412&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'196147ab-c8c7-460a-a30f-1451cdd130bc\', \'multiverseId\': 620412}, \'multiverseid\': 620412}, {\'name\': "Pippin, garde d\'Isengard", \'text\': "Partenariat avec Merry, garde d\'Isengard\\n{1}, {T} : Créez un jeton Nourriture.\\n{T}, sacrifiez quatre nourritures : Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 et acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620480&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d9e154b-3695-4619-941d-cba33ccffe21\', \'multiverseId\': 620480}, \'multiverseid\': 620480}, {\'name\': \'アイゼンガルドの監視人、ピピン\', \'text\': \'アイゼンガルドの監視人、メリーとの共闘\\n{1}, {T}：食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{T}, 食物４つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け速攻を得る。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffd90cac-aabd-4af3-85e4-b25cbd603db5\', \'multiverseId\': 620548}, \'multiverseid\': 620548}, {\'name\': \'艾森加德守门人皮平\', \'text\': \'与艾森加德守门人梅里拍档\\n{1}，{T}：派出一个食品衍生物。\\n{T}，牺牲四个食品：直到回合结束，由你操控的其他生物得+3/+3且获得敏捷异能。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb54ffd-0bf2-43eb-b091-a89d8f459fba\', \'multiverseId\': 620616}, \'multiverseid\': 620616}]', '[{\'name\': \'Preisgekröntes Schwein\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege entsprechend viele Schleifenmarken auf das Preisgekrönte Schwein. Falls dann drei oder mehr Schleifenmarken auf ihm liegen, entferne die Marken und enttappe es.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wildschwein\', \'flavor\': \'Die Sitte, Bauernstuben und Scheunen zu bauen, nahm bei den Bewohnern des Bruchs unten am Brandywein ihren Anfang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620392&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98ae1ce1-88fd-4436-8dda-1f4faeeccea9\', \'multiverseId\': 620392}, \'multiverseid\': 620392}, {\'name\': \'Cochon de compétition\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez autant de marqueurs « ruban » sur le Cochon de compétition. Ensuite, s\'il y a au moins trois marqueurs « ruban » sur le Cochon de compétition, retirez ces marqueurs et dégagez-le.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : sanglier\', \'flavor\': \'La coutume de construire des fermes et des granges commença parmi les habitants du Maresque au bord du Brandevin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d4fe20-03a9-45e6-a984-2253204061a3\', \'multiverseId\': 620460}, \'multiverseid\': 620460}, {\'name\': \'賞品の豚\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、その点数に等しい個数のリボン・カウンターを賞品の豚の上に置く。その後、これの上に３個以上のリボン・カウンターがあるなら、それらのカウンターを取り除き、これをアンタップさせる。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猪\', \'flavor\': \'農家や納屋を地上に建てる習慣はブランディワイン川沿いの沢地に住む住民から始まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'111f0be9-400b-496f-a247-18f45a6ce356\', \'multiverseId\': 620528}, \'multiverseid\': 620528}, {\'name\': \'夺奖猪\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，在夺奖猪上放置等量的绶带指示物。然后若夺奖猪上有三个或更多绶带指示物，则移去这些指示物并将它重置。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野猪\', \'flavor\': \'建造农舍和谷仓的习惯，是从白兰地河边上的泽地居民传开的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b933ca36-9e7c-4d92-b6d8-e2fc200d143b\', \'multiverseId\': 620596}, \'multiverseid\': 620596}]', '[{\'name\': \'Preisgekröntes Schwein\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege entsprechend viele Schleifenmarken auf das Preisgekrönte Schwein. Falls dann drei oder mehr Schleifenmarken auf ihm liegen, entferne die Marken und enttappe es.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wildschwein\', \'flavor\': \'Die Sitte, Bauernstuben und Scheunen zu bauen, nahm bei den Bewohnern des Bruchs unten am Brandywein ihren Anfang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620801&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e2df1b-dfe2-440d-bc68-f48f47553aa3\', \'multiverseId\': 620801}, \'multiverseid\': 620801}, {\'name\': \'Cerdo de campeonato\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores de galardón sobre el Cerdo de campeonato. Luego, si hay tres o más contadores de galardón sobre el Cerdo de campeonato, remueve esos contadores y enderézalo.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Jabalí\', \'flavor\': \'La costumbre de construir casas de campo y graneros empezó entre los habitantes de la Marjala, cerca de la orilla del Brandivino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e037f8-11fb-4867-84ee-b4fb0af82824\', \'multiverseId\': 620873}, \'multiverseid\': 620873}, {\'name\': \'Cochon de compétition\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez autant de marqueurs « ruban » sur le Cochon de compétition. Ensuite, s\'il y a au moins trois marqueurs « ruban » sur le Cochon de compétition, retirez ces marqueurs et dégagez-le.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : sanglier\', \'flavor\': \'La coutume de construire des fermes et des granges commença parmi les habitants du Maresque au bord du Brandevin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620945&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4517daa-06ea-4ac4-a465-ee8fed17d482\', \'multiverseId\': 620945}, \'multiverseid\': 620945}, {\'name\': \'Maiale da Concorso\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti sul Maiale da Concorso altrettanti segnalini nastro. Poi, se ci sono tre o più segnalini nastro sul Maiale da Concorso, rimuovi quei segnalini e STAPpalo.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cinghiale\', \'flavor\': \'I primi a creare fattorie e granai furono gli abitanti delle Paludi lungo il Brandivino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff7d108-ccd9-40d9-952c-904ba8152790\', \'multiverseId\': 621017}, \'multiverseid\': 621017}, {\'name\': \'賞品の豚\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、その点数に等しい個数のリボン・カウンターを賞品の豚の上に置く。その後、これの上に３個以上のリボン・カウンターがあるなら、それらのカウンターを取り除き、これをアンタップさせる。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猪\', \'flavor\': \'農家や納屋を地上に建てる習慣はブランディワイン川沿いの沢地に住む住民から始まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0f96ee2-671c-40a0-a03d-05729594fbf6\', \'multiverseId\': 621089}, \'multiverseid\': 621089}, {\'name\': \'Porco de Competição\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganhar pontos de vida, coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores de fita em Porco de Competição. Depois, se houver três ou mais marcadores de fita em Porco de Competição, remova aqueles marcadores e desvire-o.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Javali\', \'flavor\': \'O hábito de construir quintas com celeiros começou entre os habitantes do Pântano às margens do Brandevin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'081dc01b-7c4e-489c-9da6-be466118d344\', \'multiverseId\': 621161}, \'multiverseid\': 621161}, {\'name\': \'夺奖猪\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，在夺奖猪上放置等量的绶带指示物。然后若夺奖猪上有三个或更多绶带指示物，则移去这些指示物并将它重置。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野猪\', \'flavor\': \'建造农舍和谷仓的习惯，是从白兰地河边上的泽地居民传开的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d49ac433-7f70-4116-9753-6f4f88ef0d20\', \'multiverseId\': 621233}, \'multiverseid\': 621233}]', '[{\'name\': \'Präriefluss\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nDer Präriefluss kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Ebene, Insel\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn sah den Fluss wie ein Band, das nach Pelargir führte, und jenseits davon leuchtete am Himmel ein Licht, das vom Meer kündete. Und Gandalf sage: „Dies ist dein Reich und das Herz des größeren Reiches, das entstehen wird."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee866f29-b9d5-4c2e-af9a-1665afb33cb1\', \'multiverseId\': 621621}, \'multiverseid\': 621621}, {\'name\': \'Manantial de la pradera\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.)\\nEl Manantial de la pradera entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Llanura isla\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn vio el río, que se extendía como una cinta hasta Pelargir, y más allá una luz en el cielo que hablaba del mar. En ese momento, dijo Gandalf: "Este es tu reino, y el corazón de un reino que será todavía más grande".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c865dd8-a390-4ee8-81f2-0bf1944ccb53\', \'multiverseId\': 621808}, \'multiverseid\': 621808}, {\'name\': \'Prairie ruisselante\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nLa Prairie ruisselante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : plaine et île\', \'flavor\': "Aragorn vit le fleuve déroulé tel un ruban jusqu\'à Pelargir, et au-delà, une lumière à l\'orée du ciel évoquait la mer. Et Gandalf dit : « Voici votre royaume, et le cœur du plus grand royaume qui existera. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621995&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24525fdd-91d2-4d36-82bb-d2f302dc5b23\', \'multiverseId\': 621995}, \'multiverseid\': 621995}, {\'name\': \'Ruscello nella Prateria\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.)\\nIl Ruscello nella Prateria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Pianura Isola\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn vide il Fiume, come un nastro disteso fino a Pelargir, al di là del quale una luce in cielo rivelava la presenza del Mare. E Gandalf disse: "Questo è il tuo regno, cuore del più grande regno a venire."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385cdc01-b079-4ed1-a047-338bfdf6eb7b\', \'multiverseId\': 622182}, \'multiverseid\': 622182}, {\'name\': \'大草原の川\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、大草原の川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 平地・島\', \'flavor\': \'アラゴルンは、大河がリボンの如くくねりながらペラルギアに達し、その先の空のへりに海を物語る輝きがあるのを見た。ガンダルフが言った「これがお前さんの王国であり、未来のさらに大なる版図の中心になるのじゃ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c9521b4-9859-49c3-b196-6166faaf294f\', \'multiverseId\': 622369}, \'multiverseid\': 622369}, {\'name\': \'Riacho da Pradaria\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.)\\nRiacho da Pradaria entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Planície Ilha\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn viu o Rio como uma fita estendida até Pelargir, e além havia no céu uma luz que falava do Mar. E Gandalf disse: "Este é o seu reino, e o coração do reino maior que virá."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d44d4236-78b7-43d9-9aef-d61affa54dd8\', \'multiverseId\': 622556}, \'multiverseid\': 622556}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rache der Raben\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, verliert ihr Beherrscher 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Schwärme von schwarzen Krähen kreuzen den Himmel. Ich weiß nicht, was sie im Schilde führen, aber ich glaube, sie spionieren das Land aus."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621504&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be851250-1a05-4816-9feb-aaed930dae65\', \'multiverseId\': 621504}, \'multiverseid\': 621504}, {\'name\': \'Represalia de los cuervos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura te ataque a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas, el controlador de esa criatura pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Están volando regimientos de cuervos negros por doquier. Desconozco qué les ocurre, pero temo que estén espiando la región".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7cb6e96-437a-4782-84e7-36a4d0619afc\', \'multiverseId\': 621691}, \'multiverseid\': 621691}, {\'name\': \'Vengeance des corbeaux\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature vous attaque ou attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, le contrôleur de cette créature perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Des régiments de corbeaux noirs volent de partout. Je ne sais pas de quoi il retourne, mais je pense qu\'ils espionnent ces terres. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc74d99e-8fff-4269-84ef-5398c2eee223\', \'multiverseId\': 621878}, \'multiverseid\': 621878}, {\'name\': \'Vendetta dei Corvi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura attacca te o un planeswalker che controlli, il controllore di quella creatura perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Reggimenti di corvi neri stanno sorvolando tutto il territorio. Non so cosa stiano facendo, ma credo stiano spiando la regione."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c44aa74-abb0-449d-8346-df275cc96b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 622065}, \'multiverseid\': 622065}, {\'name\': \'カラスの仕返し\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体が、あなたかあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「黒鴉の大部隊が、上空を飛んでおる。あれが何をしようとしているのか、わしにはわからぬ。だが、どうも地上を偵察していたように思える。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fefc245-d33c-4d57-bd96-2b6784c7599e\', \'multiverseId\': 622252}, \'multiverseid\': 622252}, {\'name\': \'Vingança dos Corvos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura atacar você ou um planeswalker que você controla, o controlador daquela criatura perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Há bandos de corvos negros voando por todo lado. Não sei o que eles querem, mas acho que estão espionando essas terras."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a63b395-aee5-4720-b28e-ecc63af96f87\', \'multiverseId\': 622439}, \'multiverseid\': 622439}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rankenschimmer-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Rankenschimmer-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Wald- oder Insel-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Rankenschimmer-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Lórien wirkte wie ein leuchtendes Schiff mit verzauberten Bäumen als Masten, das vom Rand der grauen und blattlosen Welt wegsegelte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621640&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7796cb7e-e34b-435c-9af0-7a34e0a28150\', \'multiverseId\': 621640}, \'multiverseid\': 621640}, {\'name\': \'Maraña destelloenredada\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña destelloenredada entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Bosque o de Isla de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña destelloenredada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Lórien parecía un brillante barco con árboles encantados a modo de mástiles, alejándose de las orillas del mundo deshojado y gris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29c846d6-ef24-416f-bfc5-2e0cc3ec839e\', \'multiverseId\': 621827}, \'multiverseid\': 621827}, {\'name\': \'Lacis pâlevigne\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Lacis pâlevigne arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de forêt ou d\'île de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis pâlevigne arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La Lórien ressemblait à un navire lumineux, dont les mâts seraient des arbres enchantés, s\'éloignant de la lisière du monde gris et sans feuille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622014&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1efd8bca-7416-44de-b1d8-3af86f187120\', \'multiverseId\': 622014}, \'multiverseid\': 622014}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Splendarboreo\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Splendarboreo entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Foresta o Isola dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Splendarboreo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Lórien era simile a una luminosa nave dagli alberi incantati, che si allontanava dalle rive di un mondo grigio e spoglio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d31d7f2-4b27-43fa-a15c-41f5098873b4\', \'multiverseId\': 622201}, \'multiverseid\': 622201}, {\'name\': \'蔦明の交錯\', \'text\': \'蔦明の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり森や島であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、蔦明の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ロリアンの地は、まるで魔法にかけられた木々をマストに立てて光をあびた大船が、葉の落ちた灰色の世界の水ぎわから滑り去って行くようだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3bfc6b9-ebc8-4eaa-9f1e-2dedd9eb4894\', \'multiverseId\': 622388}, \'multiverseid\': 622388}, {\'name\': \'Liame da Luminovinha\', \'text\': \'Conforme Liame da Luminovinha entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Floresta ou Ilha de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Liame da Luminovinha entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Lórien parecia um navio brilhante com árvores encantadas por mastros, afastando se da margem do mundo cinzento e sem folhas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7020bb4f-3250-4bd2-8ffd-74f45b09947d\', \'multiverseId\': 622575}, \'multiverseid\': 622575}]', '[{\'name\': \'Reanimation\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Manabetrags.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Aber die Ringgeister selbst sind nicht so einfach zu zerstören."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621503&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14a0eaad-4a40-4841-a1e4-478a9d80de6a\', \'multiverseId\': 621503}, \'multiverseid\': 621503}, {\'name\': \'Reanimar\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los Espectros del Anillo no pueden destruirse fácilmente".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3815f222-31c8-4543-bcea-e3e7a779c13e\', \'multiverseId\': 621690}, \'multiverseid\': 621690}, {\'name\': \'Réanimation\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Mais les Esprits servants de l\'Anneau eux-mêmes ne peuvent être détruits si facilement. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a2cdd2-5eb0-498a-9829-8d81e4c07468\', \'multiverseId\': 621877}, \'multiverseid\': 621877}, {\'name\': \'Rianimare\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero. Perdi punti vita pari al suo valore di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ma distruggere gli Spettri dell\\\'Anello non è una cosa tanto facile."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccba0b70-1afd-44f5-bf90-f51534bee91b\', \'multiverseId\': 622064}, \'multiverseid\': 622064}, {\'name\': \'再活性\', \'text\': \'墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。あなたはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「しかし幽鬼どもそのものは、そう簡単に滅びはせぬ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16745f03-7fb1-478e-b970-17d4dd24816f\', \'multiverseId\': 622251}, \'multiverseid\': 622251}, {\'name\': \'Reanimar\', \'text\': \'Coloque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Você perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana dele.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Mas os próprios Espectros do Anel não podem ser destruídos assim tão facilmente."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19366905-ab78-4669-b2e9-f292f3c8f230\', \'multiverseId\': 622438}, \'multiverseid\': 622438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Reiter von Rohan\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Reiter von Rohan ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge zwei 2/2 rote Mensch-Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile, die Trampelschaden verursachen.\\nSturmangriff {4}{R}{W} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Sturmangriff-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, erhält die Kreatur Eile und kehrt zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments aus dem Spiel auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b805010-bb89-4842-ae36-ba31cea92fff\', \'multiverseId\': 620825}, \'multiverseid\': 620825}, {\'name\': \'Jinetes de Rohan\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Jinetes de Rohan entren al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Caballero Humano rojas 2/2 con las habilidades de arrollar y prisa.\\nRapidez {4}{R}{W}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de rapidez. Si lo haces, gana la habilidad de prisa y regresa del campo de batalla a la mano de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b239a97b-cf74-41a2-b4b0-d95cb5e147a3\', \'multiverseId\': 620897}, \'multiverseid\': 620897}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliers du Rohan\', \'text\': \'Quand les Cavaliers du Rohan arrivent sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Humain et Chevalier avec le piétinement et la célérité.\\nPrécipitation {4}{R}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de précipitation. Si vous faites ainsi, il acquiert la célérité et revient dans la main de son propriétaire depuis le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620969&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a959d23-9540-48d0-9b4c-72512b09e954\', \'multiverseId\': 620969}, \'multiverseid\': 620969}, {\'name\': \'Cavalieri di Rohan\', \'text\': "Quando i Cavalieri di Rohan entrano nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Cavaliere Umano 2/2 rosse con travolgere e rapidità.\\nAccelerare {4}{R}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di accelerare. Se lo fai, ha rapidità e torna in mano al suo proprietario dal campo di battaglia all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70db97f7-64c4-41c6-b8be-8a22d459be91\', \'multiverseId\': 621041}, \'multiverseid\': 621041}, {\'name\': \'ローハンの乗り手\', \'text\': \'ローハンの乗り手が戦場に出たとき、トランプルと速攻を持つ赤の２/２の人間・騎士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\n疾駆{4}{R}{W}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの疾駆コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これは速攻を得て、次の終了ステップの開始時に、戦場にあるこれをオーナーの手札に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e97558-6042-4d15-8bba-9045f2685b72\', \'multiverseId\': 621113}, \'multiverseid\': 621113}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiros de Rohan\', \'text\': \'Quando Cavaleiros de Rohan entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura Humano Cavaleiro vermelha 2/2 com atropelar e ímpeto.\\nInvestida {4}{R}{W} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de investida. Se fizer isso, ela ganha ímpeto e é devolvida do campo de batalha para a mão de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2604f29-932f-433c-a1f8-b9b90f5f6ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 621185}, \'multiverseid\': 621185}, {\'name\': \'洛汗骠骑\', \'text\': \'当洛汗骠骑进战场时，派出两个2/2红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的人类／骑士衍生生物。\\n掩袭{4}{R}{W}（你可以支付此咒语的掩袭费用来施放它。如果你如此作，则它获得敏捷异能，且在下个结束步骤开始时便需从战场移回其拥有者手上。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f4688c-e1d5-4a3f-8a44-1c256d6e8346\', \'multiverseId\': 621257}, \'multiverseid\': 621257}]', "[{'name': 'Reiter von Rohan', 'text': 'Wenn die Reiter von Rohan ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge zwei 2/2 rote Mensch-Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile, die Trampelschaden verursachen.\\nSturmangriff {4}{R}{W}', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620414&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '391933cd-38c6-4b7c-9092-971733b01845', 'multiverseId': 620414}, 'multiverseid': 620414}, {'name': 'Cavaliers du Rohan', 'text': 'Quand les Cavaliers du Rohan arrivent sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Humain et Chevalier avec le piétinement et la célérité.\\nPrécipitation {4}{R}{W}', 'type': 'Créature : humain et chevalier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620482&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e84a5c41-2d92-4930-b018-6d497fc12eba', 'multiverseId': 620482}, 'multiverseid': 620482}, {'name': 'ローハンの乗り手', 'text': 'ローハンの乗り手が戦場に出たとき、トランプルと速攻を持つ赤の２/２の人間・騎士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\n疾駆{4}{R}{W}', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620550&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd3146ad-cd07-4764-b366-88d3ec714822', 'multiverseId': 620550}, 'multiverseid': 620550}, {'name': '洛汗骠骑', 'text': '当洛汗骠骑进战场时，派出两个2/2红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的人类／骑士衍生生物。\\n掩袭{4}{R}{W}', 'type': '生物 ～人类／骑士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620618&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e99e485c-5ce8-45ec-b48e-500d8e4121cf', 'multiverseId': 620618}, 'multiverseid': 620618}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rieseneichen-Wächter\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nReichweite\\nWenn der Rieseneichen-Wächter ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert, +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Enttappe sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'Ents, die Erdgeborenen, alt wie die Berge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c144771-66e0-4401-b055-e55379bd3a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 621544}, \'multiverseid\': 621544}, {\'name\': \'Roble guardián supremo\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nAlcance.\\nCuando el Roble guardián supremo entre al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controla el jugador objetivo obtienen +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Enderézalas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'Ent nacido de la tierra, viejo como las montañas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a129d369-611a-4201-827f-ad2ebafc8f85\', \'multiverseId\': 621731}, \'multiverseid\': 621731}, {\'name\': \'Vigile grand chêne\', \'text\': "Flash\\nPortée\\nQuand le Vigile grand chêne arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures qu\'un joueur ciblé contrôle gagnent +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez-les.", \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin\', \'flavor\': \'Les Ents, nés de la terre, vieux comme les montagnes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621918&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d56f637d-1322-4c3a-8139-495b3093bb8a\', \'multiverseId\': 621918}, \'multiverseid\': 621918}, {\'name\': \'Grande Quercia Guardiana\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nRaggiungere\\nQuando la Grande Quercia Guardiana entra nel campo di battaglia, le creature controllate da un giocatore bersaglio prendono +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. STAPpale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'Ent dalla terra nati e vecchi come monti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'144bf5b5-5dca-4f45-9449-e8b7961f4a15\', \'multiverseId\': 622105}, \'multiverseid\': 622105}, {\'name\': \'大樫の守護者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n到達\\n大樫の守護者が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。それらをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': \'エントは大地の子、山々と同じ生まれ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ad38e68-7716-48ab-9771-67b4a2c5a4e6\', \'multiverseId\': 622292}, \'multiverseid\': 622292}, {\'name\': \'Grande Carvalho Guardião\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nAlcance\\nQuando Grande Carvalho Guardião entra no campo de batalha, as criaturas que o jogador alvo controla recebem +2/+2 até o final do turno. Desvire-as.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ent\', \'flavor\': \'Ents, os nascidos da terra, velhos como as montanhas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bae2c8b-b226-41bb-8162-58fee2fee7ab\', \'multiverseId\': 622479}, \'multiverseid\': 622479}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruf nach Beistand\', \'text\': \'Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über alle Kreaturen, die ein Gegner deiner Wahl kontrolliert. Enttappe sie. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du kannst jenen Spieler in diesem Zug nicht angreifen. Du kannst jene Kreaturen in diesem Zug nicht opfern.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Eile ist das Gebot der Stunde. Die Leuchtfeuer Gondors lodern. Der Krieg ist entfacht."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620379&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36c57745-60d0-40a4-ac9f-f04cf1fd825d\', \'multiverseId\': 620379}, \'multiverseid\': 620379}, {\'name\': "Appel à l\'aide", \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle de toutes les créatures qu\'un adversaire ciblé contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous ne pouvez pas attaquer ce joueur ce tour-ci. Vous ne pouvez pas sacrifier ces créatures ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous devons nous hâter. Les feux du Gondor sont allumés. La guerre a éclaté. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4721f2f8-e322-4161-a989-2b5d92361607\', \'multiverseId\': 620447}, \'multiverseid\': 620447}, {\'name\': \'救援を求めて\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。このターン、あなたはそのプレイヤーを攻撃できない。このターン、あなたはそれらのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げられない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「急ぐのじゃ。ゴンドールの烽火は灯された。戦いの火が燃やされたのじゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf9ebdb2-14a2-471b-9200-fc62226a5f2f\', \'multiverseId\': 620515}, \'multiverseid\': 620515}, {\'name\': \'呼唤求援\', \'text\': \'获得由目标对手操控的所有生物之操控权直到回合结束。重置这些生物。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。本回合中，你不能攻击该牌手。本回合中，你不能牺牲这些生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们要赶快。刚铎烽火刚点燃。战争已经爆发。」\\n～甘道夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'356d1a7d-7d35-4525-8a69-e3e79733ed95\', \'multiverseId\': 620583}, \'multiverseid\': 620583}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruf nach Beistand\', \'text\': \'Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über alle Kreaturen, die ein Gegner deiner Wahl kontrolliert. Enttappe sie. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du kannst jenen Spieler in diesem Zug nicht angreifen. Du kannst jene Kreaturen in diesem Zug nicht opfern.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Eile ist das Gebot der Stunde. Die Leuchtfeuer Gondors lodern. Der Krieg ist entfacht."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620788&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8af031c-15f2-4c6a-9cd3-bc723b0d9082\', \'multiverseId\': 620788}, \'multiverseid\': 620788}, {\'name\': \'Petición de ayuda\', \'text\': \'Gana el control de todas las criaturas que controla el oponente objetivo hasta el final del turno. Endereza esas criaturas. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. No puedes atacar a ese jugador este turno. No puedes sacrificar esas criaturas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Debemos darnos prisa. Las almenaras de Gondor están encendidas. La guerra comenzó".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'984775d2-271b-489c-bbeb-a172dac4a250\', \'multiverseId\': 620860}, \'multiverseid\': 620860}, {\'name\': "Appel à l\'aide", \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle de toutes les créatures qu\'un adversaire ciblé contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous ne pouvez pas attaquer ce joueur ce tour-ci. Vous ne pouvez pas sacrifier ces créatures ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous devons nous hâter. Les feux du Gondor sont allumés. La guerre a éclaté. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620932&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f889a04-b611-417e-a326-0056f692e99e\', \'multiverseId\': 620932}, \'multiverseid\': 620932}, {\'name\': \'Richiesta di Aiuto\', \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di tutte le creature controllate da un avversario bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quelle creature. Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Non puoi attaccare quel giocatore in questo turno. Non puoi sacrificare quelle creature in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Dobbiamo affrettarci. Gondor ha acceso i suoi fuochi. La guerra è scoppiata."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db1ca68-8a63-4fca-a4e8-4c29a299cc27\', \'multiverseId\': 621004}, \'multiverseid\': 621004}, {\'name\': \'救援を求めて\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。このターン、あなたはそのプレイヤーを攻撃できない。このターン、あなたはそれらのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げられない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「急ぐのじゃ。ゴンドールの烽火は灯された。戦いの火が燃やされたのじゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a7dfc38-9369-4181-a98f-69a0a2237a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 621076}, \'multiverseid\': 621076}, {\'name\': \'Pedido de Ajuda\', \'text\': \'Ganhe até o final do turno o controle de todas as criaturas que o oponente alvo controla. Desvire aquelas criaturas. Elas ganham ímpeto até o final do turno. Você não pode atacar aquele jogador neste turno. Você não pode sacrificar aquelas criaturas neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Precisamos nos apressar. Os faróis de Gondor estão acesos. A guerra se inflama."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d70baf17-a094-4ee2-a3bf-d1c26c8ad8a8\', \'multiverseId\': 621148}, \'multiverseid\': 621148}, {\'name\': \'召唤援兵\', \'text\': \'获得由目标对手操控的所有生物之操控权直到回合结束。重置这些生物。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。本回合中，你不能攻击该牌手。本回合中，你不能牺牲这些生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们要赶快。刚铎烽火刚点燃。战争已经爆发。」\\n～甘道夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6c5167b-b2a1-421d-8d44-f16092fb840e\', \'multiverseId\': 621220}, \'multiverseid\': 621220}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sam, treuer Leibdiener\', \'text\': \'Partner von Frodo, abenteuerlustiger Hobbit (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Frodo aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\\nAktivierte Fähigkeiten von Speisen, die du kontrollierst, kosten beim Aktivieren {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620669&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fb44682-c827-4343-a2b0-ef58b6a7ebc5\', \'multiverseId\': 620669}, \'multiverseid\': 620669}, {\'name\': \'Sam, ayudante leal\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Frodo, hobbit aventurero. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Frodo en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\\nTe cuesta {1} menos activar las habilidades activadas de las Comidas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Plebeyo mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75bdbf68-479d-4da8-ae0b-f0b675cc2203\', \'multiverseId\': 620673}, \'multiverseid\': 620673}, {\'name\': \'Sam, serviteur loyal\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Frodo, hobbit audacieux (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé peut mettre Frodo dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\\nLes capacités activées des nourritures que vous contrôlez coûtent {1} de moins à activer.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et paysan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620677&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'914b82ef-ef77-4dd2-a75d-04c04714391a\', \'multiverseId\': 620677}, \'multiverseid\': 620677}, {\'name\': \'Sam, Aiutante Leale\', \'text\': \'Partner di Frodo, Hobbit Avventuroso (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Frodo alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nAll\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\\nLe abilità attivate dei Cibi che controlli costano {1} in meno per essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Popolano Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8c65b2-e35b-4c4f-8637-1d1f8ba27f5d\', \'multiverseId\': 620681}, \'multiverseid\': 620681}, {\'name\': \'忠実なる従者、サム\', \'text\': \'冒険好きなホビット、フロドとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「冒険好きなホビット、フロド」を自分のライブラリーから自分の手札に加えて切り直してもよい。）\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、食物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2},{T},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたがコントロールしている食物の起動型能力を起動するためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・農民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e9ce9f-33d2-47e6-b86b-7b352aa4ace1\', \'multiverseId\': 620685}, \'multiverseid\': 620685}, {\'name\': \'Sam, Ajudante Leal\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Frodo, Hobbit Aventureiro (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Frodo do próprio grimório na própria mão e, em seguida, embaralha.)\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida".)\\nAs habilidades ativadas de Comidas que você controla custam {1} a menos para serem ativadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Plebeu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'557c1d1d-90ff-4399-bc56-a8c86c466699\', \'multiverseId\': 620689}, \'multiverseid\': 620689}, {\'name\': \'忠诚随员山姆\', \'text\': \'与雄心霍比特人弗罗多拍档（当此生物进战场时，目标牌手可以将弗罗多从其牌库置于其手上，然后洗牌。）\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个食品衍生物。（它是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\\n由你操控的食品之起动式异能减少{1}来起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／平民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'365f721d-2a7f-43bd-8beb-3140c118430d\', \'multiverseId\': 620693}, \'multiverseid\': 620693}]', "[{'name': 'Sam, treuer Leibdiener', 'text': 'Partner von Frodo, abenteuerlustiger Hobbit\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen Speise-Spielstein.\\nAktivierte Fähigkeiten von Speisen, die du kontrollierst, kosten beim Aktivieren {1} weniger.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Gesinde', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620264&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdd058f0-0728-4a05-8b8f-bf4fe7f54091', 'multiverseId': 620264}, 'multiverseid': 620264}, {'name': 'Sam, serviteur loyal', 'text': 'Partenariat avec Frodo, hobbit audacieux\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton Nourriture.\\nLes capacités activées des nourritures que vous contrôlez coûtent {1} de moins à activer.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : halfelin et paysan', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620272&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3fa1030-2316-4f3e-b2b0-637399668653', 'multiverseId': 620272}, 'multiverseid': 620272}, {'name': '忠実なる従者、サム', 'text': '冒険好きなホビット、フロドとの共闘\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、食物・トークン１つを生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしている食物の起動型能力を起動するためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・農民', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620280&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8ed8236-9f78-423f-a41e-806e6ed84486', 'multiverseId': 620280}, 'multiverseid': 620280}, {'name': '忠诚随员山姆', 'text': '与雄心霍比特人弗罗多拍档\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个食品衍生物。\\n由你操控的食品之起动式异能减少{1}来起动。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～半身人／平民', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620288&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d079027-add1-4cae-8959-536c01d1c8bc', 'multiverseId': 620288}, 'multiverseid': 620288}]", '[{\'name\': \'Samen der Erneuerung\', \'text\': \'Unverzagt (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Gegner {1} weniger.)\\nBringe bis zu zwei Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Schicke die Samen der Erneuerung ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sam pflanzte die kleine silberne Nuss auf der Wiese, wo einst der Festbaum gestanden hatte, und fragte sich, was daraus werden würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621557&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f31bca24-365e-47fd-b312-9b21a379e9f0\', \'multiverseId\': 621557}, \'multiverseid\': 621557}, {\'name\': \'Semillas de renovación\', \'text\': \'Audacia. (Cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada oponente.)\\nRegresa hasta dos cartas objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Exilia las Semillas de renovación.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Sam plantó la pequeña nuez plateada en el Campo de la Fiesta, donde antes se erguía el árbol, y se preguntó qué crecería.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd99fdd-12f8-4fcd-b382-7b6cb09d47df\', \'multiverseId\': 621744}, \'multiverseid\': 621744}, {\'name\': \'Graines du renouveau\', \'text\': "Témérité (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque adversaire.)\\nRenvoyez jusqu\'à deux cartes ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Exilez les Graines du renouveau.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Sam planta la petite graine argentée dans le Champ de la Fête, où l\'arbre se trouvait autrefois, et il se demanda ce qui pousserait.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621931&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d4d5af-8c7d-4d57-b2cb-7ee1452a2664\', \'multiverseId\': 621931}, \'multiverseid\': 621931}, {\'name\': \'Semi del Rinnovamento\', \'text\': \'Impavido (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni avversario.)\\nRiprendi in mano fino a due carte bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Esilia i Semi del Rinnovamento.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Sam piantò la piccola noce d\'argento nel Campo della Festa al posto dell\'albero e si domandò che cosa ne sarebbe venuto fuori.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f3c8b64-f0a8-40d2-9deb-59ea15cb5ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 622118}, \'multiverseid\': 622118}, {\'name\': \'蘇生の二粒\', \'text\': \'不抜（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは対戦相手１人につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nあなたの墓地にあるカード最大２枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。蘇生の二粒を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'サムは小さな銀色の木の実を、あの木があった誕生祝いの原に植え、いったい何が生えてくるのだろうと思った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f8fcaa8-4219-448c-9468-660a9626abc1\', \'multiverseId\': 622305}, \'multiverseid\': 622305}, {\'name\': \'Sementes da Renovação\', \'text\': \'Inabalável (Esta mágica custa {1} a menos por cada oponente para ser conjurada.)\\nDevolva até dois cards alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Exile Sementes da Renovação.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Sam plantou a pequena noz prateada no Campo da Festa, onde a árvore outrora estivera, e se perguntou o que brotaria dela.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f86fa9b-413c-47dd-97b9-958b08200fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 622492}, \'multiverseid\': 622492}]', "[{'name': 'Sandsteppenzitadelle', 'text': 'Die Sandsteppenzitadelle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}, {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Die Häuser und Höhlen der Hobbits im Auenland waren oft groß und wurden von großen Familien bewohnt. Manchmal lebten mehrere Generationen von Verwandten vergleichsweise friedlich in einem aus vielen Tunneln bestehenden Erb-Anwesen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621624&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4d7de74-1233-45b9-b3fd-d4061b3beb5c', 'multiverseId': 621624}, 'multiverseid': 621624}, {'name': 'Ciudadela esteparenosa', 'text': 'La Ciudadela esteparenosa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}, {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Las casas y las guaridas de los hobbits de la Comarca eran a menudo espaciosas y vivían en ellas grandes familias. En ocasiones, varias generaciones de familiares vivían en relativa paz en una mansión ancestral repleta de túneles.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621811&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12367831-dc21-41cb-b2c9-b52f15b56028', 'multiverseId': 621811}, 'multiverseid': 621811}, {'name': 'Citadelle de la steppe de sable', 'text': 'La Citadelle de la steppe de sable arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}, {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Les maisons et les trous des hobbits de la Comté étaient souvent vastes, occupés par des familles nombreuses. Parfois, plusieurs générations apparentées cohabitaient dans une paix relative dans le domaine aux nombreuses galeries de leurs ancêtres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621998&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3218edd4-38a2-4b4d-9731-569630614224', 'multiverseId': 621998}, 'multiverseid': 621998}, {'name': 'Roccaforte delle Steppe Sabbiose', 'text': 'La Roccaforte delle Steppe Sabbiose entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Case e caverne degli Hobbit della Contea erano grandi e abitate da famiglie numerose. Alcuni vivevano con più generazioni di parenti in relativa pace nella vasta e ramificata dimora ancestrale.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622185&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3969110-75e5-480b-8cad-fc3ff8205d6d', 'multiverseId': 622185}, 'multiverseid': 622185}, {'name': '砂草原の城塞', 'text': '砂草原の城塞はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'ホビット庄のホビットたちの家や穴には大規模なものが多く、大家族で住んでいた。時には数世代もの親類縁者が、先祖代々のトンネルがあまたある大邸宅に、それなりに平和に、共に暮らすこともあった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622372&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e979953-e5ef-4441-aea6-219d113b0397', 'multiverseId': 622372}, 'multiverseid': 622372}, {'name': 'Cidadela da Estepe Arenosa', 'text': 'Cidadela da Estepe Arenosa entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}, {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'As casas e tocas dos hobbits do Condado eram muitas vezes grandes e ocupadas por famílias grandes. Às vezes, muitas gerações de parentes viviam juntas em relativa paz numa única mansão ancestral de muitos túneis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622559&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1942800-7d2c-400f-8714-f74dd6d887fd', 'multiverseId': 622559}, 'multiverseid': 622559}]", '[{\'name\': \'Saruman, die Weiße Hand\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, wende Ork-Aufmarsch X an, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Zauberspruchs ist. (Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Ork. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Ork-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\\nGoblins und Orks, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {2}.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Über all seinen Werken hing ein dunkler Qualm, der sich um Orthanc legte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620670&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15e6936-1243-423f-9f6c-4d274ed6a898\', \'multiverseId\': 620670}, \'multiverseid\': 620670}, {\'name\': \'Saruman, la Mano Blanca\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, enrola X Orcos, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo. (Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. También es un Orco. Si no controlas un Ejército, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Orco negra 0/0.)\\nLos Trasgos y Orcos que controlas tienen la habilidad de rebatir {2}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero avatar\', \'flavor\': \'Sobre todas sus fraguas flotaba un humo oscuro que se arremolinaba contra los flancos de Orthanc.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04657bc-52ab-4605-af0e-6ca4ca546bc1\', \'multiverseId\': 620674}, \'multiverseid\': 620674}, {\'name\': \'Saruman, la Main Blanche\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, amassez des orques X, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort. (Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un orque. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Orque et Armée.)\\nLes gobelins et les orques que vous contrôlez ont parade {2}.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Sur tous ses ouvrages était suspendue une fumée sombre qui enveloppait les flancs d\'Orthanc.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8528df8f-37e5-4d85-868f-65adae12a816\', \'multiverseId\': 620678}, \'multiverseid\': 620678}, {\'name\': \'Saruman, la Mano Bianca\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, recluta Orchi X, dove X è il valore di mana di quella magia. (Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. È anche un Orco. Se non controlli un Esercito, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Orco 0/0 nera.)\\nI Goblin e gli Orchi che controlli hanno egida {2}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'Su tutte le sue opere, una cascata di fumo scuro si avvolse ai lati di Orthanc.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f801c64-0fe0-408c-bb5b-24c2e45400b3\', \'multiverseId\': 620682}, \'multiverseid\': 620682}, {\'name\': \'白の手、サルマン\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、オーク動員Ｘを行う。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。それはオークでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のオーク・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\\nゴブリンやオークのうちあなたがコントロールしているすべては護法{2}を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'工廠の上には黒い煙がたなびき、オルサンクの周りをまるごと包み込んでいた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a90de3ba-f498-4db4-a54e-b053a2c43900\', \'multiverseId\': 620686}, \'multiverseid\': 620686}, {\'name\': \'Saruman, A Mão Branca\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica não de criatura, arregimente Orcs X, sendo X o valor de mana daquela mágica. (Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Ele também é um Orc. Se você não controlar um Exército, crie antes uma ficha de criatura Orc Exército preta 0/0.)\\nOs Goblins e Orcs que você controla têm salvaguarda {2}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Avatar Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Sobre todas as suas obras, uma fumaça escura pairava e envolvia os flancos de Orthanc.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a23afe33-1ada-49e4-bc2f-b0bf61c486b4\', \'multiverseId\': 620690}, \'multiverseid\': 620690}, {\'name\': \'白手萨茹曼\', \'text\': \'每当你施放非生物咒语时，囤兵半兽人X，X为该咒语的法术力值。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置X个+1/+1指示物。它也是半兽人。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色半兽人／军队衍生生物。）\\n由你操控的鬼怪和半兽人具有守护{2}。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'在他建造的这一切上空，有一团黑烟萦绕不去，紧紧包在欧尔桑克周围。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2aa0004-e5b4-4429-888e-faffed08f224\', \'multiverseId\': 620694}, \'multiverseid\': 620694}]', '[{\'name\': \'Saruman, die Weiße Hand\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, wende Ork-Aufmarsch X an, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Zauberspruchs ist.\\nGoblins und Orks, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {2}.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Über all seinen Werken hing ein dunkler Qualm, der sich um Orthanc legte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'365a00bd-e4ba-46bf-90bb-91af686506d6\', \'multiverseId\': 620265}, \'multiverseid\': 620265}, {\'name\': \'Saruman, la Main Blanche\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, amassez des orques X, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.\\nLes gobelins et les orques que vous contrôlez ont parade {2}.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Sur tous ses ouvrages était suspendue une fumée sombre qui enveloppait les flancs d\'Orthanc.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620273&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49c0345b-ad11-407c-8467-f8a47674b25d\', \'multiverseId\': 620273}, \'multiverseid\': 620273}, {\'name\': \'白の手、サルマン\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、オーク動員Ｘを行う。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\\nゴブリンやオークのうちあなたがコントロールしているすべては護法{2}を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'工廠の上には黒い煙がたなびき、オルサンクの周りをまるごと包み込んでいた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e32d425b-0279-47df-bee6-37279f834702\', \'multiverseId\': 620281}, \'multiverseid\': 620281}, {\'name\': \'白手萨茹曼\', \'text\': \'每当你施放非生物咒语时，囤兵半兽人X，X为该咒语的法术力值。\\n由你操控的鬼怪和半兽人具有守护{2}。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'在他建造的这一切上空，有一团黑烟萦绕不去，紧紧包在欧尔桑克周围。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43870ded-5b68-4228-afda-3866f30119d3\', \'multiverseId\': 620289}, \'multiverseid\': 620289}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sarumans Beschwörungen\', \'text\': \'Ork-Aufmarsch X. Du millst X Karten. Du kannst davon einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. (Um Ork-Aufmarsch X anzuwenden, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Ork. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Ork-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\\nRückblende — {3}{U}{R}, schicke X Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620828&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b1be587-7873-4cec-9708-96ef62c94bed\', \'multiverseId\': 620828}, \'multiverseid\': 620828}, {\'name\': \'Invocaciones de Saruman\', \'text\': \'Enrola X Orcos. Muele X cartas. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro con valor de maná de X o menos de entre ellas sin pagar su coste de maná. (Para enrolar X Orcos, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. También es un Orco. Si no controlas un Ejército, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Orco negra 0/0.)\\nRetrospectiva—{3}{U}{R}, exiliar X cartas de tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'216ba746-7673-4551-8dca-0e3d9a50eb84\', \'multiverseId\': 620900}, \'multiverseid\': 620900}, {\'name\': \'Recrutement de Saruman\', \'text\': "Amassez des orques X. Meulez X cartes. Vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X parmi elles sans payer son coût de mana. (Pour amasser des orques X, mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un orque. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Orque et Armée.)\\nFlashback — {3}{U}{R}, exilez X cartes depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620972&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cd21dfa-4696-4dad-b972-5e1f9db4cb84\', \'multiverseId\': 620972}, \'multiverseid\': 620972}, {\'name\': \'Evocazioni di Saruman\', \'text\': \'Recluta Orchi X. Macina X carte. Puoi lanciare una magia istantaneo o stregoneria con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X scelta tra esse senza pagare il suo costo di mana. (Per reclutare Orchi X, metti X segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. È anche un Orco. Se non controlli un Esercito, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Orco 0/0 nera.)\\nFlashback—{3}{U}{R}, Esilia X carte dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01bbd7e7-f055-4254-86eb-af2eeb4e1c52\', \'multiverseId\': 621044}, \'multiverseid\': 621044}, {\'name\': \'サルマンの召喚\', \'text\': \'オーク動員Ｘを行う。カードＸ枚を切削する。あなたはその中から、マナ総量がＸ以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。（オーク動員Ｘを行うなら、あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。それはオークでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のオーク・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\\nフラッシュバック — {3}{U}{R}, あなたの墓地にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dbf6931-94d2-4151-bd40-ca8eb6bf0b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 621116}, \'multiverseid\': 621116}, {\'name\': \'Convocações de Saruman\', \'text\': \'Arregimente Orcs X. Triture X cards. Você pode conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X dentre eles sem pagar seu custo de mana. (Para arregimentar Orcs X, coloque X marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Ele também é um Orc. Se você não controlar um Exército, crie antes uma ficha de criatura Orc Exército preta 0/0.)\\nRecapitular — {3}{U}{R}, exile X cards de seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77e5bdba-fee8-49a8-a568-b84de1bba795\', \'multiverseId\': 621188}, \'multiverseid\': 621188}, {\'name\': \'萨茹曼召唤\', \'text\': \'囤兵半兽人X。磨X张牌。你可以从其中施放一个法术力值等于或小于X的瞬间或法术咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。（囤兵半兽人X的流程是，在一个由你操控的军队上放置X个+1/+1指示物。它也是半兽人。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色半兽人／军队衍生生物。）\\n返照～{3}{U}{R}，从你的坟墓场放逐X张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e85cec72-9fe0-48f9-898c-115dce826964\', \'multiverseId\': 621260}, \'multiverseid\': 621260}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sarumans Beschwörungen\', \'text\': \'Ork-Aufmarsch X. Du millst X Karten. Du kannst davon einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nRückblende — {3}{U}{R}, schicke X Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620416&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b505846-f96a-4d0a-a0ed-d21180dfd213\', \'multiverseId\': 620416}, \'multiverseid\': 620416}, {\'name\': \'Recrutement de Saruman\', \'text\': "Amassez des orques X. Meulez X cartes. Vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X parmi elles sans payer son coût de mana.\\nFlashback — {3}{U}{R}, exilez X cartes depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620484&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a8fa8d4-a3bb-4c07-a81d-20d720a2641c\', \'multiverseId\': 620484}, \'multiverseid\': 620484}, {\'name\': \'サルマンの召喚\', \'text\': \'オーク動員Ｘを行う。カードＸ枚を切削する。あなたはその中から、マナ総量がＸ以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nフラッシュバック — {3}{U}{R}, あなたの墓地にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f739edef-babc-42bb-a0f4-6d9237f93d21\', \'multiverseId\': 620552}, \'multiverseid\': 620552}, {\'name\': \'萨茹曼召唤\', \'text\': \'囤兵半兽人X。磨X张牌。你可以从其中施放一个法术力值等于或小于X的瞬间或法术咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n返照～{3}{U}{R}，从你的坟墓场放逐X张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f679aa-94db-47b7-928b-03a40742a443\', \'multiverseId\': 620620}, \'multiverseid\': 620620}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sauron, der Herr der Ringe\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, wendest du Ork-Aufmarsch 5 an, millst fünf Karten und bringst dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn ein Kommandeur, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, führt der Ring dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620266&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'172b4959-99ec-4a10-a835-143f8f96d37f\', \'multiverseId\': 620266}, \'multiverseid\': 620266}, {\'name\': \'Sauron, le Seigneur des Anneaux\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, amassez des orques 5, meulez cinq cartes, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière.\\nPiétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un commandant qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, l\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620274&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed347d81-89c1-4fd6-93dc-a1e160293d82\', \'multiverseId\': 620274}, \'multiverseid\': 620274}, {\'name\': \'指輪の王、サウロン\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、オーク動員５を行い、カード５枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。\\nトランプル\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている統率者１体が死亡するたび、指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8f7612e-3d23-4509-8a76-083280c6dbf4\', \'multiverseId\': 620282}, \'multiverseid\': 620282}, {\'name\': \'魔戒之主索隆\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，囤兵半兽人5，磨五张牌，然后将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n践踏\\n每当一个由对手操控的指挥官死去时，魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d341d8a3-88c5-43f5-b7d4-8eeab64f7861\', \'multiverseId\': 620290}, \'multiverseid\': 620290}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sauron, der Herr der Ringe\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, wendest du Ork-Aufmarsch 5 an, millst fünf Karten und bringst dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn ein Kommandeur, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, führt der Ring dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620638&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd375682-bfe4-45ca-82d4-3f4ba69d39b8\', \'multiverseId\': 620638}, \'multiverseid\': 620638}, {\'name\': \'Sauron, Señor de los Anillos\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, enrola 5 Orcos, muele cinco cartas y luego regresa una carta de criatura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nArrolla.\\nSiempre que un comandante que controla un oponente muera, el Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Horror avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f2f8cb6-4ea7-4711-9707-316a7e92cdb9\', \'multiverseId\': 620642}, \'multiverseid\': 620642}, {\'name\': \'Sauron, le Seigneur des Anneaux\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, amassez des orques 5, meulez cinq cartes, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière.\\nPiétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un commandant qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, l\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620646&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6f360ae-5786-4a9b-beee-9d4fb83828b6\', \'multiverseId\': 620646}, \'multiverseid\': 620646}, {\'name\': \'Sauron, Signore degli Anelli\', \'text\': "Quando lanci questa magia, recluta Orchi 5, macina cinque carte, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero.\\nTravolgere\\nOgniqualvolta un comandante controllato da un avversario muore, l\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orrore Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39d9a4d7-a8a1-4cf8-b68f-157cd0da50ef\', \'multiverseId\': 620650}, \'multiverseid\': 620650}, {\'name\': \'指輪の王、サウロン\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、オーク動員５を行い、カード５枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。\\nトランプル\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている統率者１体が死亡するたび、指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9802731f-2277-4aa5-aad4-94a7018d2fdc\', \'multiverseId\': 620654}, \'multiverseid\': 620654}, {\'name\': \'Sauron, Senhor dos Anéis\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjurar esta mágica, arregimente Orcs 5, triture cinco cards e depois devolva um card de criatura do seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\nAtropelar\\nToda vez que um comandante controlado por um oponente morrer, o Anel tentará você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Avatar Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26bbbde8-bfda-49ae-adb6-5860b4dd1364\', \'multiverseId\': 620658}, \'multiverseid\': 620658}, {\'name\': \'魔戒之主索隆\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，囤兵半兽人5，磨五张牌，然后将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n践踏\\n每当一个由对手操控的指挥官死去时，魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e748eba9-cb91-4e10-90b4-1aa43475f204\', \'multiverseId\': 620662}, \'multiverseid\': 620662}]', '[{\'name\': \'Saurons Relikt\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge zwei Mana einer beliebigen Kombination aus {U}, {B}, und/oder {R}.\\n{3}, {T}: Ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Während Saurons Macht wuchs, flohen Licht und Lebewesen aus seinem Reich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620425&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9db46794-1c12-4a73-a58a-f8d13ede4de9\', \'multiverseId\': 620425}, \'multiverseid\': 620425}, {\'name\': \'Relique de Sauron\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez deux manas de n\'importe quelle combinaison de {U}, {B} et/ou {R}.\\n{3}, {T} : Piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Tandis que la puissance de Sauron grandissait, la lumière et les êtres vivants abandonnaient ses frontières.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bee32f9-68bc-4425-9233-072052769cef\', \'multiverseId\': 620493}, \'multiverseid\': 620493}, {\'name\': \'サウロンの遺物\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}や{B}や{R}のうち、望む組み合わせのマナ２点を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：カード２枚を引く。その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'サウロンの力が増幅する中、光と生ある物たちはかの国の境界を離れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a86a290f-8139-4088-a0ce-c2ee202b8af6\', \'multiverseId\': 620561}, \'multiverseid\': 620561}, {\'name\': \'索隆遗宝\', \'text\': \'{T}：加两点法术力，且为{U}，{B}和／或{R}的任意组合。\\n{3}，{T}：抓两张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'随着索隆的力量逐渐壮大，光明与活物便离开了他的地界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf98e79-c7b4-4fc2-bda6-ea63a1394651\', \'multiverseId\': 620629}, \'multiverseid\': 620629}]', '[{\'name\': \'Saurons Relikt\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge zwei Mana einer beliebigen Kombination aus {U}, {B}, und/oder {R}.\\n{3}, {T}: Ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Während Saurons Macht wuchs, flohen Licht und Lebewesen aus seinem Reich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'436dd12d-bcb4-4269-96d9-1282d7be223b\', \'multiverseId\': 620837}, \'multiverseid\': 620837}, {\'name\': \'Reliquia de Sauron\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega dos manás de cualquier combinación de {U}, {B} y/o {R}.\\n{3}, {T}: Roba dos cartas, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que crecía el poder de Sauron, la luz y los seres vivos abandonaban sus fronteras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0462e179-6970-4994-9d3a-840e2bca3df9\', \'multiverseId\': 620909}, \'multiverseid\': 620909}, {\'name\': \'Relique de Sauron\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez deux manas de n\'importe quelle combinaison de {U}, {B} et/ou {R}.\\n{3}, {T} : Piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Tandis que la puissance de Sauron grandissait, la lumière et les êtres vivants abandonnaient ses frontières.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620981&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98357d2a-3330-4911-bed0-3aa5d389dd9a\', \'multiverseId\': 620981}, \'multiverseid\': 620981}, {\'name\': \'Reliquia di Sauron\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi due mana in qualsiasi combinazione di {U}, {B} e/o {R}.\\n{3}, {T}: Pesca due carte, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre la potenza di Sauron cresceva, luce ed esseri viventi abbandonavano le sue terre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'493e7db2-cb88-4760-a28b-decfd6c579b1\', \'multiverseId\': 621053}, \'multiverseid\': 621053}, {\'name\': \'サウロンの遺物\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}や{B}や{R}のうち、望む組み合わせのマナ２点を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：カード２枚を引く。その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'サウロンの力が増幅する中、光と生ある物たちはかの国の境界を離れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'453b7ffe-7f26-4a1f-b5bc-c18f2a19efb5\', \'multiverseId\': 621125}, \'multiverseid\': 621125}, {\'name\': \'Relíquia de Sauron\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione dois manas em qualquer combinação de {U}, {B} e/ou {R}.\\n{3}, {T}: Compre dois cards e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto o poder de Sauron crescia, a luz e as coisas vivas deixavam suas fronteiras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3d39371-3686-4f52-a6f2-0533b12b8b78\', \'multiverseId\': 621197}, \'multiverseid\': 621197}, {\'name\': \'索隆遗宝\', \'text\': \'{T}：加两点法术力，且为{U}，{B}和／或{R}的任意组合。\\n{3}，{T}：抓两张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'随着索隆的力量逐渐壮大，光明与活物便离开了他的地界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bcc24ab-170b-4035-a4bd-39723f9856ff\', \'multiverseId\': 621269}, \'multiverseid\': 621269}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schatzmopser\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner ein Artefakt für Mana tappt, übernimm bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges die Kontrolle über das Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Zu seinem Entsetzen konnte er nicht gleichzeitig kämpfen und seinen Schatz festhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1037509f-c09d-441d-aa7a-d81d1be9d36e\', \'multiverseId\': 621527}, \'multiverseid\': 621527}, {\'name\': \'Ladronzuelo de tesoros\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente gire un artefacto para obtener maná, gana el control de ese artefacto hasta el final de tu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Para su desgracia, no era capaz de luchar y agarrar su tesoro a la vez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282cdbf5-5e44-4712-9a03-a6b4e257d20e\', \'multiverseId\': 621714}, \'multiverseid\': 621714}, {\'name\': \'Chipeur de trésor\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire engage un artefact pour du mana, acquérez le contrôle de cet artefact jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'À son grand désarroi, il ne pouvait pas à la fois se battre et garder la main sur son trésor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621901&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff52e74-2f6c-4360-a72d-7b0f861f0f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 621901}, \'multiverseid\': 621901}, {\'name\': \'Arraffatore di Tesori\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un avversario TAPpa un artefatto per attingere mana, prendi il controllo di quell\'artefatto fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Con suo grande disappunto, non poteva lottare e anche tenere il suo tesoro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9672361-2e77-4739-a552-718b24fabbfd\', \'multiverseId\': 622088}, \'multiverseid\': 622088}, {\'name\': \'宝捕り\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がマナを引き出す目的でアーティファクト１つをタップするたび、次のあなたのターン終了時まで、そのアーティファクトのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'残念なことに、宝物を抱えて戦うことはできなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35aa3a88-b3ca-415f-a8d0-947cbe295f77\', \'multiverseId\': 622275}, \'multiverseid\': 622275}, {\'name\': \'Batedor de Tesouros\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente virar um artefato para gerar mana, ganhe o controle daquele artefato até o final do seu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Para sua decepção, ele não conseguia lutar e segurar seu tesouro ao mesmo tempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b25968a-892c-4778-ae91-eb54419547d0\', \'multiverseId\': 622462}, \'multiverseid\': 622462}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schauplatz der Verheerung\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere den Schauplatz der Verheerung: Zerstöre ein Nichtstandardland deiner Wahl, das ein Gegner kontrolliert. Jeder Spieler durchsucht seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringt sie ins Spiel und mischt danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Im Auenland ist irgendeine Teufelei am Werk."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621605&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d377f859-c6a2-49c7-a586-0d0cb2a43374\', \'multiverseId\': 621605}, \'multiverseid\': 621605}, {\'name\': \'Campo de ruina\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Campo de ruina: Destruye la tierra no básica objetivo que controla un oponente. Cada jugador busca en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, la pone en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Algo malo se cuece en la Comarca".\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9206916e-4a25-4ecd-b8b5-9cd365d6123b\', \'multiverseId\': 621792}, \'multiverseid\': 621792}, {\'name\': \'Champ de ruine\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Champ de ruine : Détruisez un terrain non-base ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Chaque joueur cherche dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la met sur le champ de bataille, puis mélange.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Il y a quelque diablerie à l\'œuvre dans la Comté. »\\n—Sam", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621979&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60a5d026-acd6-49a3-97c0-d764273b7ea0\', \'multiverseId\': 621979}, \'multiverseid\': 621979}, {\'name\': \'Campo della Rovina\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Campo della Rovina: Distruggi una terra non base bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Ogni giocatore passa in rassegna il proprio grimorio per una carta terra base, la mette sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"C\\\'è qualche diavoleria al lavoro nella Contea."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'460b388c-8701-444c-8ffa-9aa3406356ce\', \'multiverseId\': 622166}, \'multiverseid\': 622166}, {\'name\': \'廃墟の地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 廃墟の地を生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手がコントロールしていて基本でない土地１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「ホビット庄で何かけしからんことが起こってます。」\\n――サム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5a2dc4-3075-44e0-bd4f-44e6863e82ad\', \'multiverseId\': 622353}, \'multiverseid\': 622353}, {\'name\': \'Campo da Ruína\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Campo da Ruína: Destrua o terreno alvo não básico que um oponente controla. Cada jogador procura no próprio grimório um card de terreno básico, coloca-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralha.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Tem algo diabólico acontecendo no Condado."\\n— Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32be6d8e-6ddf-4291-af18-b4d18f950563\', \'multiverseId\': 622540}, \'multiverseid\': 622540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleichweg der Diebe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich gehe, vielleicht irgendwohin, wo ich mein Buch fertig schreiben kann. Ich habe mir ein schönes Ende ausgedacht: ‚Und er lebte glücklich bis ans Ende seiner Tage.\\\'"\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621623&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35700026-a2d2-471f-8312-44d7b953034f\', \'multiverseId\': 621623}, \'multiverseid\': 621623}, {\'name\': \'Pasaje del bribón\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Me voy, a ver si encuentro dónde terminar mi libro. He pensado en un bonito final: \\\'Y vivió feliz hasta el final de sus días\\\'".\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a36a4b-4d7e-4cd8-8343-0ed21214d192\', \'multiverseId\': 621810}, \'multiverseid\': 621810}, {\'name\': \'Passage des malandrins\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Je pars. Quelque part où je pourrai finir mon livre, peut-être. J\\\'ai pensé à une belle fin : "Et il vécut heureux jusqu\\\'à la fin de ses jours." »\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621997&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a2a2247-bee1-4a06-9c3c-93ed76ae542c\', \'multiverseId\': 621997}, \'multiverseid\': 621997}, {\'name\': \'Passaggio dei Farabutti\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Me ne vado; desidero trovare un posto dove poter finire il mio libro. Ho immaginato una bellissima conclusione: \\\'E visse felice e contento fino alla fine dei suoi giorni.\\\'"\\n—Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcc23b27-141c-4f79-8d31-94cb9ee3b1a2\', \'multiverseId\': 622184}, \'multiverseid\': 622184}, {\'name\': \'ならず者の道\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「私は行きます、どこか本が書き終えられそうな場所へね。素敵な結びはもう考えてあるんです。『そして彼は一生、ずっと幸せに暮らしました。』とね。」\\n――ビルボ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'539a9991-a7b8-43c7-aa1c-a9729e21d45c\', \'multiverseId\': 622371}, \'multiverseid\': 622371}, {\'name\': \'Passagem do Ladino\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Estou partindo; para algum lugar onde eu possa terminar meu livro, talvez. Já pensei num bom final pra ele: \\\'E ele viveu feliz para sempre, até o fim de seus dias.\\\'"\\n— Bilbo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a78fadca-eef5-4c94-93f5-4b2c17b6057d\', \'multiverseId\': 622558}, \'multiverseid\': 622558}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlemmender Hobbit\', \'text\': \'Speise-Verschlingen 3 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Speisen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit dreimal so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nKreaturen, deren Stärke kleiner ist als die des Schlemmenden Hobbits, können ihn nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Name war natürlich Stolzfuß.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620795&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf9a515a-cee4-4b8b-baed-0059bd40797f\', \'multiverseId\': 620795}, \'multiverseid\': 620795}, {\'name\': \'Hobbit atiborrado\', \'text\': \'Devorar Comida 3. (En cuanto esto entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar cualquier cantidad de Comidas. Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con el triple de esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nLas criaturas con fuerza menor que la fuerza del Hobbit atiborrado no pueden bloquearlo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano mediano\', \'flavor\': \'Su apellido era, por supuesto, Ganapié.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'123342a7-f3d5-49c8-a3b7-904ab0698b4c\', \'multiverseId\': 620867}, \'multiverseid\': 620867}, {\'name\': \'Hobbit festoyant\', \'text\': "Dévorement de nourriture 3 (Au moment où cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier n\'importe quel nombre de nourritures. Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec trois fois ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nLes créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle du Hobbit festoyant ne peuvent pas le bloquer.", \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': "Son nom, comme on pouvait s\'y attendre, était Fierpied.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620939&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8e1d6f-4657-4f79-b806-cafc9d01c304\', \'multiverseId\': 620939}, \'multiverseid\': 620939}, {\'name\': \'Hobbit Gozzovigliante\', \'text\': "Divorare Cibo 3 (Mentre questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un qualsiasi numero di Cibi. Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al triplo dei Cibi divorati.)\\nLe creature con forza inferiore a quella dell\'Hobbit Gozzovigliante non possono bloccarlo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Halfling\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo cognome, naturalmente, era Tronfipiede.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d07420d7-9be4-48b2-b001-5376ac9a6213\', \'multiverseId\': 621011}, \'multiverseid\': 621011}, {\'name\': \'大いに食べるホビット\', \'text\': \'食物の貪食3（これが戦場に出るに際し、あなたは望む数の食物を生け贄に捧げてもよい。このクリーチャーは、その数の３倍に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\n大いに食べるホビットよりパワーが小さいクリーチャーでは、これをブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': \'足高家の名の通り、彼は立派な足を上げていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00c64057-3405-47a8-9b88-fa04b996e51c\', \'multiverseId\': 621083}, \'multiverseid\': 621083}, {\'name\': \'Hobbit Glutão\', \'text\': \'Devorar Comida 3 (Conforme esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar um número qualquer de Comidas. Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com o triplo daquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1.)\\nAs criaturas com poder menor que o de Hobbit Glutão não podem bloqueá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pequenino Cidadão\', \'flavor\': \'O nome dele, é claro, era Pé Soberbo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3baee332-b1c9-498e-af07-1f02f3221709\', \'multiverseId\': 621155}, \'multiverseid\': 621155}, {\'name\': \'享宴霍比特人\', \'text\': \'吞噬食品3（于它进战场时，你可以牺牲任意数量的食品。此生物进战场时上面有三倍于该数量的+1/+1指示物。）\\n力量小于享宴霍比特人的生物不能阻挡它。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半身人／市民\', \'flavor\': \'他家的姓氏，当然是傲足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'154fee53-615d-43c8-9ba6-028cede9781f\', \'multiverseId\': 621227}, \'multiverseid\': 621227}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlemmender Hobbit\', \'text\': \'Speise-Verschlingen 3\\nKreaturen, deren Stärke kleiner ist als die des Schlemmenden Hobbits, können ihn nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Name war natürlich Stolzfuß.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620386&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af012c28-541a-492f-8a68-d79b02cdac7f\', \'multiverseId\': 620386}, \'multiverseid\': 620386}, {\'name\': \'Hobbit festoyant\', \'text\': \'Dévorement de nourriture 3\\nLes créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle du Hobbit festoyant ne peuvent pas le bloquer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': "Son nom, comme on pouvait s\'y attendre, était Fierpied.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'418a118d-1d09-4516-8210-4ccb320402b4\', \'multiverseId\': 620454}, \'multiverseid\': 620454}, {\'name\': \'大いに食べるホビット\', \'text\': \'食物の貪食3\\n大いに食べるホビットよりパワーが小さいクリーチャーでは、これをブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': \'足高家の名の通り、彼は立派な足を上げていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427d32ff-bf59-4174-a4fe-e347abf9d31c\', \'multiverseId\': 620522}, \'multiverseid\': 620522}, {\'name\': \'享宴霍比特人\', \'text\': \'吞噬食品3\\n力量小于享宴霍比特人的生物不能阻挡它。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半身人／市民\', \'flavor\': \'他家的姓氏，当然是傲足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e99ce3-1d12-442e-b04c-a25fb10d7159\', \'multiverseId\': 620590}, \'multiverseid\': 620590}]', "[{'name': 'Schmerzerfüllte Auslöschung', 'text': 'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil. Du verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Es gab ein Gebrüll und ein großes Durcheinander von Lärm. Flammen schossen hoch und züngelten am Dach. Das Pulsieren steigerte sich zu einem großen Tumult, und der Berg bebte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621562&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f529d25-fa6f-4019-9373-679a9c0ddd53', 'multiverseId': 621562}, 'multiverseid': 621562}, {'name': 'Fin angustioso', 'text': 'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Pierdes 3 vidas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Hubo un rugido y una enorme confusión de ruidos. Estallaron llamas y lamieron el techo. Los golpes aumentaron hasta convertirse en un tumulto y la montaña tembló.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621749&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4649e877-2f48-4589-bc28-fbd621644447', 'multiverseId': 621749}, 'multiverseid': 621749}, {'name': 'Annulation angoissée', 'text': 'Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé. Vous perdez 3 points de vie.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Il y eut un rugissement et des bruits confus. Le feu jaillit et lécha le plafond. Le vrombissement se transforma en un grand tumulte, et la Montagne trembla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621936&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '108ccf71-cc71-4869-a854-c15ccd32be9f', 'multiverseId': 621936}, 'multiverseid': 621936}, {'name': 'Dissoluzione Angosciosa', 'text': 'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio. Perdi 3 punti vita.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Seguì un boato e un immenso tumulto. Fuochi avvamparono fino al soffitto. Il rombo divenne un gigantesco fragore e la Montagna tremò.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622123&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '216eda20-0f8c-4baa-bdee-4526305c7a01', 'multiverseId': 622123}, 'multiverseid': 622123}, {'name': '苦渋の破棄', 'text': '土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。あなたは３点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '轟音と大混乱の騒音が起こった。火が跳びはね、天井を舐めた。脈打つ音はしだいに大きくなって大喧騒となり、山は揺れ動いた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622310&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ba99d5a-850a-4d91-80ec-c748727d0466', 'multiverseId': 622310}, 'multiverseid': 622310}, {'name': 'Desfazer Angustiado', 'text': 'Exile a permanente alvo não de terreno. Você perde 3 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Houve um rugido e uma grande confusão de barulhos. Labaredas subiam e lambiam o teto. O tremor cresceu até se tornar um grande tumulto e a Montanha balançou.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622497&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1debf5c-5baa-42c8-b9f1-ac8b1a080faa', 'multiverseId': 622497}, 'multiverseid': 622497}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schrecken aus dem See\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schrecken aus dem See ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {5} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, tappe alle Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, und lege dann auf jede der Kreaturen eine Betäubungsmarke. (Falls eine bleibende Karte mit Betäubungsmarke enttappt würde, entferne stattdessen eine davon.)\\nInselumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Insel-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620780&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61dedbe6-0f98-4d67-9bfc-edaf37679a3f\', \'multiverseId\': 620780}, \'multiverseid\': 620780}, {\'name\': \'Monstruosidad del lago\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Monstruosidad del lago entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {5}. Si lo haces, gira todas las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes y luego pon un contador de aturdimiento sobre cada una de esas criaturas. (Si un permanente con un contador de aturdimiento fuera a enderezarse, en vez de eso, remueve uno de esos contadores de él.)\\nCiclo de isla {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Isla, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5330cd-e7ff-4425-8953-a69119d64151\', \'multiverseId\': 620852}, \'multiverseid\': 620852}, {\'name\': \'Monstruosité du lac\', \'text\': "Quand la Monstruosité du lac arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {5}. Si vous faites ainsi, engagez toutes les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent, puis mettez un marqueur « étourdissement » sur chacune de ces créatures. (Si un permanent avec un marqueur « étourdissement » devait devenir dégagé, retirez-lui en un à la place.)\\nRecyclage d\'île {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'île, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56a666aa-b5f6-4f16-a811-968c43f16123\', \'multiverseId\': 620924}, \'multiverseid\': 620924}, {\'name\': \'Mostruosità del Lago\', \'text\': \'Quando la Mostruosità del Lago entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {5}. Se lo fai, TAPpa tutte le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari, poi metti un segnalino stordimento su ognuna di quelle creature. (Se un permanente con un segnalino stordimento sta per essere STAPpato, rimuovi invece un segnalino stordimento da esso.)\\nCicloisola {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Isola, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84d25009-687b-4471-b7a1-27512dbedc3a\', \'multiverseId\': 620996}, \'multiverseid\': 620996}, {\'name\': \'湖に潜む化け物\', \'text\': \'湖に潜む化け物が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{5}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーをタップする。その後、それらの各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ麻痺カウンター１個を置く。（麻痺カウンターが置かれているパーマネントがアンタップ状態になるなら、代わりにそれの上から麻痺カウンター１個を取り除く。）\\n島サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから島・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da45ece-0763-47a4-a8ca-1d39e51bea67\', \'multiverseId\': 621068}, \'multiverseid\': 621068}, {\'name\': \'Monstruosidade do Lago\', \'text\': \'Quando Monstruosidade do Lago entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar {5}. Se fizer isso, vire todas as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam e depois coloque um marcador de atordoamento em cada uma daquelas criaturas. (Se uma permanente com um marcador de atordoamento se tornaria desvirada, em vez disso, remova um marcador de atordoamento dela.)\\nReciclar Ilha {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de Ilha, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1b0c6b3-ad37-4f43-a13b-dc2bc585a1bc\', \'multiverseId\': 621140}, \'multiverseid\': 621140}, {\'name\': \'湖中怪兽\', \'text\': \'当湖中怪兽进战场时，你可以支付{5}。若你如此作，则横置所有由对手操控的生物，然后在这些生物上各放置一个晕眩指示物。（如果某个其上有晕眩指示物的永久物将成为未横置，则改为从其上移去一个晕眩指示物。）\\n循环海岛{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张海岛牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～巨海兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed9c1e1a-68c1-4d97-8b7b-dd6f40ecc08b\', \'multiverseId\': 621212}, \'multiverseid\': 621212}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schrecken aus dem See\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schrecken aus dem See ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {5} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, tappe alle Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, und lege dann auf jede der Kreaturen eine Betäubungsmarke.\\nInselumwandlung {2}\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620371&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca38cbdf-79e2-4090-9798-722c3a393a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 620371}, \'multiverseid\': 620371}, {\'name\': \'Monstruosité du lac\', \'text\': "Quand la Monstruosité du lac arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {5}. Si vous faites ainsi, engagez toutes les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent, puis mettez un marqueur « étourdissement » sur chacune de ces créatures.\\nRecyclage d\'île {2}", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9279e95-01db-4317-995b-b16a0c695767\', \'multiverseId\': 620439}, \'multiverseid\': 620439}, {\'name\': \'湖に潜む化け物\', \'text\': \'湖に潜む化け物が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{5}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーをタップする。その後、それらの各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ麻痺カウンター１個を置く。\\n島サイクリング{2}\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15c1c5e6-349e-4ea2-ae1d-4b37eb80b980\', \'multiverseId\': 620507}, \'multiverseid\': 620507}, {\'name\': \'幽湖潜怪\', \'text\': \'当幽湖潜怪进战场时，你可以支付{5}。若你如此作，则横置所有由对手操控的生物，然后在这些生物上各放置一个晕眩指示物。\\n循环海岛{2}\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～巨海兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4826b7d0-dea9-4aa2-97bb-26e22cf200d4\', \'multiverseId\': 620575}, \'multiverseid\': 620575}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwanengesang\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Spontanzauber, eine Hexerei oder einen Verzauberungszauber deiner Wahl. Sein bzw. ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 2/2 blauen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ein- oder zweimal hörten die Reisenden das Geräusch von Schwanenflügeln, und als sie hinaufblickten, sahen sie eine gewaltige Phalanx über den Himmel gleiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621494&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b729a98-ffd1-488e-93e7-58a52ffdf891\', \'multiverseId\': 621494}, \'multiverseid\': 621494}, {\'name\': \'Canción del cisne\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo de encantamiento, de instantáneo o de conjuro. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Ave azul 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los viajeros oyeron el movimiento rápido y el sonido quejoso de unas alas de cisnes y, alzando la mirada, vieron una bandada que atravesaba el cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c14b2d96-43dd-4776-a5b9-d50d10a11a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 621681}, \'multiverseid\': 621681}, {\'name\': \'Chant du cygne\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez un sort d\'enchantement, d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Oiseau avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À une ou deux reprises, les voyageurs entendirent les battements d\'ailes rapides et plaintifs de cygnes, et levant les yeux, ils virent une grande phalange traverser le ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'275f6b21-1c81-49c0-91f2-7dcb934b07b4\', \'multiverseId\': 621868}, \'multiverseid\': 621868}, {\'name\': \'Canto del Cigno\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia incantesimo, istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Uccello 2/2 blu con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un paio di volte i viaggiatori udirono il fruscio e il sibilo delle ali dei cigni e, alzando lo sguardo, scorsero una grossa falange che navigava in cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd22bb1e-be97-414d-93ee-aa5a928ae039\', \'multiverseId\': 622055}, \'multiverseid\': 622055}, {\'name\': \'白鳥の歌\', \'text\': \'エンチャントやインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。それのコントローラーは、飛行を持つ青の２/２の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'一度、二度と旅人たちは風を切って飛ぶ白鳥たちの翼の鳴る音を耳にした。空を見上げれば鳥群が大陣列をなして渡っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a270b1-9d1c-4743-90c8-871541bc5b24\', \'multiverseId\': 622242}, \'multiverseid\': 622242}, {\'name\': \'Canção do Cisne\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica instantânea, de encantamento ou de feitiço alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Ave azul 2/2 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas vezes os viajantes ouviram a batida e o silvo de asas de cisnes e, olhando para cima, viram uma grande falange a cruzar o céu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'544ea530-9ac7-47d0-85c1-cb9815e3966a\', \'multiverseId\': 622429}, \'multiverseid\': 622429}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwefelfälle\', \'text\': \'Die Schwefelfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine Insel oder ein Gebirge.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Du solltest die Wasserwege von Thal sehen, Frodo, und die Springbrunnen und die Teiche! Du solltest die Terrassen und Türme an den Hängen des Berges sehen!"\\n—Glóin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c538a6c8-bcc6-4a9a-874b-b4159f8ae659\', \'multiverseId\': 621630}, \'multiverseid\': 621630}, {\'name\': \'Cascada de azufre\', \'text\': \'La Cascada de azufre entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una Isla o una Montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Debería ver los canales de Valle, Frodo, y las fuentes, y los estanques! Tendría que ver las terrazas y las torres que rodean la montaña".\\n—Glóin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c416345f-3653-4470-b402-038b76573639\', \'multiverseId\': 621817}, \'multiverseid\': 621817}, {\'name\': \'Chutes de soufre\', \'text\': \'Les Chutes de soufre arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées à moins que vous ne contrôliez une île ou une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Vous devriez voir les cours d\'eau de Dale, Frodo, et les fontaines et les étangs ! Vous devriez voir les terrasses et les tours sur les flancs de la Montagne ! »\\n—Glóin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622004&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66994e66-29a1-418d-b5a6-e712bcd6eac1\', \'multiverseId\': 622004}, \'multiverseid\': 622004}, {\'name\': \'Cascata Sulfurea\', \'text\': "La Cascata Sulfurea entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli un\'Isola o una Montagna.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Dovresti vedere, Frodo, la rete fluviale di Valle, e le fontane e i laghi! Dovresti vedere le torri e le terrazze sui fianchi della Montagna!"\\n—Glóin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce3c730-f03f-44c0-8829-7aa38ea9921d\', \'multiverseId\': 622191}, \'multiverseid\': 622191}, {\'name\': \'硫黄の滝\', \'text\': \'あなたが島や山をコントロールしていないかぎり、硫黄の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「フロド殿、あなたにはぜひ一度、谷間の国の水路と噴水と池を見ていただきたい！そして山の中腹に並ぶテラスに、いくつもそそり立つ塔を！」\\n――グローイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8931072c-aaa4-45e0-877f-5d21b60db324\', \'multiverseId\': 622378}, \'multiverseid\': 622378}, {\'name\': \'Cascata de Enxofre\', \'text\': \'Cascata de Enxofre entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle uma Ilha ou uma Montanha.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Você devia ver os canais de Valle, Frodo, as fontes e os lagos! Você devia ver os terraços e as torres nas encostas da Montanha!"\\n— Glóin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a5b59e-ab2f-4a19-b041-8c82a3558bc9\', \'multiverseId\': 622565}, \'multiverseid\': 622565}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwefelquellen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}. Die Schwefelquellen fügen dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Das Land ist verdorben, verseucht jenseits aller Heilung — es sei denn, das Große Meer würde es überfluten und es mit Vergessen waschen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621631&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fae4fe8-b3c3-4d94-98f7-142a43c5d57e\', \'multiverseId\': 621631}, \'multiverseid\': 621631}, {\'name\': \'Manantiales sulfurosos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}. Los Manantiales sulfurosos te hacen 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Una tierra profanada, enferma y sin esperanza de sanación, a menos que el Gran Mar llegase a sumergirla en las aguas del olvido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48b6a09f-11d5-4508-9e32-4941773415b9\', \'multiverseId\': 621818}, \'multiverseid\': 621818}, {\'name\': \'Sources sulfureuses\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}. Les Sources sulfureuses vous infligent 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Une terre souillée, gangrenée au-delà de toute guérison, à moins que la grande mer ne s\'y engouffre et ne la plonge dans l\'oubli.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622005&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e614863-b69c-47ec-b55d-96fa90e14ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 622005}, \'multiverseid\': 622005}, {\'name\': \'Sorgenti Sulfuree\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}. Le Sorgenti Sulfuree ti infliggono 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Una terra immonda, malata, senza speranza di guarigione... salvo forse un\'invasione delle acque del Grande Mare che la sommergesse nell\'oblio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'426887e2-cc45-49c3-be98-60eb6d5c5a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 622192}, \'multiverseid\': 622192}, {\'name\': \'硫黄泉\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。硫黄泉はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'大海の水が忘却の彼方に流し去るのでもない限り、どうにも癒やせぬ病み穢れた地であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68906d1b-c762-44e5-b0d6-0449863ba03c\', \'multiverseId\': 622379}, \'multiverseid\': 622379}, {\'name\': \'Fontes Sulfurosas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}. Fontes Sulfurosas causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Uma terra conspurcada, doente além de qualquer cura — a menos que o Grande Mar viesse e a lavasse com o esquecimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b93b64-279f-4f8d-9d4f-db5718c18913\', \'multiverseId\': 622566}, \'multiverseid\': 622566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwelendes Marschland\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.)\\nDas Schwelende Marschland kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge\', \'flavor\': \'Bevor die Schatten des Abends in glücklicheren Gefilden lang wurden, gingen sie mit nur kurzer Rast weiter, bis sie die Mitte der Totensümpfe erreicht hatten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c5e886-e992-4f08-b35c-fc843f03fce7\', \'multiverseId\': 621629}, \'multiverseid\': 621629}, {\'name\': \'Cenagal ardiente\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.)\\nEl Cenagal ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Pantano montaña\', \'flavor\': \'Antes de que las sombras de la tarde llegasen a tierras más felices, prosiguieron, solo con breves descansos, hasta que llegaron al centro de la Ciénaga de los Muertos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08125fe0-a7d5-4ec7-a8b3-1ead933eb4a1\', \'multiverseId\': 621816}, \'multiverseid\': 621816}, {\'name\': \'Marécage fumant\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.)\\nLe Marécage fumant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : marais et montagne\', \'flavor\': "Avant que les ombres du soir ne s\'allongent dans des contrées moins tristes, ils se remirent en marche en ne s\'accordant que de courtes haltes jusqu\'à ce qu\'ils soient en plein cœur des Marais des Morts.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622003&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e26ead-5259-4da9-bb4f-5d3a9c34be57\', \'multiverseId\': 622003}, \'multiverseid\': 622003}, {\'name\': \'Palude Rovente\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.)\\nLa Palude Rovente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Palude Montagna\', \'flavor\': \'Prima che le ombre della sera ricominciassero ad allungarsi verso terre più felici, si rimisero in marcia con qualche breve sosta finché giunsero nel bel mezzo delle Paludi Morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aafbd3b3-df1a-4c72-abc8-6f25f28171c3\', \'multiverseId\': 622190}, \'multiverseid\': 622190}, {\'name\': \'燻る湿地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、燻る湿地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 沼・山\', \'flavor\': \'夕暮れの影がもっと幸せな土地に長く伸びる前に、彼らは再び歩き出した。死者の沼地の真ん中に来るまで、小休止を取るほかは、進み続けるだけだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a01bdd7-d99a-49e5-949c-0dddfedfcaba\', \'multiverseId\': 622377}, \'multiverseid\': 622377}, {\'name\': \'Pântano Ardente\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}.)\\nPântano Ardente entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Pântano Montanha\', \'flavor\': \'Antes que as sombras do anoitecer se alongassem em terras mais felizes, eles seguiram novamente, sem paradas senão breves, até chegarem ao meio dos Pântanos Mortos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28310d24-a2de-4770-9030-74dc593383e3\', \'multiverseId\': 622564}, \'multiverseid\': 622564}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwerter zu Pflugscharen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erhält Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Alles, was Hobbits nicht unmittelbar gebrauchen konnten, aber nicht wegwerfen wollten, nannten sie Mathom. Ihre Behausungen waren teilweise vor lauter Mathoms etwas überfüll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621475&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0085e973-36a4-4d2e-8e92-f2eb1d298cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 621475}, \'multiverseid\': 621475}, {\'name\': \'Espadas en guadañas\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador gana una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los hobbits llamaban "mathom" a cualquier cosa para la que no tuviesen un uso inmediato pero no quisiesen tirar. Sus moradas eran aptas para estar bastante llenas de mathoms.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92956de-7273-4f1b-89fb-af5fc8d95a40\', \'multiverseId\': 621662}, \'multiverseid\': 621662}, {\'name\': \'Retour au pays\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur gagne un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Tout ce dont les hobbits n\'avaient pas une utilité immédiate, mais qu\'ils n\'étaient pour autant pas disposés à jeter, ils l\'appelaient mathom. Leurs demeures avaient tendance à être encombrées de mathoms.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dbd9d98-aa9b-4949-b2f4-0277bb737d13\', \'multiverseId\': 621849}, \'multiverseid\': 621849}, {\'name\': \'Da Spade a Spighe!\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore guadagna punti vita pari alla sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Hobbit chiamavano mathom tutto ciò che non sapevano come utilizzare, ma che non volevano eliminare. Le loro abitazioni erano destinate a riempirsi di mathom.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86460d65-f16c-47c8-bc6b-bcef74960f3d\', \'multiverseId\': 622036}, \'multiverseid\': 622036}, {\'name\': \'剣を鍬に\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ホビットたちは、今すぐ使うあてはないが捨てる気にはなれないものは何でもマゾムと呼んでいた。彼らの住居は、ともするとマゾムであふれていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66cd3ae3-2306-490a-b339-a23fea1a85cc\', \'multiverseId\': 622223}, \'multiverseid\': 622223}, {\'name\': \'Espadas em Arados\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Seu controlador ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao seu poder.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Qualquer coisa que para os Hobbits não tivesse utilidade imediata, mas não quisessem jogar fora, eles chamavam de mathom. Suas moradias eram propensas a ficarem deveras atulhadas de mathoms.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1324d2e5-32e7-40da-8cea-7592b791dfc9\', \'multiverseId\': 622410}, \'multiverseid\': 622410}]', '[{\'name\': \'Segeln in den Westen\', \'text\': \'Wille des Konzils — Beginnend mit dir stimmt jeder Spieler für Zurückkehren oder Einschiffen. Falls Zurückkehren mehr Stimmen erhält, bringt jeder Spieler bis zu zwei Karten aus seinem Friedhof auf seine Hand zurück, dann schickst du Segeln in den Westen ins Exil. Bei Gleichstand oder falls Einschiffen mehr Stimmen erhält, kann jeder Spieler seine Hand abwerfen und sieben Karten ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620415&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f1088a0-9cd0-40e0-9b9c-ea477f19df1e\', \'multiverseId\': 620415}, \'multiverseid\': 620415}, {\'name\': "Voiles vers l\'ouest", \'text\': "Volonté du conseil — En commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour renvoyer ou embarquer. Si renvoyer obtient plus de votes, chaque joueur renvoie dans sa main jusqu\'à deux cartes de son cimetière, puis vous exilez les Voiles vers l\'ouest. Si embarquer obtient plus de votes ou que les votes sont à égalité, chaque joueur peut se défausser de sa main et piocher sept cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0fef00b-2e62-4a24-8a01-21b5f7941311\', \'multiverseId\': 620483}, \'multiverseid\': 620483}, {\'name\': \'西方への船出\', \'text\': \'議決 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「帰還」または「出航」のいずれかに投票する。「帰還」がより多くの票を得たなら、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分の墓地にあるカード最大２枚を自分の手札に戻す。その後、あなたは西方への船出を追放する。「出航」がより多くの票を得た、または同数なら、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ「自分の手札を捨ててカード７枚を引く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69fb0511-9fcf-40ad-9b73-70fbf6326eb7\', \'multiverseId\': 620551}, \'multiverseid\': 620551}, {\'name\': \'向西远航\', \'text\': \'议定～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「返乡」或「启程」。若返乡票数较多，则每位牌手各将至多两张牌从其坟墓场移回其手上，然后你放逐向西远航。若启程票数较多或两者同票，则每位牌手各可以弃掉其手牌并抓七张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f14e8aff-15bd-4aab-9259-4794bdf66cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 620619}, \'multiverseid\': 620619}]', '[{\'name\': \'Segeln in den Westen\', \'text\': \'Wille des Konzils — Beginnend mit dir stimmt jeder Spieler für Zurückkehren oder Einschiffen. Falls Zurückkehren mehr Stimmen erhält, bringt jeder Spieler bis zu zwei Karten aus seinem Friedhof auf seine Hand zurück, dann schickst du Segeln in den Westen ins Exil. Bei Gleichstand oder falls Einschiffen mehr Stimmen erhält, kann jeder Spieler seine Hand abwerfen und sieben Karten ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620826&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a4a17f3-7ac8-41a8-a66c-1b68d2f3abc2\', \'multiverseId\': 620826}, \'multiverseid\': 620826}, {\'name\': \'Navegar hacia el Oeste\', \'text\': \'Voluntad del consejo — Comenzando contigo, cada jugador vota regresar o embarcar. Si regresar consigue más votos, cada jugador regresa hasta dos cartas de su cementerio a su mano. Luego, exilia Navegar hacia el Oeste. Si embarcar consigue más votos o el voto acaba en empate, cada jugador puede descartar su mano y robar siete cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5451deaf-19e1-4052-a2f2-23c9635a4548\', \'multiverseId\': 620898}, \'multiverseid\': 620898}, {\'name\': "Voiles vers l\'ouest", \'text\': "Volonté du conseil — En commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour renvoyer ou embarquer. Si renvoyer obtient plus de votes, chaque joueur renvoie dans sa main jusqu\'à deux cartes de son cimetière, puis vous exilez les Voiles vers l\'ouest. Si embarquer obtient plus de votes ou que les votes sont à égalité, chaque joueur peut se défausser de sa main et piocher sept cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620970&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e089307f-45fc-426b-9acd-71eb727879ca\', \'multiverseId\': 620970}, \'multiverseid\': 620970}, {\'name\': \'Navigare a Ovest\', \'text\': \'Volontà del concilio — A partire da te, ogni giocatore vota per tornare o per imbarcarsi. Se tornare ottiene più voti, ogni giocatore riprende in mano fino a due carte dal proprio cimitero, poi tu esili Navigare a Ovest. Se imbarcarsi ottiene più voti o il voto è un pareggio, ogni giocatore può scartare la propria mano e pescare sette carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f50f8745-76e8-47a1-a655-52128e50d429\', \'multiverseId\': 621042}, \'multiverseid\': 621042}, {\'name\': \'西方への船出\', \'text\': \'議決 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「帰還」または「出航」のいずれかに投票する。「帰還」がより多くの票を得たなら、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分の墓地にあるカード最大２枚を自分の手札に戻す。その後、あなたは西方への船出を追放する。「出航」がより多くの票を得た、または同数なら、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ「自分の手札を捨ててカード７枚を引く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7c9375c-41e9-46dd-a32d-945d2df3f6d6\', \'multiverseId\': 621114}, \'multiverseid\': 621114}, {\'name\': \'Navegar para o Oeste\', \'text\': \'Vontade do conselho — A começar por você, cada jogador vota em voltar ou embarcar. Se voltar receber mais votos, cada jogador devolve até dois cards do próprio cemitério para a própria mão. Depois, você exila Navegar para o Oeste. Se embarcar receber mais votos ou a votação ficar empatada, cada jogador pode descartar a própria mão e comprar sete cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69adbc16-62dd-4cfc-a08e-9d4777e6d160\', \'multiverseId\': 621186}, \'multiverseid\': 621186}, {\'name\': \'向西远航\', \'text\': \'议定～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「返乡」或「启程」。若返乡票数较多，则每位牌手各将至多两张牌从其坟墓场移回其手上，然后你放逐向西远航。若启程票数较多或两者同票，则每位牌手各可以弃掉其手牌并抓七张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ce419c-841f-4877-bba5-6bb705bc0b34\', \'multiverseId\': 621258}, \'multiverseid\': 621258}]', '[{\'name\': \'Segen des Wunscherfüllers\', \'text\': \'Ziehe vier Karten.\\nUmwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Drei Ringe den Elbenkönigen im Himmelslicht,\\nsieben den Zwergenfürsten, in ihren Hallen aus Stein,\\nneun den Menschen, dem Tode geweiht,\\neiner dem Dunklen Herrscher auf seinem Thron,\\nim Lande Mordor, wo die Schatten drohn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a259783e-28f1-4037-a01d-c27f3dcdfef2\', \'multiverseId\': 621482}, \'multiverseid\': 621482}, {\'name\': \'Bendición del Otorgadeseos\', \'text\': \'Roba cuatro cartas.\\nCiclo {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Tres Anillos para los reyes elfos bajo el firmamento.\\nSiete para los señores enanos en casas de piedra.\\nNueve para los hombres mortales condenados al fallecimiento.\\nUno para el Señor Oscuro, que desde el trono sombrío medra\\nen la Tierra de Mordor, donde las sombras tienen su aposento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab064aef-fdb0-4608-be97-bea352a30bf0\', \'multiverseId\': 621669}, \'multiverseid\': 621669}, {\'name\': "Faveur de l\'accordeur de souhaits", \'text\': \'Piochez quatre cartes.\\nRecyclage {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Trois Anneaux pour les Rois elfes au grand air,\\nSept pour les Seigneurs nains qui de pierre firent leurs murs,\\nNeuf pour les Hommes mortels à la vie éphémère,\\nUn pour le Seigneur ténébreux sur son trône obscur\\nDans le pays de Mordor où les Ombres sont de fer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621856&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3a442d9-f7e1-484e-b300-e671b3da0f82\', \'multiverseId\': 621856}, \'multiverseid\': 621856}, {\'name\': \'Favore del Donadesideri\', \'text\': \'Pesca quattro carte.\\nCiclo {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tre Anelli ai Re degli Elfi sotto il cielo che risplende,\\nSette ai Principi dei Nani nelle loro rocche di pietra,\\nNove agli Uomini Mortali che la morte attende,\\nUno per l\'Oscuro Sire nella sua reggia tetra\\nNella Terra di Mordor, dove l\'Ombra scende.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b577dd07-b1d4-4347-8ace-0c8c7ec1743c\', \'multiverseId\': 622043}, \'multiverseid\': 622043}, {\'name\': \'願い与えの加護\', \'text\': \'カード４枚を引く。\\nサイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'三つの指輪は、空の下なるエルフの王に、\\n七つの指輪は、岩の館のドワーフの君に、\\n九つは、死すべきさだめの人の子に、\\n一つは、暗きみくらの冥王のため、\\n影よこたわるモルドールの国に。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abbe00a8-0e96-42dd-9c8b-e9dffd591d73\', \'multiverseId\': 622230}, \'multiverseid\': 622230}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva da Realizadora de Desejos\', \'text\': \'Compre quatro cards.\\nReciclar {1} ({1}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Três Anéis para os Reis Élficos sob o céu,\\nSete para os Senhores dos Anões em seus salões de pedra,\\nNove para os Homens Mortais, condenados a morrer.\\nUm para o Senhor Sombrio em seu sombrio trono\\nna terra de Mordor, onde ficam as Sombras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4134cb0-3d8a-4747-a50e-a83a4996ee3d\', \'multiverseId\': 622417}, \'multiverseid\': 622417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Selbstlose Junkerin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Selbstlose Junkerin ins Spiel kommt, verhindere allen Schaden, der dir in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn Schaden verhindert wird, der dir zugefügt würde, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Selbstlose Junkerin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621473&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5b8ed73-ad9f-47f9-baff-a5c8a0084ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 621473}, \'multiverseid\': 621473}, {\'name\': \'Escudera abnegada\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Escudera abnegada entre al campo de batalla, prevén todo el daño que se te fuera a hacer este turno.\\nSiempre que se prevenga daño que se te fuera a hacer, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Escudera abnegada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73ca62a-fd84-4938-8449-48f134f0e05f\', \'multiverseId\': 621660}, \'multiverseid\': 621660}, {\'name\': \'Écuyère dévouée\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Écuyère dévouée arrive sur le champ de bataille, prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient vous être infligées ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que des blessures qui devaient vous être infligées sont prévenues, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Écuyère dévouée.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'474cc08d-86c0-4dfb-882c-15eaaacc748f\', \'multiverseId\': 621847}, \'multiverseid\': 621847}, {\'name\': \'Scudiera Altruista\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Scudiera Altruista entra nel campo di battaglia, previeni tutto il danno che ti verrebbe inflitto in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta il danno che ti verrebbe inflitto viene prevenuto, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sulla Scudiera Altruista.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37b7435c-56ea-4b55-b28b-eb2f0395fde2\', \'multiverseId\': 622034}, \'multiverseid\': 622034}, {\'name\': \'無私の従者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n無私の従者が戦場に出たとき、このターン、あなたが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\nあなたが受けるダメージが軽減されるたび、無私の従者の上にその点数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83295e2a-9a19-4ad5-bc9f-68e138650558\', \'multiverseId\': 622221}, \'multiverseid\': 622221}, {\'name\': \'Escudeira Altruísta\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Escudeira Altruísta entrar no campo de batalha, previna todo o dano que seria causado a você neste turno.\\nToda vez que algum dano que seria causado a você for prevenido, coloque uma quantidade equivalente de marcadores +1/+1 em Escudeira Altruísta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e96065c-80b3-4e21-98aa-54bb25a0db00\', \'multiverseId\': 622408}, \'multiverseid\': 622408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sich entfaltende Wildnis\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Sich entfaltende Wildnis: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn der Winter zeigt den ersten Biss,\\nFels zerbirst im Frost der Nacht,\\ndie Teiche schwarz, die Bäume kahl,\\nder Wildnis Bosheit ist erwacht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'203564b0-3b33-4590-9712-b61dcefe388c\', \'multiverseId\': 621603}, \'multiverseid\': 621603}, {\'name\': \'Terrenos expansivos\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar los Terrenos expansivos: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando el invierno comienza a morder\\ny las piedras crujen en la noche helada;\\ncuando los árboles empiezan a pender\\ncuidado con viajar por tierra no domada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bbde019-c312-4012-9a95-cbf66eb41bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 621790}, \'multiverseid\': 621790}, {\'name\': \'Étendues sauvages en évolution\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifiez les Étendues sauvages en évolution : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Lorsque l\'hiver fait sentir sa morsure\\nEt que les pierres craquent dans la nuit gelée,\\nLorsque les étangs sont noirs et les arbres dénudés,\\nGare à qui, dans les terres sauvages, s\'aventure.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621977&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4118469f-98f7-4de1-84a7-10e208b10954\', \'multiverseId\': 621977}, \'multiverseid\': 621977}, {\'name\': \'Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica le Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Quando incomincia a mordere l\'inverno\\nE nella notte gelida scricchiolano i sassi,\\nQuando gli stagni sono neri e gli alberi un inferno,\\nÈ pericoloso nelle Terre Selvagge avviare i propri passi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'168315d8-332f-410d-97d9-f69740146d24\', \'multiverseId\': 622164}, \'multiverseid\': 622164}, {\'name\': \'進化する未開地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 進化する未開地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'身を切る冬が訪れて、\\n夜寒に石の割れる時、\\n池は黒々、木は裸、\\n荒野をゆくは身の因果。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32bd0dc2-4888-4766-8b32-9dd8549dbf67\', \'multiverseId\': 622351}, \'multiverseid\': 622351}, {\'name\': \'Terras em Desenvolvimento\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique Terras em Desenvolvimento: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando o inverno se anuncia\\ne as pedras racham na noite fria,\\ncom árvores nuas e lagos negros,\\nfunesto é o passo nos ermos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b14cedb-7223-45a8-89fc-b6ab833d8169\', \'multiverseId\': 622538}, \'multiverseid\': 622538}]', '[{\'name\': \'Siechen\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen erhalten -4/-4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Den Pflegern schien es, dass die Krankheit besonders schwer auf dem Halbling und der Herrin von Rohan lastete. Bald begannen sie, in der Finsternis zu versinken, und als die Sonne gen Westen wanderte, kroch ein grauer Schatten über ihre Gesichter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621499&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c94d5f-6c66-4c66-bc8a-ac544c1c32af\', \'multiverseId\': 621499}, \'multiverseid\': 621499}, {\'name\': \'Podredumbre\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas obtienen -4/-4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'A quienes velaban por los enfermos les parecía que este mal se había ensañado sobre todo con el mediano y la Dama de Rohan. Más pronto que tarde, los enfermos se sumieron en las tinieblas y, a medida que el sol descendía hacia el oeste, una sombra gris les cubrió los rostros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809ab1e0-918d-4738-9a9f-588d90b243d6\', \'multiverseId\': 621686}, \'multiverseid\': 621686}, {\'name\': \'Croupissement\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures gagnent -4/-4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Il semblait aux garde-malades que ce mal pesait lourdement sur le halfelin et sur la dame du Rohan. Ils sombrèrent bientôt dans les ténèbres, et tandis que le soleil passait à l\'ouest, une ombre grise rampa sur leur visage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'307f092f-467f-4195-8592-ede25ef70de9\', \'multiverseId\': 621873}, \'multiverseid\': 621873}, {\'name\': \'Languire\', \'text\': \'Tutte le creature prendono -4/-4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "A coloro che curavano i malati parve che l\'Halfling e la Dama di Rohan fossero stati duramente colpiti da quel male. Presto li videro immergersi nell\'oscurità e, man mano che il sole volgeva a occidente, un\'ombra grigia avanzava sui loro volti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b1702a2-b957-4a73-8867-f07d48a8a667\', \'multiverseId\': 622060}, \'multiverseid\': 622060}, {\'name\': \'衰滅\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－４/－４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'看護人たちには、ハーフリングとローハンの姫君にこの悪病が重苦しく覆い被さっているように思えた。やがて二人とも暗闇に落ち込んでゆき、陽が西に傾く頃には、灰色の影が彼らの顔を覆った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abe51fa1-4928-4817-9aaa-0687cc5c186c\', \'multiverseId\': 622247}, \'multiverseid\': 622247}, {\'name\': \'Debilitar\', \'text\': \'Todas as criaturas recebem -4/-4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Parecia aos cuidadores dos doentes que esse mal afligia mais pesadamente o pequenino e a Senhora de Rohan. Logo eles começaram a cair na escuridão e, conforme o sol virava para o oeste, uma sombra cinzenta lhes foi cobrindo o rosto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b61114f-b7c0-44d6-b21d-c133a73ca4ed\', \'multiverseId\': 622434}, \'multiverseid\': 622434}]', '[{\'name\': \'Siedefrost-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Siedefrost-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Insel- oder Gebirge-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Siedefrost-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Viel Rauch stieg um uns herum auf, siedender Dampf. Eis fiel wie Regen, als ich meinen Feind niederstreckte."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621609&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77278cfb-956f-4dfb-afad-d75ea58d30b7\', \'multiverseId\': 621609}, \'multiverseid\': 621609}, {\'name\': \'Maraña hervicongelada\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña hervicongelada entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Isla o de Montaña de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña hervicongelada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Una gran humareda de vapor y nubes se alzó a nuestro alrededor. El hielo cayó como lluvia y derribé a mi enemigo".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf2174cf-4d3d-4289-865f-305c1041e489\', \'multiverseId\': 621796}, \'multiverseid\': 621796}, {\'name\': \'Lacis pyrogel\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Lacis pyrogel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'île ou de montagne de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis pyrogel arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Une épaisse fumée s\'éleva autour de nous, des vapeurs brumeuses. La glace tombait telle la pluie alors que je jetais mon ennemi à terre. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621983&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c481d85-0632-47bc-b3a9-ab7f9d48449b\', \'multiverseId\': 621983}, \'multiverseid\': 621983}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Glaciardente\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Glaciardente entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Isola o Montagna dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Glaciardente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Un grande fumo s\\\'innalzò intorno a noi, vapori e foschie si sprigionarono. Il ghiaccio cadde come pioggia, mentre scaraventavo giù il mio nemico."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15bff2a0-6460-40f2-94b7-fdefc980fcb9\', \'multiverseId\': 622170}, \'multiverseid\': 622170}, {\'name\': \'凍沸の交錯\', \'text\': \'凍沸の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり島か山であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、凍沸の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「わしらの周りにはもうもうと煙が立ちこめた。靄であり、湯気であった。氷が雨と降った。わしは敵を投げ落とした。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abb2f422-9248-4968-9f22-981134d0177f\', \'multiverseId\': 622357}, \'multiverseid\': 622357}, {\'name\': \'Liame da Pirogeada\', \'text\': \'Conforme Liame da Pirogeada entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Ilha ou Montanha de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Liame da Pirogeada entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma grande fumaça se elevou à nossa volta, nuvem e vapor. O gelo caiu como uma chuva quando eu derrubei meu inimigo."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32892bd4-3f40-460e-bf39-6ef5a3b36cc6\', \'multiverseId\': 622544}, \'multiverseid\': 622544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenblütenhain\', \'text\': \'Der Sonnenblütenhain kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen Wald oder eine Ebene.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Blumen leuchteten rot und golden: Löwenmäulchen, Sonnenblumen und Kapuzinerkresse wuchsen die Mauern entlang und ragten in die runden Fenster hinein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621633&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47a209c4-b927-458a-ba36-88a90dcbb45d\', \'multiverseId\': 621633}, \'multiverseid\': 621633}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda Pétalo Solar\', \'text\': \'La Arboleda Pétalo Solar entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles un Bosque o una Llanura.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las flores brillaban en tonos dorados y rojizos; bocas de dragones, girasoles y capuchinas se extendían por las paredes de césped y se asomaban a las ventanas redondas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e566db-a531-468d-a523-3f868f8f977a\', \'multiverseId\': 621820}, \'multiverseid\': 621820}, {\'name\': \'Bosquet de Solpétal\', \'text\': \'Le Bosquet de Solpétal arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une forêt ou une plaine.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les fleurs brillaient, rouge et or : des gueules-de-loup, des tournesols et des capucines grimpant le long des murs bordant la pelouse et semblant regarder à l\'intérieur par les fenêtres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622007&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0715bae-793e-4061-9c35-aa7c881f798b\', \'multiverseId\': 622007}, \'multiverseid\': 622007}, {\'name\': \'Boschetto di Petali Solari\', \'text\': \'Il Boschetto di Petali Solari entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una Foresta o una Pianura.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Bocche di leone, girasoli, nasturzi rossi e gialli: i fiori si arrampicavano su per i muri facendo capolino dalle finestre rotonde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3270126c-0afe-4284-963c-8e12ef2db307\', \'multiverseId\': 622194}, \'multiverseid\': 622194}, {\'name\': \'陽花弁の木立ち\', \'text\': \'あなたが森や平地をコントロールしていないかぎり、陽花弁の木立ちはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'花は赤や黄金色に燃えさかっていた。金魚草にひまわり、金蓮花が芝土の土手壁のいたる所に生え、部屋の丸窓のあたりにまでつるを延ばしていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c98fce8-fa7c-4331-b6e8-844235e64ed5\', \'multiverseId\': 622381}, \'multiverseid\': 622381}, {\'name\': \'Bosque da Pétala Solar\', \'text\': \'Bosque da Pétala Solar entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma Floresta ou uma Planície.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As flores brilhavam, vermelhas e douradas: bocas-de-leão, girassóis e nastúrcios por toda a parede verde e espreitando nas janelas redondas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb88400-3edb-47e4-8e28-be823c705fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 622568}, \'multiverseid\': 622568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Im Zweiten Zeitalter bot Sauron noch keinen bösen Anblick. Er half den Elbenschmieden von Eregion, ihr Handwerk wurde mächtig, doch er lernte alle ihre Geheimnisse. Heimlich schmiedete er im Feuerberg den Einen Ring, um über sie zu herrschen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621581&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23217a5c-b649-46d4-9ea3-4f73d510488d\', \'multiverseId\': 621581}, \'multiverseid\': 621581}, {\'name\': \'Anillo solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Durante la Segunda Edad, Sauron no mostró ningún mal y los herreros elfos de Eregion recibieron su ayuda y se hicieron muy hábiles. Él aprendió todos sus secretos y traicionó su confianza. En secreto, forjó el Anillo Único en la Montaña de Fuego para dominarlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7837dde-3149-4229-8af5-bed3fbf26610\', \'multiverseId\': 621768}, \'multiverseid\': 621768}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Au Deuxième Âge, Sauron n\'était pas encore un mal à redouter. Les forgerons elfes d\'Eregion reçurent son aide et atteignirent le sommet de leur art, tandis qu\'il apprenait tous leurs secrets, avant de les trahir et de forger en secret, dans la Montagne de Feu, l\'Anneau Unique afin de devenir leur maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621955&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e512b7-4b3c-4606-9ef1-ccad8183f9ba\', \'multiverseId\': 621955}, \'multiverseid\': 621955}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Nella Seconda Era, Sauron non era ancora d\'aspetto malvagio e i Fabbri Elfi di Eregion accettarono il suo aiuto e diventarono potenti nella loro arte, mentre egli apprese tutti i loro segreti, ma li tradì e forgiò di nascosto nella Montagna di Fuoco l\'Unico Anello per dominarli.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eba4bf8-9e22-44e5-a2e0-3d8c921e4177\', \'multiverseId\': 622142}, \'multiverseid\': 622142}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'第二紀の頃、サウロンの見た目はまだ兇悪でなく、エレギオンの鍛冶はその助けを得て、ますます技量を磨いた。サウロン自身は彼らの秘伝をすべて習い覚えて裏切ると、すべての指輪を支配する一つの指輪を火の山でひそかに鋳造したのである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5bb2e32-f30c-401f-adf4-c0e34d080446\', \'multiverseId\': 622329}, \'multiverseid\': 622329}, {\'name\': \'Anel Solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Na Segunda Era, Sauron ainda não tinha uma aparência maligna, e os ferreiros élficos de Eregion receberam sua ajuda e se tornaram poderosos em suas artes, enquanto ele aprendeu todos os segredos deles e os traiu, e forjou secretamente na Montanha de Fogo o Um Anel para tornar-se mestre deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b738288-22f8-40db-8b79-ee2f3919e622\', \'multiverseId\': 622516}, \'multiverseid\': 622516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\\nOpfere die Sphäre des Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Noldor, vielleicht Fëanor selbst, fertigten die Palantíri vor so langer Zeit, dass sie nicht mehr in Jahren gemessen werden kann."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'710d7c6b-3dd2-4f18-97d9-9d0f5d8bb91b\', \'multiverseId\': 621573}, \'multiverseid\': 621573}, {\'name\': \'Esfera del comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\\nSacrificar la Esfera del comandante: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los Noldor, quizá el propio Fëanor, forjaron las palantíri en días tan remotos que el tiempo no puede medirse en años".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0510e1c4-5983-48cc-a74f-dd45ec05c9a9\', \'multiverseId\': 621760}, \'multiverseid\': 621760}, {\'name\': \'Sphère du commandant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.\\nSacrifiez la Sphère du commandant : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Les Noldors, peut-être même Fëanor en personne, forgèrent les palantíri il y a si longtemps que le temps ne peut être compté en années. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621947&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cd00382-b0cb-42b8-9ab2-9d37a773c126\', \'multiverseId\': 621947}, \'multiverseid\': 621947}, {\'name\': \'Sfera del Comandante\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.\\nSacrifica la Sfera del Comandante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"I palantíri furono fatti dai Noldor; forse l\\\'artefice fu proprio Fëanor, in giorni così lontani che il tempo non può misurarsi in anni."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d13daf-8374-46a9-869b-3bad9f918cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 622134}, \'multiverseid\': 622134}, {\'name\': \'統率者の宝球\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n統率者の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「ノルドールがパランティーリを作った。フェアノール自身が手を加えたかもしれぬ。年などで数えられぬ遠い遠い昔にな。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fc1be14-599a-47a1-8406-042934dc6fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 622321}, \'multiverseid\': 622321}, {\'name\': \'Esfera do Comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\\nSacrifique Esfera do Comandante: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Ñoldor, talvez o próprio Fëanor, criaram as palantíri em dias tão remotos que não se pode medir esse tempo em anos."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04baad9-b82b-4755-a096-d630c4751a12\', \'multiverseId\': 622508}, \'multiverseid\': 622508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stilles Dickicht\', \'text\': \'Das Stille Dickicht kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\nUmwandlung {G} ({G}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Willkommen in Caras Galadon! Hier liegt die Stadt der Galadrim, wo Fürst Celeborn wohnt, und Galadriel, die Herrin von Lórien."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621638&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba7fa93e-177d-4e5a-89dc-727beb9775ea\', \'multiverseId\': 621638}, \'multiverseid\': 621638}, {\'name\': \'Maleza tranquila\', \'text\': \'La Maleza tranquila entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\nCiclo {G}. ({G}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Bienvenidos a Caras Galadon! Esta es la ciudad de los Galadrim, donde moran el Señor Celeborn y Galadriel, la Dama de Lórien".\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c08e4ce4-997f-4260-81cc-17838d74cc4f\', \'multiverseId\': 621825}, \'multiverseid\': 621825}, {\'name\': \'Halliers tranquilles\', \'text\': \'Les Halliers tranquilles arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\nRecyclage {G} ({G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Bienvenue à Caras Galadhon ! Dans cette ville des Galadhrims résident le seigneur Celeborn et Galadriel, la Dame de Lórien. »\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622012&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8b3a70-9089-417e-815a-c9861f1c85fa\', \'multiverseId\': 622012}, \'multiverseid\': 622012}, {\'name\': \'Boschetto Tranquillo\', \'text\': \'Il Boschetto Tranquillo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\nCiclo {G} ({G}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Benvenuti a Caras Galadhon! Questa è la città dei Galadhrim dove dimorano il Sire Celeborn e Galadriel, la Dama di Lórien."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9484b673-9a5e-4f2d-97be-c0e8eab56fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 622199}, \'multiverseid\': 622199}, {\'name\': \'平穏な茂み\', \'text\': \'平穏な茂みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\nサイクリング {G}（{G}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「ようこそカラス・ガラゾンへ！ここがケレボルンの殿とロリアンのガラドリエルの奥方が住まい給うガラズリムの都です。」\\n――ハルディア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3afc120-c3bc-4ddb-a71a-31ea8b657497\', \'multiverseId\': 622386}, \'multiverseid\': 622386}, {\'name\': \'Bosque Sereno\', \'text\': \'Bosque Sereno entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\nReciclar {G} ({G}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Bem-vindos a Caras Galadhon! Esta é a cidade dos Galadhrim, onde moram o Senhor Celeborn e Galadriel, a Senhora de Lórien.\\n— Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'745d8942-6867-49ce-a9ed-858fe9af6476\', \'multiverseId\': 622573}, \'multiverseid\': 622573}]', "[{'name': 'Talisman der Überzeugung', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Der Talisman der Überzeugung fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Faramir und Éowyn traten vor und legten Hand in Hand; und alle Anwesenden tranken auf sie und freuten sich.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621582&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0248d6f1-c27f-42b1-aa20-ffed27993b6c', 'multiverseId': 621582}, 'multiverseid': 621582}, {'name': 'Talismán de convicción', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}. El Talismán de convicción te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Faramir y Éowyn se adelantaron y se tomaron de la mano. Todos los presentes brindaron por ellos y se alegraron.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621769&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff2a2e3a-c3cf-4edb-8ea7-0710e3796a5a', 'multiverseId': 621769}, 'multiverseid': 621769}, {'name': 'Talisman de conviction', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. Le Talisman de conviction vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Faramir et Éowyn se levèrent et se tinrent main dans la main ; et tous ceux qui étaient là burent à leur santé et furent heureux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621956&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd09aff38-7ec5-43c9-af60-ad73a19b34ec', 'multiverseId': 621956}, 'multiverseid': 621956}, {'name': 'Talismano della Convinzione', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}. Il Talismano della Convinzione ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Faramir ed Éowyn si fecero avanti e si presero per mano; tutti bevvero alla loro salute e furono felici.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622143&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '166ecedb-6e60-46f8-b67a-07254a4b5424', 'multiverseId': 622143}, 'multiverseid': 622143}, {'name': '確信のタリスマン', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。確信のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'ファラミアとエオウィンは前に立って手を繋ぎあった。そして参会者は皆、二人を祝って乾杯し、喜び合った。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622330&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38f860d2-aa22-41e6-a2dd-ae870bd9cdd1', 'multiverseId': 622330}, 'multiverseid': 622330}, {'name': 'Talismã da Convicção', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}. Talismã da Convicção causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Faramir e Éowyn se adiantaram e deram as mãos; e todos brindaram, beberam e se alegraram.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622517&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83cb9850-e556-4721-a11b-0ca7f1f433c8', 'multiverseId': 622517}, 'multiverseid': 622517}]", '[{\'name\': \'Talisman des Fortschritts\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}. Der Talisman des Fortschritts fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„So wird die Freundschaft zwischen der Mark und Gondor mit einem neuen Bund besiegelt, und umso mehr erfreut es mich."\\n—Éomer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93c9f75c-68fd-48a5-a2ce-adf594713713\', \'multiverseId\': 621583}, \'multiverseid\': 621583}, {\'name\': \'Talismán del progreso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}. El Talismán del progreso te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Y así, queda sellada la amistad entre la Marca y Gondor con un nuevo vínculo, y esto me regocija aún más".\\n—Éomer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d88829-a74b-46fc-829a-1b730028a35f\', \'multiverseId\': 621770}, \'multiverseid\': 621770}, {\'name\': \'Talisman de progrès\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}. Le Talisman de progrès vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Telle est l\'amitié de la Marche et du Gondor, tissée d\'un nouveau lien, et je me réjouis d\'autant plus. »\\n—Éomer", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621957&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ae0f254-3218-496a-92b2-583b59877217\', \'multiverseId\': 621957}, \'multiverseid\': 621957}, {\'name\': \'Talismano del Progresso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}. Il Talismano del Progresso ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"In tal modo un nuovo vincolo rinsalda l\\\'amicizia di Gondor e del Mark, procurandomi ancora maggiore felicità."\\n—Éomer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41a080d-02d6-4051-adbd-13a40b79b3aa\', \'multiverseId\': 622144}, \'multiverseid\': 622144}, {\'name\': \'発展のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。発展のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「これで、マークとゴンドールの友情は新たな絆で結ばれることとなる。私のいっそうの喜びです。」\\n――エーオメル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5b1ae7b-8d16-4e37-909c-da20d0adb8fa\', \'multiverseId\': 622331}, \'multiverseid\': 622331}, {\'name\': \'Talismã do Progresso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}. Talismã do Progresso causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"E assim a amizade entre a Marca e Gondor se fortalece com um novo laço, e mais ainda eu me alegro."\\n— Éomer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27ea67ed-ba70-47a7-a945-7f93c467bfdd\', \'multiverseId\': 622518}, \'multiverseid\': 622518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thron der Oberstadt\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, opfere den Thron der Oberstadt: Du wirst zum Monarchen.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der hohe Thron war leer. Am Fuße seines Podestes, auf der niedrigsten Stufe, die breit und tief war, stand ein steinerner Stuhl, schwarz und schmucklos, für den Truchsess von Gondor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621636&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef45685-4c27-448b-a245-b9cb93a367fe\', \'multiverseId\': 621636}, \'multiverseid\': 621636}, {\'name\': \'Trono de la Alta Ciudad\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrificar el Trono de la Alta Ciudad: Te conviertes en el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El gran trono estaba vacío. Al pie del estrado, en el primer peldaño, que era ancho y profundo, había un asiento, negro y sencillo, para el Senescal de Gondor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9d9ff5-21da-49a5-9476-79aebd10c055\', \'multiverseId\': 621823}, \'multiverseid\': 621823}, {\'name\': \'Trône de la Cité Haute\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifiez le Trône de la Cité Haute : Vous devenez le monarque.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Le grand trône était vide. Au pied de l\'estrade, sur la première marche large et spacieuse, se trouvait un siège de pierre, noir et sans ornement, pour l\'Intendant du Gondor.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622010&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'140760f5-92a2-4cec-b66a-ef0dd3675702\', \'multiverseId\': 622010}, \'multiverseid\': 622010}, {\'name\': \'Trono della Città Alta\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifica il Trono della Città Alta: Diventi il monarca.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "L\'alto trono era vuoto. Ai piedi della scalinata, sul gradino inferiore, largo e profondo, vi era una sedia di pietra nera e disadorna per il Sovrintendente di Gondor.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f08cba-ff54-4d55-bbc4-34fc6e9dc558\', \'multiverseId\': 622197}, \'multiverseid\': 622197}, {\'name\': \'高層都市の玉座\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}, 高層都市の玉座を生け贄に捧げる：あなたが統治者になる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'高き玉座に坐る者はいなかった。壇の下、広くて奥行きのある一番下の踏段に、ゴンドールの執政の、黒くて飾りのない石の椅子があった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'194f35d1-4cc1-4271-a7ca-d88d80479f7d\', \'multiverseId\': 622384}, \'multiverseid\': 622384}, {\'name\': \'Trono da Cidade Alta\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifique Trono da Cidade Alta: Você se torna o monarca.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'O alto trono estava vazio. Na base de sua plataforma, no degrau mais baixo, que era largo e profundo, havia uma cadeira de pedra, preta e sem adornos, para o Regente de Gondor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e14321a7-8dc3-423b-aded-3409a96d372b\', \'multiverseId\': 622571}, \'multiverseid\': 622571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tobendes Kriegsmammut\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nUmwandlung {X}{2}{R} ({X}{2}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Tobende Kriegsmammut umwandelst, zerstöre bis zu X Artefakte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': \'Die Mûmakil der Harad waren gewaltige Bestien, wie wandelnde Häuser, die riesige Türme und Kriegsmaschinen ziehen konnten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620792&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cffdafc8-98a0-48f4-b4cb-89801feb4821\', \'multiverseId\': 620792}, \'multiverseid\': 620792}, {\'name\': \'Mamut de guerra desenfrenado\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCiclo {X}{2}{R}. ({X}{2}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Mamut de guerra desenfrenado, destruye hasta X artefactos objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'Los mûmakil de Harad eran bestias imponentes, como casas ambulantes, capaces de arrastrar grandes torres y máquinas hacia la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f47af582-5a47-48bd-8a43-05a1afeb644b\', \'multiverseId\': 620864}, \'multiverseid\': 620864}, {\'name\': \'Mammouth de guerre déchaîné\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nRecyclage {X}{2}{R} ({X}{2}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Mammouth de guerre déchaîné, détruisez jusqu\'à X artefacts ciblés.", \'type\': \'Créature : éléphant\', \'flavor\': "Les Mûmakil de Harad étaient d\'immenses bêtes, telles des maisons en marche, capables de charrier d\'énormes tours et des machines de guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620936&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daeb7830-1369-4f2f-a1b1-f0d429be7d41\', \'multiverseId\': 620936}, \'multiverseid\': 620936}, {\'name\': \'Olifante da Guerra Infuriato\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nCiclo {X}{2}{R} ({X}{2}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli l\'Olifante da Guerra Infuriato, distruggi fino a X artefatti bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'I mûmakil degli Harad erano delle bestie enormi, come case ambulanti in grado di trainare in guerra torri immense e macchine imponenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5260180a-3b40-48aa-bee5-6b4224a7e33a\', \'multiverseId\': 621008}, \'multiverseid\': 621008}, {\'name\': \'猛り狂うウォー・マンモス\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nサイクリング{X}{2}{R}（{X}{2}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたが猛り狂うウォー・マンモスをサイクリングしたとき、アーティファクト最大Ｘ個を対象とする。それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': \'ハラドのムーマキルは偉大な獣であった。まるで動く家のように、それは巨塔や兵器を戦場へと引きずり出すことができた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c72b6e-2e53-4c6e-ae23-bbc7dc55bbc9\', \'multiverseId\': 621080}, \'multiverseid\': 621080}, {\'name\': \'Mamute de Guerra Enfurecido\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nReciclar {X}{2}{R} ({X}{2}{R}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você reciclar Mamute de Guerra Enfurecido, destrua até X artefatos alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'Os Mûmakil de Harad eram grandes feras, como casas ambulantes, capazes de arrastar grandes torres e máquinas para a guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05bc3701-14af-48f6-b085-4bc433fe445e\', \'multiverseId\': 621152}, \'multiverseid\': 621152}, {\'name\': \'莽闯战长毛象\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n循环{X}{2}{R}（{X}{2}{R}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环莽闯战长毛象时，消灭至多X个目标神器。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～象\', \'flavor\': \'哈拉德的猛犸都是庞大巨兽，犹如行走的房屋一般，足以将巨型攻城塔与机械拖向战场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fdfe6ea-f6dd-4cda-af5c-c5f80043c84b\', \'multiverseId\': 621224}, \'multiverseid\': 621224}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tobendes Kriegsmammut\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nUmwandlung {X}{2}{R}\\nWenn du das Tobende Kriegsmammut umwandelst, zerstöre bis zu X Artefakte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': \'Die Mûmakil der Harad waren gewaltige Bestien, wie wandelnde Häuser, die riesige Türme und Kriegsmaschinen ziehen konnten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620383&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4ad8235-5aa6-4ed5-a067-03fa9d111f68\', \'multiverseId\': 620383}, \'multiverseid\': 620383}, {\'name\': \'Mammouth de guerre déchaîné\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nRecyclage {X}{2}{R}\\nQuand vous recyclez le Mammouth de guerre déchaîné, détruisez jusqu\'à X artefacts ciblés.", \'type\': \'Créature : éléphant\', \'flavor\': "Les Mûmakil de Harad étaient d\'immenses bêtes, telles des maisons en marche, capables de charrier d\'énormes tours et des machines de guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d79a48f-b8b7-41bb-aa50-05c9813e1edd\', \'multiverseId\': 620451}, \'multiverseid\': 620451}, {\'name\': \'猛り狂うウォー・マンモス\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nサイクリング{X}{2}{R}\\nあなたが猛り狂うウォー・マンモスをサイクリングしたとき、アーティファクト最大Ｘ個を対象とする。それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': \'ハラドのムーマキルは偉大な獣であった。まるで動く家のように、それは巨塔や兵器を戦場へと引きずり出すことができた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ad31e7-0a70-4c3a-b0e8-d347cd252668\', \'multiverseId\': 620519}, \'multiverseid\': 620519}, {\'name\': \'莽闯战长毛象\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n循环{X}{2}{R}\\n当你循环莽闯战长毛象时，消灭至多X个目标神器。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～象\', \'flavor\': \'哈拉德的猛犸都是庞大巨兽，犹如行走的房屋一般，足以将巨型攻城塔与机械拖往战场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf54b52c-1969-4a30-b65d-b14f96fe4aab\', \'multiverseId\': 620587}, \'multiverseid\': 620587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tote Flussmündung\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Tote Flussmündung ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Insel- oder Sumpf-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt die Tote Flussmündung getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Das Wasser des Morgulduin lag still und dampfend da, doch der sich windende Dunst, der aus ihm aufstieg, war tödlich kalt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621596&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fa83349-b922-45ab-a7c0-a0764b421eff\', \'multiverseId\': 621596}, \'multiverseid\': 621596}, {\'name\': \'Estuario angosto\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Estuario angosto entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Isla o Pantano de tu mano. Si no lo haces, el Estuario angosto entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El agua del Morgulduin corría en silencio y humeaba, pero el vapor que se elevaba en espirales era tan frío que resultaba letal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931255de-aa8e-4a52-9819-377301d0d62f\', \'multiverseId\': 621783}, \'multiverseid\': 621783}, {\'name\': \'Estuaire asphyxié\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Estuaire asphyxié arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'île ou de marais de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, l\'Estuaire asphyxié arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les eaux du Morgulduin étaient silencieuses et fumantes, mais les volutes de vapeur qui s\'en élevaient étaient froides comme la mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621970&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d207b3b-16e7-4775-8af1-2a9c497bd03e\', \'multiverseId\': 621970}, \'multiverseid\': 621970}, {\'name\': \'Estuario Soffocato\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Estuario Soffocato entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Isola o Palude dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Estuario Soffocato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "L\'acqua del Morgulduin scorreva silente e fumante, ma il vapore che s\'innalzava torcendosi era freddo come la morte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bbae0e1-2730-446f-b0ed-52a3b283f96a\', \'multiverseId\': 622157}, \'multiverseid\': 622157}, {\'name\': \'詰まった河口\', \'text\': \'詰まった河口が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり島や沼であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、詰まった河口はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'モルグルドゥインの流れは音を立てず、靄を立ち昇らせている。しかし渦を巻くその靄は寒気立つような冷たさだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19fe992e-1e40-4633-8994-738926909d49\', \'multiverseId\': 622344}, \'multiverseid\': 622344}, {\'name\': \'Estuário Estrangulado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Estuário Estrangulado entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Ilha ou Pântano de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Estuário Estrangulado entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A água do Morgulduin era silenciosa e soltava um vapor, mas a espiral de vapor que subia era mortalmente fria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1304e468-28b9-435b-93bd-545f87b05507\', \'multiverseId\': 622531}, \'multiverseid\': 622531}]', '[{\'name\': \'Toxische Sintflut\', \'text\': \'Bezahle X Lebenspunkte als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nAlle Kreaturen erhalten -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst Sams Vision in Galadriels Spiegel hatte ihn darauf nicht vorbereitet. Der Alte Gutshof auf der Westseite war niedergerissen worden, und an seiner Stelle standen Reihen von teergedeckten Schuppen. Alle Kastanienbäume waren verschwunden. Die Wälle und Hecken waren ruiniert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1ce7e3e-74a7-4d5d-b533-812488c424e7\', \'multiverseId\': 621506}, \'multiverseid\': 621506}, {\'name\': \'Diluvio tóxico\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, paga X vidas.\\nTodas las criaturas obtienen -X/-X hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Ni la visión de Sam en el espejo lo preparó para ese momento. Habían demolido la Vieja Alquería de la orilla occidental y en su lugar había unas hileras de cobertizos alquitranados. Los castaños habían desaparecido. Los bancos y setos, rotos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d71c3c99-4f44-441a-b8fc-f947661e7d94\', \'multiverseId\': 621693}, \'multiverseid\': 621693}, {\'name\': \'Déluge toxique\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, payez X points de vie.\\nToutes les créatures gagnent -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Même la vision de Sam dans le Miroir ne l\'avait préparé. La vieille grange du côté ouest avait été démolie, et à sa place se trouvaient des rangées d\'abris goudronnés. Tous les marronniers avaient disparu. Les berges et les haies étaient détruites.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621880&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e9cd90e-59c3-4460-89b2-a505ad4262c7\', \'multiverseId\': 621880}, \'multiverseid\': 621880}, {\'name\': \'Diluvio Tossico\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, paga X punti vita.\\nTutte le creature prendono -X/-X fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Neppure la visione apparsa a Sam nello Specchio lo aveva preparato. Il Vecchio Granaio sul lato occidentale era stato demolito e sostituito da filari di orribili capannoni. Tutti i castagni erano scomparsi. Gli argini e le siepi erano rotti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42197905-784e-4537-a84a-4df1d4333faf\', \'multiverseId\': 622067}, \'multiverseid\': 622067}, {\'name\': \'毒の濁流\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、Ｘ点のライフを支払う。\\nターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'サムは鏡の中で幻影を見ていたが、それですら打ちのめされた。西側の古い穀倉は取り壊され、代わりにタールを塗った小屋が幾列も並んでいた。栗の木は一本も残ってはいなかった。土手は崩れ、生け垣は破れていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f500e9c-7ea1-407c-996d-1d9ede3f9da5\', \'multiverseId\': 622254}, \'multiverseid\': 622254}, {\'name\': \'Dilúvio Tóxico\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, pague X pontos de vida.\\nTodas as criaturas recebem -X/-X até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nem mesmo a visão de Sam no Espelho o preparara para aquilo. A Velha Granja do lado oeste havia sido derrubada e em seu lugar havia fileiras de cabanas betumadas. Não havia mais castanheiras. As ribanceiras e as cercas vivas estavam aos pedaços.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db7a4b8d-8ef7-4a3b-bffd-ecf4bafe5529\', \'multiverseId\': 622441}, \'multiverseid\': 622441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Treue dem Königreich\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn Treue dem Königreich ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nDer Monarch kontrolliert die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und kann dich nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'708b33b1-231f-4c9f-8370-f4b2a7c0f9d9\', \'multiverseId\': 620370}, \'multiverseid\': 620370}, {\'name\': \'Allégeance au royaume\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand l\'Allégeance au royaume arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nLe monarque contrôle la créature enchantée.\\nLa créature enchantée attaque à chaque combat si possible et ne peut pas vous attaquer.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce28f7e8-84cf-4b7a-bbed-571ea6350332\', \'multiverseId\': 620438}, \'multiverseid\': 620438}, {\'name\': \'王国への忠誠\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n王国への忠誠が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\n統治者はエンチャントしているクリーチャーをコントロールする。\\n各戦闘で、エンチャントしているクリーチャーは可能なら攻撃し、あなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1014dba7-7aaa-48b5-9410-408ca12e8b70\', \'multiverseId\': 620506}, \'multiverseid\': 620506}, {\'name\': \'忠于王土\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当忠于王土进战场时，你成为君主。\\n所结附的生物由君主操控。\\n所结附的生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且它不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9558dc3-6058-430b-abde-30416b074f56\', \'multiverseId\': 620574}, \'multiverseid\': 620574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Treue dem Königreich\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn Treue dem Königreich ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nDer Monarch kontrolliert die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und kann dich nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620779&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291295eb-fef1-4eee-9094-461793e99b31\', \'multiverseId\': 620779}, \'multiverseid\': 620779}, {\'name\': \'Lealtad al reino\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la Lealtad al reino entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nEl monarca controla la criatura encantada.\\nLa criatura encantada ataca cada combate si puede y no puede atacarte.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2692064b-a4db-4c03-a42e-8c20efe39978\', \'multiverseId\': 620851}, \'multiverseid\': 620851}, {\'name\': \'Allégeance au royaume\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand l\'Allégeance au royaume arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nLe monarque contrôle la créature enchantée.\\nLa créature enchantée attaque à chaque combat si possible et ne peut pas vous attaquer.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66b186c4-15eb-4d71-a0ff-d5de5b1e4cd9\', \'multiverseId\': 620923}, \'multiverseid\': 620923}, {\'name\': \'Fedeltà al Regno\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Fedeltà al Regno entra nel campo di battaglia, diventi il monarca.\\nIl monarca controlla la creatura incantata.\\nLa creatura incantata attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo, e non può attaccare te.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c458809-4bda-4df0-ad51-1ca4b1c896ec\', \'multiverseId\': 620995}, \'multiverseid\': 620995}, {\'name\': \'王国への忠誠\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n王国への忠誠が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\n統治者はエンチャントしているクリーチャーをコントロールする。\\n各戦闘で、エンチャントしているクリーチャーは可能なら攻撃し、あなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8df6a067-5887-4f1e-a773-34d24c190c68\', \'multiverseId\': 621067}, \'multiverseid\': 621067}, {\'name\': \'Fidelidade ao Reino\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Fidelidade ao Reino entra no campo de batalha, você se torna o monarca.\\nO monarca controla a criatura encantada.\\nA criatura encantada ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e não pode atacar você.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59eefd99-3cca-431c-b3f3-f5f8058b4d53\', \'multiverseId\': 621139}, \'multiverseid\': 621139}, {\'name\': \'忠于疆域\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当忠于疆域进战场时，你成为君主。\\n所结附的生物由君主操控。\\n所结附的生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且它不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9233d8f0-6a71-4637-8ad4-acf2eea1fa24\', \'multiverseId\': 621211}, \'multiverseid\': 621211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Treuloses Plündern\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann zwei Karten ab.\\nRückblende {2}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hier, Herr, ist Herugrim, die uralte Klinge. Sie wurde in Schlangenzunges Kammer gefunden. Dort sind auch viele andere Dinge, die vermisst wurden."\\n—Háma, zu Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'563b1596-a490-45b9-a133-85d49f5d72cd\', \'multiverseId\': 621512}, \'multiverseid\': 621512}, {\'name\': \'Saqueo infiel\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas, luego descarta dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hela aquí, vuestra antigua espada, mi señor: Herugrim. Se encontraba en los aposentos de Lengua de Serpiente. Hay allí muchas otras cosas que se creían perdidas".\\n—Háma a Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf5b001-8cf8-4143-8c7b-9534d0aad59f\', \'multiverseId\': 621699}, \'multiverseid\': 621699}, {\'name\': \'Pillage sans foi\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Mon seigneur, voici Herugrim, votre ancienne lame. Nous l\'avons trouvée dans la chambre de Langue de Serpent. Ainsi que bien d\'autres choses que les hommes avaient perdues. »\\n—Háma, à Théoden", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621886&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41295f3e-c914-43cc-a827-0140894182d1\', \'multiverseId\': 621886}, \'multiverseid\': 621886}, {\'name\': \'Saccheggio degli Infedeli\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte, poi scarta due carte.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ecco a te, sire, Herugrim, la tua antica lama. La trovammo nella stanza di Vermilinguo. Là si trovano molte cose che gli Uomini credevano d\\\'aver perso."\\n—Háma a Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f1b7ee-0186-4253-b324-885b40d98860\', \'multiverseId\': 622073}, \'multiverseid\': 622073}, {\'name\': \'信仰無き物あさり\', \'text\': \'カード２枚を引き、その後、カード２枚を捨てる。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「殿、古より伝わりし名剣、ヘルグリムでございます。蛇の舌の部屋に見つけました。他にもいろいろ、皆が失くした物がはいっておりました。」\\n――ハーマ、セオデンへの言葉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a78fc3fb-798b-49d9-97c8-5e399989ccd1\', \'multiverseId\': 622260}, \'multiverseid\': 622260}, {\'name\': \'Pilhagem Infiel\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards e depois descarte dois cards.\\nRecapitular {2}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-a.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Aqui, senhor, está Herugrim, sua antiga espada. Foi achada no quarto de Língua de Cobra. Há lá muitas outras coisas de que os homens deram falta."\\n— Háma, a Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d56922b5-303f-43ca-ac81-db6e4bcb0691\', \'multiverseId\': 622447}, \'multiverseid\': 622447}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trostloser Leuchtturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Númenórer waren große Seefahrer geworden, die alle Meere ostwärts erkundeten, und sie begannen, sich nach dem Westen und den verbotenen Gewässern zu sehnen, und wünschten sich die Unsterblichkeit der Elben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621600&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'589d9f5a-a9a3-403e-9217-0b0a2a1503d9\', \'multiverseId\': 621600}, \'multiverseid\': 621600}, {\'name\': \'Faro abandonado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los númenóreanos, que eran grandes marineros y habían explorado todos los mares orientales, comenzaron a desear marchar hacia el Oeste y sus aguas prohibidas, pues anhelaban la inmortalidad de los elfos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74ccdd35-7f58-4e44-ac01-a43c0b021b9c\', \'multiverseId\': 621787}, \'multiverseid\': 621787}, {\'name\': \'Phare abandonné\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les Númenóréens avaient été de grands marins, explorant toutes les mers en direction de l\'est, et ils avaient commencé à se languir de l\'ouest et des eaux interdites, enviant l\'immortalité des elfes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621974&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'873dd94d-5902-4536-888a-2beb29d3165f\', \'multiverseId\': 621974}, \'multiverseid\': 621974}, {\'name\': \'Faro Diroccato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "I Númenoreani erano diventati grandi navigatori ed esploravano tutti i mari orientali. Incominciarono a guardare con desiderio alle acque proibite e all\'Occidente, e all\'immortalità degli Elfi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df4b3fa-2fed-490f-90e6-22f368711d87\', \'multiverseId\': 622161}, \'multiverseid\': 622161}, {\'name\': \'僻地の灯台\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}：カード１枚を引く。その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ヌーメノーレアンは優れた航海者になっており、東の海はことごとく探検し尽くしていた。彼らは西方と禁断の水域に憧れ始め、エルフの不死の命を望ましく思った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c1f6806-08f6-4b45-83dc-d529fee5c76b\', \'multiverseId\': 622348}, \'multiverseid\': 622348}, {\'name\': \'Farol Desolado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os Númenóreanos haviam se tornado grandes marinheiros, explorando todos os mares a leste, e começaram a ansiar pelo oeste e as águas proibidas, desejando a imortalidade dos Elfos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a26f085d-3f94-467d-aba0-c2d9f667a455\', \'multiverseId\': 622535}, \'multiverseid\': 622535}]', "[{'name': 'Tür der Schicksale', 'text': 'Sowie die Tür der Schicksale ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch des bestimmten Typs wirkst, lege eine Ladungsmarke auf die Tür der Schicksale.\\nKreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 für jede Ladungsmarke auf der Tür der Schicksale.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621574&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb45fd5c-443e-4f58-8321-170e9b4e7764', 'multiverseId': 621574}, 'multiverseid': 621574}, {'name': 'Puerta de los destinos', 'text': 'En cuanto la Puerta de los destinos entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo del tipo elegido, pon un contador de carga sobre la Puerta de los destinos.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1 por cada contador de carga sobre la Puerta de los destinos.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621761&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8d10176-68d8-4b20-a51c-de32755efa3b', 'multiverseId': 621761}, 'multiverseid': 621761}, {'name': 'Porte des Destinées', 'text': 'Au moment où la Porte des Destinées arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort du type choisi, mettez un marqueur « charge » sur la Porte des Destinées.\\nLes créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur la Porte des Destinées.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621948&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36a6152b-4c83-42c4-9293-0d2faefb5ab4', 'multiverseId': 621948}, 'multiverseid': 621948}, {'name': 'Porta dei Destini', 'text': 'Mentre la Porta dei Destini entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia del tipo scelto, metti un segnalino carica sulla Porta dei Destini.\\nLe creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+1 per ogni segnalino carica sulla Porta dei Destini.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622135&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '518c6886-91dd-4442-9b58-fcc5fc13a4bc', 'multiverseId': 622135}, 'multiverseid': 622135}, {'name': '運命の扉', 'text': '運命の扉が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがその選ばれたタイプの呪文を唱えるたび、運命の扉の上に蓄積カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプであるすべてのクリーチャーは、運命の扉の上にある蓄積カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622322&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8961779f-0479-45c7-b997-c5e87cdc2b2d', 'multiverseId': 622322}, 'multiverseid': 622322}, {'name': 'Porta dos Destinos', 'text': 'Conforme Porta dos Destinos entra no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica do tipo escolhido, coloque um marcador de carga em Porta dos Destinos.\\nAs criaturas que você controla do tipo escolhido recebem +1/+1 para cada marcador de carga em Porta dos Destinos.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622509&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac2f1449-30bf-4437-852e-1976bc78d1e0', 'multiverseId': 622509}, 'multiverseid': 622509}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unermüdliche Versorgerin\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein oder einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Eine Speise ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu." Ein Schatz ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Lembas ist stärkender als jede Speise der Menschen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10b8e4cc-16bf-44f4-920f-06ae1d747d6b\', \'multiverseId\': 621559}, \'multiverseid\': 621559}, {\'name\': \'Proveedora incansable\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de Comida o una ficha de Tesoro. (La Comida es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas". El Tesoro es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El pan de lembas es más fortificante que cualquier otra comida hecha por los hombres".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d5a46e5-ed0c-48a2-8b7f-1fe28d179ff7\', \'multiverseId\': 621746}, \'multiverseid\': 621746}, {\'name\': \'Approvisionneuse infatigable\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton Nourriture ou un jeton Trésor. (Nourriture est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie ». Trésor est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« Le lembas est plus fortifiant que n\'importe quelle nourriture faite par les hommes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7e98b08-a0c3-4c8d-bf72-c687d5c00104\', \'multiverseId\': 621933}, \'multiverseid\': 621933}, {\'name\': \'Approvvigionatrice Instancabile\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina Cibo o una pedina Tesoro. (Il Cibo è un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita". Il Tesoro è un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il lembas è più nutriente di qualsiasi cibo fatto dagli Uomini."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a94f34f-9638-4bfa-bb84-fe5f872c10cb\', \'multiverseId\': 622120}, \'multiverseid\': 622120}, {\'name\': \'不屈の補給兵\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、食物・トークン１つか宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（食物は、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。宝物は、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「レンバスは人間の作ったどんな食べものよりも力がつきます。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54b91d2f-bc0d-41a3-bdb1-c9384a632741\', \'multiverseId\': 622307}, \'multiverseid\': 622307}, {\'name\': \'Provisionista Incansável\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha de Comida ou uma ficha de Tesouro. (Comida é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida". Tesouro é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"O lembas é mais fortificante que qualquer alimento feito pelos Homens."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a6e256e-b91d-4ae5-b5bd-9be30a8bdfbb\', \'multiverseId\': 622494}, \'multiverseid\': 622494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unheilvolle Ruinen\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Unheilvollen Ruinen ins Spiel kommen, kannst du eine Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommen die Unheilvollen Ruinen getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Straße wirkte einsam und verlassen und führte hinab zu leeren Ruinen im Nebel. Doch in der Luft lag etwas Böses.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e281bae9-4fe9-46ad-a35c-1e47328ae131\', \'multiverseId\': 621607}, \'multiverseid\': 621607}, {\'name\': \'Ruinas premonitorias\', \'text\': \'En cuanto las Ruinas premonitorias entren al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Pantano o Montaña de tu mano. Si no lo haces, las Ruinas premonitorias entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En el camino entre la niebla que descendía hacia las ruinas no parecía haber nadie y estaba abandonado. Sin embargo, se sentía algo siniestro en el aire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'150ac9b6-9e6d-4583-b48e-dfe945f41b6c\', \'multiverseId\': 621794}, \'multiverseid\': 621794}, {\'name\': \'Ruines angoissantes\', \'text\': \'Au moment où les Ruines angoissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de marais ou de montagne de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, les Ruines angoissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La route paraissait isolée et à l\'abandon, s\'enfonçant dans des ruines désertes au milieu de la brume. Mais la malveillance couvait dans l\'air.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621981&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5497f875-2b78-44f0-aeba-2e691e7dbc87\', \'multiverseId\': 621981}, \'multiverseid\': 621981}, {\'name\': \'Rovine del Presagio\', \'text\': \'Mentre le Rovine del Presagio entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Palude o Montagna dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, le Rovine del Presagio entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "La strada sembrava sola e abbandonata, diretta a fredde rovine avvolte nella nebbia. Ma nell\'aria si sentiva un non so che di malvagio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e88e26-7d2a-4a1a-b52f-c386b0b363f5\', \'multiverseId\': 622168}, \'multiverseid\': 622168}, {\'name\': \'凶兆の廃墟\', \'text\': \'凶兆の廃墟が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり沼や山であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、凶兆の廃墟はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'それは霧の中の虚ろな廃墟へと続く、わびしく見捨てられた道のように見えた。しかし空気中には邪な気配が感じられた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9cf2784-4a71-4d67-83d1-4bbe9c0575e4\', \'multiverseId\': 622355}, \'multiverseid\': 622355}, {\'name\': \'Ruínas Agourentas\', \'text\': \'Conforme Ruínas Agourentas entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Pântano ou Montanha de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Ruínas Agourentas entrará no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A estrada parecia isolada e abandonada, levando a ruínas vazias na névoa. Mas havia uma sensação maligna no ar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac7cc7f-e783-415b-a548-fc4125d0464b\', \'multiverseId\': 622542}, \'multiverseid\': 622542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unhold-Jäger\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Unhold-Jäger ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil schicken.\\nWenn der Unhold-Jäger das Spiel verlässt, bringe die ins Exil geschickte Karte unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf welche Straßen würde sich Reisende noch wagen, wenn die Dúnedain nicht mehr wären?"\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621465&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88f1686b-ec40-491c-8758-8051f0eabe31\', \'multiverseId\': 621465}, \'multiverseid\': 621465}, {\'name\': \'Cazador de demonios\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cazador de demonios entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar otra criatura objetivo.\\nCuando el Cazador de demonios deje el campo de batalla, regresa la carta exiliada al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué caminos se atrevería a tomar nadie si los Dúnedain estuviesen en tumbas?".\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74595952-1fa3-4b41-b863-9ea51e80a9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 621652}, \'multiverseid\': 621652}, {\'name\': \'Chasseur de fielleux\', \'text\': \'Quand le Chasseur de fielleux arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler une autre créature ciblée.\\nQuand le Chasseur de fielleux quitte le champ de bataille, renvoyez, sous le contrôle de son propriétaire, la carte exilée sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Qui oserait s\'aventurer sur ces routes si les Dúnedains étaient tous partis dans la tombe ? »\\n—Aragorn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'218c88a3-e1c3-4fb2-b57c-f95e5f335091\', \'multiverseId\': 621839}, \'multiverseid\': 621839}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatore di Demoni\', \'text\': "Quando il Cacciatore di Demoni entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare un\'altra creatura bersaglio.\\nQuando il Cacciatore di Demoni lascia il campo di battaglia, rimetti la carta esiliata sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Quali strade si oserebbe percorrere, se i Dúnedain riposassero tutti nella tomba?"\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c935183-4078-4e98-aeec-92c655f59d0e\', \'multiverseId\': 622026}, \'multiverseid\': 622026}, {\'name\': \'悪鬼の狩人\', \'text\': \'悪鬼の狩人が戦場に出たとき、これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。\\n悪鬼の狩人が戦場を離れたとき、その追放されているカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「我らドゥーネダインが一人残らず死んだなら、安心して通ることのできる道などあるだろうか？」\\n——アラゴルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'356e76f5-e0eb-4c8d-9e26-e4136b5b2eee\', \'multiverseId\': 622213}, \'multiverseid\': 622213}, {\'name\': \'Caçador de Demônio\', \'text\': \'Quando Caçador de Demônio entra no campo de batalha, você pode exilar outra criatura alvo.\\nQuando Caçador de Demônio deixar o campo de batalha, devolva o card exilado ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que estradas qualquer pessoa ousaria trilhar se os Dúnedain jazessem já todos no túmulo?"\\n— Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a339e81-57a3-4f9d-9741-becfd46d7caf\', \'multiverseId\': 622400}, \'multiverseid\': 622400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Untergeschlüpfter Elf\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Untergeschlüpfte Elf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Blätter so lang, das Gras so grün,\\ndie Schierlingsdolden hoch und schön,\\nund über der Lichtung schien ein Licht\\nvon Sternen, schimmernd in der Nacht."\\n—Geschichte von Tinúviel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acbed3ba-c004-4786-b943-303cdca3d10f\', \'multiverseId\': 621540}, \'multiverseid\': 621540}, {\'name\': \'Elfo refugio lejano\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Elfo refugio lejano entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las hojas eran largas y la hierba, frondosa.\\nLas umbelas de los abetos, altas y bellas.\\nY en el claro se vio una luz fogosa\\nen la sombra de las estrellas".\\n—La historia de Tinúviel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73077dbc-56cf-4658-be0e-b11ad996ed2e\', \'multiverseId\': 621727}, \'multiverseid\': 621727}, {\'name\': \'Elfe des horizons lointains\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Elfe des horizons lointains arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Longues étaient les feuilles, verte était l\'herbe,\\nLes ombelles de ciguë hautes et superbes,\\nEt dans la clairière se voyait une lumière\\nqui dans l\'ombre scintillait, stellaire. »\\n—Conte de Tinúviel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621914&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f2de8b2-98b9-41fb-b095-f592e63c03f2\', \'multiverseId\': 621914}, \'multiverseid\': 621914}, {\'name\': \'Elfa del Rifugio Lontano\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Elfa del Rifugio Lontano entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lunghe eran le foglie e l\\\'erba era fresca,\\nE le cicute ondeggiavano fiorite e belle.\\nUna luce brillava nella foresta,\\nEra tra le ombre un luccicare di stelle."\\n—Storia di Tinúviel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b82cb34e-a2fe-46ad-9def-c64ddc6f0636\', \'multiverseId\': 622101}, \'multiverseid\': 622101}, {\'name\': \'彼方地のエルフ\', \'text\': \'彼方地のエルフが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「木の葉は長く、草は緑に、\\nヘムロックの花笠は伸びて、艶やかだった。\\n森の空地にさしこむ光は、\\n宵闇にまたたく星明かりだった。」\\n――ティヌーヴィエルの物語\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d239808-8645-4161-9879-5b66c6025678\', \'multiverseId\': 622288}, \'multiverseid\': 622288}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Porto-longínquo\', \'text\': \'Quando Elfo Porto-longínquo entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Folhas, longas, grama, virente,\\nDe cicuta umbelas, altas, belas,\\nE na clareira, luz presente,\\nEstrelas na sombra luzentes."\\n— História de Tinúviel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7787b94c-753b-489a-809f-d0535370a359\', \'multiverseId\': 622475}, \'multiverseid\': 622475}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unterirdischer Fluss\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}. Der Unterirdische Fluss fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Strom und Teich sind nass und kühl, gut für die Füß\\\'! Unser Verlangen, einen Fisch zu fangen, so saftig-süß!"\\n—Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621639&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8f15a42-4022-464e-b280-1bba7da59dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 621639}, \'multiverseid\': 621639}, {\'name\': \'Río subterráneo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}. El Río subterráneo te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Pero el arroyo y el estanque son húmedos y frescos: ¡son buenos para los pies! Solo queremos atrapar un pez, jugoso y suculento".\\n—Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e400e3-0fff-44fa-9417-23383d2c95c6\', \'multiverseId\': 621826}, \'multiverseid\': 621826}, {\'name\': \'Rivière souterraine\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}. La Rivière souterraine vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Mais ruisseau et torrent sont frais et revigorants : si bon pour les pieds ! Et maintenant, on souhaiterait seulement un poisson à attraper ! »\\n—Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622013&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd576615-4b4e-4800-ac74-95d75e93465c\', \'multiverseId\': 622013}, \'multiverseid\': 622013}, {\'name\': \'Fiume Sotterraneo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}. Il Fiume Sotterraneo ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Ma stagni e ruscelli sono freschi, sono belli; la fatica è finita! Vediamo se ci riesce di prendere un pesce, polpa saporita!"\\n—Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f7089c-43c4-420f-bd7e-c532a05fc83c\', \'multiverseId\': 622200}, \'multiverseid\': 622200}, {\'name\': \'地底の大河\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。地底の大河はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「だけど池と流れは、湿ってすずしい。足にいい気持ち！わしらのほしいのは、ただ一つ魚よ。汁気たっぷりの！」\\n――ゴラム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab98da79-1c46-4cd0-8f4e-3711926b79c6\', \'multiverseId\': 622387}, \'multiverseid\': 622387}, {\'name\': \'Rio Subterrâneo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}. Rio Subterrâneo causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Mas rio e lago frio e molhado: pro pé é alento! Nós só queremos peixe, peguemos, tão suculento!"\\n— Gollum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34186428-d6f3-45a1-9c7c-8a6ea39d0dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 622574}, \'multiverseid\': 622574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unterwerfung der Hobbits\', \'text\': \'Übernimm die Kontrolle über jede Nichtkommandeur-Kreatur mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das hier ist schlimmer als Mordor! Viel schlimmer, in gewisser Hinsicht. Es trifft uns umso härter, da wir uns erinnern, wie es früher war, bevor alles zugrunde ging."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9900fa-6133-41ec-b05f-91b29321ff5b\', \'multiverseId\': 620373}, \'multiverseid\': 620373}, {\'name\': \'Subjuguer les hobbits\', \'text\': \'Acquérez le contrôle de chaque créature non-commandant avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est encore pire que le Mordor ! Bien pire, d\'une certaine manière. Ça vous touche en plein cœur, comme qui dirait, parce que c\'est chez nous et qu\'on se souvient comment c\'était avant que tout ne soit ravagé. »\\n—Sam", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5dc1dd6-4320-4771-a4d9-4fd83bae95f2\', \'multiverseId\': 620441}, \'multiverseid\': 620441}, {\'name\': \'ホビットの隷属\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が３以下であり統率者でないすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これはモルドールよりひどい！おらたちには、こっちのほうがはるかにひどい。胸をえぐられるってのはこのことです。ここは心のふるさとで、荒れ果てる前のようすが、まだ胸に残っているからです。」\\n――サム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7697cd00-1832-43b4-b718-4e798492a421\', \'multiverseId\': 620509}, \'multiverseid\': 620509}, {\'name\': \'威服霍比特人\', \'text\': \'获得所有法术力值小于或等于3且非指挥官之生物的操控权。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这比魔多还要糟糕！某些方面甚至是糟糕透了。用他们的话来说，就是糟糕到了家～因为这里真的是你家，而且你还记得它以前的样子，但现在全毁了。」\\n～山姆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bee319d9-825b-4e8f-82a5-4e450f0fd16e\', \'multiverseId\': 620577}, \'multiverseid\': 620577}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unterwerfung der Hobbits\', \'text\': \'Übernimm die Kontrolle über jede Nichtkommandeur-Kreatur mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das hier ist schlimmer als Mordor! Viel schlimmer, in gewisser Hinsicht. Es trifft uns umso härter, da wir uns erinnern, wie es früher war, bevor alles zugrunde ging."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620782&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe59109-ff3b-4e8d-8e27-8b7386c9ca65\', \'multiverseId\': 620782}, \'multiverseid\': 620782}, {\'name\': \'Subyugar a los hobbits\', \'text\': \'Gana el control de cada criatura que no sea un comandante con valor de maná de 3 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Esto es peor que Mordor! Mucho peor, en un sentido. Duele en carne viva, ya que forma parte de nosotros y lo recordamos tal y como era antes".\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e0902f0-fb5c-4526-b85a-0b0ed1a9e6ed\', \'multiverseId\': 620854}, \'multiverseid\': 620854}, {\'name\': \'Subjuguer les hobbits\', \'text\': \'Acquérez le contrôle de chaque créature non-commandant avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est encore pire que le Mordor ! Bien pire, d\'une certaine manière. Ça vous touche en plein cœur, comme qui dirait, parce que c\'est chez nous et qu\'on se souvient comment c\'était avant que tout ne soit ravagé. »\\n—Sam", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620926&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6130239-76e1-4f73-ada1-c86b0192a8cb\', \'multiverseId\': 620926}, \'multiverseid\': 620926}, {\'name\': \'Soggiogare gli Hobbit\', \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di ogni creatura non comandante con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo è peggio di Mordor! Molto peggio, in un certo senso. Ti colpisce dritto al cuore, come si suole dire, perché questa era la casa del cuore e ce la ricordiamo come era prima."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d558839-6bce-49b5-a29c-0c2bea0e7dee\', \'multiverseId\': 620998}, \'multiverseid\': 620998}, {\'name\': \'ホビットの隷属\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が３以下であり統率者でないすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これはモルドールよりひどい！おらたちには、こっちのほうがはるかにひどい。胸をえぐられるってのはこのことです。ここは心のふるさとで、荒れ果てる前のようすが、まだ胸に残っているからです。」\\n――サム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88a16e54-4bfb-48fe-b170-389d1f674c8e\', \'multiverseId\': 621070}, \'multiverseid\': 621070}, {\'name\': \'Subjugar os Hobbits\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle de cada criatura não comandante com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Isso é pior que Mordor! Muito pior, de certa forma. Dói mais fundo em você, como dizem, porque é a sua casa, e você se lembra de como era antes de ser tudo arruinado."\\n— Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7f8f2a5-cb06-456b-a8a6-584f5adada26\', \'multiverseId\': 621142}, \'multiverseid\': 621142}, {\'name\': \'征服霍比特人\', \'text\': \'获得所有法术力值小于或等于3且非指挥官之生物的操控权。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这比魔多还要糟糕！从某方面来说，甚至是糟糕透了。用他们的话来说，就是糟糕到了家～因为这里真的是你家，而且你还记得它以前的样子，但现在全毁了。」\\n～山姆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af549777-ea03-42bc-88e1-644a705b5c93\', \'multiverseId\': 621214}, \'multiverseid\': 621214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unzerstörbare Formation\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nAddendum — Falls du diesen Zauberspruch während deiner Hauptphase gewirkt hast, lege auf jede der Kreaturen eine +1/+1-Marke und sie erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621476&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bac39e75-2478-4190-88b3-0a3fc5c7b64e\', \'multiverseId\': 621476}, \'multiverseid\': 621476}, {\'name\': \'Formación inquebrantable\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nAdenda — Si lanzas este hechizo durante tu fase principal, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una de esas criaturas y ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b0c312-5ecd-4e31-9956-037656e5e275\', \'multiverseId\': 621663}, \'multiverseid\': 621663}, {\'name\': \'Formation inébranlable\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nAddenda — Si vous avez lancé ce sort pendant votre phase principale, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune de ces créatures et elles acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af03ec31-df00-4fba-be2b-7b8a597c30cb\', \'multiverseId\': 621850}, \'multiverseid\': 621850}, {\'name\': \'Formazione Indissolubile\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nAppendice — Se hai lanciato questa magia durante la tua fase principale, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ognuna di quelle creature e hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982c9c03-0179-4a77-99dc-122035900c93\', \'multiverseId\': 622037}, \'multiverseid\': 622037}, {\'name\': \'不敗の陣形\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\\n附則 ― あなたがこの呪文をあなたのメイン・フェイズ中に唱えたなら、それらのクリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それらは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e77ea03e-7a53-4698-a52e-a2abe30c6b03\', \'multiverseId\': 622224}, \'multiverseid\': 622224}, {\'name\': \'Formação Inquebrável\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\\nAdendo — Se você conjurou esta mágica durante sua fase principal, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma daquelas criaturas e elas ganham vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0791a7b7-da00-4cf1-b1e2-d880095ef080\', \'multiverseId\': 622411}, \'multiverseid\': 622411}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verbotene Alchemie\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\\nRückblende {6}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Pfusche nicht in den Angelegenheiten von Zauberern herum, denn sie sind schlau und leicht zu verärgern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621488&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'064155a2-50a4-4c21-bf59-57d3cf18b579\', \'multiverseId\': 621488}, \'multiverseid\': 621488}, {\'name\': \'Alquimia prohibida\', \'text\': \'Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.\\nRetrospectiva {6}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'No te metas en los asuntos de los magos, pues son astutos y de cólera fácil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a9c5863-ba69-4526-8b2f-5565e021653c\', \'multiverseId\': 621675}, \'multiverseid\': 621675}, {\'name\': \'Alchimie interdite\', \'text\': "Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {6}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Ne vous mêlez pas des affaires des magiciens, car ils sont subtils et prompts à la colère.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27fcf3a1-980c-45f1-8eef-0faca4f42b73\', \'multiverseId\': 621862}, \'multiverseid\': 621862}, {\'name\': \'Alchimia Proibita\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {6}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Non ti immischiare negli affari degli Stregoni, perché sono astuti e suscettibili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d2db74-3510-41f8-9dd5-09a0833c087e\', \'multiverseId\': 622049}, \'multiverseid\': 622049}, {\'name\': \'禁忌の錬金術\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'魔法使には、おせっかいをするな、変幻自在で、よく怒る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aff6f76-ffa9-47a6-b0bf-75c16abd2ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 622236}, \'multiverseid\': 622236}, {\'name\': \'Alquimia Proibida\', \'text\': \'Olhe os quatro cards do topo do seu grimório. Coloque um deles em sua mão e o restante em seu cemitério.\\nRecapitular {6}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-a.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Não se meta nos assuntos dos Magos, pois eles são sutis e se enraivecem rápido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80c293cd-6e84-42ab-9a13-40ff068dbc11\', \'multiverseId\': 622423}, \'multiverseid\': 622423}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verholzen\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur ist ein Baumhirte mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 0/4 und verliert alle Fähigkeiten.\', \'type\': \'Stammes-Verzauberung — Baumhirte, Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Huorns begannen, sich nach Süden zu bewegen, sobald die Tore wieder geschlossen waren. Ich glaube, sie hatten etwas mit den Orks auszumachen."\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'479722c7-3019-4517-a120-8864b7426b88\', \'multiverseId\': 621549}, \'multiverseid\': 621549}, {\'name\': \'Lignificar\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada es un Pueblo-arbóreo con fuerza y resistencia base de 0/4 y pierde todas las habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento tribal — Aura pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los ucornos se dirigieron hacia el sur en cuanto las puertas volvieron a cerrarse. Creo que iban a ajustar cuentas con los orcos".\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c383d52-4cd2-4d36-8cf2-9d5ce9fa06bb\', \'multiverseId\': 621736}, \'multiverseid\': 621736}, {\'name\': \'Lignification\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée est un sylvin avec une force et une endurance de base de 0/4 et perd toutes ses capacités.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement tribal : sylvin et aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Les Huorns prirent la direction du sud dès que les portes furent à nouveau fermées. Ils en avaient après les orques, je pense. »\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a08e40-3992-485d-a655-fa97769c04ad\', \'multiverseId\': 621923}, \'multiverseid\': 621923}, {\'name\': \'Lignificare\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata è un Silvantropo con forza e costituzione base 0/4 e perde tutte le abilità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Tribale — Aura Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli Ucorni si erano incamminati verso sud, non appena i cancelli furono richiusi. Loro avevano qualcosa da sbrigare con gli Orchi, immagino."\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e627b2d-b24d-40b8-9025-165d31b04a2b\', \'multiverseId\': 622110}, \'multiverseid\': 622110}, {\'name\': \'木化\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーはすべての能力を失い、基本のパワーとタフネスが０/４のツリーフォークである。\', \'type\': \'部族・エンチャント — ツリーフォーク・オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「大門がふたたび閉じられるとすぐに、フオルンたちは南に進み始めた。彼らの仕事はオークどもの相手だったのだと思うよ。」\\n――メリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd9ea7e2-2ccf-4441-8fce-8c3499c3bfef\', \'multiverseId\': 622297}, \'multiverseid\': 622297}, {\'name\': \'Lignificar\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada é um Ent com poder e resistência básicos 0/4 e perde todas as habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Tribal — Ent Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Huorns começaram a ir para o sul assim que os portões foram fechados de novo. Acho que o negócio deles era com os orcs."\\n— Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e538860-fede-436a-9a5f-78b8b4db3f54\', \'multiverseId\': 622484}, \'multiverseid\': 622484}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verjüngende Quellen\', \'text\': \'Die Verjüngenden Quellen kommen getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du hast zwei oder mehr Gegner.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Du bist in Bruchtal, und du brauchst dir einstweilen um nichts Sorgen zu machen."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621622&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf2aa7f3-be7b-48f6-95c4-90aa482531f0\', \'multiverseId\': 621622}, \'multiverseid\': 621622}, {\'name\': \'Manantiales rejuvenecedores\', \'text\': \'Los Manantiales rejuvenecedores entran al campo de batalla girados a menos que tengas dos o más oponentes.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Estás en Rivendel, no tienes de qué preocuparte en estos momentos".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fe3cb68-ca6d-4b05-bbf3-914281a9f490\', \'multiverseId\': 621809}, \'multiverseid\': 621809}, {\'name\': \'Sources rajeunisseuses\', \'text\': "Les Sources rajeunisseuses arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées à moins que vous n\'ayez au moins deux adversaires.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Vous vous trouvez à Fondcombe, et vous n\'avez à vous soucier de rien pour le moment. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621996&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a5577d-4562-4003-bbcc-223c17951542\', \'multiverseId\': 621996}, \'multiverseid\': 621996}, {\'name\': \'Fonti Rinvigorenti\', \'text\': \'Le Fonti Rinvigorenti entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate a meno che tu non abbia due o più avversari.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Sei a Gran Burrone e non devi preoccuparti di niente per il momento."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f736d2e-caaf-43de-ae29-5b7b2ffefa9b\', \'multiverseId\': 622183}, \'multiverseid\': 622183}, {\'name\': \'回復の温泉\', \'text\': \'対戦相手が２人以上いないかぎり、回復の温泉はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「ここは裂け谷じゃ。今のところはなんの心配もいらん。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dafa3a92-1d44-43f0-b5c5-20885ccff4c3\', \'multiverseId\': 622370}, \'multiverseid\': 622370}, {\'name\': \'Fontes Rejuvenescedoras\', \'text\': \'Fontes Rejuvenescedoras entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você tenha dois ou mais oponentes.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Você está em Valfenda e não precisa se preocupar com nada por ora."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c5ce143-98af-41df-804c-89281c22b55a\', \'multiverseId\': 622557}, \'multiverseid\': 622557}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verlassene Ödnis\', \'text\': \'Die Verlassene Ödnis kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Verlassene Ödnis ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Schließlich erreichten sie die Wetterspitze; der Abend rückte heran, und der Schatten des Hügels lag finster auf der Straße.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621626&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5936f92-ae81-49d4-9b37-ab2f82fc5b83\', \'multiverseId\': 621626}, \'multiverseid\': 621626}, {\'name\': \'Yermos desérticos\', \'text\': \'Los Yermos desérticos entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCuando los Yermos desérticos entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Y llegaron por fin a la Cima de los Vientos; se aproximaba el ocaso y la sombra de la colina oscurecía el camino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c1cadad-004c-4405-9186-bf8f023a2e49\', \'multiverseId\': 621813}, \'multiverseid\': 621813}, {\'name\': \'Landes érodées\', \'text\': \'Les Landes érodées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Landes érodées arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Ils arrivèrent enfin au Mont Venteux. Le jour tirait à sa fin et la colline projetait son ombre noire sur la route.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622000&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5adf3b6-3ea1-4ae7-8e37-eaf1771e8ea7\', \'multiverseId\': 622000}, \'multiverseid\': 622000}, {\'name\': \'Distese Desolate\', \'text\': \'Le Distese Desolate entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Distese Desolate entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Giunsero finalmente a Colle Vento; si avvicinava la sera e l\'ombra del colle si disegnava nera sulla strada.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b63cdae-c65f-4ec7-a77a-9acace2dc670\', \'multiverseId\': 622187}, \'multiverseid\': 622187}, {\'name\': \'磨かれたやせ地\', \'text\': \'磨かれたやせ地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n磨かれたやせ地が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ようやく一行が風見が丘にやって来た時は、夕暮れに近く、丘の影が街道の上にも暗く伸びていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8681ad74-662e-47da-b369-9d41f8214326\', \'multiverseId\': 622374}, \'multiverseid\': 622374}, {\'name\': \'Desertos Calcinados\', \'text\': \'Desertos Calcinados entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Desertos Calcinados entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Pouco depois eles chegaram ao Topo do Vento; já estava entardecendo e a sombra da colina deitava-se escura sobre a estrada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'138c1bc5-3f98-4903-b96b-2382a47d24ca\', \'multiverseId\': 622561}, \'multiverseid\': 622561}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verlockung der Möglichkeiten\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Hundert Leitern wurden gegen die Zinnen aufgerichtet. Über die Mauer und unter der Mauer hindurch kam der letzte Ansturm, der über sie fegte wie eine dunkle Woge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621526&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc7267ca-7073-4b8d-9f36-9a695730f4a3\', \'multiverseId\': 621526}, \'multiverseid\': 621526}, {\'name\': \'Entusiasmo ante la posibilidad\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta.\\nRoba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Se alzaron cientos de escaleras contra las almenas. El último asalto llegó por arriba y abajo del muro, barriendo como una ola oscura sobre una duna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eceb2811-ad03-47a6-86c5-127120e968aa\', \'multiverseId\': 621713}, \'multiverseid\': 621713}, {\'name\': \'Frisson de probabilité\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nPiochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Une centaine d\'échelles furent levées contre les remparts. Le dernier assaut passa au-dessus et en dessous du mur, balayant tout comme une vague noire sur une dune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc73c0c-0656-43b4-bfa1-2d92a840fe38\', \'multiverseId\': 621900}, \'multiverseid\': 621900}, {\'name\': \'Brivido della Possibilità\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta.\\nPesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Centinaia di scale venivano appoggiate contro il parapetto. Da sopra le mura e da sotto le mura, giunse l\'ultimo assalto, dilagando come un\'onda scura su una duna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894f8d12-56ff-4985-a14d-d14378de11eb\', \'multiverseId\': 622087}, \'multiverseid\': 622087}, {\'name\': \'胸躍る可能性\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'百本のはしごが胸壁に立てかけられた。防壁の上にも下にも、砂丘に押し寄せる黒い波の如く、最後の総攻撃が襲って来た。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'524e3693-b413-4286-ac33-78356895fda3\', \'multiverseId\': 622274}, \'multiverseid\': 622274}, {\'name\': \'Frisson das Possibilidades\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, descarte um card.\\nCompre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Cem escadas foram içadas contra as ameias. Por sobre e sob a muralha veio o último assalto, varrendo tudo, como uma onda escura sobre um monte de areia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b47d8c03-4f92-40fe-9e53-990d8ac4b4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 622461}, \'multiverseid\': 622461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Versteckter Innenhof\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Versteckte Innenhof ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um einen Kreaturenzauber des bestimmten Typs zu wirken oder eine Fähigkeit einer Kreatur oder Kreaturenkarte des bestimmten Typs zu aktivieren.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621627&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e39e4a5-367d-4eaa-a231-1df9b7ae9f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 621627}, \'multiverseid\': 621627}, {\'name\': \'Patio recóndito\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Patio recóndito entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Usa este maná solo para lanzar un hechizo de criatura del tipo elegido o para activar una habilidad de una criatura o una carta de criatura del tipo elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8371858-123f-4e4f-bee2-01884e9f3f3d\', \'multiverseId\': 621814}, \'multiverseid\': 621814}, {\'name\': \'Cour retirée\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Cour retirée arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort de créature du type choisi ou pour activer une capacité d\'une créature ou d\'une carte de créature du type choisi.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622001&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fde0e5a-d567-472f-973a-7a3c570e5614\', \'multiverseId\': 622001}, \'multiverseid\': 622001}, {\'name\': \'Cortile Appartato\', \'text\': "Mentre il Cortile Appartato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare una magia creatura del tipo scelto o per attivare un\'abilità di una creatura o di una carta creatura del tipo scelto.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac9d84c-a8a2-484e-8257-c58e110377c0\', \'multiverseId\': 622188}, \'multiverseid\': 622188}, {\'name\': \'閑静な中庭\', \'text\': \'閑静な中庭が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナは、その選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためか、その選ばれたタイプのクリーチャーやクリーチャー・カードの能力を起動するためにしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9cfd2ae-1ed8-4873-8f42-bcb3b643229f\', \'multiverseId\': 622375}, \'multiverseid\': 622375}, {\'name\': \'Pátio Reservado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Pátio Reservado entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar uma mágica de criatura do tipo escolhido ou ativar uma habilidade de uma criatura ou card de criatura do tipo escolhido.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d36c05-b96c-41d8-ab31-cf0c3a3909d7\', \'multiverseId\': 622562}, \'multiverseid\': 622562}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verstreute Haine\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.)\\nDie Verstreuten Haine kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin weit gelaufen, um diese Blätter zu finden, denn diese Pflanze wächst nicht auf den kahlen Hügeln, sondern in den Dickichten weit südlich der Straße."\\n—Streicher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621625&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cdda560-5671-4a2b-bd73-07e46eabf1b9\', \'multiverseId\': 621625}, \'multiverseid\': 621625}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda dispersa\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.)\\nLa Arboleda dispersa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque llanura\', \'flavor\': \'"He caminado mucho para encontrar estas hojas, pues no crecen en colinas desnudas, sino únicamente en los matorrales al sur, lejos del Camino".\\n—Trancos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'952a6b79-903f-460c-b3bb-6c666fb95d1d\', \'multiverseId\': 621812}, \'multiverseid\': 621812}, {\'name\': \'Bosquets épars\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.)\\nLes Bosquets épars arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt et plaine\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai dû marcher loin pour trouver ces feuilles, car cette plante ne pousse pas sur les collines nues mais dans les fourrés bien au sud de la route. »\\n—Grand-Pas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621999&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b2d1856-4b86-4fc9-bedb-bb64d0a1712f\', \'multiverseId\': 621999}, \'multiverseid\': 621999}, {\'name\': \'Selve Diradate\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.)\\nLe Selve Diradate entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Pianura\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho camminato molto per trovare queste foglie: questa infatti non è una pianta che cresce sulle brulle colline, ma nei boschetti a sud della Via."\\n—Grampasso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b23a71df-7d00-4a21-8b4b-ed3367982217\', \'multiverseId\': 622186}, \'multiverseid\': 622186}, {\'name\': \'まばらな木立ち\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。）\\nまばらな木立ちはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング {2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・平地\', \'flavor\': \'「私はこの葉を探し遠くまで歩いた。これはこうしたはげ山には生えないからだ。だが、街道のずっと南の茂みの中に生えていた。」\\n――ストライダー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b83b873-01f5-4bed-ad18-06a74e2d49b6\', \'multiverseId\': 622373}, \'multiverseid\': 622373}, {\'name\': \'Bosques Esparsos\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.)\\nBosques Esparsos entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta Planície\', \'flavor\': \'"Fui longe para achar essas folhas; porque essa planta não cresce nas colinas nuas, mas nos arvoredos bem ao sul da Estrada."\\n— Passolargo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ea8d9f-4f7a-4c91-8944-2a58bf244a47\', \'multiverseId\': 622560}, \'multiverseid\': 622560}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verstärkungen des Grauen Heeres\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Abwehr {3}\\nWenn die Verstärkungen des Grauen Heeres ins Spiel kommen, schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil. Lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Verstärkungen des Grauen Heeres, wie auf diese Weise Kreaturenkarten ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hoffe, sie haben nicht vergessen, wie man kämpft."\\n—Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620364&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d69935-c4ec-48c7-beb4-be1fb9768ee1\', \'multiverseId\': 620364}, \'multiverseid\': 620364}, {\'name\': "Renforts de l\'Ost Gris", \'text\': "Vol, parade {3}\\nQuand les Renforts de l\'Ost Gris arrivent sur le champ de bataille, exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé. Mettez sur les Renforts de l\'Ost Gris un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au nombre de cartes de créature exilées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« J\'espère qu\'ils n\'ont pas oublié comment se battre. »\\n—Gimli", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba87df8-259d-49a4-8114-38a87aa9fa8b\', \'multiverseId\': 620432}, \'multiverseid\': 620432}, {\'name\': \'灰色の軍勢の増援\', \'text\': \'飛行、護法{3}\\n灰色の軍勢の増援が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。灰色の軍勢の増援の上に、これにより追放されたクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「彼らが戦い方を忘れていないといいのだが。」\\n――ギムリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dc68a91-9ad5-44f5-8b84-be2f1857eb54\', \'multiverseId\': 620500}, \'multiverseid\': 620500}, {\'name\': \'灰色大军援兵\', \'text\': \'飞行，守护{3}\\n当灰色大军援兵进战场时，放逐目标牌手的坟墓场。在灰色大军援兵上放置若干+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于以此法放逐的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「希望他们还没忘记如何战斗。」\\n～吉姆利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44b192dd-e893-4f0a-98ed-1bb12222306e\', \'multiverseId\': 620568}, \'multiverseid\': 620568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verstärkungen des Grauen Heeres\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Abwehr {3}\\nWenn die Verstärkungen des Grauen Heeres ins Spiel kommen, schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil. Lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Verstärkungen des Grauen Heeres, wie auf diese Weise Kreaturenkarten ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hoffe, sie haben nicht vergessen, wie man kämpft."\\n—Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620772&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b5aeb45-3435-4d62-8a15-d1663b2fb4be\', \'multiverseId\': 620772}, \'multiverseid\': 620772}, {\'name\': \'Refuerzos del Ejército de las Sombras\', \'text\': \'Vuela, rebatir {3}.\\nCuando los Refuerzos del Ejército de las Sombras entren al campo de batalla, exilia el cementerio del jugador objetivo. Pon una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre los Refuerzos del Ejército de las Sombras igual a la cantidad de cartas de criatura exiliadas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Espero que no hayan olvidado cómo luchar".\\n—Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f67d6a-d23e-413d-b5a3-38ffff445723\', \'multiverseId\': 620844}, \'multiverseid\': 620844}, {\'name\': "Renforts de l\'Ost Gris", \'text\': "Vol, parade {3}\\nQuand les Renforts de l\'Ost Gris arrivent sur le champ de bataille, exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé. Mettez sur les Renforts de l\'Ost Gris un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au nombre de cartes de créature exilées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« J\'espère qu\'ils n\'ont pas oublié comment se battre. »\\n—Gimli", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef5a92f9-838a-48f9-b5b0-a19376226920\', \'multiverseId\': 620916}, \'multiverseid\': 620916}, {\'name\': \'Rinforzi della Grigia Schiera\', \'text\': \'Volare, egida {3}\\nQuando i Rinforzi della Grigia Schiera entrano nel campo di battaglia, esilia il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio. Metti sui Rinforzi della Grigia Schiera un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al numero di carte creatura esiliate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Spero che non abbiano dimenticato come combattere."\\n—Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f8c458-9a3d-4432-ac80-7868a380fa49\', \'multiverseId\': 620988}, \'multiverseid\': 620988}, {\'name\': \'灰色の軍勢の増援\', \'text\': \'飛行、護法{3}\\n灰色の軍勢の増援が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。灰色の軍勢の増援の上に、これにより追放されたクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「彼らが戦い方を忘れていないといいのだが。」\\n――ギムリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a1eeff7-9360-4c75-8631-5daf3aa3a3a2\', \'multiverseId\': 621060}, \'multiverseid\': 621060}, {\'name\': \'Reforços da Hoste Cinzenta\', \'text\': \'Voar, salvaguarda {3}\\nQuando Reforços da Hoste Cinzenta entrar no campo de batalha, exile o cemitério do jogador alvo. Coloque em Reforços da Hoste Cinzenta um número de marcadores +1/+1 igual ao número de cards de criatura exilados dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Espero que eles não tenham esquecido como se luta."\\n— Gimli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1acfdeaa-d066-4fe0-a69c-f528315152be\', \'multiverseId\': 621132}, \'multiverseid\': 621132}, {\'name\': \'灰色大军援兵\', \'text\': \'飞行，守护{3}\\n当灰色大军援兵进战场时，放逐目标牌手的坟墓场。在灰色大军援兵上放置若干+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于以此法放逐的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「希望他们还没忘记如何战斗。」\\n～吉姆利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e74fcf-1050-4a9f-b757-9968154275d9\', \'multiverseId\': 621204}, \'multiverseid\': 621204}]', '[{\'name\': \'Versunkene Katakomben\', \'text\': \'Die Versunkenen Katakomben kommen getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine Insel oder einen Sumpf.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Welt ist in der Tat voller Gefahren, und es gibt viele finstere Orte; in allen Landen ist Liebe jetzt mit Kummer vermischt."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621602&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c6e2957-5b93-462b-be8f-b931388a0e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 621602}, \'multiverseid\': 621602}, {\'name\': \'Catacumba inundada\', \'text\': \'La Catacumba inundada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una Isla o un Pantano.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"El mundo está repleto de peligros y lugares oscuros. Por doquier, el amor ahora se mezcla con la aflicción".\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc946d2-2f94-42be-b225-b035780f2091\', \'multiverseId\': 621789}, \'multiverseid\': 621789}, {\'name\': \'Catacombes noyées\', \'text\': \'Les Catacombes noyées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées à moins que vous ne contrôliez une île ou un marais.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Le monde est en effet plein de périls et on y trouve bien des endroits sombres ; dans toutes les contrées, l\'amour est désormais mêlé au deuil. »\\n—Haldir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621976&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0913fd3-277f-46c0-9c7f-76dfe7e02515\', \'multiverseId\': 621976}, \'multiverseid\': 621976}, {\'name\': \'Catacombe Allagate\', \'text\': "Le Catacombe Allagate entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate a meno che tu non controlli un\'Isola o una Palude.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mondo è davvero pieno di pericoli e vi sono molti posti oscuri; l\\\'amore è ovunque mescolato al dolore."\\n—Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9aacb4a-f815-4f46-b03a-65a529988ba8\', \'multiverseId\': 622163}, \'multiverseid\': 622163}, {\'name\': \'水没した地下墓地\', \'text\': \'あなたが島や沼をコントロールしていないかぎり、水没した地下墓地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「世界には危険が満ちていおり、暗黒の地があまたある。今やすべての国において、愛は悲しみと混ざり合っている。」\\n――ハルディア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c0b86a-3993-4636-bae4-cc9041059da1\', \'multiverseId\': 622350}, \'multiverseid\': 622350}, {\'name\': \'Catacumba Submersa\', \'text\': \'Catacumba Submersa entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle uma Ilha ou um Pântano.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"O mundo está mesmo cheio de perigos, e nele há muitos lugares sombrios; em todas as terras o amor agora se mistura ao luto."\\n— Haldir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b469b02b-4f7e-4d4f-81da-5baf3d45b253\', \'multiverseId\': 622537}, \'multiverseid\': 622537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Versunkener Talkessel\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.)\\nDer Versunkene Talkessel kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Insel, Sumpf\', \'flavor\': \'Isengart begann, sich mit schwarzen, kriechenden Bächen und Teichen zu füllen. Das Wasser fand seinen Weg hinab in Schächte und Abflusslöcher, bis Isengart schließlich wie eine riesige flache Pfanne aussah, dampfend und blubbernd.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621632&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d778885-7675-4867-9036-bfdda2c80e78\', \'multiverseId\': 621632}, \'multiverseid\': 621632}, {\'name\': \'Hondonada profunda\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Hondonada profunda entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Isla pantano\', \'flavor\': \'Isengard empezó a llenarse de arroyos y estanques de agua negra. Las aguas fluyeron por pozos y respiraderos hasta que Isengard pareció una cacerola enorme, humeante y burbujeante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2907ca1c-e175-49c2-b67e-1c302107f4ed\', \'multiverseId\': 621819}, \'multiverseid\': 621819}, {\'name\': \'Dépression engloutie\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.)\\nLa Dépression engloutie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : île et marais\', \'flavor\': "L\'Isengard se remplit peu à peu de mares et de ruisseaux noirs. Les eaux descendirent jusque dans les puits et les évents, jusqu\'à ce qu\'enfin l\'Isengard ressemble à une grande poêle fumante et bouillonnante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622006&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f34db6d-067f-4109-ac8a-b1bed799eba3\', \'multiverseId\': 622006}, \'multiverseid\': 622006}, {\'name\': \'Conca Infossata\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Conca Infossata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Isola Palude\', \'flavor\': "Isengard incominciò a riempirsi di pozzanghere e di rigagnoli neri e striscianti. Le acque penetravano in qualche pozzo e fessura, finché Isengard sembrò un\'immensa pentola ribollente e schiumeggiante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a79b7c8-60ae-4653-8d8d-4c81d0be7084\', \'multiverseId\': 622193}, \'multiverseid\': 622193}, {\'name\': \'窪み渓谷\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、窪み渓谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 島・沼\', \'flavor\': \'次第にアイゼンガルドは、黒い流れや池に埋まり始めた。水は流れる先を求めて縦穴に流れ込み、穴から迸り、ついにアイゼンガルドは、湯気を上げてぐつぐつ煮立つ片手鍋の如き有様になった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca757c64-1cad-4fa1-9624-5567132e8498\', \'multiverseId\': 622380}, \'multiverseid\': 622380}, {\'name\': \'Vale Afundado\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.)\\nVale Afundado entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Ilha Pântano\', \'flavor\': \'Isengard começou a se encher de córregos e lagos negros. As água acharam seu caminho para baixo através de poços e chaminés, até que por fim Isengard parecesse uma grande frigideira plana, fervente e borbulhante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'881bfdcb-e5e9-4c99-8545-b78ba58198a3\', \'multiverseId\': 622567}, \'multiverseid\': 622567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verwüstende Flut\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\\nMirakulum {1}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Reiter wurden überwältigt: Sie gingen im Toben des Flusses unter, der sie fortriss.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621486&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b8160ef-d72f-4c07-b794-696ebb5e32c2\', \'multiverseId\': 621486}, \'multiverseid\': 621486}, {\'name\': \'Marea devastadora\', \'text\': \'Regresa todos los permanentes que no sean tierra a las manos de sus propietarios.\\nMilagro {1}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los Jinetes se vieron sobrepasados: los ahogó el rugido del río mientras se los llevaba consigo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'341e0b89-2cc6-4854-ab4f-c07379951a7e\', \'multiverseId\': 621673}, \'multiverseid\': 621673}, {\'name\': \'Marée dévastatrice\', \'text\': "Renvoyez tous les permanents non-terrain dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\\nMiracle {1}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les cavaliers étaient submergés : noyés dans la rivière grondante qui les emportait au loin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621860&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e3ec11-081a-4937-a129-990fb303658b\', \'multiverseId\': 621860}, \'multiverseid\': 621860}, {\'name\': \'Marea Devastatrice\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare tutti i permanenti non terra in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\\nMiracolo {1}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I Cavalieri furono sopraffatti: le grida furono soffocate dal rombo del fiume che li portava via.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70ff1e56-ac3f-4aad-ba02-63ac2383c579\', \'multiverseId\': 622047}, \'multiverseid\': 622047}, {\'name\': \'壊滅的大潮\', \'text\': \'土地でないすべてのパーマネントをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n奇跡{1}{U}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードとしてこのカードを引き、すぐに公開したとき、あなたはこれを奇跡コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'乗り手たちは打ちのめされ、彼らを運び去る轟く水に飲み込まれてしまった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719ea493-a6f5-4fea-bd6d-08ccfda15676\', \'multiverseId\': 622234}, \'multiverseid\': 622234}, {\'name\': \'Maré da Devastação\', \'text\': \'Devolva todas as permanentes não de terreno para as mãos de seus donos.\\nMilagre {1}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os Cavaleiros foram sobrepujados: afogaram-se no estrondo do rio que os arrastou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25584e9-3218-46a6-9fbb-fddf0adb25f1\', \'multiverseId\': 622421}, \'multiverseid\': 622421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Visionen des Ruhms\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nRückblende {8}{W}{W}. Auf diese Weise gewirkt kostet dieser Zauberspruch {X} weniger, wobei X gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag eines Kommandeurs ist, den du besitzt und der sich in der Kommandozone oder im Spiel befindet. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621479&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b172b6-73cf-48a0-9849-4385a681be8e\', \'multiverseId\': 621479}, \'multiverseid\': 621479}, {\'name\': \'Visiones de gloria\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Humano blanca 1/1 por cada criatura que controlas.\\nRetrospectiva {8}{W}{W}. Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo de esta manera, donde X es el mayor valor de maná de un comandante del cual eres propietario en el campo de batalla o en la zona de mando. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7b26013-904c-4a83-b038-29f67b624f7d\', \'multiverseId\': 621666}, \'multiverseid\': 621666}, {\'name\': \'Visions de gloire\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nFlashback {8}{W}{W}. Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer de cette manière, X étant la valeur de mana la plus élevée d\'un commandant que vous possédez sur le champ de bataille ou dans la zone de commandement. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e1cdae-1ced-4308-af02-53457e1bcdeb\', \'multiverseId\': 621853}, \'multiverseid\': 621853}, {\'name\': \'Visioni di Gloria\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca per ogni creatura che controlli.\\nFlashback {8}{W}{W}. Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata in questo modo, dove X è il valore di mana maggiore di un comandante che possiedi sul campo di battaglia o nella zona di comando. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a9c5395-1c87-43a3-9ca6-be76c7397862\', \'multiverseId\': 622040}, \'multiverseid\': 622040}, {\'name\': \'栄光の光景\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１体の白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{8}{W}{W}。これによりこの呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘは、戦場か統率領域にありあなたがオーナーである統率者の中で最大のマナ総量に等しい。（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a82ca645-72ac-434c-a8e6-4645317b2082\', \'multiverseId\': 622227}, \'multiverseid\': 622227}, {\'name\': \'Visões de Glória\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura Humano branca 1/1 para cada criatura que você controla.\\nRecapitular {8}{W}{W}. Esta mágica custa {X} a menos para conjurar desta forma, sendo X o maior valor de mana de um comandante seu no campo de batalha ou na zona de comando. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-a.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5321b64-d659-4ea1-9020-70761e26678d\', \'multiverseId\': 622414}, \'multiverseid\': 622414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vorherbestimmen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann eine Karte. (Schaue dir für Hellsicht 2 die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist das Geschäft der Zauberer: Zauberer machen sich immer Sorgen um die Zukunft."\\n—Baumbart\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621493&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d253511b-0258-476a-b0e5-8b6ab0b8ec00\', \'multiverseId\': 621493}, \'multiverseid\': 621493}, {\'name\': \'Preordinar\', \'text\': \'Adivina 2 y luego roba una carta. (Para adivinar 2, mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Así son los magos: siempre les preocupa el futuro".\\n—Bárbol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3531362e-e08f-4415-b4c3-b2f2dd117245\', \'multiverseId\': 621680}, \'multiverseid\': 621680}, {\'name\': \'Prédestination\', \'text\': "Regard 2, puis piochez une carte. (Pour appliquer regard 2, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez ensuite n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est là une affaire pour les magiciens : les magiciens sont toujours préoccupés par l\'avenir. »\\n—Sylvebarbe", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d131db83-faf2-488f-8cbd-4e2ab6fe5225\', \'multiverseId\': 621867}, \'multiverseid\': 621867}, {\'name\': \'Predestinare\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 2, poi pesca una carta. (Per profetizzare 2, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Preoccuparsi è compito degli Stregoni, che sono sempre in apprensione per il futuro."\\n—Barbalbero\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ab8aa7-8eac-40a5-bf4e-b13d6338c595\', \'multiverseId\': 622054}, \'multiverseid\': 622054}, {\'name\': \'定業\', \'text\': \'占術２を行い、その後、カード１枚を引く。（占術２とは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「それは魔法使たちの仕事だ。魔法使はいつも先のことを心配する。」\\n――木の鬚\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c4d37a-fff5-480d-99da-fbe181ecc5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 622241}, \'multiverseid\': 622241}, {\'name\': \'Preordenar\', \'text\': \'Use vidência 2 e depois compre um card. (Para usar vidência 2, olhe os dois cards do topo do seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles no fundo e o restante no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Esse é o trabalho dos Magos: os Magos estão sempre preocupados com o futuro."\\n— Barbárvore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e75fea6b-7d7e-406e-bf79-3dbc51de6cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 622428}, \'multiverseid\': 622428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wachstumsspirale\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte. Du kannst eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Das schnelle Wachstum der Wildnis, mit Dornsträuchern, Zaunrosen und Waldreben, legte bereits einen Schleier über diesen Ort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c553484b-016e-43ff-8cee-87ff1522e639\', \'multiverseId\': 621564}, \'multiverseid\': 621564}, {\'name\': \'Espiral de crecimiento\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El crecimiento rápido y salvaje de las zarzas, escaramujos y clemátides trepadoras cubría este lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e2c04e-7b1c-43f0-a093-ed3d98adc223\', \'multiverseId\': 621751}, \'multiverseid\': 621751}, {\'name\': \'Spirale de croissance\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La croissance rapide de la végétation de bruyère, d\'églantines et de clématite rampante recouvrait déjà ce lieu d\'un voile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621938&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e90372-4159-4ec7-9bdc-fd17c8691077\', \'multiverseId\': 621938}, \'multiverseid\': 621938}, {\'name\': \'Spirale di Crescita\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La rapida crescita della vegetazione ricca di brughiere e di rose selvatiche e di clematidi rampicanti stava già ricoprendo con un velo questo posto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b578289f-cdb2-4217-b3be-ed70a929509d\', \'multiverseId\': 622125}, \'multiverseid\': 622125}, {\'name\': \'成長のらせん\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を引く。あなたは、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'茨や野薔薇や地を這うクレマチスなど、旺盛に繁る荒れ地の植物が、すでにこの場所を覆っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc9e5fd-33ae-4af3-aaa5-2fd7f1824ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 622312}, \'multiverseid\': 622312}, {\'name\': \'Espiral de Crescimento\', \'text\': \'Compre um card. Você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O crescimento rápido da mata selvagem com urzes, rosas-mosquetas e clematites rastejantes já lançava um véu sobre esse lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593e7ced-833a-4a0b-b9f7-e52fa2d72995\', \'multiverseId\': 622499}, \'multiverseid\': 622499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Waldelfen\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Waldelfen ins Spiel kommen, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Elben sind wundersam schön anzuschauen, oder so heißt es."\\n—Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'692e42c9-9db7-42a0-aae7-e45cd5fd91c3\', \'multiverseId\': 621560}, \'multiverseid\': 621560}, {\'name\': \'Elfos del bosque\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Elfos del bosque entren al campo de batalla, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los elfos son increíblemente hermosos, o eso se dice".\\n—Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48712581-b77c-46e6-9792-743a733b9f97\', \'multiverseId\': 621747}, \'multiverseid\': 621747}, {\'name\': \'Elfe des bois\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Elfe des bois arrive sur le champ de bataille, cherchez une carte de forêt dans votre bibliothèque, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« Les elfes sont superbement beaux, à ce qu\'on raconte. »\\n—Faramir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621934&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d155311-278b-4acc-9a84-1a2a24c14f8e\', \'multiverseId\': 621934}, \'multiverseid\': 621934}, {\'name\': \'Elfi dei Boschi\', \'text\': \'Quando gli Elfi dei Boschi entrano nel campo di battaglia, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli Elfi sono meravigliosamente belli, a quanto pare."\\n—Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'688b14f7-3207-4cf4-aa87-152f43c938d7\', \'multiverseId\': 622121}, \'multiverseid\': 622121}, {\'name\': \'ウッド・エルフ\', \'text\': \'ウッド・エルフが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「エルフたちは見たところ驚くほどに美しいという。ともかくそう聞いている。」\\n――ファラミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76e5ca45-5c3b-4d79-a9e6-b22a140b0e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 622308}, \'multiverseid\': 622308}, {\'name\': \'Elfos da Floresta\', \'text\': \'Quando Elfos da Floresta entrar no campo de batalha, procure em seu grimório um card de Floresta, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"Os Elfos são maravilhosamente lindos de se ver, ou pelo menos é o que dizem."\\n— Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79961329-e7f1-4e47-940d-b15cf148d825\', \'multiverseId\': 622495}, \'multiverseid\': 622495}]', "[{'name': 'Waldfriedhof', 'text': 'Der Waldfriedhof kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen Sumpf oder einen Wald.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Die Hügelgräberhöhen hatten in den Legenden der Hobbits einen ebenso finsteren Ruf wie der Wald selbst.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621643&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94ce0a0b-c524-4195-ab78-48e0e8f0dcd1', 'multiverseId': 621643}, 'multiverseid': 621643}, {'name': 'Cementerio boscoso', 'text': 'El Cementerio boscoso entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles un Pantano o un Bosque.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Las Quebradas de los Túmulos tenían una siniestra reputación en las leyendas de los hobbits, como el propio bosque.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621830&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd18c85a4-34e6-459c-a799-0c6392b9ef2b', 'multiverseId': 621830}, 'multiverseid': 621830}, {'name': 'Cimetière des sylves', 'text': 'Le Cimetière des sylves arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez un marais ou une forêt.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Dans les légendes hobbites, les Hauts des Galgals avaient une aussi sinistre réputation que la Forêt elle-même.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622017&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd585245d-1e05-41c0-9cf4-d4d8a35108dd', 'multiverseId': 622017}, 'multiverseid': 622017}, {'name': 'Cimitero Silvestre', 'text': 'Il Cimitero Silvestre entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una Palude o una Foresta.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'I Tumulilande nelle leggende degli Hobbit avevano una reputazione tetra e sinistra come quella della Foresta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622204&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0585d472-9489-461e-b9f9-1ab9ea1b5af4', 'multiverseId': 622204}, 'multiverseid': 622204}, {'name': '森林の墓地', 'text': 'あなたが沼や森をコントロールしていないかぎり、森林の墓地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '塚山丘陵は、ホビットの伝説において、古森と同じくらいに不吉な評判を得ていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622391&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afd1bd0c-332b-44a1-a738-f9fee56e78d8', 'multiverseId': 622391}, 'multiverseid': 622391}, {'name': 'Cemitério da Floresta', 'text': 'Cemitério da Floresta entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle um Pântano ou uma Floresta.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'As Colinas dos Túmulos tinham uma reputação tão sinistra nas lendas dos Hobbits quanto a própria Floresta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622578&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0abb0818-f2d2-412d-8dd0-d3be0e2fbd9c', 'multiverseId': 622578}, 'multiverseid': 622578}]", '[{\'name\': \'Waldlandstrom\', \'text\': \'Der Waldlandstrom kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Dort liegen die Wälder von Lothlórien! Das ist der schönste aller Orte, an denen mein Volk wohnt."\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b84bbc8-b5ec-4c4b-9a27-0964b69b6a16\', \'multiverseId\': 621644}, \'multiverseid\': 621644}, {\'name\': \'Arroyo forestal\', \'text\': \'El Arroyo forestal entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Ahí está el bosque de Lothlórien! Es la más bella de las moradas de mi pueblo".\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f7d894a-74aa-4f2b-a809-7d3711ad318f\', \'multiverseId\': 621831}, \'multiverseid\': 621831}, {\'name\': \'Ruisseau des sylves\', \'text\': \'Le Ruisseau des sylves arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Voici les arbres de Lothlórien ! Voici le plus beau des pays de mon peuple. »\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622018&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f33df4-df96-4b73-9e5f-ab7dc714cf3a\', \'multiverseId\': 622018}, \'multiverseid\': 622018}, {\'name\': \'Ruscello nel Bosco\', \'text\': \'Il Ruscello nel Bosco entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Laggiù si trovano i boschi di Lothlórien! È la più bella fra tutte le dimore della mia gente."\\n—Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f09076cb-c518-4d61-9999-872a723e2dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 622205}, \'multiverseid\': 622205}, {\'name\': \'森林地の小川\', \'text\': \'森林地の小川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「あそこにはロスロリアンの森がある！我らエルフ族の住まう地の中でも、もっとも美しいところ。」\\n――レゴラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a89340-80e0-40d0-bdb5-d55c30e033d1\', \'multiverseId\': 622392}, \'multiverseid\': 622392}, {\'name\': \'Riacho da Floresta\', \'text\': \'Riacho da Floresta entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Lá ficam as matas de Lothlórien! Elas são o mais belo dos lares do meu povo."\\n— Legolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e8ef31-ffb0-4a0a-aeeb-772f2ccec41d\', \'multiverseId\': 622579}, \'multiverseid\': 622579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Waldläufer im Grenzland\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nDu kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nSolange ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du Länder oben von deiner Bibliothek spielen. (Du kannst auf diese Weise nur dann ein Land spielen, falls du in diesem Zug noch eines spielen darfst.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher, Waldläufer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621477&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1453dca3-ad99-498c-8e85-e3ffbe5e67b0\', \'multiverseId\': 621477}, \'multiverseid\': 621477}, {\'name\': \'Exploradores de los límites\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nPuedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nMientras un oponente controle más tierras que tú, puedes jugar tierras desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca. (Puedes jugar una tierra de esta manera solo si te queda una jugada de tierra disponible.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guardabosque explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd59939-ed95-45be-bde7-dc34a4c5e348\', \'multiverseId\': 621664}, \'multiverseid\': 621664}, {\'name\': "Rangers de l\'orée", \'text\': "Initiative\\nVous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nTant qu\'un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez jouer des terrains depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Vous ne pouvez jouer un terrain de cette manière que s\'il vous reste une mise en jeu de terrain disponible.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur et ranger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cac5ff55-f505-45b0-bc30-be8a87b429a6\', \'multiverseId\': 621851}, \'multiverseid\': 621851}, {\'name\': \'Ranger di Frontiera\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nPuoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nFintanto che un avversario controlla più terre di te, puoi giocare terre dalla cima del tuo grimorio. (Puoi giocare una terra in questo modo solo se potresti giocarne una normalmente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ranger Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'614fd423-e1a5-4527-9585-e585823795c3\', \'multiverseId\': 622038}, \'multiverseid\': 622038}, {\'name\': \'境界のレインジャー\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nあなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見てよい。\\n対戦相手１人が土地をあなたよりも多くコントロールしているかぎり、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から土地をプレイしてもよい。（これにより土地をプレイするには、あなたは土地プレイを残している必要がある。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト・レインジャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bade0be-5e8e-4638-95de-d08423c67467\', \'multiverseId\': 622225}, \'multiverseid\': 622225}, {\'name\': \'Patrulheiros dos Confins\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nVocê pode olhar o card do topo de seu grimório a qualquer momento.\\nEnquanto um oponente controlar mais terrenos que você, você poderá jogar terrenos do topo de seu grimório. (Você só pode jogar um terreno desta forma se tiver uma jogada de terreno disponível.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor Guardião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf627e90-d611-45ef-bf41-a8544d62af49\', \'multiverseId\': 622412}, \'multiverseid\': 622412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Waldverbundenes Präsent\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Gegner. Du und jener Spieler erzeugt je einen X/X grünen Baumhirte-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nBestimme einen Gegner. Du und jener Spieler erzeugt je X 1/1 grüne Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Lernt nun die Namen der lebenden Wesen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567676b7-8881-4b98-899d-04a73da363e7\', \'multiverseId\': 621558}, \'multiverseid\': 621558}, {\'name\': \'Ofrenda silvana\', \'text\': \'Elige un oponente. Ese jugador y tú crean una ficha de criatura Pueblo-arbóreo verde X/X.\\nElige un oponente. Ese jugador y tú crean X fichas de criatura Guerrero Elfo verdes 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Aprendan ahora la ciencia de las criaturas vivientes!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80052e9a-91c7-4401-9b5f-bc874c764581\', \'multiverseId\': 621745}, \'multiverseid\': 621745}, {\'name\': \'Offrande sylvestre\', \'text\': \'Choisissez un adversaire. Ce joueur et vous créez chacun un jeton de créature X/X verte Sylvin.\\nChoisissez un adversaire. Ce joueur et vous créez chacun X jetons de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Apprenez maintenant l\'histoire de toutes les créatures vivantes ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621932&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6718a45d-0d09-41c9-b64f-666dd256e639\', \'multiverseId\': 621932}, \'multiverseid\': 621932}, {\'name\': \'Offerta Silvestre\', \'text\': \'Scegli un avversario. Tu e quel giocatore create ognuno una pedina creatura Silvantropo X/X verde.\\nScegli un avversario. Tu e quel giocatore create ognuno X pedine creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verdi.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Impara ora la storia degli Esseri Viventi!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b6bb9e7-450c-46be-b07b-ff1479dee1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 622119}, \'multiverseid\': 622119}, {\'name\': \'森の捧げ物\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を選ぶ。あなたとそのプレイヤーは、それぞれ緑のＸ/Ｘのツリーフォーク・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n対戦相手１人を選ぶ。あなたとそのプレイヤーは、それぞれ緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「いざ生ける者どもの知識をまなばん！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce173ff-ff54-4fa4-ab5b-7788e80b1c01\', \'multiverseId\': 622306}, \'multiverseid\': 622306}, {\'name\': \'Oferenda Silvestre\', \'text\': \'Escolha um oponente. Você e aquele jogador criam, cada um, uma ficha de criatura Ent verde X/X.\\nEscolha um oponente. Você e aquele jogador criam, cada um, X fichas de criatura Elfo Guerreiro verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora aprenda a história das Criaturas Vivas!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0921d1e-c069-4482-b74c-4482ca1098ad\', \'multiverseId\': 622493}, \'multiverseid\': 622493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weg ins Exil\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher kann seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hinfort, Schlangenzunge, wohin du willst. Aber sollten wir uns jemals wieder begegnen, werde ich keine Gnade walten lassen."\\n—Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621472&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'941f77ac-35e0-464e-bfa3-6b4a2e85ee38\', \'multiverseId\': 621472}, \'multiverseid\': 621472}, {\'name\': \'Camino al exilio\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador puede buscar en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Adelante, Lengua de Serpiente, ve donde desees. Pero si nos volvemos a encontrar, no tendré piedad".\\n—Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56a66ef6-0f4e-43f1-8bd0-5c1e55c23cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 621659}, \'multiverseid\': 621659}, {\'name\': "Chemin vers l\'exil", \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Partez maintenant, Langue de Serpent, où vous voulez. Mais si nous nous croisons à nouveau un jour, ne comptez pas sur ma clémence. »\\n—Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7930c14a-e989-4575-9f2f-74c4cfb182fc\', \'multiverseId\': 621846}, \'multiverseid\': 621846}, {\'name\': "Sentiero dell\'Esilio", \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore può passare in rassegna il proprio grimorio per una carta terra base, mettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Parti subito, Vermilinguo, e vai dove vuoi. Ma in questo caso, se ci incontreremo di nuovo, non avrò pietà."\\n—Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ad88100-9138-4fa0-953c-b62e9a264c31\', \'multiverseId\': 622033}, \'multiverseid\': 622033}, {\'name\': \'流刑への道\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは「自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「蛇の舌よ。どこにでもお前の望むところへ今すぐ行くがよい。だが、もしもふたたび会うことがあれば、余は容赦はせぬ。」\\n――セオデン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1032d6b7-3fa6-413d-b164-6a47d07a90e3\', \'multiverseId\': 622220}, \'multiverseid\': 622220}, {\'name\': \'Caminho para o Exílio\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Seu controlador pode procurar no próprio grimório um card de terreno básico, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora vá, Língua de Cobra, para onde quiser. Mas então, se algum dia nos reencontrarmos, não serei misericordioso."\\n— Théoden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52fbbf1b-5c3b-4570-b6fc-8061116db972\', \'multiverseId\': 622407}, \'multiverseid\': 622407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weise der Renaturierung\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Weise der Renaturierung ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe drei Zeitalter im Westen der Welt durchlebt, viele Niederlagen und viele fruchtlose Siege."\\n—Elrond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d51812d0-d567-48bf-aa14-1d6356e9bba3\', \'multiverseId\': 621556}, \'multiverseid\': 621556}, {\'name\': \'Sabia de la recuperación\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Sabia de la recuperación entre al campo de batalla, puedes destruir el encantamiento o artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"He vivido tres épocas en el mundo del Oeste, muchas derrotas y muchas victorias estériles".\\n—Elrond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'622696e6-31e0-4920-adfb-10905917a854\', \'multiverseId\': 621743}, \'multiverseid\': 621743}, {\'name\': \'Sage du reboisement\', \'text\': \'Quand la Sage du reboisement arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez détruire une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai vu trois âges dans l\'ouest du monde, ainsi que de nombreuses défaites et de nombreuses victoires stériles. »\\n—Elrond", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e1e919a-4d95-4d58-8dc0-2675b304bb85\', \'multiverseId\': 621930}, \'multiverseid\': 621930}, {\'name\': \'Saggia della Rivendicazione\', \'text\': \'Quando la Saggia della Rivendicazione entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi distruggere un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho visto tre ere ad ovest del mondo, molte sconfitte e molte vittorie inutili."\\n—Elrond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cfd7c78-4294-49c3-870c-fcd9ab81a650\', \'multiverseId\': 622117}, \'multiverseid\': 622117}, {\'name\': \'再利用の賢者\', \'text\': \'再利用の賢者が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「私は西方世界の三つの時代を見てきた。多くの敗北と、多くの無駄な勝利を見てきた。」\\n――エルロンド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0001f0aa-003a-4272-844e-73bd49268814\', \'multiverseId\': 622304}, \'multiverseid\': 622304}, {\'name\': \'Sábia da Reivindicação\', \'text\': \'Quando Sábia da Reivindicação entra no campo de batalha, você pode destruir o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Já vi três eras no Oeste do mundo, e muitas derrotas, e muitas vitórias infrutíferas."\\n— Elrond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c0ae45-4f59-4392-8018-645f8d94c177\', \'multiverseId\': 622491}, \'multiverseid\': 622491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wettergegerbter Wanderer\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Länderkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Nomade, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Der Wald von Drúadan wurde Ghân-buri-Ghân und seinem Volk gewährt, auf dass er für immer ihnen gehöre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621480&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'010a0f71-b544-461a-b2da-12186c8853f0\', \'multiverseId\': 621480}, \'multiverseid\': 621480}, {\'name\': \'Caminante curtido\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja. Activa esto solo si un oponente controla más tierras que tú.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo nómada humano\', \'flavor\': \'El bosque de Drúadan se le otorgó a Ghân-buri-Ghân y a su pueblo para que les perteneciese para siempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f12b4db-ece0-4d30-8ea6-5c2d23d02664\', \'multiverseId\': 621667}, \'multiverseid\': 621667}, {\'name\': \'Voyageur hâlé\', \'text\': "{W}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez. N\'activez que si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et nomade et clerc\', \'flavor\': "La forêt de Drúadan fut donnée à Ghân-buri-Ghân et à son peuple, pour qu\'elle leur appartienne à jamais.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621854&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bad9e7e6-1245-4e26-9155-bca3cb4580a1\', \'multiverseId\': 621854}, \'multiverseid\': 621854}, {\'name\': \'Viandante Navigato\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola. Attiva solo se un avversario controlla più terre di te.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Nomade Umano\', \'flavor\': \'La Foresta di Drúadan è stata donata a Ghân-buri-ghân e alla sua gente perché appartenga loro per sempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'340d1782-3798-40d9-87ca-6b423e4933d1\', \'multiverseId\': 622041}, \'multiverseid\': 622041}, {\'name\': \'雨ざらしの旅人\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。対戦相手１人があなたより多くの土地をコントロールしているときにしか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ノーマッド・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'ドルーアダンの森はガーン＝ブリ＝ガーンおよびその部族に、永久に彼ら自身のものとして与えられた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f90f4af-fc4b-4234-8925-cb886ad2fdc6\', \'multiverseId\': 622228}, \'multiverseid\': 622228}, {\'name\': \'Viajante Enrijecido\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Procure um card de terreno em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe. Ative somente se um oponente controlar mais terrenos que você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Nômade Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'A Floresta de Drúadan foi concedida a Ghân-buri-Ghân e seu povo, em posse perpétua.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb678b04-1da9-4c9e-afec-b001867535fb\', \'multiverseId\': 622415}, \'multiverseid\': 622415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Windgepeitschte Felswand\', \'text\': \'Die Windgepeitschte Felswand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Windgepeitschte Felswand ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„An diesem Strom, auf dieser Seite des Großen Flusses, liegt Rohan."\\n—Celeborn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621641&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dd05262-87af-44b8-b644-7f84ff2cfda0\', \'multiverseId\': 621641}, \'multiverseid\': 621641}, {\'name\': \'Risco cicatriz del viento\', \'text\': \'El Risco cicatriz del viento entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Risco cicatriz del viento entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Cerca de ese arroyo, a este lado del Río Grande, se encuentra Rohan".\\n—Celeborn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b77368c-333b-4cff-b331-c52f79708b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 621828}, \'multiverseid\': 621828}, {\'name\': \'Cordillère marquée par les vents\', \'text\': \'La Cordillère marquée par les vents arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Cordillère marquée par les vents arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Aux abords de ce cours d\'eau, de ce côté-ci de la grande rivière, s\'étend le Rohan. »\\n—Celeborn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622015&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17a8534-9534-45f2-9bc1-2652f366dc19\', \'multiverseId\': 622015}, \'multiverseid\': 622015}, {\'name\': \'Dirupo Eroso dai Venti\', \'text\': \'Il Dirupo Eroso dai Venti entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Dirupo Eroso dai Venti entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Lungo queste rive, sulla sponda vicina del Grande Fiume, vi è Rohan."\\n—Celeborn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a01d1df2-aa11-4dce-9e8a-ca33e058f45b\', \'multiverseId\': 622202}, \'multiverseid\': 622202}, {\'name\': \'風に削られた岩山\', \'text\': \'風に削られた岩山はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n風に削られた岩山が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「大河のこちら側がローハンの国だ。」\\n――ケレボルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae9d86d2-4cb7-42d0-bafe-b5d14f5fa8a0\', \'multiverseId\': 622389}, \'multiverseid\': 622389}, {\'name\': \'Penhasco Marcado pelo Vento\', \'text\': \'Penhasco Marcado pelo Vento entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Penhasco Marcado pelo Vento entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Perto daquele curso d\\\'água, deste lado do Grande Rio, fica Rohan."\\n— Celeborn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'849269c7-c4b1-46ad-8f93-a9fbf701a15e\', \'multiverseId\': 622576}, \'multiverseid\': 622576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Windschneller Streich\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu. Erzeuge so viele 1/1 grüne Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine, wie auf diese Weise überschüssiger Schaden zugefügt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ein schriller Schrei ertönte — man hatte sie entdeckt. Dann erklang das Klirren und Krachen von Stahl.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620394&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2243f11-dd8a-4572-8b7e-35f201eb3bfa\', \'multiverseId\': 620394}, \'multiverseid\': 620394}, {\'name\': \'Tranche prestebrise\', \'text\': \'Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. Créez un nombre de jetons de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier égal au surplus de blessures infligées de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Un cri perçant retentit : ils avaient été repérés. On entendit une sonnerie et le fracas de l\'acier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ffa07f2-e771-4944-bfdb-1cef6f4037b9\', \'multiverseId\': 620462}, \'multiverseid\': 620462}, {\'name\': \'疾風斬り\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。これにより与えた余剰のダメージの点数に等しい数の緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'かん高い叫び声が聞こえる。彼らは見つかってしまったのだ。鋼が鳴り、ぶつかり合う音がした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78226d76-6173-472e-8b95-6fe62e210700\', \'multiverseId\': 620530}, \'multiverseid\': 620530}, {\'name\': \'迅风割斩\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物对目标不由你操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。派出若干1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物，其数量等同于以此法造成的过量伤害数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'尖叫声起～追兵发现了他们。顿时钢铁出鞘相撞的声音响成一片。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eda83ee-3b43-4e46-935b-c37259aedbdf\', \'multiverseId\': 620598}, \'multiverseid\': 620598}]', '[{\'name\': \'Windschneller Streich\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu. Erzeuge so viele 1/1 grüne Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine, wie auf diese Weise überschüssiger Schaden zugefügt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ein schriller Schrei ertönte — man hatte sie entdeckt. Dann erklang das Klirren und Krachen von Stahl.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620803&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4250219b-5a66-42cd-8dbc-2ed532f85655\', \'multiverseId\': 620803}, \'multiverseid\': 620803}, {\'name\': \'Corte aéreo raudo\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo que no controlas. Crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Guerrero Elfo verdes 1/1 igual a la cantidad de daño sobrante hecho de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Se oyó un chillido agudo: los habían visto. Luego, estalló el clamor y el repiqueteo del acero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a78ee4-37b6-49a1-9796-1bfa5a47aed3\', \'multiverseId\': 620875}, \'multiverseid\': 620875}, {\'name\': \'Tranche prestebrise\', \'text\': \'Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. Créez un nombre de jetons de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier égal au surplus de blessures infligées de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Un cri perçant retentit : ils avaient été repérés. On entendit une sonnerie et le fracas de l\'acier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620947&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7dc3a50-a1bc-4530-bade-24f83bd30688\', \'multiverseId\': 620947}, \'multiverseid\': 620947}, {\'name\': \'Fendente Veloce Come il Vento\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. Crea un numero di pedine creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verdi pari al danno in eccesso inflitto in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Un urlo stridulo si levò: erano stati visti. L\'acciaio squillò e vibrò.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4f0ade0-953e-4a93-bf62-dfdf6cf7d712\', \'multiverseId\': 621019}, \'multiverseid\': 621019}, {\'name\': \'疾風斬り\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。これにより与えた余剰のダメージの点数に等しい数の緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'かん高い叫び声が聞こえる。彼らは見つかってしまったのだ。鋼が鳴り、ぶつかり合う音がした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'097340b9-d895-42b3-bee1-2f7fa80180e0\', \'multiverseId\': 621091}, \'multiverseid\': 621091}, {\'name\': \'Corte Ventoveloz\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla causa dano igual ao seu poder à criatura alvo que você não controla. Crie um número de fichas de criatura Elfo Guerreiro verde 1/1 igual à quantidade de dano excedente causada dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Ouviu-se um grito estridente — tinham sido avistados. Houve um retinido e o entrechoque de espadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66837918-d413-475f-bf1c-340d93aa2f25\', \'multiverseId\': 621163}, \'multiverseid\': 621163}, {\'name\': \'迅风割斩\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物对目标不由你操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。派出若干1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物，其数量等同于以此法造成的过量伤害数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'尖叫声起～追兵发现了他们。顿时钢铁出鞘相撞的声音响成一片。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e8f31a-323e-4083-ae7d-fab5f9f8ddd2\', \'multiverseId\': 621235}, \'multiverseid\': 621235}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wohlhabender Wirt\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Wohlhabende Wirt ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Bürger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a3829c2-0c23-4829-85b1-943306bd8f22\', \'multiverseId\': 621553}, \'multiverseid\': 621553}, {\'name\': \'Posadero adinerado\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Posadero adinerado entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nSiempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9696936c-2530-4294-b583-6647bf39a02e\', \'multiverseId\': 621740}, \'multiverseid\': 621740}, {\'name\': \'Aubergiste prospère\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Aubergiste prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et citoyen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621927&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda306ee-6eaa-4437-ac27-ae7819f66d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 621927}, \'multiverseid\': 621927}, {\'name\': \'Locandiere Facoltoso\', \'text\': \'Quando il Locandiere Facoltoso entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\\nOgniqualvolta un\\\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86a7378f-3b30-43a9-b092-374e92372127\', \'multiverseId\': 622114}, \'multiverseid\': 622114}, {\'name\': \'裕福な亭主\', \'text\': \'裕福な亭主が戦場に出たとき、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nこれでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee1d6f3-5fe6-4172-9d52-9b422a8f7ad3\', \'multiverseId\': 622301}, \'multiverseid\': 622301}, {\'name\': \'Taverneiro Próspero\', \'text\': \'Quando Taverneiro Próspero entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\\nToda vez que outra criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pequenino Cidadão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0cff627-7816-44b3-8393-2dc16d468372\', \'multiverseId\': 622488}, \'multiverseid\': 622488}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wucherndes Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Den ganzen Winter hindurch blieb Sam so geduldig, wie er nur konnte. Der Frühling übertraf seine kühnsten Hoffnungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf7ba3e-55c1-4130-9228-1f2c80a7e6a8\', \'multiverseId\': 621554}, \'multiverseid\': 621554}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento exuberante\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Sam esperó pacientemente durante todo el invierno. La primavera superó con creces sus esperanzas más alocadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5f3fb8a-7777-49b8-bdcc-a2fc3dd1a5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 621741}, \'multiverseid\': 621741}, {\'name\': \'Croissance luxuriante\', \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tout l\'hiver durant, Sam resta aussi patient que possible. Le printemps surpassa toutes ses espérances.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621928&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5914952a-b131-4459-8f0e-7e952094b075\', \'multiverseId\': 621928}, \'multiverseid\': 621928}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Inarrestabile\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Sam lasciò passare l\'inverno il più pazientemente possibile. La primavera superò ogni sua più ardita speranza.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'806d4aa4-cdc5-4f17-b3d9-6d27dbbf15ab\', \'multiverseId\': 622115}, \'multiverseid\': 622115}, {\'name\': \'不屈の自然\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'サムは冬の間じゅう、できる限り辛抱強く待った。そして春は、彼の大それた望みすら上回るものになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78005058-537b-4518-ad3c-6674f7109293\', \'multiverseId\': 622302}, \'multiverseid\': 622302}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Exuberante\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque aquele card no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Por todo o inverno Sam permaneceu tão paciente quanto pôde. A primavera superou suas maiores esperanças.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a937ff-f7d6-40e9-afc7-53342d55c35c\', \'multiverseId\': 622489}, \'multiverseid\': 622489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerfallende Nekropolis\', \'text\': \'Die Zerfallende Nekropolis kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}, {B} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Als Frodo sich den Ring ansteckte und ihn für sich beanspruchte, erschütterte dies die Macht in Barad-dûr, und der Turm bebte vom Fundament bis in seine stolze, verbitterte Krone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621599&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbfd0040-25b0-4589-a67b-3ce315f2f4b9\', \'multiverseId\': 621599}, \'multiverseid\': 621599}, {\'name\': \'Necrópolis desmoronándose\', \'text\': \'La Necrópolis desmoronándose entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}, {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En cuanto Frodo se puso el Anillo y lo reclamó para sí, el Poder en Barad-dûr se estremeció y la torre tembló desde los cimientos hasta su cima letal y orgullosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bd736f0-a209-4a5d-b16c-931fb31a2424\', \'multiverseId\': 621786}, \'multiverseid\': 621786}, {\'name\': \'Nécropole croulante\', \'text\': \'La Nécropole croulante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}, {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "À l\'instant où Frodo enfila l\'Anneau et le revendiqua pour lui-même, le Pouvoir de Barad-dûr fut ébranlé, et la Tour trembla depuis ses fondations jusqu\'à sa fière et cruelle couronne.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621973&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae728340-6130-404f-8d9f-293ff9c2f54d\', \'multiverseId\': 621973}, \'multiverseid\': 621973}, {\'name\': \'Necropoli in Sfacelo\', \'text\': \'La Necropoli in Sfacelo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}, {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Quando Frodo infilò l\'Anello rivendicandolo, il Potere fu scosso a Barad-dûr e la Torre tremò, dalle fondamenta fino alla fiera e orgogliosa cresta.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a244b7c2-03e9-471d-995d-4bf6b0adf0ec\', \'multiverseId\': 622160}, \'multiverseid\': 622160}, {\'name\': \'崩れゆく死滅都市\', \'text\': \'崩れゆく死滅都市はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'フロドが指輪をはめ、指輪は我がものであると宣言すると、バラド＝ドゥールのかの力は動揺し、塔はその礎から誇り高く苛烈なる頂に至るまで震えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f4e5473-ecc7-4082-a23f-5bfa0776e1aa\', \'multiverseId\': 622347}, \'multiverseid\': 622347}, {\'name\': \'Necrópole Despedaçada\', \'text\': \'Necrópole Despedaçada entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}, {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Frodo pôs o Anel e o reivindicou para si, o Poder em Barad-dûr se abalou, e a Torre tremeu das fundações até a coroa orgulhosa e hostil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e52f79e-2a99-4d0a-a06d-04a7c6e1278d\', \'multiverseId\': 622534}, \'multiverseid\': 622534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zornesruh-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Zornesruh-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Gebirge- oder Ebene-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Zornesruh-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Schatten verschwand, die Sonne trat hervor, und Licht umströmte alles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621610&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4651a363-5d5a-4542-8b7a-0d4085de726e\', \'multiverseId\': 621610}, \'multiverseid\': 621610}, {\'name\': \'Maraña calmafuriosa\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña calmafuriosa entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Montaña o de Llanura de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña calmafuriosa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La sombra se disipó y el sol quedó destapado: se hizo la luz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f7c9ed6-a029-4b9a-bf7b-0ee1b4de2fe2\', \'multiverseId\': 621797}, \'multiverseid\': 621797}, {\'name\': \'Lacis calmerage\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Lacis calmerage arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de montagne ou de plaine de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis calmerage arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "L\'Ombre s\'éclipsa, dévoilant le Soleil, et la lumière jaillit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621984&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e45108-8e56-4f1a-87f0-99fce85398b7\', \'multiverseId\': 621984}, \'multiverseid\': 621984}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Furiacalma\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Furiacalma entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Montagna o Pianura dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Furiacalma entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "E l\'Ombra scomparve, e il Sole fu svelato, e la luce crebbe.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b07ef2ca-6f4f-4684-bb3a-28b63d1b1910\', \'multiverseId\': 622171}, \'multiverseid\': 622171}, {\'name\': \'怒静の交錯\', \'text\': \'怒静の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり山か平地であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、怒静の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'大いなる影は去り、太陽の覆いははずされ、日が燦として輝きだした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'796a7393-68e8-4fbc-80b1-6aa90f35ab4a\', \'multiverseId\': 622358}, \'multiverseid\': 622358}, {\'name\': \'Liame da Calmafuriosa\', \'text\': \'Conforme Liame da Calmafuriosa entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Montanha ou Planície de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Liame da Calmafuriosa entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A Sombra partiu, e o Sol foi revelado, e a luz jorrou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3470b0-96f1-432e-aee7-4e5a01068adc\', \'multiverseId\': 622545}, \'multiverseid\': 622545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zu gierig, zu tief\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie fügt jeder anderen Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zwerge reden nicht gerne darüber, aber Mithril war gleichermaßen der Grund ihres Reichtums wie auch ihres Untergangs."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620418&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a457a152-afb8-4083-b2bf-5017ea7e956f\', \'multiverseId\': 620418}, \'multiverseid\': 620418}, {\'name\': \'Trop avidement, trop profondément\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Cette créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à chaque autre créature.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les nains ne racontent pas d\'histoires, mais si le mithril a été la source de leur richesse, il n\'en causa pas moins leur perte. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620486&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2dc77ad-b937-409c-a756-a7b01f96b27d\', \'multiverseId\': 620486}, \'multiverseid\': 620486}, {\'name\': \'あまりにも貪欲に、あまりにも深く\', \'text\': \'墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。そのクリーチャーはそれでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、それのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ドワーフが自分から話すことはないが、ミスリルは彼らの富の基盤でありながら、破滅の基でもあったのじゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e910ea4-02b8-4d8c-a672-d724c7441ce9\', \'multiverseId\': 620554}, \'multiverseid\': 620554}, {\'name\': \'太贪婪，也太深\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。该生物对每个其他生物各造成等同于前者力量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「矮人对此闭口不言；不过秘银既是他们财富基石，也是他们的毁灭祸根。」\\n～甘道夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7223d0cd-f2dd-4d53-8289-f6891ffaa987\', \'multiverseId\': 620622}, \'multiverseid\': 620622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zu gierig, zu tief\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie fügt jeder anderen Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zwerge reden nicht gerne darüber, aber Mithril war gleichermaßen der Grund ihres Reichtums wie auch ihres Untergangs."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620830&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bf70614-42fb-4bea-8815-468ac3174b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 620830}, \'multiverseid\': 620830}, {\'name\': \'Demasiada codicia, demasiado abajo\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Esa criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a cada otra criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los enanos no hablan de ello, pero, aunque el mithril fuera la base de su riqueza, también fue su perdición".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a4e74e0-2ad5-44df-85c8-9b198d107fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 620902}, \'multiverseid\': 620902}, {\'name\': \'Trop avidement, trop profondément\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Cette créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à chaque autre créature.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les nains ne racontent pas d\'histoires, mais si le mithril a été la source de leur richesse, il n\'en causa pas moins leur perte. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620974&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3afe7406-f9b3-44b9-91b7-5b1c57426eab\', \'multiverseId\': 620974}, \'multiverseid\': 620974}, {\'name\': \'Troppo Avidamente, Troppo in Profondità\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero. Quella creatura infligge a ogni altra creatura danno pari alla sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I Nani non narrano alcuna storia; ma così come fu il fondamento della loro ricchezza, il mithril fu anche la causa della loro distruzione."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b7d3606-6658-4c26-8842-cf74925e8281\', \'multiverseId\': 621046}, \'multiverseid\': 621046}, {\'name\': \'あまりにも貪欲に、あまりにも深く\', \'text\': \'墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。そのクリーチャーはそれでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、それのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ドワーフが自分から話すことはないが、ミスリルは彼らの富の基盤でありながら、破滅の基でもあったのじゃ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1edc3fd-fb97-436c-ad80-efad4bffffd5\', \'multiverseId\': 621118}, \'multiverseid\': 621118}, {\'name\': \'Com Ganância Demais, Fundo Demais\', \'text\': \'Coloque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Aquela criatura causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao próprio poder a cada outra criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os anões não contam histórias; mas assim como o mithril foi a base de sua riqueza, também foi sua destruição."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db8117b9-f1de-4b0a-bb3b-da623c4a37bf\', \'multiverseId\': 621190}, \'multiverseid\': 621190}, {\'name\': \'太贪婪，也太深\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。该生物对每个其他生物各造成等同于前者力量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「矮人对此闭口不言；不过秘银既是他们财富基石，也是他们的毁灭祸根。」\\n～甘道夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e88dcd15-c803-4531-87d7-ec6ba213b2e1\', \'multiverseId\': 621262}, \'multiverseid\': 621262}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zugangstunnel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 3 oder weniger kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf bald! Ich komme am Morgen mit einer Armee von Tuks zurück."\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8be9b35a-5b99-4d2b-a344-348521dcbbc3\', \'multiverseId\': 621591}, \'multiverseid\': 621591}, {\'name\': \'Túnel de acceso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: La criatura objetivo con fuerza de 3 o menos no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Hasta pronto! Por la mañana volveré con un ejército de Tuk".\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1662855c-d20f-4563-9225-b673e3db9266\', \'multiverseId\': 621778}, \'multiverseid\': 621778}, {\'name\': "Tunnel d\'accès", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T} : Une créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 3 ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« À bientôt ! Je vous ramènerai une armée de Touque au matin. »\\n—Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621965&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8968931d-f722-42b7-b89a-3689d72e9569\', \'multiverseId\': 621965}, \'multiverseid\': 621965}, {\'name\': "Tunnel d\'Accesso", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 3 non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"A presto! Vi riporterò un esercito di Tuc domattina."\\n—Pipino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52867e44-c274-4f18-84b2-eee3b72e6b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 622152}, \'multiverseid\': 622152}, {\'name\': \'接続トンネル\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：パワーが３以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「すぐに戻って来るからな！朝には、トゥックの一連隊を連れて戻るよ。」\\n――ピピン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e781502-f927-4759-940c-2a87a381fe1b\', \'multiverseId\': 622339}, \'multiverseid\': 622339}, {\'name\': \'Túnel de Acesso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: A criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 3 não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vejo vocês em breve. Trago um exército de Tûks pela manhã."\\n— Pippin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c8f152f-2776-4980-b0c1-14bbc2b19906\', \'multiverseId\': 622526}, \'multiverseid\': 622526}]', "[{'name': 'Zunehmende Hingabe', 'text': 'Erzeuge fünf 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine. Falls dieser Zauberspruch aus einem Friedhof gewirkt wurde, erzeuge stattdessen zehn solcher Spielsteine.\\nRückblende {7}{W}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621468&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03fe4b0c-9af6-47ad-9e3e-c3ed330b64ad', 'multiverseId': 621468}, 'multiverseid': 621468}, {'name': 'Aumentar la devoción', 'text': 'Crea cinco fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1. Si este hechizo fue lanzado desde un cementerio, en vez de eso, crea diez de esas fichas.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{W}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621655&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86f2cee8-d7de-44ff-a9e9-6c558476f06a', 'multiverseId': 621655}, 'multiverseid': 621655}, {'name': 'Dévotion grandissante', 'text': 'Créez cinq jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis un cimetière, créez dix de ces jetons à la place.\\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621842&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '402d5c12-241e-4e79-be2b-d079ce6dfdb0', 'multiverseId': 621842}, 'multiverseid': 621842}, {'name': 'Devozione Crescente', 'text': 'Crea cinque pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche. Se questa magia è stata lanciata da un cimitero, crea invece dieci di quelle pedine.\\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622029&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06a65913-87c2-4b74-a7b0-282fabea9c8d', 'multiverseId': 622029}, 'multiverseid': 622029}, {'name': '高まる献身', 'text': '白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン５体を生成する。この呪文が墓地から唱えられていたなら、代わりに、そのトークン10体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{7}{W}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622216&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a76adbed-20d8-4ec3-8bb0-dab5d8868bde', 'multiverseId': 622216}, 'multiverseid': 622216}, {'name': 'Devoção Crescente', 'text': 'Crie cinco fichas de criatura Humano branca 1/1. Se esta mágica foi conjurada de um cemitério, em vez disso, crie dez dessas fichas.\\nRecapitular {7}{W}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-a.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622403&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edeb257c-78da-4486-be4d-3614c3230f0a', 'multiverseId': 622403}, 'multiverseid': 622403}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zweischneidiges Erbstück\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, kannst du Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek aufdecken, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckst, die mit ihr einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam hat. Nimm jene Karte auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'379101d6-48b7-4cf9-a4a4-0d3aff4533d2\', \'multiverseId\': 621576}, \'multiverseid\': 621576}, {\'name\': \'Espada familiar\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, puedes mostrar cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con ella. Pon esa carta en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a74caf-111a-4ff2-bb7e-b078897d500f\', \'multiverseId\': 621763}, \'multiverseid\': 621763}, {\'name\': "Lame d\'héritage", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +3/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, vous pouvez révéler les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature qui partage un type de créature avec elle. Mettez cette carte dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621950&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54128a69-8bb9-49da-ada4-ecdee15d6759\', \'multiverseId\': 621950}, \'multiverseid\': 621950}, {\'name\': \'Cimelio Affilato\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, puoi rivelare carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con essa. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b6f2b9f-9289-4cbf-a775-9e2914d5ff42\', \'multiverseId\': 622137}, \'multiverseid\': 622137}, {\'name\': \'先祖伝来の宝刀\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたは「それと共通のクリーチャー・タイプ１つを持つクリーチャー・カード１枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードをあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。」を選んでもよい。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3535efdf-37d0-4797-b500-9910aa85d040\', \'multiverseId\': 622324}, \'multiverseid\': 622324}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Herança\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada morre, você pode revelar cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com ela. Coloque aquele card na sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506d6615-deeb-417c-8c89-e214da320a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 622511}, \'multiverseid\': 622511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Éomer, König von Rohan\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nÉomer, König von Rohan, kommt für jeden anderen Menschen, den du kontrollierst, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\nWenn Éomer ins Spiel kommt, wird ein Spieler deiner Wahl zum Monarchen. Éomer fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe seiner Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620401&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04d25fe9-58a8-462a-84e8-904e29f6708b\', \'multiverseId\': 620401}, \'multiverseid\': 620401}, {\'name\': \'Éomer, roi du Rohan\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nÉomer, roi du Rohan arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui pour chaque autre humain que vous contrôlez.\\nQuand Éomer arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé devient le monarque. Éomer inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'682a9697-2d4a-4ec9-9da9-87c99e94be4b\', \'multiverseId\': 620469}, \'multiverseid\': 620469}, {\'name\': \'ローハンの王、エオメル\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\nローハンの王、エオメルは、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない人間１体につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nローハンの王、エオメルが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人と、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。その前者が統治者になる。ローハンの王、エオメルはその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5ab03e2-8ffc-47cb-a1e7-a21bf070682b\', \'multiverseId\': 620537}, \'multiverseid\': 620537}, {\'name\': \'洛汗国王伊奥梅尔\', \'text\': \'连击\\n洛汗国王伊奥梅尔进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于由你操控的其他人类数量。\\n当伊奥梅尔进战场时，目标牌手成为君主。伊奥梅尔对任意一个目标造成等同于前者力量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ce182e-6e05-4a4e-be5f-13b0ee474bf6\', \'multiverseId\': 620605}, \'multiverseid\': 620605}]', '[{\'name\': \'Éomer, König von Rohan\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nÉomer, König von Rohan, kommt für jeden anderen Menschen, den du kontrollierst, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\nWenn Éomer ins Spiel kommt, wird ein Spieler deiner Wahl zum Monarchen. Éomer fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe seiner Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620810&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5105369-7f04-4ae6-81f2-497cb8bd2a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 620810}, \'multiverseid\': 620810}, {\'name\': \'Éomer, rey de Rohan\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nÉomer, rey de Rohan entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él por cada otro Humano que controlas.\\nCuando Éomer entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo se convierte en el monarca. Éomer hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6553f49-90d0-4fc5-89ed-676b9db161ca\', \'multiverseId\': 620882}, \'multiverseid\': 620882}, {\'name\': \'Éomer, roi du Rohan\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nÉomer, roi du Rohan arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui pour chaque autre humain que vous contrôlez.\\nQuand Éomer arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé devient le monarque. Éomer inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620954&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68bc9d0-bf10-41b5-9dd5-c755b0aeb4ce\', \'multiverseId\': 620954}, \'multiverseid\': 620954}, {\'name\': \'Éomer, Re di Rohan\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco\\nÉomer, Re di Rohan entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni altro Umano che controlli.\\nQuando Éomer entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio diventa il monarca. Éomer infligge a un qualsiasi bersaglio danni pari alla propria forza.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3162e438-1e49-4c22-bbb2-7077a9e446a3\', \'multiverseId\': 621026}, \'multiverseid\': 621026}, {\'name\': \'ローハンの王、エオメル\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\nローハンの王、エオメルは、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない人間１体につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nローハンの王、エオメルが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人と、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。その前者が統治者になる。ローハンの王、エオメルはその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'536bc0f7-b2f8-4337-9edc-a5ade4986c40\', \'multiverseId\': 621098}, \'multiverseid\': 621098}, {\'name\': \'Éomer, Rei de Rohan\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nÉomer, Rei de Rohan, entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 para cada outro Humano que você controla.\\nQuando Éomer entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo torna-se o monarca. Éomer causa a qualquer alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao próprio poder.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2c3fa6-f46c-4a37-a72b-18eadb76d16b\', \'multiverseId\': 621170}, \'multiverseid\': 621170}, {\'name\': \'洛汗国王伊奥梅尔\', \'text\': \'连击\\n洛汗国王伊奥梅尔进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于由你操控之其他人类的数量。\\n当伊奥梅尔进战场时，目标牌手成为君主。伊奥梅尔对任意一个目标造成等同于前者力量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bb40c28-2bbf-4887-9e3c-824a03fd11e6\', \'multiverseId\': 621242}, \'multiverseid\': 621242}]', "[{'name': 'Éowyn die Schildmaid', 'text': 'Erstschlag\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls in diesem Zug ein anderer Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, erzeuge zwei 2/2 rote Mensch-Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile, die Trampelschaden verursachen. Falls du dann sechs oder mehr Menschen kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620260&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8192b108-7426-4221-b8bf-8b43fb6f2662', 'multiverseId': 620260}, 'multiverseid': 620260}, {'name': 'Éowyn, vierge guerrière', 'text': 'Initiative\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, si un autre humain est arrivé sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Humain et Chevalier avec le piétinement et la célérité. Puis si vous contrôlez au moins six humains, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620268&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '608461a8-1957-41d0-853f-a5de462c0fb2', 'multiverseId': 620268}, 'multiverseid': 620268}, {'name': '盾持つ乙女、エオウィン', 'text': '先制攻撃\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、このターンにこれでない人間１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがある場合、トランプルと速攻を持つ赤の２/２の人間・騎士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。その後、あなたが６体以上の人間をコントロールしているなら、カード１枚を引く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620276&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2144db4d-2540-4b0c-ae42-4d28a3ea674f', 'multiverseId': 620276}, 'multiverseid': 620276}, {'name': '执盾女战士伊奥温', 'text': '先攻\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，若本回合中有另一个人类在你的操控下进战场，则派出两个2/2红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的人类／骑士衍生生物。然后如果你操控六个或更多人类，则抓一张牌。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／骑士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620284&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61414a08-3268-43d8-ba0a-a1c7248925f6', 'multiverseId': 620284}, 'multiverseid': 620284}]", '[{\'name\': \'Éowyn die Schildmaid\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls in diesem Zug ein anderer Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, erzeuge zwei 2/2 rote Mensch-Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile, die Trampelschaden verursachen. Falls du dann sechs oder mehr Menschen kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620635&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4bd298c-f53d-4d37-b79d-5ce158d83f89\', \'multiverseId\': 620635}, \'multiverseid\': 620635}, {\'name\': \'Éowyn, doncella guerrera\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, si otro Humano entró al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, crea dos fichas de criatura Caballero Humano rojas 2/2 con las habilidades de arrollar y prisa. Luego, si controlas seis o más Humanos, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3bef711-0dc8-47e9-acd4-904bdc89ee11\', \'multiverseId\': 620639}, \'multiverseid\': 620639}, {\'name\': \'Éowyn, vierge guerrière\', \'text\': \'Initiative\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, si un autre humain est arrivé sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Humain et Chevalier avec le piétinement et la célérité. Puis si vous contrôlez au moins six humains, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620643&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'799bd099-8581-4b4d-a54b-082968b700a9\', \'multiverseId\': 620643}, \'multiverseid\': 620643}, {\'name\': \'Éowyn, Fanciulla Combattente\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se un altro Umano è entrato nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, crea due pedine creatura Cavaliere Umano 2/2 rosse con travolgere e rapidità. Poi, se controlli sei o più Umani, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b585c4fa-7597-4095-9c2f-5d9275349e3d\', \'multiverseId\': 620647}, \'multiverseid\': 620647}, {\'name\': \'盾持つ乙女、エオウィン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、このターンにこれでない人間１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たことがある場合、トランプルと速攻を持つ赤の２/２の人間・騎士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。その後、あなたが６体以上の人間をコントロールしているなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d87590e7-37ac-4c75-b48b-69d3f2c6f887\', \'multiverseId\': 620651}, \'multiverseid\': 620651}, {\'name\': \'Éowyn, Donzela do Escudo\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, se outro Humano tiver entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, crie duas fichas de criatura Humano Cavaleiro vermelha 2/2 com atropelar e ímpeto. Depois, se você controlar seis ou mais Humanos, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91362e0a-6a23-4859-a2d4-f8e39d0af427\', \'multiverseId\': 620655}, \'multiverseid\': 620655}, {\'name\': \'执盾女战士伊奥温\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，若本回合中有另一个人类在你的操控下进战场，则派出两个2/2红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的人类／骑士衍生生物。然后如果你操控六个或更多人类，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0abb6c64-c42e-433d-91d6-3dde8171074c\', \'multiverseId\': 620659}, \'multiverseid\': 620659}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überfluteter Hain\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{G/U}, {T}: Erzeuge {G}{G}, {G}{U} oder {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Das Geräusch fließenden und fallenden Wassers war laut, und der Abend war erfüllt von einem schwachen Duft nach Bäumen und Blumen, als verweilte der Sommer noch in Elronds Gärten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'434538ce-bc84-42fc-b29f-6cf223564216\', \'multiverseId\': 621606}, \'multiverseid\': 621606}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda inundada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{G/U}, {T}: Agrega {G}{G}, {G}{U} o {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Por la tarde se oía el sonido fuerte del agua que fluía y caía, y se percibía un leve aroma a árboles y flores, como si el verano persistiese en los jardines de Elrond.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff284917-f8e8-43da-8b33-de9f2f2798b9\', \'multiverseId\': 621793}, \'multiverseid\': 621793}, {\'name\': \'Bosquet inondé\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{G/U}, {T} : Ajoutez {G}{G}, {G}{U} ou {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Le bruit de l\'eau vive et des cascades dominait, et le léger parfum des arbres et des fleurs flottait dans l\'air du soir, comme si l\'été s\'attardait encore dans les jardins d\'Elrond.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621980&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f3d3079-79a6-40c0-b2d8-1bf1d69a5925\', \'multiverseId\': 621980}, \'multiverseid\': 621980}, {\'name\': \'Boschetto Inondato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{G/U}, {T}: Aggiungi {G}{G}, {G}{U} o {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Il rumore dell\'acqua che scorreva e scrosciava era forte, e la sera profumava dolcemente di alberi e di fiori, come se l\'estate si attardasse sui giardini di Elrond.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f78b1b2-661f-4557-b3a5-7fa86197b21b\', \'multiverseId\': 622167}, \'multiverseid\': 622167}, {\'name\': \'溢れかえる果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{G/U}, {T}：{G}{G}か{G}{U}か{U}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'流れ落ちる水音がひときわ高く、木々や花々のあえかな香りが夕暮れに満ちて、エルロンドの館の庭には夏がまだ残っているようだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81af6d7c-0f0c-4ae8-b621-3e5435eb6c83\', \'multiverseId\': 622354}, \'multiverseid\': 622354}, {\'name\': \'Bosque Alagado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{G/U}, {T}: Adicione {G}{G}, {G}{U} ou {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'O som de água corrente e cascateante era alto, e a noite se enchia do suave aroma de árvores e folhas, como se o verão ainda se demorasse nos jardins de Elrond.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ce491e0-30ae-4308-bfba-50052da13da2\', \'multiverseId\': 622541}, \'multiverseid\': 622541}]', "[{'name': 'Überwindung des Caradhras', 'text': 'Dilemma des Konzils — Beginnend mit dir stimmt jeder Spieler für Rothorn-Pass oder Minen von Moria. Für jede Rothorn-Pass-Stimme durchsuchst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte und bringst sie getappt ins Spiel. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische danach. Für jede Stimme für Minen von Moria bringst du eine Karte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nSchicke die Überwindung des Caradhras ins Exil.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620393&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6164570c-ac15-4e23-a104-30b9734f5e8b', 'multiverseId': 620393}, 'multiverseid': 620393}, {'name': 'Franchissement du Caradhras', 'text': 'Dilemme du conseil — En commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour le Col de Rubicorne ou les Mines de la Moria. Pour chaque vote pour le Col de Rubicorne, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez. Pour chaque vote pour les Mines de la Moria, renvoyez une carte dans votre main depuis votre cimetière.\\nExilez le Franchissement du Caradhras.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620461&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f840d11a-68e6-4951-8173-639ed3e8c16f', 'multiverseId': 620461}, 'multiverseid': 620461}, {'name': 'カラズラスを越える旅', 'text': '動議 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「赤角山道」または「モリアの坑道」のいずれかに投票する。「赤角山道」１票につき、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。これによりあなたがあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、ライブラリーを切り直す。「モリアの坑道」１票につき、あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚をあなたの手札に戻す。\\nカラズラスを越える旅を追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620529&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd93c8bb7-4417-4214-9990-a2c0f8928709', 'multiverseId': 620529}, 'multiverseid': 620529}, {'name': '穿越卡拉兹拉斯', 'text': '议争～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「红角口」或「墨瑞亚矿坑」。「红角口」每有一票，便从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，并将之横置放进战场。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则洗牌。「墨瑞亚矿坑」每有一票，便将一张牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n放逐穿越卡拉兹拉斯。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620597&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49599d30-de4c-422f-a641-3b5a2ea81d00', 'multiverseId': 620597}, 'multiverseid': 620597}]", '[{\'name\': \'Überwindung des Caradhras\', \'text\': \'Dilemma des Konzils — Beginnend mit dir stimmt jeder Spieler für Rothornpass oder Minen von Moria. Für jede Rothornpass-Stimme durchsuchst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte und bringe sie getappt ins Spiel. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische danach. Für jede Stimme für Minen von Moria bringst du eine Karte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nSchicke die Überwindung des Caradhras ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620802&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3401d7-0821-40c1-960d-7e9b8119947d\', \'multiverseId\': 620802}, \'multiverseid\': 620802}, {\'name\': \'Viajar por el Caradhras\', \'text\': \'Dilema del consejo — Comenzando contigo, cada jugador vota el Paso del Cuerno Rojo o las Minas de Moria. Por cada voto por el Paso del Cuerno Rojo, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica y ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, baraja. Por cada voto por las Minas de Moria, regresa una carta de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nExilia Viajar por el Caradhras.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d9abf4-bebd-4e6e-a008-5a40bc90dae4\', \'multiverseId\': 620874}, \'multiverseid\': 620874}, {\'name\': \'Franchissement du Caradhras\', \'text\': \'Dilemme du conseil — En commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour le Col de Rubicorne ou les Mines de la Moria. Pour chaque vote pour le Col de Rubicorne, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez. Pour chaque vote pour les Mines de la Moria, renvoyez une carte dans votre main depuis votre cimetière.\\nExilez le Franchissement du Caradhras.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ddaa010-244c-45fb-be78-c58bcdbef174\', \'multiverseId\': 620946}, \'multiverseid\': 620946}, {\'name\': \'Attraversamento di Caradhras\', \'text\': "Dilemma del consiglio — A partire da te, ogni giocatore vota per il Valico Cornorosso o le Miniere di Moria. Per ogni voto per il Valico Cornorosso, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base e mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescola. Per ogni voto per le Miniere di Moria, riprendi in mano una carta dal tuo cimitero.\\nEsilia l\'Attraversamento di Caradhras.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4549771a-f8ad-4a87-8658-f55a40ddcaf8\', \'multiverseId\': 621018}, \'multiverseid\': 621018}, {\'name\': \'カラズラスを越える旅\', \'text\': \'動議 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「赤角山道」または「モリアの坑道」のいずれかに投票する。「赤角山道」１票につき、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。これによりあなたがあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、ライブラリーを切り直す。「モリアの坑道」１票につき、あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚をあなたの手札に戻す。\\nカラズラスを越える旅を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e99602e-a683-4082-87b6-3126a57801d5\', \'multiverseId\': 621090}, \'multiverseid\': 621090}, {\'name\': \'Travessia de Caradhras\', \'text\': \'Dilema do conselho — Começando com você, cada jogador vota em Passo do Chifre Vermelho ou Minas de Moria. Para cada voto em Passo do Chifre Vermelho, procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico e coloque-o no campo de batalha virado. Se você procurar em seu grimório dessa forma, embaralhe. Para cada voto em Minas de Moria, devolva um card de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nExile Travessia de Caradhras.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15040e2d-3bd8-41b8-bac5-3dfe351d3a75\', \'multiverseId\': 621162}, \'multiverseid\': 621162}, {\'name\': \'穿越卡拉兹拉斯\', \'text\': \'议争～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「红角口」或「墨瑞亚矿坑」。「红角口」每有一票，便从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，并将之横置放进战场。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则洗牌。「墨瑞亚矿坑」每有一票，便将一张牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n放逐穿越卡拉兹拉斯。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9304e6cb-01be-4d5e-9d94-130de04ce35d\', \'multiverseId\': 621234}, \'multiverseid\': 621234}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überwältigender Ansturm\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursachen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden und erhalten +X/+X, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sie fürchten die Ringgeister nicht, denn jene, die im Segensreich gewohnt haben, leben in beiden Welten zugleich, und sie haben sowohl gegen das Sichtbare als auch gegen das Unsichtbare große Macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'479058bf-3109-4f1e-9ac2-a752d5ab411a\', \'multiverseId\': 621551}, \'multiverseid\': 621551}, {\'name\': \'Estampida abrumadora\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar y obtienen +X/+X, donde X es la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Ellos no temen a los Espectros del Anillo, pues quienes han vivido en el Reino Bienaventurado viven al mismo tiempo en ambos mundos y tienen grandes poderes contra lo visible y lo invisible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d587571d-86bd-42b6-976f-ebedf855d6c8\', \'multiverseId\': 621738}, \'multiverseid\': 621738}, {\'name\': \'Ruée irrésistible\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement et gagnent +X/+X, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ils ne craignent pas les Esprits servants de l\'Anneau, car ceux qui ont demeuré dans le royaume béni vivent dans les deux mondes à la fois, et ont un grand pouvoir aussi bien contre ce qui se voit que contre ce qui ne se voit pas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=621925&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf75827-ffe4-456c-8ba6-95c0b511f26a\', \'multiverseId\': 621925}, \'multiverseid\': 621925}, {\'name\': \'Fuga Travolgente\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, le creature che controlli hanno travolgere e prendono +X/+X, dove X è la forza maggiore tra le creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Essi non temono gli Spettri dell\'Anello, perché coloro che sono vissuti nel Reame Beato esistono allo stesso tempo in entrambi i mondi e il loro grande potere si esercita sia sui Visibili che sugli Invisibili.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7738625-2736-4521-96ed-96b94e06f210\', \'multiverseId\': 622112}, \'multiverseid\': 622112}, {\'name\': \'圧倒する暴走\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを得て＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最大のパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは指輪の幽鬼を恐れぬ。かつて至福の国に住んだことのある者は、同時に二つの世界に生きており、見えるものにも見えないものにも抗いうる大いなる力を持つからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79bda91e-77ba-4745-b044-811392a8f6b5\', \'multiverseId\': 622299}, \'multiverseid\': 622299}, {\'name\': \'Estouro Esmagador\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, as criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar e recebem +X/+X, sendo X o maior poder entre as criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Eles não temem os Espectros do Anel, pois os que viveram no Reino Abençoado habitam simultaneamente os dois mundos, e contra o Visível e o Invisível têm grande poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69c7de63-37e8-4cfd-88e0-66c3658bd3f4\', \'multiverseId\': 622486}, \'multiverseid\': 622486}]']
